&#39;s first government-backed ‘tech town’" data-v-f94cd9c1><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aZcHo8FoBIGEgjgp_BarnsleyRobota451.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aZcHo8FoBIGEgjgp_BarnsleyRobot.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C79%2C818%2C388&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aZcHo8FoBIGEgjgp_BarnsleyRobot.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C79%2C818%2C388&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aZcHo8FoBIGEgjgp_BarnsleyRobot.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C79%2C818%2C388&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt width="384" height="182" class="blog-card__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-f94cd9c1><div class="blog-card__content" data-post-date="2026-02-19T12:58:00+0000" data-v-f94cd9c1><p class="blog-card__category" data-v-f94cd9c1>Press</p><h3 class="blog-card__title" data-v-f94cd9c1>Evri is trialing autonomous robot deliveries in Barnsley - the UK&#39;s first government-backed ‘tech town’</h3></div></a><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div></article><!--]--></div><nav class="blog-pagination" role="navigation" aria-label="Blog pagination" data-v-9b5ce304><!----><!--[--><button class="blog-pagination__number blog-pagination__number--active" aria-current="page" data-v-9b5ce304><span class="visually-hidden" data-v-9b5ce304>Page </span><span data-v-9b5ce304>1</span></button><button class="blog-pagination__number" data-v-9b5ce304><span class="visually-hidden" data-v-9b5ce304>Page </span><span data-v-9b5ce304>2</span></button><button class="blog-pagination__number" data-v-9b5ce304><span class="visually-hidden" data-v-9b5ce304>Page </span><span data-v-9b5ce304>3</span></button><button class="blog-pagination__number" data-v-9b5ce304><span class="visually-hidden" data-v-9b5ce304>Page </span><span data-v-9b5ce304>4</span></button><button class="blog-pagination__number" data-v-9b5ce304><span class="vis