anguages":57,"data":58},"alSYNxIAAC0AgZZj","evri-group-delivers-parcel-volumes-of-over-one-billion","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-group-delivers-parcel-volumes-of-over-one-billion","press","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22alSYNxIAAC0AgZZj%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2026-07-13T13:27:54+0000",[55],"evri-group-delivers-parcel-volumes-of-over-one-billion-after-record-year-powered-by-80m-investment",[],[],{"title":59,"category":8,"metaDescription":60,"canonical":61,"titleTag":62,"featuredImage":63,"publishedDate":79,"slices":80},"Evri Group Delivers Parcel Volumes of Over One Billion After Record Year Powered by £80M Investment","Read here about Evri Group FY 25-26 Financial Results","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002FEvri-Group-Delivers-Parcel-Volumes-Over-One-Billion","Evri Group Delivers Parcel Volumes of Over One Billion",{"dimensions":64,"alt":67,"copyright":8,"url":68,"id":69,"edit":70,"thumbnail":72},{"width":65,"height":66},960,568,"External image of Evri hub","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FSqag_iUQucUos-nH_4H0A1376.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,0,6000,3550&w=960&h=568","Sqag_iUQucUos-nH",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":71},"transparent",{"dimensions":73,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":76,"id":69,"edit":77},{"width":74,"height":75},384,182,"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FSqag_iUQucUos-nH_4H0A1376.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,353,6000,2844&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":78,"zoom":33,"background":71},353,"2026-07-13",[81,103,143,150,246],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":84,"primary":100,"id":101,"slice_type":102,"slice_label":8},"default-slice","sktwi1xtmkfgx8626",[85],{"title":86,"content":8,"pillEnabled":87,"link":88,"dataGtmTrack":8},"Click here to read about Evri's Annual Reports",false,{"id":89,"type":90,"tags":91,"lang":19,"slug":93,"first_publication_date":94,"last_publication_date":95,"uid":96,"url":97,"link_type":98,"key":99,"isBroken":87},"YvpQihIAACAAniG5","content-page",[92],"Policies","our-latest-report","2022-08-17T13:17:06+0000","2026-07-13T14:12:29+0000","annual-reports","\u002Fannual-reports","Document","588a1755-bf59-4a59-a724-5d1748f41078",{"sectionTitle":8,"sectionDescription":8,"pillEnabled":87,"showPaddingTop":87},"feature_link_cards$758b5f17-e36d-43dc-a978-fe7144acf48e","feature_link_cards",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":104,"primary":106,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[105],{},{"content":107},[108,113,116,119,122,125,129,132,135,138],{"type":109,"text":110,"spans":111,"direction":112},"list-item","Expanded Evri Group delivering over 1 billion parcels annually",[],"ltr",{"type":109,"text":114,"spans":115,"direction":112},"Latest FY year results show 17% YoY increase in parcel volumes fuelled by £80m investment into operations, customer service and couriers",[],{"type":109,"text":117,"spans":118,"direction":112},"Strong Group revenue up +29% YoY follows transformational year with strategic acquisitions of DHL eCommerce UK and Coll-8",[],{"type":109,"text":120,"spans":121,"direction":112},"Group Adjusted EBITDA rose 18% to £402m, marking another year of strong growth",[],{"type":109,"text":123,"spans":124,"direction":112},"Ambition to become UK’s biggest parcel delivery company, targeting 1.4 billion parcels annually by 2030, as well as a technology-driven e-commerce enabler",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":128,"direction":112},"paragraph","",[],{"type":126,"text":130,"spans":131,"direction":112},"Evri Group, the UK’s leading dedicated parcel delivery company, has today revealed it is now delivering more than one billion parcels on an annual basis. This follows a record financial year for volumes in FY25\u002F26, as it sets out its ambition to become the UK’s number one parcel delivery company.",[],{"type":126,"text":133,"spans":134,"direction":112},"Bolstered by a strategic £80m investment into its operations, service and people, the company’s latest financial report reveals Group parcel volumes increased 17% for the 12 months to 28 February 2026.",[],{"type":126,"text":136,"spans":137,"direction":112},"Following the completion of its merger with DHL eCommerce UK in October 2025, the enlarged group has met its target of exceeding one billion parcels three years earlier than previously planned, with the business now setting its sights on a new target of hitting 1.4 billion parcels by 2030.",[],{"type":126,"text":139,"spans":140,"direction":112},"The news comes as the newly formed Evri Group reported strong financial results, with revenue up 29% YoY to £2.38bn for the 52 weeks to 28 February 2026, while Group Adjusted EBITDA rose to £402m - marking another year of growth in a very competitive market environment.",[],"rich_text$3e17074e-984c-431f-af68-ac47b28f726f","rich_text",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":144,"primary":145,"id":148,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":146,"quoteSource":147},"Shopping habits have changed for good. The growth of online small businesses, social commerce and pre-loved marketplaces last year is driving parcel volumes higher, with the combined Evri Group now delivering more than one billion parcels annually.\nFollowing significant investment in our service, operations and people this year, including £50m to more than double our ParcelShop and locker network by 2030, we are focused on meeting customers where they are, with greater flexibility, convenience and choice.\nThe formation of Evri Group, through our merger with DHL eCommerce UK and acquisition of Coll-8, means we are better placed than ever to offer greater reach and more ways for customers to send, receive and return parcels at a fair price.\nOur ambition is to become the UK’s largest parcel company by 2030, delivering 1.4 billion parcels a year. We will achieve that by continuing to invest in our network, technology and people, while maintaining the quality of service our customers expect.\nThank you to our colleagues and couriers, whose dedication makes this success possible every day.","Martijn de Lange, CEO at Evri","quote$1e145a83-f484-4106-9e10-c6e58da199e9","quote",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":151,"primary":152,"id":245,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":153},[154,156,158,164,167,170,173,176,179,184,187,190,193,196,199,202,207,210,213,216,219,222,225,230,233,236,239,242],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":155,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":157,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":159,"spans":160,"direction":112},"Evri Group – a transformational year",[161],{"start":32,"end":162,"type":163},36,"strong",{"type":126,"text":165,"spans":166,"direction":112},"These latest results follow a transformational year for Evri after it completed its merger with DHL eCommerce UK in 2025, expanding the scale and range of what it can offer to both shoppers and businesses. Evri also acquired Coll-8, an Irish independent customs clearance and logistics specialist, in May 2025, which will further supercharge Evri’s international capability.",[],{"type":126,"text":168,"spans":169,"direction":112},"Following its merger with DHL UK eCommerce, Evri Group has extended its position as one of the UK's largest logistics businesses, while diversifying to become a leading technology-driven e-commerce enabler, further fuelled by its continued new client wins, customer adoption, and partnership with marketplaces and social e-commerce platforms. It has also been independently recognised for its improving quality of service, and for holding the best on-time delivery record for Evri Drop Off.",[],{"type":126,"text":171,"spans":172,"direction":112},"The enlarged Evri Group encompasses six operating brands: Evri; Evri Premium - A Network of DHL; Evri Fulfilment; Evri International; UK Mail; and Coll-8. Together, this gives customers access to the UK's only network that combines affordable consumer delivery, premium high-value delivery, B2B mail, and specialist customs clearance in one place.",[],{"type":126,"text":174,"spans":175,"direction":112},"Evri Premium - A Network of DHL brings together the best of both organisations, with the trusted premium network, enhanced by Evri's technology, innovation and investment. The result is a premium delivery proposition with the backing of DHL's global network and the benefits of Evri's market-leading customer experience, visibility and convenience.",[],{"type":126,"text":177,"spans":178,"direction":112},"This marks a transformative new chapter for the Evri Group, expanding beyond a parcel delivery business to a major international e-commerce logistics group.",[],{"type":126,"text":180,"spans":181,"direction":112},"Responding to changes in shopping behaviour",[182],{"start":32,"end":183,"type":163},43,{"type":126,"text":185,"spans":186,"direction":112},"The Group has responded to the growing and evolving e-commerce market with a strategic growth programme focused on investments in our capacity, people, and capabilities.",[],{"type":126,"text":188,"spans":189,"direction":112},"The continued rise of recommerce, with the buying and selling of pre-loved items via platforms like Vinted, eBay and Depop, has turned the average household wardrobe into a small business, driving significant growth in consumer-to-consumer parcel volumes.",[],{"type":126,"text":191,"spans":192,"direction":112},"While the rise of social commerce, the ‘scroll and spend’ social shopping, where purchases are made directly through platforms like TikTok Shop and Instagram, has added another layer of demand. In addition, easy, hassle-free returns have become a basic expectation for online shoppers, making a reliable, affordable returns network a commercial necessity for any retailer.",[],{"type":126,"text":194,"spans":195,"direction":112},"Evri has been at the heart of all these trends, and as the delivery partner of choice for Europe's leading pre-loved marketplaces, SMEs and retail platforms, the Group is well placed to grow as these markets continue to expand.",[],{"type":126,"text":197,"spans":198,"direction":112},"In addition, Evri is giving customers more control over deliveries than ever before.",[],{"type":126,"text":200,"spans":201,"direction":112},"Whether that's choosing home delivery, diverting a parcel in flight to a safe place or neighbour, or collecting from one of its ParcelShops and lockers across the UK, which topped over 11,000 locations during FY25\u002F26, millions of customers have decided where, when and how they receive parcels by setting their preferences online or in the Evri app.",[],{"type":126,"text":203,"spans":204,"direction":112},"Strategic Investments",[205],{"start":32,"end":206,"type":163},21,{"type":126,"text":208,"spans":209,"direction":112},"The Group increased capital expenditure to £80m in 2025\u002F6 (2024\u002F25: £57m). Capital spend continues to be high-returning with a clear focus on strategic investments underpinning commitment to quality of service and future growth.",[],{"type":126,"text":211,"spans":212,"direction":112},"The Group has invested around £30m in state-of-the-art automated sortation at Evri’s Barnsley super hub, with a £25m investment in the third tier of sortation and the introduction of a £4m small item sorter. These upgrades will enable the site to process up to 1.5 million parcels per day by Christmas 2026.",[],{"type":126,"text":214,"spans":215,"direction":112},"The business also announced a £50m investment in its ParcelShop and locker network, aiming to expand to 25,000 UK locations by 2030, more than doubling its current footprint and creating the country’s largest network. This rollout includes the first launch of Evri’s owned smart lockers, offering enhanced functionality for customers.",[],{"type":126,"text":217,"spans":218,"direction":112},"Beyond physical infrastructure, the Group has invested significantly in technology and automation to improve how it operates.",[],{"type":126,"text":220,"spans":221,"direction":112},"This includes Veri-snap, an AI-powered system that reviews millions of delivery photographs each day, to ensure deliveries meet customer expectations and best practice standards. As well as the company’s brand-new courier app, which works in tandem with AI to further enhance delivery quality, compliance and consistency in the final mile. Together this investment in technology underpins the end-to-end courier delivery process, managing quality in real time and recognising high performing couriers.",[],{"type":126,"text":223,"spans":224,"direction":112},"Retailer and customer-facing improvements include an upgraded AI chatbot with call-back and escalation features, direct chatbot deep-linking for faster customer journeys and a new real-time, fully digital client portal for account management.",[],{"type":126,"text":226,"spans":227,"direction":112},"Delivering for everyone",[228],{"start":32,"end":229,"type":163},23,{"type":126,"text":231,"spans":232,"direction":112},"In its latest financial year, Evri marked one year of its partnership with Scope, surpassing its fundraising target with over £180,000 raised since the start of the partnership. The Group also published its first Social Impact Report, reinforcing its ambition to be the UK’s most accessible delivery company.",[],{"type":126,"text":234,"spans":235,"direction":112},"With one in four deliveries going to disabled consumers, Evri introduced new accessibility features, including doorstep preferences used by over 90,000 customers and a digital audit reaching 500,000 users, while supporting Scope campaigns and engaging colleagues.",[],{"type":126,"text":237,"spans":238,"direction":112},"The Group provides opportunities to work for many thousands of people across the UK, and it employs more than 12,000 people, while working with over 30,000 self-employed couriers and drivers. Evri has 4 million independent five-star Trustpilot reviews and an average courier rating of 4.6 out of 5.",[],{"type":126,"text":240,"spans":241,"direction":112},"On sustainability, Evri achieved EcoVadis Gold accreditation, placing it among the top 5% of businesses globally for sustainability performance. The recognition reflects progress across environmental, social and ethical priorities, including expanding its electric fleet to 427 vehicles (17% of total fleet) and joining the United Nations Global Compact.",[],{"type":126,"text":243,"spans":244,"direction":112},"                                       ENDS",[],"rich_text$553a15c6-bf4b-4f0e-a8dc-9cc03aabf8d9",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":247,"primary":248,"id":284,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":249},[250,255,258,261,264,267,270,273],{"type":126,"text":251,"spans":252,"direction":112},"About Evri",[253],{"start":32,"end":254,"type":163},10,{"type":126,"text":256,"spans":257,"direction":112},"Evri Group is the UK’s leading dedicated parcel delivery company. Following the completed merger between Evri and DHL eCommerce UK in 2025, the combined Group now delivers more than one billion parcels on an annual basis.",[],{"type":126,"text":259,"spans":260,"direction":112},"DHL eCommerce UK will be rebranded Evri Premium – A Network of DHL, providing greater choice and cost-competitive services for both consumers and businesses, with new services including mail collection and processing, and a dedicated separate network for high-value deliveries.",[],{"type":126,"text":262,"spans":263,"direction":112},"Evri, the core operating brand, partners with Europe’s top retailers, marketplaces, pre-loved sites and small businesses – and its mission is to be the most convenient way to send, receive and return parcels at a fair cost.",[],{"type":126,"text":265,"spans":266,"direction":112},"Founded in Yorkshire in 1974, Evri has grown over the last five decades into a team of 12,000+ employees and 30,000+ self-employed couriers working in their local communities, as well as a growing network of more than 11,000+ ParcelShops and Lockers and 500+ hubs, depots and delivery units. ",[],{"type":126,"text":268,"spans":269,"direction":112},"The Group continues to enhance its international capability and enable the global trade of parcels, boosted by its acquisition in 2025 of Coll-8, an Irish independent customs clearance and logistics specialist, and the DHL eCommerce UK merger.",[],{"type":126,"text":271,"spans":272,"direction":112},"Evri has 4 million independent 5-star Trustpilot reviews, an average courier rating of 4.6 out of 5, reflecting a strong commitment to customer experience. Every parcel matters to Evri, and that is why it is committed to investing in the continuous improvement of its operations, service and technology.",[],{"type":126,"text":274,"spans":275,"direction":112},"For more info: www.evri.com\u002Fnews-and-corporate ",[276],{"start":277,"end":278,"type":279,"data":280},15,46,"hyperlink",{"link_type":281,"url":282,"target":283},"Web","press.html\u002F\u002Furldefense.com\u002Fv3\u002F__http:\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fnews-and-corporate__;!!KZXpRQ!XXp1b6auPQhqEikzO24Td1WLLcOiKei-_sEGnaz1LXy6FIZdIH744ZKALMLghNBHhvufy1YVkeCCqssIjm9R-A$","_blank","rich_text$d943dff3-8312-4cc6-8352-5ee66c413f35",{"id":286,"uid":287,"url":288,"type":50,"href":289,"tags":290,"first_publication_date":291,"last_publication_date":291,"slugs":292,"linked_documents":293,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":294,"data":295},"aibUXREAACkAgDFx","world-cup-sofaconomy-to-generate-388-million-spend-by-brits","\u002Fpress\u002Fworld-cup-sofaconomy-to-generate-388-million-spend-by-brits","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22aibUXREAACkAgDFx%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2026-06-08T14:47:49+0000",[287],[],[],{"title":296,"category":8,"metaDescription":297,"canonical":298,"titleTag":287,"featuredImage":299,"publishedDate":310,"slices":311},"World Cup ‘sofaconomy’ to generate £388 million spend by Brits","World-cup-sofaconomy-to-generate-388-million-spend-by-brits","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fworld-cup-sofaconomy-to-generate-388-million-spend-by-brits",{"dimensions":300,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":302,"id":303,"edit":304,"thumbnail":305},{"width":65,"height":301},638,"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaibU0weQX7-eW98Z_Worldcup.png?auto=format,compress&rect=0,0,641,426&w=960&h=638","aibU0weQX7-eW98Z",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":306,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":307,"id":303,"edit":308},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaibU0weQX7-eW98Z_Worldcup.png?auto=format,compress&rect=0,61,641,304&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":309,"zoom":33,"background":71},61,"2026-06-08",[312,389,396],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":313,"primary":315,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[314],{},{"content":316},[317,323,328,333,337,342,349,352,358,363,368,373,375,378,386],{"type":126,"text":318,"spans":319,"direction":112},"·       Sporting events drive the ‘sofaconomy’ as shopping habits fuel the stay-at-home trend",[320],{"start":321,"end":322,"type":163},8,93,{"type":126,"text":324,"spans":325,"direction":112},"·       £4.8 million of purchases could be triggered by a single World Cup match – across the parcel industry and the World Cup, this could generate £388 million in spending",[326],{"start":321,"end":327,"type":163},173,{"type":126,"text":329,"spans":330,"direction":112},"·       68% spike in parcel volumes from sportswear retailers as fans turn to online shopping for pre-event buying, in-event purchases and post-event spending",[331],{"start":321,"end":332,"type":163},158,{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":335,"direction":112}," ",[336],{"start":32,"end":33,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":338,"spans":339,"direction":112},"8th June 2026: The World Cup is set to fuel a surge in online shopping across the UK, with parcel volumes jumping significantly as fans gear up for the tournament – and the ‘sofaconomy’ driving Brits to spend up to an additional £388 million.",[340],{"start":32,"end":341,"type":163},14,{"type":126,"text":343,"spans":344,"direction":112},"New data released by Evri shows that major sporting events, in particular the World Cup, are part of retail’s hidden calendar, driving parcel volumes up by as much as 68% above typical levels for sports retailers, as consumers rush online to prepare for match days.",[345],{"start":206,"end":346,"type":279,"data":347},25,{"link_type":281,"url":348,"target":283},"press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002F",{"type":126,"text":350,"spans":351,"direction":112},"Evri is anticipating a surge in parcel volume with the World Cup only days away. Based on the average value of parcels in the Evri network, and Evri’s own parcel data for previous tournaments; Euro 2024 and World Cup 2022, it’s expected that Evri will see more than £4.8 million worth of goods enter its network – for a single World Cup match - from three of its top sportswear retailers alone. Extrapolated across the logistics industry, and with England possibly playing a maximum of eight games – if they reach the final – this could result in £388 million in spending by Brits.",[],{"type":126,"text":353,"spans":354,"direction":112}," This trend highlights how modern fans are increasingly shopping in real time, purchasing replica kits, merchandise, fitness gear and equipment, and home viewing essentials. The data shows a changing consumer mindset, the growth reflects a broader shift in how consumers engage with sport and retail:",[355],{"start":356,"end":357,"type":163},217,218,{"type":109,"text":359,"spans":360,"direction":112},"Pre-event buying. Fans expect fast, flexible delivery ahead of key matches; Evri delivers around four million parcels on some of its busiest days, including those around major sporting events. Next day delivery accounts for around half of deliveries around this time.",[361],{"start":32,"end":362,"type":163},17,{"type":109,"text":364,"spans":365,"direction":112},"In-event second-screen shopping. Shopping is increasingly instant and event driven. Social media and live coverage influence in-event purchasing decisions in real time leading to the rise of ‘second-screen’ shopping.",[366],{"start":32,"end":367,"type":163},33,{"type":109,"text":369,"spans":370,"direction":112},"The final whistle effect. Post-event celebrations or commiseration spending drive secondary spikes after match preparation purchases.",[371],{"start":32,"end":372,"type":163},26,{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":374,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":376,"spans":377,"direction":112},"Rather than planning purchases in advance, consumers are now reacting to fixtures, results and trends as they happen. To help ensure customers get their parcel ahead of England’s first game with Croatia on 17th June, Evri is advising customers to order by 15th June with next day delivery for consumers to get their football merchandise before the first game.",[],{"type":126,"text":379,"spans":380,"direction":112},"With a busy summer of sport ahead, kicking off with the World Cup, followed by Wimbledon and The Commonwealth Games, Evri is keen to make sure consumers never miss a parcel and is encouraging them to download the Evri app. Whilst the final the minutes of an England game can be chaotic - parcel delivery shouldn’t be and whilst we can’t end 60 years of hurt, we can end delivery disappointment.",[381],{"start":382,"end":383,"type":279,"data":384},213,221,{"link_type":281,"url":385,"target":283},"press.html\u002F\u002Fapps.apple.com\u002Fgb\u002Fapp\u002Fevri\u002Fid1446461114",{"type":126,"text":387,"spans":388,"direction":112},"By giving consumers more choice than ever with parcels delivered to customer’s homes, neighbours, ParcelShops, lockers, or to safe places, Evri’s customers can use the app or website to take control of their deliveries",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":390,"primary":392,"id":395,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[391],{},{"quoteText":393,"quoteSource":394},"Major sporting moments like the World Cup are no longer just cultural milestones – they’re powerful drivers of real-time shopping behaviour. We’re seeing fans increasingly turn to ‘sofaconomy’ spending, buying everything from kits to home viewing essentials as the action unfolds.At Evri, we’re geared up to support this surge, helping retailers meet demand and ensuring consumers can shop with confidence – whether they’re preparing for kick-off or celebrating after the final whistle. Our focus is on giving customers fast, flexible delivery options so they never miss a moment, or a parcel.","David Saenz, Chief Commercial Officer at Evri Group","quote$9e3adc75-b49a-4e37-aa23-b1347a9f1816",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":397,"primary":399,"id":473,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[398],{},{"content":400},[401,406,409,412,415,418,421,424,427,430,433,436,438,441,444,447,449,452,454,456,460,462,465],{"type":126,"text":402,"spans":403,"direction":112},"Notes to Editors",[404],{"start":32,"end":405,"type":163},16,{"type":126,"text":407,"spans":408,"direction":112},"Methodology",[],{"type":126,"text":410,"spans":411,"direction":112},"Parcel volume increase (68%)\nThe 68% uplift is based on analysis of parcel volumes from a basket of major sportswear retailers within Evri’s network during UEFA Euro 2024. The figure represents the average increase in parcel volumes in the 48-hour period before and after match days, compared with baseline non-event trading periods.",[],{"type":126,"text":413,"spans":414,"direction":112},"Average parcel value (£31.50)\nThe average parcel value is calculated using Evri network data for the week commencing 19 May 2026, based on 16.1 million parcels, giving a mean declared item value of £31.50.",[],{"type":126,"text":416,"spans":417,"direction":112},"Estimated spend per match (£4.8 million)\nUsing the £31.50 average parcel value and observed parcel volumes from three of Evri’s largest sportswear retail clients during comparable tournament fixtures (Euro 2024 and World Cup 2022), Evri estimates that parcels linked to match-day demand equate to approximately £4.8 million in consumer purchases per match within its network.",[],{"type":126,"text":419,"spans":420,"direction":112},"Industry-wide extrapolation (£388 million)\nTo estimate total UK spend:",[],{"type":126,"text":422,"spans":423,"direction":112},"·       Calculated using Evri’s assumed share of the UK parcels market",[],{"type":126,"text":425,"spans":426,"direction":112},"·       The £4.8 million figure is scaled proportionally to represent the wider logistics industry",[],{"type":126,"text":428,"spans":429,"direction":112},"·       The estimate assumes England plays up to eight matches (progressing to the final)",[],{"type":126,"text":431,"spans":432,"direction":112},"·       This results in a projected total of up to £388 million in incremental consumer spending linked to World Cup-driven parcel activity",[],{"type":126,"text":434,"spans":435,"direction":112},"Definition of ‘sofaconomy’\n‘Sofaconomy’ refers to consumer spending driven by at-home viewing of live events, including pre-event preparation, in-event purchases via second-screen behaviour, and post-event discretionary spending.",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":437,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":439,"spans":440,"direction":112},"About Evri Group",[],{"type":126,"text":442,"spans":443,"direction":112},"Evri Group is the UK’s leading dedicated parcel delivery company. Following the completed merger between Evri and DHL eCommerce UK in 2025, the combined Group delivers more than 1 billion parcels and a further 1 billion business letters annually.",[],{"type":126,"text":445,"spans":446,"direction":112},"DHL eCommerce UK will be rebranded Evri Premium, providing greater choice and cost-competitive services for both consumers and businesses, with new services including mail collection and processing, and a dedicated separate network for high-value deliveries.",[],{"type":126,"text":262,"spans":448,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":450,"spans":451,"direction":112},"Founded in Yorkshire in 1974, Evri has grown over the last five decades into a team of 12,000+ employees and 30,000+ self-employed couriers working in their local communities, as well as a growing network of more than 12,000+ ParcelShops and Lockers and 500+ hubs and depots. ",[],{"type":126,"text":268,"spans":453,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":271,"spans":455,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":274,"spans":457,"direction":112},[458],{"start":277,"end":278,"type":279,"data":459},{"link_type":281,"url":282,"target":283},{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":461,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":463,"spans":464,"direction":112},"Media enquiries",[],{"type":126,"text":466,"spans":467,"direction":112},"For any enquiries relating to Evri Group or its companies; Evri, DHL eCommerce UK, UK Mail and Coll-8, please contact: prteam@evri.com",[468],{"start":469,"end":470,"type":279,"data":471},119,134,{"link_type":281,"url":472,"target":283},"mailto:prteam@evri.com","rich_text$ce002123-26b4-41b8-8b03-c7e639238eee",{"id":475,"uid":476,"url":477,"type":50,"href":478,"tags":479,"first_publication_date":480,"last_publication_date":480,"slugs":481,"linked_documents":482,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":483,"data":484},"ae817xIAACgA9ioK","robots-in-rugby-evri-set-to-trial-autonomous-guided-vehicles-in-its-rugby-hub","\u002Fpress\u002Frobots-in-rugby-evri-set-to-trial-autonomous-guided-vehicles-in-its-rugby-hub","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ae817xIAACgA9ioK%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2026-04-27T10:29:23+0000",[476],[],[],{"title":485,"category":8,"metaDescription":485,"canonical":486,"titleTag":485,"featuredImage":487,"publishedDate":498,"slices":499},"Robots in Rugby: Evri set to trial autonomous guided vehicles in its Rugby hub","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Frobots-in-rugby-evri-set-to-trial-autonomous-guided-vehicles-in-its-rugby-hub",{"dimensions":488,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":490,"id":491,"edit":492,"thumbnail":493},{"width":65,"height":489},540,"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F94a05482-5519-4dcc-81b3-7332e50ee1ea_Barnsley+Image.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,0,1920,1080&w=960&h=540","ZGSbvxEAACIA9D2b",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":494,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":495,"id":491,"edit":496},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F94a05482-5519-4dcc-81b3-7332e50ee1ea_Barnsley+Image.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,85,1920,910&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":497,"zoom":33,"background":71},85,"2026-04-27",[500,540,546,552,559],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":501,"primary":503,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[502],{},{"content":504},[505,508,511,514,516,520,523,525,528,530,533,535,538],{"type":126,"text":506,"spans":507,"direction":112},"·       Evri will trial two AGV power pallets, in partnership with Translift Group",[],{"type":126,"text":509,"spans":510,"direction":112},"·       The trial marks Evri’s first step on its ‘under the roof’ robotic journey",[],{"type":126,"text":512,"spans":513,"direction":112},"·       The announcement follows two successful trials of autonomous delivery robots in Yorkshire.",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":515,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":517,"spans":518,"direction":112},"27th April 2026  Evri Group is looking to lead the way in innovation and automation as the UK’s premier parcel delivery company and has taken the next step on its robotics journey as it has today announced it is trialling two automated guided vehicles (AGVs) at its Rugby hub, marking the first step in what Evri is calling ‘under the roof’ robotics.",[519],{"start":32,"end":362,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":521,"spans":522,"direction":112},"Currently, Evri has workers moving cages or pallets with cardboard in from one end of the hub to another all day, every day. The introduction of these robotic vehicles means they can pick up the load, and as a growing business, investing in robotics like this allows",[],{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":524,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":526,"spans":527,"direction":112},"existing workers to be redistributed to more productive and meaningful tasks to meet the growing demands of increased parcel volumes as well as being upskilled to become robot handlers!",[],{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":529,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":531,"spans":532,"direction":112},"These automated power pallets have a built-in LiDAR (Light Detection Ranging) to detect ceiling mounted sensors which guide and map vehicle’s route. The AGV will be programmed to follow the route from A to B and scheduled stops can be included if needed and on a continuous loop allowing workers to load or unload manually along the way. It carries a load of up to 1.5 tonnes.  They can also be switched from automated to manual if required.",[],{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":534,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":536,"spans":537,"direction":112},"The announcement comes following successful trials of a robotic delivery dog last August as well as an on-going trial of autonomous deliveries in Barnsley, the UK’s official and only ‘Tech Town’, where Evri’s largest hub is based.",[],{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":539,"direction":112},[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":541,"primary":543,"id":395,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[542],{},{"quoteText":544,"quoteSource":545},"This trial marks the first of what we hope will be many, exploring how robotics can support our hub and depot operations as well as the colleagues that work there. We’re constantly looking at innovative ways to improve and enhance what we do, and we’ve got more exciting things we’ll be looking at this year.","Adrian Berry, Innovation Delivery Manager at Evri Group",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":547,"primary":548,"id":551,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":549,"quoteSource":550},"I’m excited to see the AGVs in action and to see the benefits they can have on production. Some of the work our colleagues carry out can be very monotonous, our hub is incredibly large and it takes a long time walking back and forth carrying cardboard for example,  things like this will help our people on the tasks they don’t love so they can spend time on work they enjoy.","Lee Moss, Head of Hub operations at Evri Group","quote$8d8b76e9-8505-4c06-af5d-15869dd2870c",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":553,"primary":555,"id":557,"slice_type":558,"slice_label":8},[554],{},{"SectionHeader":8,"SectionText":556},[],"section_component$e7791133-821c-4c24-b09a-f4bdfafcaf06","section_component",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":560,"primary":562,"id":473,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[561],{},{"content":563},[564,567,570,573,576,579,583,588],{"type":126,"text":251,"spans":565,"direction":112},[566],{"start":32,"end":254,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":568,"spans":569,"direction":112},"Evri Group brings together Evri, DHL eCommerce UK – which in 2026 will be rebranded Evri Premium, a network of DHL - customs clearance and logistics specialist Coll-8 and business letters leader UK Mail, to create the UK’s premier parcel delivery company. The combined Evri Group will deliver more than 1 billion parcels and a further 1 billion business letters annually.",[],{"type":126,"text":571,"spans":572,"direction":112},"Evri, the core operating brand, currently delivers around 900 million parcels a year, and is on a mission to be the most convenient way to send, receive and return parcels, without costing the earth.",[],{"type":126,"text":574,"spans":575,"direction":112},"Working with everyone from Europe’s top retailers, marketplaces and pre-loved sites to gift-givers, the roots of Evri can be traced back to Yorkshire in 1974. The business has grown over the last five decades and now has a team of 12,000+ employees and 30,000+ couriers, as well as a growing network of more than 10,000+ ParcelShops and Lockers and 500+ state-of-the-art hubs and depots.  Following its acquisition of Coll-8, an Irish independent customs clearance and logistics specialist, and merger with DHL eCommerce UK, Evri Group continues to enhance its international capability and enable world trade.",[],{"type":126,"text":577,"spans":578,"direction":112},"Evri has over 4 million independent 5-star Trustpilot reviews, an average courier rating of 4.6\u002F5, reflecting a strong commitment to customer experience.",[],{"type":126,"text":274,"spans":580,"direction":112},[581],{"start":277,"end":278,"type":279,"data":582},{"link_type":281,"url":282,"target":283},{"type":126,"text":584,"spans":585,"direction":112}," Media enquiries  ",[586],{"start":33,"end":587,"type":163},18,{"type":126,"text":466,"spans":589,"direction":112},[590],{"start":469,"end":470,"type":279,"data":591},{"link_type":281,"url":472,"target":283},{"id":593,"uid":594,"url":595,"type":50,"href":596,"tags":597,"first_publication_date":598,"last_publication_date":598,"slugs":599,"linked_documents":601,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":602,"data":603},"addesRIAACwA9njx","evri-recognised-sustainability-performance","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-recognised-sustainability-performance","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22addesRIAACwA9njx%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2026-04-09T08:14:56+0000",[600],"evri-recognised-in-top-5-of-companies-globally-for-sustainability-performance",[],[],{"title":604,"category":8,"metaDescription":605,"canonical":606,"titleTag":604,"featuredImage":607,"publishedDate":618,"slices":619},"Evri Recognised in Top 5% of Companies Globally for Sustainability Performance","Read about Evri Being Recognised in Top 5% of Companies Globally for Sustainability Performance","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002FEvri-Recognised-Top-5%-Companies-Globally-Sustainability-Performance",{"dimensions":608,"alt":609,"copyright":8,"url":610,"id":611,"edit":612,"thumbnail":613},{"width":65,"height":65},"Image of EcoVadis Gold badge","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaddfUZ1ZCF7ETAYG_HERMESPARCELNETLTD-GROUP-_EV_Recognition.png?auto=format,compress&rect=0,0,1667,1667&w=960&h=960","addfUZ1ZCF7ETAYG",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":614,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":615,"id":611,"edit":616},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaddfUZ1ZCF7ETAYG_HERMESPARCELNETLTD-GROUP-_EV_Recognition.png?auto=format,compress&rect=0,438,1667,790&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":617,"zoom":33,"background":71},438,"2026-04-09",[620,656,661],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":621,"primary":623,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[622],{},{"content":624},[625,634,637,640,643,646,649,652,654],{"type":126,"text":626,"spans":627,"direction":112},"Evri, the UK’s premier parcel delivery company, has been awarded Gold status by independent global sustainability ratings provider EcoVadis, placing the business in the top 5% of companies assessed worldwide for sustainability performance.",[628,631],{"start":629,"end":630,"type":163},65,69,{"start":632,"end":633,"type":163},169,207,{"type":126,"text":635,"spans":636,"direction":112},"The Gold rating marks a significant step forward for Evri, and following its previous Silver accreditation, recognises continued progress across key environmental, social and ethical areas of the business.",[],{"type":126,"text":638,"spans":639,"direction":112},"EcoVadis assesses organisations on the quality of their sustainability performance and management practices across four core themes – Environment, Labour & Human Rights, Ethics, and Sustainable Procurement, with ratings based on evidence-led analysis of policies, actions and results, and benchmarked against companies globally.",[],{"type":126,"text":641,"spans":642,"direction":112},"Evri’s Gold EcoVadis accreditation further reinforces its commitment to becoming net zero, reflecting year‑on‑year improvements in its sustainability performance.",[],{"type":126,"text":644,"spans":645,"direction":112},"Recent progress recognised within the assessment includes the strengthening of Evri’s environmental policy to introduce clearer commitments and targets, as well as the launch of a supplier code of conduct to further embed responsible and ethical practices across its supply chain.",[],{"type":126,"text":647,"spans":648,"direction":112},"The accreditation also follows Evri’s recent participation in the United Nations Global Compact, the world’s largest voluntary corporate sustainability initiative, reflecting the commitment of CEO Martijn de Lange and the wider business to uphold its principles and drive meaningful impact.",[],{"type":126,"text":650,"spans":651,"direction":112},"Established by the United Nations in 2000, the UN Global Compact is founded on ten universally accepted principles covering human rights, labour, the environment, and anti‑corruption, and calls on participating organisations to align their strategies and operations with these values.",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":653,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":655,"direction":112},[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":657,"primary":658,"id":660,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":659,"quoteSource":147},"We’re thrilled to be awarded Gold status by EcoVadis in recognition of the huge steps we’re making towards Evri’s sustainability goals.\nPlacing us in the top 5% of companies globally for our sustainability performance, this accreditation reflects the important progress taking place across our operations and supply chain, and our commitment to building a more sustainable and responsible parcel delivery network.","quote$97e50289-4016-4846-b246-75087b70aa77",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":662,"primary":663,"id":714,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":664},[665,667,672,675,679,687,691,695,700,702,704,706,709],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":666,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":668,"spans":669,"direction":112},"ENDS",[670],{"start":32,"end":671,"type":163},4,{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":673,"direction":112},[674],{"start":32,"end":33,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":676,"spans":677,"direction":112},"Notes to editor",[678],{"start":32,"end":277,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":680,"spans":681,"direction":112},"Imagery: https:\u002F\u002Fphotos.app.goo.gl\u002Fzwj5yAqmHBACBoqv9",[682],{"start":683,"end":684,"type":279,"data":685},9,52,{"link_type":281,"url":686,"target":283},"press.html\u002F\u002Fphotos.app.goo.gl\u002Fzwj5yAqmHBACBoqv9",{"type":126,"text":688,"spans":689,"direction":112},"Media enquiries  ",[690],{"start":32,"end":362,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":466,"spans":692,"direction":112},[693],{"start":469,"end":470,"type":279,"data":694},{"link_type":281,"url":472,"target":283},{"type":126,"text":696,"spans":697,"direction":112},"About Evri  ",[698],{"start":32,"end":699,"type":163},12,{"type":126,"text":568,"spans":701,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":571,"spans":703,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":574,"spans":705,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":707,"spans":708,"direction":112},"Evri has 4 million independent 5-star Trustpilot reviews, an average courier rating of 4.6\u002F5, reflecting a strong commitment to customer experience.",[],{"type":126,"text":710,"spans":711,"direction":112},"For more info: www.evri.com\u002Fnews-and-corporate ",[712],{"start":277,"end":278,"type":279,"data":713},{"link_type":281,"url":282,"target":283},"rich_text$b4cde17a-1573-4cf4-a47a-843950f56d16",{"id":716,"uid":717,"url":718,"type":50,"href":719,"tags":720,"first_publication_date":721,"last_publication_date":722,"slugs":723,"linked_documents":725,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":726,"data":727},"acqPexIAACcA49Li","evri-invest-4m-expand-fulfiment-barnsley","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-invest-4m-expand-fulfiment-barnsley","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22acqPexIAACcA49Li%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2026-03-30T15:06:44+0000","2026-03-31T09:21:19+0000",[724],"evri-group-invest-over-4m-to-expand-fulfilment-network-in-barnsley",[],[],{"title":728,"category":8,"metaDescription":729,"canonical":730,"titleTag":728,"featuredImage":731,"publishedDate":743,"slices":744},"Evri Group invest over £4m to expand fulfilment network in Barnsley","Read about Evri Group's investment of over £4m to expand fulfilment network in Barnsley","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-group-invest-expand-fulfilment-network",{"dimensions":732,"alt":734,"copyright":8,"url":735,"id":736,"edit":737,"thumbnail":738},{"width":65,"height":733},615,"Image showing external view of Evri's new fulfilment hub in Barnsley","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FacqQE5GXnQHGZGfw_FulfilmentCentreExterior.png?auto=format,compress&rect=0,0,2345,1502&w=960&h=615","acqQE5GXnQHGZGfw",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":739,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":740,"id":736,"edit":741},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FacqQE5GXnQHGZGfw_FulfilmentCentreExterior.png?auto=format,compress&rect=0,195,2345,1111&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":742,"zoom":33,"background":71},195,"2026-03-30",[745,790,794,800],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":746,"primary":748,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[747],{},{"content":749},[750,754,759,764,767,770,773,776,779,782,785,788],{"type":109,"text":751,"spans":752,"direction":112},"Evri Group invests over £4m in new Barnsley fulfilment centre",[753],{"start":32,"end":309,"type":163},{"type":109,"text":755,"spans":756,"direction":112},"New 265,000 sq ft site designed to support next day demand and growth of SMEs",[757],{"start":32,"end":758,"type":163},77,{"type":109,"text":760,"spans":761,"direction":112},"More than 150 jobs to be created in the community, which follows Barnsley becoming UK’s first ‘Tech Town’",[762],{"start":32,"end":763,"type":163},105,{"type":126,"text":765,"spans":766,"direction":112},"Evri Group, the UK’s premier parcel delivery company, has today announced the launch of a brand new 265,000 sq ft fulfilment centre in Barnsley, following an investment of over £4m into the site.",[],{"type":126,"text":768,"spans":769,"direction":112},"This new Barnsley opening marks the latest milestone in Evri’s rapidly expanding fulfilment operation, which has seen sustained double-digit year-on-year growth since its launch in 2021.",[],{"type":126,"text":771,"spans":772,"direction":112},"Located less than 100 metres from Evri’s existing Barnsley hub, the new facility will enable parcels to be injected directly into its largest operational site every hour, facilitating seamless integration into Evri’s national and international network to unlock faster delivery options for all retailers.",[],{"type":126,"text":774,"spans":775,"direction":112},"Evri received the keys to the site on 18th March, beginning an immediate fit-out of the space, which will launch in July 2026 and include cutting-edge sorting and packing automation, allowing parcels to move from order stage to pick, pack and entrance to the delivery network within an hour.",[],{"type":126,"text":777,"spans":778,"direction":112},"A key feature of the new site is its 11.59pm order cut-off time for next-day delivery – a significant extension that allows thousands of small and medium-sized businesses to get their goods to their customers as fast as the nation’s biggest brands.",[],{"type":126,"text":780,"spans":781,"direction":112},"The facility also provides same-day dispatch, seven days a week, as well as support for Amazon Prime distribution and global scaling capabilities for bedroom CEOs looking to grow internationally.",[],{"type":126,"text":783,"spans":784,"direction":112},"The announcement follows the success of Evri’s first fulfilment centre in Basildon, as well as additional sites on the US East Coast, the Netherlands and Oman, cementing its position as a global fulfilment solution for retailers of all sizes.",[],{"type":126,"text":786,"spans":787,"direction":112},"Following the recent announcement that Barnsley has been recognised as the UK’s first ‘Tech Town’, reflecting the town’s growing reputation as a hub for innovation and inward investment, Evri’s new fulfilment site builds on this momentum in supporting local growth, with over 150 new job roles created as a direct result.",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":789,"direction":112},[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":791,"primary":792,"id":660,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":793,"quoteSource":394},"The launch of this purpose-built fulfilment facility, designed to meet the needs of the shopper of today and tomorrow, will bring exciting opportunities to some of the UK most loved brands as well as our country’s deep reservoir of small and medium size companies.\nWe’ve paired cutting edge fulfilment technology with a direct connection to the Evri Group’s well established and fast growing domestic and international networks, meaning whatever the business need, we have a solution.",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":795,"primary":796,"id":799,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":797,"quoteSource":798},"The Evri team has been an ideal partner as we grow, and we’re very excited with the new warehouse.\nBeing able to order at midnight, have the package in the Evri network within an hour and be delivered next day will be amazing for our customers.","Amy Wilshere of Furocity, Evri fulfilment client","quote$d58fa2a3-46e1-47c2-b5e5-e65b945fc77b",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":801,"primary":802,"id":714,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":803},[804,806,809,812,815,820,825,828,832,835,838,840,843,845],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":805,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":668,"spans":807,"direction":112},[808],{"start":32,"end":671,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":810,"direction":112},[811],{"start":32,"end":33,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":402,"spans":813,"direction":112},[814],{"start":32,"end":405,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":816,"spans":817,"direction":112},"Images",[818],{"start":32,"end":819,"type":163},6,{"type":126,"text":821,"spans":822,"direction":112},"press.html\u002F\u002Fphotos.app.goo.gl\u002Fgk5mepa8FjH1ptLq7",[823],{"start":32,"end":183,"type":279,"data":824},{"link_type":281,"url":821,"target":283},{"type":126,"text":688,"spans":826,"direction":112},[827],{"start":32,"end":362,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":466,"spans":829,"direction":112},[830],{"start":469,"end":470,"type":279,"data":831},{"link_type":281,"url":472,"target":283},{"type":126,"text":696,"spans":833,"direction":112},[834],{"start":32,"end":699,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":836,"spans":837,"direction":112},"Evri Group brings together Evri, DHL eCommerce UK, customs clearance and logistics specialist Coll-8 and business letters leader UK Mail, to create the UK’s premier parcel delivery company. The combined Evri Group will deliver more than 1 billion parcels and a further 1 billion business letters annually.",[],{"type":126,"text":571,"spans":839,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":841,"spans":842,"direction":112},"Working with everyone from Europe’s top retailers, marketplaces and pre-loved sites to gift-givers, the roots of Evri can be traced back to Yorkshire in 1974. The business has grown over the last five decades and now has a team of 12,000+ employees and 30,000 couriers, as well as a growing network of more than 13,000+ ParcelShops and Lockers and 500+ state-of-the-art hubs and depots.  Following its acquisition of Coll-8, an Irish independent customs clearance and logistics specialist, and merger with DHL eCommerce UK, Evri Group continues to enhance its international capability and enable world trade.",[],{"type":126,"text":707,"spans":844,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":710,"spans":846,"direction":112},[847],{"start":277,"end":278,"type":279,"data":848},{"link_type":281,"url":282,"target":283},{"id":850,"uid":851,"url":852,"type":50,"href":853,"tags":854,"first_publication_date":855,"last_publication_date":855,"slugs":856,"linked_documents":857,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":858,"data":859},"abfHWxIAACsA2Mps","evri-embraces-artificial-intelligence-with-amazon-web-services-to-further-enhance-customer-experience","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-embraces-artificial-intelligence-with-amazon-web-services-to-further-enhance-customer-experience","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22abfHWxIAACsA2Mps%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2026-03-16T09:27:53+0000",[851],[],[],{"title":860,"category":8,"metaDescription":861,"canonical":862,"titleTag":860,"featuredImage":863,"publishedDate":875,"slices":876},"Evri embraces artificial intelligence with Amazon Web Services to further enhance customer experience","Read about Evri embraces artificial intelligence with Amazon Web Services to further enhance customer experience","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-embraces-artificial-intelligence-with-amazon-web-services-to-further-enhance-customer-experience",{"dimensions":864,"alt":866,"copyright":8,"url":867,"id":868,"edit":869,"thumbnail":870},{"width":65,"height":865},640,"An Evri Courier delivering a parcel to an excited mother and child. The Courier is taking a photo for proof of delivery on their mobile device.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6thyJbqstJ9-e-N_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6523.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6thyJbqstJ9-e-N",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":871,"alt":866,"copyright":8,"url":872,"id":868,"edit":873},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6thyJbqstJ9-e-N_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6523.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},791,"2026-03-16",[877,940,948,953,958],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":878,"primary":880,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[879],{},{"content":881},[882,887,892,897,899,904,907,910,913,916,919,926,933,936,938],{"type":126,"text":883,"spans":884,"direction":112},"·       Evri powers Artificial Intelligence (AI) transformation with Amazon Web Services (AWS) and Databricks",[885],{"start":321,"end":886,"type":163},109,{"type":126,"text":888,"spans":889,"direction":112},"·       Millions of delivery photos are taken each day, with more than 900 million parcels delivered a year",[890],{"start":321,"end":891,"type":163},107,{"type":126,"text":893,"spans":894,"direction":112},"·       Evri takes around 90 million delivery photos every month and this integration will enable Evri to check every delivery photo - using Amazon Nova Lite",[895],{"start":321,"end":896,"type":163},157,{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":898,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":900,"spans":901,"direction":112},"The Evri Group, on track to become the UK’s premier parcel delivery company, is embracing the power of artificial intelligence (AI) to transform its operations and improve customer satisfaction across the board.",[902],{"start":903,"end":671,"type":163},3,{"type":126,"text":905,"spans":906,"direction":112},"Evri is collaborating with Amazon Web Services (AWS) to integrate first-to-market AI technology into its transformation strategy, helping the business to manage over 900 million parcels a year with greater precision.",[],{"type":126,"text":908,"spans":909,"direction":112},"Named ‘Veri Snap AI’, this innovation is an evolution of Evri’s existing Parcel Vision technology and automatically processes delivery photos taken on the doorstep by couriers, by using the Amazon Nova Lite generative AI model via Amazon Bedrock, a service that simplifies building and scaling generative AI applications. Evri takes around 90 million delivery photos every month and this innovation will enable Evri to check every delivery photo.",[],{"type":126,"text":911,"spans":912,"direction":112},"The technology will identify parcels in the photos to assess aspects including the location of the delivery and conditions of the parcel to confirm if it’s a compliant delivery. This will improve the compliance of delivery photos and enable a team to proactively investigate any instances where delivery photos don’t meet Evri’s expectations helping to improve the overall delivery experience for customers and support couriers. Overall, this will lead to an enhanced first-time customer experience and ensure high quality service for clients.",[],{"type":126,"text":914,"spans":915,"direction":112},"Evri trialled the technology with more than 20 million photos being checked and following its success, the business is now deploying the technology across its entire network. The new technology has already led to improvement in deliveries with additional training to couriers being provided. ",[],{"type":126,"text":917,"spans":918,"direction":112},"In addition, there are already plans for future enhancements, which include being able to check, in real time, if a courier is taking a compliant photo and suggest where to leave parcels safely if not, based on previous successful deliveries. ",[],{"type":126,"text":920,"spans":921,"direction":112},"Customers can take control of their deliveries by using the Evri app on iOS or Android to track a parcel, choose a safe place, preferred neighbour, or divert to a ParcelShop or Locker. The app will automatically add any parcels customers are due to receive, giving the quickest access to the latest parcel updates.",[922],{"start":629,"end":923,"type":279,"data":924},68,{"link_type":281,"url":925,"target":283},"press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fmobile-app",{"type":126,"text":927,"spans":928,"direction":112},"This move follows Evri’s announcement in June 2024 in which it shared plans for AI investment not totalling around £4m. By embracing AI, Evri continues to set a new standard for transparency and accuracy in parcel delivery, reinforcing its commitment to putting customers first. Evri has more than four million independent five-star Trustpilot reviews, an average courier rating of 4.6\u002F5, reflecting a strong commitment to customer experience.",[929],{"start":587,"end":930,"type":279,"data":931},50,{"link_type":281,"url":932,"target":283},"press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-announces-1-million-investment-into-ai-strategy-to-further-transform-the-customer-experience",{"type":126,"text":934,"spans":935,"direction":112},"Alongside its investment in AI, and Lockers, Evri has also invested more than £36 million in its infrastructure, increasing the number of parcels it can handle every day, to 4.4 million per day.",[],{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":937,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":939,"direction":112},[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":941,"primary":942,"id":947,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":943},[944],{"type":126,"text":945,"spans":946,"direction":112},"-",[],"rich_text$21ea522d-1b8f-4074-abed-19d82bf1bd5c",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":949,"primary":950,"id":660,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":951,"quoteSource":952},"Harnessing AI through our collaboration with AWS and Databricks marks a pivotal moment in Evri’s AI transformation. Veri Snap AI allows us to proactively enhance the delivery experience for millions of customers, working towards a future where every parcel photo meets our standards. This innovation improves transparency and trust, whilst empowering our teams to focus on what matters most – delivering excellence.","Marcus Hunter, Chief Technology Officer at Evri Group.",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":954,"primary":955,"id":799,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":956,"quoteSource":957},"We are delighted that Evri is expanding its use of AWS technologies and taking AI deeper into its business operations. By leveraging AI, generative AI, and the cloud to power new services like Veri Snap AI, Evri is able to deliver a better experience for both customers and its workforce. We look forward to working together with Evri as it looks to continue to embrace AI technology.","Richard Turnbull, UK&I Head of Manufacturing, Automotive and Logistics at Amazon Web Services.",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":959,"primary":960,"id":714,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":961},[962,965,969,972,975,977,979,982,984],{"type":126,"text":688,"spans":963,"direction":112},[964],{"start":32,"end":362,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":466,"spans":966,"direction":112},[967],{"start":469,"end":470,"type":279,"data":968},{"link_type":281,"url":472,"target":283},{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":970,"direction":112},[971],{"start":32,"end":33,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":696,"spans":973,"direction":112},[974],{"start":32,"end":699,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":568,"spans":976,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":571,"spans":978,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":980,"spans":981,"direction":112},"Working with everyone from Europe’s top retailers, marketplaces and pre-loved sites to gift-givers, the roots of Evri can be traced back to Yorkshire in 1974. The business has grown over the last five decades and now has a team of 12,000+ employees and 30,000 couriers, as well as a growing network of more than 10,000+ ParcelShops and Lockers and 500+ state-of-the-art hubs and depots.  Following its acquisition of Coll-8, an Irish independent customs clearance and logistics specialist, and merger with DHL eCommerce UK, Evri Group continues to enhance its international capability and enable world trade.",[],{"type":126,"text":707,"spans":983,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":710,"spans":985,"direction":112},[986],{"start":277,"end":278,"type":279,"data":987},{"link_type":281,"url":282,"target":283},{"id":989,"uid":990,"url":991,"type":50,"href":992,"tags":993,"first_publication_date":994,"last_publication_date":995,"slugs":996,"linked_documents":997,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":998,"data":999},"abMRvhIAAC0A0hCS","evri-boosts-convenience-with-major-new-locker-partnerships-at-tesco-and-motor-fuel-group","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-boosts-convenience-with-major-new-locker-partnerships-at-tesco-and-motor-fuel-group","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22abMRvhIAAC0A0hCS%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2026-03-13T09:24:32+0000","2026-03-13T10:55:00+0000",[990],[],[],{"title":1000,"category":8,"metaDescription":1001,"canonical":1002,"titleTag":1000,"featuredImage":1003,"publishedDate":1014,"slices":1015},"Evri boosts convenience with major new locker partnerships at Tesco and Motor Fuel Group","Read about Evri's major new locker partnerships at Tesco and Motor Fuel Group","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-boosts-convenience-with-major-new-locker-partnerships-at-tesco-and-motor-fuel-group",{"dimensions":1004,"alt":1005,"copyright":8,"url":1006,"id":1007,"edit":1008,"thumbnail":1009},{"width":65,"height":865},"A blue Evri parcel locker outside a Tesco store","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FabMSPVxvIZEnjoV8_evri-march-deployment-63.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,0,6988,4659&w=960&h=640","abMSPVxvIZEnjoV8",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":1010,"alt":1005,"copyright":8,"url":1011,"id":1007,"edit":1012},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FabMSPVxvIZEnjoV8_evri-march-deployment-63.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,673,6988,3312&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":1013,"zoom":33,"background":71},673,"2026-03-13",[1016,1102,1108,1113,1120,1141,1146,1153,1172,1178,1185],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":1017,"primary":1019,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[1018],{},{"content":1020},[1021,1026,1031,1036,1038,1041,1043,1046,1048,1052,1055,1058,1061,1063,1066,1071,1076,1080,1085,1087,1090,1093,1096,1099],{"type":109,"text":1022,"spans":1023,"direction":112},"Evri announces new trial at selected Tesco stores, and 500 locations at Motor Fuel Group forecourts",[1024],{"start":32,"end":1025,"type":163},99,{"type":109,"text":1027,"spans":1028,"direction":112},"New research from Evri reveals almost all Brits say where their parcel is delivered matters, and more than three quarters would use a parcel locker",[1029],{"start":32,"end":1030,"type":163},147,{"type":109,"text":1032,"spans":1033,"direction":112},"Part of Evri’s long-term commitment to double its ParcelShop and locker network by 2030",[1034],{"start":32,"end":1035,"type":163},87,{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":1037,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":1039,"spans":1040,"direction":112},"Evri Group, the UK’s premier parcel delivery company, has today announced the launch of a new trial of its owned locker network in partnership with one of the UK’s leading grocery retailers, Tesco. Plus, a new nationwide partnership with Motor Fuel Group, the UK’s largest independent forecourt operator, to launch 500 new locker locations at petrol stations across the UK.",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":1042,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":1044,"spans":1045,"direction":112},"The partnerships will significantly expand the company’s reach to boost convenience, choice and control for millions of customers ahead of Mother’s Day. This comes as new consumer research from Evri highlights the nation’s growing reliance for last-minute occasions, and whilst more than 99% of parcels arrive on time, Evri is encouraging customers to choose alternative delivery options if they’re not going to be home:",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":1047,"direction":112},[],{"type":1049,"text":1050,"spans":1051,"direction":112},"o-list-item","Nearly half of Brits (48%) say they worry that gifts ordered online for occasions like Mother’s Day won’t arrive on time, highlighting growing delivery anxiety around special events.",[],{"type":1049,"text":1053,"spans":1054,"direction":112},"Around one in five Brits (19%) have had to rearrange a delivery because they weren’t home, two in five (42%) don’t have, or don’t want to use a safe place",[],{"type":1049,"text":1056,"spans":1057,"direction":112},"More than three quarters of Brits (78%) say they would use a parcel locker, highlighting strong demand for alternative delivery options.",[],{"type":1049,"text":1059,"spans":1060,"direction":112},"Almost all Brits (95%) say where their parcel is delivered is important to them.",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":1062,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":1064,"spans":1065,"direction":112},"At a time of year when millions are sending and receiving sentimental gifts – and with Mother’s Day falling just two days after Friday 13th - Evri is encouraging customers who won’t be at home, not to leave it to luck on Friday 13th and avoid delivery drama by considering delivery options to make sure those important gifts arrive safely and on time:",[],{"type":1049,"text":1067,"spans":1068,"direction":112},"Deliver directly to a secure locker – available 24\u002F7 and deal if you won’t be home",[1069],{"start":32,"end":1070,"type":163},35,{"type":1049,"text":1072,"spans":1073,"direction":112},"Use real-time diversions to reroute an out-for-delivery parcel",[1074],{"start":32,"end":1075,"type":163},24,{"type":1049,"text":1077,"spans":1078,"direction":112},"Nominate a safe place such as a shed, porch or garage",[1079],{"start":32,"end":206,"type":163},{"type":1049,"text":1081,"spans":1082,"direction":112},"Add accessibility preferences such as requesting more time to get to the door",[1083],{"start":32,"end":1084,"type":163},29,{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":1086,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":1088,"spans":1089,"direction":112},"Customers using the lockers will have access to Evri’s pick-up and drop-off services, providing a quick, contact-free method for sending and receiving parcels, with ‘print-at-locker’ functionality, alongside fast and seamless QR code scanning.",[],{"type":126,"text":1091,"spans":1092,"direction":112},"With a current network of more than 11,000 ParcelShops and lockers, including ParcelShop services at Post Office branches and Asda stores, this follows a previous announcement by the UK’s premier parcel delivery company of its £50m investment to more than double this number by 2030. ",[],{"type":126,"text":1094,"spans":1095,"direction":112},"Evri, which delivers over 900 million parcels a year, has partnered with smart tech company Bloq.it, on the development of these new lockers, with an initial commissioning of at least 1,000. Unlike the parcel firm’s existing shared locker network, where lockers can be used to drop off parcels for multiple carriers, these lockers will be owned and operated exclusively by Evri.",[],{"type":126,"text":1097,"spans":1098,"direction":112},"Evri’s commitment to expanding its locker network follows a growing trend in consumer appetite for choice, with internal data showing a 343% increase in usage since the beginning of 2025, as well as a 19% increase in parcel diversions to lockers, as customers seek alternative delivery methods for when they may not be home.",[],{"type":126,"text":1100,"spans":1101,"direction":112},"And with Evri’s internal data for 2024\u002F25 showing a 34% reduction in carbon emissions for ParcelShop and locker deliveries compared to a standard courier delivery, growing this network is a vital part of its sustainability roadmap.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":1103,"primary":1104,"id":947,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":1105},[1106],{"type":126,"text":945,"spans":1107,"direction":112},[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":1109,"primary":1110,"id":660,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":1111,"quoteSource":1112},"It might be Friday 13th, but by partnering with Tesco and Motor Fuel Group to launch our lockers, we’re making sure that shoppers don’t leave it to luck when it comes to their parcel deliveries - reinforcing our commitment to a choice of quality delivery methods.\n“Evri’s own data shows that customers value convenience when it comes to deliveries, so with Tesco stores and Motor Fuel Group forecourts at the heart of so many communities, there will be easy access to Evri services alongside filling up or picking up essentials.\n“Together, these partnerships will provide shoppers with even more flexibility to send, receive, and return parcels in a way that suits them, reflecting how consumer behaviour is continuing to evolve.","Liam Rogan, Head of ParcelShops and Lockers Network at Evri Group",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":1114,"primary":1115,"id":1119,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":1116},[1117],{"type":126,"text":945,"spans":1118,"direction":112},[],"rich_text$9e75a663-2500-4802-a7ad-b0e0f0961f58",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":1121,"primary":1122,"id":1140,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":1123},[1124,1129,1134,1137],{"type":126,"text":1125,"spans":1126,"direction":112},"Tesco: launch of Evri’s newest locker network",[1127],{"start":32,"end":1128,"type":163},45,{"type":126,"text":1130,"spans":1131,"direction":112},"This new trial of Evri’s owned locker network is in partnership with one of the UK’s leading grocery retailers, Tesco. The pilot, begins this week and will see the first wave of Evri’s branded lockers rolled out at a small number of Tesco Extra and Superstore locations across the UK.",[1132],{"start":1133,"end":1030,"type":163},146,{"type":126,"text":1135,"spans":1136,"direction":112},"This new trial builds on Evri’s existing partnership with Tesco Clubcard, which already allows customers to collect Clubcard points for every parcel they send, no matter where they choose to drop it off.",[],{"type":126,"text":1138,"spans":1139,"direction":112},"For every £1 spent via Evri.com, customers earn one Clubcard point, which can then be converted into vouchers to use on their Tesco shop.",[],"rich_text$778779ea-15e7-4acc-95ff-29388cd39e56",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":1142,"primary":1143,"id":799,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":1144,"quoteSource":1145},"We’re constantly looking for ways to make the shopping trip even more convenient for our customers, and as part of a small locker hub partner trial across a small number of stores, where we are bringing a number of providers together, we’re pleased to introduce Evri lockers across a selected small number of stores.","Tesco Strategic Partnership team",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":1147,"primary":1148,"id":1152,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":1149},[1150],{"type":126,"text":945,"spans":1151,"direction":112},[],"rich_text$8e651d98-e746-4974-8d5b-f2fb6cce600e",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":1154,"primary":1155,"id":1171,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":1156},[1157,1162,1165,1168],{"type":126,"text":1158,"spans":1159,"direction":112},"Motor Fuel Group: 500 new locker locations",[1160],{"start":32,"end":1161,"type":163},42,{"type":126,"text":1163,"spans":1164,"direction":112},"Evri is also partnering with Motor Fuel Group, the UK’s largest independent forecourt operator, to install 500 new locker at petrol stations across the UK in a new nationwide partnership. The rollout begins in this month and will continue through spring.",[],{"type":126,"text":1166,"spans":1167,"direction":112},"By expanding its network into high-traffic MFG locations, Evri aims to make these options easier and more visible for customers across the country. Many of the new MFG sites have Morrisons Daily, Subway and Starbucks stores alongside dedicated Evri lockers, giving millions of shoppers the opportunity to send, receive and return parcels while filling up, grabbing a coffee, or picking up essentials.",[],{"type":126,"text":1169,"spans":1170,"direction":112},"MFG’s nationwide presence provides major reach in both urban and rural communities. The collaboration with MFG will provide customers with access to Evri’s full range of services including parcel pick-up, drop-off and returns. All lockers will have print-at-locker functionality to print a self-adhesive label, enabling quick parcel returns.",[],"rich_text$cc46561c-29d4-4acc-951f-aef66898a1c9",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":1173,"primary":1174,"id":1177,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":1175,"quoteSource":1176},"With the rollout of Evri’s lockers across 500 Motor Fuel Group sites, this new partnership brings together two brands focused on everyday convenience.\nTogether we’re able to give customers greater flexibility to send, collect and return parcels as part of their regular routines, while enhancing the role our forecourts play in local communities and adding real value for our retail partners.","A Motor Fuel Group spokesperson","quote$3bbd7537-8372-4ffe-a897-8e812a4fd16a",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":1179,"primary":1180,"id":1184,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":1181},[1182],{"type":126,"text":945,"spans":1183,"direction":112},[],"rich_text$82e9f4d5-769c-4173-9b6e-3f1865171177",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":1186,"primary":1187,"id":714,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":1188},[1189,1193,1196,1198,1201,1205,1208,1211,1213,1215,1217,1219],{"type":126,"text":1190,"spans":1191,"direction":112},"Survey methodology",[1192],{"start":32,"end":587,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":1194,"spans":1195,"direction":112},"The research was conducted by Opinion Matters, among a sample of 2,000 UK Nationally Representative Adults. The data was collected between 04.03.2026 - 06.03.2026. Opinion Matters abides by and employs members of the Market Research Society and follows the MRS code of conduct and ESOMAR principles. Opinion Matters is also a member of the British Polling Council.",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":1197,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":688,"spans":1199,"direction":112},[1200],{"start":32,"end":362,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":466,"spans":1202,"direction":112},[1203],{"start":469,"end":470,"type":279,"data":1204},{"link_type":281,"url":472,"target":283},{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":1206,"direction":112},[1207],{"start":32,"end":33,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":696,"spans":1209,"direction":112},[1210],{"start":32,"end":699,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":568,"spans":1212,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":571,"spans":1214,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":980,"spans":1216,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":707,"spans":1218,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":710,"spans":1220,"direction":112},[1221],{"start":277,"end":278,"type":279,"data":1222},{"link_type":281,"url":282,"target":283},{"id":1224,"uid":1225,"url":1226,"type":50,"href":1227,"tags":1228,"first_publication_date":1229,"last_publication_date":1230,"slugs":1231,"linked_documents":1233,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":1234,"data":1235},"aa7AChEAAC0ASC2Y","evri-driving-academy-opens-its-doors-to-external-candidates-avonmouth","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-driving-academy-opens-its-doors-to-external-candidates-avonmouth","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22aa7AChEAAC0ASC2Y%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2026-03-09T12:48:45+0000","2026-03-09T18:24:54+0000",[1232],"evri-driving-academy-opens-its-doors-toexternal-candidates",[],[],{"title":1236,"category":8,"metaDescription":1237,"canonical":1238,"titleTag":1239,"featuredImage":1240,"publishedDate":1252,"slices":1253},"Evri Driving Academy opens its doors to external candidates","Read about how Evri Driving Academy opens its doors to external candidates","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002FEvri-Driving-Academy-opens-its-doors-to-external-candidates","Evri Driving Academy opens its doors to external candidates | Evri",{"dimensions":1241,"alt":1243,"copyright":8,"url":1244,"id":1245,"edit":1246,"thumbnail":1247},{"width":65,"height":1242},720,"Matthew, HGV driver, smiling in front of an Evri truck","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Faa7AfFxvIZEnjePV_MatthewHGVDriver.jpeg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,0,5712,4284&w=960&h=720","aa7AfFxvIZEnjePV",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":1248,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":1249,"id":1245,"edit":1250},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Faa7AfFxvIZEnjePV_MatthewHGVDriver.jpeg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,788,5712,2707&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":1251,"zoom":33,"background":71},788,"2026-03-09",[1254,1302,1308,1326],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":1255,"primary":1257,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[1256],{},{"content":1258},[1259,1263,1268,1273,1281,1284,1287,1290,1293,1296,1299],{"type":109,"text":1260,"spans":1261,"direction":112},"For the first time, members of the public can apply to train as HGV drivers through Evri’s Driving Academy. ",[1262],{"start":32,"end":891,"type":163},{"type":109,"text":1264,"spans":1265,"direction":112},"The Academy has supported internal driver progression for many years, including 113 HGV licences achieved in 2025 alone, and is expanding at a time of ongoing national HGV driver shortages. ",[1266],{"start":32,"end":1267,"type":163},189,{"type":109,"text":1269,"spans":1270,"direction":112},"The programme provides Category C and C+E training, offering a new route into a high-demand career in logistics.   ",[1271],{"start":32,"end":1272,"type":163},113,{"type":126,"text":1274,"spans":1275,"direction":112},"Evri, the UK’s premier parcel delivery company, is now accepting applications from external candidates for its heavy goods vehicles (HGV) licence training programme. Evri’s Driving Academy, which has supported internal driver progression for many years, helped drivers achieve 113 new HGV licences in 2025 alone and is now opening the scheme to outside applicants at a time when the UK faces a critical shortage of HGV drivers. The Road Haulage Association estimates the country needs 60,000 new drivers each year for the next five years to keep up with demand, making this programme a rare opportunity for younger drivers to gain highly sought-after skills and build a career in one of the UK’s most in-demand sectors.",[1276],{"start":1277,"end":1278,"type":279,"data":1279},485,537,{"link_type":281,"url":1280,"target":283},"press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.rha.uk.net\u002Fnews\u002Fnews\u002Fdetail\u002F60-000-hgv-drivers-needed-every-year",{"type":126,"text":1282,"spans":1283,"direction":112},"The Driving Academy operates from sites in Normanton, Avonmouth and Hemel Hempstead and offers structured training for Category C (Class 2) and Category C+E (Class 1) licences – the qualifications required to drive heavy goods vehicles and articulated lorries. The programme provides a new route into professional HGV driving for those looking to progress or change careers.  ",[],{"type":126,"text":1285,"spans":1286,"direction":112},"One driver who has progressed through the Academy is Matthew Gilbert, who completed his training through the Avonmouth operation. Matthew passed his Class 2 licence in January 2025 and went on to achieve his Class 1 licence shortly after in June, which qualifies him to drive larger articulated vehicles. ",[],{"type":126,"text":1288,"spans":1289,"direction":112},"Before joining the Academy, Matthew worked as part of the ParcelShop office team, supporting day-to-day operations and drivers. Applying for the programme allowed him to fulfil a long-held ambition. “I’ve always wanted to obtain my HGV licence ever since I was a little boy, so I decided it was time to fulfil that dream,” he said. ",[],{"type":126,"text":1291,"spans":1292,"direction":112},"Matthew completed the training through the Academy’s intensive course and praised the support he received throughout. Although stepping into the cab of a lorry was initially nerve-wracking, Matthew said the quality of training quickly built confidence. “My trainer was fantastic,” he said. “The level of training I was given made me feel comfortable very quickly. Driving a lorry is actually easier than you’d think once you get used to it.”  ",[],{"type":126,"text":1294,"spans":1295,"direction":112},"After completing the programme, Matthew joined the transport team in Plymouth as a Class 1 Day Driver. He later took on additional responsibilities as a Class 2 Driving Assessor and has since been promoted to Transport Supervisor.  ",[],{"type":126,"text":1297,"spans":1298,"direction":112},"Matthew described HGV driving as a rewarding career and said he would fully recommend the Academy to others, adding that the opportunities available following qualification had exceeded his expectations.  ",[],{"type":126,"text":1300,"spans":1301,"direction":112},"“The Academy helped me get my HGV licences and it has opened so many doors for me within the transport industry,” he said. “I’d definitely recommend it.” ",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":1303,"primary":1304,"id":1307,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":1305,"quoteSource":1306},"I never imagined I’d be sitting behind the wheel of a heavy goods vehicle, but I achieved my own Cat C licence thanks to the Evri Driving Academy. I’m proud that we’re building a workplace where everyone can thrive, and with the right training and support, you can achieve more than you think. The programme is designed to help anyone, regardless of background, step into a career in logistics, and I’d encourage all aspiring drivers to take that step.” ","Lyn Warren, Chief Human Resources Officer at Evri","quote$0c596b77-f299-4fc4-ae48-4428d836b9d9",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":1309,"primary":1310,"id":1325,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":1311},[1312,1314],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":1313,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":1315,"spans":1316,"direction":112},"The Evri Driving Academy offers structured training and guidance for aspiring HGV drivers. External candidates can find out more and apply via https:\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fcareers\u002Fjoin-our-driving-academy. Completing the programme is a great way to get your foot in the door, with opportunities to join Evri’s HGV team throughout the year. ",[1317,1322],{"start":1318,"end":1319,"type":279,"data":1320},143,196,{"link_type":281,"url":1321,"target":283},"press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fcareers\u002Fjoin-our-driving-academy",{"start":1319,"end":1323,"type":1324},198,"em","rich_text$87f66540-fa0c-41f0-ba31-2f5f00c37751",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":1327,"primary":1328,"id":714,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":1329},[1330,1332,1336,1338,1341,1345,1348,1351,1353,1355,1357,1360],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":1331,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":1333,"spans":1334,"direction":112},"-ENDS-",[1335],{"start":32,"end":819,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":1337,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":688,"spans":1339,"direction":112},[1340],{"start":32,"end":362,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":466,"spans":1342,"direction":112},[1343],{"start":469,"end":470,"type":279,"data":1344},{"link_type":281,"url":472,"target":283},{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":1346,"direction":112},[1347],{"start":32,"end":33,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":696,"spans":1349,"direction":112},[1350],{"start":32,"end":699,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":568,"spans":1352,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":571,"spans":1354,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":574,"spans":1356,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":1358,"spans":1359,"direction":112},"Evri has close to 4 million independent 5-star Trustpilot reviews, an average courier rating of 4.6\u002F5, reflecting a strong commitment to customer experience.",[],{"type":126,"text":1361,"spans":1362,"direction":112},"For more info: www.evri.com\u002Fnews-and-corporate",[1363],{"start":277,"end":278,"type":279,"data":1364},{"link_type":281,"url":282,"target":283},{"id":1366,"uid":1367,"url":1368,"type":50,"href":1369,"tags":1370,"first_publication_date":1371,"last_publication_date":1372,"slugs":1373,"linked_documents":1374,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":1375,"data":1376},"aa643hEAACgASCKd","evri-driving-academy-opens-its-doors-to-external-candidates-normanton","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-driving-academy-opens-its-doors-to-external-candidates-normanton","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22aa643hEAACgASCKd%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2026-03-09T12:41:32+0000","2026-03-09T18:24:23+0000",[1232],[],[],{"title":1236,"category":8,"metaDescription":1237,"canonical":1238,"titleTag":1239,"featuredImage":1377,"publishedDate":1252,"slices":1389},{"dimensions":1378,"alt":1380,"copyright":8,"url":1381,"id":1382,"edit":1383,"thumbnail":1384},{"width":65,"height":1379},1280,"Ellie, HGV driver, smiling in her truck","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Faa66BlxvIZEnjeLV_HGVDriverEllie.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=960&h=1280","aa66BlxvIZEnjeLV",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":1385,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":1386,"id":1382,"edit":1387},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Faa66BlxvIZEnjeLV_HGVDriverEllie.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C995%2C2316%2C1098&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":1388,"zoom":33,"background":71},995,[1390,1436,1441,1454],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":1391,"primary":1393,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[1392],{},{"content":1394},[1395,1398,1401,1404,1409,1412,1415,1418,1421,1424,1427,1430,1433],{"type":109,"text":1260,"spans":1396,"direction":112},[1397],{"start":32,"end":891,"type":163},{"type":109,"text":1264,"spans":1399,"direction":112},[1400],{"start":32,"end":1267,"type":163},{"type":109,"text":1269,"spans":1402,"direction":112},[1403],{"start":32,"end":1272,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":1405,"spans":1406,"direction":112},"Evri, the UK’s premier parcel delivery company, is now accepting applications from external candidates for its heavy goods vehicles (HGV) licence training programme. Evri’s Driving Academy, which has supported internal driver progression for many years, helped drivers achieve 113 new HGV licences in 2025 alone and is now opening the scheme to outside applicants at a time when the UK faces a critical shortage of HGV drivers. The Road Haulage Association estimates the country needs 60,000 new drivers each year for the next five years to meet growing demand. As the industry looks to attract a broader and more diverse workforce, programmes like this are creating new opportunities for women and younger people to build careers in logistics – one of the UK’s most in-demand sectors.",[1407],{"start":1277,"end":1278,"type":279,"data":1408},{"link_type":281,"url":1280,"target":283},{"type":126,"text":1410,"spans":1411,"direction":112},"The Driving Academy operates from sites in Normanton, Avonmouth and Hemel Hempstead and offers structured training for Category C (Class 2) and Category C+E (Class 1) licences – the qualifications required to drive large goods vehicles and articulated lorries. The programme provides a new route into professional HGV driving for those looking to progress or change careers.  ",[],{"type":126,"text":1413,"spans":1414,"direction":112},"One driver who has progressed through the Academy is Ellie-Mae Saddington, who trained at the Normanton site and now works as a Class 1 Day Driver based in Sheffield. ",[],{"type":126,"text":1416,"spans":1417,"direction":112},"Ellie-Mae joined Evri shortly after passing her standard driving test in 2021, initially working as a transit van driver for Evri ParcelShops. With limited experience at the time, she decided to apply for HGV training after seeing the opportunity for career progression. “The bigger the vehicle, the bigger the opportunities,” she said. ",[],{"type":126,"text":1419,"spans":1420,"direction":112},"Ellie-Mae completed both her Class 2 and Class 1 licences through the Academy’s bootcamp programme, passing Class 2 in 2023 and Class 1 first time in 2025, qualifying her to drive larger articulated vehicles. ",[],{"type":126,"text":1422,"spans":1423,"direction":112},"The Driving Academy combines online learning with practical, in-person training – a blend that proved ideal for Ellie-Mae as she worked towards her qualification. ",[],{"type":126,"text":1425,"spans":1426,"direction":112},"She described the programme as “clear, supportive and easy to follow,” noting that the structure helped her stay confident throughout the process, with instructors and colleagues always on hand to offer support. ",[],{"type":126,"text":1428,"spans":1429,"direction":112},"“They give you everything you need, and someone was always there if you had questions. The instructors were knowledgeable and reassuring. It felt like a proper bonding experience,” she said. ",[],{"type":126,"text":1431,"spans":1432,"direction":112},"HGV driving may seem intimidating at first, but Ellie-Mae encourages others to take the leap. “It’s not as daunting as you may think. Every mile begins with the decision to take the wheel.”  ",[],{"type":126,"text":1434,"spans":1435,"direction":112},"She added that the role has improved her work-life balance, with more stable hours and weekends off, and urged other women not to be put off by stereotypes. “Don’t let the fact that it’s a male dominated field stop you,” she said. “Women are just as capable, and the trucking community is very welcoming.” ",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":1437,"primary":1438,"id":1440,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":1439,"quoteSource":1306},"I never imagined I’d be sitting behind the wheel of a heavy goods vehicle, but I achieved my own Cat C licence thanks to the Evri Driving Academy. I’m proud that we’re building a workplace where everyone can thrive, and with the right training and support, you can achieve more than you think. The programme is designed to help anyone, regardless of background, step into a career in logistics, and I’d encourage all aspiring drivers to take that step.” ","quote$fc92398b-ced8-4729-b130-e1d18920591a",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":1442,"primary":1443,"id":1453,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":1444},[1445,1447],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":1446,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":1448,"spans":1449,"direction":112},"The Evri Driving Academy offers structured training and guidance for aspiring HGV drivers. External candidates can find out more and apply via https:\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fcareers\u002Fjoin-our-driving-academy. Completing the programme is a great way to get your foot in the door, with opportunities to join Evri’s HGV team throughout the year. ",[1450,1452],{"start":1318,"end":1319,"type":279,"data":1451},{"link_type":281,"url":1321,"target":283},{"start":1319,"end":1323,"type":1324},"rich_text$a4643b03-db7d-4448-9950-471702ea6f52",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":1455,"primary":1456,"id":714,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":1457},[1458,1460,1463,1465,1468,1472,1475,1478,1480,1482,1484,1486,1490,1492],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":1459,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":1333,"spans":1461,"direction":112},[1462],{"start":32,"end":819,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":1464,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":688,"spans":1466,"direction":112},[1467],{"start":32,"end":362,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":466,"spans":1469,"direction":112},[1470],{"start":469,"end":470,"type":279,"data":1471},{"link_type":281,"url":472,"target":283},{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":1473,"direction":112},[1474],{"start":32,"end":33,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":696,"spans":1476,"direction":112},[1477],{"start":32,"end":699,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":568,"spans":1479,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":571,"spans":1481,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":574,"spans":1483,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":1358,"spans":1485,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":710,"spans":1487,"direction":112},[1488],{"start":277,"end":278,"type":279,"data":1489},{"link_type":281,"url":282,"target":283},{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":1491,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":1493,"direction":112},[],{"id":1495,"uid":1496,"url":1497,"type":50,"href":1498,"tags":1499,"first_publication_date":1500,"last_publication_date":1500,"slugs":1501,"linked_documents":1503,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":1504,"data":1505},"aamODhIAACUAyb95","evri-group-boosts-growth-with-over-3700-new-community-courier-warehouse-driver-and-head-office-roles","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-group-boosts-growth-with-over-3700-new-community-courier-warehouse-driver-and-head-office-roles","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22aamODhIAACUAyb95%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2026-03-05T14:15:04+0000",[1502],"evrigroupboostsgrowthwithover3700-newcommunity-courierwarehousedriverand-head-officeroles",[],[],{"title":1506,"category":8,"metaDescription":1507,"canonical":1508,"titleTag":1509,"featuredImage":1510,"publishedDate":1520,"slices":1521},"Evri Group boosts growth with over 3700 new community courier, warehouse, driver and head office roles ","Read about how Evri Group boosts growth with over 3700 new community courier, warehouse, driver and head office roles ","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-group-boosts-growth-with-over-3700-new-community-courier-warehouse-driver-and-head-office-roles","Evri Group boosts growth with over 3700 new community courier, warehouse, driver and head office roles | Evri",{"dimensions":1511,"alt":1512,"copyright":8,"url":1513,"id":1514,"edit":1515,"thumbnail":1516},{"width":65,"height":865},"A parcel in waterproof blue packaging is being handed to a recipient at the door. A blue Evri van can be seen in the background.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6y9MZbqstJ9-iHb_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9013.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6y9MZbqstJ9-iHb",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":1517,"alt":1512,"copyright":8,"url":1518,"id":1514,"edit":1519},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6y9MZbqstJ9-iHb_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9013.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2026-02-23",[1522,1578,1583,1588],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":1523,"primary":1525,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[1524],{},{"content":1526},[1527,1531,1536,1538,1541,1544,1547,1550,1553,1556,1559,1576],{"type":126,"text":1528,"spans":1529,"direction":112},"·       Jobs creation supports quality commitment as Evri ranks highest in UK for on-time delivery rates ",[1530],{"start":321,"end":763,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":1532,"spans":1533,"direction":112},"·       As hiring falls in the logistics sector, Evri Group bucks the trend with thousands of new roles to drive service quality and continued growth ",[1534],{"start":321,"end":1535,"type":163},150,{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":1537,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":1539,"spans":1540,"direction":112},"Evri Group is announcing plans to create over 3700 new opportunities with a particular focus in operations on courier roles at the heart of local communities to drive up delivery quality.",[],{"type":126,"text":1542,"spans":1543,"direction":112},"The announcement follows operational investment of £36 million last year as the business bolstered its operations and service to support parcel volume growth.",[],{"type":126,"text":1545,"spans":1546,"direction":112},"This latest investment builds on Evri’s commitment to delivering industry leading service, with close to 4 million 5* Trustpilot reviews and an average courier star rating of 4.7\u002F5, while underpinning its rapid growth following its merger with DHL eCommerce UK. In the last week alone independent data from Parcel2Go found that for UK deliveries, Evri Drop-Off recorded the highest on-time delivery rate in 2025 of all carriers. The same report also ranked Evri Drop-Off as having one of the highest rankings (top 3) for customer satisfaction for International deliveries at 4.54 out of 5. ",[],{"type":126,"text":1548,"spans":1549,"direction":112},"Evri’s focus on bringing in 3700 new workers including community couriers supports its commitment to further driving service quality as data highlights higher customer",[],{"type":126,"text":1551,"spans":1552,"direction":112},"satisfaction rates towards couriers that deliver regular rounds and know their communities well.",[],{"type":126,"text":1554,"spans":1555,"direction":112},"For couriers themselves, the business offers them the opportunity to drive their own earnings, benefit from the flexibility of being self-employed all whilst earning significantly more than national minimum wage with average rates of £20 per hour for established couriers. Regular round holders also have the opportunity to convert to be a GMB union backed Evri Plus courier which opens up access to holiday pay (28 days annually), pension contributions, dedicated delivery round(s) and guaranteed minimum earnings.",[],{"type":126,"text":1557,"spans":1558,"direction":112},"In addition to courier positions, Evri Group is also hiring for self-employed driver roles across the UK with opportunities to earn as much as £1200 a week for experienced drivers, as well as a range of opportunities at all levels within its warehouse and head office functions.",[],{"type":126,"text":1560,"spans":1561,"direction":112},"For courier opportunities, roles are open nationwide across the UK, those interested can find out more and apply here.  Self-employed driver vacancies with Evri Premium, a network of DHL, are open UK wide and more information is available here. Head office roles which offer hybrid working opportunities range from graduate positions earning £27,000 per annum through to warehouse opportunities and senior IT and management roles earning upwards of £85,000 per annum. All vacancies can be found here.",[1562,1566,1571],{"start":1272,"end":1563,"type":279,"data":1564},117,{"link_type":281,"url":1565,"target":283},"press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fbeacourier",{"start":1567,"end":1568,"type":279,"data":1569},239,244,{"link_type":281,"url":1570,"target":283},"press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fcareers\u002Fself-employed-van-driver",{"start":1572,"end":1573,"type":279,"data":1574},495,499,{"link_type":281,"url":1575,"target":283},"press.html\u002F\u002Fevricareer.com\u002FCareers\u002F2022%20Multipage%20Microsite-1995\u002FSearch%20Jobs?SiteID=3680",{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":1577,"direction":112},[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":1579,"primary":1580,"id":660,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":1581,"quoteSource":1582},"We’re a global business that hasn’t forgotten its local roots and our customers tell us they appreciate the service given by regular community couriers that get to know their customers. We’re delivering a billion parcels now, but each one matters and as the highest ranked provider for on time deliveries in the UK, we’re committed to investing in creating the roles our customers want as we strive to keep offering higher standards of service that continually raise the bar.","Gary Robinson Group Director Final Mile at Evri Group",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":1584,"primary":1585,"id":799,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":1586,"quoteSource":1587},"We’re a Group with an exciting future and colleagues joining us benefit from access to fast growth business where they can develop their skills and own their own career with the flexibility to work in a way that works for them. In the last week alone, we have launched a new apprenticeship scheme designed to strengthen data and artificial intelligence (AI) skills across our workforce, highlighting our commitment to supporting our talent to grow and evolve their roles working hand in hand with the latest advancements in technology","Lyn Warren, Chief HR officer for Evri Group",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":1589,"primary":1590,"id":714,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":1591},[1592,1594,1597,1599,1602,1606,1609,1612,1614,1616,1618,1620,1624,1626],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":1593,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":1333,"spans":1595,"direction":112},[1596],{"start":32,"end":819,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":1598,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":688,"spans":1600,"direction":112},[1601],{"start":32,"end":362,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":466,"spans":1603,"direction":112},[1604],{"start":469,"end":470,"type":279,"data":1605},{"link_type":281,"url":472,"target":283},{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":1607,"direction":112},[1608],{"start":32,"end":33,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":696,"spans":1610,"direction":112},[1611],{"start":32,"end":699,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":568,"spans":1613,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":571,"spans":1615,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":574,"spans":1617,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":1358,"spans":1619,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":710,"spans":1621,"direction":112},[1622],{"start":277,"end":278,"type":279,"data":1623},{"link_type":281,"url":282,"target":283},{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":1625,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":1627,"direction":112},[],{"id":1629,"uid":1630,"url":1631,"type":50,"href":1632,"tags":1633,"first_publication_date":1634,"last_publication_date":1635,"slugs":1636,"linked_documents":1637,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":1638,"data":1639},"aadBKxIAACYAxjq5","evri-chooses-east-of-england-co-op-for-first-owned-lockers","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-chooses-east-of-england-co-op-for-first-owned-lockers","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22aadBKxIAACYAxjq5%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2026-03-04T07:00:56+0000","2026-03-12T19:19:19+0000",[1630],[],[],{"title":1640,"category":8,"metaDescription":1641,"canonical":1642,"titleTag":1640,"featuredImage":1643,"publishedDate":1655,"slices":1656},"Evri chooses East of England Co-op for first owned lockers","Read about how Evri chooses East of England Co-op for first owned lockers","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-chooses-east-of-england-co-op-for-first-owned-lockers",{"dimensions":1644,"alt":1646,"copyright":8,"url":1647,"id":1648,"edit":1649,"thumbnail":1650},{"width":65,"height":1645},857,"Blue Evri drop box locker in an East of England Co-op store","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaadBZFxvIZEnjSpy_evri-colchester-deployment-drop-22v3-1-.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=1,0,5158,4605&w=960&h=857","aadBZFxvIZEnjSpy",{"x":33,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":1651,"alt":1646,"copyright":8,"url":1652,"id":1648,"edit":1653},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaadBZFxvIZEnjSpy_evri-colchester-deployment-drop-22v3-1-.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1080,5160,2446&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":1654,"zoom":33,"background":71},1080,"2026-03-04",[1657,1704,1708,1714,1719,1725],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":1658,"primary":1660,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[1659],{},{"content":1661},[1662,1667,1672,1677,1680,1683,1686,1689,1692,1695,1698,1701],{"type":109,"text":1663,"spans":1664,"direction":112},"Evri partners with East of England Co-op for launch of owned locker network",[1665],{"start":32,"end":1666,"type":163},75,{"type":109,"text":1668,"spans":1669,"direction":112},"The first two drop-box lockers have been rolled out",[1670],{"start":32,"end":1671,"type":163},51,{"type":109,"text":1673,"spans":1674,"direction":112},"Builds on Evri’s network of 11,000+ ParcelShops and Lockers",[1675],{"start":32,"end":1676,"type":163},59,{"type":126,"text":1678,"spans":1679,"direction":112},"Evri, the UK’s premier parcel delivery company, has today announced an extension to its partnership with East of England Co-op and is rolling out the first two Evri-owned drop-box lockers in its stores which are ready to use.",[],{"type":126,"text":1681,"spans":1682,"direction":112},"Evri currently has a network of more than 11,000+ ParcelShops and Lockers. East of England Co-op already operates a number of ParcelShop locations for Evri, so this new deal builds on the existing partnership by enabling consumers to drop off parcels at a drop-box locker quickly, contact-free, and without queueing or speaking to a person.",[],{"type":126,"text":1684,"spans":1685,"direction":112},"Evri has commissioned at least 1,000 new lockers and drop-boxes from supplier, Bloq.it. Unlike Evri’s existing shared locker network, where lockers can be used to drop off parcels for multiple carriers, these lockers are owned and operated exclusively by Evri.",[],{"type":126,"text":1687,"spans":1688,"direction":112},"The first two drop-box lockers of this kind will enable consumers to easily drop off parcels they’re sending or returning by scanning their QR code to instantly print a self-adhesive label from the integrated printer. These drop-box lockers will be rolled out across the following East of England Co-op stores:",[],{"type":1049,"text":1690,"spans":1691,"direction":112},"East of England Coop, Leiston Supermarket, Sizewell Road, Leiston, IP16 4AE",[],{"type":1049,"text":1693,"spans":1694,"direction":112},"East of England Coop, Stanway Supermarket, Stanway Retail Park, Peartree Road, Stanway, Colchester, CO3 0LX",[],{"type":126,"text":1696,"spans":1697,"direction":112},"Evri reached the 2,000-locker milestone before Christmas, as usage accelerates, recording a 343% increase since during 2025, as consumers continue to adopt alternative ways to get parcels delivered. In addition, parcel diversions to lockers have increased by around 20%, which reflects a clear and sustained shift in consumer behaviour.",[],{"type":126,"text":1699,"spans":1700,"direction":112},"The surge in usage underlines Evri’s £50 million investment in its expansion plans to double its network within five years. Evri currently has a network of more than 11,000 ParcelShops and lockers and plans to increase the number of locations to 25,000 by 2030.",[],{"type":126,"text":1702,"spans":1703,"direction":112},"Locker deliveries can improve choice, convenience and first-time delivery success alongside reducing missed deliveries and 24\u002F7 access. Consumers can currently order directly to a locker through many of the UK’s top retailers, most consumers can divert parcels to a nearby locker if they’re going to be out when they’re expecting a delivery. And soon consumers will be able to add a preference to their Evri account enabling them to direct all parcels to a ParcelShop or Locker of their choice – great for those working nightshifts or those who are regularly out at work.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":1705,"primary":1706,"id":660,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":1707,"quoteSource":1112},"We’re thrilled to start 2026 by launching our own network of branded lockers, reinforcing our commitment to expanding Evri’s ParcelShop and locker network, whilst giving customers greater choice, convenience and control of their parcels. We have a long-standing partnership with East of England Co-op stores, so we’re delighted to launch our very first drop-box lockers in some of these stores.",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":1709,"primary":1710,"id":1140,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":1711},[1712],{"type":126,"text":945,"spans":1713,"direction":112},[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":1715,"primary":1716,"id":799,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":1717,"quoteSource":1718},"Extending our partnership with Evri and introducing these new lockers into our stores is a natural next step for us. We’re always looking for ways to add convenience and value for our members and customers, and these lockers provide a quick, simple and secure way to send or return parcels whilst visiting their local East of England Co-op Food store.","Simon Dryell, Chief Commercial Officer at East of England Co-op",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":1720,"primary":1721,"id":1171,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":1722},[1723],{"type":126,"text":945,"spans":1724,"direction":112},[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":1726,"primary":1727,"id":714,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":1728},[1729,1732,1736,1739,1742,1744,1746,1748,1750],{"type":126,"text":688,"spans":1730,"direction":112},[1731],{"start":32,"end":362,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":466,"spans":1733,"direction":112},[1734],{"start":469,"end":470,"type":279,"data":1735},{"link_type":281,"url":472,"target":283},{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":1737,"direction":112},[1738],{"start":32,"end":33,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":696,"spans":1740,"direction":112},[1741],{"start":32,"end":699,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":568,"spans":1743,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":571,"spans":1745,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":980,"spans":1747,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":707,"spans":1749,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":710,"spans":1751,"direction":112},[1752],{"start":277,"end":278,"type":279,"data":1753},{"link_type":281,"url":282,"target":283},{"id":1755,"uid":1756,"url":1757,"type":50,"href":1758,"tags":1759,"first_publication_date":1760,"last_publication_date":1760,"slugs":1761,"linked_documents":1762,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":1763,"data":1764},"aZcG1RIAACIAcKrz","evri-is-trialing-autonomous-robot-deliveries-in-barnsley---the-uks-first-government-backed-tech-town","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-is-trialing-autonomous-robot-deliveries-in-barnsley---the-uks-first-government-backed-tech-town","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22aZcG1RIAACIAcKrz%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2026-02-19T12:58:00+0000",[1756],[],[],{"title":1765,"category":8,"metaDescription":1766,"canonical":1767,"titleTag":1768,"featuredImage":1769,"publishedDate":1781,"slices":1782},"Evri is trialing autonomous robot deliveries in Barnsley - the UK's first government-backed ‘tech town’","Read about how Evri Evri is trialing autonomous robot deliveries in Barnsley - the UK's first government-backed ‘tech town’","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-is-trialing-autonomous-robot-deliveries-in-barnsley---the","Evri is trialing autonomous robot deliveries in Barnsley - the UK's first government-backed ‘tech town’ | Evri",{"dimensions":1770,"alt":1771,"copyright":8,"url":1772,"id":1773,"edit":1774,"thumbnail":1775},{"width":65,"height":865},"Two Evri colleagues work together at a table ","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaYTVgt0YXLCxVdjU_20220725-EVRI-PeoplePhotography-376.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,0,6240,4160&w=960&h=640","aYTVgt0YXLCxVdjU",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":1776,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":1777,"id":1778,"edit":1779},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaZcHo8FoBIGEgjgp_BarnsleyRobot.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,79,818,388&w=384&h=182","aZcHo8FoBIGEgjgp",{"x":32,"y":1780,"zoom":33,"background":71},79,"2026-02-16",[1783,1847,1852,1857,1863],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":1784,"primary":1786,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[1785],{},{"content":1787},[1788,1793,1798,1803,1805,1808,1812,1819,1821,1823,1826,1829,1837,1839,1845],{"type":126,"text":1789,"spans":1790,"direction":112},"·       Evri and Delivers.AI have launched a three-month  autonomous delivery trial in Barnsley, the UK's first government-backed ‘tech town’",[1791],{"start":321,"end":1792,"type":163},141,{"type":126,"text":1794,"spans":1795,"direction":112},"·       Participants can sign up to receive all parcels by robot, choose a delivery time slot and track their parcel in real-time",[1796],{"start":321,"end":1797,"type":163},129,{"type":126,"text":1799,"spans":1800,"direction":112},"·       Electric-powered and fully monitored, the robots offer a flexible, accessible and eco-friendly alternative, supporting Evri’s 2035 net zero target",[1801],{"start":321,"end":1802,"type":163},154,{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":1804,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":1806,"spans":1807,"direction":112},"A new trial of an autonomous delivery robot is going live in Redbrook, Barnsley, offering residents a glimpse into the future of final mile delivery. A partnership between Evri, the UK’s premier parcel delivery company, and Delivers.AI, will see a pilot run for at least three months. It aims to explore how robotics can support local couriers, while enhancing the overall delivery experience for consumers through increased choice and convenience.",[],{"type":126,"text":1809,"spans":1810,"direction":112},"\nHere's how it works:",[1811],{"start":33,"end":206,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":1813,"spans":1814,"direction":112},"Eligible residents can opt in to the trial to receive all their parcels by robot during the trial. Once a delivery is scheduled, customers receive a booking link via SMS to choose a time slot. When it’s time, the parcel is loaded into the robot, which travels to the customer’s address. Customers can track the robot in real time online and will receive a secure link via SMS to unlock the robot’s lid once it arrives. If no one’s home, the parcel is returned to the depot and redelivered by a courier.",[1815],{"start":1816,"end":1161,"type":279,"data":1817},37,{"link_type":281,"url":1818,"target":283},"press.html\u002F\u002Fdev.doh3onof9is0p.amplifyapp.com\u002F",{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":1820,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":1822,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":1824,"spans":1825,"direction":112},"The robots are weatherproof, compliant with traffic laws and electric-powered, offering a secure and sustainable delivery option that supports Evri's commitment to become net zero by 2035. Designed to operate 24\u002F7, they offer greater flexibility for customers –",[],{"type":126,"text":1827,"spans":1828,"direction":112},"whether that’s receiving a parcel late at night or choosing a designated time slot that consumers and can fit around busy lifestyles. They can also wait longer at the door, which helps people who may need more time to answer, and with a compact design standing at 80cm tall, they’re accessible to wheelchair users too.",[],{"type":126,"text":1830,"spans":1831,"direction":112},"Operating out of Barnsley Business and Innovation Centre, the robots are fully monitored by Evri’s operations team in partnership with Delivers.AI, in real time. If an issue arises, such as an obstruction or attempted tampering, Evri can intervene immediately and even manually redirect the robot if needed.\n\nAs part of the pilot, Evri will be looking to demonstrate the robot and its technology to local schools   and give children the opportunity to name the robot.",[1832],{"start":1833,"end":1834,"type":279,"data":1835},399,412,{"link_type":281,"url":1836,"target":283},"press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhoyland-common-pupils-evri-tour",{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":1838,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":1840,"spans":1841,"direction":112},"The trial is currently limited to a small area of Redbrook, Barnsley. Residents can check their postcode online to see if they are eligible. Customers can also opt out at any time via a dedicated link. The results of the trial will inform any decisions about future expansion.",[1842],{"start":763,"end":1843,"type":279,"data":1844},111,{"link_type":281,"url":1818,"target":283},{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":1846,"direction":112},[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":1848,"primary":1849,"id":660,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":1850,"quoteSource":1851},"We’re always looking at innovative ways to improve the delivery experience for our customers. The robots will work alongside our couriers, supporting them in their roles while helping to increase the speed, convenience and flexibility of the services we offer. We’re excited to see how the residents in Barnsley respond to this new service, and what we can learn from the trial.","Marcus Hunter, Chief Technology Officer at Evri Group",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":1853,"primary":1854,"id":799,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":1855,"quoteSource":1856},"Hosting this pilot at The Business Village demonstrates how Barnsley is putting innovation into practice. From my position at BBIC and as a member of the Barnsley Inclusive Economy Board, I see this as a strong signal of the borough’s ambition. It supports our digital and logistics sectors, brings new technology directly into the community, and reinforces Barnsley’s reputation as a place where practical, forward-looking innovation can thrive","Martin Beesley, Barnsley Business Innovation Centre",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":1858,"primary":1859,"id":1862,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":1860,"quoteSource":1861},"As the UK's first government-backed Tech Town, it's fantastic to see this type of innovation, which could become the future for home deliveries, taking place here in Barnsley.\n \"It is initiatives and ideas like this which are trialling new technologies that will play a crucial role in us becoming the UK's leading digital town, one the missions from our Inclusive Economic Growth Strategy.\n \"We wish Evri every success with this trial and will be following it with interest","Councillor Robin Franklin, Cabinet spokesperson for Regeneration and Culture","quote$39170220-1b3c-4466-ba79-f860073ab8c6",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":1864,"primary":1865,"id":714,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":1866},[1867,1869,1872,1874,1877,1881,1884,1887,1889,1891,1893,1895,1899,1901],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":1868,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":1333,"spans":1870,"direction":112},[1871],{"start":32,"end":819,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":1873,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":688,"spans":1875,"direction":112},[1876],{"start":32,"end":362,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":466,"spans":1878,"direction":112},[1879],{"start":469,"end":470,"type":279,"data":1880},{"link_type":281,"url":472,"target":283},{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":1882,"direction":112},[1883],{"start":32,"end":33,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":696,"spans":1885,"direction":112},[1886],{"start":32,"end":699,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":568,"spans":1888,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":571,"spans":1890,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":574,"spans":1892,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":1358,"spans":1894,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":710,"spans":1896,"direction":112},[1897],{"start":277,"end":278,"type":279,"data":1898},{"link_type":281,"url":282,"target":283},{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":1900,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":1902,"direction":112},[],[1904,2064,2196,2274,2336,2455,2599,2713,2815,2946,3069,3198],{"id":1905,"uid":1906,"url":1907,"type":50,"href":1908,"tags":1909,"first_publication_date":1910,"last_publication_date":1911,"slugs":1912,"linked_documents":1913,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":1914,"data":1915},"aYmyyBMAACEAT91Z","evri-group-kicks-off-second-year-of-scope-partnership-raising-28000","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-group-kicks-off-second-year-of-scope-partnership-raising-28000","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22aYmyyBMAACEAT91Z%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2026-02-09T10:16:14+0000","2026-04-10T10:22:33+0000",[1906],[],[],{"title":1916,"category":8,"metaDescription":1917,"canonical":1918,"titleTag":1919,"featuredImage":1920,"publishedDate":1931,"slices":1932},"Evri Group kicks off second year of Scope partnership raising £28,000","Read about how Evri Group has raised £28,000 and its sponsorship of Scope Awards","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-group-kicks-off-second-year-of-scope-partnership-raising-28000","Evri Group Kicks off Second Year of Scope Partnership | Evri",{"dimensions":1921,"alt":1923,"copyright":8,"url":1924,"id":1925,"edit":1926,"thumbnail":1927},{"width":65,"height":1922},706,"A photo of a large group of people on a golf course","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaYmzFd0YXLCxVmtb_EvriCharityGolfDaygroupshot.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,2692,1980&w=960&h=706","aYmzFd0YXLCxVmtb",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":1928,"alt":1923,"copyright":8,"url":1929,"id":1925,"edit":1930},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaYmzFd0YXLCxVmtb_EvriCharityGolfDaygroupshot.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,353,2692,1276&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":78,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2026-02-09",[1933,1995,2000,2008,2013,2020,2026],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":1934,"primary":1936,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[1935],{},{"content":1937},[1938,1940,1945,1950,1955,1957,1960,1963,1971,1974,1977,1983,1986,1989,1992],{"type":126,"text":1916,"spans":1939,"direction":112},[],{"type":109,"text":1941,"spans":1942,"direction":112},"£28,000 raised for disability equality charity Scope, funding almost 2,000 calls to Scope’s helpline and bringing overall total to more than £188,000",[1943],{"start":32,"end":1944,"type":163},149,{"type":109,"text":1946,"spans":1947,"direction":112},"Evri is announced as headline sponsor of annual Scope Awards for second year",[1948],{"start":32,"end":1949,"type":163},76,{"type":109,"text":1951,"spans":1952,"direction":112},"More than 100,000 people set accessibility preferences as Evri encourages anyone with preferences or needs to provide instructions to the carrier",[1953],{"start":32,"end":1954,"type":163},145,{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":1956,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":1958,"spans":1959,"direction":112},"Evri, the UK’s premier parcel delivery company, has kicked off its second year of partnership with disability equality charity Scope by raising £28,000 at a charity golf day attended by some of its top clients.",[],{"type":126,"text":1961,"spans":1962,"direction":112},"Evri’s fundraising efforts reinforce its commitment to supporting Scope for three years. The £28,000, raised through mulligans such as extra shots, and followed by an auction, could go towards funding almost 2,000 calls to Scope’s helpline.",[],{"type":126,"text":1964,"spans":1965,"direction":112},"There are 16 million disabled people in the UK and Scope’s free helpline is a lifeline giving guidance, advice and emotional support.  With the average call costing £15, every donation helps. This latest event brings Evri’s current total fundraising with Scope to over £188,000, following the announcement of its year-one total, and publishing its inaugural Social Impact Report.",[1966],{"start":1967,"end":1968,"type":279,"data":1969},358,378,{"link_type":281,"url":1970,"target":283},"press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Faccessibility",{"type":126,"text":1972,"spans":1973,"direction":112},"Evri today announces it will be the headline sponsor of the annual Scope Awards, for the second year running. The award ceremony will take place in April 2026 to celebrate disability equality champions, amplify disabled voices and build a movement of change with disabled people.",[],{"type":126,"text":1975,"spans":1976,"direction":112},"Whilst Evri continues to fundraise, it also calls on anyone with a preference or accessibility need, to share instructions via its website or app. More than 100,000 customers have now shared accessibility specific preferences and millions more have shared other preferences requests. Customers can select doorstep options and give their courier instructions for a successful and comfortable delivery.",[],{"type":109,"text":1978,"spans":1979,"direction":112},"This can be done within the Evri App by following these instructions:",[1980],{"start":1981,"end":162,"type":279,"data":1982},28,{"link_type":281,"url":925,"target":283},{"type":109,"text":1984,"spans":1985,"direction":112},"Step 1: Click ‘more’, ‘preferences’, then ‘accessibility instructions’",[],{"type":109,"text":1987,"spans":1988,"direction":112},"Step 2: Select one options which include give me more time to get to the door, ring my doorbell instead of knocking or don’t block my doorway with a parcel.",[],{"type":109,"text":1990,"spans":1991,"direction":112},"Step 3: Click ‘save’",[],{"type":126,"text":1993,"spans":1994,"direction":112},"Evri’s Social Impact Report, published in November 2025, also outlined Evri’s plans for year two, including expanded training, volunteering initiatives whilst launching new initiatives to make Evri a more accessible place to work for colleagues.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":1996,"primary":1997,"id":660,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":1998,"quoteSource":1999},"We’re delighted to start our second year of partnership with Scope by fundraising £28,000, but we’re just getting started. Over the next few years and beyond, we’re dedicated to ensuring Evri serves all our communities and is an amazing place to work for all.","Martijn de Lange, CEO at Evri Group",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":2001,"primary":2002,"id":2007,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":2003},[2004],{"type":126,"text":2005,"spans":2006,"direction":112},"...",[],"rich_text$d99ac183-9569-4cd0-93ce-4a71a1d5121c",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":2009,"primary":2010,"id":799,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":2011,"quoteSource":2012},"Evri is proud to sponsor the Scope Awards for the second year running, supporting our commitment to disability equality, the vital work Scope does across the UK, and building on a fantastic first year supporting Scope, during which we donated over £160,000.\n Being involved in these awards is personal to me. I was diagnosed with dyslexia at 26, which helped make sense of the challenges I’d faced at school and earlier in my career. Those experiences taught me to reassess my strengths and stay true to my values – even when it meant facing difficult situations.\n Joining Evri was a turning point. I found a workplace that respects difference, recognises potential, and encourages people to bring their whole selves to work. That’s why I’m honoured to judge this year’s awards, celebrating the achievements of disabled people and allies who are driving real progress.","Andrew Griffiths, Health & Safety Workplace Auditor at Evri Group, and Scope Awards judge",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":2014,"primary":2015,"id":2019,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":2016},[2017],{"type":126,"text":2005,"spans":2018,"direction":112},[],"rich_text$a0a0e934-7ea4-4412-91dc-8d7f0c8e94a7",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":2021,"primary":2022,"id":2025,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":2023,"quoteSource":2024},"I’d like to thank our partners, Evri and their clients, for their wonderful generosity raising £28,000 in their recent golf day. This brings their fundraising total to over £188,000 and the impact of this cannot be underestimated.\nThese vital funds will go a long way in helping us create a society where disabled people have equal opportunities and support. They’re also essential to help us provide services, such as our free helpline, that empower and provide a lifeline for many disabled people.","Sammi Skelding, Head of Partnerships and Philanthropy at disability equality charity Scope","quote$8b1f2bb9-c55e-404b-b32f-156fcfa75229",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":2027,"primary":2028,"id":714,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":2029},[2030,2032,2035,2037,2040,2044,2047,2050,2052,2054,2056,2058,2062],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":2031,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":1333,"spans":2033,"direction":112},[2034],{"start":32,"end":819,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":2036,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":688,"spans":2038,"direction":112},[2039],{"start":32,"end":362,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":466,"spans":2041,"direction":112},[2042],{"start":469,"end":470,"type":279,"data":2043},{"link_type":281,"url":472,"target":283},{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":2045,"direction":112},[2046],{"start":32,"end":33,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":696,"spans":2048,"direction":112},[2049],{"start":32,"end":699,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":568,"spans":2051,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":571,"spans":2053,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":574,"spans":2055,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":1358,"spans":2057,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":710,"spans":2059,"direction":112},[2060],{"start":277,"end":278,"type":279,"data":2061},{"link_type":281,"url":282,"target":283},{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":2063,"direction":112},[],{"id":2065,"uid":2066,"url":2067,"type":50,"href":2068,"tags":2069,"first_publication_date":2070,"last_publication_date":2071,"slugs":2072,"linked_documents":2074,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":2075,"data":2076},"aYTUYREAACUAJ27u","evri-ai-data-apprenticeship","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-ai-data-apprenticeship","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22aYTUYREAACUAJ27u%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2026-02-05T17:47:12+0000","2026-02-06T09:15:00+0000",[2073],"evri-group-extends-apprenticeship-offer-with-new-ai-and-data-programmes",[],[],{"title":2077,"category":8,"metaDescription":2078,"canonical":2079,"titleTag":2080,"featuredImage":2081,"publishedDate":2089,"slices":2090},"Evri Group extends apprenticeship offer with new AI and data programmes","Read about how Evri Group extends apprenticeship offer with new AI and data programmes","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002FEvri-extends-apprenticeship-offer-new-AI-data-programmes","Evri Group extends apprenticeship offer with new AI and data programmes | Evri",{"dimensions":2082,"alt":1771,"copyright":8,"url":1772,"id":1773,"edit":2083,"thumbnail":2084},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":2085,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":2086,"id":1773,"edit":2087},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaYTVgt0YXLCxVdjU_20220725-EVRI-PeoplePhotography-376.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,601,6240,2958&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":2088,"zoom":33,"background":71},601,"2026-02-05",[2091,2132,2137,2142],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":2092,"primary":2094,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[2093],{},{"content":2095},[2096,2098,2101,2104,2107,2109,2112,2115,2118,2121,2124,2127,2130],{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":2097,"direction":112},[],{"type":109,"text":2099,"spans":2100,"direction":112},"Evri Group launches new AI and data apprenticeship scheme to colleagues in partnership with educational tech company Multiverse",[],{"type":109,"text":2102,"spans":2103,"direction":112},"Colleagues at the UK’s premier parcel delivery company can apply to four dedicated pilot programmes",[],{"type":109,"text":2105,"spans":2106,"direction":112},"Launch follows Evri’s wider commitment to apprenticeship learning, gifting £250K via Government Levy transfer scheme to other small businesses",[],{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":2108,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":2110,"spans":2111,"direction":112},"The UK’s premier parcel delivery company, the Evri Group, has announced the launch of a new apprenticeship scheme designed to strengthen data and artificial intelligence (AI) skills across its workforce.",[],{"type":126,"text":2113,"spans":2114,"direction":112},"Starting in February, the scheme offers colleagues the opportunity to join one of four dedicated pilot programmes, with successful candidates joining the Evri Group’s AI or Data Academy.",[],{"type":126,"text":2116,"spans":2117,"direction":112},"And launched in partnership with leading education technology provider Multiverse, the two academies, which offer both level 3 and level 4 courses, are aimed at colleagues who don’t currently work in AI and data, but who want to build practical, career-enhancing skills in these fast-growing areas.",[],{"type":126,"text":2119,"spans":2120,"direction":112},"The programmes will support over 90 colleagues from various departments across the business in gaining hands-on skills through a series of modules, workshops and real business projects, culminating in a final assessment.",[],{"type":126,"text":2122,"spans":2123,"direction":112},"Those who successfully complete the course will achieve a recognised apprenticeship L3 or L4 qualification in their chosen specialism, equipping them with new skills and knowledge in these areas to apply within their current role.",[],{"type":126,"text":2125,"spans":2126,"direction":112},"The launch of the new academies builds on the Evri Group’s strong commitment to colleague learning and development, with the business already offering apprenticeship programmes in areas such as Leadership & Management, Transport, Sales and finance, and in 2025 alone, over 120 colleagues received support to upskill through these schemes.",[],{"type":126,"text":2128,"spans":2129,"direction":112},"Additionally, Evri’s support of the government’s Apprenticeship Levy transfer scheme saw the parcel company pledge £250,000 in the last financial year to help other small businesses fund their own apprenticeship programmes. Since 2021, this figure has reached £465,000, supporting small businesses in a number of sectors, including hairdressing, early years, and construction.",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":2131,"direction":112},[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":2133,"primary":2134,"id":660,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":2135,"quoteSource":2136},"I'm delighted that we’ve been able to offer these fantastic programmes through our partnership with Multiverse.\nAt Evri, continuous learning and development is a core part of who we are, and we’re committed to giving colleagues every opportunity to grow, build new skills and progress in their careers.\nWith AI and data playing an increasingly important role across our industry, this is a fantastic chance for colleagues outside of traditional tech and data roles to gain practical, future-focused skills that can make a real difference in their current roles and beyond.","Lyn Warren, Chief HR Officer at Evri",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":2138,"primary":2139,"id":799,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":2140,"quoteSource":2141},"AI and data are no longer just tools for tech teams: they are the fundamental building blocks of the modern workplace. By launching these academies, Evri is staying ahead of the curve and ensuring its workforce is equipped for the future of logistics.\nWe are proud to partner with a forward-thinking brand that recognises that the best way to drive innovation is to invest directly in the people who know the business best.","Gary Eimerman, Chief Learning Officer at Multiverse",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":2143,"primary":2144,"id":714,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":2145},[2146,2148,2151,2153,2156,2160,2163,2166,2168,2170,2172,2174,2178,2180,2184,2187,2190,2193],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":2147,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":1333,"spans":2149,"direction":112},[2150],{"start":32,"end":819,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":2152,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":688,"spans":2154,"direction":112},[2155],{"start":32,"end":362,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":466,"spans":2157,"direction":112},[2158],{"start":469,"end":470,"type":279,"data":2159},{"link_type":281,"url":472,"target":283},{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":2161,"direction":112},[2162],{"start":32,"end":33,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":696,"spans":2164,"direction":112},[2165],{"start":32,"end":699,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":568,"spans":2167,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":571,"spans":2169,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":574,"spans":2171,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":1358,"spans":2173,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":710,"spans":2175,"direction":112},[2176],{"start":277,"end":278,"type":279,"data":2177},{"link_type":281,"url":282,"target":283},{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":2179,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":2181,"spans":2182,"direction":112},"About Multiverse",[2183],{"start":32,"end":405,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":2185,"spans":2186,"direction":112},"Multiverse is the upskilling platform for AI and tech adoption. Multiverse has partnered with over 1,500 companies to deliver a new kind of learning that’s transforming the workforce through tech skills.",[],{"type":126,"text":2188,"spans":2189,"direction":112},"Multiverse apprenticeships are for people of any age or career stage and focus on critical AI, data and tech skills. Multiverse learners have driven $2bn + ROI for their employers, using the skills they’ve learned to improve productivity and measurable performance.",[],{"type":126,"text":2191,"spans":2192,"direction":112},"Multiverse has raised approximately $500 million in venture funding from investors including Lightspeed Venture Partners, Index Ventures and General Catalyst, making the company Europe’s only EdTech unicorn.",[],{"type":126,"text":2194,"spans":2195,"direction":112},"For more information, visit www.multiverse.io",[],{"id":2197,"uid":2198,"url":2199,"type":50,"href":2200,"tags":2201,"first_publication_date":2202,"last_publication_date":2202,"slugs":2203,"linked_documents":2204,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":2205,"data":2206},"aUPj8BIAACIAFQCw","wigans-longest-serving-courier-37-years-on-the-road","\u002Fpress\u002Fwigans-longest-serving-courier-37-years-on-the-road","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22aUPj8BIAACIAFQCw%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2025-12-18T11:29:04+0000",[2198],[],[],{"title":2207,"category":8,"metaDescription":2208,"canonical":2209,"titleTag":2210,"featuredImage":2211,"publishedDate":2221,"slices":2222},"Wigan’s longest serving courier: 37 years on the road","Read about Wigan’s longest serving courier: 37 years on the road","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fwigans-longest-serving-courier-37-years-on-the-road","Wigan’s longest serving courier: 37 years on the road | Evri",{"dimensions":2212,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":2214,"id":2215,"edit":2216,"thumbnail":2217},{"width":65,"height":2213},954,"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaUPk-XNYClf9oY9h_Janet.png?auto=format,compress&rect=0,0,327,325&w=960&h=954","aUPk-XNYClf9oY9h",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":2218,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":2219,"id":2215,"edit":2220},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaUPk-XNYClf9oY9h_Janet.png?auto=format,compress&rect=0,85,327,155&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":497,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2025-12-17",[2223],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":2224,"primary":2226,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[2225],{},{"content":2227},[2228,2235,2238,2241,2244,2247,2250,2253,2256,2259,2262,2265,2268,2271],{"type":126,"text":2229,"spans":2230,"direction":112},"17th December 2025  As the UK’s premier parcel delivery company, gears up for the festive period to deliver around 4 million parcels a day, Evri is celebrating one of the UK’s most dedicated, and believed to be longest serving couriers, Janet Swinburn from Wigan. She has been an Evri courier for almost four decades in Kitt Green, Wigan.",[2231,2232],{"start":32,"end":587,"type":163},{"start":2233,"end":2234,"type":163},19,20,{"type":126,"text":2236,"spans":2237,"direction":112},"Janet, now 77, began her courier career just before her 40th birthday, initially covering a round for a friend. She has remained a constant presence through the company’s evolution from Grattan, to Parcelnet, Hermes, and now Evri.",[],{"type":126,"text":2239,"spans":2240,"direction":112},"Janet credits the flexibility of the role for helping her balance work and family life and says the job has brought lasting friendships and a sense of community. She said:",[],{"type":126,"text":2242,"spans":2243,"direction":112},"” When I first started my children were seven and four and the flexibility of the job allowed me to work around school times, balancing work and family life. As the years have gone on and my children have grown, I’ve found I do it for other reasons. I’ve made friends doing this job, seeing the same old faces day to day as well as meeting new ones. I’ve had the pleasure of seeing people having children, watching them grow and now I deliver to them and I’m seeing them have children as well.”",[],{"type":126,"text":2245,"spans":2246,"direction":112},"Janet began life as a courier to cover a round for a friend\u002F Over 37 years, Janet has witnessed dramatic changes in the industry—from sorting parcels at home and using paper manifests, to today’s app-based route optimisation and digital tracking.“When I first started, we used to have the parcels delivered to our house, then we had to bag up the items ourselves and pair them with invoices ready for delivery. It’s very different to how it works today.”",[],{"type":126,"text":2248,"spans":2249,"direction":112},"She also said, “My husband and I would argue as he couldn’t get the car in the garage as it was full of catalogues ready to go out and be delivered, now everything is online and no one uses catalogues, some of my older customers miss those as they don’t have the internet to order anything.”",[],{"type":126,"text":2251,"spans":2252,"direction":112},"We asked Janet about other changes she had seen over the years and how things had changed.",[],{"type":126,"text":2254,"spans":2255,"direction":112},"“We used to use paper manifests, maps to find out where we were going and as I mentioned people ordered things from catalogues. Now we have apps on our phones with our manifests on, and route optimisations to find people’s addresses - almost everyone shops online.”",[],{"type":126,"text":2257,"spans":2258,"direction":112},"Janet also talked about the volume of parcels growing, with Evri expecting to deliver more than 900 million this year.",[],{"type":126,"text":2260,"spans":2261,"direction":112},"“I deliver about 100 parcels day, one of the biggest things I’ve seen in recent years are the increased number of parcels.”",[],{"type":126,"text":2263,"spans":2264,"direction":112},"With the festive season approaching, we asked Janet if she had any tips to give to customer to help with their deliveries:",[],{"type":126,"text":2266,"spans":2267,"direction":112},"“Let us know where your safe place is if you’re not going to be in, or tell us which neighbour you want us to leave a parcel with. You can do this before we even have your parcel on the Evri app. It really helps us knowing the best place to put your parcel securely and helps us speed up deliveries to other customers.”",[],{"type":126,"text":2269,"spans":2270,"direction":112},"Janet is believed to be the UK’s longest-serving courier.",[],{"type":126,"text":2272,"spans":2273,"direction":112},"Carl Lyon, Chief Operating Officer, Evri, said: “Janet and the thousands of other couriers delivering this Christmas are at the centre of communities and delivering an important service. At 37 years and counting, she’s certainly one of the most dedicated couriers – and a true part of Wigan’s community.”",[],{"id":2275,"uid":2276,"url":2277,"type":50,"href":2278,"tags":2279,"first_publication_date":2280,"last_publication_date":2281,"slugs":2282,"linked_documents":2284,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":2285,"data":2286},"aUAZCRIAACUAD0_i","panorama","\u002Fpress\u002Fpanorama","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22aUAZCRIAACUAD0_i%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2025-12-15T14:24:29+0000","2025-12-16T09:36:57+0000",[2283],"our-response-to-bbc-panorama",[],[],{"title":2287,"category":8,"metaDescription":2288,"canonical":2289,"titleTag":2290,"featuredImage":2291,"publishedDate":2301,"slices":2302},"Our response to BBC Panorama","Read Evri's response to BBC Panorama","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fpanorama","Our response to BBC Panorama | Evri",{"dimensions":2292,"alt":2293,"copyright":8,"url":2294,"id":2295,"edit":2296,"thumbnail":2297},{"width":65,"height":865},"A female Evri van driver poses in front of her blue Evri van.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zBX5bqstJ9-iO1_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9828.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6zBX5bqstJ9-iO1",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":2298,"alt":2293,"copyright":8,"url":2299,"id":2295,"edit":2300},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zBX5bqstJ9-iO1_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9828.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2025-12-15",[2303],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":2304,"primary":2306,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[2305],{},{"content":2307},[2308,2312,2315,2318,2321,2324,2327,2330,2333],{"type":126,"text":2309,"spans":2310,"direction":112},"An Evri spokesperson said:",[2311],{"start":32,"end":372,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":2313,"spans":2314,"direction":112},"“The BBC Panorama programme, deliberately airing during our busiest season, relies on cherry-picked and skewed cases that do not reflect who we are or the dedication of thousands of local couriers serving their communities everyday. The Panorama team has withheld relevant and specific information to allow us to fully review and fairly respond.",[],{"type":126,"text":2316,"spans":2317,"direction":112},"“Evri provides a fast, reliable, and cost-effective delivery service, and will deliver about 900 million parcels this year to over 25 million households through its 34,000 self-employed couriers who choose to work for us and are attracted by flexible work in their communities.",[],{"type":126,"text":2319,"spans":2320,"direction":112},"“Our benchmark-setting delivery rates, which exceed punctuality targets of many other industries, and exceptional growth are driven by our strong investment and the trust placed in us by customers ranging from small businesses to major high street retailers.",[],{"type":126,"text":2322,"spans":2323,"direction":112},"“We have an industry leading and GMB backed pay scheme for our regular self-employed couriers which offers pensions and holiday and sick pay.",[],{"type":126,"text":2325,"spans":2326,"direction":112},"“Evri couriers generate earnings significantly above the National Living Wage, with average earnings exceeding £20 per hour, and our model was approved by HMRC after a multi-year review. Despite requesting details, Panorama did not provide specific information on pay to review these claims, as part of a fair right of reply.",[],{"type":126,"text":2328,"spans":2329,"direction":112},"“If any courier has concerns about their pay or working conditions, we have clear, rapid processes to address them and work closely with the GMB to listen and act and have a history of constructive engagement that has led to improvements for couriers. We take health and safety very seriously, and where there is a risk that our standards are not fully met, we audit sites to check safety and compliance.",[],{"type":126,"text":2331,"spans":2332,"direction":112},"“Parcels are labelled by clients, such as retailers, not Evri. And 99.2% of all parcels are correctly banded. Couriers can request checks and upgrades via the courier app if they think a parcel has been misbanded. We have also invested in proactive processes which identifies any misbands and correct rates. We introduced a new small packet rate in February 2025 in response to competition in the market – with the clear intention that couriers will benefit from increased volumes from this change.",[],{"type":126,"text":2334,"spans":2335,"direction":112},"“At a time when many companies are reducing headcount and unemployment is growing, we’re proud to be creating thousands of opportunities – and last week announced we will create an additional 2,500 jobs, including courier roles.”",[],{"id":2337,"uid":2338,"url":2339,"type":50,"href":2340,"tags":2341,"first_publication_date":2342,"last_publication_date":2342,"slugs":2343,"linked_documents":2345,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":2346,"data":2347},"aTKZ8RIAACAA-hu1","evri-strengthens-parcelshops-for-peak","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-strengthens-parcelshops-for-peak","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22aTKZ8RIAACAA-hu1%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2025-12-05T09:19:38+0000",[2344],"evri-strengthens-parcelshop-network-for-peak",[],[],{"title":2348,"category":8,"metaDescription":2349,"canonical":2350,"titleTag":2351,"featuredImage":2352,"publishedDate":2363,"slices":2364},"Evri strengthens ParcelShop network for peak","Read about how Evri is strengthening its ParcelShop network for peak here","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-strengthens-parcelshop-network-for-peak","Evri strengthens ParcelShop network for peak | Evri",{"dimensions":2353,"alt":2354,"copyright":8,"url":2355,"id":2356,"edit":2357,"thumbnail":2358},{"width":65,"height":865},"Man exits an Evri ParcelShop carrying his parcel","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaTKepnNYClf9n2P5_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2942.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,0,1000,667&w=960&h=640","aTKepnNYClf9n2P5",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":2359,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":2360,"id":2356,"edit":2361},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaTKepnNYClf9n2P5_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2942.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,97,1000,474&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":2362,"zoom":33,"background":71},97,"2025-12-05",[2365,2405,2410,2416],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":2366,"primary":2368,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[2367],{},{"content":2369},[2370,2373,2376,2379,2381,2384,2387,2390,2393,2396,2399,2402],{"type":109,"text":2371,"spans":2372,"direction":112},"UK’s premier parcel delivery company prepares for peak with roll out of new ParcelShop print-in-store devices",[],{"type":109,"text":2374,"spans":2375,"direction":112},"Evri has teamed up with Zebra Technologies, a global leader in digitising and automating workflows to deliver intelligent operations, for new premium liner-less printing solution",[],{"type":109,"text":2377,"spans":2378,"direction":112},"Rollout looks to strengthen Evri’s ParcelShop network ahead of what is forecast to be another record-breaking peak",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":2380,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":2382,"spans":2383,"direction":112},"Parcel delivery company, Evri, has announced the further strengthening of its network of ParcelShops this peak, with the rollout of its brand-new state-of-the-art label printers.",[],{"type":126,"text":2385,"spans":2386,"direction":112},"In readiness for what is forecast to be another record-breaking festive season, the UK’s premier parcel delivery company has collaborated with Zebra Technologies, a global leader in digitising and automating workflows to deliver intelligent operations, in the creation and installation of the new devices, giving customers an even more seamless experience when choosing to print their labels in store.",[],{"type":126,"text":2388,"spans":2389,"direction":112},"And with completion of the rollout targeted for the end of this year, Evri’s launch of the new devices across a total of 7,000 locations further bolsters its continued commitment to its ParcelShop network.",[],{"type":126,"text":2391,"spans":2392,"direction":112},"In a first for Evri, the new print-in-store kiosk solution has been designed and built by Zebra to offer a zero-liner solution, meaning all labels printed are completely liner-less, further supporting ParcelShops in their sustainability efforts by reducing waste generation.",[],{"type":126,"text":2394,"spans":2395,"direction":112},"Additionally, shops will see greater efficiency from the new devices, with up to 50% more labels per roll and variable sizing so stores only print what they need, while customers will benefit from an even faster, more seamless service thanks to the new in-built premium technology.",[],{"type":126,"text":2397,"spans":2398,"direction":112},"And with more labels per roll, fewer rolls are required for transport and storage, resulting in a 40% reduction in shipping weight and helping to lower CO₂ emissions.",[],{"type":126,"text":2400,"spans":2401,"direction":112},"The rollout comes as part of a wider commitment by Evri to its ParcelShop and Locker network, which includes over 6,000 independent retailers, following an announcement earlier this year of its plans to double its existing 10,000-strong estate, reaching 25,000 locations by 2030, as part of a wider £50 million investment.",[],{"type":126,"text":2403,"spans":2404,"direction":112},"Alongside this, the Yorkshire-based parcel delivery company recently revealed its new partnership with Asda, which will see the rollout of its ParcelShops across the supermarket chain’s entire estate. Starting in October, the service launched in over 300 Asda stores, with plans to be in all 1,200 stores by April next year.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":2406,"primary":2407,"id":148,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":2408,"quoteSource":2409},"We know that an increasing number of customers are looking for flexibility when it comes to sending and receiving their parcels, which is why our ParcelShop network is such a vital part of our business.\nWe’re committed to ensuring that the shops that make up our estate are set up for success, not just as we enter our busiest trading period but also all year round, as well as striving to give our customers an even more seamless experience.\nWe’re particularly excited about what we’ve been able to achieve by collaborating with Zebra, as it was important that we created a fully considered device that would provide long-term durability and efficiency as well as continue to improve on what we’ve done previously.","Liam Rogan, Head of ParcelShops and Lockers at Evri",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":2411,"primary":2412,"id":2415,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":2413,"quoteSource":2414},"We are pleased to support Evri in providing its customers with a flexible and elevated experience and progress its mission to be the most convenient way to send, receive and return parcels. \nThe custom-built print-in-store kiosks, featuring our ET45 enterprise tablets and ZD621 linerless printers, will make work better every day for Evri’s frontline.","Phil Sambrook, EMEA Transport and Logistics Vertical Lead - Strategy at Zebra Technologies","quote$b9fab84f-f2e5-4743-877d-52c23bf97fff",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":2417,"primary":2418,"id":284,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":2419},[2420,2422,2425,2427,2429,2431,2433,2438,2440,2444],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":2421,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":696,"spans":2423,"direction":112},[2424],{"start":32,"end":699,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":568,"spans":2426,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":571,"spans":2428,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":574,"spans":2430,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":1358,"spans":2432,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":2434,"spans":2435,"direction":112},"For more info: www.evri.com\u002Fnews-and-corporate  ",[2436],{"start":277,"end":278,"type":279,"data":2437},{"link_type":281,"url":282,"target":283},{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":2439,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":2441,"spans":2442,"direction":112},"About Zebra Technologies",[2443],{"start":32,"end":1075,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":2445,"spans":2446,"direction":112},"Zebra provides the foundation for intelligent operations with an award-winning portfolio of connected frontline, asset visibility and automation solutions powered by AI. Organisations globally across retail, manufacturing, transportation, logistics, healthcare, and other industries rely on us to deliver outcomes today while driving innovation for what’s next. Together with our partners, we create new ways of working that improve productivity and empower organisations to be better every day. Learn more at www.zebra.com.",[2447,2450],{"start":2448,"end":2449,"type":163},494,496,{"start":2451,"end":2452,"type":279,"data":2453},510,523,{"link_type":281,"url":2454,"target":283},"press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.zebra.com\u002F",{"id":2456,"uid":2457,"url":2458,"type":50,"href":2459,"tags":2460,"first_publication_date":2461,"last_publication_date":2462,"slugs":2463,"linked_documents":2464,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":2465,"data":2466},"aSQurxAAAByv0U-Y","evri-leads-accessibility-change-with-160k-raised-for-scope","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-leads-accessibility-change-with-160k-raised-for-scope","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22aSQurxAAAByv0U-Y%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2025-11-24T12:00:07+0000","2026-04-10T10:23:27+0000",[2457],[],[],{"title":2467,"category":8,"metaDescription":2468,"canonical":2469,"titleTag":2470,"featuredImage":2471,"publishedDate":2481,"slices":2482},"Evri leads accessibility change with £160k raised for Scope","Read Evri's Social Impact Report here","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-leads-accessibility-change-with-160k-raised-for-scope","Evri Leads Accessibility Change with £160k Raised for Scope",{"dimensions":2472,"alt":2473,"copyright":8,"url":2474,"id":2475,"edit":2476,"thumbnail":2477},{"width":65,"height":865},"A customer sitting in a wheelchair is outside their front door smiling as the courier hands a parcel to them.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XpOJbqstJ9-Waq_EVRI_LOCATION_01_0379.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6XpOJbqstJ9-Waq",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":2478,"alt":2473,"copyright":8,"url":2479,"id":2475,"edit":2480},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XpOJbqstJ9-Waq_EVRI_LOCATION_01_0379.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2025-11-24",[2483,2492,2561,2565,2573,2578],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":2484,"primary":2490,"id":2491,"slice_type":102,"slice_label":8},[2485],{"title":2486,"content":8,"pillEnabled":87,"link":2487,"dataGtmTrack":8},"Click here to read about Evri's accessibility journey",{"link_type":281,"key":2488,"url":2489},"45e0cd45-d4c1-4b15-b8bb-f17aefe76ca2","\u002Faccessibility",{"sectionTitle":2467,"sectionDescription":8,"pillEnabled":87,"showPaddingTop":87},"feature_link_cards$14bc9337-7b70-4a22-8cc4-2efb54bf013d",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":2493,"primary":2495,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[2494],{},{"content":2496},[2497,2502,2507,2511,2515,2518,2521,2524,2527,2530,2533,2536,2539,2542,2545,2548,2551,2554,2556],{"type":109,"text":2498,"spans":2499,"direction":112},"£160,494 raised in first year of accessibility partnership",[2500],{"start":32,"end":2501,"type":163},58,{"type":109,"text":2503,"spans":2504,"direction":112},"Doorstep preferences set for 90,000 customers with accessibility needs",[2505],{"start":32,"end":2506,"type":163},70,{"type":109,"text":2508,"spans":2509,"direction":112},"Piloted a donation scheme enabling consumers to donate items via Evri’s network",[2510],{"start":32,"end":1780,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":2512,"spans":2513,"direction":112},"24th November 2025 Evri, the UK’s premier parcel delivery company, is redefining accessibility in logistics and has marked the first anniversary of its strategic partnership with disability equality charity Scope, by surpassing its fundraising target and publishing its inaugural Social Impact Report, underscoring its ambition to become the UK’s most accessible delivery company.",[2514],{"start":32,"end":2233,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":2516,"spans":2517,"direction":112},"The report highlights Evri’s bold ambition and showcases key achievements from the past 12 months as Evri’s brand momentum has also been recognised externally by Citizens Advice in its annual parcels league table, which highlighted Evri as the only parcel carrier to have a positive upward trajectory since the league table began in 2021.",[],{"type":126,"text":2519,"spans":2520,"direction":112},"Evri is continuing its thrust towards becoming the most accessible parcel delivery company by committing to further fundraising in its second year of partnership, whilst also showing meaningful progress in other areas including being one of only two firms to have improved their Citizens Advice customer service score over the last three years. Evri has also been named among the Top 10 Most Improved Brands in the UK by YouGov’s Brand Index, reflecting rising consumer trust and satisfaction.",[],{"type":126,"text":2522,"spans":2523,"direction":112},"Since launching the partnership at Evri’s 50th anniversary gala, the company has raised over £160,494, exceeding its initial goal of £125,000 for year one. Over the last year, Evri has:",[],{"type":109,"text":2525,"spans":2526,"direction":112},"Raised more than ever before through activities ranging from painting plant pots, climbing mountains to holding bake sales.",[],{"type":109,"text":2528,"spans":2529,"direction":112},"Launched doorstep accessibility preferences which has enabled more than 90,000 customers to select doorstep options and give their courier instructions for a successful and comfortable delivery. This can be done within the Evri App by following these instructions: Step 1: Click ‘more’, ‘preferences’, then ‘accessibility instructions’ Step 2: Select one of three options; give me more time to get to the door, ring my doorbell instead of knocking or don’t block my doorway with a parcel. Step 3: Click ‘save’",[],{"type":109,"text":2531,"spans":2532,"direction":112},"Commissioned a full digital accessibility audit and integrated the AccessiBe widget on Evri.com, the widget has around 500,000 users per month and offers a number of profiles which automatically make suggested adjustments, such as a seizure safe profile to pause all animation.",[],{"type":109,"text":2534,"spans":2535,"direction":112},"Supported Scope’s flagship campaigns including its carol concert, the Scope Awards and Disability Pride Month.",[],{"type":109,"text":2537,"spans":2538,"direction":112},"Driven awareness of Scope on Evri’s electric fleet, ParcelShop device screens, website and more.",[],{"type":109,"text":2540,"spans":2541,"direction":112},"Established the Evri Body Collective, a quarterly listening session, and conducted a colleague insight survey, to gain a deeper understanding from people with lived experience of disability.",[],{"type":109,"text":2543,"spans":2544,"direction":112},"Reviewed policies to ensure best practice, with a planned roll out of accessibility training for colleagues. Evri has also refreshed brand guidelines, adding new colours to its palette to increase colour contrast, and launched accessibility guidance for ParcelShops.",[],{"type":109,"text":2546,"spans":2547,"direction":112},"Piloted a first of its kind donation scheme for Scope in September and October enabling consumers to donate items via Evri’s network for free, by dropping off items at any of Evri’s 10,000+ ParcelShops or Lockers with Evri delivering directly into Scope charity shops. Items from the campaign sold in the first few weeks have already raised more than £1,200 for Scope and the campaign also helped increase awareness of Scope, reaching 81 million people through media.",[],{"type":126,"text":2549,"spans":2550,"direction":112},"The volume of parcels sent via the donation scheme also contributed towards Evri’s continued increase in parcel volume. Earlier this month, Evri announced record half-year results reporting a 12% increase in parcel volumes.",[],{"type":126,"text":2552,"spans":2553,"direction":112},"Funds generated by sales of the donated items help Scope to support disabled people and their families.  There are 16 million disabled people in the UK and Scope’s free helpline is a lifeline giving guidance, advice and emotional support.  With the average call costing £15, every donation helps.",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":2555,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":2557,"spans":2558,"direction":112},"Evri's full Social Impact Report is available on its accessibility page here: www.evri.com\u002Faccessibility",[2559],{"start":32,"end":2560,"type":163},104,{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":2562,"primary":2563,"id":148,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":2564,"quoteSource":147},"Together with Scope, we’re building a delivery experience that works for everyone; our colleagues, couriers, customers and clients. Every parcel, every person, every place.\nOur own research shows that one in four people rely on home deliveries to maintain their independence or improve their quality of life.  That’s why we set a bold ambition a year ago that we aim to become the most accessible parcel delivery company.\nI’m incredibly proud of the achievements of the last year, from launching accessibility preferences to supporting Scope’s campaigns and initiatives. These steps bring us closer to our ambition.\nOver the next few years and beyond, we’re dedicated to ensuring Evri better serves our communities and is an amazing place to work for all. We aim to make a positive impact on the lives of people with a condition or impairment and help create a more inclusive and equitable society.",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":2566,"primary":2567,"id":2572,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":2568},[2569],{"type":126,"text":2570,"spans":2571,"direction":112},".",[],"rich_text$aafb7537-fd40-49f0-a815-32b743f3f490",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":2574,"primary":2575,"id":2415,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":2576,"quoteSource":2577},"Evri's dedication to becoming the UK's most accessible delivery service aligns perfectly with Scope's mission for disability equality. This partnership exemplifies the transformative impact that can be achieved when business and charity unite around a shared purpose, breaking down barriers and creating inclusive opportunities.\nOur collaboration with Evri is a testament to the power of strategic partnerships. Together, we are demonstrating how accessibility and innovation can drive lasting change, making the world a fairer place for disabled people.\nEvri's commitment to accessibility shines through in this partnership. By working together, we are showing how businesses and charities can create lasting change when they share the same values, inspiring more organisations to follow our lead.","Mark Hodgkinson, CEO at Scope",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":2579,"primary":2580,"id":284,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":2581},[2582,2584,2587,2589,2591,2593,2595],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":2583,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":696,"spans":2585,"direction":112},[2586],{"start":32,"end":699,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":568,"spans":2588,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":571,"spans":2590,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":574,"spans":2592,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":1358,"spans":2594,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":2434,"spans":2596,"direction":112},[2597],{"start":277,"end":278,"type":279,"data":2598},{"link_type":281,"url":282,"target":283},{"id":2600,"uid":2601,"url":2602,"type":50,"href":2603,"tags":2604,"first_publication_date":2605,"last_publication_date":2606,"slugs":2607,"linked_documents":2609,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":2610,"data":2611},"aR17ahAAACQAx4c2","evri-reports-record-half-year-performance","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-reports-record-half-year-performance","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22aR17ahAAACQAx4c2%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2025-11-19T13:00:21+0000","2025-11-20T15:00:52+0000",[2608],"strong-wardrobe-to-wallet-marketplace-trading-drives-record-half-year-performance-for-evri",[],[],{"title":2612,"category":8,"metaDescription":2613,"canonical":2614,"titleTag":2615,"featuredImage":2616,"publishedDate":2626,"slices":2627},"Strong ‘wardrobe to wallet’ marketplace trading drives record half-year performance for Evri","Read here about Evri's record half-year performance","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fmarketplace-trading-drives-record-performance-evri","Evri reports record half-year performance | Evri",{"dimensions":2617,"alt":2618,"copyright":8,"url":2619,"id":2620,"edit":2621,"thumbnail":2622},{"width":65,"height":865},"Man packs parcels on his living room floor","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaR2ACWGnmrmGqA5Z_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5349.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","aR2ACWGnmrmGqA5Z",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":2623,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":2624,"id":2620,"edit":2625},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaR2ACWGnmrmGqA5Z_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5349.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2025-11-19",[2628,2634,2668,2672,2692],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":2629,"primary":2633,"id":2491,"slice_type":102,"slice_label":8},[2630],{"title":2631,"content":8,"pillEnabled":87,"link":2632,"dataGtmTrack":8},"Click here to read about Evri's annual reports",{"link_type":281,"key":2488,"url":97},{"sectionTitle":8,"sectionDescription":8,"pillEnabled":87,"showPaddingTop":87},{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":2635,"primary":2637,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[2636],{},{"content":2638},[2639,2642,2645,2648,2651,2654,2657,2666],{"type":126,"text":2640,"spans":2641,"direction":112},"Evri, the UK’s leading parcel delivery company, today announced record half-year results reporting a 12% increase in parcel volumes and a strong rise in profit, as buoyant online marketplace trading and investment in its operations boosted retail sales.",[],{"type":126,"text":2643,"spans":2644,"direction":112},"Parcel volumes rose by 47m to 425m with profit (adjusted EBITDA*) rising 22% to £209m for the 26 weeks ended 30 August 2025.",[],{"type":126,"text":2646,"spans":2647,"direction":112},"The company’s continued investment in infrastructure, technology, and customer experience has supported its growth trajectory, with new business wins across key sectors and sustained demand from existing clients. Revenue also increased by 12% to £973m over the period, partly driven by marketplaces and pre-loved sites, as customers continue to make money from their own and others’ wardrobes.",[],{"type":126,"text":2649,"spans":2650,"direction":112},"Marketplaces have become a ”super retail channel” driven by consumer demand for second-hand bargains and an appetite for households to cash in on unwanted items.",[],{"type":126,"text":2652,"spans":2653,"direction":112},"In the half year, Evri also won significant new business from small and medium enterprises (SMEs) with volumes up 56% and retained several of its largest clients.",[],{"type":126,"text":2655,"spans":2656,"direction":112},"Operational performance and on-time delivery rates remained strong with 5,000 couriers recruited during the summer months with volumes exceeding 18m during many weeks and the August Bank holiday being Evri’s busiest ever on record.",[],{"type":126,"text":2658,"spans":2659,"direction":112},"Evri’s brand momentum has also been recognised externally, with its improvements recognised today (19 November) by Citizens Advice in its annual parcels league table which highlighted Evri as the only parcel carrier to have a positive upward trajectory since the league table began in 2021. Evri, which ranks in joint third place alongside DPD, showed meaningful progress in customer service compared to the previous year, and is also one of only two parcel firms to have improved their customer service score over the last three years. Evri has also been named among the Top 10 Most Improved Brands in the UK by YouGov’s Brand Index, reflecting rising consumer trust and satisfaction.",[2660,2663],{"start":2661,"end":2662,"type":163},572,599,{"start":2664,"end":2665,"type":163},613,633,{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":2667,"direction":112},[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":2669,"primary":2670,"id":148,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":2671,"quoteSource":147},"These financial results reflect the strength of our strategy and the dedication of our colleagues and couriers. We’re delivering more parcels than ever, expanding our client base, and improving profitability – all while continuing to invest in the future of delivery. The merger with DHL eCommerce UK marks a major milestone, enabling us to offer even greater reach. While receiving independent recognition from Citizens Advice and YouGov for how we are transforming our customer experience is significant and a testament to our hard work.\nEvri’s performance sets a strong foundation for the second half of the year as it prepares for the key peak trading period. We have recruited 9,000 extra couriers and are investing over £30m to boost our operations and service.",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":2673,"primary":2674,"id":245,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":2675},[2676,2678,2680,2683,2686,2689],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":2677,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":2679,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":2681,"spans":2682,"direction":112},"The results come after Evri completed its merger with DHL eCommerce UK in October 2025, further strengthening its network capacity and service offering. The enlarged Evri Group will combine two highly complementary businesses – delivering over 1 billion parcels and 1 billion business letters annually – to create a one-stop solution for domestic and international parcel logistics.",[],{"type":126,"text":2684,"spans":2685,"direction":112},"Next year, DHL eCommerce UK will be rebranded to Evri Premium – a Network of DHL, and it will remain a separate network offering fast, time-sensitive deliveries with enhanced shipping security protection for high-value and large items.",[],{"type":126,"text":2687,"spans":2688,"direction":112},"In May 2025, Evri completed its first-ever acquisition of Coll-8, one of Ireland’s leading independent customs clearance and logistics specialists, to drive accelerated deliveries and returns for customers in the Republic of Ireland. Evri is also investing more than £50 million to launch an owned, in-house network of 10,000 smart lockers as part of its network expansion to support its continued growth.",[],{"type":126,"text":1333,"spans":2690,"direction":112},[2691],{"start":32,"end":819,"type":163},{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":2693,"primary":2694,"id":284,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":2695},[2696,2698,2701,2703,2705,2707,2709],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":2697,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":696,"spans":2699,"direction":112},[2700],{"start":32,"end":699,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":568,"spans":2702,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":571,"spans":2704,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":574,"spans":2706,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":1358,"spans":2708,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":2434,"spans":2710,"direction":112},[2711],{"start":277,"end":278,"type":279,"data":2712},{"link_type":281,"url":282,"target":283},{"id":2714,"uid":2715,"url":2716,"type":50,"href":2717,"tags":2718,"first_publication_date":2719,"last_publication_date":2719,"slugs":2720,"linked_documents":2721,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":2722,"data":2723},"aRWnOhEAACMAmj83","evri-reveals-uks-kindest-delivery-driver-ahead-of-world-kindness-day","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-reveals-uks-kindest-delivery-driver-ahead-of-world-kindness-day","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22aRWnOhEAACMAmj83%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2025-11-13T09:41:44+0000",[2715],[],[],{"title":2724,"category":8,"metaDescription":2725,"canonical":2726,"titleTag":2724,"featuredImage":2727,"publishedDate":2737,"slices":2738},"Evri reveals UK’s kindest delivery driver ahead of World Kindness Day","Read here about Evri's kindest courier","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-reveals-uks-kindest-delivery-driver-ahead-of-world-kindness-day",{"dimensions":2728,"alt":2729,"copyright":8,"url":2730,"id":2731,"edit":2732,"thumbnail":2733},{"width":65,"height":1242},"A photo of Evri courier, Michael McMullen, in uniform at an Evri depot","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaRWnc7pReVYa4a0T_MichaelMcMullen1.jpeg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,0,5712,4284&w=960&h=720","aRWnc7pReVYa4a0T",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":2734,"alt":2729,"copyright":8,"url":2735,"id":2731,"edit":2736},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaRWnc7pReVYa4a0T_MichaelMcMullen1.jpeg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,788,5712,2707&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":1251,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2025-11-13",[2739,2786],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":2740,"primary":2742,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[2741],{},{"content":2743},[2744,2750,2753,2756,2759,2762,2765,2768,2771,2774,2777,2780,2783],{"type":126,"text":2745,"spans":2746,"direction":112},"13th November 2025: Ahead of World Kindness Day on 13th November – a day to celebrate acts of kindness, compassion and goodwill, Evri, the UK’s premier parcel company has been searching for the UK’s kindest delivery driver. Evri has crunched the numbers and is celebrating one of its kindest couriers, Michael McMullen, who was rated ‘friendly’ by the customers he delivers to, more than 1,700 times so far in 2025 alone, making him one of the three top-rated independent couriers for friendliness, out of Evri’s 30,000 strong team of couriers. Evri’s couriers are rated on average 4.6\u002F5, and whilst Michael’s star rating exceeds the average, it's the number of ‘friendly’ ratings that makes him really stand out.",[2747,2748],{"start":32,"end":2234,"type":163},{"start":2749,"end":1797,"type":163},128,{"type":126,"text":2751,"spans":2752,"direction":112},"Michael has been delivering parcels for Evri for five years in seaside town Seaham, in County Durham and is a familiar face in his local community. He said: “I joined Evri because there’s good money to be made, if you give a good service. My regular customers make the job great, and they’re an important part of what keeps me doing what I do, alongside the flexibility and delivering in my local area – I’ll often bump into my regulars in the supermarket when I’m doing my weekly shop and it’s always nice to see a friendly face.”",[],{"type":126,"text":2754,"spans":2755,"direction":112},"Starting with just 30 parcels a day, Michael is now comfortably delivering 140 parcels a day – up to 200 at busier times. He attributes his high friendliness rating to going the extra mile, “I love doing the same round, that’s the way I really get to know my regulars. I read some of the comments they leave for me, and I think I’ve probably been rated most-friendly because I help my customers carry heavy boxes to exactly where they want them – whether that’s on a kitchen worktop or round the back. For some of the more elderly customers I deliver to, I know I’m the only face they might see that day, so I think it’s important even though we’re busy just to give them 5 minutes of our time. I think a smile to say good morning goes a long way too, and you just know that customers appreciate you going the extra mile.”",[],{"type":126,"text":2757,"spans":2758,"direction":112},"Kindness is a two-way street; Michael and Evri encourage customers to consider these simple ways to be kind to their local courier, especially during the busy parcel season:",[],{"type":1049,"text":2760,"spans":2761,"direction":112},"Make sure you’ve got a visible house number, and outside lights on especially if it’s dark when you’re expecting a parcel.",[],{"type":1049,"text":2763,"spans":2764,"direction":112},"Keep pets secure, whilst most love dogs, some four-legged friends can be a bit too enthusiastic that your parcel has arrived.",[],{"type":1049,"text":2766,"spans":2767,"direction":112},"Choose a safe place if you’re not going to be in, you can do it through the Evri app, or Michael says he doesn’t mind a handwritten note in the window if that’s what customers prefer.",[],{"type":126,"text":2769,"spans":2770,"direction":112},"Michael concluded, “To be honest, getting to know your courier is the best thing you can do, cause then they know exactly where to leave your parcel.”",[],{"type":126,"text":2772,"spans":2773,"direction":112},"Evri is proud to celebrate the everyday kindness shown by couriers like Michael who help make parcel delivery a more personal and positive experience. Evri has given Michael a shopping voucher to thank him for living the company’s values.",[],{"type":126,"text":2775,"spans":2776,"direction":112},"And for anyone interested in following in Michael’s footsteps, Evri is currently on the lookout for couriers to join the business, with roles available across County Durham.",[],{"type":126,"text":2778,"spans":2779,"direction":112},"In preparation for what is planned to be another record-breaking festive period, Evri is strengthening its workforce in the region with a mixture of full-time and flexible roles available.",[],{"type":126,"text":2781,"spans":2782,"direction":112},"Couriers can typically earn up to £18 an hour on average, while new recruits looking to join the parcel firm’s network are eligible to enjoy an enhanced benefits package, which includes a ‘welcome payment’ of up to £1000, alongside an additional ‘learning payment’ designed to support new couriers in their training.",[],{"type":126,"text":2784,"spans":2785,"direction":112},"For those looking to apply, visit www.evri.com\u002Fbeacourier for more details and all terms and conditions.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":2787,"primary":2788,"id":284,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":2789},[2790,2793,2796,2800,2803,2806,2809,2811,2813],{"type":126,"text":402,"spans":2791,"direction":112},[2792],{"start":32,"end":405,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":688,"spans":2794,"direction":112},[2795],{"start":32,"end":362,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":466,"spans":2797,"direction":112},[2798],{"start":469,"end":470,"type":279,"data":2799},{"link_type":281,"url":472,"target":283},{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":2801,"direction":112},[2802],{"start":32,"end":33,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":696,"spans":2804,"direction":112},[2805],{"start":32,"end":699,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":2807,"spans":2808,"direction":112},"Evri Group brings together Evri, DHL eCommerce UK – which in 2026 will be rebranded Evri Premium, a network of DHL - customs clearance and logistics specialist Coll-8 and business letters leader UK Mail, to create the UK’s premier parcel delivery company. The combined Evri Group will deliver more than 1 billion parcels and a further 1 billion business letters annually",[],{"type":126,"text":571,"spans":2810,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":980,"spans":2812,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":1358,"spans":2814,"direction":112},[],{"id":2816,"uid":2817,"url":2818,"type":50,"href":2819,"tags":2820,"first_publication_date":2821,"last_publication_date":2822,"slugs":2823,"linked_documents":2825,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":2826,"data":2827},"aRHLqBEAACEAlLwg","evri-announces-deadline-dates-christmas","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-announces-deadline-dates-christmas","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22aRHLqBEAACEAlLwg%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2025-11-10T11:36:28+0000","2025-11-10T11:37:31+0000",[2824],"evri-announces-deadline-for-sending-christmas-gifts",[],[],{"title":2828,"category":8,"metaDescription":2829,"canonical":2830,"titleTag":2828,"featuredImage":2831,"publishedDate":2841,"slices":2842},"Evri announces deadline for sending Christmas gifts","Read here about Evri's deadline dates for Christmas","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-announces-Christmas-sending-deadline",{"dimensions":2832,"alt":2833,"copyright":8,"url":2834,"id":2835,"edit":2836,"thumbnail":2837},{"width":65,"height":865},"Man sends parcels with Evri through one of their ParcelShops","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaRHNLbpReVYa4SVL_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2548.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","aRHNLbpReVYa4SVL",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":2838,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":2839,"id":2835,"edit":2840},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaRHNLbpReVYa4SVL_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2548.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2025-11-10",[2843,2918],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":2844,"primary":2846,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[2845],{},{"content":2847},[2848,2851,2856,2860,2864,2868,2870,2873,2876,2879,2886,2889,2892,2894,2898,2913,2916],{"type":126,"text":2849,"spans":2850,"direction":112},"It’s the most wonderful time of the year, and it’s coming fast! Evri has announced today the deadline for sending Christmas gifts, so for any customers planning to send a little Christmas magic to someone special this year, they can make sure their parcels are part of the festive fun. Evri is advising that customers should plan ahead to make sure their gifts sleigh their way on time by checking Evri’s last posting dates for Christmas 2025.",[],{"type":126,"text":2852,"spans":2853,"direction":112},"The posting deadlines for sending parcels in the UK are:",[2854],{"start":32,"end":2855,"type":163},56,{"type":109,"text":2857,"spans":2858,"direction":112},"Friday 19th December  – last day for courier collections",[2859],{"start":32,"end":1075,"type":163},{"type":109,"text":2861,"spans":2862,"direction":112},"Friday 19th December – send a parcel standard delivery from an Evri ParcelShop or Locker by 11am",[2863],{"start":32,"end":229,"type":163},{"type":109,"text":2865,"spans":2866,"direction":112},"Saturday 20th December – send a parcel next-day delivery from an Evri ParcelShop or Locker by 11am",[2867],{"start":32,"end":346,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":2869,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":2871,"spans":2872,"direction":112},"Sending a parcel with Evri couldn't be easier and there are three simple ways for customers to choose from. Courier collection, ParcelShop or Locker drop off.",[],{"type":126,"text":2874,"spans":2875,"direction":112},"Evri can collect parcels direct from a customer’s home with its door-to-door courier service and customers can choose when they’d  like Evri to collect it. Customers can also drop off their  Christmas gifts at any of Evri’s 10,000+ ParcelShops and Lockers, one of the largest pick up and drop off parcel networks in the UK.",[],{"type":126,"text":2877,"spans":2878,"direction":112},"Using one of our ParcelShops or Lockers is simple and convenient. Customers can book their parcel at evri.com and Evri will send them a QR code, they’ll need the code to print their label at one of the easy-to-use ParcelShop devices, then just hand the parcel over to a member of staff in store. If they’re using a 24\u002F7 locker, they can use the same QR code to print a label there and follow the on-screen instructions to pop it in the locker.",[],{"type":126,"text":2880,"spans":2881,"direction":112},"Customers can book online via evri.com or download our Evri app, available on the App Store and Google Play.",[2882],{"start":2883,"end":2884,"type":279,"data":2885},30,38,{"link_type":281,"url":348,"target":283},{"type":126,"text":2887,"spans":2888,"direction":112},"This follows the announcement that Evri has partnered with Asda to make its ParcelShop services available in 1,200 Asda stores by April 2026, with more than 300 stores already live, providing customers with even more choice of where to send, collect or return their parcels.",[],{"type":126,"text":2890,"spans":2891,"direction":112},"Evri has invested more than £36 million in its infrastructure, increasing the number of parcels it can handle every day, to 4.4 million, so consumers have a reliable delivery service they can trust this Christmas.",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":2893,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":2895,"spans":2896,"direction":112},"International - last posting dates for standard delivery",[2897],{"start":32,"end":2855,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":2899,"spans":2900,"direction":112},"Evri’s parcel network stretches far and wide to 220+ countries and territories across the world and the holiday season is no exception. For customers looking to send a gift abroad they’ll need the final posting dates for their target destination to make sure Evri can deliver on time. These are different for each country, so a list of most popular destinations is available here.",[2901,2906,2907,2912],{"start":2902,"end":2903,"type":279,"data":2904},161,179,{"link_type":281,"url":2905,"target":283},"press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fguides\u002Fsend-gifts-abroad",{"start":2902,"end":2903,"type":163},{"start":2908,"end":2909,"type":279,"data":2910},375,380,{"link_type":281,"url":2911,"target":283},"press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fnews\u002Flast-posting-dates-for-christmas-2025",{"start":2908,"end":2909,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":2914,"spans":2915,"direction":112},"Wishing gift givers across the country a season filled with joy, warmth, and wonderful deliveries - happy Christmas from everyone at Evri.",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":2917,"direction":112},[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":2919,"primary":2920,"id":284,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":2921},[2922,2925,2928,2932,2935,2938,2940,2942,2944],{"type":126,"text":402,"spans":2923,"direction":112},[2924],{"start":32,"end":405,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":688,"spans":2926,"direction":112},[2927],{"start":32,"end":362,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":466,"spans":2929,"direction":112},[2930],{"start":469,"end":470,"type":279,"data":2931},{"link_type":281,"url":472,"target":283},{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":2933,"direction":112},[2934],{"start":32,"end":33,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":696,"spans":2936,"direction":112},[2937],{"start":32,"end":699,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":2807,"spans":2939,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":571,"spans":2941,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":980,"spans":2943,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":1358,"spans":2945,"direction":112},[],{"id":2947,"uid":2948,"url":2949,"type":50,"href":2950,"tags":2951,"first_publication_date":2952,"last_publication_date":2953,"slugs":2954,"linked_documents":2956,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":2957,"data":2958},"aPn-LBAAACIAHmKy","evri-and-asda-launch-parcelshop-service","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-and-asda-launch-parcelshop-service","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22aPn-LBAAACIAHmKy%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2025-10-23T10:18:01+0000","2026-04-10T10:22:58+0000",[2955],"evri--asda-launch-parcelshop-service-in-asda-stores",[],[],{"title":2959,"category":8,"metaDescription":2960,"canonical":2961,"titleTag":2962,"featuredImage":2963,"publishedDate":2975,"slices":2976},"Evri & Asda launch ParcelShop service in Asda stores","Read here about Evri's partnership with Asda","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-and-asda-launch-parcelshop-service","Evri & Asda launch ParcelShop service in Asda stores | Evri",{"dimensions":2964,"alt":2966,"copyright":8,"url":2967,"id":2968,"edit":2969,"thumbnail":2970},{"width":65,"height":2965},1302,"Asda Express store with Evri ParcelShop services","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaPn-l7pReVYa3mLq_Evri-ParcelShop-1-.png?auto=format,compress&rect=0,0,2831,3840&w=960&h=1302","aPn-l7pReVYa3mLq",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":2971,"alt":2966,"copyright":8,"url":2972,"id":2968,"edit":2973},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaPn-l7pReVYa3mLq_Evri-ParcelShop-1-.png?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1249,2832,1342&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":2974,"zoom":33,"background":71},1249,"2025-10-23",[2977,3015,3021,3028,3034,3041],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":2978,"primary":2980,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[2979],{},{"content":2981},[2982,2985,2988,2991,2994,2997,3000,3003,3005,3013],{"type":126,"text":2983,"spans":2984,"direction":112},"Evri and Asda has today announced a new partnership that will see the rollout of ParcelShops in all Asda stores — marking a first for a UK supermarket.",[],{"type":126,"text":2986,"spans":2987,"direction":112},"The partnership will allow customers to collect and return parcels from thousands of different retailers, at their local Asda store, offering added convenience ahead of the busy festive period.",[],{"type":126,"text":2989,"spans":2990,"direction":112},"The service has recently launched in over 300 Asda locations, its Express convenience sites and some of its supermarkets and superstores.",[],{"type":126,"text":2992,"spans":2993,"direction":112},"It will eventually be rolled out to all 1,200 Asda stores across the UK by April next year.",[],{"type":126,"text":2995,"spans":2996,"direction":112},"The new service will make it even more convenient for customers to shop with Asda as they can pick up their groceries and collect parcels in one trip, reflecting Asda’s focus on offering a range of services under one roof.",[],{"type":126,"text":2998,"spans":2999,"direction":112},"With over 97% of urban consumers already within one mile of an Evri pick-up\u002Fdrop-off point, the expansion also highlights the growing popularity of out-of-home (OOH) delivery networks.",[],{"type":126,"text":3001,"spans":3002,"direction":112},"The announcement follows Evri’s £50 million investment, revealed in June 2025, to double its network of ParcelShops and Lockers to 25,000 locations by 2030.",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":3004,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":3006,"spans":3007,"direction":112},"You can find your nearest Evri ParcelShop by visiting: https:\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ffind-a-parcelshop.",[3008,3012],{"start":3009,"end":322,"type":279,"data":3010},55,{"link_type":281,"url":3011,"target":283},"press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ffind-a-parcelshop",{"start":3009,"end":322,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":3014,"direction":112},[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":3016,"primary":3017,"id":3020,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":3018,"quoteSource":3019},"This landmark agreement with fellow Leeds-based Asda strengthens our commitment to creating a delivery network fit for the modern UK shopper, directly giving them choice, convenience and control.\nWe are excited about the opportunities this new partnership will bring, helping to us further drive our ambition to expand our capabilities and deliver an even more comprehensive, cost-effective, and customer-focused service across the UK and beyond.","Martijn de Lange, CEO, Evri Group","quote$0e0b9f45-0dec-4a46-b945-beb927060458",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":3022,"primary":3023,"id":3027,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":3024},[3025],{"type":126,"text":2570,"spans":3026,"direction":112},[],"rich_text$e60b86cb-5c42-4964-999c-52fc7df18d97",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":3029,"primary":3030,"id":3033,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":3031,"quoteSource":3032},"One of the things that sets Asda apart is our unmatchable mix of services, so we’re delighted to be partnering with Evri to be able to launch a brand-new one just in time for the festive season.\nWe know how much our customers value convenience, and this service gives them the flexibility to collect or return an Evri parcel whether they’re popping in for a pint of milk in one of our Express stores or doing their big shop in one of our larger stores.","Chris Hall, Vice President, Logistics at Asda","quote$7c429c90-7065-48da-b7d0-ace58858dcf2",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":3035,"primary":3036,"id":3040,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":3037},[3038],{"type":126,"text":2570,"spans":3039,"direction":112},[],"rich_text$68e7902d-6351-4e52-bc56-1eaf828c0d19",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":3042,"primary":3043,"id":284,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":3044},[3045,3048,3051,3055,3058,3061,3063,3065,3067],{"type":126,"text":402,"spans":3046,"direction":112},[3047],{"start":32,"end":405,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":688,"spans":3049,"direction":112},[3050],{"start":32,"end":362,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":466,"spans":3052,"direction":112},[3053],{"start":469,"end":470,"type":279,"data":3054},{"link_type":281,"url":472,"target":283},{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":3056,"direction":112},[3057],{"start":32,"end":33,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":696,"spans":3059,"direction":112},[3060],{"start":32,"end":699,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":2807,"spans":3062,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":571,"spans":3064,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":980,"spans":3066,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":1358,"spans":3068,"direction":112},[],{"id":3070,"uid":3071,"url":3072,"type":50,"href":3073,"tags":3074,"first_publication_date":3075,"last_publication_date":3076,"slugs":3077,"linked_documents":3078,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":3079,"data":3080},"aNznZBMAACIAOzrz","introducing-the-evri-group-the-uks-premier-parcel-delivery-company","\u002Fpress\u002Fintroducing-the-evri-group-the-uks-premier-parcel-delivery-company","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22aNznZBMAACIAOzrz%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2025-10-01T15:04:49+0000","2025-10-01T15:18:18+0000",[3071],[],[],{"title":3081,"category":8,"metaDescription":3082,"canonical":3083,"titleTag":3084,"featuredImage":3085,"publishedDate":3096,"slices":3097},"Introducing the Evri Group: The UK’s Premier Parcel Delivery Company","Read here about the Evri Group: the UK’s Premier Parcel Delivery Company","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fintroducing-the-evri-group-the-uks-premier-parcel-delivery-company","Introducing the Evri Group: the UK’s Premier Parcel Delivery Company",{"dimensions":3086,"alt":3088,"copyright":8,"url":3089,"id":3090,"edit":3091,"thumbnail":3092},{"width":65,"height":3087},526,"A photo of Martijn de Lange, the CEO of Evri Group","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaNzol55xUNkB1Uzb_MartijndeLangeEvriGroup.png?auto=format,compress&rect=0,0,1759,964&w=960&h=526","aNzol55xUNkB1Uzb",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":3093,"alt":3088,"copyright":8,"url":3094,"id":3090,"edit":3095},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaNzol55xUNkB1Uzb_MartijndeLangeEvriGroup.png?auto=format,compress&rect=0,65,1759,834&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":629,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2025-10-01",[3098,3170],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":3099,"primary":3101,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[3100],{},{"content":3102},[3103,3108,3110,3113,3116,3119,3122,3125,3128,3131,3134,3137,3140,3143,3146,3149,3152,3155,3158,3161,3163],{"type":126,"text":3104,"spans":3105,"direction":112},"A message from Martijn de Lange, CEO Evri Group",[3106],{"start":32,"end":3107,"type":163},47,{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":3109,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":3111,"spans":3112,"direction":112},"On 1 October 2025, we officially completed our merger with DHL eCommerce UK.",[],{"type":126,"text":3114,"spans":3115,"direction":112},"This is a pivotal moment in our history as we bring together two highly complementary businesses to create the UK’s premier parcel delivery group.",[],{"type":126,"text":3117,"spans":3118,"direction":112},"The enlarged Evri Group brings exciting benefits, opportunities and choice for consumers, clients, suppliers and our people as we become a one-stop solution for domestic and international parcel logistics.",[],{"type":126,"text":3120,"spans":3121,"direction":112},"Bringing combined experience of over 60 years in logistics, Evri’s flexible, effective and unique self-employed courier proposition, will be enhanced with the addition of DHL eCommerce’s UK network. Next year, DHL eCommerce UK will be rebranded and go by the name Evri Premium – a Network of DHL, it will remain a separate network offering fast, time-sensitive deliveries with enhanced shipping security protection for high-value and large items.",[],{"type":126,"text":3123,"spans":3124,"direction":112},"The new Evri Group will include:",[],{"type":109,"text":3126,"spans":3127,"direction":112},"Evri’s core offer of a flexible courier network for low-weight and low-value parcels.",[],{"type":109,"text":3129,"spans":3130,"direction":112},"A dedicated and secure premium van network for high value items called Evri Premium.",[],{"type":109,"text":3132,"spans":3133,"direction":112},"Business-to-business (B2B) parcel services.",[],{"type":109,"text":3135,"spans":3136,"direction":112},"Unrivalled international capability and customs clearance expertise.",[],{"type":109,"text":3138,"spans":3139,"direction":112},"Fulfilment services to handle the behind-the-scenes process of storing products, packing them, shipping them, and making sure they arrive on time.",[],{"type":109,"text":3141,"spans":3142,"direction":112},"A best-in-class business mail service – UK Mail.",[],{"type":126,"text":3144,"spans":3145,"direction":112},"Our combined group will bring together a team of over 30,000 couriers and van drivers, 12,000 colleagues, with a fleet of 8,000 vehicles to deliver over 1 billion parcels and 1 billion letters annually.",[],{"type":126,"text":3147,"spans":3148,"direction":112},"Our incredible people will remain the driving force behind this UK success story, coming together to offer the best possible service and choice as we journey towards becoming the UK’s most competitive, customer-focused parcel carrier.",[],{"type":126,"text":3150,"spans":3151,"direction":112},"We are extremely excited for what the future holds.",[],{"type":126,"text":3153,"spans":3154,"direction":112},"Martijn de Lange",[],{"type":126,"text":3156,"spans":3157,"direction":112},"CEO",[],{"type":126,"text":3159,"spans":3160,"direction":112},"Evri Group",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":3162,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":3164,"spans":3165,"direction":112},"Watch the video here",[3166,3169],{"start":32,"end":2234,"type":279,"data":3167},{"link_type":281,"url":3168,"target":283},"press.html\u002F\u002Fvimeo.com\u002F1122801182\u002F0c6815b5dd",{"start":32,"end":2234,"type":163},{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":3171,"primary":3172,"id":284,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":3173},[3174,3177,3180,3184,3187,3190,3192,3194,3196],{"type":126,"text":402,"spans":3175,"direction":112},[3176],{"start":32,"end":405,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":688,"spans":3178,"direction":112},[3179],{"start":32,"end":362,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":466,"spans":3181,"direction":112},[3182],{"start":469,"end":470,"type":279,"data":3183},{"link_type":281,"url":472,"target":283},{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":3185,"direction":112},[3186],{"start":32,"end":33,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":696,"spans":3188,"direction":112},[3189],{"start":32,"end":699,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":2807,"spans":3191,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":571,"spans":3193,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":980,"spans":3195,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":1358,"spans":3197,"direction":112},[],{"id":3199,"uid":3200,"url":3201,"type":50,"href":3202,"tags":3203,"first_publication_date":3204,"last_publication_date":3205,"slugs":3206,"linked_documents":3207,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":3208,"data":3209},"aNahKRAAACkA2u5R","evri-accelerates-uk-network-transformation-with-36-million-investment-ahead-of-black-friday-peak","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-accelerates-uk-network-transformation-with-36-million-investment-ahead-of-black-friday-peak","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22aNahKRAAACkA2u5R%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2025-09-26T14:38:08+0000","2025-09-29T15:45:05+0000",[3200],[],[],{"title":3210,"category":8,"metaDescription":3211,"canonical":3212,"titleTag":3213,"featuredImage":3214,"publishedDate":3220,"slices":3221},"Evri accelerates UK network transformation with £36 million investment ahead of Black Friday peak","Read here about Evri acceleration of its UK network transformation with £36 million investment ahead of Black Friday peak  ","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-accelerates-uk-network-transformation-with-36-million-investment-ahead-of-black-friday-peak","Evri accelerates UK network transformation with £36 million investment ahead of Black Friday peak  ",{"dimensions":3215,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":490,"id":491,"edit":3216,"thumbnail":3217},{"width":65,"height":489},{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":3218,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":495,"id":491,"edit":3219},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":497,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2025-09-29",[3222,3281,3286],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":3223,"primary":3225,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[3224],{},{"content":3226},[3227,3232,3237,3242,3246,3249,3252,3255,3258,3264,3271,3274,3277,3279],{"type":109,"text":3228,"spans":3229,"direction":112},"£36 million strategic investment into Evri’s parcel network supporting service enhancements ",[3230],{"start":32,"end":3231,"type":163},91,{"type":109,"text":3233,"spans":3234,"direction":112},"Follows merger with DHL eCommerce UK, due to complete imminently ",[3235],{"start":32,"end":3236,"type":163},64,{"type":109,"text":3238,"spans":3239,"direction":112},"Record network capacity of 4.4 million parcels per day ",[3240],{"start":32,"end":3241,"type":163},54,{"type":126,"text":3243,"spans":3244,"direction":112},"29th September 2025: The newly formed Evri Group, one of the UK's largest dedicated parcel delivery companies, has today announced a strategic £36 million investment programme to bolster its operational parcel network in preparation for this year’s peak period. This latest investment builds on Evri’s commitment to delivering industry leading service, with close to 4 million 5* Trustpilot reviews and an average courier star rating of 4.7\u002F5,  while underpinning its rapid growth following its merger with DHL eCommerce UK, due to complete imminently.  ",[3245],{"start":32,"end":206,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":3247,"spans":3248,"direction":112},"Evri is investing heavily in its infrastructure, starting with an expansion to its superhub in Barnsley with the introduction of a new small item sorter – a £4 million investment - a crucial new piece of state-of-the-art equipment, enabling the hub to handle smaller items more efficiently and quickly - items which are typically imported from international markets.  ",[],{"type":126,"text":3250,"spans":3251,"direction":112},"Further upgrades are on-going at Barnsley as Evri plans ahead to increase capacity further with an additional third tier – an investment of £25 million - being built within the existing  structure, once compete the Barnsley hub alone will have the capacity to process 5.5 million parcels a day by Christmas 2026. ",[],{"type":126,"text":3253,"spans":3254,"direction":112},"As well as upgrading Evri’s super hub, there have been strategic depot moves in Avonmouth and Lutterworth and upgrades to Pen-Y-Bont, Southampton and Bury St-Edmunds to increase capacity within these depots. These improvements are in anticipation of another record-breaking peak, whilst improving our colleague experience with new facilities. Furthermore, Evri also announced a new depot in Belfast, serving as gateway to Europe as well as speeding up cross border shipping between NI and ROI. These represent an investment of around £7.5 million across all sites. ",[],{"type":126,"text":3256,"spans":3257,"direction":112},"Couriers are at the heart of Evri’s business and deliver more than 900 million parcels a year. To facilitate the additional volume, Evri will reach a total of more than 30,000 couriers for the festive season. As well as additional couriers there are 70 other new roles across the operation, created to support another successful peak.  ",[],{"type":126,"text":3259,"spans":3260,"direction":112},"This follows Evri’s announcement earlier this year of its £50 million investment into its ParcelShop and Locker network, increasing convenience for consumers. This further investment will boost the overall capacity of the network to 4.4 million parcels per day whilst ensuring a cost-effective and reliable service for clients and consumers.  ",[3261],{"start":3262,"end":3263,"type":163},341,342,{"type":126,"text":3265,"spans":3266,"direction":112},"Evri’s service improvements are supported by digital enhancements, such as Evri’s app. 2.7 million consumers use Evri’s app each month, representing a 17% year on year increase. The app is the number nine rated app in ‘Lifestyle’ on the iOS app store, with its popularity as a method to track and manage parcels enhancing the customer experience this Christmas. Consumers are being prompted to set their safe place preferences or accessibility needs, improving the information couriers have when delivering and driving an increase in first time delivery rates. Consumers without a safe place location, are now able to automatically divert all parcels to a ParcelShop or Locker.   ",[3267],{"start":3268,"end":3269,"type":279,"data":3270},237,250,{"link_type":281,"url":385,"target":283},{"type":126,"text":3272,"spans":3273,"direction":112},"This latest investment announcement closely follows what has been a milestone year in Evri’s 50-year history, with its recent acquisition of Coll-8, Ireland’s leading independent customs clearance and logistics specialists, as well as the merger with DHL eCommerce UK, due to complete imminently. Upon completion, the merged Evri and DHL ecommerce UK business will deliver over a billion parcels and a further one billion business letters annually, offering consumers and businesses greater choice and cost competitive solutions. ",[],{"type":126,"text":3275,"spans":3276,"direction":112},"The Evri Group will deliver over 1 billion parcels and a further 1 billion business letters annually and is poised to bring significant benefits to consumers and businesses by offering greater choice and cost competitive solutions. These ongoing investments are underpinned by Evri’s rapid growth - serving the majority of the UK’s biggest retail brands. Evri now delivers to over 220 locations worldwide, offering clients and consumers a fast, reliable and cost-effective global delivery solution.  ",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":3278,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":3280,"direction":112},[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":3282,"primary":3283,"id":148,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":3284,"quoteSource":3285},"Following a historic year for Evri, with our acquisition of Coll-8 in Ireland and our landmark merger with DHL, which is due to complete imminently, we continue to invest significantly in our operation to ensure we deliver the best possible service to our clients and customers, especially at the busiest time of the year for our industry. We’re on track to become the UK’s premier parcel delivery business and this investment supports our continued growth as we will deliver more than a billion parcels and a billion letters a year globally.","Martijn de Lange, CEO of Evri Group",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":3287,"primary":3288,"id":284,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":3289},[3290,3294,3296,3298,3301,3304,3307,3310,3313,3319,3321,3324],{"type":126,"text":3291,"spans":3292,"direction":112},"                                                Notes to Editors",[3293],{"start":32,"end":3236,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":3295,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":3297,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":3299,"spans":3300,"direction":112},"About Evri   ",[],{"type":126,"text":3302,"spans":3303,"direction":112},"Evri is on track to become the UK’s premier parcel delivery company for businesses and consumers alike. Following the merger with DHL eCommerce UK, due to complete imminently, the combined Evri business will deliver more than 1 billion parcels and a further 1 billion business letters annually.  ",[],{"type":126,"text":3305,"spans":3306,"direction":112},"The company – which currently delivers around 900 million parcels a year – has a mission to be the most convenient way to send, receive and return parcels, without costing the earth.   ",[],{"type":126,"text":3308,"spans":3309,"direction":112},"Working with Europe’s top retailers, marketplaces and pre-loved sites, the roots of Evri can be traced back to Yorkshire in 1974. The business has grown over the decades and now has a team of 8,000+ employees and 28,000 couriers, as well as a growing network of ParcelShops and Lockers and state-of-the-art hubs and depots.  Following its acquisition of Coll-8 in May 2025, an Irish independent customs clearance and logistics specialists, Evri continues to enhance its international capability.  ",[],{"type":126,"text":3311,"spans":3312,"direction":112},"Delivering c. 99% of parcels on time, Evri has more than 3 million independent 5-star Trustpilot reviews, an average courier rating of 4.7\u002F5, and a strong commitment to customer experience. ",[],{"type":126,"text":3314,"spans":3315,"direction":112},"For more info: www.evri.com\u002Fnews-and-corporate   ",[3316],{"start":277,"end":278,"type":279,"data":3317},{"link_type":281,"url":3318,"target":283},"press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fnews-and-corporate",{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":3320,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":3322,"spans":3323,"direction":112},"Media enquiries ",[],{"type":126,"text":3325,"spans":3326,"direction":112},"prteam@evri.com ",[3327],{"start":32,"end":277,"type":279,"data":3328},{"link_type":281,"url":472,"target":283},[3330,3503,3714,3830,3967,4139,4266,4395,4535,4673,4784,4959],{"id":3331,"uid":3332,"url":3333,"type":50,"href":3334,"tags":3335,"first_publication_date":3336,"last_publication_date":3337,"slugs":3338,"linked_documents":3339,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":3340,"data":3341},"aNT-JxMAACEA5B6H","evri-issues-urgent-warning-to-iphone-users-as-new-scam-emerges","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-issues-urgent-warning-to-iphone-users-as-new-scam-emerges","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22aNT-JxMAACEA5B6H%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2025-09-25T08:47:31+0000","2025-09-26T08:33:16+0000",[3332],[],[],{"title":3342,"category":8,"metaDescription":3343,"canonical":3344,"titleTag":3342,"featuredImage":3345,"publishedDate":3354,"slices":3355},"Evri issues urgent warning to iPhone users as new scam emerges ","Read here about Evri's warning to iPhone users","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-issues-urgent-warning-to-iphone-users-as-new-scam-emerges",{"dimensions":3346,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":3347,"id":3348,"edit":3349,"thumbnail":3350},{"width":65,"height":865},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaNUAmp5xUNkB1Fuh_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5604.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,0,960,640&w=960&h=640","aNUAmp5xUNkB1Fuh",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":3351,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":3352,"id":3348,"edit":3353},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaNUAmp5xUNkB1Fuh_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5604.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,93,960,455&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":322,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2025-09-24",[3356,3417,3422,3427,3433],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":3357,"primary":3359,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[3358],{},{"content":3360},[3361,3366,3370,3374,3378,3381,3384,3387,3390,3393,3396,3399,3402,3405,3408,3411,3414],{"type":126,"text":3362,"spans":3363,"direction":112},"·       iPhone users are being sent malicious profiles in targeted attacks by scammers",[3364],{"start":321,"end":3365,"type":163},86,{"type":126,"text":3367,"spans":3368,"direction":112},"·       Evri tracked a rise of 10% in phishing scams",[3369],{"start":321,"end":684,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":3371,"spans":3372,"direction":112},"·       In recent months Evri has taken down more than 18,000 malicious scam sites and fake social media profiles",[3373],{"start":321,"end":1272,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":3375,"spans":3376,"direction":112},"24th September 2025: Evri, one the UK's largest dedicated parcel delivery companies, is committed to protecting the privacy and security of its customers and took down more than 18,000 malicious scam sites and fake social media profiles in recent months with 73% removed within 48 hours.",[3377],{"start":32,"end":206,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":3379,"spans":3380,"direction":112},"However, delivery scam messages aren’t slowing down with an almost 10% increase reported last year. Evri today issues an urgent warning about a new scam targeting iPhone users and is reminding consumers how to stay safe and avoid delivery scams.",[],{"type":126,"text":3382,"spans":3383,"direction":112},"The warning and renewed guidance, which affects thousands of consumers across the UK each month, has been issued as the company warns that in one of the cyber criminals’ latest scams, they are attaching profiles to the phishing attempts in the hope that members of the public will click on the attachment. If downloaded, these profiles can be used to alter settings on the users’ iPhone without consumers being aware. They could redirect traffic, so it goes through the attacker’s computer, with personal data potentially being captured and examined, before going out to the internet. Or it could change other policies and security settings that a user has set on their phone without their knowledge. ",[],{"type":126,"text":3385,"spans":3386,"direction":112},"Additionally, Evri has identified further evidence of iPhone users being specifically targeted. Consumers are being prompted to copy and paste a malicious link into Safari, an app that isn't available on Android devices. Evri believes this demonstrates a new level of sophistication among cybercriminals, who appear to be moving away from generic, multi-platform phishing kits in favour of tailored attacks designed specifically for iPhone users.",[],{"type":126,"text":3388,"spans":3389,"direction":112},"Phishing is when criminals use scam emails and text messages to trick victims. The aim is often to make consumers visit a website, which may steal bank details or other personal information. They will often pretend to be an organisation you trust. These tactics can be very convincing and often use genuine-looking branding and messaging.",[],{"type":126,"text":3391,"spans":3392,"direction":112},"Evri works closely with a number of leading external cybersecurity partners such as Netcraft, BT, Clickatell, and the UK Government’s National Cyber Security Centre to identify delivery scams using Evri’s name and remove them as quickly as possible.",[],{"type":126,"text":3394,"spans":3395,"direction":112},"Evri is advising customers to be extra vigilant when shopping online and is issuing core advice on what to look out for which they’re calling the 3 Ls.",[],{"type":126,"text":3397,"spans":3398,"direction":112},"·       Language – poor language and badly written messages.",[],{"type":126,"text":3400,"spans":3401,"direction":112},"·       Lack of – Lack of a personal greeting, lack of personal information such as a tracking number of your delivery address.",[],{"type":126,"text":3403,"spans":3404,"direction":112},"·       Links – unusual links or buttons that urge customers to take action such as pay a re-delivery fee; this is something Evri will never charge for.",[],{"type":126,"text":3406,"spans":3407,"direction":112},"Consumers are being urged to report suspicious activity. Information on how to do that is available on Evri’s website: evri.com\u002Fcyber-security. All messages will be investigated with expert partners to take down associated fraudulent websites. Consumers should also report any other suspicious emails to report@phishing.gov.uk or forward suspicious text messages to 7726 free of charge.",[],{"type":126,"text":3409,"spans":3410,"direction":112},"If a consumer thinks they’ve been a victim of these scams they should:",[],{"type":126,"text":3412,"spans":3413,"direction":112},"·       Talk to their bank or card provider immediately",[],{"type":126,"text":3415,"spans":3416,"direction":112},"·       Report the scam to Action Fraud on 0300 123 2040",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":3418,"primary":3419,"id":148,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":3420,"quoteSource":3421},"Delivery scams continue to become more sophisticated, and as a business that puts its clients and customers first, we are committed to working proactively to tackle this. This latest scam clearly shows scammers continue to innovate and are now turning to targeting specific consumer groups and we’re urging people to stay vigilant and re-issuing important guidance, which will protect the public.","Lee Howard, Head Information Risk and Information Security, Evri",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":3423,"primary":3424,"id":3426,"slice_type":558,"slice_label":8},[],{"SectionHeader":8,"SectionText":3425},[],"section_component$0d8314e3-56fe-456b-ac0d-b4e5171eb53f",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":3428,"primary":3429,"id":3432,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":3430,"quoteSource":3431},"The reason our campaign is called ‘Stop! Think Fraud’ is precisely because of scams like this. What seems like an everyday message from a trusted delivery company is deliberately designed to catch us out.\n Every time you get a message on your phone, email or social media, stop and don’t let fraudsters win. Through our Plan for Change, this Government is ramping up efforts with a tougher, expanded Fraud Strategy to help working people protect every pound.","Lord Hanson, Minister for fraud","quote$aca37450-beb6-441e-9a10-b3924a7a7ac3",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":3434,"primary":3435,"id":284,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":3436},[3437,3442,3444,3448,3451,3457,3461,3464,3467,3470,3475,3478,3481,3484,3488,3491,3494,3497,3500],{"type":126,"text":3438,"spans":3439,"direction":112},"                                               Notes to Editors",[3440],{"start":32,"end":3441,"type":163},63,{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":3443,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":3445,"spans":3446,"direction":112},"Evri",[3447],{"start":32,"end":671,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":3449,"spans":3450,"direction":112},"Evri is one of the UK’s largest dedicated parcel delivery companies, delivering more than 800 million parcels a year. The company has a mission to be the most convenient way to send, receive and return parcels, without costing the earth. Evri works with most of Europe’s top retailers, marketplaces and pre-loved sites. The roots of Evri can be traced back to Yorkshire in 1974 but the business has grown over the decades and now has a team of 8,000+ employees, 25,000+ couriers, 10,000+ out of home locations and a growing network of state-of-the-art hubs and depots. Evri has more than 3 million independent 5-star Trustpilot reviews, on-time delivery rates which surpass 99%, an average courier rating of 4.7\u002F5, and a commitment to provide an answer for everyone following a significant investment in customer experience.",[],{"type":126,"text":3452,"spans":3453,"direction":112},"Media enquiries: prteam@evri.com",[3454],{"start":362,"end":3455,"type":279,"data":3456},32,{"link_type":281,"url":472,"target":283},{"type":126,"text":3458,"spans":3459,"direction":112},"How to spot scam messages:",[3460],{"start":32,"end":372,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":3462,"spans":3463,"direction":112},"·       Poor language: Look out for poorly written sentences with spelling and grammatical errors",[],{"type":126,"text":3465,"spans":3466,"direction":112},"·       Lack of a personal greeting: They may use 'Dear Customer' or ‘Dear [your email address]’ instead of using the name you use on your account (though criminals are getting better at personalising messages)",[],{"type":126,"text":3468,"spans":3469,"direction":112},"·       An unusual or vague email address: The email address will often be different from the usual email address you receive from that company, even just using a slight misspelling or different formatting. Evri will typically email from @evri.com and SMS messages from Evri will not show the sender as a mobile phone number, will never ask for payment or include any links other than evri.link",[],{"type":126,"text":3471,"spans":3472,"direction":112},"Evri works closely with a number of leading cybersecurity partners:",[3473],{"start":32,"end":3474,"type":163},67,{"type":126,"text":3476,"spans":3477,"direction":112},"·       Netcraft - the world's largest provider of takedowns and cybercrime disruption services, to take down scam websites either reported to them or identified themselves through their own intelligence.",[],{"type":126,"text":3479,"spans":3480,"direction":112},"·       Clickatell – the provider of Evri’s SMS SenderID, and responsible for the protection of this against fraudulent activity. [To note, the SenderID Protection Registry and other equivalent services (such as Clickatell) are dependent on mobile networks also complying to this to be fully successful.]",[],{"type":126,"text":3482,"spans":3483,"direction":112},"·       Evri has worked with the National Cyber Security Centre (part of GCHQ) to establish a forum across delivery companies where security\u002Fscams could be discussed and activities to reduce these attacks shared.",[],{"type":126,"text":3485,"spans":3486,"direction":112},"Data security:",[3487],{"start":32,"end":341,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":3489,"spans":3490,"direction":112}," Security of customer data is a top priority. We have robust policies and processes in place, including:",[],{"type":126,"text":3492,"spans":3493,"direction":112},"·       As we become aware of fake Evri websites or social media profiles we work with our partners to get them taken down",[],{"type":126,"text":3495,"spans":3496,"direction":112},"·       We conduct ongoing security testing against our systems that process customer data, in order to confirm your information remains secure",[],{"type":126,"text":3498,"spans":3499,"direction":112},"·       We also secure customers’ own Evri accounts by monitoring and blocking suspicious logon attempts",[],{"type":126,"text":3501,"spans":3502,"direction":112},"·       Internally we ensure only those Evri colleagues who need access to your data have it and we provide guidance and training to them to ensure they know how to handle it appropriately and in line with GDPR requirements. We understand and have defined legal bases for all of our processing activity",[],{"id":3504,"uid":3505,"url":3506,"type":50,"href":3507,"tags":3508,"first_publication_date":3509,"last_publication_date":3509,"slugs":3510,"linked_documents":3511,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":3512,"data":3513},"aMQlLxIAACEAP3DV","evri-targets-90000-donations-to-support-scope-as-research-finds-people-more-likely-to-donate-items-at-parcel-lockers","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-targets-90000-donations-to-support-scope-as-research-finds-people-more-likely-to-donate-items-at-parcel-lockers","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22aMQlLxIAACEAP3DV%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2025-09-14T08:29:25+0000",[3505],[],[],{"title":3514,"category":8,"metaDescription":3515,"canonical":3516,"titleTag":3514,"featuredImage":3517,"publishedDate":3528,"slices":3529},"Evri targets £90,000 donations to support Scope as research finds people more likely to donate items at parcel lockers","Read here about Evri's support of Scope's stock donation campaign","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-targets-90000-donations-to-support-scope-as-research-finds-people-more-likely-to-donate-items-at-parcel-lockers",{"dimensions":3518,"alt":3519,"copyright":8,"url":3520,"id":3521,"edit":3522,"thumbnail":3523},{"width":65,"height":65},"Evri and Scope partnership logo","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaL_ZyWGNHVfTO0gu_EV0006-EvrixScope-02.png?auto=format,compress&rect=0,0,1080,1080&w=960&h=960","aL_ZyWGNHVfTO0gu",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":3524,"alt":3519,"copyright":8,"url":3525,"id":3521,"edit":3526},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaL_ZyWGNHVfTO0gu_EV0006-EvrixScope-02.png?auto=format,compress&rect=0,284,1080,512&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":3527,"zoom":33,"background":71},284,"2025-09-15",[3530,3608,3613,3617,3622,3627,3633],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":3531,"primary":3533,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[3532],{},{"content":3534},[3535,3540,3545,3549,3554,3557,3560,3563,3565,3568,3571,3574,3577,3580,3583,3585,3588,3591,3594,3597,3599,3602,3605],{"type":109,"text":3536,"spans":3537,"direction":112},"People can now donate items to Scope by post – completely free of charge",[3538],{"start":32,"end":3539,"type":163},72,{"type":109,"text":3541,"spans":3542,"direction":112},"Donations accepted at over 10,000 Evri ParcelShops and Lockers",[3543],{"start":32,"end":3544,"type":163},62,{"type":109,"text":3546,"spans":3547,"direction":112},"46% of people more likely to donate to charity using parcel lockers",[3548],{"start":32,"end":3474,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":3550,"spans":3551,"direction":112},"Monday 15th September 2025 Evri, one of the UK’s largest dedicated parcel delivery companies is proud to support disability equality charity Scope’s donation drive. For the first time, Scope supporters can send donations via Evri’s network at no cost to themselves, or the charity.",[3552],{"start":32,"end":3553,"type":163},27,{"type":126,"text":3555,"spans":3556,"direction":112},"From 15th September 2025, Evri will fund the full cost of deliveries for two weeks, making it easier and more convenient than ever for people to contribute to Scope’s vital work. This initiative is part of Evri’s broader commitment to accessibility, following its three-year partnership with Scope announced in October 2024.",[],{"type":126,"text":3558,"spans":3559,"direction":112},"This September, Evri and Scope are encouraging people to donate just one good quality item – whether it’s something unworn, unsold online or a missed return. The organisations hope to generate around 6,000 parcels of postal donations which could raise around £90,000.",[],{"type":126,"text":3561,"spans":3562,"direction":112},"Expanding donation access through Evri’s 10,000+ drop-off locations – believed to be the UK’s largest charity drop-off network – will help maintain a steady flow of contributions.",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":3564,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":3566,"spans":3567,"direction":112},"Exclusive charity shop research by Evri and Scope shows there’s an appetite for people to donate to charity shops:",[],{"type":126,"text":3569,"spans":3570,"direction":112},"·       Nearly half, 47% (one in two) [1] of people said they would be more likely to donate if charity shops allowed you to drop off items at a parcel delivery locker.  ",[],{"type":126,"text":3572,"spans":3573,"direction":112},"·       A quarter of people, 24% (one in four) who donate to charity shops say they donate more now than they did five years ago [1]",[],{"type":126,"text":3575,"spans":3576,"direction":112},"Some of the main factors for not donating items include:",[],{"type":126,"text":3578,"spans":3579,"direction":112},"·       The nearest charity shop being too far away 17% (one in six). [1]",[],{"type":126,"text":3581,"spans":3582,"direction":112},"·       16% (one in six) say there are not enough donation points nearby and a further 12% (one in eight) say charity shop opening times don’t suit their hours [1]",[],{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":3584,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":3586,"spans":3587,"direction":112},"Donating is quick and easy:",[],{"type":126,"text":3589,"spans":3590,"direction":112},"1.            Visit Evri.com\u002FScope to create your free parcel label",[],{"type":126,"text":3592,"spans":3593,"direction":112},"2.           Package your item using Evri’s packaging guidance",[],{"type":126,"text":3595,"spans":3596,"direction":112},"3.           Print a label and drop off the parcel at any of Evri’s 10,000+ ParcelShops or Lockers",[],{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":3598,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":3600,"spans":3601,"direction":112},"Donated items will then be sorted by a team of Evri volunteers and sent on to Scope shops where they’ll be sold to raise funds to continue Scope’s vital work.",[],{"type":126,"text":3603,"spans":3604,"direction":112},"Donations help raise funds for Scope to support disabled people and their families.  There are 16 million disabled people in the UK and Scope’s free helpline is a lifeline giving guidance, advice and emotional support.  With the average call costing £15, every donation helps.",[],{"type":126,"text":3606,"spans":3607,"direction":112},"Evri’s partnership with Scope reflects its ambition to become the most accessible parcel delivery company in the UK. Since launching the partnership, Evri has already helped raise £150,000 for Scope and introduced accessibility preferences for consumers – such as requesting more time to get to the door.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":3609,"primary":3610,"id":148,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":3611,"quoteSource":3612},"We believe accessibility should be at the heart of everything we do – from how we deliver parcels to how we support our communities. We’re on a journey, and partnering with Scope allows us to make giving easier and more inclusive for everyone. Our recent research highlights that by removing barriers to donation, and using our ParcelShops and Lockers for good, we’re helping ensure that quality items reach the people and places where they can make the biggest difference.","Ros Hunt, Director of Ecommerce, Evri",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":3614,"primary":3615,"id":3426,"slice_type":558,"slice_label":8},[],{"SectionHeader":8,"SectionText":3616},[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":3618,"primary":3619,"id":3432,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":3620,"quoteSource":3621},"We’re delighted Evri has thrown their support behind our stock generation campaign.  With their vast network of drop off locations, it means so many more people now have the opportunity to donate at a time and location convenient to them, 24 hours a day. It also means their customers have an opportunity to help us create an equal future, with disabled people.\nIt’s great to donate. You’ll love the space you get back and you’ll be making a huge difference for disabled people. Life costs more for disabled people, who need an extra £1,095 each month on average, just to have the same standard of living as non-disabled households. Since the cost of living crisis began, many are finding themselves pushed to the brink and are contacting our free helpline for vital support and guidance.\nIf donating cash to a charity is a bit of a stretch for you, your pre-loved clothes can help raise money for a much-needed cause. If you spot something you’ve not worn in three years, maybe it’s time to donate it. One hit wonder styles tend not to make a comeback. The puffball tried hard and thankfully failed, so it’s highly unlikely you’ll ever wear it again but our customers love finding fancy dress items in our shops.","Debbie Boylen, Head of Retail at disability equality charity Scope",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":3623,"primary":3624,"id":3626,"slice_type":558,"slice_label":8},[],{"SectionHeader":8,"SectionText":3625},[],"section_component$73c0a117-fce3-46d4-be34-a90df14043e8",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":3628,"primary":3629,"id":3632,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":3630,"quoteSource":3631},"I have ADHD and Scope’s helpline was an absolute lifeline when I was struggling to understand the wording on the Disability Living Allowance (DLA) form. The helpline advisor was really kind, really lovely and very clear. The call helped me to understand what to include on the DLA form and also confirmed that I could receive both Carer’s Allowance and the carer element of Universal Credit. This was a huge help, as we have so many extra costs each month. \nAs a mother of a child who’s disabled, having somebody on the phone for advice while I've still got my eyes on my toddler is just so helpful. The advisor offered reassurance, clarity, and I knew I was being listened to. This was particularly valuable as I was dealing with complex and emotionally draining forms.   \nI’m so pleased Evri is supporting Scope this autumn helping to make donating so easy. The helpline is an essential service not just for me but for all disabled people. Every donation you give, will help people like me, get the expert advice, emotional support and the guidance they desperately need.","Scope helpline user, Shellie Warner is parent to Adonis, 2 ½, He has Down’s syndrome and Total Colonic Hirschsprung’s Disease. Previously had an ASD (hole in the heart) and this closed naturally. Shellie Warner said","quote$42c506d3-13e3-42ea-95aa-a613dd563976",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":3634,"primary":3635,"id":284,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":3636},[3637,3642,3645,3648,3650,3654,3657,3659,3662,3665,3668,3671,3674,3680,3687,3693,3699,3702,3707,3710,3712],{"type":126,"text":3638,"spans":3639,"direction":112},"                                                            -ENDS-",[3640],{"start":32,"end":3641,"type":163},66,{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":3643,"direction":112},[3644],{"start":32,"end":33,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":402,"spans":3646,"direction":112},[3647],{"start":32,"end":405,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":3649,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":3651,"spans":3652,"direction":112},"Source and references",[3653],{"start":32,"end":206,"type":163},{"type":109,"text":3655,"spans":3656,"direction":112},"[1] Opinium 15-19 August 2025. Weighted to be nationally representative. 2000 UK adults.",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":3658,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":251,"spans":3660,"direction":112},[3661],{"start":32,"end":254,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":3663,"spans":3664,"direction":112},"Evri is on track to become the UK’s premier parcel delivery company for businesses and consumers alike. Following the expected completion of its proposed merger with DHL eCommerce UK by the end of 2025 (subject to customary regulatory clearances), the combined Evri business will deliver more than 1 billion parcels and a further 1 billion business letters annually. ",[],{"type":126,"text":3666,"spans":3667,"direction":112},"The company – which currently delivers around 900 million parcels a year – has a mission to be the most convenient way to send, receive and return parcels, without costing the earth.  ",[],{"type":126,"text":3669,"spans":3670,"direction":112},"Working with Europe’s top retailers, marketplaces and pre-loved sites, the roots of Evri can be traced back to Yorkshire in 1974. The business has grown over the decades and now has a team of 8,000+ employees and 28,000 couriers, as well as a growing network of ParcelShops and Lockers and state-of-the-art hubs and depots.  Following its acquisition of Coll-8 in May 2025, an Irish independent customs clearance and logistics specialists, Evri continues to enhance its international capability. ",[],{"type":126,"text":3672,"spans":3673,"direction":112},"Delivering c. 99% of parcels on time, Evri has more than 3 million independent 5-star Trustpilot reviews, an average courier rating of 4.7\u002F5, and a strong commitment to customer experience.",[],{"type":109,"text":3675,"spans":3676,"direction":112},"Find out more at www.evri.com\u002Fscope",[3677],{"start":362,"end":1070,"type":279,"data":3678},{"link_type":281,"url":3679,"target":283},"press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fscope",{"type":109,"text":3681,"spans":3682,"direction":112},"Packaging guidance www.evri.com\u002Fsend\u002Fhow-to-wrap-a-parcel",[3683],{"start":2233,"end":3684,"type":279,"data":3685},57,{"link_type":281,"url":3686,"target":283},"press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fsend\u002Fhow-to-wrap-a-parcel",{"type":109,"text":3688,"spans":3689,"direction":112},"Drop off location finder www.evri.com\u002Ffind-a-parcelshop",[3690],{"start":346,"end":3009,"type":279,"data":3691},{"link_type":281,"url":3692,"target":283},"press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ffind-a-parcelshop",{"type":109,"text":3694,"spans":3695,"direction":112},"To contact Evri’s press office, please email prteam@evri.com",[3696],{"start":1128,"end":3697,"type":279,"data":3698},60,{"link_type":281,"url":472,"target":283},{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":3700,"direction":112},[3701],{"start":32,"end":33,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":3703,"spans":3704,"direction":112},"About Scope",[3705],{"start":32,"end":3706,"type":163},11,{"type":126,"text":3708,"spans":3709,"direction":112},"We are Scope. We campaign to transform attitudes to disability, tackle injustice and inspire action. We create opportunities and provide information and support that empowers.",[],{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":3711,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":3713,"direction":112},[],{"id":3715,"uid":3716,"url":3717,"type":50,"href":3718,"tags":3719,"first_publication_date":3720,"last_publication_date":3721,"slugs":3722,"linked_documents":3723,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":3724,"data":3725},"aLk2dhUAAC0AK_60","dhl-ecommerce-uk-and-evri-secure-unconditional-cma-approval","\u002Fpress\u002Fdhl-ecommerce-uk-and-evri-secure-unconditional-cma-approval","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22aLk2dhUAAC0AK_60%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2025-09-04T08:31:55+0000","2025-09-16T15:27:47+0000",[3716],[],[],{"title":3726,"category":8,"metaDescription":3727,"canonical":3728,"titleTag":3726,"featuredImage":3729,"publishedDate":3740,"slices":3741},"DHL eCommerce UK and Evri secure unconditional CMA approval","Read here about Evri's merger with DHL eCommerce UK","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fdhl-ecommerce-uk-and-evri-secure-unconditional-cma-approval",{"dimensions":3730,"alt":3731,"copyright":8,"url":3732,"id":3733,"edit":3734,"thumbnail":3735},{"width":65,"height":865},"Martijn De Lange, Chief Executive Officer, Evri, between two trailers.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaLk502GNHVfTOpB__MDL-DHL.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,0,8256,5504&w=960&h=640","aLk502GNHVfTOpB_",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":3736,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":3737,"id":3733,"edit":3738},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaLk502GNHVfTOpB__MDL-DHL.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,796,8256,3913&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":3739,"zoom":33,"background":71},796,"2025-09-04",[3742,3770,3775,3779,3784],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":3743,"primary":3745,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[3744],{},{"content":3746},[3747,3750,3753,3756,3758,3762,3764],{"type":126,"text":3748,"spans":3749,"direction":112},"  Merger of Evri and DHL eCommerce UK unconditionally cleared by the UK’s Competition and Markets Authority, with the transaction expected to complete promptly following receipt of all regulatory approvals",[],{"type":126,"text":3751,"spans":3752,"direction":112},"  The combined Evri Group will become the UK’s premier parcel and mail delivery business, enhancing choices for consumers and businesses",[],{"type":126,"text":3754,"spans":3755,"direction":112},"  DHL eCommerce UK will rebrand as Evri Premium in 2026, maintaining a separate network for fast, secure deliveries of high-value items",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":3757,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":3759,"spans":3760,"direction":112},"Bonn, London, September 4th , 2025: The UK’s Competition and Markets Authority (CMA) has today unconditionally approved the merger of Evri, one of the UK's largest dedicated parcel delivery companies, with DHL eCommerce UK, the e-commerce logistics specialist of DHL Group. This approval is a key milestone  to concluding and completing the deal, which is expected to take place promptly following receipt of all regulatory approvals.",[3761],{"start":32,"end":1070,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":3763,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":3765,"spans":3766,"direction":112},"The combined Evri Group will create the UK’s premier parcel and mail delivery business, offering a cost-effective solution for domestic and international parcel logistics and providing greater choice for consumers and businesses. In 2026, DHL eCommerce UK will be rebranded as Evri Premium – a network of DHL, and it will remain a separate network that offers fast, time-sensitive deliveries with enhanced shipping security protection for high-value and large items. The combined Group will bring together a team of over 30,000 couriers and van drivers, along with 12,000 colleagues, and a fleet of 8,000 vehicles, all dedicated to delivering over 1 billion parcels and 1 billion letters annually, with the addition of UK Mail.",[3767],{"start":3768,"end":3769,"type":1324},277,308,{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":3771,"primary":3772,"id":148,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":3773,"quoteSource":3774},"This is a pivotal moment and the biggest milestone in our 50 years as we create a premier parcel delivery business of significant scale. I am excited to welcome our new DHL colleagues who share our commitment to great customer service.\n\nThis new combined Evri Group brings exciting benefits for consumers, businesses and suppliers. Evri’s strong brand and flexible, cost-effective and unique courier proposition, will be enhanced with the addition of DHL eCommerce’s UK network. Through access to  DHL’s well-recognised global network, the new Evri Group will offer an enhanced international capability and we will enter the UK mail space for the first-time ever to operate business mail services.\n\nThis deal will accelerate our growth strategy and cements our position as a disruptor within the parcel delivery sector.","Martijn De Lange, Chief Executive Officer, Evri",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":3776,"primary":3777,"id":3426,"slice_type":558,"slice_label":8},[],{"SectionHeader":8,"SectionText":3778},[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":3780,"primary":3781,"id":3432,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":3782,"quoteSource":3783},"We are delighted that this strategic transaction  has been officially approved by the UK Competition and Markets Authority. CMA clearance marks a significant step forward in our commitment to providing the best service and innovative solutions in the UK parcel delivery market. Together, we want to reshape the landscape of logistics, offering our customers a seamless and secure experience and meeting their evolving needs in a fast-paced world.\nThe new Evri Group will include Evri’s core offering of a flexible courier network for low-weight and low-value parcels, along with a dedicated and secure premium van network for high-value items and B2B parcel services. It will leverage DHL eCommerce’s expertise in cross-border parcel shipping and out-of-home network of more than 150, 000 global access points.","Pablo Ciano, CEO of DHL eCommerce at DHL Group",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":3785,"primary":3786,"id":284,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":3787},[3788,3791,3794,3797,3799,3803,3805,3809,3811,3814,3817,3819,3822,3824,3828],{"type":126,"text":3638,"spans":3789,"direction":112},[3790],{"start":32,"end":3641,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":3792,"direction":112},[3793],{"start":32,"end":33,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":402,"spans":3795,"direction":112},[3796],{"start":32,"end":405,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":3798,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":3800,"spans":3801,"direction":112},"DHL – The logistics company for the world",[3802],{"start":32,"end":903,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":3804,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":3806,"spans":3807,"direction":112},"DHL is the leading global brand in the logistics industry. Our DHL divisions offer an unrivalled portfolio of logistics services ranging from national and international parcel delivery, e-commerce shipping and fulfillment solutions, international express, road, air and ocean transport to industrial supply chain management. With approximately 400,000 employees in more than 220 countries and territories worldwide, DHL connects people and businesses securely and reliably, enabling global sustainable trade flows. With specialized solutions for growth markets and industries including technology, life sciences and healthcare, engineering, manufacturing & energy, auto-mobility and retail, DHL is decisively positioned as “The logistics company for the world”.",[3808],{"start":32,"end":903,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":3810,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":3812,"spans":3813,"direction":112},"DHL is part of DHL Group. The Group generated revenues of approximately 84.2 billion euros in 2024. With sustainable business practices and a commitment to society and the environment, the Group makes a positive contribution to the world. DHL Group aims to achieve net-zero emissions logistics by 2050.",[],{"type":126,"text":3815,"spans":3816,"direction":112},"Media enquiries: pressestelle@dhl.com",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":3818,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":3445,"spans":3820,"direction":112},[3821],{"start":32,"end":671,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":3449,"spans":3823,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":3452,"spans":3825,"direction":112},[3826],{"start":362,"end":3455,"type":279,"data":3827},{"link_type":281,"url":472,"target":283},{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":3829,"direction":112},[],{"id":3831,"uid":3832,"url":3833,"type":50,"href":3834,"tags":3835,"first_publication_date":3836,"last_publication_date":3836,"slugs":3837,"linked_documents":3839,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":3840,"data":3841},"aKROyxEAACQAt7hq","evri-trials-robot-dog","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-trials-robot-dog","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22aKROyxEAACQAt7hq%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2025-08-19T17:00:45+0000",[3838],"paws-itively-delivered-evri-delivers-first-parcels-in-leeds-by-robotic-dog",[],[],{"title":3842,"category":8,"metaDescription":3843,"canonical":3844,"titleTag":3845,"featuredImage":3846,"publishedDate":3858,"slices":3859},"Paws-itively delivered! Evri delivers first parcels in Leeds by robotic dog","Read here about Evri's robo-dog trial in Leeds","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002FEvri-delivers-first-parcels-Leeds-robotic dog","Evri delivers first parcels in Leeds by robotic dog | Evri",{"dimensions":3847,"alt":3849,"copyright":8,"url":3850,"id":3851,"edit":3852,"thumbnail":3853},{"width":65,"height":3848},1440,"Image showing Evri's robo-dog in action on a residential street","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaKSDI6Tt2nPbadvM_Image-95-.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,0,1701,2552&w=960&h=1440","aKSDI6Tt2nPbadvM",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":3854,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":3855,"id":3851,"edit":3856},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaKSDI6Tt2nPbadvM_Image-95-.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,873,1701,806&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":3857,"zoom":33,"background":71},873,"2025-08-19",[3860,3895,3900,3911,3916],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":3861,"primary":3863,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[3862],{},{"content":3864},[3865,3869,3873,3875,3878,3881,3884,3887],{"type":109,"text":3866,"spans":3867,"direction":112},"Launch of robotic dog delivery by Evri will be a UK industry-first",[3868],{"start":32,"end":3641,"type":163},{"type":109,"text":3870,"spans":3871,"direction":112},"Man’s best friend will be let off the lead to deliver paw in hand with Evri couriers in North Leeds",[3872],{"start":32,"end":1025,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":3874,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":3876,"spans":3877,"direction":112},"In a UK industry-first, the robotic version of man’s best friend will work in partnership with a courier to deliver parcels during a two week trial in North Leeds.",[],{"type":126,"text":3879,"spans":3880,"direction":112},"There’s no need to keep this dog on a lead – with sophisticated automation, the four-legged robot dog will be able to hop in and out of the courier’s van as it makes its way to and from homes delivering parcels and taking some of the leg work out for the courier.",[],{"type":126,"text":3882,"spans":3883,"direction":112},"Parcels will be loaded by the courier and gently placed from the dog’s ‘mouth’ at the destination. Powered by General Physical AI, the robot leverages simulation and real-world data to power the next-generation intelligence. Equipped with cameras, LiDAR, and advanced perception systems, it’s designed to navigate safely around obstacles such as pedestrians, cyclists or wheelie bins and it can stop instantly in emergencies.",[],{"type":126,"text":3885,"spans":3886,"direction":112},"The dog has gone through a rigorous training schedule and it’s trainers have developed algorithms and game-like training worlds that closely mimic reality to enable the dog to master mobility, manipulation, and autonomy tasks in just days.",[],{"type":126,"text":3888,"spans":3889,"direction":112},"Last year, Evri celebrated fifty years of deliveries with a nostalgic look back at how delivery and consumer habits have evolved over the past five decades. As part of a report, consumers were asked what they thought the future of delivery would look like; only 16% of respondents thought that robots would eventually be delivering their parcels but for some of our consumers, that future is about the be realised.",[3890],{"start":3891,"end":3892,"type":279,"data":3893},170,176,{"link_type":281,"url":3894,"target":283},"press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002F50",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":3896,"primary":3897,"id":148,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":3898,"quoteSource":3899},"Couriers always have and always will be the heart of our business. Robots will never replace them, but we are dedicated to finding new and innovative methods to support our couriers and increase the speed and convenience of the services we offer. \n\nIn this next stage of innovation, we are thrilled to introduce Milo the robotic delivery dog and we’re excited to see the trial get underway and see what we learn. We hope innovative ideas like this will complement our service offering and provide increased flexibility and choice for consumers.","Marcus Hunter, Chief Technology Officer at Evri",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":3901,"primary":3902,"id":245,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":3903},[3904,3906,3908],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":3905,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":3907,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":3909,"spans":3910,"direction":112},"The autonomous canine has been developed by RIVR, a Swiss global innovation leader in physical AI. In partnership with Evri, the focus of the trial is to gain insight into how the robot dogs can work with couriers to improve efficiency support with some of the more strenuous parts of the job. The robot dog will operate out of Morley for a two-week trial.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":3912,"primary":3913,"id":3432,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":3914,"quoteSource":3915},"This deployment marks a major milestone—not just for RIVR and Evri, but for the future of last-mile delivery in the UK. By bringing autonomous doorstep delivery robots into live operations, we're demonstrating how technology can ease the burden on couriers, enhance delivery efficiency, and raise the bar for customer experience. \n\nWe're proud to be launching this first-of-its-kind initiative with a partner as forward-thinking as Evri.","Marko Bjelonic, CEO of RIVR",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":3917,"primary":3918,"id":284,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":3919},[3920,3922,3924,3927,3930,3933,3936,3938,3941,3944,3947,3950,3952,3954,3956,3958,3963],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":3921,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":3923,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":3925,"spans":3926,"direction":112},"This is just one of several robot trials Evri is conducting as it looks to the future of parcel delivery, with the goal of providing support to couriers and developing solutions that will complement its delivery offering alongside couriers.",[],{"type":126,"text":3928,"spans":3929,"direction":112},"Plans are underway for a small and light EV robot, developed by Delivers AI, to be trialled in September for at least 3 months Residents in a chosen area of Barnsley  will have the option to have all their parcels delivered by these robots for the three-month trial. Residents will have the option to sign up for the trial via a dedicated website.",[],{"type":126,"text":3931,"spans":3932,"direction":112},"These robots can be deployed 24 hours a day, allowing for nighttime deliveries for consumers on different schedules, or more on-demand services with designated time slots for consumers. The robots can also be used to support consumers who need more time to get to the door. Evri expects to uncover unexpected benefits as part of the trial.",[],{"type":126,"text":3934,"spans":3935,"direction":112},"Evri aims to reach net zero by 2035, and these robots can support and further that ambition by facilitating more sustainable deliveries.",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":3937,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":1333,"spans":3939,"direction":112},[3940],{"start":32,"end":819,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":3942,"direction":112},[3943],{"start":32,"end":33,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":402,"spans":3945,"direction":112},[3946],{"start":32,"end":405,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":251,"spans":3948,"direction":112},[3949],{"start":32,"end":254,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":3663,"spans":3951,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":3666,"spans":3953,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":3669,"spans":3955,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":3672,"spans":3957,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":3959,"spans":3960,"direction":112},"For more info: www.evri.com\u002Fnews-and-corporate  ",[3961],{"start":277,"end":278,"type":279,"data":3962},{"link_type":281,"url":282,"target":283},{"type":126,"text":3452,"spans":3964,"direction":112},[3965],{"start":362,"end":3455,"type":279,"data":3966},{"link_type":281,"url":472,"target":283},{"id":3968,"uid":3969,"url":3970,"type":50,"href":3971,"tags":3972,"first_publication_date":3973,"last_publication_date":3974,"slugs":3975,"linked_documents":3977,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":3978,"data":3979},"aH-hexAAACYA8ewZ","evri-record-results","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-record-results","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22aH-hexAAACYA8ewZ%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2025-07-23T10:30:32+0000","2025-07-23T11:58:02+0000",[3976],"evri-delivers-record-results-and-parcel-volumes-after-increased-investment-in-service",[],[],{"title":3980,"category":8,"metaDescription":3981,"canonical":3982,"titleTag":3983,"featuredImage":3984,"publishedDate":3994,"slices":3995},"Evri delivers record results and parcel volumes after increased investment in service","Read here about Evri's record results and parcel volumes","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-delivers-record-results-and-parcel-volumes","Evri delivers record results and parcel volumes | Evri",{"dimensions":3985,"alt":3986,"copyright":8,"url":3987,"id":3988,"edit":3989,"thumbnail":3990},{"width":65,"height":865},"A smiling family of four stand outside their front door holding a parcel from Evri","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaH-mTlGsbswqTIu9_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7201.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","aH-mTlGsbswqTIu9",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":3991,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":3992,"id":3988,"edit":3993},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaH-mTlGsbswqTIu9_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7201.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2025-07-23",[3996,4002,4045,4049,4112],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":3997,"primary":4001,"id":2491,"slice_type":102,"slice_label":8},[3998],{"title":2631,"content":8,"pillEnabled":87,"link":3999,"dataGtmTrack":8},{"link_type":281,"key":2488,"url":4000},"press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fannual-reports",{"sectionTitle":8,"sectionDescription":8,"pillEnabled":87,"showPaddingTop":87},{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":4003,"primary":4005,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[4004],{},{"content":4006},[4007,4010,4013,4016,4019,4022,4025,4027,4030,4033,4036,4039,4042],{"type":109,"text":4008,"spans":4009,"direction":112},"Best-ever parcel volumes with 11% increase to over 807m in 2024-25; parcel numbers up 25% in the last two years ",[],{"type":109,"text":4011,"spans":4012,"direction":112},"Record adjusted EBITDA up 17% to £341m, on revenue higher by 12% to £1.85bn during the period that Evri was acquired by Apollo Funds",[],{"type":109,"text":4014,"spans":4015,"direction":112},"£57m investment in operations and technology to further improve service, as Evri rated one of the Top 10 most improved brands in 2024 by YouGov’s brand index ",[],{"type":109,"text":4017,"spans":4018,"direction":112},"Announced plans to be the most accessible parcel delivery company, including a landmark partnership with Scope and new accessible delivery options  ",[],{"type":109,"text":4020,"spans":4021,"direction":112},"Post-period end, announced proposed merger with DHL eCommerce to create a premier parcel delivery business – delivering over 1bn parcels and a further 1bn business letters ",[],{"type":109,"text":4023,"spans":4024,"direction":112},"Major announcements post period end: acquired Coll8, expanding Evri’s compelling service portfolio in the Republic of Ireland; and announced a £50m investment in doubling its network of ParcelShops and Lockers to 25,000 locations by 2030.",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":4026,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":4028,"spans":4029,"direction":112},"Evri Limited today announces it delivered record adjusted EBITDA and parcel volumes for the year to 1 March 2025, driven by a £57m operational investment to further improve service, broad-based growth across its divisions and new client wins.",[],{"type":126,"text":4031,"spans":4032,"direction":112},"One of the UK's largest dedicated parcel delivery companies, Evri outperformed the market to deliver record parcel volumes of more than 807m over the 52 weeks, up from c. 730m in 2023-24. This represents a 25% increase in parcel numbers in the last two years, putting Evri firmly on track to achieve its ambition to become the UK’s premier parcel delivery business, supported by strategic transactions post the period end. ",[],{"type":126,"text":4034,"spans":4035,"direction":112},"Evri’s growth in 2024-25 was supported by strong parcel volumes including across consumer-to-consumer marketplaces, such as eBay and Vinted, as the mega-trend in selling second-hand items online shows no sign of slowing down. New client wins saw the business diversify into new sectors including fresh food, car parts and floristry.",[],{"type":126,"text":4037,"spans":4038,"direction":112},"Its adjusted EBITDA increased by almost a fifth to £341m during the period when it was acquired by Apollo Funds, a leading global asset management firm, in August 2024.",[],{"type":126,"text":4040,"spans":4041,"direction":112},"In May 2025 Evri announced a proposed merger with DHL eCommerce UK. Evri then acquired Irish business, and EU logistics specialist, Coll-8 later that month – to expand its compelling retail-to-consumer service portfolio to offer greater choice and cost-competitive solutions for consumers and businesses. In June, Evri also announced an investment of £50m in cutting-edge lockers as part of plans to expand its network of ParcelShops and Lockers.",[],{"type":126,"text":4043,"spans":4044,"direction":112},"The company’s commitment to continuous innovation was demonstrated by it investing £57m in 2024-25, to enhance its operations and technology to further improve service levels.  During the year, Evri’s maintained its excellent 99% on-time delivery record, its Net Promoter Score rose by 2.4 points to + 64 and brand consideration rose against the market with Evri also rated one of the Top 10 most improved brands in 2024 by YouGov’s brand index.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":4046,"primary":4047,"id":148,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":4048,"quoteSource":147},"In what was a landmark 50th year for our business, we delivered record adjusted EBITDA and retail-to-consumer parcel volumes – driven by our best-ever peak, and growth across our divisions and new client wins. Apollo’s acquisition of Evri last year was testament to our success to date and, thanks to the dedication of our colleagues and couriers, we are well-positioned for next-generation delivery services.  \n\nOur unwavering commitment to improving the customer journey has kept pace with record growth with us almost doubling our multi-million pound investments into our operations and service in the last financial year.\n\nIt was a year that saw us expand our client base into new sectors, including fresh food, car parts and floristry, and grow our presence in existing ones. We continue to meet increased demand for customer-to-customer deliveries for online marketplaces, as buyer and seller behaviour changes – fuelled by scroll and spend social commerce sites such as TikTok’s shop.  Evri’s tech-enabled convenience is equipping a growing army of bedroom CEOs who are shaping the future of ecommerce.\n\nWe are also excited by Evri’s proposed merger with DHL eCommerce in the UK, and our acquisition of Coll-8, both announced in May, to put us firmly on track to become the UK’s premier parcel delivery group to serve both consumers and businesses. Furthermore, a planned £50 million investment announced in June will see us expand our network of ParcelShops and Lockers.",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":4050,"primary":4051,"id":245,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":4052},[4053,4055,4057,4060,4063,4066,4071,4076,4079,4082,4085,4088,4091,4094,4097,4100,4103,4106,4109],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":4054,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":4056,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":4058,"spans":4059,"direction":112},"Evri celebrated its 50th anniversary in 2024, reflecting how the business continues to evolve and adapt to the changing shopping habits of customers in the UK and overseas.  ",[],{"type":126,"text":4061,"spans":4062,"direction":112},"During the period, Evri nearly doubled investments in its operations, including the introduction of new depots in Tyneside, Pen-y-Bont and Sheffield. Sustainable initiatives also remained top of mind, as the firm rolled out 100 additional eCargo bikes with plans to reach 3,000 in the next decade. A total of 3 million Evri parcels are now delivered by bike or electric vehicles a year. Tech updates to Evri’s popular app also included enhanced parcel tracking features and range of new delivery preferences, in particular aid to those with accessibility needs. ",[],{"type":126,"text":4064,"spans":4065,"direction":112},"Evri’s strong performance in 2024-25 was powered by its team of 8,800 colleagues and 28,000 self-employed couriers. The company’s couriers are paid above the National Living Wage at an average of £20.86 per hour and since launching the \"self-employed plus\" (SE+) courier model in September 2019, Evri has led the industry in offering self-employed workers greater protection and benefits. ",[],{"type":126,"text":4067,"spans":4068,"direction":112},"Transformational transactions: ",[4069],{"start":32,"end":4070,"type":163},31,{"type":126,"text":4072,"spans":4073,"direction":112},"On 14 May 2025, Evri and DHL eCommerce, the e-commerce logistics specialist of DHL Group, announced a strategic transaction which proposes the merger of DHL eCommerce UK with Evri. As part of the transaction, DHL Group will acquire a significant minority stake in Evri. ",[4074],{"start":4075,"end":632,"type":163},153,{"type":126,"text":4077,"spans":4078,"direction":112},"If approved, the new enlarged Evri Group will include: ",[],{"type":109,"text":4080,"spans":4081,"direction":112},"Cost-effective and flexible courier network for next-day and standard deliveries for small and large items for retailers, businesses and consumers. ",[],{"type":109,"text":4083,"spans":4084,"direction":112},"A separate, dedicated and secure premium network for high-value and larger parcels for B2B and B2C deliveries. ",[],{"type":109,"text":4086,"spans":4087,"direction":112},"A comprehensive SME solution, which offers everything from mail, lightweight, larger, secure, B2B and international services. ",[],{"type":109,"text":4089,"spans":4090,"direction":112},"A network of over 10,000 ParcelShops and Lockers. ",[],{"type":109,"text":4092,"spans":4093,"direction":112},"The operation of a best-in-class mail service on behalf of businesses in the UK. ",[],{"type":126,"text":4095,"spans":4096,"direction":112},"On 21 May 2025, Evri also announced its acquisition of an Irish customs clearance and logistics specialist, Coll-8. It will: ",[],{"type":109,"text":4098,"spans":4099,"direction":112},"Strengthen its end-to-end delivery and clearance capabilities in the Republic of Ireland and wider EU.  ",[],{"type":109,"text":4101,"spans":4102,"direction":112},"Integrate Coll-8’s bespoke digital platform to reduce Evri’s delivery times from five to two days and speed up returns in the Republic of Ireland.  ",[],{"type":109,"text":4104,"spans":4105,"direction":112},"Leverage Coll-8’s 500-strong pick-up and drop-off network in the Republic of Ireland, providing a step-change in convenience for Irish customers, accelerating returns to UK retailers. ",[],{"type":109,"text":4107,"spans":4108,"direction":112},"Benefit retailers who can reclaim any duty through Coll-8’s automated process for returned items for taxes paid when goods are imported into Ireland. ",[],{"type":126,"text":1333,"spans":4110,"direction":112},[4111],{"start":32,"end":819,"type":163},{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":4113,"primary":4114,"id":284,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":4115},[4116,4120,4123,4126,4129,4132],{"type":126,"text":4117,"spans":4118,"direction":112},"Notes to Editors:",[4119],{"start":32,"end":362,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":696,"spans":4121,"direction":112},[4122],{"start":32,"end":699,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":4124,"spans":4125,"direction":112},"Evri is on track to become the UK’s premier parcel delivery company for businesses and consumers alike. Following the expected completion of its proposed merger with DHL eCommerce UK by the end of 2025 (subject to customary regulatory clearances), the combined Evri business will deliver more than 1 billion parcels and a further 1 billion business letters annually.",[],{"type":126,"text":4127,"spans":4128,"direction":112},"The company – which currently delivers around 900 million parcels a year – has a mission to be the most convenient way to send, receive and return parcels, without costing the earth.",[],{"type":126,"text":4130,"spans":4131,"direction":112},"Working with Europe’s top retailers, marketplaces and pre-loved sites, the roots of Evri can be traced back to Yorkshire in 1974. The business has grown over the decades and now has a team of 8,000+ employees and 28,000 couriers, as well as a growing network of ParcelShops and Lockers and state-of-the-art hubs and depots.  Following its acquisition of Coll-8 in May 2025, an Irish independent customs clearance and logistics specialists, Evri continues to enhance its international capability.",[],{"type":126,"text":4133,"spans":4134,"direction":112},"Delivering c. 99% of parcels on time, Evri has more than 3 million independent 5-star Trustpilot reviews, an average courier rating of 4.7\u002F5, and a strong commitment to customer experience. For more info: www.evri.com\u002Fnews-and-corporate ",[4135],{"start":4136,"end":4137,"type":279,"data":4138},205,236,{"link_type":281,"url":3318,"target":283},{"id":4140,"uid":4141,"url":4142,"type":50,"href":4143,"tags":4144,"first_publication_date":4145,"last_publication_date":4146,"slugs":4147,"linked_documents":4149,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":4150,"data":4151},"aHTdkhAAACQAuieV","evri-vinted-partnership","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-vinted-partnership","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22aHTdkhAAACQAuieV%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2025-07-14T10:45:00+0000","2025-07-15T10:10:40+0000",[4148],"evri-and-vinted-expand-partnership-as-pre-loved-shopping-boom-delivers-volume-boost",[],[],{"title":4152,"category":8,"metaDescription":4153,"canonical":4154,"titleTag":4155,"featuredImage":4156,"publishedDate":4169,"slices":4170},"Evri and Vinted expand partnership as pre-loved shopping boom delivers volume boost","Read here about Evri and Vinted partnership expansion","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-vinted-expand-partnership","Evri and Vinted expand partnership | Evri",{"dimensions":4157,"alt":4159,"copyright":8,"url":4160,"id":4161,"edit":4162,"thumbnail":4164},{"width":65,"height":4158},658,"A man uses an Evri device at a ParcelShop to send a parcel","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaHTeY0MqNJQqH1bc_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2000.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=2,0,7056,4836&w=960&h=658","aHTeY0MqNJQqH1bc",{"x":4163,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":71},2,{"dimensions":4165,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":4166,"id":4161,"edit":4167},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaHTeY0MqNJQqH1bc_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2000.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,745,7059,3346&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":4168,"zoom":33,"background":71},745,"2025-07-14",[4171,4191,4198,4204],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":4172,"primary":4173,"id":4190,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":4174},[4175,4178,4181,4184,4187],{"type":126,"text":4176,"spans":4177,"direction":112},"Evri, one of the UK’s largest dedicated parcel delivery companies, has expanded its long-term partnership with Vinted, the leading second-hand fashion marketplace in Europe and a go-to destination for all kinds of second-hand items, following a period of significant volume growth for both businesses.",[],{"type":126,"text":4179,"spans":4180,"direction":112},"Evri has been a key delivery partner for the Vinted marketplace since 2018, during which time both organisations have experienced remarkable growth, with parcel delivery volumes increasing by millions per year. This follows data released in Evri’s inaugural UK Ecommerce Pulse report, which in 2024 revealed that nearly 30 million UK adults shopped online for pre-loved items.",[],{"type":126,"text":4182,"spans":4183,"direction":112},"Signalling ongoing growth for Vinted, Evri and Vinted have signed a further 4-year contract. This extended partnership will see Vinted customers benefit from Evri’s growing network of ParcelShop and best-in-class dedicated locker locations, as the Evri business grows rapidly towards becoming the UK’s Premier Parcel Delivery Company with plans to deliver over 1 billion parcels and a further 1 billion business letters annually.",[],{"type":126,"text":4185,"spans":4186,"direction":112},"Evri and Vinted’s extension of their partnership follows three key strategic announcements by Evri: the proposed merger with DHL UK eCommerce, the acquisition of Coll-8, Ireland’s leading independent customs clearance and logistics specialist to supercharge its international capability and the launch of Evri’s new locker strategy which will see Evri invest £50 million in continuing to grow the largest network of ParcelShops and Lockers by 2030 - more than doubling its presence to 25,000 locations.",[],{"type":126,"text":4188,"spans":4189,"direction":112},"Over the summer, Evri will also become the first UK carrier to trial Vinted’s reusable packaging across a number of select locations in Evri’s ParcelShop network. At these trial locations, Vinted users can benefit from the convenience of picking up Vinted reusable packaging when dropping off items in select Evri ParcelShops.",[],"rich_text$e886ec11-f21b-479f-b9ec-547f9ba9e5de",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":4192,"primary":4194,"id":4197,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[4193],{},{"quoteText":4195,"quoteSource":4196},"We’ve been proud to partner with Vinted during what has been a transformative period of growth in pre-loved and ecommerce for both of our businesses.\nAs we embark on the next chapter of our partnership, we are pleased to continue to grow together with customers of Vinted benefiting from access to what we expect will become the UK’s largest network of ParcelShops and Lockers.\nFollowing an investment of £50 million over the next five years, we will grow our ParcelShop and locker presence to 25,000 locations by 2030. Our two businesses are perfectly placed to grow together as the pre-loved boom continues to drive increased demand for Vinted.","David Saenz, Chief Commercial Officer at Evri","quote$3427ca6b-895d-4c96-9bfa-cceca338bb5f",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":4199,"primary":4200,"id":4203,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":4201,"quoteSource":4202},"At Vinted, we want our members to benefit from the most convenient and efficient shipping options.\nExpanding our partnership with Evri ensures that our UK members can continue to use its growing delivery network and its exciting new locker proposition, making it even easier to buy and sell second-hand items.","Vytautas Atkoičaitis, Vice President of Vinted","quote$93508a64-5087-4e34-b121-c0dd3a86682c",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":4205,"primary":4206,"id":4265,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":4207},[4208,4210,4212,4215,4217,4221,4225,4231,4234,4236,4238,4241,4243,4247,4249,4253,4256,4259],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":4209,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":4211,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":668,"spans":4213,"direction":112},[4214],{"start":32,"end":671,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":4216,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":4218,"spans":4219,"direction":112},"Notes to editors",[4220],{"start":32,"end":405,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":3694,"spans":4222,"direction":112},[4223],{"start":1128,"end":3697,"type":279,"data":4224},{"link_type":281,"url":472,"target":283},{"type":126,"text":4226,"spans":4227,"direction":112},"Video and image available here: https:\u002F\u002Fphotos.app.goo.gl\u002FkBrkodwRkBb1U6eRA",[4228],{"start":3455,"end":1666,"type":279,"data":4229},{"link_type":281,"url":4230,"target":283},"press.html\u002F\u002Fphotos.app.goo.gl\u002FkBrkodwRkBb1U6eRA",{"type":126,"text":251,"spans":4232,"direction":112},[4233],{"start":32,"end":254,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":4124,"spans":4235,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":4127,"spans":4237,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":4239,"spans":4240,"direction":112},"Working with Europe’s top retailers, marketplaces and pre-loved sites, the roots of Evri can be traced back to Yorkshire in 1974. The business has grown over the decades and now has a team of 8,000+ employees and 28,000 couriers, as well as a growing network of Parcelshops and Lockers and state-of-the-art hubs and depots.  Following its acquisition of Coll-8 in May 2025, an Irish independent customs clearance and logistics specialists, Evri continues to enhance its international capability.",[],{"type":126,"text":3672,"spans":4242,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":1361,"spans":4244,"direction":112},[4245],{"start":277,"end":278,"type":279,"data":4246},{"link_type":281,"url":282,"target":283},{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":4248,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":4250,"spans":4251,"direction":112},"About Vinted",[4252],{"start":32,"end":699,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":4254,"spans":4255,"direction":112},"Vinted is the leading second-hand fashion marketplace in Europe and a go-to destination for all kinds of second-hand items, with a mission to make second-hand the first choice worldwide.",[],{"type":126,"text":4257,"spans":4258,"direction":112},"Vinted was founded in 2008 in Lithuania and in 2019 became the country’s first Unicorn. Today Vinted is still headquartered in Vilnius, with offices in Lithuania, Germany and the Netherlands, and over 2,000 employees. Its backers include Accel, EQT Growth, Insight Partners, Lightspeed Venture Partners, and Sprints",[],{"type":126,"text":4260,"spans":4261,"direction":112},"Find out more at https:\u002F\u002Fcompany.vinted.com\u002Fnewsroom",[4262],{"start":362,"end":684,"type":279,"data":4263},{"link_type":281,"url":4264,"target":283},"press.html\u002F\u002Fcompany.vinted.com\u002Fnewsroom","rich_text$3ed545fc-34c3-4688-8898-0c92b660baac",{"id":4267,"uid":4268,"url":4269,"type":50,"href":4270,"tags":4271,"first_publication_date":4272,"last_publication_date":4272,"slugs":4273,"linked_documents":4275,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":4276,"data":4277},"aGJEvxIAACMATdqv","evri-lockers-investment","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-lockers-investment","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22aGJEvxIAACMATdqv%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2025-06-30T08:16:32+0000",[4274],"evri-announces-50m-investment-in-cutting-edge-lockers-as-part-of-its-continued-growth-towards-offering-the-uks-premier-out-of-home-delivery-network",[],[],{"title":4278,"category":8,"metaDescription":4279,"canonical":4280,"titleTag":4281,"featuredImage":4282,"publishedDate":4294,"slices":4295},"Evri announces £50m investment in cutting edge lockers as part of its continued growth towards offering the UK’s premier Out of Home Delivery Network","Read here about Evri's £50m investment into its Out of Home Delivery Network","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002FEvri-investment-out-of-home","Evri announces £50m investment into Out of Home Delivery Network | Evri",{"dimensions":4283,"alt":4285,"copyright":8,"url":4286,"id":4287,"edit":4288,"thumbnail":4289},{"width":65,"height":4284},643,"Customer prints a postage label from a set of Evri lockers","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaGJFx3fc4bHWi1KB_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=3,0,8158,5464&w=960&h=643","aGJFx3fc4bHWi1KB",{"x":903,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":4290,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":4291,"id":4287,"edit":4292},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaGJFx3fc4bHWi1KB_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,797,8164,3869&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":4293,"zoom":33,"background":71},797,"2025-06-30",[4296,4330,4336,4361],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":4297,"primary":4298,"id":4190,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":4299},[4300,4304,4308,4313,4315,4318,4321,4324,4327],{"type":109,"text":4301,"spans":4302,"direction":112},"Evri will double its ‘pick up, drop off’ network of ParcelShops and Lockers to 25,000 locations by 2030, contributing to its strength as one of the UK’s leaders for out of home",[4303],{"start":32,"end":3892,"type":163},{"type":109,"text":4305,"spans":4306,"direction":112},"Long-term strategy to invest more than £50 million over next 5 years in 10,000 lockers",[4307],{"start":32,"end":3365,"type":163},{"type":109,"text":4309,"spans":4310,"direction":112},"Development of best in class lockers with new features including drop boxes and label printers that revolutionise the locker experience UK consumers have today",[4311],{"start":32,"end":4312,"type":163},159,{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":4314,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":4316,"spans":4317,"direction":112},"Evri, one of the UK’s largest dedicated parcel delivery companies, today [June 30] announces an ambitious plan to significantly grow its Out of Home network by 2030 – more than doubling its network of ParcelShops and lockers to 25,000.",[],{"type":126,"text":4319,"spans":4320,"direction":112},"The business has long been at the forefront of Out of Home delivery in the UK, including being the first to do next day delivery to its extensive network of independent shops, Post Offices and lockers. Evri’s innovation in Out of Home over the past decade has brought speed, convenience, cost savings and environmental benefits to the UK market.",[],{"type":126,"text":4322,"spans":4323,"direction":112},"To support this growth, Evri is investing more than £50 million to launch an owned, in-house network of smart lockers that bring dynamic new functionality to the consumer experience. Evri will roll out 10,000 lockers as part of its network expansion to support its continued growth with the UK’s leading retailers and marketplaces.",[],{"type":126,"text":4325,"spans":4326,"direction":112},"Evri currently has a network of more than 10,000 ParcelShops and lockers, which includes its flagship independent shop network, Post Office branches, corporate partners such as Co-op. Its partnerships and investment will more than double this by 2030, with Parcelshops and locker locations set to grow to 25,000 – hitting the 2,000 locker milestone before Christmas 2025.",[],{"type":126,"text":4328,"spans":4329,"direction":112},"The announcement follows a 500% year-on-year increase in locker usage*, a trend which is anticipated to continue.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":4331,"primary":4333,"id":4197,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[4332],{},{"quoteText":4334,"quoteSource":4335},"We are committed to offering greater delivery choices for the consumers, retail clients, and businesses that we serve. This major multi-million-pound investment will establish one of the UK’s largest pick up, drop off networks as part of our mission to become the UK’s premier parcel delivery business. Our expanding network of locations is shaping the future of parcel delivery in the UK with smart technology and greater accessibility.","Martijn de Lange, CEO of Evri",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":4337,"primary":4338,"id":4360,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":4339},[4340,4342,4345,4348,4356,4358],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":4341,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":4343,"spans":4344,"direction":112},"All lockers in the Evri network will have high-quality hardware with a label printer, drop box, parcel detection sensors, and will be accessible 24 hours a day, 7 days a week. Customers will benefit from a best-in-class user experience with the option for a completely contactless experience through geo-based Near Field Communication. Customers will also be able to see a pre-arrival capacity indicator to ensure there is space, before making a journey.",[],{"type":126,"text":4346,"spans":4347,"direction":112},"Evri also intends to continue the growth of its ParcelShop network of independent convenience stores, which offer a valuable service to their local communities. The firm’s latest move to invest further in Lockers will complement one of the most diverse parcel delivery networks in the UK with options to deliver to home, work, ParcelShops and Lockers, alongside ‘on the road’ diversions to a neighbour or safe place. Divert options ensure consumers have choice, convenience and control over their parcel, further enhancing the accessibility of parcel delivery.",[],{"type":126,"text":4349,"spans":4350,"direction":112},"Retailers will be able to offer Evri lockers, alongside ParcelShops, at the point of sale in the online shopping experience. Landlords and shop owners interested in hosting a locker can find out more here.",[4351],{"start":4352,"end":4353,"type":279,"data":4354},199,204,{"link_type":281,"url":4355,"target":283},"press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops\u002Fhost-a-locker?utm_source=web&utm_medium=press-release&utm_campaign=become-a-locker",{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":4357,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":1333,"spans":4359,"direction":112},[],"rich_text$ac5bf6b3-8f33-4341-894e-06656e76849f",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":4362,"primary":4363,"id":4265,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":4364},[4365,4368,4371,4374,4377,4379,4385,4389],{"type":126,"text":4218,"spans":4366,"direction":112},[4367],{"start":32,"end":405,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":251,"spans":4369,"direction":112},[4370],{"start":32,"end":254,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":4372,"spans":4373,"direction":112},"Evri is on track to become the UK’s premier parcel delivery company. Contingent upon closing conditions (including customary regulatory approvals), following the expected completion of its proposed merger with DHL eCommerce UK the combined Evri business is expected to deliver more than 1 billion parcels and a further 1 billion business letters annually. ",[],{"type":126,"text":4375,"spans":4376,"direction":112},"The company – which currently delivers around 900 million parcels a year – has a mission to be the most convenient way to send, receive and return parcels, without costing the earth. Working with Europe’s top retailers, marketplaces and pre-loved sites, the roots of Evri can be traced back to Yorkshire in 1974. The business has grown over the decades and now has a team of 8,000+ employees and 25,000+ couriers, as well as 10,000+ out of home locations and a growing network of state-of-the-art hubs and depots.  Following its acquisition of Coll-8 in May 2025, Ireland’s leading independent customs clearance and logistics specialists, Evri continues to supercharge its international capability. ",[],{"type":126,"text":3311,"spans":4378,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":4380,"spans":4381,"direction":112},"Find out more at www.evri.com",[4382],{"start":362,"end":1084,"type":279,"data":4383},{"link_type":281,"url":4384,"target":283},"press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com",{"type":126,"text":3694,"spans":4386,"direction":112},[4387],{"start":1128,"end":3697,"type":279,"data":4388},{"link_type":281,"url":472,"target":283},{"type":126,"text":4390,"spans":4391,"direction":112},"Videos and images available at Evri headline images - Google Photos",[4392],{"start":4070,"end":3474,"type":279,"data":4393},{"link_type":281,"url":4394,"target":283},"press.html\u002F\u002Fphotos.google.com\u002Fshare\u002FAF1QipMcz31085uPjC84Qku2g2swDrF4UwqNqgVa6_JvP-VBihLVi64eZDWcA0VRA9ESSA?key=OVFzZjFaVzNlTWNVRWJURzhRbEZTX0N3c1U5S2hR",{"id":4396,"uid":4397,"url":4398,"type":50,"href":4399,"tags":4400,"first_publication_date":4401,"last_publication_date":4402,"slugs":4403,"linked_documents":4405,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":4406,"data":4407},"aEa5FREAACAAmsCY","evri-continues-growth","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-continues-growth","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22aEa5FREAACAAmsCY%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2025-06-09T10:54:37+0000","2025-06-09T12:01:07+0000",[4404],"evri-continues-growth-with-5000-new-courier-roles",[],[],{"title":4408,"category":8,"metaDescription":4409,"canonical":4410,"titleTag":4411,"featuredImage":4412,"publishedDate":4422,"slices":4423},"Evri continues growth with 5,000 new courier roles","Read here about Evri's continued growth with 5,000 new courier roles","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002FEvri-growth-5,000-courier-roles","Evri continues growth with 5,000 new courier roles | Evri",{"dimensions":4413,"alt":4414,"copyright":8,"url":4415,"id":4416,"edit":4417,"thumbnail":4418},{"width":65,"height":865},"Evri courier delivers and scans a parcel for a customer who is accepting the parcel on their doorstep","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaEa6ZLh8WN-LV4-V_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10159.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","aEa6ZLh8WN-LV4-V",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":4419,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":4420,"id":4416,"edit":4421},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaEa6ZLh8WN-LV4-V_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10159.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2025-06-09",[4424,4463,4468,4502],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":4425,"primary":4426,"id":4190,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":4427},[4428,4433,4438,4443,4445,4448,4451,4454,4457,4460],{"type":109,"text":4429,"spans":4430,"direction":112},"Evri announces creation of 5000 new courier roles as it aims to become UK’s premier parcel delivery business",[4431],{"start":32,"end":4432,"type":163},108,{"type":109,"text":4434,"spans":4435,"direction":112},"Recruitment drive will see it work with 33,000 couriers – its highest number ever",[4436],{"start":32,"end":4437,"type":163},81,{"type":109,"text":4439,"spans":4440,"direction":112},"Drive announced as Evri relaunches its market leading union-backed courier initiative – ‘Evri Plus’ – which offers paid holidays and pensions to self-employed courier",[4441],{"start":32,"end":4442,"type":163},166,{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":4444,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":4446,"spans":4447,"direction":112},"Evri has today announced it is creating 5,000 new courier roles into the business, as part of its long-term growth strategy and ambition to become the UK’s premier parcel delivery business.",[],{"type":126,"text":4449,"spans":4450,"direction":112},"The addition of these roles will deliver the brand’s largest-ever self-employed courier network, taking it to over 33,000.",[],{"type":126,"text":4452,"spans":4453,"direction":112},"As one of the UK’s largest dedicated parcel delivery companies, today’s announcement follows a huge period of growth for the Yorkshire-based business, which has grown ten-fold over the last decade and serves most of the UK’s major retailers.",[],{"type":126,"text":4455,"spans":4456,"direction":112},"The brand also recently revealed future international growth further bolstered by last month’s announcement of its merger with DHL eCommerce UK and the acquisition of leading customs clearance and logistics specialist Coll-8.",[],{"type":126,"text":4458,"spans":4459,"direction":112},"And alongside existing couriers, those joining the business will also have the opportunity to become part of the brand’s relaunched and pioneering ‘Evri Plus’ initiative, which remains the UK’s only union-backed courier scheme.",[],{"type":126,"text":4461,"spans":4462,"direction":112},"Evri Plus gives self-employed workers access to a range of additional benefits, including 28 days paid holiday, guaranteed national minimum wage, pension contributions and parental leave, as well as other additional flexible benefits. The initiative works on an opt-in basis, available to eligible couriers*, and the business is keen to boost numbers.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":4464,"primary":4466,"id":4197,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[4465],{},{"quoteText":4467,"quoteSource":4335},"We continue to deliver phenomenal growth at Evri, and none more so than within our hard-working courier network, who are truly the backbone of our business.\n\nWe know that service, reliability and quality are critical factors for our clients and consumers, and so by expanding our self-employed network further, we remain focused on delivering in each of those areas.\n\nAnd it’s so important that we continue to support our couriers, which is why I’m so proud that we are leading the way with our pioneering ‘Evri Plus’ initiative, providing couriers with greater protection and benefits alongside the opportunity to retain the flexibility of self-employment.",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":4469,"primary":4470,"id":4360,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":4471},[4472,4474,4477,4480,4483,4486,4489,4492,4498,4500],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":4473,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":4475,"spans":4476,"direction":112},"Roles are available throughout the country, with areas of focus including Plymouth, Bury, Hastings, Dover and Scarborough, and couriers can typically earn £20.86 an hour on average whilst being able to enjoy the flexibility of delivering parcels any time between 8am and 8pm.",[],{"type":126,"text":4478,"spans":4479,"direction":112},"The creation of these roles follows Evri’s recent announcement of its proposed merger with DHL eCommerce UK in a move that will see over 1 billion parcels and a further 1 billion business letters delivered annually by the newly named Evri Group, alongside its acquisition of Coll-8, which will see accelerated parcel deliveries for retailers to the Republic of Ireland.",[],{"type":126,"text":4481,"spans":4482,"direction":112},"This new venture, which compliments the cost-effective and flexible courier offer from Evri with the addition of DHL eCommerce’s premium van delivery network, will most notably see the former entering the UK business letters market for the first time.",[],{"type":126,"text":4484,"spans":4485,"direction":112},"And with this latest recruitment drive, at least 1,000 courier roles created are permanent, with 4,000 additional flexible roles available to support a busy summer period and other peaks in parcel volumes throughout the year. There will be opportunities for those flexible roles to become permanent for couriers who want to build a career with Evri and continue delivering through the festive period.",[],{"type":126,"text":4487,"spans":4488,"direction":112},"Among other benefits open to Evri couriers are free access to both wellbeing benefits, such as Digital GP and Physio, as well as discounts for major retailers to help save on everyday expenses.",[],{"type":126,"text":4490,"spans":4491,"direction":112},"Evri also recently launched a ‘Go Electric’ scheme to incentivise its self-employed couriers to switch to electric vehicles by offering up to £3,300 towards an electric vehicle over two years.",[],{"type":126,"text":4493,"spans":4494,"direction":112},"For those looking to apply, visit: www.evri.com\u002Fbeacourier",[4495],{"start":1070,"end":2501,"type":279,"data":4496},{"link_type":281,"url":4497,"target":283},"press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fbeacourier",{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":4499,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":1333,"spans":4501,"direction":112},[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":4503,"primary":4504,"id":4265,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":4505},[4506,4509,4512,4514,4517,4522,4524,4527,4530,4532],{"type":126,"text":4218,"spans":4507,"direction":112},[4508],{"start":32,"end":405,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":4510,"spans":4511,"direction":112},"*Evri Plus is open to couriers that meet certain eligibility criteria, including delivering on at least five days a week, on up to two regular rounds. Evri Plus couriers can access guaranteed minimum levels of earnings, paid holiday, pension enrolment and trade union representation with the GMB",[],{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":4513,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":816,"spans":4515,"direction":112},[4516],{"start":32,"end":819,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":4518,"spans":4519,"direction":112},"press.html\u002F\u002Fphotos.app.goo.gl\u002FQ1bUhdcP93FREWLQA",[4520],{"start":32,"end":183,"type":279,"data":4521},{"link_type":281,"url":4518,"target":283},{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":4523,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":251,"spans":4525,"direction":112},[4526],{"start":32,"end":254,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":4528,"spans":4529,"direction":112},"Evri is one of the UK’s biggest dedicated parcel delivery companies, delivering almost 900 million parcels a year. The company has a mission to be the most convenient way to send, receive and return parcels, without costing the earth. Evri works with most of Europe’s top retailers, marketplaces and pre-loved sites.",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":4531,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":4533,"spans":4534,"direction":112},"The roots of Evri can be traced back to Yorkshire in 1974 but the business has grown over the decades and now has a team of 8,000+ employees, 25,000+ couriers, 10,000+ out of home locations and a growing network of state-of-the-art hubs and depots. Evri has more than 3 million independent 5-star Trustpilot reviews, on-time delivery rates which surpass 99%, an average courier rating of 4.7\u002F5, and a commitment to provide an answer for everyone following a significant investment in customer experience.",[],{"id":4536,"uid":4537,"url":4538,"type":50,"href":4539,"tags":4540,"first_publication_date":4541,"last_publication_date":4541,"slugs":4542,"linked_documents":4544,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":4545,"data":4546},"aCxHdxEAACMAG_mn","evri-acquires-coll-8","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-acquires-coll-8","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22aCxHdxEAACMAG_mn%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2025-05-21T06:56:25+0000",[4543],"evri-acquires-coll-8-accelerating-parcel-deliveries-for-retailers-to-the-republic-of-ireland",[],[],{"title":4547,"category":8,"metaDescription":4548,"canonical":4549,"titleTag":4550,"featuredImage":4551,"publishedDate":4562,"slices":4563},"Evri acquires Coll-8 accelerating parcel deliveries for retailers to the Republic of Ireland","Read here about Evri's acquisition of Coll-8 accelerating parcel deliveries for retailers to the Republic of Ireland","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-acquires-coll-8","Evri acquires Coll-8 accelerating parcel deliveries for retailers to the Republic of Ireland | Evri",{"dimensions":4552,"alt":4553,"copyright":8,"url":4554,"id":4555,"edit":4556,"thumbnail":4557},{"width":65,"height":1242},"Wide angle drone photograph of Evri branded vehicles at Evri's Warrington Hub","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F51a1d737-b024-4d66-8fec-e2e8754fe946_Evri+branded+trucks+wide.png?auto=format,compress&rect=0,0,6000,4500&w=960&h=720","ZGYkGhEAACMA9vIe",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":4558,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":4559,"id":4555,"edit":4560},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F51a1d737-b024-4d66-8fec-e2e8754fe946_Evri+branded+trucks+wide.png?auto=format,compress&rect=0,828,6000,2844&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":4561,"zoom":33,"background":71},828,"2025-05-21",[4564,4603,4608,4614,4620,4633],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":4565,"primary":4567,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[4566],{},{"content":4568},[4569,4572,4575,4578,4581,4583,4586,4589,4592,4595,4598,4601],{"type":109,"text":4570,"spans":4571,"direction":112},"Evri’s acquisition of leading customs clearance and logistics specialist Coll-8 supercharges its international capability by strengthening its end-to-end delivery and clearance capabilities in the Republic of Ireland and wider EU.",[],{"type":109,"text":4573,"spans":4574,"direction":112},"Integration of Coll-8’s bespoke digital platform will reduce Evri’s delivery times from five to two days and speed up returns in the Republic of Ireland which has a large, and growing e-commerce market with predicted revenue of €5.4bn this year. [1]",[],{"type":109,"text":4576,"spans":4577,"direction":112},"Complementary acquisition will also leverage Coll-8’s pick-up and drop-off network in the Republic of Ireland, providing a step-change in convenience for Irish customers, accelerating returns to UK retailers.",[],{"type":109,"text":4579,"spans":4580,"direction":112},"Retailers can benefit from Coll-8’s automated process to reclaim any duty on returned items for taxes paid when goods are imported into Ireland.",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":4582,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":4584,"spans":4585,"direction":112},"Evri, the UK’s largest dedicated parcel delivery company, has today announced the multi-million-pound acquisition of Coll-8, one of Ireland’s fastest-growing and leading independent customs clearance and logistics specialists, to drive accelerated deliveries and returns for customers in the Republic of Ireland.",[],{"type":126,"text":4587,"spans":4588,"direction":112},"The highly complementary acquisition will strengthen Evri’s end-to-end capabilities in the Republic of Ireland and wider European Union by integrating its market-leading parcel delivery services with Coll-8’s bespoke, digital customs clearance platform, which automates and streamlines cross-border trade.",[],{"type":126,"text":4590,"spans":4591,"direction":112},"Currently, while Evri can guarantee next-day delivery within the UK, deliveries into the Republic of Ireland can take up to five days. By leveraging Coll-8’s technology, Evri expects to reduce delivery times to two days, significantly enhancing its end-to-end service proposition with coverage across first mile, middle mile and customs clearance for international customers.",[],{"type":126,"text":4593,"spans":4594,"direction":112},"This is the latest deal underpinning Evri’s long-term growth strategy and closely follows it announcing a strategic transaction on 14 May with DHL eCommerce UK, the e-commerce logistics specialist of DHL Group. The proposed merger between Evri and DHL eCommerce UK will lead to the combined Evri business delivering over 1 billion parcels and a further 1 billion business letters annually, bringing significant benefits to consumers and businesses by offering greater choice and cost competitive solutions.",[],{"type":126,"text":4596,"spans":4597,"direction":112},"Coll-8 is a customs clearance pioneer that has more than 500 drop2shop pickup and drop-off (PUDO) locations in the Republic of Ireland, many of which are at premises managed by BWG, Ireland's largest operator of convenience stores. These will complement Evri’s PUDO network that utilises third parties there. The integration of these networks will enhance collections and returns for customers, further improving services. With expertise in e-commerce customs clearance, Coll-8 was founded in 2021 by Dave Field and currently serves major retailers and postal providers including Boots, THG, Boohoo, An Post, Holland & Barrett, and River Island which are all also Evri clients.",[],{"type":126,"text":4599,"spans":4600,"direction":112},"This transaction is part of Evri’s long-term growth strategy to deliver more than a billion parcels a year, supported by its recent merger agreement with DHL eCommerce in the UK, and driven by its continued growth in parcel volumes from new retail clients, expansion in SMEs and online marketplaces, and international inbound and outbound opportunities.",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":4602,"direction":112},[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":4604,"primary":4606,"id":4197,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[4605],{},{"quoteText":4607,"quoteSource":4335},"This landmark acquisition will significantly accelerate the speed of Evri’s parcel delivery and return times for our customers in the Republic of Ireland. We look forward to collaborating with Coll-8’s talented team to elevate our end-to-end service offering across the region, as their cutting-edge customs clearance platform will give Evri a seamless gateway into European markets. This transaction will be a win-win for our customers and clients.\n\nThis will make Evri the delivery solution of choice for both UK and Ireland and our first-ever acquisition signals our intent to build on our significant organic growth which has seen us triple in size in a short space of time. Our owners have backed our plans and are investing to meet our target to deliver more than a billion parcels a year, bolstered by our recent landmark merger agreement with DHL eCommerce UK – and cement our position as a powerhouse of the parcel delivery sector.",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":4609,"primary":4610,"id":4360,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":4611},[4612],{"type":126,"text":945,"spans":4613,"direction":112},[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":4615,"primary":4616,"id":4619,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":4617,"quoteSource":4618},"When we launched, we wanted to offer brands and consumers a better, more cost-effective and more environmentally-friendly way of getting the very best out of the massive opportunities which e-commerce represents.\nI’m convinced that, together with Evri, we can now take our respective momentum to another level entirely. We have the combined experience, technology, the infrastructure and the ambition to succeed.","Dave Field, Founder and Chief Executive Officer of Coll-8","quote$8c95b27a-32e2-41e9-aa3a-5d2c38645295",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":4621,"primary":4622,"id":4632,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":4623},[4624,4626,4629],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":4625,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":4627,"spans":4628,"direction":112},"Founded in 1974, over the last decade Evri has grown ten-fold and now serves most of the UK’s major retailers and currently delivers more than 800 million parcels a year.",[],{"type":126,"text":4630,"spans":4631,"direction":112},"Last year the business made a £57 million investment in operations, including courier recruitment and customer service enhancements. As part of its sustainability commitments, Evri is also targeting to achieve net-zero emissions by 2035, the sector’s largest sustainable fleet, and 100% renewable energy usage. The company also continues to champion accessibility, partnering with Scope to create a more inclusive service for disabled customers.",[],"rich_text$fca42dee-df91-46af-a83d-15ba75c351a6",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":4634,"primary":4635,"id":4265,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":4636},[4637,4640,4642,4645,4648,4650,4652,4656,4659,4662,4665,4668,4670],{"type":126,"text":4218,"spans":4638,"direction":112},[4639],{"start":32,"end":405,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":4641,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":3445,"spans":4643,"direction":112},[4644],{"start":32,"end":671,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":4646,"spans":4647,"direction":112},"Evri is one of the UK’s largest dedicated parcel delivery companies, delivering around 900 million parcels a year. The company has a mission to be the most convenient way to send, receive and return parcels, without costing the earth. Evri works with most of Europe’s top retailers, marketplaces and pre-loved sites. The roots of Evri can be traced back to Yorkshire in 1974 but the business has grown over the decades and now has a team of 8,000+ employees, 25,000+ couriers, 10,000+ out of home locations and a growing network of state-of-the-art hubs and depots. Evri has more than 3 million independent 5-star Trustpilot reviews, on-time delivery rates which surpass 99%, an average courier rating of 4.7\u002F5, and a commitment to provide an answer for everyone following a significant investment in customer experience.",[],{"type":126,"text":3452,"spans":4649,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":4651,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":4653,"spans":4654,"direction":112},"Coll-8",[4655],{"start":32,"end":819,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":4657,"spans":4658,"direction":112},"Coll-8 has transformed the means by which UK retailers ship to consumers in Ireland, and has developed drop2shop, an award-winning nationwide network of 500 location by which shoppers can collect and return online orders.",[],{"type":126,"text":4660,"spans":4661,"direction":112},"Headquartered at Baldonell in Dublin, Coll-8 maintains a separate site at Rosemount in the city, as well as two locations in the UK - a UK head office at Runcorn and a warehouse at Tamworth.",[],{"type":126,"text":4663,"spans":4664,"direction":112},"The deal is the latest success for Mr Field. Prior to launching Coll-8, he was responsible for co-founding the company which became Ireland's largest independent parcel delivery business, Nightline.",[],{"type":126,"text":4666,"spans":4667,"direction":112},"That achievement earned him a nomination as one of Ernst & Young Entrepreneur's of the year.",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":4669,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":4671,"spans":4672,"direction":112},"[1] Source: https:\u002F\u002Fwww.statista.com\u002Foutlook\u002Femo\u002Fecommerce\u002Fireland converted from USD to Euros at exchange rate dated 30th April 2025",[],{"id":4674,"uid":4675,"url":4676,"type":50,"href":4677,"tags":4678,"first_publication_date":4679,"last_publication_date":4679,"slugs":4680,"linked_documents":4682,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":4683,"data":4684},"aCR-thAAACIAewZa","evri-announces-partnership-with-eflorist","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-announces-partnership-with-eflorist","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22aCR-thAAACIAewZa%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2025-05-14T11:59:39+0000",[4681],"a-blossoming-relationship-evri-announces-business-first-partnership-with-leading-uk-based-platform-eflorist",[],[],{"title":4685,"category":8,"metaDescription":4686,"canonical":4687,"titleTag":4688,"featuredImage":4689,"publishedDate":4701,"slices":4702},"A Blossoming relationship! Evri announces business-first partnership with leading UK-based platform Eflorist","Read here about Evri's new business-first partnership with leading UK-based platform Eflorist","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-announces-partnership-with-eflorist","Evri announces business-first partnership with leading UK-based platform Eflorist | Evri",{"dimensions":4690,"alt":4692,"copyright":8,"url":4693,"id":4694,"edit":4695,"thumbnail":4696},{"width":65,"height":4691},1238,"Evri announces business-first partnership with online flower retail Eflorist","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaCSDTSdWJ-7kSFCa_Eflorist2.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,0,1191,1536&w=960&h=1238","aCSDTSdWJ-7kSFCa",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":4697,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":4698,"id":4694,"edit":4699},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaCSDTSdWJ-7kSFCa_Eflorist2.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,486,1191,564&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":4700,"zoom":33,"background":71},486,"2025-05-12",[4703,4728,4734,4739],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":4704,"primary":4706,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[4705],{},{"content":4707},[4708,4711,4714,4717,4720,4723,4726],{"type":126,"text":4709,"spans":4710,"direction":112},"The UK’s largest dedicated parcel delivery company, Evri, has announced a brand-first partnership with leading online flower platform Eflorist.",[],{"type":126,"text":4712,"spans":4713,"direction":112},"Marking the parcel firm’s expansion into the flower sector, Evri, who deliver over 800m parcels a year, has joined up with the UK-based online florist to offer a fast and reliable delivery service for its customers.",[],{"type":126,"text":4715,"spans":4716,"direction":112},"And following a successful start, which saw delivery targets exceeded during the peak Mother’s Day trading period, Eflorist have already witnessed a positive increase on their overall Net Promoter Score (NPS) since joining forces with Evri.",[],{"type":126,"text":4718,"spans":4719,"direction":112},"Eflorist, who form part of the global Euroflorist Group, will join Evri’s growing client list - spanning more than 1,600 of the UK’s biggest retail brands – and become the first of its kind in the flowers sector to partner with the Yorkshire-based delivery business.",[],{"type":126,"text":4721,"spans":4722,"direction":112},"With over 75 years’ experience in the industry, Eflorist pride themself in delivering the freshest flowers direct to customers doorsteps, and by working with Evri, they’ll look to leverage the company’s large operational capacity to fulfil their next day delivery commitment, seven days a week.",[],{"type":126,"text":4724,"spans":4725,"direction":112},"Customers of Eflorist, who deliver over 1m arrangements a year, will also benefit from Evri’s varied delivery options, including a network of over 10,000 ParcelShops and lockers, as well as overall value for money.",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":4727,"direction":112},[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":4729,"primary":4731,"id":4197,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[4730],{},{"quoteText":4732,"quoteSource":4733},"We’re thrilled to partner with Eflorist and support them in their mission to deliver the freshest flowers to customers all over the UK.\n\nAt Evri, we’re committed to continually evolving as a business, and that is why this partnership is particularly important to us, as it marks our first venture into the flowers sector.\n\nAnd with huge initial success already seen across Mother’s Day weekend, which saw delivery targets exceeded, we look forward to building on our relationship with them as we grow further within this sector.","Tim Williams, Head of Strategic Sales at Evri",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":4735,"primary":4736,"id":4619,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":4737,"quoteSource":4738},"We’re thrilled to be partnering with Evri as we continue to deliver emotions that matter to customers across the UK.\n\nThere’s always a reason behind every bouquet we send – whether it’s love, celebration, or support – and ensuring those moments arrive fresh and exactly when they’re needed is absolutely essential.\n\nThat’s why we were particularly impressed by Evri’s delivery success rate for Mother’s Day – a day that carries deep emotional meaning for so many. Timely delivery isn’t just a goal; it’s an expectation we hold to the highest standard.\n\nAt Eflorist, customer satisfaction is something we monitor and review constantly – it’s at the heart of everything we do. With Evri’s proven delivery capabilities and shared customer-first approach, we’re confident this partnership will continue to strengthen the connections we help our customers create.","Paul Isaia, Chief Commercial Officer at Eflorist",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":4740,"primary":4741,"id":4265,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":4742},[4743,4747,4749,4753,4756,4758,4761,4764,4767,4769,4773,4776,4779,4782],{"type":126,"text":4744,"spans":4745,"direction":112},"-END- ",[4746],{"start":32,"end":819,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":4748,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":4750,"spans":4751,"direction":112},"Media enquiries:",[4752],{"start":32,"end":405,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":4754,"spans":4755,"direction":112},"prteam@evri.com",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":4757,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":251,"spans":4759,"direction":112},[4760],{"start":32,"end":254,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":4762,"spans":4763,"direction":112},"Evri is the UK’s biggest dedicated parcel delivery company, delivering more than 800 million parcels a year. The company has a mission to be the most convenient way to send, receive and return parcels, without costing the earth. Evri works with most of Europe’s top retailers, marketplaces and pre-loved sites.",[],{"type":126,"text":4765,"spans":4766,"direction":112},"The roots of Evri can be traced back to Yorkshire in 1974 but the business has grown over the decades and now has a team of 8,000+ employees, 2,000+ couriers, 10,000+ out of home locations and a growing network of state-of-the-art hubs and depots. Evri has more than 3 million independent 5-star Trustpilot reviews, on-time delivery rates which are amongst the highest in the industry, an average courier rating of 4.7\u002F5, and a commitment to provide an answer for everyone following a significant investment in customer experience.",[],{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":4768,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":4770,"spans":4771,"direction":112},"About Eflorist",[4772],{"start":32,"end":341,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":4774,"spans":4775,"direction":112},"There’s always a reason for giving flowers.",[],{"type":126,"text":4777,"spans":4778,"direction":112},"Eflorist is a leading European e-commerce platform for flowers and complementary products.",[],{"type":126,"text":4780,"spans":4781,"direction":112},"We believe flowers are the best way to express emotions and no reason is too big or small for giving flowers to oneself, or anyone else. We have a presence in ten European countries and deliver worldwide.",[],{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":4783,"direction":112},[],{"id":4785,"uid":4786,"url":4787,"type":50,"href":4788,"tags":4789,"first_publication_date":4790,"last_publication_date":4791,"slugs":4792,"linked_documents":4794,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":4795,"data":4796},"aCRhDxIAACEAol1B","dhl-ecommerce-uk-to-merge-with-evri","\u002Fpress\u002Fdhl-ecommerce-uk-to-merge-with-evri","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22aCRhDxIAACEAol1B%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2025-05-14T10:00:09+0000","2026-04-10T10:19:42+0000",[4793],"dhl-ecommerce-uk-to-merge-with-evri-to-create-uks-premier-parcel-delivery-business",[],[],{"title":4797,"category":8,"metaDescription":4798,"canonical":4799,"titleTag":4800,"featuredImage":4801,"publishedDate":4812,"slices":4813},"DHL eCommerce UK to merge with Evri to create UK’s premier parcel delivery business","Read here about DHL eCommerce UK to merge with Evri to create UK’s premier parcel delivery business","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fdhl-ecommerce-uk-to-merge-with-evri","DHL eCommerce UK to merge with Evri To offer a Premium Service",{"dimensions":4802,"alt":4803,"copyright":8,"url":4804,"id":4805,"edit":4806,"thumbnail":4807},{"width":65,"height":865},"Martijn de Lange, CEO of Evri, with Pablo Ciano, CEO of DHL eCommerce in front of Evri and DHL vehicles","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaCRu7idWJ-7kSD4J_0Z9_0955-Edit.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,0,7789,5193&w=960&h=640","aCRu7idWJ-7kSD4J",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":4808,"alt":4803,"copyright":8,"url":4809,"id":4805,"edit":4810},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaCRu7idWJ-7kSD4J_0Z9_0955-Edit.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,751,7789,3692&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":4811,"zoom":33,"background":71},751,"2025-05-14",[4814,4857,4862,4868,4873,4905,4911],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":4815,"primary":4817,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[4816],{},{"content":4818},[4819,4821,4825,4829,4833,4840,4842,4845,4849,4852,4855],{"type":126,"text":4797,"spans":4820,"direction":112},[],{"type":109,"text":4822,"spans":4823,"direction":112},"Transformational Merger: Strategic partnership of highly complementary UK businesses to create one-stop solution for domestic and international parcel logistics",[4824],{"start":32,"end":229,"type":163},{"type":109,"text":4826,"spans":4827,"direction":112},"Premier Service Portfolio: Evri’s unique courier proposition will be enhanced with the addition of DHL eCommerce’s UK network; international capability and business mail services.",[4828],{"start":32,"end":3553,"type":163},{"type":109,"text":4830,"spans":4831,"direction":112},"Growth Potential: DHL Group will acquire a significant minority stake in the combined new Evri Group with multiple options to strengthen ties",[4832],{"start":32,"end":362,"type":163},{"type":109,"text":4834,"spans":4835,"direction":112},"Strong Brand: Evri will retain its core branding, DHL eCommerce in the UK will operate under Evri Premium – a network of DHL eCommerce",[4836,4837,4839],{"start":32,"end":699,"type":163},{"start":4838,"end":341,"type":163},13,{"start":322,"end":470,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":4841,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":4843,"spans":4844,"direction":112},"Evri, one of the UK's largest dedicated parcel delivery companies, and DHL eCommerce, the e-commerce logistics specialist of DHL Group, have today announced a strategic transaction that will see the merger of DHL eCommerce UK with Evri. The merged Evri business will deliver over 1 billion parcels and a further 1 billion business letters annually and is poised to bring significant benefits to consumers and businesses by offering greater choice and cost competitive solutions. As part of the transaction, DHL Group will acquire a significant minority stake in Evri.",[],{"type":126,"text":4846,"spans":4847,"direction":112},"Evri’s cost-effective and flexible courier offer will be complemented with the addition of DHL eCommerce’s premium van delivery network. Rebranded Evri Premium – a network of DHL eCommerce, this will remain a dedicated and secure, separate network that will offer fast, time-sensitive deliveries with enhanced shipping security protection for high-value and large items for B2B and B2C parcel services.",[4848],{"start":1030,"end":1267,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":4850,"spans":4851,"direction":112},"The new Group will include an expanded international capability for inbound and outbound parcels to complement Evri’s own international network by making use of DHL eCommerce’s extensive expertise in cross-border parcel shipping and an out-of-home network of nearly 150, 000 global access points. This includes faster transit times across the world with access to DHL’s own eCommerce network in Europe, the U.S. and selected Asian markets such as India.",[],{"type":126,"text":4853,"spans":4854,"direction":112},"Notably, Evri is entering the UK business letter market for the first time, with DHL’s UK Mail retained in the new combined Group and offering a best-in-class mail service. This will also offer e-commerce businesses more options for sending lighter-weight items. In addition, customers will benefit from the Group’s new combined out-of-home shop and locker network parcel delivery and collection which will be the UK’s largest.",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":4856,"direction":112},[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":4858,"primary":4860,"id":4197,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[4859],{},{"quoteText":4861,"quoteSource":4335},"We are excited that DHL eCommerce UK will merge with Evri to bring together two highly complementary UK businesses – committed to innovation and offering customers and clients the best possible service. By combining Evri’s scale, innovation and DHL eCommerce’s best-in-class premium van network, we are creating the pre-eminent parcel delivery group in the UK. Over the last decade Evri has grown ten-fold in size and this transaction will further expand our access into the European and global e-commerce markets. Since Apollo-managed funds came on board as our owners, they have backed our intent to drive forward and grow to become the UK’s premier parcel delivery business.",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":4863,"primary":4864,"id":4360,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":4865},[4866],{"type":126,"text":945,"spans":4867,"direction":112},[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":4869,"primary":4870,"id":4619,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":4871,"quoteSource":4872},"DHL eCommerce and Evri both stand for top service quality, reliability, and sustainability, which makes this partnership a great fit for our customers. Together, we'll be able to offer more efficient, far-reaching, and innovative solutions to keep up with the fast-paced e-commerce market. By joining forces in the UK, we're creating a one-stop shop for all our customers' parcel needs here and giving them better delivery options from around the world.","Pablo Ciano, CEO of DHL eCommerce",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":4874,"primary":4875,"id":4632,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":4876},[4877,4879,4882,4885,4888,4891,4894,4897,4900,4903],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":4878,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":4880,"spans":4881,"direction":112},"The compelling service portfolio of the newly formed Group will include:",[],{"type":109,"text":4883,"spans":4884,"direction":112},"Cost-effective and flexible courier network for next-day and standard deliveries for small and large items for retailers, businesses and consumers.",[],{"type":109,"text":4886,"spans":4887,"direction":112},"A separate, dedicated and secure premium network for high-value and larger parcels for B2B and B2C deliveries.",[],{"type":109,"text":4889,"spans":4890,"direction":112},"A leading SME one stop shop solution which offers everything from mail, lightweight, larger, secure, B2B, international and fulfilment services.",[],{"type":109,"text":4892,"spans":4893,"direction":112},"The UK’s largest out-of-home network of 15,000 access points.",[],{"type":109,"text":4895,"spans":4896,"direction":112},"Extensive international capability to complement Evri’s own international network by making use of DHL eCommerce’s expertise in cross-border parcel shipping and global out-of-home network of nearly 150,000 access points.",[],{"type":109,"text":4898,"spans":4899,"direction":112},"The operation of a best-in-class mail service on behalf of businesses in the UK.",[],{"type":126,"text":4901,"spans":4902,"direction":112},"On completion, the combined Group, will bring together a team of over 30,000 couriers and van drivers, 12,000 colleagues, with a fleet of 8,000 vehicles to deliver over 1 billion parcels and 1 billion letters annually.",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":4904,"direction":112},[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":4906,"primary":4907,"id":4910,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":4908,"quoteSource":4909},"This is a tremendous milestone in Evri’s journey, and we are delighted to welcome a global leader like DHL as a strategic partner and shareholder. By embracing technology and innovation, Evri has grown from strength to strength in a dynamic e-commerce market. With DHL’s complementary expertise and strong network, the business is well positioned to further improve its reliable services and the customer experience.","Evri Chairman and Apollo Partner Alex van Hoek","quote$b71fc39a-22df-4b14-89bd-fcf0d734ad1c",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":4912,"primary":4913,"id":4265,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":4914},[4915,4917,4920,4923,4925,4930,4932,4935,4937,4941,4943,4945,4947,4951,4953,4957],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":4916,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":4918,"spans":4919,"direction":112},"Following completion, Martijn de Lange will lead the combined business in the UK, with Stu Hill, currently CEO of DHL eCommerce UK, becoming MD of Evri’s Premium DHL network business. The DHL eCommerce UK executive team will also join the new group.",[],{"type":126,"text":4921,"spans":4922,"direction":112},"Evri will continue to be majority owned by Apollo-managed funds. Completion of the transaction and the outlined partnership are contingent upon closing conditions, including customary regulatory approvals. The businesses of DHL Express, DHL Supply Chain and DHL Global Forwarding in the UK are unaffected by this transaction and will continue to operate as they do at present.",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":4924,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":4926,"spans":4927,"direction":112},"– End –",[4928],{"start":32,"end":4929,"type":163},7,{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":4931,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":4933,"spans":4934,"direction":112},"Image: Pablo Ciano, CEO of DHL eCommerce (left) with Martijn de Lange, CEO of Evri (right) in front of Evri and DHL vehicles",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":4936,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":4938,"spans":4939,"direction":112},"DHL is the leading global brand in the logistics industry. Our DHL divisions offer a broad portfolio of logistics services ranging from national and international parcel delivery, e-commerce shipping and fulfillment solutions, international express, road, air and ocean transport to industrial supply chain management. With approximately 400,000 employees in more than 220 countries and territories worldwide, DHL connects people and businesses securely and reliably, enabling global sustainable trade flows. With specialized solutions for growth markets and industries including technology, life sciences and healthcare, engineering, manufacturing & energy, auto-mobility and retail, DHL is decisively positioned as “The logistics company for the world”.",[4940],{"start":32,"end":903,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":4942,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":3812,"spans":4944,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":4946,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":4948,"spans":4949,"direction":112},"Evri is one of the UK’s dedicated parcel delivery company, delivering more than 800 million parcels a year. The company has a mission to be the most convenient way to send, receive and return parcels, without costing the earth. Evri works with most of Europe’s top retailers, marketplaces and pre-loved sites. The roots of Evri can be traced back to Yorkshire in 1974 but the business has grown over the decades and now has a team of 8,000+ employees, 25,000+ couriers, 10,000+ out of home locations and a growing network of state-of-the-art hubs and depots. Evri has more than 3 million independent 5-star Trustpilot reviews, on-time delivery rates which surpass 99%, an average courier rating of 4.7\u002F5, and a commitment to provide an answer for everyone following a significant investment in customer experience.",[4950],{"start":32,"end":671,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":4952,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":3452,"spans":4954,"direction":112},[4955],{"start":362,"end":3455,"type":279,"data":4956},{"link_type":281,"url":472,"target":283},{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":4958,"direction":112},[],{"id":4960,"uid":4961,"url":4962,"type":50,"href":4963,"tags":4964,"first_publication_date":4965,"last_publication_date":4966,"slugs":4967,"linked_documents":4968,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":4969,"data":4970},"aCRllRIAACAAomQc","evri-steps-into-spotlight-as-headline-sponsor-of-scope-awards","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-steps-into-spotlight-as-headline-sponsor-of-scope-awards","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22aCRllRIAACAAomQc%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2025-05-14T09:48:00+0000","2025-09-14T08:29:02+0000",[4961],[],[],{"title":4971,"category":8,"metaDescription":4972,"canonical":4973,"titleTag":4974,"featuredImage":4975,"publishedDate":4981,"slices":4982},"Evri steps into spotlight as headline sponsor of Scope Awards","Read here about Evri's sponsorship of Scope Awards","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-steps-into-spotlight-as-headline-sponsor-of-scope-awards","Evri steps into spotlight as headline sponsor of Scope Awards | Evri",{"dimensions":4976,"alt":2473,"copyright":8,"url":2474,"id":2475,"edit":4977,"thumbnail":4978},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":4979,"alt":2473,"copyright":8,"url":2479,"id":2475,"edit":4980},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2025-05-13",[4983,5001,5006,5018,5023],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":4984,"primary":4986,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[4985],{},{"content":4987},[4988,4991,4994,4997,4999],{"type":126,"text":4989,"spans":4990,"direction":112},"This week Evri will proudly take to the stage as headline sponsor of the annual Scope Awards. As the leading UK parcel firm, the brand continues to champion inclusivity and doubles down on its commitment to accessibility and a more equitable future.",[],{"type":126,"text":4992,"spans":4993,"direction":112},"Taking place on Thursday, 15th May at the Kia Oval in London, the ceremony celebrates the achievements of individuals, organisations and game-changers that are driving progress towards disability equality. Hosted by the BAFTA nominated actor Adam Pearson, the awards are made up of 38 nominees shortlisted for the nine Scope Award categories.",[],{"type":126,"text":4995,"spans":4996,"direction":112},"Marking this exciting moment in the diversity, equity and inclusion calendar, Evri will play a key role in supporting the event. Alongside the host, Lyn Warren, Evri’s Chief HR Officer, will also take to the stage to highlight the brand’s partnership with Scope.",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":4998,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":5000,"direction":112},[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":5002,"primary":5004,"id":4197,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[5003],{},{"quoteText":5005,"quoteSource":2136},"We believe that inclusivity is at the heart of a great workplace, and we have an ambition to become the most accessible parcel delivery company for our colleagues and couriers, as well as our customers and clients.\nBeing a sponsor of the fantastic Scope Awards is an important step in championing disability equality and ensuring that everyone feels valued and supported. I’m looking forward to being inspired by a room full of gamechangers and I’ll been listening closely to all the stories being shared.\nI am committed to making Evri an amazing place to work for all, where accessibility and opportunity go hand in hand. Through our partnership with Scope, we reaffirm our dedication to fostering a workplace that empowers every individual to thrive.",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":5007,"primary":5008,"id":4632,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":5009},[5010,5012,5015],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":5011,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":5013,"spans":5014,"direction":112},"This milestone builds on Evri’s October 2024 announcement of a three-year strategic partnership with Scope when Evri announced an ambition to become the most accessible parcel delivery company for its colleagues, couriers, customers and clients.",[],{"type":126,"text":5016,"spans":5017,"direction":112},"Joining the judging panel and in attendance on the night is Evri’s Head of Major Accounts, Andy Cotter, a senior disabled colleague for the parcel organisation, who brings valuable insight and expertise to the selection process.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":5019,"primary":5020,"id":4910,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":5021,"quoteSource":5022},"We are delighted to be the headline sponsor for the Scope Awards, championing the amazing progress being made towards disability equality.\nI’m passionate about the work we’re doing to become the most accessible parcel delivery company, and with my recent first-hand experience of how an impairment can affect you mentally and in the workplace, I’m proud to be judging the awards.\nOn our busiest day last year, we delivered almost 4 million parcels, and we estimate around 1 million of these were delivered to disabled consumers. We recognise the opportunity to do better and over the next few years, and beyond, we are dedicated to making sure Evri better serves our communities and is an amazing place to work for all.\nWe aim to make a positive impact on the lives of disabled people and create a more inclusive and equitable society.","Andy Cotter, Head of Major Accounts at Evri",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":5024,"primary":5025,"id":5035,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":5026},[5027,5029,5032],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":5028,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":5030,"spans":5031,"direction":112},"Alongside Lyn and Andy, also attending the awards is Gary. He is a courier, and amputee, who has been a key member of the firm’s Evri Body Collective since its launch, and proud to share his story. The Evri Body Collective is an initiative that empowers individuals with lived experience of disability to share insights and drive progress in a listening session with Evri leaders.",[],{"type":126,"text":5033,"spans":5034,"direction":112},"Within the first few months of Evri’s partnership with Scope, the business exceeded its £125,000 target and reached a £150,000 milestone. Evri also launched accessibility preferences on the doorstep, including options such as needing more time to get to the door. ",[],"rich_text$f92184d3-f634-4f0e-8bcd-3c344fdea8cb",[5037,5134,5198,5293,5396,5478,5564,5673,5757,5961,6061,6137],{"id":5038,"uid":5039,"url":5040,"type":50,"href":5041,"tags":5042,"first_publication_date":5043,"last_publication_date":5044,"slugs":5045,"linked_documents":5046,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":5047,"data":5048},"Z-agrxEAACAAQ29Q","evri-embarks-on-robot-dog-deliveries","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-embarks-on-robot-dog-deliveries","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22Z-agrxEAACAAQ29Q%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2025-04-01T18:53:15+0000","2025-04-01T18:54:10+0000",[5039],[],[],{"title":5049,"category":8,"metaDescription":5050,"canonical":5051,"titleTag":5052,"featuredImage":5053,"publishedDate":5063,"slices":5064},"Evri emBARKS on robot dog deliveries","Read here about Evri's launch of robot dog deliveries","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-embarks-on-robot-dog-deliveries","Evri emBARKS on robot dog deliveries | Evri",{"dimensions":5054,"alt":5055,"copyright":8,"url":5056,"id":5057,"edit":5058,"thumbnail":5059},{"width":65,"height":65},"A robot dog stepping out of a blue Evri branded van to a female courier with a dog harness and biscuit","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ-ag_XdAxsiBwC6o_walkies2.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,0,1080,1080&w=960&h=960","Z-ag_XdAxsiBwC6o",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":5060,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":5061,"id":5057,"edit":5062},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ-ag_XdAxsiBwC6o_walkies2.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,284,1080,512&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":3527,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2025-04-02",[5065,5098,5103,5129],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":5066,"primary":5068,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[5067],{},{"content":5069},[5070,5074,5079,5082,5085,5090,5093,5096],{"type":126,"text":5071,"spans":5072,"direction":112},"Launch of robotic delivery by Evri will be a UK industry first",[5073],{"start":32,"end":3544,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":5075,"spans":5076,"direction":112},"Man’s best friend will be let off the lead to deliver paw in hand with Evri couriers later this year",[5077],{"start":32,"end":5078,"type":163},100,{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":5080,"direction":112},[5081],{"start":32,"end":33,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":5083,"spans":5084,"direction":112},"You’d be forgiven for thinking yesterday’s robot dog announcement by Evri, the UK’s biggest dedicated parcel delivery company was an April Fool’s prank, but the business has revealed it wasn’t a barking mad joke and is pleased to confirm it will trial an autonomous robot delivery dog later this year.  ",[],{"type":126,"text":5086,"spans":5087,"direction":112},"Last year, Evri celebrated fifty years of deliveries with a nostalgic look back at how delivery and consumer habits have evolved over the past five decades. As part of a report, consumers were asked what they thought the future of delivery would look like; only 16% of respondents thought that robots would eventually be delivering their parcels but for some of our consumers, they won’t have to wait long for this futuristic vision to be realised.",[5088],{"start":3891,"end":3892,"type":279,"data":5089},{"link_type":281,"url":3894,"target":283},{"type":126,"text":5091,"spans":5092,"direction":112},"In a UK first, the robotic version of man’s best friend will work in partnership with a courier to deliver parcels in a trial set for summer 2025. There’s no need to keep this dog on a lead – with sophisticated automation, the four-legged robot dog will be able to hop in and out of the courier’s van as it makes its way to and from homes delivering parcels and taking some of the leg work out for the courier.",[],{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":5094,"direction":112},[5095],{"start":32,"end":33,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":5097,"direction":112},[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":5099,"primary":5101,"id":4197,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[5100],{},{"quoteText":5102,"quoteSource":3899},"Couriers always have and always will be the heart of our business. Robots will never replace them, but we are dedicated to finding new and innovative methods to support our couriers and increase the speed and convenience of the services we offer. In this next stage of innovation, we are thrilled to introduce both these robot delivery trials, which could provide increased flexibility and choice for consumers.",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":5104,"primary":5105,"id":4632,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":5106},[5107,5109,5112,5115,5118,5121,5127],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":5108,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":5110,"spans":5111,"direction":112},"The autonomous canine has been developed by RIVR, a Swiss global innovation leader in physical AI. In partnership with Evri, the focus of the trial is to gain insight into how the robot dogs can work with couriers to improve efficiency support with some of the more strenuous parts of the job.",[],{"type":126,"text":5113,"spans":5114,"direction":112},"The robot dog trial is just one of several robot trials Evri is conducting as it looks to the future of parcel delivery, with the goal of providing a helping paw to couriers and developing solutions that will complement its delivery offering alongside couriers.",[],{"type":126,"text":5116,"spans":5117,"direction":112},"Operating out of Barnsley Business Innovation Centre, a small and light EV robot, developed by Delivers AI, will also soon be out daily delivering parcels with the support of the local courier. This summer, residents on a chosen streets in Barnsley will have the option to have all their parcels delivered by these robots for the three-month trial. Residents will have the option to sign up for the trial via a dedicated website.",[],{"type":126,"text":5119,"spans":5120,"direction":112},"These robots can be deployed 24 hours a day, allowing for night-time deliveries for consumers on different schedules, or more on-demand services with designated time slots for consumers. The robots can also be used to support consumers who need more time to get to the door. Evri expects to uncover unexpected benefits as part of the trial.",[],{"type":126,"text":5122,"spans":5123,"direction":112},"Additionally, Evri will be taking the robot into local schools to demonstrate its capabilities to young children and give them the chance to name the robot.",[5124],{"start":5125,"end":3544,"type":279,"data":5126},49,{"link_type":281,"url":1836,"target":283},{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":5128,"direction":112},[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":5130,"primary":5131,"id":4910,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":5132,"quoteSource":5133},"We're incredibly proud to be hosting the trial run for this programme in Barnsley, which aligns with the ambition in our new Inclusive Economic Growth Strategy to become the UK's leading digital town. This is an amazing piece of innovation that could revolutionise home deliveries and we wish Evri the best of luck with the trial.","Councillor Robin Franklin, Barnsley Council's Cabinet spokesperson for Regeneration and Culture",{"id":5135,"uid":5136,"url":5137,"type":50,"href":5138,"tags":5139,"first_publication_date":5140,"last_publication_date":5140,"slugs":5141,"linked_documents":5143,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":5144,"data":5145},"Z-afJREAACAAQ2zw","pawcel-service-evri-launches-robot-dog-deliveries","\u002Fpress\u002Fpawcel-service-evri-launches-robot-dog-deliveries","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22Z-afJREAACAAQ2zw%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2025-04-01T07:13:39+0000",[5142],"paw-cel-service-evri-launches-robot-dog-deliveries",[],[],{"title":5146,"category":8,"metaDescription":5147,"canonical":5148,"titleTag":5149,"featuredImage":5150,"publishedDate":5161,"slices":5162},"Paw-cel service: Evri launches robot dog deliveries","Read here about Evri's launch of robot dog","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fpawcel-service-evri-launches-robot-dog-deliveries","Paw-cel service: Evri launches robot dog deliveries | Evri",{"dimensions":5151,"alt":5152,"copyright":8,"url":5153,"id":5154,"edit":5155,"thumbnail":5156},{"width":65,"height":65},"A blue dog collar next to a blue dog bowl with the Evri logo","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ-agf3dAxsiBwC4f_dog-bowl-fun2.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,0,998,998&w=960&h=960","Z-agf3dAxsiBwC4f",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":5157,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":5158,"id":5154,"edit":5159},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ-agf3dAxsiBwC4f_dog-bowl-fun2.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,262,998,473&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":5160,"zoom":33,"background":71},262,"2025-04-01",[5163,5180,5185],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":5164,"primary":5166,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[5165],{},{"content":5167},[5168,5171,5174,5177],{"type":126,"text":5169,"spans":5170,"direction":112},"The future of parcel delivery has arrived, and it’s got four legs and a wagging tail! Evri, the UK’s largest parcel delivery firm is announcing the launch of a new robotic delivery dog, bringing a whole new meaning to the term “man’s best friend.” ",[],{"type":126,"text":5172,"spans":5173,"direction":112},"These state-of-the-art robotic couriers are designed to fetch and carry parcels straight to customers’ doors with speed, agility, and an impeccable sense of direction. ",[],{"type":126,"text":5175,"spans":5176,"direction":112},"Equipped with AI-powered navigation, obstacle detection, and a tail-waggingly good attitude, these high-tech hounds will sniff out the most efficient routes and ensure packages are delivered in record time. Whether tackling stairs, braving the weather, or dodging rogue wheelie bins, Evri’s Robo-Dogs are trained to go the extra mile - without ever stopping for a belly rub. ",[],{"type":126,"text":5178,"spans":5179,"direction":112},"Unlike their furry counterparts, these pups don’t need walking, feeding, or treats - though they do appreciate a “good boy” now and then. Customers can track their paws-itively futuristic delivery in real time, watching their Robo-Dog trot up to their doorstep with their latest online order. ",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":5181,"primary":5183,"id":4197,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[5182],{},{"quoteText":5184,"quoteSource":3899},"We’re always looking for innovative ways to enhance our delivery experience, and what could be better than a delivery dog to play fetch with those all-important parcels. Our Robo-Dogs are efficient, reliable, and any human’s best friend delivering alongside our couriers, most importantly, they won’t chew your slippers. This is a game-changer for last-mile delivery, and we can’t wait for customers to see our couriers and their new robotic sidekicks in action.",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":5186,"primary":5187,"id":4632,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":5188},[5189,5192,5195],{"type":126,"text":5190,"spans":5191,"direction":112},"Not only are these robotic retrievers revolutionising deliveries, but they’re also helping Evri on keep its carbon paw-print in check. Fully electric, robo-dogs are a lower carbon solution for eco-conscious customers who want their parcels delivered without adding to their carbon paw-print. ",[],{"type":126,"text":5193,"spans":5194,"direction":112},"Watch this space to find out more about Evri’s plans to unleash robo-dogs. Customers lucky enough to receive a robo-pup delivery from Evri will be the first in the UK to experience a delivery of this kind, and the ulti-mutt convenience of high-tech home delivery. ",[],{"type":126,"text":5196,"spans":5197,"direction":112},"Keep your eyes peeled and your doorbells ready—because when Evri says “fetch”, these dogs deliver! ",[],{"id":5199,"uid":5200,"url":5201,"type":50,"href":5202,"tags":5203,"first_publication_date":5204,"last_publication_date":5205,"slugs":5206,"linked_documents":5207,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":5208,"data":5209},"Z3afgBAAACAAsTlX","evri-reports-best-ever-christmas-and-peak-trading","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-reports-best-ever-christmas-and-peak-trading","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22Z3afgBAAACAAsTlX%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2025-01-02T20:06:51+0000","2025-02-13T08:23:53+0000",[5200],[],[],{"title":5210,"category":8,"metaDescription":5211,"canonical":5212,"titleTag":5213,"featuredImage":5214,"publishedDate":5224,"slices":5225},"Evri reports best-ever Christmas and peak trading","Read here about Evri's best-ever Christmas and peak trading","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-reports-best-ever-christmas-and-peak-trading","Evri reports best-ever Christmas and peak trading | Evri",{"dimensions":5215,"alt":5216,"copyright":8,"url":5217,"id":5218,"edit":5219,"thumbnail":5220},{"width":65,"height":865},"A female courier dressed in an Evri uniform stands in front of a blue Evri van. She is posing with a parcel in her hands.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6y_05bqstJ9-iMl_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9407.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6y_05bqstJ9-iMl",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":5221,"alt":5216,"copyright":8,"url":5222,"id":5218,"edit":5223},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6y_05bqstJ9-iMl_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9407.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2025-01-03",[5226,5252,5256,5277],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":5227,"primary":5229,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[5228],{},{"content":5230},[5231,5236,5241,5246,5249],{"type":109,"text":5232,"spans":5233,"direction":112},"Investment in operations and service of around £35m helps deliver record 173 million parcels in the nine weeks to 28 December 2024 [1], up 12% on last year",[5234],{"start":32,"end":5235,"type":163},155,{"type":109,"text":5237,"spans":5238,"direction":112},"Evri delivered biggest-ever individual trading week for parcels of 24.7m, as customers grabbed Black Friday (29 November 2024) bargains during a price-focused ‘thrift-mas’ [2]",[5239],{"start":32,"end":5240,"type":163},175,{"type":109,"text":5242,"spans":5243,"direction":112},"Almost 4,000 parcels delivered to UK households every minute in peak delivery weeks",[5244],{"start":32,"end":5245,"type":163},83,{"type":126,"text":5247,"spans":5248,"direction":112},"Evri delivered record parcel volumes over its peak festive period, including its best-ever week following Black Friday, as customers shopped for bargains in a ‘thrift-mas’ amidst caution over household budgets.",[],{"type":126,"text":5250,"spans":5251,"direction":112},"The biggest week in its 50-year history saw Evri deliver 24.7m parcels (to 7 December 2024) as post-Black Friday deliveries rose by 20.8% on the same period in 2023. This ‘mega-week’ was followed by weeks of high demand post Black Friday and Cyber Monday as consumers left it late to grab deals from online retailers, putting their trust in last-minute deliveries, while Evri’s standard on-time service levels also remained strong.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":5253,"primary":5254,"id":148,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":5255,"quoteSource":147},"We continue to see fast growth towards our five-year target to become a billion parcel a year business and the Christmas trading period was no exception with our delivery volumes demonstrating that retailers online offerings fared much better than expected. We saw record volumes of deliveries and double digit growth as generous shoppers treated loved ones and friends.\n\nDuring a festive season that saw approximately 40 million UK adults doing most of their Christmas shopping online, the investments in our network and customer service paid off – sustaining our yearly average of more than 99% of standard parcels being delivered on time. We recruited an extra 9,000 people to prepare for our busiest trading period and our amazing couriers and colleagues stopped at nothing as they came together to deliver for our retail clients and shoppers.",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":5257,"primary":5258,"id":5276,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":5259},[5260,5262,5264,5267,5270,5273],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":5261,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":5263,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":5265,"spans":5266,"direction":112},"Evri grew total parcel volumes by 12% to 173 million over the nine weeks to 28 December 2024, despite the disruption caused by volatile weather, such as Storm Darragh in early December. On average Evri delivered 2.7 million parcels a day over this period as almost 4,000 parcels reached UK households every minute, with deliveries rising to almost 3.8 million on its busiest day on December 4th.",[],{"type":126,"text":5268,"spans":5269,"direction":112},"Growth was broad based across segments with Evri an integral part of the supply chains across the market. Volume from domestic retailers was up 6.9%, while overseas inbound trade from online retailers and marketplaces continued to deliver strong growth, with volumes up 24.0% year on year as customers focussed on value.",[],{"type":126,"text":5271,"spans":5272,"direction":112},"Evri also saw strong demand from its eCommerce segment as the growth in online marketplaces and social media shopping continues to be a growing part of consumers’ retail habits.",[],{"type":126,"text":5274,"spans":5275,"direction":112},"This resilient performance reflects Evri’s investment of around £35m during the Peak period to enhance its operations with more delivery units and 8,000 extra couriers recruited, with another 1,000 added across other parts of the business. It also boosted its customer service to make it easier for customers to contact the company, in addition to providing new delivery preference options for people with accessibility needs.",[],"rich_text$1f7c7459-40f8-4dd7-89d5-19cb476b7164",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":5278,"primary":5279,"id":245,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":5280},[5281,5283,5288],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":5282,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":5284,"spans":5285,"direction":112},"[1] Peak trading period being the nine weeks ended 28 December 2024, comparative period being the nine weeks ended 30 Dec 2023",[5286],{"start":32,"end":5287,"type":1324},126,{"type":126,"text":5289,"spans":5290,"direction":112},"[1] Research taken from survey of 2000 UK Respondents (Nat Rep 18+), conducted between 29.11.2024 - 02.12.2024 highlighted that 33% would shop for more discounted items during Christmas 2024, with 15% shopping on Black Friday and 7% looking for Cyber Monday deals",[5291],{"start":32,"end":5292,"type":1324},263,{"id":5294,"uid":5295,"url":5296,"type":50,"href":5297,"tags":5298,"first_publication_date":5299,"last_publication_date":5299,"slugs":5300,"linked_documents":5301,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":5302,"data":5303},"Z3ai_BAAACAAsT9i","evri-becomes-first-in-logistics-to-adopt-new-daf-xb-electric-truck","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-becomes-first-in-logistics-to-adopt-new-daf-xb-electric-truck","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22Z3ai_BAAACAAsT9i%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2025-01-02T14:35:11+0000",[5295],[],[],{"title":5304,"category":8,"metaDescription":5305,"canonical":5306,"titleTag":5307,"featuredImage":5308,"publishedDate":5317,"slices":5318},"Evri becomes first in logistics to adopt new DAF XB electric truck","Read here about Evri's adoption of new DAF XB electric truck","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-becomes-first-in-logistics-to-adopt-new-daf-xb-electric-truck","Evri becomes first in logistics to adopt new DAF XB electric truck | Evri",{"dimensions":5309,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":5310,"id":5311,"edit":5312,"thumbnail":5313},{"width":65,"height":1242},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F63444938-7b70-4f6d-be5d-549447bd4253_Evri+branded+trucks.png?auto=format,compress&rect=0,0,6000,4500&w=960&h=720","ZGYjqxEAAB4A9vFy",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":5314,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":5315,"id":5311,"edit":5316},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F63444938-7b70-4f6d-be5d-549447bd4253_Evri+branded+trucks.png?auto=format,compress&rect=0,828,6000,2844&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":4561,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2024-12-17",[5319,5385,5390],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":5320,"primary":5322,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[5321],{},{"content":5323},[5324,5327,5330,5333,5336,5338,5341,5344,5347,5349,5352,5356,5360,5364,5368,5370,5373,5376,5379,5382],{"type":109,"text":5325,"spans":5326,"direction":112},"Evri is first in logistics to integrate new DAF XB Electric truck into its fleet",[],{"type":109,"text":5328,"spans":5329,"direction":112},"Truck has 300km range, supporting parcel firm’s goal of zero-emission logistics",[],{"type":109,"text":5331,"spans":5332,"direction":112},"Also plays key role in decarbonizing middle-mile vehicles",[],{"type":109,"text":5334,"spans":5335,"direction":112},"The vehicle will operate in real-world conditions, contributing to Evri’s sustainability targets",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":5337,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":5339,"spans":5340,"direction":112},"Building on its extensive sustainability initiatives, the UK’s biggest dedicated parcel delivery company has taken another step towards sustainable innovation.",[],{"type":126,"text":5342,"spans":5343,"direction":112},"Becoming one of the first companies to integrate the new DAF XB Electric truck into its operations, Evri has announced the cutting-edge electric vehicle will begin operating from its Southampton depot. ",[],{"type":126,"text":5345,"spans":5346,"direction":112},"Designed and produced by Leyland Trucks, the DAF XB Electric represents the future of sustainable urban transport, with the parcel firm’s model forming part of a limited ‘early adopter’ program of just 10 vehicles, marking the final development phase before full-scale production commences in 2025. ",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":5348,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":5350,"spans":5351,"direction":112},"Key highlights of the new DAF XB Electric truck include:  ",[],{"type":1049,"text":5353,"spans":5354,"direction":112},"Range & Charging: An impressive range of up to 300km, supported by on-site charging at the Southampton depot and an Adams Morey fast charger nearby.",[5355],{"start":32,"end":405,"type":163},{"type":1049,"text":5357,"spans":5358,"direction":112},"Payload: Accommodates a 16-pallet body size, ideal for urban distribution. ",[5359],{"start":32,"end":4929,"type":163},{"type":1049,"text":5361,"spans":5362,"direction":112},"Energy Efficiency: Equipped with 282kWh batteries and a PACCAR EX-M2 190kW motor for optimised performance. The truck allows both overnight AC charging (22kW) and fast DC charging (up to 150kW). ",[5363],{"start":32,"end":362,"type":163},{"type":1049,"text":5365,"spans":5366,"direction":112},"Sustainability Leadership: By adopting this first-of-its-kind model, Evri is leading the industry’s transition to zero-emissions logistics. ",[5367],{"start":32,"end":346,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":5369,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":5371,"spans":5372,"direction":112},"The vehicle will operate under real-world conditions with regular customer deliveries, as part of Evri’s ongoing efforts to assess and scale sustainable transport options.",[],{"type":126,"text":5374,"spans":5375,"direction":112},"This truck is a key step towards achieving zero emissions in the company’s ‘middle mile’ vehicles, which have previously posed one of the main fleet technology challenges due to range limitations.",[],{"type":126,"text":5377,"spans":5378,"direction":112},"Performance will be closely monitored by the Product Development team at Leyland Trucks, ensuring seamless integration and fine-tuning, before the truck enters full production. ",[],{"type":126,"text":5380,"spans":5381,"direction":112},"Evri’s adoption of the DAF XB Electric builds on the company’s broader sustainability efforts, including a £19 million investment to expand its fleet of e-cargo bikes and electric vehicles.",[],{"type":126,"text":5383,"spans":5384,"direction":112},"In the 2023-2024 financial year alone, Evri achieved a 21% carbon reduction per parcel, reinforcing its ambition to deliver all parcels using alternative fuels by 2035. ",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":5386,"primary":5387,"id":148,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":5388,"quoteSource":5389},"The DAF XB Electric joining our depot network marks an important milestone in our low-carbon fleet strategy.\nThe launch means we now have a sustainable solution for every stage of the parcel journey, from local deliveries with e-bikes and vans to long-distance trunking. \nThis integration completes our fleet, offering a fully low-carbon solution across all fleet types.","David Landy, Head of Fleet at Evri",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":5391,"primary":5392,"id":5395,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":5393,"quoteSource":5394},"Evri is proud to be at the forefront of sustainable delivery innovation. Adopting the new DAF XB Electric ahead of full production demonstrates our commitment to reducing our environmental impact while maintaining operational excellence.","Pauline Potter, Director of Transformation at Evri","quote$a5e5a0c0-b9c2-4e6e-b278-04687bd9414f",{"id":5397,"uid":5398,"url":5399,"type":50,"href":5400,"tags":5401,"first_publication_date":5402,"last_publication_date":5403,"slugs":5404,"linked_documents":5405,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":5406,"data":5407},"Z3ahsRAAACIAsT0X","return-to-sender-four-million-gifts-to-be-sent-back-in-january-2025","\u002Fpress\u002Freturn-to-sender-four-million-gifts-to-be-sent-back-in-january-2025","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22Z3ahsRAAACIAsT0X%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2025-01-02T14:29:53+0000","2025-02-13T08:25:42+0000",[5398],[],[],{"title":5408,"category":8,"metaDescription":5409,"canonical":5410,"titleTag":5411,"featuredImage":5412,"publishedDate":5424,"slices":5425},"Return to sender: four million gifts to be sent back in January 2025","Read here about Evri's prediction for the busiest 'returns season'","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Freturn-to-sender-four-million-gifts-to-be-sent-back-in-january-2025","Return to sender: four million gifts to be sent back in January 2025 | Evri",{"dimensions":5413,"alt":5415,"copyright":8,"url":5416,"id":5417,"edit":5418,"thumbnail":5419},{"width":65,"height":5414},546,"An Evri ParcelShop is in full view with its blue signage and a customer is walking up the accesssbility ramp and holding a parcel.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf__EVRI_LOCATION_03_3111.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,6400,3640&w=960&h=546","Z6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf_",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":5420,"alt":5415,"copyright":8,"url":5421,"id":5417,"edit":5422},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf__EVRI_LOCATION_03_3111.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,304,6400,3033&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":5423,"zoom":33,"background":71},304,"2024-12-27",[5426,5473],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":5427,"primary":5429,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[5428],{},{"content":5430},[5431,5435,5439,5443,5446,5449,5452,5455,5457,5461,5465,5469],{"type":109,"text":5432,"spans":5433,"direction":112},"More than four million parcels to be returned in January",[5434],{"start":32,"end":2855,"type":163},{"type":109,"text":5436,"spans":5437,"direction":112},"Numbers of returns more than double after Christmas",[5438],{"start":32,"end":1671,"type":163},{"type":109,"text":5440,"spans":5441,"direction":112},"Evri offers advice to consumers on returns",[5442],{"start":32,"end":1161,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":5444,"spans":5445,"direction":112},"After Christmas, many people find themselves facing the all-too-familiar disappointment of receiving gifts that don’t fit, match their style, or is something they already have. Whether it’s a pair of shoes two sizes too big, or an ill-judged slogan tee, unwanted gifts will be heading back to retailers in droves this January.",[],{"type":126,"text":5447,"spans":5448,"direction":112},"Evri, the UK’s biggest dedicated parcel company which delivers 800 million parcels a year, has examined its own parcel data and planning experts predict the busiest returns season on record with a staggering four million parcels likely to be returned in January alone. Last year, more than a million parcels were returned in the week commencing 31st December 2023 and a total of 3.9 million returns were handled in the 4 weeks following Christmas – more than double the typical numbers of returns.",[],{"type":126,"text":5450,"spans":5451,"direction":112},"Depending on the retailer’s policy, you may have as little as 14 days to return an unwanted gift, which might mean getting out of your pyjamas on those days between Christmas and New Year when everyone forgets what day of the week it is. Experts at Evri also estimate around half of retailers still offer free returns, but it’s worth checking before you send.",[],{"type":126,"text":5453,"spans":5454,"direction":112},"January can be a difficult month, with a longer gap between pay days so consumers are expected to be watching every penny coming back into their bank account. Evri urges consumers to follow some simple tips, so they get their money back and don’t miss out:",[],{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":5456,"direction":112},[],{"type":1049,"text":5458,"spans":5459,"direction":112},"Check the policy. Check your retailer’s return and exchange policy and pay particular attention to the deadline for getting the items back to them. Some retailers may give consumers as little as 14 days to return unwanted items whilst some may extend this for the Christmas period. Either way, be sure to check and set a reminder in your phone so you don’t miss it.",[5460],{"start":32,"end":362,"type":163},{"type":1049,"text":5462,"spans":5463,"direction":112},"Reuse packaging. Reusing existing packaging is more sustainable but be aware, it’s important to remove or cover up old barcodes and labels as parcels are handled by automated scanners which might get confused by multiple barcodes.",[5464],{"start":32,"end":405,"type":163},{"type":1049,"text":5466,"spans":5467,"direction":112},"Make it secure. Whether you use old packaging or new, make sure there are no loose or torn edges which could get stuck in machinery. Include an address inside the parcel as a precaution in case the label becomes unreadable. However, it’s important not to put sticky tape over the barcode itself as that can make it difficult to scan and cause delays.",[5468],{"start":32,"end":277,"type":163},{"type":1049,"text":5470,"spans":5471,"direction":112},"Check your local returns point. Evri has near 17,000 ParcelShops and Lockers that can be used for returns, many of which are open longer hours and most are open between Christmas and New Year. 95% of the UK’s urban population are within a 5-minute walk of an Evri drop-off point, so there’s a good reason to get some step in, in the post-Christmas slump.",[5472],{"start":32,"end":4070,"type":163},{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":5474,"primary":5475,"id":148,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":5476,"quoteSource":5477},"If you need to send an unwanted gift back, don’t miss the returns window. It’s easy to return items as we have one of the largest drop-off networks in the UK with almost 17,000 ParcelShops and Lockers including more than 3,200 Post Office branches, as well as Tesco stores and independent convenience stores. Most locations are open between Christmas and New Year, so there’s no need to make it a future-you problem.","Ros Hunt, Director of Ecommerce at Evri",{"id":5479,"uid":5480,"url":5481,"type":50,"href":5482,"tags":5483,"first_publication_date":5484,"last_publication_date":5485,"slugs":5486,"linked_documents":5487,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":5488,"data":5489},"Z1aTeRIAACIA3jDu","evri-boosts-website-accessibility-using-ai","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-boosts-website-accessibility-using-ai","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22Z1aTeRIAACIA3jDu%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2024-12-09T06:55:33+0000","2025-02-13T08:28:14+0000",[5480],[],[],{"title":5490,"category":8,"metaDescription":5491,"canonical":5492,"titleTag":5493,"featuredImage":5494,"publishedDate":5504,"slices":5505},"Evri boosts website accessibility using AI","Read here about how Evri has boosted its website accessibility using AI","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-boosts-website-accessibility-using-ai","Evri boosts website accessibility using AI | Evri",{"dimensions":5495,"alt":5496,"copyright":8,"url":5497,"id":5498,"edit":5499,"thumbnail":5500},{"width":65,"height":865},"A woman is sat at home at her desk smiling looking at her laptop screen","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdBZbqstJ9-inZ_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7819.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6zdBZbqstJ9-inZ",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":5501,"alt":5496,"copyright":8,"url":5502,"id":5498,"edit":5503},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdBZbqstJ9-inZ_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7819.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2024-12-09",[5506,5543,5548,5558],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":5507,"primary":5509,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[5508],{},{"content":5510},[5511,5515,5519,5523,5525,5528,5531,5534,5537,5540],{"type":109,"text":5512,"spans":5513,"direction":112},"One in four home deliveries go to disabled consumers",[5514],{"start":32,"end":684,"type":163},{"type":109,"text":5516,"spans":5517,"direction":112},"First in parcel industry to partner with market leader accessiBe",[5518],{"start":32,"end":3236,"type":163},{"type":109,"text":5520,"spans":5521,"direction":112},"Widget uses AI to adjust website, including seizure-safe profiles",[5522],{"start":32,"end":629,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":5524,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":5526,"spans":5527,"direction":112},"Evri, is the UK’s biggest dedicated parcel delivery company, delivering over 730 million parcels each year, has today announced a new partnership with accessiBe, a leader in web accessibility solutions, to improve website accessibility using artificial intelligence (AI).",[],{"type":126,"text":5529,"spans":5530,"direction":112},"Last month, Evri announced a new ambition to become the most accessible parcel delivery company in the UK as it estimates one in four home deliveries go to disabled consumers.",[],{"type":126,"text":5532,"spans":5533,"direction":112},"accessiBe was founded in 2018 and works with brands such as British Airways, BMW and Nintendo. Evri is the first major UK parcel delivery company leveraging accessiBe to promote digital inclusion and empower disabled consumers to use its website, including tracking, delivery preferences, and booking a courier collection.",[],{"type":126,"text":5535,"spans":5536,"direction":112},"The website widget uses AI technology to give consumers control over their website experience. It enables users to choose from several profiles that automatically implement recommended adjustments. These include a seizure-safe profile to pause all animation; a vision-impaired profile to enhance visuals, adjust contrast and modify colour; and an ADHD-friendly profile to enhance focus and reduce distractions. In addition to the pre-set profile, the interface offers dozens of custom adjustments such as keyboard navigation, text magnification, font size and contrast adjustments, sound muting, and image hiding.",[],{"type":126,"text":5538,"spans":5539,"direction":112},"This enhancement is Evri’s latest move on its journey towards accessibility. In October, Evri launched improved doorstep preferences allowing disabled consumers to request more time to get to the door and to ring the doorbell instead of knocking. Consumers can now add preferences to their account which will apply to every Evri parcel delivery.",[],{"type":126,"text":5541,"spans":5542,"direction":112},"Evri has also commissioned a full website audit to understand how to further improve the accessibility of its website. These commitments build on existing partnerships. Evri has worked with the Research Institute for Disabled Consumers since 2023 to conduct accessibility research and has also worked with other organisations to conduct website accessibility audits and with charities to create employment opportunities for disabled people.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":5544,"primary":5545,"id":148,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":5546,"quoteSource":5547},"Every customer matters, and every parcel matters. We know through our own research that one in four people rely on home deliveries to maintain their independence or improve the quality of their life. I’m proud of the updates we launched last month, giving disabled consumers even more control over their doorstep experience and this latest improvement to our website, brings Evri another step closer on its mission to become the most accessible parcel delivery company. We will continue to listen to customers, colleagues and couriers over the next few years, making sure Evri better serves our communities.","Chris Ashworth, Chief Customer Officer at Evri",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":5549,"primary":5550,"id":5557,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":5551},[5552,5554],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":5553,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":5555,"spans":5556,"direction":112},"-\n",[],"rich_text$15228c77-2860-47fa-a321-a04bc63d5bf5",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":5559,"primary":5560,"id":5563,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":5561,"quoteSource":5562},"With 24% of the UK population living with disabilities in an increasingly digital world, it is essential that we ensure accessible online services. We’re excited to partner with Evri to integrate our web accessibility solutions into their platform, creating a more inclusive, seamless, and customer-friendly experience.","Dekel Skoop, CEO at accessiBe","quote$213ccb21-8578-41c6-8fd7-f532ddc4d1c2",{"id":5565,"uid":5566,"url":5567,"type":50,"href":5568,"tags":5569,"first_publication_date":5570,"last_publication_date":5571,"slugs":5572,"linked_documents":5573,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":5574,"data":5575},"Z0849xAAAEM6gjrn","evri-and-gmb-union-deliver-ground-breaking-courier-pay-deal","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-and-gmb-union-deliver-ground-breaking-courier-pay-deal","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22Z0849xAAAEM6gjrn%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2024-12-04T00:01:48+0000","2025-02-13T09:12:56+0000",[5566],[],[],{"title":5576,"category":8,"metaDescription":5577,"canonical":5578,"titleTag":5579,"featuredImage":5580,"publishedDate":5590,"slices":5591},"Evri and GMB Union deliver ground-breaking courier pay deal","Read here about the ground-breaking courier pay deal delivered by Evri and GMB Union","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-and-gmb-union-deliver-ground-breaking-courier-pay-deal","Evri and GMB Union deliver ground-breaking courier pay deal | Evri",{"dimensions":5581,"alt":5582,"copyright":8,"url":5583,"id":5584,"edit":5585,"thumbnail":5586},{"width":65,"height":865},"An Evri courier is handing three parcels to a man at his doorstep. They are both laughing as if a funny joke or anecdote was shared.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdKZbqstJ9-inz_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8362.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6zdKZbqstJ9-inz",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":5587,"alt":5582,"copyright":8,"url":5588,"id":5584,"edit":5589},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdKZbqstJ9-inz_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8362.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2024-12-04",[5592,5630,5635,5643,5648],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":5593,"primary":5595,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[5594],{},{"content":5596},[5597,5601,5605,5610,5612,5615,5618,5621,5624,5627],{"type":109,"text":5598,"spans":5599,"direction":112},"Industry first initiative will provide self-employed couriers with insurance-backed paid sick leave",[5600],{"start":32,"end":1025,"type":163},{"type":109,"text":5602,"spans":5603,"direction":112},"Pay offer worth millions, including festive support payments",[5604],{"start":32,"end":3697,"type":163},{"type":109,"text":5606,"spans":5607,"direction":112},"Comprehensive benefits package including paid holidays, guaranteed rates of pay, pension contributions and parental leave",[5608],{"start":32,"end":5609,"type":163},121,{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":5611,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":5613,"spans":5614,"direction":112},"Evri, the UK’s biggest parcel delivery company, and GMB Union have today announced a ground-breaking pay deal for the union’s couriers – an industry first that will give its self-employed couriers access to paid sick leave*.",[],{"type":126,"text":5616,"spans":5617,"direction":112},"Under the new pay deal Evri’s eligible “self-employed plus” (SE+) couriers who are members of GMB Union will receive:",[],{"type":109,"text":5619,"spans":5620,"direction":112},"Festive support payments of up to £950 for SE+ GMB Union members",[],{"type":109,"text":5622,"spans":5623,"direction":112},"Fully subsidised death, disability, accident and sickness insurance starting January 25th providing financial protection against unforeseen circumstances ",[],{"type":109,"text":5625,"spans":5626,"direction":112},"Access to qualified accountants for assistance with VAT returns",[],{"type":126,"text":5628,"spans":5629,"direction":112},"Couriers not yet enrolled in the SE+ scheme will have the opportunity to join starting from January 2025.  ",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":5631,"primary":5632,"id":148,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":5633,"quoteSource":5634},"Our couriers are highly valued as the engine of our business. We’ve been proud to lead the industry in offering self-employed workers greater protection and benefits since 2019. This latest ground-breaking deal is a significant step forwards demonstrating our commitment to supporting couriers financially and with a raft of protection and benefits, including sick pay for our SE+ workers in an industry first.","Martijn De Lange, CEO, Evri",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":5636,"primary":5637,"id":5557,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":5638},[5639,5641],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":5640,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":5555,"spans":5642,"direction":112},[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":5644,"primary":5645,"id":5563,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":5646,"quoteSource":5647},"Securing sickness payments for thousands of couriers is a huge step forward. Once again GMB has shown the difference unions can make in the modern world of work.","Gill Ogilvie, GMB Lead Organiser",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":5649,"primary":5650,"id":5672,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":5651},[5652,5654,5657,5660,5663,5666,5669],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":5653,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":5655,"spans":5656,"direction":112},"Today’s announcement follows Evri’s launch of its inaugural (SE+) courier model in September 2019. This remains the UK’s only union-backed courier initiative.",[],{"type":126,"text":5658,"spans":5659,"direction":112},"The pioneering SE+ scheme provides access to 28 days paid holiday, guaranteed national minimum wage, pension contributions, parental leave and additional flexible benefits.",[],{"type":126,"text":5661,"spans":5662,"direction":112},"Earlier this year, Evri also partnered with flexible benefits platform, Onsi, to enhance its offering to couriers introducing:",[],{"type":109,"text":5664,"spans":5665,"direction":112},"Wellbeing support, which offers couriers benefits like Digital GP, Digital Physio and support for mental health, finances, and family.",[],{"type":109,"text":5667,"spans":5668,"direction":112},"Discounts, to provide couriers with deals to save on everyday expenses",[],{"type":109,"text":5670,"spans":5671,"direction":112},"Financial management support which provides early access to wages.",[],"rich_text$81fdc700-f197-4c89-a931-6423a691f6c2",{"id":5674,"uid":5675,"url":5676,"type":50,"href":5677,"tags":5678,"first_publication_date":5679,"last_publication_date":5680,"slugs":5681,"linked_documents":5682,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":5683,"data":5684},"Z0cHrBAAACUAdkal","evri-invests-32m-in-service-enhancements-ahead-of-peak","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-invests-32m-in-service-enhancements-ahead-of-peak","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22Z0cHrBAAACUAdkal%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2024-11-27T12:00:16+0000","2025-02-13T09:12:40+0000",[5675],[],[],{"title":5685,"category":8,"metaDescription":5686,"canonical":5687,"titleTag":5688,"featuredImage":5689,"publishedDate":5699,"slices":5700},"Evri invests £32m in service enhancements ahead of peak","Read here about Evri's £32m investment into service enhancements ahead of peak","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-invests-32m-in-service-enhancements-ahead-of-peak","Evri invests £32m in service enhancements ahead of peak | Evri",{"dimensions":5690,"alt":5691,"copyright":8,"url":5692,"id":5693,"edit":5694,"thumbnail":5695},{"width":65,"height":865},"An Evri courier smiling and posing for the camera in a residential area holding a parcel.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6thBpbqstJ9-e9Y_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6183.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6thBpbqstJ9-e9Y",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":5696,"alt":5691,"copyright":8,"url":5697,"id":5693,"edit":5698},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6thBpbqstJ9-e9Y_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6183.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2024-11-27",[5701,5752],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":5702,"primary":5704,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[5703],{},{"content":5705},[5706,5711,5715,5719,5721,5728,5731,5734,5737,5740,5743,5746,5749],{"type":126,"text":5707,"spans":5708,"direction":112},"·       £32m invested in service and operational improvements since 2023.",[5709],{"start":321,"end":5710,"type":163},73,{"type":126,"text":5712,"spans":5713,"direction":112},"·       Investment comes as Evri announces plans to reach 1 billion parcels within 5 years.",[5714],{"start":321,"end":3231,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":5716,"spans":5717,"direction":112},"·       9000 jobs created in Evri’s biggest ever recruitment drive 2,500 more than last year.",[5718],{"start":321,"end":322,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":5720,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":5722,"spans":5723,"direction":112},"Wednesday 27th  November2024: Evri, the UK’s biggest dedicated parcel delivery company has finalised its preparations for another record-breaking peak following a £32 million investment in service enhancements, with further investment intended totalling £57 million by the end of 2025.",[5724,5725],{"start":32,"end":2883,"type":163},{"start":2883,"end":5726,"type":279,"data":5727},34,{"link_type":281,"url":4384,"target":283},{"type":126,"text":5729,"spans":5730,"direction":112},"Last year Evri  handled over 730 million parcels  with 99% delivered successfully on time. These latest investments in the operation and customer service ahead of the Christmas period will help ensure it continues to deliver this high level of service for retailers and consumers.",[],{"type":126,"text":5732,"spans":5733,"direction":112},"The delivery giant expects that  on its busiest it day will handle more than 3.7 million parcels but has capacity to handle up to 4.2 million if needed. Preparations for this began in July when Evri announced it was looking for an additional 9,000 people to join the business, that included 8,000 couriers, its biggest ever courier recruitment drive and, 2,000 workers for across its hubs and depots.",[],{"type":126,"text":5735,"spans":5736,"direction":112},"As well as investing in people, Evri has also invested in its infrastructure, relocating three depots in Tyneside, Pen-y-bont and Sheffield. The moves mean that Evri is able to to increase their capacity in those locations by more than 200,000 parcels combined. Sheffield represented a £2.5million investment, with a 132,000 sq ft of space and created 23 new jobs for the area.",[],{"type":126,"text":5738,"spans":5739,"direction":112}," The business has also upgraded 60 of its smaller more localised delivery units as well as introducing new locations to handle increased volumes.",[],{"type":126,"text":5741,"spans":5742,"direction":112},"Evri’s out of home network now spans over 16,000 locations including 3200 Post Offices following the partnership last year, its aiming to add another 1200 to this before the end of the 2024. This expansive network means consumers now have more convenience and choice to fit round their busy Christmas schedules when it comes to sending, receiving or retuning their parcels.",[],{"type":126,"text":5744,"spans":5745,"direction":112},"Last year Evri announced it had invested £10m in its customer service operation, launching new ways to make contact by phone or online, throughout 2024 the business has continued to invest in this area, listening to customers to continuously improve its service with a customer satisfaction score of 86. Evri has also been awarded more than three million five-star ratings on Trustpilot and customers using Evri’s own app rate them 4.7 out of 5.",[],{"type":126,"text":5747,"spans":5748,"direction":112},"Evri also recently announced its partnership with Scope with the aim of being the most accessible delivery company in the UK, starting with a range of doorstep delivery improvements for people living with a condition or impairment.",[],{"type":126,"text":5750,"spans":5751,"direction":112},"Evri’s delivery preference enhancements, informed by research conducted with the Research Institute of Disabled Consumers (RiDC), include the ability for disabled consumers to request more time to get to the door and to ring the doorbell instead of knocking. Consumers can add preferences to their account which will apply to every Evri parcel delivery and collection. In addition, Evri is testing a screen reader tool on www.evri.com to make its website accessible and inclusive with features such as colour changes and ADHD support.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":5753,"primary":5754,"id":148,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":5755,"quoteSource":5756},"This significant investment underlines Evri's commitment to continuous improvement and ensuring we deliver a seamless experience for both our customers and business partners. \nWith the festive season fast approaching, we know this is an important time for retailers and consumers alike. We've invested heavily to ensure we can continue to deliver our industry-leading on-time delivery rate of 99%. \nBy expanding our network, bolstering our workforce, and investing in innovative technology, we're confident we're well-equipped to handle the ever-increasing demand for parcel deliveries during the peak period.","Ashley Walker, Director of Planning and Infrastructure at Evri",{"id":5758,"uid":5759,"url":5760,"type":50,"href":5761,"tags":5762,"first_publication_date":5763,"last_publication_date":5764,"slugs":5765,"linked_documents":5766,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":5767,"data":5768},"ZzcmwRAAACMAXxKe","evri-delivers-record-year-and-significant-investment-in-customer-service","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-delivers-record-year-and-significant-investment-in-customer-service","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZzcmwRAAACMAXxKe%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2024-11-18T08:10:33+0000","2026-04-10T10:20:42+0000",[5759],[],[],{"title":5769,"category":8,"metaDescription":5770,"canonical":5771,"titleTag":5772,"featuredImage":5773,"publishedDate":5782,"slices":5783},"Evri delivers record year and significant investment in customer service","Read here about Evri's record year and significant investment in customer service","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-delivers-record-year-and-significant-investment-in-customer-service","Evri Delivers Record Year & Customer Service Investment | Evri",{"dimensions":5774,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":5775,"id":5776,"edit":5777,"thumbnail":5778},{"width":65,"height":489},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZqJahR5LeNNTxfrR_promovisual.png?auto=format,compress&rect=0,0,608,342&w=960&h=540","ZqJahR5LeNNTxfrR",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":5779,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":5780,"id":5776,"edit":5781},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZqJahR5LeNNTxfrR_promovisual.png?auto=format,compress&rect=0,27,608,288&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":3553,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2024-11-18",[5784,5790,5846,5850,5861,5867,5943],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":5785,"primary":5789,"id":101,"slice_type":102,"slice_label":8},[5786],{"title":86,"content":8,"pillEnabled":87,"link":5787,"dataGtmTrack":8},{"id":89,"type":90,"tags":5788,"lang":19,"slug":93,"first_publication_date":94,"last_publication_date":95,"uid":96,"url":97,"link_type":98,"key":99,"isBroken":87},[92],{"sectionTitle":8,"sectionDescription":8,"pillEnabled":87,"showPaddingTop":87},{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":5791,"primary":5793,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[5792],{},{"content":5794},[5795,5799,5803,5807,5812,5816,5820,5824,5829,5831,5834,5837,5840,5843],{"type":109,"text":5796,"spans":5797,"direction":112},"Best-ever parcel volumes of over 730 million in 2023-24 with over 99% of standard parcels delivered on-time",[5798],{"start":32,"end":891,"type":163},{"type":109,"text":5800,"spans":5801,"direction":112},"Record adjusted EBITDA[1] of £292m up 33.7%[2]. Revenue up 15.2% to £1.7bn2",[5802],{"start":32,"end":1666,"type":163},{"type":109,"text":5804,"spans":5805,"direction":112},"Profit before tax more than doubled to £119m, compared with £51m in 2022-23",[5806],{"start":32,"end":1666,"type":163},{"type":109,"text":5808,"spans":5809,"direction":112},"£32m investment in customer service and operations in 2023-24, with significant further investment planned for 2024-25",[5810],{"start":32,"end":5811,"type":163},118,{"type":109,"text":5813,"spans":5814,"direction":112},"Strategic partnerships with Amazon Prime, Post Office and Tesco Clubcard to create more convenient and rewarding ways to send and receive parcels.",[5815],{"start":32,"end":1133,"type":163},{"type":109,"text":5817,"spans":5818,"direction":112},"Evri plans to reach 1 billion parcels a year within five years as part of its ambitious growth plans supported by rapid international expansion",[5819],{"start":32,"end":1318,"type":163},{"type":109,"text":5821,"spans":5822,"direction":112},"Apollo Funds completed its acquisition of Evri on 23 August 2024",[5823],{"start":32,"end":3236,"type":163},{"type":109,"text":5825,"spans":5826,"direction":112},"H1 2024-25 revenue of £865m is up 10.6% driven by a broad-based increase in parcel volumes",[5827],{"start":32,"end":5828,"type":163},90,{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":5830,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":5832,"spans":5833,"direction":112},"Evri Limited[1] today announces it grew adjusted EBITDA1 by a third to £292m in its last financial year after a £32m investment in its customer service and operations drove record parcel volumes which outperformed the market.",[],{"type":126,"text":5835,"spans":5836,"direction":112},"The company’s record annual results underline Evri’s continued growth as it unveiled a target to become a billion-parcel-a-year business within five years, by capitalising on parcel volume growth from new retail client wins; its SME proposition; the rising trend for online marketplaces and social media; together with inbound and outbound international expansion.",[],{"type":126,"text":5838,"spans":5839,"direction":112},"As the UK’s biggest dedicated parcel delivery company, Evri grew parcel volumes by 14.9% [1,2] to more than 730m in the 53 weeks to 29 February 2024 [2] – reaching around 85% of UK households - while total revenue rose by 15.2% to more than £1.7bn [2].",[],{"type":126,"text":5841,"spans":5842,"direction":112},"During 2024-25, the company has extended its out-of-home pick-up and drop-off locations to over 16,000. This also now includes branches of the Post Office, which is offering delivery services other than Royal Mail for the first-time in its 360-year history, after it signed a landmark partnership with Evri in 2023.",[],{"type":126,"text":5844,"spans":5845,"direction":112},"Evri is on track to nearly double investments in its operations in fiscal year 2024-25, including significant capital allocation to technology, data and analytics initiatives - designed to continuously improve the customer experience.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":5847,"primary":5848,"id":148,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":5849,"quoteSource":147},"For 50 years we have been delivering parcels and we have never been as relevant, powering the ecommerce ambitions of record numbers of clients, marketplaces, SMEs and consumers. Evri had a record year - delivering more parcels than ever with over 99% arriving on time, a reflection of the ongoing dedication and hard work of our colleagues and couriers.\nThe company’s best-ever year was underpinned by significant investment in our operations and customer service, as well as deepening our relationships with retailers and forging new partnerships.\nThe growth of online marketplaces including value-led market entrants and the rising popularity of pre-loved fashion, which shoppers see as an affordable and sustainable option, have reshaped shopping habits. Our differentiated, flexible business model and focus on service means the business is well placed to take advantage of new consumer trends, such as these.\nThis unique model together with the business’ track record of growth, and progress in executing our ambitious business plan were key factors that attracted Apollo Funds to acquire Evri in August. We are confident of further success under our new owner, who is committed to accelerating our growth strategy. \nWe have been pleased to sustain the strong trading momentum into the current financial year, as we have continued to deliver double-digit revenue growth amid a more positive outlook for ecommerce in the UK and overseas in the short and long term.",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":5851,"primary":5852,"id":5276,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":5853},[5854,5856,5858],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":5855,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":5857,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":5859,"spans":5860,"direction":112},"Today’s results update follow the completed acquisition of Evri by Apollo Funds in August 2024.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":5862,"primary":5863,"id":5866,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":5864,"quoteSource":5865},"Evri has an innovative model, great technology and purpose-built infrastructure for reliable, lower emissions delivery in the fast-growing e-commerce market. Evri puts the customer first, and we are pleased to see this continue to come through in their results, whether measured by on-time parcel volumes, new strategic partnerships, or investments in operations.","Apollo Partner Alex van Hoek","quote$7412fb1c-1c33-4972-9f9a-5582bffae7c4",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":5868,"primary":5869,"id":245,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":5870},[5871,5873,5875,5880,5883,5886,5889,5892,5894,5898,5901,5904,5907,5910,5913,5915,5919,5922,5925,5927,5931,5934,5937,5940],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":5872,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":5874,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":5876,"spans":5877,"direction":112},"Growth platform underpinned by investment",[5878],{"start":32,"end":5879,"type":163},41,{"type":126,"text":5881,"spans":5882,"direction":112},"Evri’s strong performance was driven by investment of over £32m in operations and customer services in 2023-24, including hiring more than 6,500 couriers - to achieve a 99% on-time delivery rate for standard parcels.",[],{"type":126,"text":5884,"spans":5885,"direction":112},"Evri invested more than £10m into improving its customer service functions, as part of its “Answer for everyone” strategy. This included the successful launch of a new chatbot and callback feature to deliver responses to customers within 24 hours, resulting in a marked increase in consumer satisfaction levels.",[],{"type":126,"text":5887,"spans":5888,"direction":112},"Evri’s “self-employed plus” (SE+) courier model is the UK’s only union backed courier initiative, and the scheme has attracted a stable backbone of couriers on SE+, who work regularly for the business on an on-going basis. This pioneering model provides paid holidays, guaranteed rates of pay, pension contributions, parental leave and additional flexible benefits. In addition, during 2023-24, Evri enhanced the support it provides to any new courier joining the business. This includes the introduction of new starter payments to supplement courier earnings during their first few weeks.",[],{"type":126,"text":5890,"spans":5891,"direction":112},"Over the course of 2024-25, Evri plans to invest around £57m to meet growing demand for services and to further improve its operations and the customer journey. This includes adding capacity to its Barnsley ‘Super Hub’, as well as investment in technology and data analytics to improve tracking, operational planning and cyber security.",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":5893,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":5895,"spans":5896,"direction":112},"A growing and more diverse business",[5897],{"start":32,"end":1070,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":5899,"spans":5900,"direction":112},"The company’s growth last year was further underpinned by the successful broadening of its commercial partnerships as well as strengthening its long-term relationships with more than two-thirds of the UK’s biggest retail brands, including JD Sports, Next, and Marks & Spencer.",[],{"type":126,"text":5902,"spans":5903,"direction":112},"Evri signed several new strategic partnerships in 2023-24, unlocking opportunities for volume growth and serving new customer segments.",[],{"type":126,"text":5905,"spans":5906,"direction":112},"·       In May 2023, Evri was made an accredited Seller Fulfilled Prime carrier for Amazon’s Prime service to deliver parcels on behalf of all merchants on their website.",[],{"type":126,"text":5908,"spans":5909,"direction":112},"·       In November 2023, Evri signed a significant deal with Post Office, meaning customers can send, collect, and return Evri parcels over the counter in more than 2,550 Post Office branches currently, with the opportunity for more in the future.",[],{"type":126,"text":5911,"spans":5912,"direction":112},"·       Also in November, Evri entered a new partnership with Tesco, to allow customers to collect Tesco Clubcard points every time they send a parcel with Evri.",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":5914,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":5916,"spans":5917,"direction":112},"Investment in Sustainability",[5918],{"start":32,"end":1981,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":5920,"spans":5921,"direction":112},"Evri is committed to becoming the leading sustainable parcel delivery company – targeting net-zero emissions by 2035, building the largest sustainable fleet in the sector, and using 100% renewable energy.",[],{"type":126,"text":5923,"spans":5924,"direction":112},"In 2024, Evri announced a further £19m multi-year investment in sustainability to drive the company’s ambitions – including growing its fleet of e-cargo bikes to 3,000 over the next decade, giving it the UK’s biggest fleet of e-cargo bikes for parcel delivery.",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":5926,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":5928,"spans":5929,"direction":112},"Latest trading",[5930],{"start":32,"end":341,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":5932,"spans":5933,"direction":112},"Strong parcel volumes have continued into the first half of 2024-25. Group Revenue for the 26 weeks ended 31 August 2024 was £865m up 10.6% on the prior year, despite the Group’s strong trading in 2023-24.",[],{"type":126,"text":5935,"spans":5936,"direction":112},"Whilst the consumer trends we have seen over the last two years, including the growth of online marketplaces (including value-led market entrants and pre-loved platforms) have continued to be a feature, parcel growth in H1 2024-25 has been broad based across client segments. We have seen significant contribution from the positive conversion of the new business pipelines, the continued growth of SME volumes and an improvement in the performance of our UK corporate segment, following a period of post-COVID-19 market normalisation.",[],{"type":126,"text":5938,"spans":5939,"direction":112},"The BRC- KPMG retail monitor reported a return to year-on year growth in non-food online sales over the summer. July and August market growth was 0.3% and 1.5% respectively, particularly driven by growth in clothing and health & beauty products and summer promotional activity. Year on year market growth increased to 3.4% in September 2024, the strongest market growth post Covid.",[],{"type":126,"text":5941,"spans":5942,"direction":112},"The stronger market conditions we have seen in recent months, support a more positive outlook in the general consumer backdrop, compared to the last two years. We remain on track to report growth in revenue and adjusted EBITDA in 2024-25, supported by higher volumes.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":5944,"primary":5945,"id":284,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":5946},[5947,5952,5957],{"type":126,"text":5948,"spans":5949,"direction":112},"[1] Alternative performance measures, as defined in the Glossary Page 97 2023-24 Concert Topco Limited Annual Report & Financial Statements",[5950],{"start":32,"end":5951,"type":1324},139,{"type":126,"text":5953,"spans":5954,"direction":112},"[2] 2023\u002F24 was a 53-week financial period and the additional week accounted for £30m revenue and £7m of the adjusted EBITDA. Excluding the 53rd week impact, revenue growth was 13.1% and Adjusted EBITDA growth was 30.3% versus 2022\u002F23",[5955],{"start":32,"end":5956,"type":1324},234,{"type":126,"text":5958,"spans":5959,"direction":112},"[3] Evri Limited Annual Report and Financial Statements will be available from Companies House in November 2024",[5960],{"start":32,"end":1843,"type":1324},{"id":5962,"uid":5963,"url":5964,"type":50,"href":5965,"tags":5966,"first_publication_date":5967,"last_publication_date":5968,"slugs":5969,"linked_documents":5971,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":5972,"data":5973},"ZyTA8RAAACEAyYN0","pulse-2024","\u002Fpress\u002Fpulse-2024","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZyTA8RAAACEAyYN0%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2024-11-04T10:41:46+0000","2025-02-13T09:32:46+0000",[5970],"nearly-30-million-uk-adults-shopped-online-for-pre-loved-items-in-the-last-year--and-its-not-just-gen-z",[],[],{"title":5974,"category":8,"metaDescription":5975,"canonical":5976,"titleTag":5977,"featuredImage":5978,"publishedDate":5988,"slices":5989},"Nearly 30 million UK adults shopped online for pre-loved items in the last year – and it’s not just Gen Z","Read here about Evri's UK Ecommerce Pulse Report findings","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fpulse-2024","Nearly 30 million UK adults shopped online for pre-loved items in the last year – and it’s not just Gen Z  | Evri",{"dimensions":5979,"alt":5980,"copyright":8,"url":5981,"id":5982,"edit":5983,"thumbnail":5984},{"width":65,"height":865},"A side-view profile of a customer sitting on a sofa, with a laptop resting on their lap as they look down at the screen.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6Xqi5bqstJ9-WcS_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5681.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6Xqi5bqstJ9-WcS",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":5985,"alt":5980,"copyright":8,"url":5986,"id":5982,"edit":5987},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6Xqi5bqstJ9-WcS_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5681.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2024-11-11",[5990,6001,6027,6031],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":5991,"primary":6000,"id":101,"slice_type":102,"slice_label":8},[5992],{"title":5993,"content":8,"pillEnabled":87,"link":5994,"dataGtmTrack":8},"Click here to download Evri's UK Ecommerce Pulse Report, November 2024",{"link_type":22,"key":5995,"kind":38,"id":5996,"url":5997,"name":5998,"size":5999},"3f892eb2-8d16-46a2-845d-4bba36b21dd9","ZytSWq8jQArT0SQr","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZytSWq8jQArT0SQr_Evri-UKEcommercePulseReport-November2024.pdf","404-not-found.html","4913724",{"sectionTitle":8,"sectionDescription":8,"pillEnabled":87,"showPaddingTop":87},{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":6002,"primary":6004,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[6003],{},{"content":6005},[6006,6011,6015,6021,6024],{"type":109,"text":6007,"spans":6008,"direction":112},"Some 55% of UK adults have bought pre-loved items online in the last year and not just the youngest: 61% of those aged 35-54 did, as this mega-trend goes mainstream.",[6009],{"start":32,"end":6010,"type":163},165,{"type":109,"text":6012,"spans":6013,"direction":112},"Cost-of-living pressures, a focus on sustainability and demand for unique items are driving this bargain-hunting online, while others use marketplaces to make money.",[6014],{"start":32,"end":6010,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":6016,"spans":6017,"direction":112},"More than half of the UK adult population have bought a second-hand item online in the last year – and it’s not just the youngest clicking away, as older consumers are also driving the second-hand shopping mega-trend, according to Evri’s inaugural UK Ecommerce Pulse report.",[6018],{"start":6019,"end":6020,"type":1324},248,266,{"type":126,"text":6022,"spans":6023,"direction":112},"The UK’s largest dedicated parcel delivery firm found that 55% of the adult population – around 28 million – have purchased a pre-loved item online in the last 12 months. On the flip slide, 47% of adults have also sold a second-hand item online over this period, highlighting how people are also making money from the pre-loved items in their wardrobes, lofts or garages.",[],{"type":126,"text":6025,"spans":6026,"direction":112},"Younger shoppers are the engine of the pre-loved boom as more than two-thirds, or 67%, of those aged 18-34 have bought second-hand items in the last year. Perhaps surprisingly, 61% of those aged 35-54 also shopped online for pre-loved items in the last 12 months, as online marketplaces offering second-hand goods become part of the lives of consumers.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":6028,"primary":6029,"id":148,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":6030,"quoteSource":147},"The pre-loved revolution in online shopping is still in its infancy and we see a long runway of growth ahead. Whether it is a desire to shop more sustainably, find unique items, or save and make money, consumers have caught the second-hand online shopping bug. The reality is that consumers are finding their own properties and those of others veritable treasure troves of pre-loved items from dresses to tech gadgets – and this is fuelling this bargain-hunting phenomenon online.\nEvri celebrated its 50th anniversary this year and as a partner to most of the UK’s biggest retailers and online marketplaces, we continue to see first-hand how pre-loved and other online shopping habits continue to evolve at pace.",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":6032,"primary":6033,"id":5276,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":6034},[6035,6038,6041,6044,6048,6051,6054,6058],{"type":126,"text":6036,"spans":6037,"direction":112},"\nEvri’s polling found that one in ten UK consumers purchase second-hand items several times a month.",[],{"type":126,"text":6039,"spans":6040,"direction":112},"The findings are supported by Evri’s own data – as it has witnessed first-hand the explosive growth of second-hand platforms experiencing a staggering 160% year-on-year increase in parcel volumes on these platforms.",[],{"type":126,"text":6042,"spans":6043,"direction":112},"That said, there are some generational differences in shopping behaviour, as only 40% of those aged over 55 bought or sold a second-hand item in the last year.",[],{"type":126,"text":6045,"spans":6046,"direction":112},"Evri’s Pulse also found that thriftiness amidst ongoing cost-of-living pressures was cited as the main reason behind the growing demand for pre-loved shopping, as 75% of those surveyed said the need to save cash led them to go bargain-hunting online. The popularity of second-hand sites has also soared as 30% of shoppers enjoy searching for unique items, such as vintage clothing.",[6047],{"start":4929,"end":4838,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":6049,"spans":6050,"direction":112},"Nearly a quarter, or 24%, of respondents cited sustainability or reduced carbon footprint as a key reason for pre-loved shopping, as consumers have become increasingly aware of the environmental impact of sectors, such as the fast-fashion industry. The research revealed a stark gender divide in attitudes towards the importance of shopping sustainably – while a third of women cited sustainability as a reason for shopping online for pre-loved items, only 18% of male respondents said the same.",[],{"type":126,"text":6052,"spans":6053,"direction":112},"Evri is committed to becoming the UK’s leading sustainable parcel delivery company – targeting net-zero emissions by 2035, with plans for the largest sustainable fleet in the sector, and striving for 100% renewable energy. Earlier in 2024, Evri announced a further £19m multi-year investment in sustainability to drive the company’s ambitions of tripling its fleet of e-cargo bikes from 33 to almost 100.",[],{"type":126,"text":6055,"spans":6056,"direction":112},"For Evri’s Ecommerce Pulse, FGS Global, the strategic communications firm, conducted an extensive poll of 4,012 UK adults, weighted to be nationally representative based on gender, location and ethnicity, between the 15th – 21st of July 2024.",[6057],{"start":903,"end":1981,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":6059,"spans":6060,"direction":112},"Industry analysts expect the pre-loved market to continue to grow strongly. In fashion alone, sales of pre-owned clothes soared by 18% to $197bn (£156bn) last year and are forecast to reach $350bn by 2028, according to GlobalData.",[],{"id":6062,"uid":6063,"url":6064,"type":50,"href":6065,"tags":6066,"first_publication_date":6067,"last_publication_date":6068,"slugs":6069,"linked_documents":6071,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":6072,"data":6073},"ZyDcGxIAACAAbpuR","evri-announces-deadline-for-millions-sending-christmas-presents-and-extends-partnership-with-post-office-to-1200-further-branches","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-announces-deadline-for-millions-sending-christmas-presents-and-extends-partnership-with-post-office-to-1200-further-branches","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZyDcGxIAACAAbpuR%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2024-10-29T13:04:23+0000","2025-02-13T09:34:35+0000",[6070],"evri-announces-2024-deadline-for-millions-sending-christmas-presents-and-extends-partnership-with-post-office-to-1200-further-branches",[],[],{"title":6074,"category":8,"metaDescription":6075,"canonical":6076,"titleTag":6077,"featuredImage":6078,"publishedDate":6088,"slices":6089},"Evri announces 2024 deadline for millions sending Christmas presents and extends partnership with Post Office to 1,200 further branches","Read here about Evri's deadline for millions sending Christmas presents and extended partnership with Post Office","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-announces-deadline-for-millions-sending-christmas-presents-and-extends-partnership-with-post-office-to-1200-further-branches","Evri announces deadline for millions sending Christmas presents and extends partnership with Post Office to 1,200 further branches  | Evri",{"dimensions":6079,"alt":6080,"copyright":8,"url":6081,"id":6082,"edit":6083,"thumbnail":6084},{"width":65,"height":865},"A mother is attaching the shipping label to a parcel on her coffee table. Her two children are sat behind her on the sofa playing cards.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zc5ZbqstJ9-inM_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7557.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6zc5ZbqstJ9-inM",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":6085,"alt":6080,"copyright":8,"url":6086,"id":6082,"edit":6087},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zc5ZbqstJ9-inM_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7557.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2024-10-28",[6090],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":6091,"primary":6093,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[6092],{},{"content":6094},[6095,6100,6104,6108,6111,6114,6117,6120,6124,6128,6132],{"type":126,"text":6096,"spans":6097,"direction":112},"·       More than 3,200 Post Office branches will now take Evri parcels",[6098],{"start":321,"end":6099,"type":163},71,{"type":126,"text":6101,"spans":6102,"direction":112},"·       UK’s biggest parcel drop off network – almost 17,000 locations",[6103],{"start":321,"end":2506,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":6105,"spans":6106,"direction":112},"·       Send by 11am on 21st December for pre-Christmas delivery",[6107],{"start":321,"end":3236,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":6109,"spans":6110,"direction":112},"Evri, the UK’s biggest dedicated parcel delivery company, is today encouraging consumers to send their Christmas gifts as early as possible, as it adds more than 1,200 additional Post Office branches to its parcel drop off network. This extends Evri’s network to almost 17,000, which is believed to be the biggest parcel pick up and drop off network in the UK.",[],{"type":126,"text":6112,"spans":6113,"direction":112},"Evri is urging consumers planning to send Christmas gifts domestically not to leave it to the last minute – with the final cut-off point for next-day parcels being drop off at a ParcelShop by 11am on 21st December. By the end of October, the business will have more than 16,800 locations to send, collect or return parcels, including Post Office branches, Tesco Express stores, lockers and many independent convenience stores, allowing busy customers to send their parcels at their convenience.",[],{"type":126,"text":6115,"spans":6116,"direction":112},"In November 2023, Evri announced a groundbreaking partnership with Post Office for consumers to send Evri parcels at the counter of more than 2,000 Post Office branches for the first time in the Post Office’s 360-year history. By the end of October, less than a year on from the start of the partnership, and in preparation for the festive season, the number of Post Offices branches that accept Evri parcels will total more than 3,200. This brings the total number of Evri’s pick up and drop off locations to more than 16,800.",[],{"type":126,"text":6118,"spans":6119,"direction":112},"The UK (domestic) Christmas posting deadlines are:",[],{"type":126,"text":6121,"spans":6122,"direction":112},"·       Thursday 19th December – last day for courier collections",[6123],{"start":321,"end":4070,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":6125,"spans":6126,"direction":112},"·       Friday 20th December – send standard delivery parcels from a ParcelShop by 11am",[6127],{"start":321,"end":1084,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":6129,"spans":6130,"direction":112},"·       Saturday 21st December – send next-day delivery parcels from a ParcelShop by 11am",[6131],{"start":321,"end":4070,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":6133,"spans":6134,"direction":112}," To find your all of our Post Office locations, as well as your nearest ParcelShop or Locker visit www.evri.com\u002Ffind-a-parcelshop",[6135],{"start":1025,"end":1797,"type":279,"data":6136},{"link_type":281,"url":3692,"target":283},{"id":6138,"uid":6139,"url":6140,"type":50,"href":6141,"tags":6142,"first_publication_date":6143,"last_publication_date":6144,"slugs":6145,"linked_documents":6146,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":6147,"data":6148},"ZxjtlRAAACEAUHaW","spike-in-delivery-scams-as-12000-malicious-sites-taken-down-by-evri","\u002Fpress\u002Fspike-in-delivery-scams-as-12000-malicious-sites-taken-down-by-evri","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZxjtlRAAACEAUHaW%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2024-10-23T12:46:46+0000","2025-02-13T09:36:41+0000",[6139],[],[],{"title":6149,"category":8,"metaDescription":6150,"canonical":6151,"titleTag":6152,"featuredImage":6153,"publishedDate":6163,"slices":6164},"Spike in delivery scams as 12,000 malicious sites taken down by Evri","Read here about Evri's commitment to Cyber Security","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fspike-in-delivery-scams-as-12000-malicious-sites-taken-down-by-evri","Spike in delivery scams as 12,000 malicious sites taken down by Evri  | Evri",{"dimensions":6154,"alt":6155,"copyright":8,"url":6156,"id":6157,"edit":6158,"thumbnail":6159},{"width":65,"height":865},"A woman is sat at home at her desk looking puzzled or confused towards her laptop screen","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdCJbqstJ9-ina_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7830.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6zdCJbqstJ9-ina",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":6160,"alt":6155,"copyright":8,"url":6161,"id":6157,"edit":6162},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdCJbqstJ9-ina_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7830.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2024-10-14",[6165,6224,6230],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":6166,"primary":6168,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[6167],{},{"content":6169},[6170,6173,6176,6179,6183,6186,6189,6192,6194,6196,6209,6212,6214,6216,6218],{"type":126,"text":6171,"spans":6172,"direction":112},"·       Warning to shoppers as consumer scam reports up by 235% year on year",[],{"type":126,"text":6174,"spans":6175,"direction":112},"·       Latest data shows scamming incidents on the rise with reports of phishing emails increasing by 472% around the festive period",[],{"type":126,"text":6177,"spans":6178,"direction":112},"·       News comes as Evri tackled 12,000 malicious webpages in last 12 months alone, the most its ever taken down.",[],{"type":126,"text":6180,"spans":6181,"direction":112},"14th October 2024: Evri, the UK's largest dedicated parcel delivery company, has warned about escalating security attacks on parcel customers after reporting a four-fold rise in scamming incidents and that 12,000 fake sites had been taken down.",[6182],{"start":32,"end":2233,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":6184,"spans":6185,"direction":112},"The announcement comes during National Cyber Security Awareness Month and ahead of the start of the festive shopping season, when Phishing scams rise dramatically.",[],{"type":126,"text":6187,"spans":6188,"direction":112},"Phishing is when criminals use scam emails, text messages and fake social media profiles to trick victims. The aim is often to make consumers visit a website, which may steal bank details or other personal information. They will often pretend to be an organisation you trust. These tactics can be very convincing and often use genuine-looking branding and messaging.",[],{"type":126,"text":6190,"spans":6191,"direction":112},"Evri is advising customers to be extra vigilant during the festive shopping period and is issuing core advice on what to look out for which they’re calling the 3 L’s.",[],{"type":126,"text":3397,"spans":6193,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":3400,"spans":6195,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":6197,"spans":6198,"direction":112},"·       Links – unusual links or buttons that urge customers to take action such as pay a re-delivery fee; this is something Evri will never charge for. Evri is also urging consumers to report suspicious activity, information on how to do that is available on Evri’s website: evri.com\u002Fcyber-security. All messages will be investigated with expert partners to take down associated fraudulent websites. Consumers should also report any other suspicious emails to report@phishing.gov.uk or forward suspicious text messages to 7726 free of charge.",[6199,6204],{"start":6200,"end":6201,"type":279,"data":6202},276,299,{"link_type":281,"url":6203,"target":283},"press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fcyber-security",{"start":6205,"end":6206,"type":279,"data":6207},461,483,{"link_type":281,"url":6208,"target":283},"mailto:report@phishing.gov.uk",{"type":126,"text":6210,"spans":6211,"direction":112}," If a consumer thinks they have fallen victim to one of these scams they should:",[],{"type":126,"text":3412,"spans":6213,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":3415,"spans":6215,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":6217,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":6219,"spans":6220,"direction":112},"Evri works closely with a number of leading external cybersecurity partners such as Netcraft, Clickatell, BT, the Cyber Defence Alliance to identify scams and remove them as quickly as possible and is also liaising with the UK Government’s National Cyber Security Centre to make the communications with customers more reliable.",[6221],{"start":6222,"end":6223,"type":1324},326,327,{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":6225,"primary":6226,"id":6229,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":6227,"quoteSource":6228},"These criminals are taking advantage of the millions of parcels we deliver to households every day, especially at this busy time of year. They use what we would refer to as the ‘spray and pray’ method, sending thousands of messages every day aided now by the use of AI. Inevitably, this means some of them are likely to arrive with someone expecting a parcel, increasing the chance of catching customers out. Lots of these messages try to charge a ‘redelivery fee’ which is nonsense – we will attempt delivery three times before an item is returned and there is no charge.”","Richa Bhuttar, Chief Information Security Officer at Evri,","quote$6529511d-aba3-425b-bdeb-5ed9b8bfa534",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":6231,"primary":6232,"id":6235,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":6233,"quoteSource":6234},"We know that unfortunately, criminals will be looking for every opportunity to scam people out of their hard-earned cash, especially in the run up to a busy festive period for online shoppers.\n I urge everyone to help us fight scammers by following the government’s Stop! Think Fraud advice and if something feels off, don’t hesitate, forward suspicious emails to the Suspicious Email Reporting Service at report@phishing.gov.uk, and forward suspicious text messages to 7726.","Sarah Lyons, the Government’s National Cyber Security Centres Deputy Director for Economy and Society at the NCSC","quote$7064fe50-0bb8-4bc2-87fb-20f31e424968",[6237,6320,6402,6455,6518,6606,6669,6754,6846,6933,6987,7071],{"id":6238,"uid":6239,"url":6240,"type":50,"href":6241,"tags":6242,"first_publication_date":6243,"last_publication_date":6244,"slugs":6245,"linked_documents":6246,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":6247,"data":6248},"ZweEbhEAACIAgyE_","evri-announces-ambition-to-become-the-most-accessible-parcel-company-as-it-partners-with-disability-equality-charity-scope","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-announces-ambition-to-become-the-most-accessible-parcel-company-as-it-partners-with-disability-equality-charity-scope","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZweEbhEAACIAgyE_%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2024-10-10T07:42:35+0000","2025-02-13T09:40:47+0000",[6239],[],[],{"title":6249,"category":8,"metaDescription":6250,"canonical":6251,"titleTag":6252,"featuredImage":6253,"publishedDate":6259,"slices":6260},"Evri announces ambition to become the most accessible parcel company as it partners with disability equality charity Scope","Read here about Evri's ambition to become the most accessible parcel company","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-announces-ambition-to-become-the-most-accessible-parcel-company-as-it-partners-with-disability-equality-charity-scope","Evri announces ambition to become the most accessible parcel company as it partners with disability equality charity Scope | Evri",{"dimensions":6254,"alt":2473,"copyright":8,"url":2474,"id":2475,"edit":6255,"thumbnail":6256},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":6257,"alt":2473,"copyright":8,"url":2479,"id":2475,"edit":6258},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2024-10-10",[6261,6305,6309,6314],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":6262,"primary":6264,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[6263],{},{"content":6265},[6266,6270,6274,6279,6282,6285,6288,6291,6294,6297,6299,6302],{"type":126,"text":6267,"spans":6268,"direction":112},"·       Three-year commitment to Scope, a leading disability equality charity",[6269],{"start":321,"end":758,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":6271,"spans":6272,"direction":112},"·       Ambition to become the most accessible parcel delivery company",[6273],{"start":321,"end":2506,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":6275,"spans":6276,"direction":112},"·       Industry leading app improvements enable customers to set accessibility preferences for every delivery",[6277],{"start":321,"end":6278,"type":163},110,{"type":126,"text":6280,"spans":6281,"direction":112},"Evri, the UK’s biggest dedicated parcel delivery company, today announced a range of doorstep delivery improvements for people living with a condition or impairment and a major partnership with disability equality charity Scope.",[],{"type":126,"text":6283,"spans":6284,"direction":112},"New doorstep delivery preferences have launched this week to offer more options for those who might need longer, or who can’t get to the door to accept a delivery.",[],{"type":126,"text":6286,"spans":6287,"direction":112},"Evri estimates one in four home deliveries go to consumers with a disability and it unveiled a new ambition to become the most accessible parcel delivery company for consumers, colleagues and couriers with a condition or impairment.",[],{"type":126,"text":6289,"spans":6290,"direction":112},"Evri has entered into a three-year partnership with Scope, a leading UK disability equality charity. In the first partnership of its type in the sector, they will work together to promote disability inclusion within the logistics industry, and join forces to create lasting and meaningful social change.",[],{"type":126,"text":6292,"spans":6293,"direction":112},"The strategic partnership will focus on creating a more accessible and inclusive workplace for both disabled Evri employees and disabled consumers. Scope will support Evri to audit their practices, understand what they need to do to improve and work with them to create and deliver training packages.",[],{"type":126,"text":6295,"spans":6296,"direction":112},"Evri will also donate £125,000 to support Scope’s mission to create an equal future with disabled people. Scope campaigns to transform attitudes towards disability, tackle injustice and inspire action. It supports over 4 million disabled people every year by providing information and advice via its helpline and online community, and creating employment opportunities.",[],{"type":126,"text":5750,"spans":6298,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":6300,"spans":6301,"direction":112},"This builds on Evri’s ongoing efforts in this space, including the introduction of its Workplace Adjustment Policy and Inclusive Language Guide for employees.",[],{"type":126,"text":6303,"spans":6304,"direction":112},"These commitments build on existing partnerships. Evri has worked with the RiDC since 2023 to conduct accessibility research, and has previously worked with other organisations to conduct website accessibility audits and with other charities to create employment opportunities for disabled people. ",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":6306,"primary":6307,"id":6229,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":6308,"quoteSource":147},"Our own research shows that one in four people rely on home deliveries to maintain their independence or improve the quality of their life. We are launching exciting new product developments which will improve services for those with accessibility needs. I’m also very proud of the commitments we have made today which brings Evri another step closer to becoming the most accessible parcel delivery company. Over the next few years, and beyond, we are dedicated to making sure Evri better serves our communities and is an amazing place to work for all. We aim to make a positive impact on the lives of people with a condition or impairment and create a more inclusive and equitable society.",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":6310,"primary":6311,"id":6235,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":6312,"quoteSource":6313},"We are delighted to be partnering with Evri. There are 16 million disabled people in the UK, reflecting a huge proportion of Evri’s customers and workforce. Our employment experts will be working with Evri to support them in becoming a more accessible and inclusive business for their employees and customers. We are encouraged that Evri is prioritising addressing disability inequality in its business and is committed to learning and improving its practices. It’s only by working together that we will achieve real social change and can create an equal future for disabled people.","Amanda Mitchell, Executive Director of Fundraising at Scope",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":6315,"primary":6316,"id":6319,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":6317,"quoteSource":6318},"RiDC is very pleased to be continuing its collaboration with Evri, which began in February 2023 with research aimed at understanding the needs and expectations of disabled and older people when using parcel delivery services. Thanks to RiDC’s pan-disabled consumer panel, we were able to provide Evri with valuable and actionable insights which they have since taken on board. We are now embarking on further research aimed at ensuring a high level of accessibility of Evri’s website. Our research is entirely based on the direct feedback of disabled and older consumers and so provides a voice for the significant proportion of Evri’s customer base who have a disability, health condition or access need. We look forward to this latest research bringing about further improvements in the accessibility of Evri’s parcel delivery services.","Catherine Cashman, Associate Director of Research at the Research Institute of Disabled Consumers","quote$d2f0ca90-03c9-404d-970f-cfad37d2237b",{"id":6321,"uid":6322,"url":6323,"type":50,"href":6324,"tags":6325,"first_publication_date":6326,"last_publication_date":6327,"slugs":6328,"linked_documents":6329,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":6330,"data":6331},"ZuLEUBIAACUAfgZE","tesco-delivers-double-clubcard-points-on-parcels-with-evri","\u002Fpress\u002Ftesco-delivers-double-clubcard-points-on-parcels-with-evri","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZuLEUBIAACUAfgZE%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2024-09-12T10:41:06+0000","2025-02-13T09:44:28+0000",[6322],[],[],{"title":6332,"category":8,"metaDescription":6333,"canonical":6334,"titleTag":6335,"featuredImage":6336,"publishedDate":6347,"slices":6348},"Tesco delivers double Clubcard points on parcels with Evri","Read here about double Tesco Clubcard points on parcels with Evri","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Ftesco-delivers-double-clubcard-points-on-parcels-with-evri","Tesco delivers double Clubcard points on parcels with Evri | Evri",{"dimensions":6337,"alt":6338,"copyright":8,"url":6339,"id":6340,"edit":6341,"thumbnail":6342},{"width":65,"height":865},"A close-up of a customer applying a label to their parcel. A ParcelShop Print in Store device is in view behind the parcel.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJbpbqstJ9-TgK_EVRI_LOCATION_PIS2.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,6707,4471&w=960&h=640","Z6TJbpbqstJ9-TgK",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":6343,"alt":6338,"copyright":8,"url":6344,"id":6340,"edit":6345},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJbpbqstJ9-TgK_EVRI_LOCATION_PIS2.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,647,6707,3179&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":6346,"zoom":33,"background":71},647,"2024-07-29",[6349],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":6350,"primary":6352,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[6351],{},{"content":6353},[6354,6358,6361,6364,6367,6370,6373,6376,6379,6382,6384,6387,6390,6393,6396,6399],{"type":126,"text":6355,"spans":6356,"direction":112},"Tesco Clubcard users can get double points this September with Evri, the UK’s biggest dedicated parcel delivery company, as it continues to celebrate 50 years of delivering.",[6357],{"start":3544,"end":3441,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":6359,"spans":6360,"direction":112},"Last November Evri and Tesco announced a partnership to allow consumers to collect Clubcard points when sending a parcel with Evri. The deal reflected the commitment of both parties in rewarding customer loyalty and this latest offering expands the commitment.",[],{"type":126,"text":6362,"spans":6363,"direction":112},"For any parcels booked online at evri.com between Monday 9th and Monday 30th September 2024, Clubcard points collected will be automatically doubled. For every £1 spent on Evri.com sending a parcel, consumers can now collect 2 Clubcard points, meaning the more parcels they send, the more points they can turn into vouchers to get money off their Tesco shop. Alternatively, consumers can choose to donate to charity – or double the value of their points with more than 100 Tesco Clubcard Reward Partners.",[],{"type":126,"text":6365,"spans":6366,"direction":112},"How it works",[],{"type":126,"text":6368,"spans":6369,"direction":112},"·       Step 1: Consumers should add their Clubcard number on the Evri basket page",[],{"type":126,"text":6371,"spans":6372,"direction":112},"·       Step 2: Click the 'Collect points' button and it will be checked with Tesco",[],{"type":126,"text":6374,"spans":6375,"direction":112},"·       Step 3: Consumers can enjoy their points! They'll be credited within 14 days",[],{"type":126,"text":6377,"spans":6378,"direction":112},"Evri announces this deal as it continues its 50th year celebrations. Evri’s roots can be traced back to 1974 as Grattan mail order in Bradford. The business started with just seven couriers; the families of directors packed and delivered parcels to local customers; this is where the home delivery model was launched. In the early nineties, Evri had 1,000 couriers, covering 60% of the UK and delivering parcels two to three days a week. Fast forward to 2024 and Evri is a Leeds-based UK success story, with more than 20,000 couriers and 8,000 employees, delivering more than 730 million parcels to consumers each year to over 220 destinations worldwide.  ",[],{"type":126,"text":6380,"spans":6381,"direction":112},"Evri initially partnered with Tesco in 2021, when its ParcelShop services were made available in Tesco Express stores across the UK enabling customers to send, receive and return parcels as they shopped. Consumers can now use Evri’s parcel services in more than 1,200 Tesco stores and print a free label in-store if they don’t have a printer at home.",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":6383,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":402,"spans":6385,"direction":112},[6386],{"start":32,"end":405,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":6388,"spans":6389,"direction":112},"Terms and Conditions",[],{"type":126,"text":6391,"spans":6392,"direction":112},"●      Points are awarded within 14 days from the date of purchase.",[],{"type":126,"text":6394,"spans":6395,"direction":112},"●      You cannot apply an Evri discount code and Tesco Clubcard to the same order.",[],{"type":126,"text":6397,"spans":6398,"direction":112},"●      You can only collect Clubcard points on parcels sent within the UK using our website www.evri.com. Any returned or cancelled parcels will be excluded. Orders made on the international.evri.com website or the Evri App will also be excluded.",[],{"type":126,"text":6400,"spans":6401,"direction":112},"●      Points will be doubled on any parcels booked and paid for on www.evri.com between Monday 9th September 2024 and Monday 30th September 2024 inclusive.",[],{"id":6403,"uid":6404,"url":6405,"type":50,"href":6406,"tags":6407,"first_publication_date":6408,"last_publication_date":6409,"slugs":6410,"linked_documents":6411,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":6412,"data":6413},"ZtHtexAAACAARFZ9","evri-and-euro-car-parts-gear-up-for-faster-deliveries","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-and-euro-car-parts-gear-up-for-faster-deliveries","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZtHtexAAACAARFZ9%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2024-08-30T16:06:43+0000","2025-02-13T09:45:42+0000",[6404],[],[],{"title":6414,"category":8,"metaDescription":6415,"canonical":6416,"titleTag":6417,"featuredImage":6418,"publishedDate":6347,"slices":6428},"Evri and Euro Car Parts gear up for faster deliveries","Read here about Evri's partnership with Euro Car Parts","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-and-euro-car-parts-gear-up-for-faster-deliveries","Evri and Euro Car Parts gear up for faster deliveries | Evri",{"dimensions":6419,"alt":6420,"copyright":8,"url":6421,"id":6422,"edit":6423,"thumbnail":6424},{"width":65,"height":865},"A female van driver dressed in an Evri banded hi-vis vest is loading a blue Evri van with parcels.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6y_8JbqstJ9-iMt_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9442.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6y_8JbqstJ9-iMt",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":6425,"alt":6420,"copyright":8,"url":6426,"id":6422,"edit":6427},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6y_8JbqstJ9-iMt_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9442.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},[6429,6449],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":6430,"primary":6432,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[6431],{},{"content":6433},[6434,6437,6440,6443,6446],{"type":126,"text":6435,"spans":6436,"direction":112},"Evri, the UK’s biggest dedicated parcel delivery company, today announced a new one-year partnership with Euro Car Parts, a leading supplier of car parts and accessories. This strategic partnership will focus on enhancing Euro Car Parts' customer experience by offering later cut-off times on orders, convenient click-and-collect options, and a commitment to sustainability.",[],{"type":126,"text":6438,"spans":6439,"direction":112},"Euro Car Parts customers will now benefit from significantly later order cut-off times, allowing them to place orders well into the evening for next-day delivery. This improved service, facilitated by Evri's efficient network and later collection times, translates into an additional five hours of daily selling time for Euro Car Parts with a next-day delivery promise and further enhances Euro Car Parts’ position within a competitive market.",[],{"type":126,"text":6441,"spans":6442,"direction":112},"The partnership will also introduce a click-and-collect option, providing customers with the flexibility to pick up their orders at a convenient location. This caters to the growing demand for omnichannel retail experiences, where customers seamlessly transition between online browsing and physical collection.",[],{"type":126,"text":6444,"spans":6445,"direction":112},"Both Evri and Euro Car Parts share a commitment to sustainable practices. Evri's ongoing investment in electric vehicles and innovative delivery solutions will contribute to reducing the environmental impact of Euro Car Parts' last-mile deliveries.",[],{"type":126,"text":6447,"spans":6448,"direction":112},"Through a competitive tender process, Euro Car Parts selected Evri as sole carrier for consumer home delivery and a strategic partner that not only delivers a cost-effective solution but also possesses the capabilities to support their ambitious e-commerce growth plans. Additionally, both companies are exploring the possibility of integrating out of home delivery options (to Evri ParcelShops and Lockers) in the future.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":6450,"primary":6452,"id":4197,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[6451],{},{"quoteText":6453,"quoteSource":6454},"We’re delighted to partner with Euro Car Parts and facilitate their growth plans by offering later cut off times for their consumers. This collaboration will allow us to leverage our extensive delivery network and we are confident that this partnership will be mutually beneficial.”","Ryan Norris, Sales Director, Evri",{"id":6456,"uid":6457,"url":6458,"type":50,"href":6459,"tags":6460,"first_publication_date":6461,"last_publication_date":6462,"slugs":6463,"linked_documents":6464,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":6465,"data":6466},"ZqoLPxAAACEA0bec","evri-celebrates-50-years-of-delivering-on-yorkshire-day","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-celebrates-50-years-of-delivering-on-yorkshire-day","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZqoLPxAAACEA0bec%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2024-07-31T10:59:29+0000","2024-07-31T15:24:15+0000",[6457],[],[],{"title":6467,"category":8,"metaDescription":6468,"canonical":6469,"titleTag":6470,"featuredImage":6471,"publishedDate":6481,"slices":6482},"Evri celebrates 50 years of delivering on Yorkshire Day","Read here about Evri celebrating 50 years of delivering on Yorkshire Day","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-celebrates-50-years-of-delivering-on-yorkshire-day","Evri celebrates 50 years of delivering on Yorkshire Day | Evri",{"dimensions":6472,"alt":6473,"copyright":8,"url":6474,"id":6475,"edit":6476,"thumbnail":6477},{"width":65,"height":489},"Martijn De Lange, Evri CEO","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZqoYgR5LeNNTxpZL_MartijnScreencap.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C0%2C1920%2C1080&w=960&h=540","ZqoYgR5LeNNTxpZL",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":6478,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":6479,"id":6475,"edit":6480},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZqoYgR5LeNNTxpZL_MartijnScreencap.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C85%2C1920%2C910&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":497,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2024-08-01",[6483,6512],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":6484,"primary":6486,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[6485],{},{"content":6487},[6488,6491,6494,6497,6500,6503,6506,6509],{"type":126,"text":6489,"spans":6490,"direction":112},"Leeds-based Evri, the UK’s biggest dedicated parcel delivery company, is celebrating its 50th year of courier deliveries today, on Yorkshire Day.",[],{"type":126,"text":6492,"spans":6493,"direction":112},"You’d be forgiven for thinking Evri is a relatively new household name, the roots of Evri can be traced back to 1974 as Grattan mail order in Bradford. The business started with just seven couriers; the families of directors packed and delivered parcels to local customers; this is where the home delivery model was launched. In the early nineties, Evri had 1,000 couriers, covering 60% of the UK and delivering parcels two to three days a week. Fast forward to 2024 and Evri is a Leeds-based UK success story, with more than 20,0000 couriers and 8,000 employees, delivering more than 730 million parcels each year to over 220 destinations worldwide.",[],{"type":126,"text":6495,"spans":6496,"direction":112},"Evri’s huge success and growth over the past 5 years can in part be attributed to the rise of online shopping during the pandemic, Evri has revealed that over 60% of consumers in its home county of Yorkshire receive up to 4 deliveries per week to their home.",[],{"type":126,"text":6498,"spans":6499,"direction":112},"Yorkshire-based consumers are sensible with their purchases, with most (over 80%) spending below £150 a month online, with groceries and clothing being people’s top priority.",[],{"type":126,"text":6501,"spans":6502,"direction":112},"The celebration comes ahead of a report due to be released in the coming week to mark its 50th year.  The report will look back at the changing nature of retail and ecommerce over the last five decades and will provide expert insight into changing retail trends, consumer confidence and shifts within the communities it delivers to.",[],{"type":126,"text":6504,"spans":6505,"direction":112},"The delivery business has changed so much over the years, speaking with, Debbie Sharkey, who has been working for the for business for 35 years as a customer service advisor, she shared some of the changes she’s seen over her time with the business.",[],{"type":126,"text":6507,"spans":6508,"direction":112},"“Originally, I worked on the phones taking orders for purchases from the Grattan catalogue, flexibility was important for me a young mum with a one-year-old and I worked the night shift, my daughter now works here as well and has done for 12 years. The biggest change I’ve seen over my time is the shift to homeworking during the pandemic.”",[],{"type":126,"text":6510,"spans":6511,"direction":112},"Debbie also recognises the change in technology, as she went on to say, “Technology’s impact is undeniable, I can with hazy memories recall green writing on computers and records being on microfiche, a really old method of storing data, the ability to have so much data at my fingertips now is much more efficient for the customer experience. The one thing that has been a constant is my headset though, albeit it’s much more modern now.”",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":6513,"primary":6515,"id":4197,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[6514],{},{"quoteText":6516,"quoteSource":6517},"In our 50 years we’ve witnessed mail order evolve to introduce the first-ever telephone ordering service, a shift from printed publications to online ordering and the introduction of next day deliveries.  As we look back in fondness at the past half century, we are also focussed on delivering for our customers and clients in the UK and overseas now and over the next 50 years and more. People are still feeling cost-of-living pressures, high levels of inflation and higher interest rates, although stabilising, have all exerted pressure on disposable income and spending power. However, the phenomenon of home shopping continues to grow and evolve, and we have been quick to respond to this as the fastest-growing parcel delivery service.","Martijn De Lange, Chief Executive, Evri",{"id":6519,"uid":6520,"url":6521,"type":50,"href":6522,"tags":6523,"first_publication_date":6524,"last_publication_date":6525,"slugs":6526,"linked_documents":6527,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":6528,"data":6529},"ZqPT_RAAAB8AyKjl","evri-creates-9000-new-jobs-in-record-recruitment-drive","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-creates-9000-new-jobs-in-record-recruitment-drive","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZqPT_RAAAB8AyKjl%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2024-07-29T07:27:42+0000","2025-02-13T08:27:43+0000",[6520],[],[],{"title":6530,"category":8,"metaDescription":6531,"canonical":6532,"titleTag":6533,"featuredImage":6534,"publishedDate":6347,"slices":6544},"Evri creates 9,000 new jobs in record recruitment drive","Read here about Evri's creation of 9,000 new jobs in record recruitment drive","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-creates-9000-new-jobs-in-record-recruitment-drive","Evri creates 9,000 new jobs in record recruitment drive | Evri",{"dimensions":6535,"alt":6536,"copyright":8,"url":6537,"id":6538,"edit":6539,"thumbnail":6540},{"width":65,"height":865},"A female Evri van driver poses in the driving seat of her blue Evri van.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zBVJbqstJ9-iOw_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9817.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6zBVJbqstJ9-iOw",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":6541,"alt":6536,"copyright":8,"url":6542,"id":6538,"edit":6543},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zBVJbqstJ9-iOw_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9817.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},[6545,6574,6579],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":6546,"primary":6548,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[6547],{},{"content":6549},[6550,6553,6556,6559,6562,6565,6568,6571],{"type":109,"text":6551,"spans":6552,"direction":112},"Recruitment drive will take Evri’s total courier network to over 28,000",[],{"type":109,"text":6554,"spans":6555,"direction":112},"Evri plans to deliver around 4 million parcels a day",[],{"type":109,"text":6557,"spans":6558,"direction":112},"Hiring plan follows significant investment in customer service and operations",[],{"type":109,"text":6560,"spans":6561,"direction":112},"Evri continues to deliver on-time with more than 99% of its parcel deliveries",[],{"type":126,"text":6563,"spans":6564,"direction":112},"Evri, the UK’s biggest dedicated parcel delivery company, has today announced plans to recruit 8,000 additional couriers alongside 1,000 warehouse and other supporting roles this year as it plans to surpass its record parcel delivery volumes.",[],{"type":126,"text":6566,"spans":6567,"direction":112},"The business’ total self-employed courier workforce will hit 28,000 as it delivers around 4 million parcels during its busiest days.",[],{"type":126,"text":6569,"spans":6570,"direction":112},"The recruitment drive marks the growth of online deliveries, with parcel volumes outstripping the Covid years off the back of sales from successful home-grown high street retailers, fast-growing new entrants and pre-loved platforms.",[],{"type":126,"text":6572,"spans":6573,"direction":112},"Evri’s roots can be traced back 50 years to Bradford in 1974 as Grattan Mail Order. Evri now delivers 730 million parcels each year, serving 12 million customers a week via a growing network of self-employed couriers, five hubs, 27 depots and 550 delivery units.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":6575,"primary":6577,"id":4197,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[6576],{},{"quoteText":6578,"quoteSource":6517},"We know that service, reliability and quality are critical factors for our clients and consumers. We have an industry-leading 99% on-time delivery rate and our couriers have received more than 3 million 5-star reviews on Trustpilot and customers using our own app rate their courier 4.7 out of 5 on average.\n\nNew client wins, and increased parcel volumes are proof of the trust customers have in our service and biggest-ever recruitment drive promises to deliver another record year.\n\n“Evri is also on the way to be the most sustainable parcel delivery company by building the largest sustainable fleet of e-cargo bikes, with more bikes than ever on the road in 2024, as we move towards our goal of becoming net-zero by 2035.",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":6580,"primary":6581,"id":6605,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":6582},[6583,6586,6589,6592,6595,6598],{"type":126,"text":6584,"spans":6585,"direction":112},"Evri’s peak trading recruitment drive builds on Evri’s significant investment recently in customer service, including launching a new chatbot and callback feature to deliver a response in 24 hours or less, tripling the number of people who get an answer.",[],{"type":126,"text":6587,"spans":6588,"direction":112},"Last year, Evri delivered a record performance over its peak festive period, when it grew parcel volumes to more than 154 million over the nine weeks to 30 December 2023. This included a delivery blitz in the final seven days after cautious shoppers waited for discounts before purchasing.",[],{"type":126,"text":6590,"spans":6591,"direction":112},"Across the country, 8,000 couriers are needed this year, exceeding the 5,000 for last Christmas, with Scotland, Bury St Edmunds, Plymouth and Gatwick key areas for hiring. Couriers can apply easily by attending an introductory call with the local Community Delivery Manager, and then begin training. Evri will begin training and onboarding new couriers from August.",[],{"type":126,"text":6593,"spans":6594,"direction":112},"Today, couriers typically earn around £16.50 per hour and can enjoy the flexibility of delivering parcels any time between 8am and 8pm. Couriers will often be delivering in their local area, within familiar surroundings and usually not too far from home to accommodate their other commitments.",[],{"type":126,"text":6596,"spans":6597,"direction":112},"The parcel delivery company has enhanced its courier package and has recently partnered with Onsi to give all self-employed couriers, both new and existing, access to new benefits including Digital GP, mental health support, discounts at supermarkets and on fuel. This is additional to their existing benefits scheme and is completely free of charge.",[],{"type":126,"text":6599,"spans":6600,"direction":112},"To find out more and join Evri, visit: www.beacourier.co.uk",[6601],{"start":6602,"end":1676,"type":279,"data":6603},39,{"link_type":281,"url":6604,"target":283},"press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.beacourier.co.uk","rich_text$0cbdce96-4138-47f3-8213-a434e9d4db0d",{"id":6607,"uid":6608,"url":6609,"type":50,"href":6610,"tags":6611,"first_publication_date":6612,"last_publication_date":6613,"slugs":6614,"linked_documents":6615,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":6616,"data":6617},"ZpZmRhEAACMAaoQd","evri-partners-with-onsi-to-enhance-courier-benefits","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-partners-with-onsi-to-enhance-courier-benefits","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZpZmRhEAACMAaoQd%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2024-07-16T12:52:37+0000","2025-02-13T09:51:28+0000",[6608],[],[],{"title":6618,"category":8,"metaDescription":6619,"canonical":6620,"titleTag":6621,"featuredImage":6622,"publishedDate":6632,"slices":6633},"Evri partners with Onsi to enhance courier benefits","Read here about Evri's partnership with Onsi","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-partners-with-onsi-to-enhance-courier-benefits","Evri partners with Onsi to enhance courier benefits | Evri",{"dimensions":6623,"alt":6624,"copyright":8,"url":6625,"id":6626,"edit":6627,"thumbnail":6628},{"width":65,"height":865},"An Evri Courier walking towards a row of houses in a residential area with two parcels under his arm","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6tgT5bqstJ9-e7I_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6057.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6tgT5bqstJ9-e7I",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":6629,"alt":6624,"copyright":8,"url":6630,"id":6626,"edit":6631},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6tgT5bqstJ9-e7I_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6057.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2024-07-16",[6634,6657,6663],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":6635,"primary":6637,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[6636],{},{"content":6638},[6639,6642,6645,6648,6651,6654],{"type":126,"text":6640,"spans":6641,"direction":112},"Evri, the UK’s biggest dedicated parcel delivery company, is committed to continually improving its services by further investing in its people. Evri today announces a partnership with Onsi, a flexible benefits platform, to enhance its offering to couriers.",[],{"type":126,"text":6643,"spans":6644,"direction":112},"All 25,000+ self-employed couriers, both new and existing, can access these benefits from the beginning of their time with Evri. This is additional to their existing benefits scheme and is completely free of charge. Evri couriers will have two main new benefits, provided by Onsi:",[],{"type":126,"text":6646,"spans":6647,"direction":112},"●       Wellbeing, which offers couriers benefits like Digital GP, Digital Physio and support for mental health, finances, and family.",[],{"type":126,"text":6649,"spans":6650,"direction":112},"●       Discounts, to provide couriers with deals to save on everyday expenses,      including nine major supermarkets and fuel discounts.",[],{"type":126,"text":6652,"spans":6653,"direction":112},"So far, the most popular deals have been fuel and supermarkets including Tesco, Shell, Aldi, Asda and Sainsbury’s. With most people experiencing an increase in the cost of living, these discounts can help take the pressure off some regular outgoings.",[],{"type":126,"text":6655,"spans":6656,"direction":112},"Evri’s network of 25,000+ couriers, who deliver more than 730 million parcels annually, are at the heart of the business and its landmark GMB-backed pay model provides drivers with guaranteed minimum wages, holiday pay and pensions.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":6658,"primary":6660,"id":4197,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[6659],{},{"quoteText":6661,"quoteSource":6662},"Our couriers are at the heart of our business, and we recognise the importance additional benefits from platforms like Onsi can make to their work and home life. As our business continues to grow, it’s an exciting time to join us and become a courier, working flexibly around other commitments.","Gary Robinson, Director of Final Mile at Evri",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":6664,"primary":6665,"id":6668,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":6666,"quoteSource":6667},"At Onsi, we have a vision of a world of work where everyone wins. Being able to provide Evri couriers with benefits to protect their physical and financial wellbeing is a core part of our mission. We are delighted to welcome Evri to Onsi and looking forward to our partnership.","A spokesperson at Onsi","quote$9cbad863-41c7-492c-8ff0-91bb1cf517df",{"id":6670,"uid":6671,"url":6672,"type":50,"href":6673,"tags":6674,"first_publication_date":6675,"last_publication_date":6675,"slugs":6676,"linked_documents":6677,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":6678,"data":6679},"Znq-FBIAAKxKOxU6","evri-aces-delivery-with-tennis-star-liam-broady-and-donates-5000-to-tennis-first","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-aces-delivery-with-tennis-star-liam-broady-and-donates-5000-to-tennis-first","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22Znq-FBIAAKxKOxU6%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2024-06-25T13:22:10+0000",[6671],[],[],{"title":6680,"category":8,"metaDescription":6681,"canonical":6682,"titleTag":6683,"featuredImage":6684,"publishedDate":6695,"slices":6696},"Evri aces delivery with tennis star Liam Broady and donates £5,000 to Tennis First","Read here about Evri partnership with British tennis star Liam Broady and £5,000 donation to Tennis First","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Feevri-aces-delivery-with-tennis-star-liam-broady-and-donates-5000-to-tennis-first","Evri aces delivery with tennis star Liam Broady and donates £5,000 to Tennis First | Evri",{"dimensions":6685,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":6687,"id":6688,"edit":6689,"thumbnail":6690},{"width":65,"height":6686},1707,"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZnrEBJbWFbowe1yz_LiamBroady2.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=960&h=1707","ZnrEBJbWFbowe1yz",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":6691,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":6692,"id":6688,"edit":6693},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZnrEBJbWFbowe1yz_LiamBroady2.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C316%2C1080%2C512&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":6694,"zoom":33,"background":71},316,"2024-06-25",[6697,6733,6739,6743],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":6698,"primary":6700,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[6699],{},{"content":6701},[6702,6707,6711,6715,6717,6721,6724,6727,6730],{"type":126,"text":6703,"spans":6704,"direction":112},"British tennis star, Liam Broady, swapped his tennis racket for an Evri uniform and zero-emission e-cargo bike for a day",[6705],{"start":32,"end":6706,"type":163},120,{"type":126,"text":6708,"spans":6709,"direction":112},"Evri has donated £5,000 to charity Tennis First",[6710],{"start":32,"end":3107,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":6712,"spans":6713,"direction":112},"42% increase in sports parcels ahead of the ‘summer of sports’",[6714],{"start":32,"end":3544,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":6716,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":6718,"spans":6719,"direction":112},"25th June 2024: Evri, the UK’s biggest dedicated parcel delivery company, has teamed up with British tennis star Liam Broady to deliver a special package to the National Tennis Centre as he prepares for the prestigious Wimbledon tournament, which starts on 1st July this year.",[6720],{"start":32,"end":405,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":6722,"spans":6723,"direction":112},"For one day only, Broady drastically changed his career, donned the Evri uniform and swapped his tennis racket for a zero-emission e-cargo bike for a day, delivering a parcel to the National Tennis Centre. Broady was recognised by a fan whilst dressed in an Evri uniform and made time to stop and take a have a chat with the supporter.",[],{"type":126,"text":6725,"spans":6726,"direction":112},"The 30-year-old is currently British number five and reached a career high ranking of world number 93 last year. Broady has previously won eight singles titles and, despite friendly jokes from rival Andy Murray, is preparing for Wimbledon again this year.",[],{"type":126,"text":6728,"spans":6729,"direction":112},"Evri’s delivery site in Colliers Wood, just a short distance from the Wimbledon grounds, operates a zero-emission fleet - the company delivered 720,000 parcels using pedal power in the last financial year. Evri has set itself an ambitious net-zero target of 2035, reflecting its commitment to more sustainable deliveries.",[],{"type":126,"text":6731,"spans":6732,"direction":112},"To mark this partnership, Evri has also donated £5,000 to Tennis First, a charity which helped Liam in his junior days and where he is now an ambassador.  Tennis First helps young players develop, starting from 7 years of age.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":6734,"primary":6736,"id":4197,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[6735],{},{"quoteText":6737,"quoteSource":6738},"I had a great time delivering a parcel for Evri and experiencing their zero-emission e-cargo bikes. It was eye-opening to see the challenges couriers deal with on a normal day – they’re completely different to the challenges on a tennis court but I have a new-found empathy for everyone delivering to my door and the importance of choosing a safe place or alternative delivery location if you’re out. \nIt's fantastic to see companies taking sustainability seriously, and the donation to Tennis First is a brilliant initiative. Hopefully, it will inspire more young people to pick up a racket.","Liam Broady",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":6740,"primary":6741,"id":6668,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":6742,"quoteSource":5547},"We're delighted to have partnered with Liam Broady for this special delivery. Wimbledon is a highlight of the sporting calendar, and we're proud to play our part. Our investment in e-cargo bikes underlines our commitment to cleaner, greener deliveries, while the donation to Tennis First reflects our passion for supporting grassroots sports.",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":6744,"primary":6745,"id":6753,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":6746},[6747,6750],{"type":126,"text":6748,"spans":6749,"direction":112},"Evri has also seen a surge in sportswear parcels, indicating Brits are gearing up for a ‘summer of sports’. Evri has identified five of its top sports retailers and revealed a 42% increase in parcel volume in April and May 2024 compared to January and February this year – typically busy months for fitness, indicating consumers are excited for the sporting seasons, which includes Wimbledon. The company is well-positioned to deliver these parcels quickly and efficiently, ensuring everyone gets the kit they need to enjoy their favourite sports.",[],{"type":126,"text":6751,"spans":6752,"direction":112},"Evri is investing heavily in sustainable delivery solutions and, Evri recently announced a £19 million investment in sustainability to reach net-zero by 2035. The plans include growing the electric cargo bike fleet to 111 within months and electric vehicles from to 270 within a year.",[],"rich_text$4b54939d-8fc7-4da4-852e-6c210841b2ec",{"id":6755,"uid":6756,"url":6757,"type":50,"href":6758,"tags":6759,"first_publication_date":6760,"last_publication_date":6761,"slugs":6762,"linked_documents":6763,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":6764,"data":6765},"ZnWtYRIAACIAM9NN","evri-invests-19-million-and-announces-plans-for-uks-biggest-pedal-powered-parcel-delivery-fleet","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-invests-19-million-and-announces-plans-for-uks-biggest-pedal-powered-parcel-delivery-fleet","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZnWtYRIAACIAM9NN%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2024-06-23T23:02:09+0000","2024-06-24T13:35:55+0000",[6756],[],[],{"title":6766,"category":8,"metaDescription":6767,"canonical":6768,"titleTag":6769,"featuredImage":6770,"publishedDate":6782,"slices":6783},"Evri invests £19 million and announces plans for UK’s biggest pedal powered parcel delivery fleet","Read here about Evri's £19 million investment in sustainability","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-invests-19-million-and-announces-plans-for-uks-biggest-pedal-powered-parcel-delivery-fleet","Evri invests £19 million and announces plans for UK’s biggest pedal powered parcel delivery fleet | Evri",{"dimensions":6771,"alt":6773,"copyright":8,"url":6774,"id":6775,"edit":6776,"thumbnail":6777},{"width":65,"height":6772},646,"Evri zero-emission e-cargo bike investment in sustainability ","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZnWt5pbWFbowexS8_Evrie-cargobike-4-.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C1%2C11055%2C7439&w=960&h=646","ZnWt5pbWFbowexS8",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":6778,"alt":6773,"copyright":8,"url":6779,"id":6775,"edit":6780},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZnWt5pbWFbowexS8_Evrie-cargobike-4-.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C1101%2C11055%2C5240&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":6781,"zoom":33,"background":71},1101,"2024-06-24",[6784,6816,6822,6841],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":6785,"primary":6787,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[6786],{},{"content":6788},[6789,6793,6797,6801,6803,6807,6810,6813],{"type":126,"text":6790,"spans":6791,"direction":112},"Evri expects to deliver the UK’s largest fleet of e-cargo bikes for parcel delivery growing to 99 in months with plans for 3,000 bikes in a decade",[6792],{"start":32,"end":1133,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":6794,"spans":6795,"direction":112},"Plans to expand its fleet of electric vehicles to 270 within the next year, with significant investment into own charging infrastructure to support growth",[6796],{"start":32,"end":1802,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":6798,"spans":6799,"direction":112},"Rollout part of new £19 million sustainability investment, supporting ambition for 100% of Evri deliveries to be by alternative fuels by 2035",[6800],{"start":32,"end":1792,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":6802,"direction":112},[],{"type":126,"text":6804,"spans":6805,"direction":112},"24 June 2024: Evri, the UK’s biggest dedicated parcel delivery company, has today accelerated its commitment to sustainability announcing a further £19 million investment in new plans to fast-track the rollout out of electric cargo bikes to deliver parcels and reduce emissions.",[6806],{"start":32,"end":341,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":6808,"spans":6809,"direction":112},"The ambitious plans, which are expected to give Evri the UK’s biggest fleet of e-cargo bikes for parcel delivery, are part of a wider £19 million investment in sustainability. This will see Evri grow its fleet of e-cargo bikes from 33 to 99 and electric vehicles (EVs) from 168 to 270 within the next year. The business also has plans to grow its fleet of electric cargo bikes to 3,000 over the next decade - as part of its wider plans to reduce carbon emissions across its network and become a net-zero company by 2035.",[],{"type":126,"text":6811,"spans":6812,"direction":112},"Evri has established a dedicated \"final-mile electrification taskforce\" which will spearhead innovative solutions, explore partnerships, and implement strategies to transform last-mile deliveries into a zero-emission operation.",[],{"type":126,"text":6814,"spans":6815,"direction":112},"Evri already has electric cargo bikes operating in London, Bristol, Oxford and Cambridge and the company currently delivers 1.5 million parcels a year, by bike or EV. The business aims to triple that number to around four million over the next year. These deliveries are part of the more than 720 million parcels that Evri delivers each year – of which more than 99% are on time.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":6817,"primary":6819,"id":4197,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[6818],{},{"quoteText":6820,"quoteSource":6821},"Pedal power will rev up our efforts to reimagine parcel deliveries in the UK as we aim to become the biggest operator of e-cargo bikes in the sector. We achieved a 9% decrease in carbon emissions since last year. The £19 million investment announced today will lay the groundwork for Evri to dial up on its ambition to become the UK’s most sustainable parcel carrier.","Martijn De Lange, CEO at Evri",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":6823,"primary":6824,"id":4632,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":6825},[6826,6829,6832,6835,6838],{"type":126,"text":6827,"spans":6828,"direction":112},"The permanent fleet of electric cargo bikes deliver the “last mile” of urban parcel deliveries — moving a parcel from a local transportation depot to its destination. Each bike has a capacity of about 2,000 litres, meaning it can deliver around 110 parcels in one go. With zero tailpipe emissions a single parcel delivery by e-cargo bike can be expected to produce up to a 250g carbon saving alone. The growth to delivering 4 million parcels a year by e-cargo bike could save carbon equivalent to the amount created by driving over 400,000 miles, potentially reducing air and noise pollution as well as helping with congestion on the roads.",[],{"type":126,"text":6830,"spans":6831,"direction":112},"The company also plans to replace diesel vehicles used on its ParcelShop, and SME collection routes. Evri will add 148 EVs to its fleet, before its busy Christmas period this year, with a further 122 joining the fleet in spring 2025. This commitment will see electric vans account for over half of its ParcelShop drop-offs and collections. To support these vehicles Evri will continue expansion of its own EV charging infrastructure investing over £1 million in this across its depot network and hubs.",[],{"type":126,"text":6833,"spans":6834,"direction":112},"This will be complemented by the significant expansion of its ‘out of home’ (OOH) estate. Evri’s OOH network is currently believed to be the largest in the UK with more than 15,000 locations which include Tesco Express stores and Post Office branches. ",[],{"type":126,"text":6836,"spans":6837,"direction":112},"The wider sustainability team has already delivered a 21% carbon reduction per parcel for financial year (FY) 23-24 with this down to 370g per parcel delivered. This is beyond the 10% reduction per parcel achieved in FY 22-23, and a 9% absolute reduction in spite of volume growth. Earlier this year, Evri achieved Silver EcoVadis rating, which places the delivery company among the global top 15% percent of companies rated for sustainability. Furthermore, 100% of electricity consumption across Evri sites is backed by Renewable Energy Guarantees of Origin (REGO) certified renewable energy sources.",[],{"type":126,"text":6839,"spans":6840,"direction":112},"This announcement builds on Evri’s previous investment in renewable bio-methane compressed natural gas which fuels more than half of its first-mile fleet and reduces carbon emissions by up to 84%. The company also uses other alternative fuels, such as hydrotreated vegetable oil (HVO), as standard at its depot in Brooklands - HVO is a drop-in alternative diesel made from 100% renewable raw materials and sustainable waste from verified vegetable fats and oils.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":6842,"primary":6843,"id":6668,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":6844,"quoteSource":6845},"Evri is committed to making a positive impact on the environment and delivering a sustainable future. Our multi-year ESG plans represent a significant leap forward, and we are confident that these initiatives will propel us towards our net-zero goal. We are not just investing in technology, but also in our people, empowering them to be part of the solution. Together, we can build a more sustainable future for the parcel delivery industry, as well as the communities we serve.","Pauline Potter, Director of Procurement and Sustainability at Evri",{"id":6847,"uid":6848,"url":6849,"type":50,"href":6850,"tags":6851,"first_publication_date":6852,"last_publication_date":6853,"slugs":6854,"linked_documents":6855,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":6856,"data":6857},"Zl1mtxEAACEA8Tha","evri-announces-1-million-investment-into-ai-strategy-to-further-transform-the-customer-experience","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-announces-1-million-investment-into-ai-strategy-to-further-transform-the-customer-experience","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22Zl1mtxEAACEA8Tha%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2024-06-03T06:51:59+0000","2025-02-13T11:10:53+0000",[6848],[],[],{"title":6858,"category":8,"metaDescription":6859,"canonical":932,"titleTag":6858,"featuredImage":6860,"publishedDate":6870,"slices":6871},"Evri announces £1 million investment into AI strategy to further transform the customer experience","Read here about Evri's £1 million investment into AI strategy",{"dimensions":6861,"alt":6862,"copyright":8,"url":6863,"id":6864,"edit":6865,"thumbnail":6866},{"width":65,"height":865},"A customer sat on a sofa in their lounge, holding their tablet and looking at their screen.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6Xs8JbqstJ9-WfG_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5477.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6Xs8JbqstJ9-WfG",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":6867,"alt":6862,"copyright":8,"url":6868,"id":6864,"edit":6869},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6Xs8JbqstJ9-WfG_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5477.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2024-06-03",[6872,6899,6905,6913,6919,6925],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":6873,"primary":6875,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[6874],{},{"content":6876},[6877,6881,6884,6887,6890,6893,6896],{"type":126,"text":6878,"spans":6879,"direction":112},"3rd June 2024: Evri, the UK's biggest dedicated parcel delivery company, today announced a £1 million investment in its artificial intelligence (AI) strategy, to further transform its customer service and ensure parcels pass through its network smoothly.",[6880],{"start":32,"end":277,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":6882,"spans":6883,"direction":112},"The overarching aim of the strategic investment is focused on driving enhancements in customer service, including smarter use of data, enhancing parcel security and optimising workforce productivity, while in the future Evri will also explore and test the use of augmented reality headsets for couriers.",[],{"type":126,"text":6885,"spans":6886,"direction":112},"Its AI strategy will also help to further position Evri as a disruptor in parcel delivery and leader in AI adoption within the sector, and solidify its commitment to operational excellence, transforming operations and delivering better for its customers, clients, colleagues and couriers.",[],{"type":126,"text":6888,"spans":6889,"direction":112},"Evri's AI strategy focuses on three key areas. First, it will further improve customer service, as AI will simplify, speed up and improve the consistency of its parcel delivery services by automating simple data collection and identification of issues. This will in turn free up Evri’s customer service team to focus on resolving more complex issues, leading to faster resolutions and a consistently higher quality of service.",[],{"type":126,"text":6891,"spans":6892,"direction":112},"Second, it will enhance parcel security through Evri implementing AI-powered tools. Using AI Evri will be able to more quickly identify, on the doorstep, if a parcel is being left in a highly safe place – as the tech will analyse data against previous delivery photos. The enhancements will also analyse claims data, and automatically check geo-location and delivery photos to identify potentially false claims. This builds on Evri’s existing ParcelVision technology, which checks every photo couriers take, in real time, to ensure the quality of delivery photos.",[],{"type":126,"text":6894,"spans":6895,"direction":112},"Finally, Evri will use AI to optimise workforce planning by analysing data and predicting future demands. This will ensure Evri will have the right people in the right place at the right time, improving efficiency and delivery success rates.",[],{"type":126,"text":6897,"spans":6898,"direction":112},"Evri, working in collaboration with AI consultancy Robiquity, has created a ‘AI Centre of Excellence’ team and recruited top talent to ensure it has the right people at the heart of its transformational work in AI. The strategy is already delivering tangible benefits; initial implementations have resulted in improved outputs and optimised operations, demonstrating the transformative power of AI.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":6900,"primary":6902,"id":6904,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[6901],{},{"quoteText":6903,"quoteSource":3899},"Our significant investment in AI underscores Evri's commitment to continuous improvement and innovation. This strategy will empower our people and optimise our operations, ultimately enabling us to deliver a best-in-class experience for everyone we serve. It demonstrates that Evri is a tech-forward business and a really exciting place for new talent to work – we want to be the number one parcel delivery company globally. We put a real focus on intelligent automation in the middle of 2023, and we have been supported by Robiquity for the start of this exciting journey. The team at Robiquity have been crucial in building the foundations – allowing us to move at pace with implementing the early stages of our strategy. The significant benefits achieved through Intelligent Process Automation in the first six months have given us the platform to explore other AI, with a view to implementing later technologies to help shape the future of our business.","quote$f85636be-b309-4b46-9fd7-ad70ca0b4568",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":6906,"primary":6907,"id":6912,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":6908},[6909],{"type":126,"text":6910,"spans":6911,"direction":112},"Evri aims to leverage augmented reality headsets in the future to significantly reduce the time it takes to bring in and train new couriers. As the situations couriers deal with on the doorstep can vary greatly, Evri will explore the use of headsets for couriers to experience real-life scenarios and how best to deal with them to achieve customer satisfaction.",[],"rich_text$fc4479a9-1421-4605-8f22-a1598c6b1128",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":6914,"primary":6916,"id":6918,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[6915],{},{"quoteText":6917,"quoteSource":3899},"We're committed to supporting colleagues and helping them work smarter. AI will remove some of the mundane tasks, freeing them to focus on higher-value activities. Our AI strategy proves we're committed to deploying cutting-edge tech and we're quick to market. Moreover, the chosen AI technology has been evolving for 15 years, providing a proven track record that gives Evri confidence in its investment. Evri is a disruptor in the logistics industry known for its ability to deliver parcels quickly, efficiently, and often at a lower cost than competitors.","quote$649d1aea-626c-4c21-b1f5-0f4888a49821",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":6920,"primary":6921,"id":6924,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[],{"quoteText":6922,"quoteSource":6923},"We are delighted with the opportunity to support such a forward-thinking and ambitious business as Evri. They have an unwavering vision that AI can transform how they operate, and ultimately provide huge benefit to their customers. We are already seeing massive benefits delivered in the first six months, with much more to come. This is testament to the partnership approach adopted between us. We are looking forward to supporting Evri on their applied AI roadmap and celebrating further successes along the way.","James Procter, Chief Operating Officer at Robiquity","quote$1046c768-6f5f-45fa-9719-24bb70e79cf7",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":6926,"primary":6927,"id":6932,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[],{"content":6928},[6929],{"type":126,"text":6930,"spans":6931,"direction":112},"Marcus Hunter was recently acknowledged for his work in the top five of the CIO 100 Awards UK ranking.",[],"rich_text$67d6b73b-120f-4e87-8913-6db5be5dd47b",{"id":6934,"uid":6935,"url":6936,"type":50,"href":6937,"tags":6938,"first_publication_date":6939,"last_publication_date":6940,"slugs":6941,"linked_documents":6942,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":6943,"data":6944},"ZlYHBhAAACcAvfVX","evri-pledges-200000-levy-to-support-smes","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-pledges-200000-levy-to-support-smes","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZlYHBhAAACcAvfVX%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2024-05-28T16:35:17+0000","2025-02-13T11:12:08+0000",[6935],[],[],{"title":6945,"category":8,"metaDescription":6946,"canonical":6947,"titleTag":6945,"featuredImage":6948,"publishedDate":6958,"slices":6959},"Evri pledges £200,000 levy to support SMEs","Read here about Evri's £200,000 levy pledge to support SMEs","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-pledges-200000-levy-to-support-smes",{"dimensions":6949,"alt":6950,"copyright":8,"url":6951,"id":6952,"edit":6953,"thumbnail":6954},{"width":65,"height":865},"An Evri courier smiling and posing for the camera holding a parcel and their mobile device.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDpJbqstJ9-cfg_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4415.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6pDpJbqstJ9-cfg",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":6955,"alt":6950,"copyright":8,"url":6956,"id":6952,"edit":6957},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDpJbqstJ9-cfg_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4415.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2024-05-28",[6960,6975,6981],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":6961,"primary":6963,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[6962],{},{"content":6964},[6965,6969,6972],{"type":126,"text":6966,"spans":6967},"28th May 2024: Evri, the UK’s biggest dedicated parcel delivery company, has pledged £100,000 of its apprenticeship levy to West Yorkshire Combined Authority and £100,000 to Total People, to support SMEs. The pledge will enable smaller businesses to take on new apprentices and upskill current employees. Evri hopes this will provide an invaluable boost to support the growth of small UK businesses and the development of their people as they continue to battle rising costs.",[6968],{"start":32,"end":277,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":6970,"spans":6971},"Evri has been pledging its levy since 2021. To date it has supported 48 employers and helped create over 70 apprenticeships including, adult care workers, scaffolders, and early years practitioners - a profession that was reported to be suffering from a shortage earlier this year. Evri is working closely with West Yorkshire Combined Authority and Total People, to help identify suitable companies and ensure the funds are being spent efficiently, helping support those that will benefit most. Recent changes made by the government mean Evri can pledge a record amount this year and almost £230,000 has been used to date.",[],{"type":126,"text":6973,"spans":6974},"Total People is one of the largest providers of apprenticeships and work-based learning in the North-West of England.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":6976,"primary":6978,"id":6904,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[6977],{},{"quoteText":6979,"quoteSource":6980},"We are delighted that Evri has once again pledged their levy funds to help SMEs to grow and develop their workforce through apprenticeship training. By combining our apprenticeships expertise with Evri’s generous funding, we can continue to support people into rewarding careers and help struggling sectors to combat the skills shortage. This money will make a real difference.\"","Melanie Nicholson, Managing Director of Total People",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":6982,"primary":6984,"id":6918,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[6983],{},{"quoteText":6985,"quoteSource":6986},"We’re creating a region of learning and creativity to empower everyone to boost their skills and succeed, no matter their background or circumstances.\n“Thanks to large businesses like Evri helping us fund new apprenticeships, our smaller employers have been able to take on hundreds of extra people, helping us build a stronger, brighter West Yorkshire where everyone can achieve and thrive.\"","Tracy Brabin, Mayor of West Yorkshire",{"id":6988,"uid":6989,"url":6990,"type":50,"href":6991,"tags":6992,"first_publication_date":6993,"last_publication_date":6994,"slugs":6995,"linked_documents":6997,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":6998,"data":6999},"ZkIn4hIAAO5r39gI","scammers-are-getting-smarter-evri-issues-warning-to-imessage-users-as-scams-reach-an-all-time-high","\u002Fpress\u002Fscammers-are-getting-smarter-evri-issues-warning-to-imessage-users-as-scams-reach-an-all-time-high","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZkIn4hIAAO5r39gI%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2024-05-13T15:14:26+0000","2025-02-13T11:14:02+0000",[6996],"scammers-are-getting-smarter-evri-issues-warning-to-imessage-users-as-scams-reach-an-all-time-high.",[],[],{"title":7000,"category":8,"metaDescription":7001,"canonical":7002,"titleTag":7003,"featuredImage":7004,"publishedDate":7014,"slices":7015},"Scammers are getting smarter: Evri issues warning to iMessage users as scams reach an all time high.","Read here about Evri's  warning to iMessage users as scams reach an all time high.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fscammers-are-getting-smarter-evri-issues-warning-to-imessage-users-as-scams-reach-an-all-time-high","Scammers are getting smarter: Evri issues warning to iMessage users as scams reach an all time high | Evri",{"dimensions":7005,"alt":7006,"copyright":8,"url":7007,"id":7008,"edit":7009,"thumbnail":7010},{"width":65,"height":865},"A customer sat on a sofa, holding their tablet and looking frustratingly at their screen.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XqdJbqstJ9-WcJ_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5671.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6XqdJbqstJ9-WcJ",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":7011,"alt":7006,"copyright":8,"url":7012,"id":7008,"edit":7013},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XqdJbqstJ9-WcJ_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5671.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2024-05-13",[7016,7065],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":7017,"primary":7019,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[7018],{},{"content":7020},[7021,7025,7028,7030,7033,7036,7039,7042,7045,7047,7050,7059,7061,7063],{"type":126,"text":7022,"spans":7023},"7th May 2024: Evri, the UK's largest dedicated parcel delivery company, is committed to protecting the privacy and security of its customers and has issued an updated warning about scammers becoming smarter.",[7024],{"start":32,"end":341,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":7026,"spans":7027},"The renewed guidance on phishing messages, which affects thousands of consumers across the UK each month, has been issued ahead of CYBERUK - the UK government’s flagship cyber security event. The company has revealed a 174% increase in reported scams from April 2023 to April 2024 whilst it has successfully closed down more than 5,000 scam sites in the last year, a 268% increase year on year.",[],{"type":126,"text":3388,"spans":7029},[],{"type":126,"text":7031,"spans":7032},"Evri works closely with a number of leading external cybersecurity partners such as Netcraft, Clickatell and the UK Government’s National Cyber Security Centre to identify delivery scams using Evri’s name and remove them as quickly as possible.",[],{"type":126,"text":7034,"spans":7035},"Evri’s core advice remains the same, which is to look out for:",[],{"type":126,"text":7037,"spans":7038},"·       Poor language",[],{"type":126,"text":7040,"spans":7041},"·       A lack of personal greeting",[],{"type":126,"text":7043,"spans":7044},"·       Unusual links",[],{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":7046},[],{"type":126,"text":7048,"spans":7049},"However, scammers are getting smarter and using techniques to avoid defence measures. Evri is alerting consumers to look out for an increase in messages coming via iMessage; Apple’s encrypted messaging service, and Rich Communication Services (RCS); a similar technology used on Google Android devices. These services are intended to replace more traditional SMS, and are great for things such as personal privacy, but mean any defences available to Evri’s specialist partners, such as flagging text messages for malicious links, don’t work. This makes it ideal for scammers to use these services as they have a much higher chance of their messages getting through.",[],{"type":126,"text":7051,"spans":7052},"Evri is also urging consumers to report suspicious activity, information on how to do that is available on Evri’s website: evri.com\u002Fcyber-security. All messages will be investigated with expert partners to take down associated fraudulent websites. Consumers should also report any other suspicious emails to report@phishing.gov.uk. Text messages should also be reported by forwarding to 7226, which is free.",[7053,7056],{"start":7054,"end":1133,"type":279,"data":7055},123,{"link_type":281,"url":6203},{"start":3769,"end":7057,"type":279,"data":7058},330,{"link_type":281,"url":6208},{"type":126,"text":3409,"spans":7060},[],{"type":126,"text":3412,"spans":7062},[],{"type":126,"text":3415,"spans":7064},[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":7066,"primary":7068,"id":6904,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[7067],{},{"quoteText":7069,"quoteSource":7070},"\"These criminals use the ‘spray and pray’ method, taking advantage of the millions of parcels we deliver to households every day. They know sending thousands of messages every day means some of them are likely to reach some people expecting a parcel. Lots of these messages try to charge a ‘redelivery fee’ which is nonsense – we will attempt delivery three times before an item is returned and there is no charge. Gmail and Hotmail have pretty much got it nailed in terms of diverting phishing emails to quarantine folders whereas smaller mail providers seem to be less effective because their maturity is not at the same level.”","Richa Bhuttar, Chief Information Security Officer at Evri",{"id":7072,"uid":7073,"url":7074,"type":50,"href":7075,"tags":7076,"first_publication_date":7077,"last_publication_date":7078,"slugs":7079,"linked_documents":7082,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":7083,"data":7084},"ZjNuZRIAACMAymr6","april-fools-day.-get-your-skates-on-evri-rolls-into-a-new-era-of-zero-emission-deliveries-with-roller-skating-couriers","\u002Fpress\u002Fapril-fools-day.-get-your-skates-on-evri-rolls-into-a-new-era-of-zero-emission-deliveries-with-roller-skating-couriers","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZjNuZRIAACMAymr6%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2024-05-02T10:51:30+0000","2024-05-02T10:58:42+0000",[7073,7080,7081],"april-fools.-get-your-skates-on-evri-rolls-into-a-new-era-of-zero-emission-deliveries-with-roller-skating-couriers","evri-hosts-retailer-event-with-jill-scott-mbe-to-unveil-international-expansion",[],[],{"title":7085,"category":8,"metaDescription":7086,"canonical":7087,"titleTag":7088,"featuredImage":7089,"publishedDate":7101,"slices":7102},"April fools' Day. Get your skates on: Evri rolls into a new era of zero-emission deliveries with roller-skating couriers","Read here about Evri's April fools' day joke","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fapril-fools-day.-get-your-skates-on-evri-rolls-into-a-new-era-of-zero-emission-deliveries-with-roller-skating-couriers","April fools' Day. Get your skates on: Evri rolls into a new era of zero-emission deliveries with roller-skating couriers | Evri",{"dimensions":7090,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":7091,"id":7092,"edit":7093,"thumbnail":7095},{"width":65,"height":65},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fa0d5e32e-8175-41d8-b550-200efceefd3c_courier_rollerskates_3.jpg?auto=compress,format&rect=0,0,1107,1107&w=960&h=960","ZjNvrhIAACQAymzr",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":7094,"background":34},0.8672086720867209,{"dimensions":7096,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":7097,"id":7092,"edit":7098},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fa0d5e32e-8175-41d8-b550-200efceefd3c_courier_rollerskates_3.jpg?auto=compress,format&rect=0,291,1107,525&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":7099,"zoom":7100,"background":34},-101,0.34688346883468835,"2024-04-01",[7103],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":7104,"primary":7106,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[7105],{},{"content":7107},[7108,7112,7115,7118,7121,7124,7126],{"type":126,"text":7109,"spans":7110},"1st April 2024: Today, Evri, the UK’s biggest dedicated parcel delivery company, is proud to announce its latest ground-breaking zero-emission initiative – couriers delivering on roller skates. ",[7111],{"start":32,"end":405,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":7113,"spans":7114},"Starting today, 1st April, a trial of Evri couriers will roll into action. This innovative programme bolsters Evri’s position as one of the leading low-carbon delivery companies, adding to its existing fleet of electric vans – currently 37% - and 150 zero-emission e-cargo bikes whilst also adding an extra dose of fun into the delivery process.",[],{"type":126,"text":7116,"spans":7117},"The trial will aim to reduce carbon emissions, boost efficiency in urban areas and promote well-being. Evri has already seen a 10% decrease in carbon per parcel year on year and it hopes that this new initiative will significantly boost the figure over the next 12 months. Greener deliveries remain a priority, with the business introducing e-cargo bikes in cities across the country over the last year to meet an ambitious target of 1.5 million parcels delivered year by bike in 2024. In addition to the environmental benefits, the use of roller skate will speed up deliveries in built up urban areas such as city centres where one-way streets, congestion and suitable parking can slow down deliveries.  ",[],{"type":126,"text":7119,"spans":7120}," Safety will remain a top priority for the business which will be providing training, protective equipment and alternatives, such as skis, for snow and other bad weather. ",[],{"type":126,"text":7122,"spans":7123},"An Evri spokesperson said, “We’re excited to be rolling out this new green initiative. We’re always looking to trial new innovative ways to help us meet our goal of being net zero by 2035 and this further strengthens our commitment. We think there are multiple benefits to this trail on top of the environmental ones, we hope it will increase delivery efficiency and help our couriers be fitter and healthier”.",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":7125},[],{"type":126,"text":7127,"spans":7128},"Please note: This press release is intended for April Fools' Day purposes only and does not reflect any actual plans by Evri to implement a roller skate delivery programme. The image supplied has been generated by AI.",[7129],{"start":32,"end":356,"type":163},[7131,7192,7246,7314,7377,7473,7540,7634,7698,7760,7825,7879],{"id":7132,"uid":7133,"url":7134,"type":50,"href":7135,"tags":7136,"first_publication_date":7137,"last_publication_date":7138,"slugs":7139,"linked_documents":7140,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":7141,"data":7142},"ZiIkExEAACcAteK1","from-pubs-to-green-machines-evri-bike-courier-reveals-secrets-of-the-job","\u002Fpress\u002Ffrom-pubs-to-green-machines-evri-bike-courier-reveals-secrets-of-the-job","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZiIkExEAACcAteK1%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2024-04-19T08:06:26+0000","2025-02-13T11:15:54+0000",[7133],[],[],{"title":7143,"category":8,"metaDescription":7144,"canonical":7145,"titleTag":7146,"featuredImage":7147,"publishedDate":7157,"slices":7158},"From pubs to green machines: Evri bike courier reveals secrets of the job","Read here about Evri's bike courier revealing the secrets of the job","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Ffrom-pubs-to-green-machines-evri-bike-courier-reveals-secrets-of-the-job","From pubs to green machines: Evri bike courier reveals secrets of the job | Evri",{"dimensions":7148,"alt":7149,"copyright":8,"url":7150,"id":7151,"edit":7152,"thumbnail":7153},{"width":65,"height":865},"View from the window of a house, an Evri courier is approaching and waving to a woman in the window. He is delivering a couple of parcels to the house.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdE5bqstJ9-inh_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7995.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6zdE5bqstJ9-inh",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":7154,"alt":7149,"copyright":8,"url":7155,"id":7151,"edit":7156},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdE5bqstJ9-inh_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7995.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2024-03-25",[7159],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":7160,"primary":7162,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[7161],{},{"content":7163},[7164,7168,7171,7174,7177,7180,7183,7186,7189],{"type":126,"text":7165,"spans":7166},"19th April 2024: Forget crowded offices and rush hour commutes. Meet Robert Yeadon, one of Evri’s 150 eco-champions, who swapped serving behind a bar to serving customers in his community and has been delivering parcels by e-cargo bike for the company since November last year, following a career change. Swapping a bustling office for the busy streets of Colliers Wood in London riding on an EAV cargo bike. He’s shared what it’s like to deliver parcels on one of these bikes.",[7167],{"start":32,"end":362,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":7169,"spans":7170},"Rob’s job as a bike courier starts at about 1:30pm, one the benefits he loves is that the flexibility allows him to work another job he has in the morning. Arriving at the local Evri depot he starts by scanning and then loading around 70 parcels on to the bike. It takes less than half an hour to scan the parcels then about 10 minutes to load them. Less than an hour after arriving he’s out on the road ready to deliver his round. ",[],{"type":126,"text":7172,"spans":7173},"Rob tackles traffic like a champ with no fumes, just efficiency as these e-cargo bikes can use cycle lanes. He said, “It takes around 3 hours to deliver all the parcels. I live 3 minutes from the depot, and I know the local area well, so I know a few side streets that help me speed things up.” He went on to talk about the advantages of the bikes, “The obvious one is the benefits to the environment of course then on top of that, the bikes can be more efficient than traditional methods, especially in built up areas and allow you navigate busy streets easier.”",[],{"type":126,"text":7175,"spans":7176}," Rob isn’t just delivering parcels; he’s delivering a greener future. The EAV cargo bikes are one of the largest on the market, boasting a cargo volume of 2,000 litres, a 170kg payload. With zero tailpipe emissions a single bike can be expected to produce up to a 3t carbon saving alone.",[],{"type":126,"text":7178,"spans":7179},"70 parcels might sound like a lot of weight to pedal around. When asked if it was hard work Rob revealed a surprising perk, “You’d think the bike would feel heavy and hard to ride, but it’s the opposite, you don’t feel any weight at all. The bike really does the work for you, it’s great, the throttle gets the bike moving, all you have to do is steer, it doesn’t really feel like you’re pedalling.”",[],{"type":126,"text":7181,"spans":7182},"When asked what he loves about the job he told us, “I used to work in a pub and then worked as a recruitment consultant for a couple of years, I wanted to a more active job, something where I could be out and about. This job gives me just that, I cycle around 40 miles a week. I get to see different places and meet new people and build up a rapport with my customers. People often stop me and ask about the bike, how fast it goes, how it works and where they can get one from.”",[],{"type":126,"text":7184,"spans":7185},"An obvious question people may have when considering this job is how fit do you need be? According to Rob, “A level of fitness helps but the bike does a lot of the work, so people shouldn’t be put off, personally I feel like I’ve got fitter as result of doing the job which is great. This job is perfect for anyone who wants to ditch the desk and get paid whilst getting fit.”",[],{"type":126,"text":7187,"spans":7188},"Over the last two years Evri has rolled out e-cargo bikes across multiple sites including Bristol, Edinburgh, Manchester, Wimbledon, and Oxford. Last year it delivered 1.5 million parcels by e-cargo bike, and it has ambitious plans to increase that in the next 12 months. Where e-cargo bikes are in place, it means 100% reduction in tailpipe emissions for parcels under 15kg direct to the consumer address. ",[],{"type":126,"text":7190,"spans":7191},"Evri is pushing to be the most sustainable parcel delivery company and as well as rolling out zero-emission e-cargo bikes, the business is expanding its EV fleet and testing alternative solutions such as battery-powered and hydrogen vehicles in a bid to reduce its carbon footprint. Evri achieved a 10% reduction in the carbon per parcel since last year and has ambitious plans to become net-zero by 2035. ",[],{"id":7193,"uid":7194,"url":7195,"type":50,"href":7196,"tags":7197,"first_publication_date":7198,"last_publication_date":7199,"slugs":7200,"linked_documents":7201,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":7202,"data":7203},"ZgFfdRAAACoAck0q","evris-egg-stremely-dedicated-courier-couple","\u002Fpress\u002Fevris-egg-stremely-dedicated-courier-couple","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZgFfdRAAACoAck0q%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2024-03-25T11:36:47+0000","2025-02-13T11:17:27+0000",[7194],[],[],{"title":7204,"category":8,"metaDescription":7205,"canonical":7206,"titleTag":7207,"featuredImage":7208,"publishedDate":7157,"slices":7218},"Evri’s ‘egg-stremely’ dedicated courier couple","Read here about Evri's ‘egg-stremely’ dedicated courier couple","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevris-egg-stremely-dedicated-courier-couple","Evri’s ‘egg-stremely’ dedicated courier couple | Evri",{"dimensions":7209,"alt":7210,"copyright":8,"url":7211,"id":7212,"edit":7213,"thumbnail":7214},{"width":65,"height":865},"A customer is standing in the doorway of their home, holding their parcels and smiling for the camera.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XrMpbqstJ9-WdD_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4860.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6XrMpbqstJ9-WdD",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":7215,"alt":7210,"copyright":8,"url":7216,"id":7212,"edit":7217},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XrMpbqstJ9-WdD_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4860.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},[7219],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":7220,"primary":7222,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[7221],{},{"content":7223},[7224,7228,7231,7234,7237,7240,7243],{"type":126,"text":7225,"spans":7226},"25th March 2024: Alan and Alyson Hopkin have been delivering for Evri for over 17 years and are well-known across the villages of the Vale of Glamorgan. Every year the couple capture everyone’s hearts with their seasonal antics, and this year is no different as they deliver more ‘egg-citing’ moments in their local community.  ",[7227],{"start":32,"end":362,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":7229,"spans":7230},"In the run up to Easter, the dedicated couple have decided to do something ‘egg-straordinary’. Whilst Alyson drives Alan will deliver, dressed as the Easter Bunny.",[],{"type":126,"text":7232,"spans":7233},"‘Hoppy’ to talk about why they were doing this, they said, “This is the first year we’ve done this, we’re going to head out on Good Friday and Saturday to deliver parcels with Alan dressed head to toe as the Easter Bunny. We wanted to do it last year but couldn’t in the end, so we can’t wait. We’ve even got a basket to put chocolate eggs in for the little ones.”",[],{"type":126,"text":7235,"spans":7236},"One local resident said, “We love them both and look forward to the holidays, seeing Alan, and his outfits. They make so many people smile – the kids love to see him on his round and I’m sure they will be looking forward to seeing the Easter Bunny.”",[],{"type":126,"text":7238,"spans":7239},"The plot ‘chickens’, another local resident told us, “It’s not just Easter they do this, at Halloween, Alan will always be dressed scarily and at Christmas he can be seen running around dressed as Santa with a sack full of parcels over his shoulder.  Alan and Alyson are superb couriers, and we feel lucky to have them in the Vale.”",[],{"type":126,"text":7241,"spans":7242},"When asked why they do it, they said, “It’s just a bit of fun, but people look forward to seeing it and it’s something different for us to look forward to as well. Of course, the children love it, but so do a lot of our older customers who don’t see many people, we often stop and have a quick chat with them on the doorstep, it really cheers them up and gives them some joy. Because we’ve been doing this so long now, a lot of these customer have become friends, who wouldn’t want to make a friend laugh or smile.”",[],{"type":126,"text":7244,"spans":7245},"Alan went onto to say, “People trust us so much, just a couple of weeks ago someone asked to help rescue a parcel from that was delivered incorrectly by another company that was needed for an anniversary. They were so happy we were able to help they’ve been baking us cakes ever since.”",[],{"id":7247,"uid":7248,"url":7249,"type":50,"href":7250,"tags":7251,"first_publication_date":7252,"last_publication_date":7253,"slugs":7254,"linked_documents":7255,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":7256,"data":7257},"ZgFQmxAAACgAcgtn","evri-confirms-easter-delivery-dates","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-confirms-easter-delivery-dates","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZgFQmxAAACgAcgtn%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2024-03-25T10:28:54+0000","2025-02-13T11:19:47+0000",[7248],[],[],{"title":7258,"category":8,"metaDescription":7259,"canonical":7260,"titleTag":7261,"featuredImage":7262,"publishedDate":7272,"slices":7273},"Evri confirms Easter delivery dates","Read here about Evri's Easter delivery dates","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-confirms-easter-delivery-dates","Evri confirms Easter delivery dates  | Evri",{"dimensions":7263,"alt":7264,"copyright":8,"url":7265,"id":7266,"edit":7267,"thumbnail":7268},{"width":65,"height":865},"A female courier is walking up a quiet British street. A white picket fence can be seen beside her and she is holding a brown paper parcel in her hand.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zAdZbqstJ9-iNi_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9627.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6zAdZbqstJ9-iNi",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":7269,"alt":7264,"copyright":8,"url":7270,"id":7266,"edit":7271},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zAdZbqstJ9-iNi_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9627.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2024-01-19",[7274],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":7275,"primary":7277,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[7276],{},{"content":7278},[7279,7283,7287,7292,7297,7305],{"type":126,"text":7280,"spans":7281},"19th March 2024: Evri, the UK's biggest dedicated parcel delivery company, is pleased to announce important dates for the upcoming Easter weekend. Evri understands that every parcel matters, especially over significant holidays such as Easter and its urging consumers to order early so parcels arrive before the bank holiday weekend.",[7282],{"start":32,"end":362,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":7284,"spans":7285},"Services:",[7286],{"start":32,"end":683,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":7288,"spans":7289}," ·       Home delivery: Evri couriers will not be delivering on Easter Sunday 31st March or Easter Monday 1st April.",[7290,7291],{"start":32,"end":33,"type":163},{"start":683,"end":229,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":7293,"spans":7294}," ·       Sending a parcel: The last opportunity to send a parcel for arrival before Good Friday 29th March would be to send a parcel using Evri’s next day service from a ParcelShop by 12pm (midday) on Wednesday 27th March.",[7295,7296],{"start":32,"end":33,"type":163},{"start":683,"end":3553,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":7298,"spans":7299},"·       ParcelShops and Lockers: Many ParcelShops will still be open for consumers to pick up or drop off parcels over the Easter weekend. Evri advises checking opening times of ParcelShops before making a journey. Lockers are available 24\u002F7. Find a ParcelShop at: evri.com\u002Ffind-a-parcelshop",[7300,7301],{"start":321,"end":3455,"type":163},{"start":7302,"end":7303,"type":279,"data":7304},265,291,{"link_type":281,"url":3692},{"type":126,"text":7306,"spans":7307}," ·       Customer service: Customers can get in touch 24\u002F7 via telephone or chat. Many issues, such as missing address information, can be dealt with automatically. For more complex issues, consumers can log an enquiry by chat or leaving a message and an advisor will respond as quickly as possible.  Evri’s UK-based customer service teams will not be working on Good Friday 29th March and Easter Monday 1st April. Get help from Evri at: evri.com\u002Fcontact-us",[7308,7309,7310],{"start":32,"end":33,"type":163},{"start":683,"end":372,"type":163},{"start":617,"end":7311,"type":279,"data":7312},457,{"link_type":281,"url":7313},"press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fcontact-us",{"id":7315,"uid":7316,"url":7317,"type":50,"href":7318,"tags":7319,"first_publication_date":7320,"last_publication_date":7321,"slugs":7322,"linked_documents":7323,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":7324,"data":7325},"ZdyYfhEAACQAk6Bm","evri-and-kbf-enterprises-announce-strategic-partnership-to-fuel-global-expansion","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-and-kbf-enterprises-announce-strategic-partnership-to-fuel-global-expansion","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZdyYfhEAACQAk6Bm%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2024-02-26T13:59:20+0000","2025-02-13T11:25:08+0000",[7316],[],[],{"title":7326,"category":8,"metaDescription":7327,"canonical":7328,"titleTag":7329,"featuredImage":7330,"publishedDate":7340,"slices":7341},"Evri and KBF Enterprises announce strategic partnership to fuel global expansion","Read here about Evri's partnership with KBF Enterprises","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-and-kbf-enterprises-announce-strategic-partnership-to-fuel-global-expansion","Evri and KBF Enterprises announce strategic partnership to fuel global expansion | Evri",{"dimensions":7331,"alt":7332,"copyright":8,"url":7333,"id":7334,"edit":7335,"thumbnail":7336},{"width":65,"height":865},"An Evri Courier gathering multiple parcels from their car to deliver to their destination","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDWJbqstJ9-ce__EVRI_LOCATION_04_3369.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6pDWJbqstJ9-ce_",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":7337,"alt":7332,"copyright":8,"url":7338,"id":7334,"edit":7339},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDWJbqstJ9-ce__EVRI_LOCATION_04_3369.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2024-02-26",[7342,7363,7370],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":7343,"primary":7345,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[7344],{},{"content":7346},[7347,7351,7354,7357,7360],{"type":126,"text":7348,"spans":7349},"26th February 2023: Evri, the UK's biggest dedicated parcel delivery company, and KBF Enterprises, today announced a new three-year contract set to drive international expansion for the sports nutrition business.",[7350],{"start":32,"end":2234,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":7352,"spans":7353},"KBF Enterprises, owner of Warrior, one of the country’s leading sports nutrition brands has awarded Evri a three-year extension to its delivery contract which will now include fulfilment via its UK, European, USA and rest-of-world distribution sites.",[],{"type":126,"text":7355,"spans":7356},"KBF Enterprises will leverage Evri's strategically located fulfilment warehouses located across the world; from Basildon, UK to Utrecht, Netherlands and New Jersey, US to Oman in the Middle East, to stock and distribute its popular range of protein bars and supplements. The collaboration will enable KBF Enterprises to accelerate its global expansion in North America, MENA and European regions, expanding its e-commerce offering internationally for the first time.",[],{"type":126,"text":7358,"spans":7359},"The collaboration between Evri and KBF Enterprises will significantly reduce delivery times to their customers by allowing KBF Enterprises to be situated ‘in territory’ to give customer that localised experience, thanks to Evri's efficient delivery network and proximity to key markets in Europe and America. KBF Enterprises’ customers will also be able to track parcels end-to-end, ensuring a seamless and transparent delivery experience.",[],{"type":126,"text":7361,"spans":7362},"Evri recently invested £11m in its specialist international function, opening ‘express lanes’ to a number of international destinations – it plans to increase the number of ‘express lanes’ this year. A challenging retail climate, impacted by the cost of living in the UK, means retailers are looking for other solutions and new markets for additional customers. KBF Enterprises has ambitious plans to increase its international presence this year and Evri’s pan-European network and expertise will empower KBF Enterprises to efficiently reach new markets and expand its international footprint. Evri will be supporting the retailer with its unique package of services designed to simplify international growth for businesses of any size.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":7364,"primary":7366,"id":7369,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[7365],{},{"quoteText":7367,"quoteSource":7368},"We are thrilled to extend our partnership with KBF Enterprises and support their ambitious global expansion plans. Our strategically located fulfilment centres and expertise in cross-border logistics will enable KBF Enterprises to offer their customers a faster and more convenient delivery experience, ultimately contributing to their continued success.","Mike Roberts, Fulfilment Business Development Manager at Evri","quote$ef35aca1-5fbb-495b-81ae-4f249f651728",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":7371,"primary":7373,"id":7376,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[7372],{},{"quoteText":7374,"quoteSource":7375},"Evri has been a trusted partner in delivering our products to our customers in the UK for many years. We are confident that their European fulfilment network and logistics capabilities will be instrumental in driving our international growth. This partnership will allow us to offer our customers across Europe and North America the same exceptional e-commerce service our UK customers receive – giving more people across the globe online access to the Warrior range of sports nutrition products and taking us one step closer to our achieving our ambitious international expansion plans.","Kieran Fisher, Founder of Warrior and KBF Enterprises","quote$0a0c7648-a10a-4065-8c1d-62c7d16bd851",{"id":7378,"uid":7379,"url":7380,"type":50,"href":7381,"tags":7382,"first_publication_date":7383,"last_publication_date":7383,"slugs":7384,"linked_documents":7386,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":7387,"data":7388},"ZctltBIAACkAFzIk","evri-reveals-road-trip-of-the-most-romantic-uk-street-names","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-reveals-road-trip-of-the-most-romantic-uk-street-names","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZctltBIAACkAFzIk%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2024-02-13T12:56:19+0000",[7379,7385],"evri-delivers-love-is-this-britains-most-romantic-courier-couple",[],[],{"title":7389,"category":8,"metaDescription":7390,"canonical":7391,"titleTag":7392,"featuredImage":7393,"publishedDate":7406,"slices":7407},"Evri reveals road trip of the most romantic UK street names","Read here about Evri road trip of the most romantic UK street names","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-reveals-road-trip-of-the-most-romantic-uk-street-names","Evri reveals road trip of the most romantic UK street names | Evri",{"dimensions":7394,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":7396,"id":7397,"edit":7398,"thumbnail":7400},{"width":65,"height":7395},504,"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fdd28e2ab-937c-42d7-be17-5d13c17295ed_Valentine%27s-Street-Names-1200x630.png?auto=compress,format&rect=0,0,1200,630&w=960&h=504","ZctlVRIAACgAFzFt",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":7399,"background":71},0.8,{"dimensions":7401,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":7402,"id":7397,"edit":7403},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fdd28e2ab-937c-42d7-be17-5d13c17295ed_Valentine%27s-Street-Names-1200x630.png?auto=compress,format&rect=0,31,1200,569&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":7404,"zoom":7405,"background":71},-10,0.32,"2024-02-12",[7408,7426,7458],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":7409,"primary":7411,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[7410],{},{"content":7412},[7413,7420,7423],{"type":126,"text":7414,"spans":7415},"12th February 2024: Love is in air, but you don’t need to jet off to Paris to find romance when it’s right here on your doorstep. Evri, the UK’s biggest dedicated delivery company, has revealed some of the most romantic street names its couriers deliver to.",[7416,7417],{"start":32,"end":2234,"type":163},{"start":7418,"end":470,"type":279,"data":7419},130,{"link_type":281,"url":348},{"type":126,"text":7421,"spans":7422},"There are over two million streets across the UK, so it’s no surprise some of them have love inspired names. Evri has created a romantic road trip of the UK so the public know exactly where to go to find the loved-up lanes.",[],{"type":126,"text":7424,"spans":7425},"Evri drivers are on the road, delivering to 12 million households each week, making over 720 million deliveries a year. Topping the list with what its couriers think is the most romantic street name is Love Lane, it seems like a popular choice as well, with 123 lanes sharing the same name. Coming in second and third are Valentine Close and Lovers Walk. ",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":7427,"primary":7453,"id":7456,"slice_type":7457,"slice_label":8},[7428,7431,7434,7436,7439,7441,7443,7446,7449,7451],{"Col1Content":7429,"Col2Content":7430},"Love Lane","123",{"Col1Content":7432,"Col2Content":7433},"Valentine Close","14",{"Col1Content":7435,"Col2Content":7433},"Lovers Walk",{"Col1Content":7437,"Col2Content":7438},"Lovington Lane","3",{"Col1Content":7440,"Col2Content":7438},"St Valentines CLose",{"Col1Content":7442,"Col2Content":7438},"Roses Close",{"Col1Content":7444,"Col2Content":7445},"Lovers Avenue","2",{"Col1Content":7447,"Col2Content":7448},"Kissing Gate","1",{"Col1Content":7450,"Col2Content":7448},"Date Street",{"Col1Content":7452,"Col2Content":7448},"Heart in Hand Road",{"SectionTitle":8,"SectionSubtitle":8,"Col1Header":7454,"Col2Header":7455,"TableFooter":8,"isTableShort":8},"Street name","Number of streets","information_table$a6601533-4671-4f52-b8ae-b1881b601ceb","information_table",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":7459,"primary":7461,"id":7472,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[7460],{},{"content":7462},[7463,7466,7469],{"type":126,"text":7464,"spans":7465},"Those are the obvious choices, but Evri hasn’t stopped there, it’s also revealed some of the more uniquely romantic street names its couriers deliver to. These include Passionflower Close, Amor Place, Lusted Road, Bleeding Heart Court, Dear Love Gate, Sweetloves Lane, Hearts Delight, Cupids Chase and Kissing Tree Lane.",[],{"type":126,"text":7467,"spans":7468},"An Evri spokesperson, said: \"Valentine's Day is all about celebrating love in all its forms, while a box of chocolates or some new underwear might be appreciated, we wanted to offer something a little different this year – a chance to discover the hidden gems of romance nestled amidst our delivery routes.\"",[],{"type":126,"text":7470,"spans":7471},"Roses Close in Jesmond, Newcastle is a stone’s throw from Jesmond Dene, a wonderful historic park. Kissing Gate is just outside Hull, known for its aquarium. Next up is Love Lane in Ossett, Wakefield a few streets away from Ossett’s impressive town hall, is home to two real ale breweries and not far from the home of local celebrity Jane McDonald. Fourth on the list is Valentine Close in Sheffield – the city famous for its music scene, producing acts including Pulp, Def Leppard and Arctic Monkeys. Continuing the road trip to Lovers Lane in Oldham near Lydgate village and not far from thriving Uppermill with its quaint canal-side coffee shops. Onwards to St Valentines Close in West Bromwich on the edge of Sandwell Valley Country Park then to Lovington Walk in Leicester – Leicester known for England’s ‘lost king’ Richard III being found beneath a car park. Next stop is Lovers Walk in Dunstable; Dunstable Downs, a chalky escarpment outside the town, is a popular site for kite flying, paragliding and hang gliding. Date Street in Elephant and Castle, a thriving community with a variety of notable buildings and a number of notable residents including Charlie Chaplin. A final stop brings you to Heart in Hand Road, a short distance from historical landmark Reculver Towers.",[],"rich_text$80387d44-6e95-483b-98af-0f7f13877ba1",{"id":7474,"uid":7475,"url":7476,"type":50,"href":7477,"tags":7478,"first_publication_date":7479,"last_publication_date":7480,"slugs":7481,"linked_documents":7483,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":7484,"data":7485},"Zctk4RIAACkAFzCn","is-this-britains-most-romantic-courier-couple","\u002Fpress\u002Fis-this-britains-most-romantic-courier-couple","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22Zctk4RIAACkAFzCn%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2024-02-13T12:50:17+0000","2024-02-13T12:50:48+0000",[7385,7482],"evris-hr-chief-takes-the-wheel-to-champion-female-drivers",[],[],{"title":7486,"category":8,"metaDescription":7487,"canonical":7488,"titleTag":7489,"featuredImage":7490,"publishedDate":7406,"slices":7500},"Evri delivers love: Is this Britain’s most romantic courier couple?","Read here about Britain's most romantic courier couple","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fis-this-britains-most-romantic-courier-couple","Evri delivers love: Is this Britain’s most romantic courier couple? | Evri",{"dimensions":7491,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":7492,"id":7493,"edit":7494,"thumbnail":7495},{"width":65,"height":1242},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F777760fb-6de7-4fd8-8c5c-8a6b288bc2ca_Gill+Steve+Evri.jpeg?auto=compress,format&rect=0,0,1200,900&w=960&h=720","ZctlnxIAACoAFzH8",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":7399,"background":34},{"dimensions":7496,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":7497,"id":7493,"edit":7498},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F777760fb-6de7-4fd8-8c5c-8a6b288bc2ca_Gill+Steve+Evri.jpeg?auto=compress,format&rect=0,166,1200,569&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":7499,"zoom":7405,"background":34},-53,[7501],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":7502,"primary":7504,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[7503],{},{"content":7505},[7506,7510,7513,7516,7519,7522,7525,7529,7533,7537],{"type":126,"text":7507,"spans":7508},"12th February 2024: With Valentine's Day just around the corner, love is definitely in the air – and on the roads! Evri, the UK's biggest dedicated parcel delivery company, is proud to shine a spotlight on one of its most heart-warming couples: Steve and Gill, a husband-and-wife team who have been delivering smiles (and parcels) together for five years.",[7509],{"start":32,"end":2234,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":7511,"spans":7512},"Steve and Gill, who met at work, deliver together on their round in Peterborough. They met whilst loading their vans next to each other and bonded over a similar taste in music and a good giggle. \"It was love at first delivery,\" laughs Gill. \"We bonded over shared stories of our favourite customers, a love of gin and a passion for showing the world how good couriers act.\"",[],{"type":126,"text":7514,"spans":7515},"They work on different rounds, out of the same depot so they can still share those special moments of loading their vans side by side and reminiscing about the time they realised they both had an aversion to black pens, preferring blue ink and reserving black for ‘official documents’.",[],{"type":126,"text":7517,"spans":7518},"Gill has delivered for Evri for 20 years and Steve for seven. Gill has seen people have babies and now their babies have grown up and are old enough to order their own clothes. They have been together for over four years and got married on the fourth anniversary of them getting together, in October 2023. Steve asked Gill out for a drink and “the rest is history”, he adds. \"Working together is a dream come true. I’ve realised this is exactly what life is supposed to be like and we’re so grateful to Evri that we get to spend our days side-by-side, delivering gifts that bring joy and excitement to people's lives. Valentine's Day is always a special time – seeing the excitement on people's faces when they receive a surprise parcel makes it all the more rewarding.\"",[],{"type":126,"text":7520,"spans":7521},"Last weekend, even though Steve was using up some of his holidays, he chose to drive Gill around, just so they could spend a little more time together. That’s why we think we’ve found the most romantic courier couple in Britain.",[],{"type":126,"text":7523,"spans":7524},"Gill and Steve offer their top tips for those planning a romantic surprise with some clever tips to keep your gifts under wraps:",[],{"type":126,"text":7526,"spans":7527},"1.    Divert your delivery: Choose a convenient Evri ParcelShop or locker as your delivery location. Steve shares, \"It's the perfect way to pick up your Valentine's surprise discreetly – no need to worry about prying eyes at home!\"",[7528],{"start":819,"end":3553,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":7530,"spans":7531},"2.    Track your parcel: Stay ahead of the game with Evri's handy app, you can track your parcel and add extra information for your courier, too. Gill says, \"You can see exactly when your parcel is out for delivery, so you can plan your grand reveal accordingly.\"",[7532],{"start":819,"end":1075,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":7534,"spans":7535},"3.    Get creative with delivery instructions: Leave specific instructions for the driver, by using what3words or adding a map pin and photo of exactly where you want a parcel hidden like in the bucket in the shed. Steve adds, \"Our drivers are happy to help make your surprise delivery extra special.\"",[7536],{"start":819,"end":278,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":7538,"spans":7539},"From delivering romantic chocolates to surprise clothing bundles, Gill and Steve are proud to play a role in making Valentine's Day a success. \"It's a privilege to be part of someone's love story,\" says Gill. \"We're not just delivering parcels, we're delivering happiness, one parcel at a time.\"",[],{"id":7541,"uid":7482,"url":7542,"type":50,"href":7543,"tags":7544,"first_publication_date":7545,"last_publication_date":7546,"slugs":7547,"linked_documents":7548,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":7549,"data":7550},"ZcIxmhIAAB4Aly7t","\u002Fpress\u002Fevris-hr-chief-takes-the-wheel-to-champion-female-drivers","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZcIxmhIAAB4Aly7t%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2024-02-06T13:22:50+0000","2025-02-13T11:27:00+0000",[7482],[],[],{"title":7551,"category":8,"metaDescription":7552,"canonical":7553,"titleTag":7554,"featuredImage":7555,"publishedDate":7564,"slices":7565},"Evri’s HR chief takes the wheel to champion female drivers","Read here about Evri’s HR chief taking the wheel to champion female drivers","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevris-hr-chief-takes-the-wheel-to-champion-female-drivers","Evri’s HR chief takes the wheel to champion female drivers | Evri",{"dimensions":7556,"alt":6536,"copyright":8,"url":7557,"id":7558,"edit":7559,"thumbnail":7560},{"width":65,"height":865},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zBSJbqstJ9-iOp_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9780.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6zBSJbqstJ9-iOp",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":7561,"alt":6536,"copyright":8,"url":7562,"id":7558,"edit":7563},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zBSJbqstJ9-iOp_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9780.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2024-02-06",[7566,7615,7621,7627],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":7567,"primary":7569,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[7568],{},{"content":7570},[7571,7575,7578,7581,7584,7587,7590,7593,7596,7602,7606,7609,7612],{"type":126,"text":7572,"spans":7573},"6th February 2024: Evri, the UK's biggest dedicated parcel delivery company, today announced its ambition to become the employer of choice for female drivers in the industry. While 30% of its couriers are women, the number of female HGV, LGV and van drivers remains around 3%, only slightly above the industry average.",[7574],{"start":32,"end":2233,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":7576,"spans":7577},"Lyn Warren, Evri's Chief Human Resources Officer, is spearheading the company's efforts to close this gap. With over 20 years of experience in HR and retail, Lyn brings a wealth of expertise in building inclusive and engaging workplaces. She is leading by example, currently undergoing training to obtain her own CAT C licence, demonstrating Evri's commitment to inspiring other women to consider these fulfilling career paths.",[],{"type":126,"text":7579,"spans":7580},"Evri's announcement during National Apprenticeship Week, which takes place from 5th to 10th February 2024. The company will be using the week to highlight its commitment to apprenticeships and attract new talent into the logistics industry.",[],{"type":126,"text":7582,"spans":7583},"Evri will launch several initiatives to attract and retain female drivers, including:",[],{"type":126,"text":7585,"spans":7586},"·       A new recruitment and communications campaign to raise awareness and champion female drivers as well as providing more information on becoming a trainee driver, which will include experienced female drivers telling their stories. ",[],{"type":126,"text":7588,"spans":7589},"·       Listening groups with existing female drivers to understand how Evri can make its workplace a more inclusive environment. Evri wants to ensure that when attracting new drivers, they are retained, and their experience is a positive one. ",[],{"type":126,"text":7591,"spans":7592},"·       A mentoring programme with existing experienced female drivers to support new ones. It can be daunting starting a new career in any environment, and feedback from our existing female drivers has shown the value of having a mentor they can ask questions.",[],{"type":126,"text":7594,"spans":7595},"Driver roles at Evri are often day shifts and in most instances, return to their start point within the shift, meaning no sleeping in cabs. This has often been given as a blocker to women taking driver roles. Evri has dedicated Driving Academy facilities across the UK, including Wakefield and Hemel Hempstead where a pipeline of future LGV drivers are given the training required to achieve their CAT C or to progress to CAT C+E licence. Evri funds this training for both internal and newly recruited colleagues. Lyn Warren is mid-way through her training and hopes to pass this year. ",[],{"type":126,"text":7597,"spans":7598},"Aspiring drivers can find out more and apply at: www.evri.com\u002Fdriver-academy",[7599],{"start":5125,"end":1949,"type":279,"data":7600},{"link_type":281,"url":7601},"press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fdriver-academy",{"type":126,"text":7603,"spans":7604},"Further information",[7605],{"start":32,"end":2233,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":7607,"spans":7608},"In the past year, Evri has launched new policies in line with its ambition of creating a truly inclusive workplace, including its menopause and fertility guides, transitioning at work guide, and inclusive language handbook. ",[],{"type":126,"text":7610,"spans":7611},"Evri's commitment to gender equality extends beyond HGV drivers. The company is also working to increase the representation of women in other traditionally male-dominated roles in our operation. Evri’s latest Gender Pay Gap report, published in 2024, shows that it has increased the number of women in leadership roles, has a mean gender pay gap of 2.5%, well below the UK’s mean gender pay gap at 8.3%, and a higher percentage of women than men achieved a bonus in 2023.",[],{"type":126,"text":7613,"spans":7614},"According to data published by the Driver and Vehicle Standards Agency, the percentage of women taking a LGV CPC practical test increased from 4.6% in 2021-22 to 5.4% in 2022-23 up to 6.4% in 2023-24 so far. Evri hopes to see this increase at a faster rate. More than 200 apprentices and trainee drivers have gone through Evri’s driving academy in the last two years.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":7616,"primary":7618,"id":4197,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[7617],{},{"quoteText":7619,"quoteSource":7620},"I'm passionate about creating a workplace where everyone, regardless of background or gender, can thrive, the logistics industry has traditionally been male dominated, but I believe women have the talent and skillset to excel in this field. We're removing barriers and creating opportunities for women to join our team, and I'm confident that we can make Evri a place where they can reach their full potential.","Lyn Warren, CHRO at Evri",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":7622,"primary":7624,"id":7626,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[7623],{},{"quoteText":7625,"quoteSource":6821},"We know that a diverse workforce is a strong workforce. By creating a more inclusive workplace, we can attract and retain the best talent and build a more successful business. We're committed to making Evri a place where everyone has the opportunity to reach their full potential, regardless of who they are.","quote$177ab880-1fa0-41f1-8b3b-02911bf38240",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":7628,"primary":7630,"id":7633,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[7629],{},{"quoteText":7631,"quoteSource":7632},"Hayley Stocks, current LGV driver, was formerly a dental nurse for ten years before she decided to change careers in 2020","I haven’t looked back since! Being an LGV driver gives you more freedom and life choices than my previous job, you can choose the hours, shifts and type of work you prefer. The Driving Academy team were brilliant! They made me feel at ease from day one. Since I’ve passed my C+E with the Driving Academy, it has opened more doors for my career, given me more responsibility within my place of work and the knowledge I will most likely never be out of a job. And to top it off, the training course test was paid for by Evri and no expense to myself.","quote$e65d03b8-e445-4c18-bf0c-9b8028dd5306",{"id":7635,"uid":7636,"url":7637,"type":50,"href":7638,"tags":7639,"first_publication_date":7640,"last_publication_date":7641,"slugs":7642,"linked_documents":7643,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":7644,"data":7645},"ZbdssRIAAB4ANjWP","ann-summers-chooses-evri-as-sole-delivery-partner-for-multi-million-pound-contract","\u002Fpress\u002Fann-summers-chooses-evri-as-sole-delivery-partner-for-multi-million-pound-contract","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZbdssRIAAB4ANjWP%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2024-01-29T09:20:26+0000","2026-04-10T10:23:55+0000",[7636],[],[],{"title":7646,"category":8,"metaDescription":7647,"canonical":7648,"titleTag":7649,"featuredImage":7650,"publishedDate":7660,"slices":7661},"Ann Summers chooses Evri as sole delivery partner for multi-million-pound contract","Read here about Evri's partnership with Ann Summers","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fann-summers-chooses-evri-as-sole-delivery-partner-for-multi-million-pound-contract","Ann Summers chooses Evri as sole delivery partner  | Evri",{"dimensions":7651,"alt":7652,"copyright":8,"url":7653,"id":7654,"edit":7655,"thumbnail":7656},{"width":65,"height":865},"A courier scanning a parcel barcode using their mobile device","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDc5bqstJ9-cfO_EVRI_LOCATION_04_3711.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6pDc5bqstJ9-cfO",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":7657,"alt":7652,"copyright":8,"url":7658,"id":7654,"edit":7659},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDc5bqstJ9-cfO_EVRI_LOCATION_04_3711.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2024-01-29",[7662,7686,7692],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":7663,"primary":7665,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[7664],{},{"content":7666},[7667,7671,7674,7677,7680,7683],{"type":126,"text":7668,"spans":7669},"29th January 2024: Ann Summers, the leading retailer of lingerie and sex toys, has awarded Evri, the biggest dedicated parcel delivery company, a multi-million-pound delivery contract.",[7670],{"start":32,"end":2233,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":7672,"spans":7673},"Evri has been selected as the sole partner to handle all of Ann Summers’ business-to-customer parcels including delivery pick-up, drop-off (PUDO) and returns. Evri was chosen to partner with the retailer due to a combination of its operational capacity, delivery options, sustainability initiatives and overall cost effectiveness. Last year, Evri delivered over 700 million parcels on behalf of many of the UK’s top retailers, serving over 12 million customers per week. Choosing Evri enables the retailer to continue to offer free delivery when customers spend over £40 – keeping the brand accessible during the cost-of-living crisis. ",[],{"type":126,"text":7675,"spans":7676},"Evri has a network of more than 14,000 PUDO locations including ParcelShops and lockers. Delivery to ParcelShops, which are often located in Tesco Express stores, Post Office branches or independent convenience stores, and usually within a 10-minute walk, typically reduces carbon by 45% compared to a traditional home delivery – which helps the retailer on its journey to become more sustainable and helps satisfy the eco-minded shoppers who want to shop more sustainably. Delivery to ParcelShops can also be a more discreet way to receive a parcel, enabling customers to maintain the mystery when gift-giving this Christmas.",[],{"type":126,"text":7678,"spans":7679},"Other sustainability initiatives include the use of electric delivery bikes, bio-methane fuelled vehicles and electric ParcelShop vans which have contributed towards Evri’s reduction in operational carbon emissions by 31% since last year. Evri had the lowest carbon per parcel output of any major delivery company when comparing 2021-22 data.",[],{"type":126,"text":7681,"spans":7682}," To increase convenience, customers can upgrade to next day or Sunday delivery with a one-hour or two-hour delivery window. In-flight diversions, branded customer communications and delivery photo for every parcel will typically come as standard.",[],{"type":126,"text":7684,"spans":7685},"This announcement follows news in September 2023 that Ann Summers hit over £100m turnover and revealed plans to open more stores across the UK.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":7687,"primary":7689,"id":4197,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[7688],{},{"quoteText":7690,"quoteSource":7691},"\"Ann Summers is a leading British retailer in its field with a recognisable brand and heritage which dates back to the 70s– a similar heritage to Evri which was born out of Grattan Mail Order in Bradford around the same time. We are delighted to be given the opportunity to partner with them to deliver a more sustainable, reliable and cost-effective service for their customers.”","Ryan Norris, Sales Director at Evri",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":7693,"primary":7695,"id":7626,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[7694],{},{"quoteText":7696,"quoteSource":7697},"We are committed to providing our customers with the best possible experience, and this partnership with Evri will help us to achieve this by offering fast, sustainable and high-quality delivery services. We are delighted so far with delivery success rates, the helpfulness of the team and the ease of migration.","Dan Pass, Head of Logistics at Ann Summers",{"id":7699,"uid":7700,"url":7701,"type":50,"href":7702,"tags":7703,"first_publication_date":7704,"last_publication_date":7705,"slugs":7706,"linked_documents":7708,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":7709,"data":7710},"ZbDKFxIAAB8ALJIX","evri-and-chinese-marketplace-jd-announce-landmark-partnership-to-drive-growth-of-european-brands-in-china","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-and-chinese-marketplace-jd-announce-landmark-partnership-to-drive-growth-of-european-brands-in-china","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZbDKFxIAAB8ALJIX%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2024-01-24T08:31:32+0000","2026-04-10T10:26:14+0000",[7707],"evri--jd.com-announce-partnership-to-drive-growth-of-european-brands-in-china",[],[],{"title":7711,"category":8,"metaDescription":7712,"canonical":7713,"titleTag":7714,"featuredImage":7715,"publishedDate":7725,"slices":7726},"Evri & JD.com announce partnership to drive growth of European brands in China","Read here about Evri's landmark partnership with JD.com","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-and-chinese-marketplace-jd-announce-landmark-partnership-to-drive-growth-of-european-brands-in-china","Evri & JD.com Announce Partnership  in China | Evri",{"dimensions":7716,"alt":7717,"copyright":8,"url":7718,"id":7719,"edit":7720,"thumbnail":7721},{"width":65,"height":865},"An Evri Courier about to deliver two parcels, and a customer ready to recieve them are being entertained by a child with a football.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6tiQ5bqstJ9-e-k_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6830.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6tiQ5bqstJ9-e-k",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":7722,"alt":7717,"copyright":8,"url":7723,"id":7719,"edit":7724},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6tiQ5bqstJ9-e-k_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6830.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2024-01-24",[7727,7748,7754],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":7728,"primary":7730,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[7729],{},{"content":7731},[7732,7736,7739,7742,7745],{"type":126,"text":7733,"spans":7734},"24th January 2024: Evri, the UK’s biggest dedicated parcel delivery company, and Chinese marketplace JD.com today announced a partnership aimed at bridging the gap between European brands and the market in China. The integration of JD.com's advanced logistics and e-commerce capabilities in China with Evri’s extensive delivery network across Europe will offer European businesses a seamless and efficient gateway to access JD.com's vast consumer base in China – and Chinese brands enhanced growth opportunities in Europe.",[7735],{"start":32,"end":587,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":7737,"spans":7738},"JD.com and Evri’s partnership represents an integration of the companies’ core strengths in logistics, supply chain, and cross-border e-commerce, establishing comprehensive two-way logistics services that span across China and Europe. This collaboration is set to open doors for European brands and merchants, particularly in the UK, providing them access to JD.com's vast customer base of 600 million consumers in China.",[],{"type":126,"text":7740,"spans":7741},"Leveraging Evri's extensive delivery network throughout Europe, JD Logistics will offer customers in China enhanced services and offerings to European brands. The services will include Evri’s local pick-up and warehousing in Europe and then international transportation, access to Chinese bonded warehouses, customs clearance, and comprehensive delivery across China.",[],{"type":126,"text":7743,"spans":7744},"Moreover, JD Worldwide, the cross-border e-commerce platform of JD.com, will provide Evri’s retail partners with valuable insights on the Chinese market including consumer behaviour, marketing and pricing strategies, product selection advice, and online operational strategies specific to China. The partnership will initially prioritize the beauty and apparel sectors, areas where JD.com has substantial insights into the shopping preferences of Chinese consumers.",[],{"type":126,"text":7746,"spans":7747},"The collaboration will also enable JD Logistics to offer integrated warehousing and comprehensive delivery solutions to clients in Europe by leveraging Evri’s local distribution network and JD’s self-operated overseas warehouses.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":7749,"primary":7751,"id":4197,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[7750],{},{"quoteText":7752,"quoteSource":7753},"This is a landmark partnership between Evri and JD.com and a powerful testament to the growing synergy between the economies of the UK and China. By combining our expertise and resources, we're supporting the growth of British businesses in new markets and also fostering sustainable growth for both Evri and JD.com. We're confident that this collaboration will pave the way for a vibrant future of innovation and collaboration in the e-commerce landscape. While Evri is perhaps best known as the UK’s biggest dedicated parcel delivery company, we continue to grow internationally and deliver to more than 200 countries in six continents across Europe, Asia and the rest of the world, including from our modern warehouses overseas.","David Saenz, Chief Growth Officer at Evri",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":7755,"primary":7757,"id":7626,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[7756],{},{"quoteText":7758,"quoteSource":7759},"By integrating Evri's extensive delivery network with our cutting-edge logistics solutions, JD.com is enhancing our service capabilities in Europe and simultaneously offering European brands a direct and efficient pathway to the expansive Chinese market. This partnership underscores our dedication to building a robust global logistics network and our commitment to the success of international brands.\nJD.com operates nearly 90 international warehouses in 15 countries and regions and plans to further extend its global supply chain and logistics network over the next three years. This partnership reinforces JD.com’s position as a global leader in the e-commerce and logistics sectors, demonstrating its ability to bridge markets and create new opportunities for businesses worldwide.","Qun Xue, Vice President of JD.com and Head of JD Logistics International",{"id":7761,"uid":7762,"url":7763,"type":50,"href":7764,"tags":7765,"first_publication_date":7766,"last_publication_date":7767,"slugs":7768,"linked_documents":7770,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":7771,"data":7772},"Za46JhEAAOTqhzce","evri-delivers-record-peak-season-of-more-than-150m-parcels-boosted-by-a-late-festive-surge-from-discount-seeking-shoppers","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-delivers-record-peak-season-of-more-than-150m-parcels-boosted-by-a-late-festive-surge-from-discount-seeking-shoppers","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22Za46JhEAAOTqhzce%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2024-01-22T09:53:35+0000","2026-04-10T10:16:38+0000",[7769],"evri-delivers-record-peak-season-of-more-than-150m-parcels",[],[],{"title":7773,"category":8,"metaDescription":7774,"canonical":7775,"titleTag":7776,"featuredImage":7777,"publishedDate":7783,"slices":7784},"Evri delivers record peak season of more than 150m parcels","Read here about Evri's record peak season 2023","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-delivers-record-peak-season-of-more-than-150m-parcels-boosted-by-a-late-festive-surge-from-discount-seeking-shoppers","Evri Delivers Record Peak Season - More Than 150M Parcels | Evri",{"dimensions":7778,"alt":7332,"copyright":8,"url":7333,"id":7334,"edit":7779,"thumbnail":7780},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":7781,"alt":7332,"copyright":8,"url":7338,"id":7334,"edit":7782},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2024-01-22",[7785,7820],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":7786,"primary":7788,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[7787],{},{"content":7789},[7790,7792,7795,7798,7801,7805,7808,7811,7814,7817],{"type":126,"text":7773,"spans":7791,"direction":112},[],{"type":109,"text":7793,"spans":7794,"direction":112},"Evri delivers best-ever peak season with parcel volumes surpassing 150 million and 99% of deliveries handled on time",[],{"type":109,"text":7796,"spans":7797,"direction":112},"Customers left their shopping late with 21% spike in parcel volumes in the final week ",[],{"type":109,"text":7799,"spans":7800,"direction":112},"Record performance boosted by Evri’s significant investment in customer services ",[],{"type":126,"text":7802,"spans":7803,"direction":112},"22nd January 2024: Evri delivered a record performance of more than 150 million parcels over its peak festive period, driven by a 21% surge in deliveries in the final Christmas week as bargain-hunting consumers left their shopping late. ",[7804],{"start":32,"end":587,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":7806,"spans":7807,"direction":112},"Customers appeared open to shopping around in the search for value, holding out for bargains with traditional retailers, but also expanding the use of new brands and the increased use of marketplaces. Evri saw continued strong demand from China’s ecommerce fashion and online marketplace new entrants over the festive season.",[],{"type":126,"text":7809,"spans":7810,"direction":112},"Evri grew parcel volumes to more than 154 million over the nine weeks to 30 December 2023, including a delivery blitz in the final seven days after cautious shoppers waited for discounts before purchasing – with last-minute gifts featuring heavily – in contrast to lower volumes around Black Friday in November. The company’s best-ever peak season was supported by the £32m service investment plan into its operations and customer service teams with service levels consistently at or above 99% for standard deliveries – up several percentage points on last year. The business hired over 6,500 colleagues to fulfil orders and handle customer queries during the period between Black Friday and Christmas.",[],{"type":126,"text":7812,"spans":7813,"direction":112},"Evri’s peak performance was supported by its launch of a new automatic callback function via a new dedicated phone line, which is already connecting thousands more customers to a UK-based advisor at Evri’s contact centre. The new callback function is an Interactive Voice Response phone service that connects customers who call Evri directly to one of its advisors or records a message so they can call back once they’ve looked into the issue. These services promise to deliver a response in 24 hours or less.",[],{"type":126,"text":7815,"spans":7816,"direction":112},"Another boost for customers during peak was the option to use more than 10,000 of Evri’s ParcelShops, and lockers, including 1,200 Tesco stores, giving consumers a convenient alternative to home delivery with the flexibility to collect parcels around their schedules. ",[],{"type":126,"text":7818,"spans":7819,"direction":112},"In May, Evri announced that Amazon had made it an accredited Seller Fulfilled Prime carrier for its Prime service to deliver parcels on behalf of all merchants on the e-commerce giant’s website – giving Evri the opportunity to grow its business by several million parcels a year.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":7821,"primary":7823,"id":4197,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[7822],{},{"quoteText":7824,"quoteSource":5547},"Evri has deep and long-lasting relationships with the majority of the UK’s leading retailers. We were pleased that our service performance across the year and particularly across the peak weeks has been acknowledged across our client base with very positive feedback from brands, including M&S. Every parcel matters – and that is why Evri is committed to continually improving its services by investing in its people, infrastructure and processes.",{"id":7826,"uid":7827,"url":7828,"type":50,"href":7829,"tags":7830,"first_publication_date":7831,"last_publication_date":7832,"slugs":7833,"linked_documents":7834,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":7835,"data":7836},"Za45OBEAAK3FhzWv","evri-moves-to-larger-depot-in-tyneside-to-enable-growth","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-moves-to-larger-depot-in-tyneside-to-enable-growth","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22Za45OBEAAK3FhzWv%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2024-01-22T09:49:17+0000","2025-02-13T11:29:21+0000",[7827],[],[],{"title":7837,"category":8,"metaDescription":7838,"canonical":7839,"titleTag":7840,"featuredImage":7841,"publishedDate":7783,"slices":7851},"Evri moves to larger depot in Tyneside to enable growth","Read here about Evri's new depot in Tyneside","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-moves-to-larger-depot-in-tyneside-to-enable-growth","Evri moves to larger depot in Tyneside to enable growth | Evri",{"dimensions":7842,"alt":7843,"copyright":8,"url":7844,"id":7845,"edit":7846,"thumbnail":7847},{"width":65,"height":865},"An Evri Courier using a ring doorbell to notify a customer that they have arrived with their parcels.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6tghJbqstJ9-e71_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6102.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6tghJbqstJ9-e71",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":7848,"alt":7843,"copyright":8,"url":7849,"id":7845,"edit":7850},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6tghJbqstJ9-e71_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6102.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},[7852,7873],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":7853,"primary":7855,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[7854],{},{"content":7856},[7857,7861,7864,7867,7870],{"type":126,"text":7858,"spans":7859},"Monday 22nd January 2024: Evri, the UK’s biggest dedicated parcel delivery company has relocated to a larger site in Tyneside, approximately 4 miles from the original location. The move is part of a nationwide plan to facilitate future growth of parcel volume driven by continued growth of consumer demand for home delivery.",[7860],{"start":32,"end":346,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":7862,"spans":7863},"For more than 20 years, the Tyneside depot has been an integral part of the community and Evri’s operation in the North East. The enduring commitment is evident not only in the efficient parcel processing of thousands of parcels every day, but also the positive impact it has had on the local economy, with more than 180 people from the community working at the site. ",[],{"type":126,"text":7865,"spans":7866},"As part of the move, Evri will be consolidating both its original site and its pop-up site into one large unit which has been refurbished based on Evri’s requirements. As part of the refurbishment, 8 new state-of-the-art docking areas have been added to ensure swift and seamless processing of parcels.",[],{"type":126,"text":7868,"spans":7869},"The new Tyneside depot, now spanning an expansive 149,000 sq. ft, which is approximately twice the size of the original site, reflects the remarkable growth within the business. The upgraded depot is now equipped to handle an impressive 50,000 additional parcels per day bringing the total capacity to 200,000 per day which demonstrates Evri’s commitment to meeting increasing demand. Evri has signed a lease for the site, committing to more than a decade ahead in the community.",[],{"type":126,"text":7871,"spans":7872},"All existing workers have moved to the new site and Evri expects to create new jobs at the site this year.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":7874,"primary":7876,"id":4197,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[7875],{},{"quoteText":7877,"quoteSource":7878},"We are very excited to be moving into our new depot. We’ve got a great team here – some have worked here for decades – and provide a great service to the local community. We are very grateful all the team have moved with us - a big thank you to everyone who has helped make this happen.","Gary Chalk, Head of Depots (North), at Evri",{"id":7880,"uid":7881,"url":7882,"type":50,"href":7883,"tags":7884,"first_publication_date":7885,"last_publication_date":7886,"slugs":7887,"linked_documents":7888,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":7889,"data":7890},"ZaalhhEAACUAe_6d","evri-partners-with-pedal--post-to-deliver-in-oxfords-zero-emission-zone","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-partners-with-pedal--post-to-deliver-in-oxfords-zero-emission-zone","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZaalhhEAACUAe_6d%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2024-01-16T16:05:05+0000","2026-04-10T10:27:12+0000",[7881],[],[],{"title":7891,"category":8,"metaDescription":7892,"canonical":7893,"titleTag":7894,"featuredImage":7895,"publishedDate":7905,"slices":7906},"Evri Partners With Pedal & Post to Deliver In Oxford’s Zero Emission Zone","Read here about Evri's partnership with Pedel & Post","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-partners-with-pedal--post-to-deliver-in-oxfords-zero-emission-zone","Evri Partners With Pedal & Post | Evri",{"dimensions":7896,"alt":7897,"copyright":8,"url":7898,"id":7899,"edit":7900,"thumbnail":7901},{"width":65,"height":865},"An Evri Courier carrying multiple parcels to their destination in a residential area","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDZZbqstJ9-cfI_EVRI_LOCATION_04_3589.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6pDZZbqstJ9-cfI",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":7902,"alt":7897,"copyright":8,"url":7903,"id":7899,"edit":7904},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDZZbqstJ9-cfI_EVRI_LOCATION_04_3589.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2024-01-16",[7907,7925,7931],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":7908,"primary":7910,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[7909],{},{"content":7911},[7912,7916,7919,7922],{"type":126,"text":7913,"spans":7914},"15th January 2024: Evri, the UK’s largest dedicated parcel delivery company, has partnered with local cargo bike delivery firm Pedal & Post to provide carbon free deliveries to all consumers homes in Oxford’s Zero Emission Zone.",[7915],{"start":32,"end":2233,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":7917,"spans":7918},"This latest partnership is part of Evri’s wider sustainability strategy and commitment to reach net-zero in direct and indirect carbon emissions by 2035.",[],{"type":126,"text":7920,"spans":7921},"The company, which already uses cargo bikes in Bristol, Edinburgh, Manchester and Wimbledon, has partnered with Pedal & Post, one of the UK’s first low emissions couriers. Pedal & Post will dedicate four EAV cargo bikes to deliver up to 600 parcels per day, increasing to 1,200 during Evri’s peak period. It follows Evri’s recent commitment to triple its parcel deliveries by cargo bikes to over 500,000 within the next year. ",[],{"type":126,"text":7923,"spans":7924},"The EAV cargo bikes are one of the largest on the market, boasting a cargo volume of 2,000 litres, a 170kg payload and generate zero emissions. The use of these e-cargo bikes not only has a positive impact on the environment, but it should mean deliveries are even more reliable in built up areas that are challenging to deliver to using traditional methods.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":7926,"primary":7928,"id":4197,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[7927],{},{"quoteText":7929,"quoteSource":7930},"Pedal & Post were one of the first companies in the UK to launch zero emission bike deliveries and we share the same ambitions of leading the way in sustainable deliveries. We’re excited to be partnering with such experienced experts in cycle logistics. Cargo bikes are an important part of our commitment to reach net zero by 2035 and will help build our network of sustainable delivery options.","Luke Turnbull, Final Mile Sustainability Specialist at Evri",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":7932,"primary":7934,"id":7937,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[7933],{},{"quoteText":7935,"quoteSource":7936},"We’re delighted to partner with Evri to sustainably deliver parcels to customers in Oxford. We are excited to be supporting their journey towards net zero. It’s so important that businesses like Evri have a clear strategy in place to reduce carbon emissions to make or cities healthier and better, safer places to live.","Christopher Benton, CEO at Pedal & Post","quote$54e63c3e-73c4-4d1c-96de-a0c7c217fc35",[7939,8000,8043,8140,8211,8323,8408,8480,8589,8642,8709,8766],{"id":7940,"uid":7941,"url":7942,"type":50,"href":7943,"tags":7944,"first_publication_date":7945,"last_publication_date":7946,"slugs":7947,"linked_documents":7948,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":7949,"data":7950},"ZXw1gxEAACEAjFlt","evri-takes-the-reins-on-christmas-charity-deliveries","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-takes-the-reins-on-christmas-charity-deliveries","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZXw1gxEAACEAjFlt%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2023-12-15T11:19:40+0000","2025-02-13T11:33:00+0000",[7941],[],[],{"title":7951,"category":8,"metaDescription":7952,"canonical":7953,"titleTag":7954,"featuredImage":7955,"publishedDate":7965,"slices":7966},"Evri takes the reins on Christmas charity deliveries","Read here about Evri's Christmas charity deliveries","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-takes-the-reins-on-christmas-charity-deliveries","Evri takes the reins on Christmas charity deliveries | Evri",{"dimensions":7956,"alt":7957,"copyright":8,"url":7958,"id":7959,"edit":7960,"thumbnail":7961},{"width":65,"height":865},"A female van driver dressed in an Evri branded hi-vis vest is sat in the cabin of her van. A pile of parcels is placed on the seat beside her.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zAVJbqstJ9-iNV_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9575.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6zAVJbqstJ9-iNV",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":7962,"alt":7957,"copyright":8,"url":7963,"id":7959,"edit":7964},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zAVJbqstJ9-iNV_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9575.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2023-12-15",[7967,7988,7994],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":7968,"primary":7970,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[7969],{},{"content":7971},[7972,7979,7982,7985],{"type":126,"text":7973,"spans":7974},"December 2023: Evri, the UK’s biggest dedicated parcel delivery company, has delivered hundreds of parcels to children across the UK in partnership with Go Beyond during the festive period.",[7975,7976,7977],{"start":32,"end":341,"type":163},{"start":277,"end":2233,"type":163},{"start":277,"end":2233,"type":279,"data":7978},{"link_type":281,"url":348},{"type":126,"text":7980,"spans":7981},"Go Beyond is a charity giving children and young people facing serious challenges in their lives the chance for a break that lasts a lifetime.",[],{"type":126,"text":7983,"spans":7984},"Evri, in a heartwarming collaboration with Go Beyond, has made a significant impact this festive season by providing free deliveries for the Christmas gifts destined for children across the UK. Through their dedicated effort, Evri’s teams have successfully delivered over 700 parcels, saving the charity an impressive £2,000. This substantial cost-saving allows Go Beyond to allocate those funds towards other meaningful initiatives, further enhancing its ability to make a positive difference in the community. The long-standing partnership between Evri and Go Beyond exemplifies the spirit of giving and collaboration, this is the fifth year Evri has delivered these parcels, bringing joy and support to those in need at a particularly difficult time of year.",[],{"type":126,"text":7986,"spans":7987},"Last year, Evri raised almost £250,000 to charitable and community groups and we plan to expand our charitable efforts next year.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":7989,"primary":7991,"id":7993,"slice_type":558,"slice_label":8},[7990],{},{"SectionHeader":8,"SectionText":7992},[],"section_component$d51d7478-4b44-46ca-b417-63fb7cc93e57",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":7995,"primary":7997,"id":4197,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[7996],{},{"quoteText":7998,"quoteSource":7999},"We are incredibly grateful to Evri for providing this wonderful service and enabling so many hundreds of children across the country to receive an extra special Christmas gift this December. For some of these children, a gift from Go Beyond will be the only present they receive. As a small charity that relies solely on the generosity of our supporters to provide our vital services we are so grateful to all those who help us with our work, our huge thanks go to all at Evri for their continuing support. We wish everyone a very happy Christmas.","Director of Development and Sustainability, Karen Puszczynska at Go Beyond",{"id":8001,"uid":8002,"url":8003,"type":50,"href":8004,"tags":8005,"first_publication_date":8006,"last_publication_date":8007,"slugs":8008,"linked_documents":8009,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":8010,"data":8011},"ZXw0qhEAACIAjFVh","evri-delivers-the-spirit-of-giving-back-for-christmas-jumper-day","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-delivers-the-spirit-of-giving-back-for-christmas-jumper-day","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZXw0qhEAACIAjFVh%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2023-12-15T11:15:37+0000","2025-02-13T11:35:06+0000",[8002],[],[],{"title":8012,"category":8,"metaDescription":8013,"canonical":8014,"titleTag":8015,"featuredImage":8016,"publishedDate":7965,"slices":8022},"Evri delivers the spirit of giving back for Christmas Jumper Day","Read here about Evri's Christmas jumper day 2023.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-delivers-the-spirit-of-giving-back-for-christmas-jumper-day","Evri delivers the spirit of giving back for Christmas Jumper Day | Evri",{"dimensions":8017,"alt":5582,"copyright":8,"url":5583,"id":5584,"edit":8018,"thumbnail":8019},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":8020,"alt":5582,"copyright":8,"url":5588,"id":5584,"edit":8021},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},[8023],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":8024,"primary":8026,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[8025],{},{"content":8027},[8028,8035,8038,8041],{"type":126,"text":8029,"spans":8030},"December 2023: Evri, the UK’s biggest dedicated parcel delivery company, celebrates the start of the holiday season by taking part in Christmas Jumper Day for Save the Children on the 7th December at its Leeds-based headquarters and across its operational network.",[8031,8032,8033],{"start":32,"end":341,"type":163},{"start":277,"end":2233,"type":163},{"start":277,"end":2233,"type":279,"data":8034},{"link_type":281,"url":348},{"type":126,"text":8036,"spans":8037},"Save the Children’s mission is to save and improve children’s lives around the world. They work to ensure children have healthcare, food, and shelter, as well as learning and child protection services when children need it most. The money raised will help towards water purification tablets, food paste sachets, midwives birth kits and school in a bag kits. ",[],{"type":126,"text":8039,"spans":8040},"Employees eagerly embrace the festive tradition, donning their most cheerful and quirky jumpers to raise funds on 7th December which coincides with one of Evri’s busiest days of the year and helps people do their work with a touch of extra sparkle. The initiative not only supports a great cause but also fosters a sense of community and teamwork, reinforcing the positive work culture at Evri where making a beneficial impact extends beyond the workplace.",[],{"type":126,"text":7986,"spans":8042},[],{"id":8044,"uid":8045,"url":8046,"type":50,"href":8047,"tags":8048,"first_publication_date":8049,"last_publication_date":8050,"slugs":8051,"linked_documents":8052,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":8053,"data":8054},"ZXiAdBEAACkASHWH","evri-lifts-the-lid-on-how-it-tracks-down-missing-or-damaged-parcels","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-lifts-the-lid-on-how-it-tracks-down-missing-or-damaged-parcels","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZXiAdBEAACkASHWH%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2023-12-12T16:26:37+0000","2025-02-13T11:52:14+0000",[8045],[],[],{"title":8055,"category":8,"metaDescription":8056,"canonical":8057,"titleTag":8058,"featuredImage":8059,"publishedDate":8070,"slices":8071},"Evri lifts the lid on how it tracks down missing or damaged parcels","Read here to learn about how Evri tracks down missing or damaged parcels","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-lifts-the-lid-on-how-it-tracks-down-missing-or-damaged-parcels","Evri lifts the lid on how it tracks down missing or damaged parcels | Evri",{"dimensions":8060,"alt":8061,"copyright":8,"url":8062,"id":8063,"edit":8064,"thumbnail":8065},{"width":65,"height":865},"An Evri Courier climbing the stairs in a block of flats to deliver a parcel to a customers door","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDhJbqstJ9-cfU_EVRI_LOCATION_04_3932.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8612,5741&w=960&h=640","Z6pDhJbqstJ9-cfU",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":8066,"alt":8061,"copyright":8,"url":8067,"id":8063,"edit":8068},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDhJbqstJ9-cfU_EVRI_LOCATION_04_3932.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,831,8612,4082&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":8069,"zoom":33,"background":71},831,"2023-12-12",[8072],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":8073,"primary":8075,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[8074],{},{"content":8076},[8077,8081,8085,8088,8091,8094,8097,8101,8104,8107,8111,8114,8117,8127,8131,8134],{"type":126,"text":8078,"spans":8079},"December 2023: A special parcel detective at Evri, the UK’s largest dedicated parcel delivery company, has offered insider insight as we head into the festive period about the lengths employees go to, to reunite parcels which get lost in transit.  Evri successfully delivers more than 720 million parcels per year serving 12 million people across the country. Evri is expecting to deliver up to 3.5 million parcels per day during its busiest week. But sometimes parcels lose their label or become separated from their packaging. ",[8080],{"start":32,"end":277,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":8082,"spans":8083}," So, what happens in those circumstances?",[8084],{"start":32,"end":5879,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":8086,"spans":8087},"Evri has a dedicated team of parcel detectives, their very own team of Poirots, who have shared just how a parcel could go missing.",[],{"type":126,"text":8089,"spans":8090},"David, one of Evri’s parcel detectives explains, “We’re often asked how a parcel can just vanish, especially when it has a tracking number, surely you can see exactly where it is? The answer is of course a parcel doesn’t just vanish into thin air.”",[],{"type":126,"text":8092,"spans":8093},"They went to explain, “There are a variety of reasons a parcel may go missing whilst on its way to a customer. The most common issue we face is a problem with the parcels label becoming damaged and unreadable or the label comes away from the packaging all together”. ",[],{"type":126,"text":8095,"spans":8096}," A parcel’s label is vital and is used at every point of its journey to track the parcel and route it forward to its destination. Without a readable label, or a label at all, this becomes a substantial challenge and can make it almost impossible to know the parcel’s destination.",[],{"type":126,"text":8098,"spans":8099},"So, what happens to these parcels? ",[8100],{"start":32,"end":1070,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":8102,"spans":8103},"Evri’s dedicated parcel detectives work hard to try and repatriate these parcels, using AI technology to log and categorise these parcels to try and reunite them with the customer. The team will often need to look inside the parcel to try and find additional information to identify a parcel’s destination and work closely with customer service teams based in depots to cross reference with customer queries. Where the team can determine a parcel’s origin and destination it will be repackaged and sent back on its way to be delivered. Often, with retail parcels whereby the end customer can’t be established the parcel will be sent back to the retailer. Other parcels that look to hold sentimental value are held securely for a number of months whilst additional attempts are made to reunite the parcels. ",[],{"type":126,"text":8105,"spans":8106},"Another one of Evri’s parcel detectives shared some examples of the successes they have, “Last week we were able to reunite almost 40% of parcels that came into us. I take great pride in being able to get these parcels where they need to go as they mean so much to people, just the other day I was able to identify someone’s misplaced wedding dress and a gift intend for another bride on the morning of her wedding. Sometimes I feel like Sherlock homes piecing the clues together.” ",[],{"type":126,"text":8108,"spans":8109}," How else can a parcel be lost? ",[8110],{"start":33,"end":3455,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":8112,"spans":8113},"Some other reasons for a parcel going missing include parcels being poorly packaged and the items becoming dislodged from packaging or incorrectly addressed items. On rare occasions, there is of course human error. ",[],{"type":126,"text":8115,"spans":8116},"Another one of Evri’s parcel detectives shared this, “We want to deliver every parcel successfully especially at Christmas time, but sometimes the way in which parcels are sent can make things difficult. I remember once someone sending a birthday cake in a bin bag.”",[],{"type":126,"text":8118,"spans":8119},"Evri wants customer using their service to send parcel to loved ones this festive period to be mindful of the packaging and contents guidelines they provide so that their parcels can arrive safely and on time. No Christmas cakes in bin bags please. ",[8120,8123],{"start":6278,"end":469,"type":279,"data":8121},{"link_type":281,"url":8122},"press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fsend\u002Fhow-to-wrap-a-parcel",{"start":8124,"end":1318,"type":279,"data":8125},124,{"link_type":281,"url":8126},"press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fsend\u002Fwhat-i-can-and-cannot-send",{"type":126,"text":8128,"spans":8129}," What to do if your parcel is missing?",[8130],{"start":33,"end":2884,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":8132,"spans":8133},"This depends on who is sending the parcel. If you’re waiting for a parcel from a retailer or someone else you’ve bought a parcel from, and the parcel has been with Evri for over 5 days then you should let them know, and they will contact Evri. Allowing the retailer or sender to deal with Evri direct is the quickest way for a customer to get a refund or replacement, should one be needed.",[],{"type":126,"text":8135,"spans":8136},"If you’ve sent a parcel and it hasn’t been delivered after 5 days customers can contact Evri direct via webchat or telephone. If the parcel can’t be located, customers will have the option to submit a claim, providing they have taken the relevant cover. Parcels can be covered for a small amount of 5p per £1 over the £20 free cover provided and Evri provides content guidelines on what items can be covered for loss or damage.",[8137],{"start":8138,"end":1968,"type":279,"data":8139},360,{"link_type":281,"url":8126},{"id":8141,"uid":8142,"url":8143,"type":50,"href":8144,"tags":8145,"first_publication_date":8146,"last_publication_date":8147,"slugs":8148,"linked_documents":8149,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":8150,"data":8151},"ZXgeEBIAACIATl0b","the-gateway-to-a-perfect-delivery-meet-dennis-your-local-delivery-driver-who-fixes-gates-whilst-delivering-evri-parcels","\u002Fpress\u002Fthe-gateway-to-a-perfect-delivery-meet-dennis-your-local-delivery-driver-who-fixes-gates-whilst-delivering-evri-parcels","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZXgeEBIAACIATl0b%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2023-12-12T08:49:41+0000","2025-02-13T11:57:27+0000",[8142],[],[],{"title":8152,"category":8,"metaDescription":8153,"canonical":8154,"titleTag":8155,"featuredImage":8156,"publishedDate":8070,"slices":8162},"The gateway to a perfect delivery: Meet Dennis, your local delivery driver, who fixes gates whilst delivering Evri parcels","Read here to learn about Dennis, a delivery driver, who fixes gates whilst delivering Evri parcels","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fthe-gateway-to-a-perfect-delivery-meet-dennis-your-local-delivery-driver-who-fixes-gates-whilst-delivering-evri-parcels","The gateway to a perfect delivery: Meet Dennis, your local delivery driver, who fixes gates whilst delivering Evri parcels | Evri",{"dimensions":8157,"alt":1512,"copyright":8,"url":1513,"id":1514,"edit":8158,"thumbnail":8159},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":8160,"alt":1512,"copyright":8,"url":1518,"id":1514,"edit":8161},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},[8163],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":8164,"primary":8166,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[8165],{},{"content":8167},[8168,8171,8174,8177,8180,8183,8186,8189,8193,8198,8203,8207],{"type":126,"text":8169,"spans":8170},"Dennis, a local delivery driver in Outwood in Wakefield, is a real local hero and has been named by one local as the village gatekeeper. Alongside his day job of delivering parcels for Evri within the community, he’s often found carrying out repair jobs for customers on his round.",[],{"type":126,"text":8172,"spans":8173},"Couriers often deliver up to 150 parcels a day and Dennis usually has around 80 parcels to deliver but that doesn’t stop him taking the time to go above and beyond for his customers. Dennis carries tools whilst out on his courier round and completes small fixes to his customer’s properties such as adjusting hinges and joints of gates. Dennis estimates he’s repaired approximately 7 gates and has done countless other jobs – including fixing letterboxes and loose door handles. Dennis is no gatecrasher, he’ll always get permission before making repairs.",[],{"type":126,"text":8175,"spans":8176},"Dennis said: “I’m often the only person some people see, and it can really brighten up their day, especially if I’m able to help them out by fixing something. I really love being part of the community.",[],{"type":126,"text":8178,"spans":8179},"“When I am out delivering, I carry dog biscuits for my customer’s dogs, and they love it – both the dogs and their owners! I carry tools to repair any gates that need a repair such as loose hinges, loose joints or gates than need a trim if they are scraping on the floor – at no charge, of course. I have one customer in a wheelchair, I open all her parcels for her as her hands are weak.”",[],{"type":126,"text":8181,"spans":8182},"“I am about to replace a customer’s gate with one I salvaged from another customer who didn't need it. I had to reduce it in size so it will fit my customer’s gateway, but I’ll soon get the time to remove her old one and fit this one.”",[],{"type":126,"text":8184,"spans":8185},"“I love the job; I enjoy being out and about and definitely couldn’t be sat at a desk all day - I love the interaction with people and my community is like a second family. It’s important to always be kind to your delivery driver, you never know when they might be able to help you out too!”",[],{"type":126,"text":8187,"spans":8188},"Dennis is proud of his 5-star ratings and feedback from his customers includes:",[],{"type":126,"text":8190,"spans":8191},"·       “Dennis is my favourite delivery guy from Evri. Friendly, reliable and professional.”",[8192],{"start":321,"end":322,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":8194,"spans":8195},"·       “Always delivered with a smile.”",[8196],{"start":321,"end":8197,"type":1324},40,{"type":126,"text":8199,"spans":8200},"·       “Super-efficient man, friendly and caring about both my property and my parcels.”",[8201],{"start":321,"end":8202,"type":1324},89,{"type":126,"text":8204,"spans":8205},"·       “Excellent, can’t fault him, even gives a treat to the dog!”",[8206],{"start":321,"end":923,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":8208,"spans":8209},"·       “Perfect like always”",[8210],{"start":321,"end":1084,"type":1324},{"id":8212,"uid":8213,"url":8214,"type":50,"href":8215,"tags":8216,"first_publication_date":8217,"last_publication_date":8218,"slugs":8219,"linked_documents":8220,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":8221,"data":8222},"ZXM5jhIAACIAOMb2","evri-issues-guidance-as-it-successfully-closes-down-more-than-1000-delivery-scams-protecting-millions-of-consumers","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-issues-guidance-as-it-successfully-closes-down-more-than-1000-delivery-scams-protecting-millions-of-consumers","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZXM5jhIAACIAOMb2%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2023-12-08T15:50:24+0000","2025-02-13T11:58:21+0000",[8213],[],[],{"title":8223,"category":8,"metaDescription":8224,"canonical":8225,"titleTag":8226,"featuredImage":8227,"publishedDate":8233,"slices":8234},"Evri issues guidance as it successfully closes down more than 1,000 delivery scams protecting millions of consumers","Read here to find Evri's scam guidance to protect millions of customers","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-issues-guidance-as-it-successfully-closes-down-more-than-1000-delivery-scams-protecting-millions-of-consumers","Evri issues guidance as it successfully closes down more than 1,000 delivery scams protecting millions of consumers | Evri",{"dimensions":8228,"alt":6862,"copyright":8,"url":6863,"id":6864,"edit":8229,"thumbnail":8230},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":8231,"alt":6862,"copyright":8,"url":6868,"id":6864,"edit":8232},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2023-12-08",[8235],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":8236,"primary":8238,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[8237],{},{"content":8239},[8240,8243,8246,8249,8252,8254,8258,8264,8268,8272,8277,8282,8286,8290,8294,8296,8299,8302,8305,8308,8313,8315],{"type":126,"text":8241,"spans":8242},"Evri, the UK’s largest dedicated parcel delivery company, has offered consumers advice on spotting and avoiding online cyber scams in the run-up to Christmas. ",[],{"type":126,"text":8244,"spans":8245},"The pandemic led to a surge in online shopping and home deliveries. Evri reported at the time that the huge surge had led to an extra 250 million parcels entering its network and it saw 5 years of growth in just 5 months. As more people shop online, scammers have been quick to take advantage of consumers recognising that millions of us would be waiting on a delivery from one of the big delivery companies.",[],{"type":126,"text":8247,"spans":8248},"Bogus text and emails impersonating well-known retailers and parcel firms are sent out in attempt to trick consumers into handing over their personal information and bank details.",[],{"type":126,"text":8250,"spans":8251},"A member of Evri’s Cyber Security team said: “These criminals use what we call the ‘spray and pray’ method. Sending out millions of these messages each month across a variety of different brands in hope of catching you out. We take fraudulent activity incredibly seriously here and we work closely with a number of leading external cybersecurity partners as well as the UK Government’s National Cyber Security Centre to identify scams and remove these as quickly as possible.  We are active members of the National Cyber Security Centre’s Trust Group for Logistics, where we work with our industry peers to share information and develop cross-industry strategies to reduce the number of scams.”",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":8253},[],{"type":126,"text":8255,"spans":8256},"How to spot a scam",[8257],{"start":32,"end":587,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":8259,"spans":8260},"Evri has its own dedicated page to help consumers spot and report fraud and has shared its top tips below.",[8261],{"start":362,"end":6602,"type":279,"data":8262},{"link_type":281,"url":8263},"press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fcyber-security",{"type":126,"text":8265,"spans":8266},"·       Look out for poor language – poorly written sentences, grammar and spelling errors.",[8267],{"start":321,"end":5726,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":8269,"spans":8270},"·       Lack of a personal greeting – they may use 'Dear Customer' or ‘Dear [your email address]’ instead of using the name you use on your account (though criminals are getting better at personalising messages)",[8271],{"start":321,"end":1070,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":8273,"spans":8274},"·       Link or Button - they may include links or buttons in emails that urge you to click on them. Before you click on any links, hover over the button or URL to check it goes where it's supposed to. If it brings up an unrecognised address, it could be a scam.",[8275],{"start":321,"end":8276,"type":163},22,{"type":126,"text":8278,"spans":8279},"·       An unusual or vague email address - the email address will often be different from the usual email address you receive from that company, even just using a slight misspelling or different formatting.",[8280],{"start":321,"end":8281,"type":163},44,{"type":126,"text":8283,"spans":8284},"·       Check the number - a scam text message often arrives as a mobile number, rather than from an official source.",[8285],{"start":321,"end":3553,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":8287,"spans":8288},"·       They will try and rush you – the scam will want you to act quickly, if the message is trying to get you to send them details quickly you should be suspicious.",[8289],{"start":321,"end":5726,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":8291,"spans":8292},"·       Lacks detail about your parcel – delivery scams are typically vague and offer no specifics about a parcel, no tracking number, where it’s coming from or what’s inside.",[8293],{"start":321,"end":2884,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":8295},[],{"type":126,"text":8297,"spans":8298},"If you think you’ve been a victim of on these scams you should:",[],{"type":126,"text":8300,"spans":8301},"·       Talk to your bank or card provider immediately",[],{"type":126,"text":8303,"spans":8304},"·       Report the scam to Action Fraud on 0300 123 2040 ",[],{"type":126,"text":8306,"spans":8307},"·       You can find more independent advice and support via Citizens Advice consumer help line on 0808 223 1122 ",[],{"type":126,"text":8309,"spans":8310},"·       Report suspicious SMS activity to the government’s own anti-phishing services at 7726 or report@phishing.gov.uk",[8311],{"start":2362,"end":469,"type":279,"data":8312},{"link_type":281,"url":6208},{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":8314},[],{"type":126,"text":8316,"spans":8317},"Evri would never request payment from their customers via SMS or Email, and would urge all customers to report suspicious activity, in addition customers can report directly to their dedicated mailbox - phishing@evri.com.",[8318],{"start":8319,"end":8320,"type":279,"data":8321},203,220,{"link_type":281,"url":8322},"mailto:phishing@evri.com",{"id":8324,"uid":8325,"url":8326,"type":50,"href":8327,"tags":8328,"first_publication_date":8329,"last_publication_date":8330,"slugs":8331,"linked_documents":8332,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":8333,"data":8334},"ZXMRnBIAAB8AOBRS","five-tips-from-a-delivery-driver-to-get-christmas-parcels-on-time","\u002Fpress\u002Ffive-tips-from-a-delivery-driver-to-get-christmas-parcels-on-time","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZXMRnBIAAB8AOBRS%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2023-12-08T13:07:00+0000","2025-03-11T08:27:51+0000",[8325],[],[],{"title":8335,"category":8,"metaDescription":8336,"canonical":8337,"titleTag":8338,"featuredImage":8339,"publishedDate":8233,"slices":8350},"Five tips from a delivery driver to get Christmas parcels on time","Read here to find out five top tips from a delivery driver to get Christmas parcels on time","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Ffive-tips-from-a-delivery-driver-to-get-christmas-parcels-on-time","Five-tips-from-a-delivery-driver-to-get-christmas-parcels-on-time | Evri",{"dimensions":8340,"alt":8341,"copyright":8,"url":8342,"id":8343,"edit":8344,"thumbnail":8345},{"width":65,"height":865},"A handful of parcels are being handed to a recipient at the door. Both the courier and recipient are clearly visible","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6y_apbqstJ9-iMH_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9298.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,2,7801,5201&w=960&h=640","Z6y_apbqstJ9-iMH",{"x":32,"y":4163,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":8346,"alt":8341,"copyright":8,"url":8347,"id":8343,"edit":8348},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6y_apbqstJ9-iMH_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9298.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,753,7801,3697&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":8349,"zoom":33,"background":71},753,[8351],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":8352,"primary":8354,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[8353],{},{"content":8355},[8356,8360,8363,8365,8369,8371,8375,8377,8381,8383,8387,8389,8393,8396,8401],{"type":126,"text":8357,"spans":8358},"6 December 2023: Delivery drivers get a bad rap sometimes, especially when it comes to the busy period between Black Friday and Christmas when they often have more than 150 parcels to deliver in one day. Evri has prepared itself to deliver up to 3.5 million parcels on its busiest day this year.",[8359],{"start":32,"end":277,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":8361,"spans":8362},"With Christmas just around the corner and consumers likely to be ordering many more parcels, Vince Carr, one of Evri’s 26,000 couriers, is offering his advice to all consumers ordering online and calling for customers to make some small changes to help couriers successfully deliver a parcel first time.",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":8364},[],{"type":126,"text":8366,"spans":8367},"1.    Get to know your driver: “I think one of the best tips I can give is just getting to know your local courier, having a chat with them and letting them know a bit about you. If you’re someone who works from home, you might want your parcel left in your porch, if you’ve got a newborn and want us to knock quietly or if you’re out and about regularly but want your parcel left in a safe place it’s great to know what customer’s preferred safe place is. It makes everything so much simpler, and no amount of technology can replace that human connection.”",[8368],{"start":819,"end":1084,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":8370},[],{"type":126,"text":8372,"spans":8373},"2.    Have visible house number: “This should be an easy one for most people, pop to a local DIY shop and pick up a cheap house number sticker, or better still, if you can get a personalised one which has your house number and street name it means delivery drivers know they’re at the right address” Vince went on to say, “We have such a complex network of roads in the UK and house types can vary so much from maisonettes to flat blocks and gated estates to estates with identical houses and no numbers, it’s just so helpful to know you’re at the right house so customers can get their parcel successfully first time. It’s even more important now it’s getting darker, earlier.”",[8374],{"start":819,"end":3455,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":8376},[],{"type":126,"text":8378,"spans":8379},"3.    Choose your preferences: “Evri and other companies have invested in technology to help make sure you can still get your parcel even if you’re out. I love it when a customer has chosen a preferred neighbour or safe location and perhaps even chosen a neighbour to avoid, because that way, I know the neighbour they’ve chosen is probably someone that’s going to accept the parcel without any hassle meaning I can get on with my day and my customer can get their parcel and have a chat with their neighbour at the same time.”",[8380],{"start":819,"end":2883,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":8382},[],{"type":126,"text":8384,"spans":8385},"4.    Check your address twice: “I know it might sound a bit silly but it’s so important to double check your address, including your postcode, when you’re ordering from a retailer. I’ve had so many parcels that have either gone to someone’s old address so I’m met with a ‘they don’t live here anymore’ or ‘they moved out last year’ but also, I’ve had countless parcels missing a house number or road name and although we do our best to work it out, it’s just so simple to take a few extra seconds to check it’s a correct and complete address – especially when it comes to getting presents delivered before the big day!”",[8386],{"start":819,"end":4070,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":8388},[],{"type":126,"text":8390,"spans":8391},"5.    Use ParcelShops and Lockers: “This is especially handy if you’re working nights or if you’re going on holiday – most customers can divert to a ParcelShop so if you’re not going to be in, it saves us drivers a wasted journey and you can collect the parcel at a more convenient time. It also has the added benefit of being a greener way to get stuff you’ve ordered online.”",[8392],{"start":819,"end":367,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":8394,"spans":8395},"Vince concluded: “I hope these tips help, I just want to make sure no one is disappointed as I know it’s such an important time of the year for so many people. Let’s all be kind to each other and try to help each other out when we can!”",[],{"type":126,"text":8397,"spans":8398},"For more tips, visit Evri’s  handy packaging guide.",[8399],{"start":1084,"end":930,"type":279,"data":8400},{"link_type":281,"url":8122},{"type":126,"text":8402,"spans":8403},"Evri recently announced a £46m investment which includes the launch of a dedicated callback facility to boost its customer service and operations in preparation for its Christmas peak. Evri’s contact page is available here  and the phone number is 0330 808 5456.",[8404],{"start":357,"end":8405,"type":279,"data":8406},223,{"link_type":281,"url":8407},"press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fcontact-us",{"id":8409,"uid":8410,"url":8411,"type":50,"href":8412,"tags":8413,"first_publication_date":8414,"last_publication_date":8415,"slugs":8416,"linked_documents":8418,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":8419,"data":8420},"ZVskqBAAAB8AMAL4","evri-little-helps--as-parcel-delivery-giant-agrees-industry-first-for-customers-to-receive-tesco-clubcard-points","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-little-helps--as-parcel-delivery-giant-agrees-industry-first-for-customers-to-receive-tesco-clubcard-points","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZVskqBAAAB8AMAL4%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2023-11-20T09:32:02+0000","2023-11-21T10:53:56+0000",[8410,8417],"evri-dials-up-new-automated-phone-line-to-quickly-connect-customers-to-uk-advisors-as-part-of-a-46m-total-investment",[],[],{"title":8421,"category":8,"metaDescription":8422,"canonical":8423,"titleTag":8424,"featuredImage":8425,"publishedDate":8438,"slices":8439},"‘Evri’ Little Helps – as parcel delivery giant agrees industry first for customers to receive Tesco Clubcard points","Read all about Evri's partnership with Tesco clubcard","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-little-helps--as-parcel-delivery-giant-agrees-industry-first-for-customers-to-receive-tesco-clubcard-points","‘Evri’ Little Helps – as parcel delivery giant agrees industry first for customers to receive Tesco Clubcard points | Evri",{"dimensions":8426,"alt":8427,"copyright":8,"url":8428,"id":8429,"edit":8430,"thumbnail":8432},{"width":65,"height":865},"Photo of a customer holding smartphone to blue parcelshop terminal","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F0e765f26-9b95-41d0-93b5-a64a02214b69_customer+holding+smartphone+to+blue+parcelshop+terminal.jpg?auto=compress,format&rect=0,0,5000,3333&w=960&h=640","YhT3NREAACcA1Lhy",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":8431,"background":34},0.192,{"dimensions":8433,"alt":8427,"copyright":8,"url":8434,"id":8429,"edit":8435},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F0e765f26-9b95-41d0-93b5-a64a02214b69_customer+holding+smartphone+to+blue+parcelshop+terminal.jpg?auto=compress,format&rect=0,482,5000,2370&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":8436,"zoom":8437,"background":34},-37,0.0768,"2023-11-20",[8440,8473],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":8441,"primary":8443,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[8442],{},{"content":8444},[8445,8449,8452,8455,8458,8461,8464,8467,8470],{"type":126,"text":8446,"spans":8447},"20th November 2023: Evri, the UK’s biggest dedicated parcel delivery company, has today announced a ground-breaking partnership with Tesco that will enable consumers to collect Tesco Clubcard points for every parcel they send with Evri – helping customers facing cost-of-living pressures as we approach the festive parcel-sending season.",[8448],{"start":32,"end":2233,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":8450,"spans":8451},"This is the first time that the UK’s largest retailer, Tesco, has agreed this type of Clubcard partnership with a parcel delivery firm – reflecting the commitment of both companies to reward customers for their loyalty. ",[],{"type":126,"text":8453,"spans":8454},"From today, consumers will be able to collect one Tesco Clubcard point for every £1 spent at evri.com. Customers will then be able to turn points into vouchers to get money off their Tesco shop. Alternatively, consumers can choose to donate to charity – or double the value of their points with more than 100 Tesco Clubcard Reward Partners. ",[],{"type":126,"text":8456,"spans":8457},"Evri’s Clubcard partnership with Tesco represents the latest step forward in its UK growth strategy and comes after it recently announced a £46 million investment to boost its customer service and operations in preparation for its busiest period of the year for parcels from Black Friday to Christmas Day.",[],{"type":126,"text":8459,"spans":8460},"This investment includes Evri hiring more than 6,500 colleagues – double last year’s figure – including couriers, customer care team members and workers for its hubs and depots, as well as a new automatic callback function via a new dedicated phone line before its upcoming peak period. ",[],{"type":126,"text":8462,"spans":8463}," This Interactive Voice Response that Evri launched earlier in October is expected to connect thousands more customers to a UK-based advisor at Evri’s contact centre. ",[],{"type":126,"text":8465,"spans":8466},"Today’s announcement follows Evri’s partnership with Tesco, which launched in 2021, when Evri’s ParcelShop services were made available in Tesco Express stores across the UK enabling customers to send, receive and return parcels as they shopped. ",[],{"type":126,"text":8468,"spans":8469},"Consumers can now use Evri’s parcel services in more than 1,200 Tesco stores and print a free label in-store if they don’t have a printer at home. For 76% of the UK population, Evri’s ParcelShops are located within a 10-minute walk and deliveries made to ParcelShops typically reduce emissions by 45% when compared to a home delivery.",[],{"type":126,"text":8471,"spans":8472},"Over the last five years, Evri has tripled the size of to become the UK’s leading dedicated parcel delivery company, handling a staggering 730 million parcels each year.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":8474,"primary":8476,"id":8479,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[8475],{},{"quoteText":8477,"quoteSource":8478},"We’re proud to make sending a parcel even better value, through our partnership with Tesco Clubcard. Collecting points is an extra benefit we’re delighted to offer in addition to our market leading services, giving consumers control, choice and convenience as we approach the busy festive season. This launch is another step forward on our mission of delivering better for our customers. It is great to see two large and successful customer brands come together to help customers at a time when household budgets are under pressure.","David Saenz, Chief Growth Officer at Evri,","quote$186f5457-288a-46b7-bc3e-f2da988318c1",{"id":8481,"uid":8482,"url":8483,"type":50,"href":8484,"tags":8485,"first_publication_date":8486,"last_publication_date":8487,"slugs":8488,"linked_documents":8489,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":8490,"data":8491},"ZVTotRAAACYAFJbk","evri-dials-up-new-automated-phone-line","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-dials-up-new-automated-phone-line","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZVTotRAAACYAFJbk%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2023-11-15T16:26:50+0000","2025-02-13T13:02:25+0000",[8417],[],[],{"title":8492,"category":8,"metaDescription":8493,"canonical":8494,"titleTag":8495,"featuredImage":8496,"publishedDate":8506,"slices":8507},"Evri dials up new automated phone line to quickly connect customers to UK advisors, as part of a £46m total investment","Read all about Evri's launches new phone line","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-dials-up-new-automated-phone-line","Evri dials up new automated phone line to quickly connect customers to UK advisors, as part of a £46m total investment | Evri",{"dimensions":8497,"alt":8498,"copyright":8,"url":8499,"id":8500,"edit":8501,"thumbnail":8502},{"width":65,"height":865},"An older couple, a man and a woman, are sat on a sofa. The man is on the phone while the woman sits beside him. They look happy.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6ozypbqstJ9-cXp_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10847.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6ozypbqstJ9-cXp",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":8503,"alt":8498,"copyright":8,"url":8504,"id":8500,"edit":8505},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6ozypbqstJ9-cXp_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10847.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2023-11-15",[8508,8555,8560,8566,8576,8582],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":8509,"primary":8511,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[8510],{},{"content":8512},[8513,8517,8520,8523,8526,8529,8532,8535,8538,8550],{"type":126,"text":8514,"spans":8515},"10th November 2023:  Evri, the UK’s biggest dedicated parcel delivery company, today launches a new automatic callback function via a new dedicated phone line, as part of a £46m total investment to boost its customer service and operations in preparation for its Christmas peak. ",[8516],{"start":32,"end":2233,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":8518,"spans":8519},"The dedicated callback facility is expected to connect thousands more customers to a UK-based advisor at Evri’s contact centre before its busiest period of the year for parcels from ‘Black Friday’ in late November to just before Christmas Day. Ahead of then, Evri will hire more than 6,500 colleagues – double last year’s figure – including couriers, customer care team members and workers for its hubs and depots, as part of its combined investment. ",[],{"type":126,"text":8521,"spans":8522},"The new callback function is an Interactive Voice Response (IVR) phone service that automatically connects customers who call Evri directly to one of its advisors or records a message so they can call back once they’ve looked into the issue. Both services promise to deliver a response in 24 hours or less.",[],{"type":126,"text":8524,"spans":8525},"Customers can call 0330 808 5456, 24 hours a day, to leave a message with advisors available Monday to Friday between 8am and 4pm then Saturday between 8am and 2pm.",[],{"type":126,"text":8527,"spans":8528},"The new service initially connects customers to our voice assistant, who helps us to get the caller the right help, as fast as possible. The caller’s telephone number is used to identify active parcels and is then put through to the right place to get help. If the telephone number isn’t linked to a parcel, the customer will need to provide the 16-digit parcel tracking number. Depending on what a query relates to, our voice assistant can provide support, connect the caller to an Evri customer service advisor for help, or record a message to call the customer back once we’ve investigated.",[],{"type":126,"text":8530,"spans":8531},"The new phone service complements Evri’s recently introduced chat service, which is already resolving queries more quickly and directing more customers to its customer service agents when needed. The chat service is the quickest way for customers to get in touch and receive an answer. ",[],{"type":126,"text":8533,"spans":8534},"The new callback function was inspired by direct customer feedback as part of Evri’s customer insight panel, first launched in 2020 when the company was still known as Hermes. ",[],{"type":126,"text":8536,"spans":8537},"The customer ambassador panel, which includes customers and small business owners, was created to help Evri better understand the needs of customers. The panel members were clear that they wanted to see “small improvements” that make a “big difference” and have helped to define what kind of customer experience they’d like to see from Evri.",[],{"type":126,"text":8539,"spans":8540},"Evri’s contact page is available here and the phone number is 0330 808 5456. More information on how Evri is Delivering Better here:",[8541,8542,8544,8547],{"start":367,"end":2884,"type":163},{"start":367,"end":1816,"type":279,"data":8543},{"link_type":281,"url":8407},{"start":8545,"end":8546,"type":163},127,132,{"start":8545,"end":8546,"type":279,"data":8548},{"link_type":281,"url":8549},"press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fdelivering-better",{"type":126,"text":8551,"spans":8552},"Chris Ashworth, Chief Customer Officer at Evri, said: “Over the last five years we have tripled the size of our business to become the UK’s leading dedicated parcel delivery company, handling a staggering 730 million parcels each year. As more of us send and receive parcels every day, it has become more important than ever for Evri to invest in its customer service capabilities to answer customers’ questions as quickly and efficiently as possible. As part of our transformation, we’ve listened to our customers and invested more £10 million in new ways to get in touch.  We have made significant progress as a business this year, with a renewed focus on service delivery standards. This has helped us to strengthen our relationship with existing customers who recognise the efforts we’ve made, as well as forging new relationships, including being accredited to deliver Amazon Prime, after achieving a service standard of 99% of parcels delivered within three days and 98% of all next-day orders delivered on time.”",[8553],{"start":32,"end":8554,"type":163},48,{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":8556,"primary":8558,"id":8479,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[8557],{},{"quoteText":8559,"quoteSource":5547},"As we head into our peak period, we know that every parcel matters and we will be doing everything we can to deliver for customers at this important time.",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":8561,"primary":8563,"id":8565,"slice_type":558,"slice_label":8},[8562],{},{"SectionHeader":8,"SectionText":8564},[],"section_component$537109c0-7649-47dd-a539-892aa7f22d65",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":8567,"primary":8569,"id":8575,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[8568],{},{"content":8570},[8571],{"type":126,"text":8572,"spans":8573},"Independent consumer champion, Kate Hardcastle MBE, who has been advising Evri on its ambassador panel and enhancements to its customer service said: \"As consumers are ever more reliant on parcel delivery companies, they deserve consistency and reliability with a clear line of communication when they need assistance. Evri is using technology and insights to develop a range of support services that allow customers more choice in keeping informed when sending parcels and expecting deliveries, allowing consumers to get on with their lives\"",[8574],{"start":32,"end":930,"type":163},"rich_text$f804b961-cf7c-4c00-9b89-48492013ec6e",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":8577,"primary":8579,"id":8581,"slice_type":558,"slice_label":8},[8578],{},{"SectionHeader":8,"SectionText":8580},[],"section_component$6ba10763-b393-4f84-bcf3-eba7d9a50a6b",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":8583,"primary":8585,"id":8588,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[8584],{},{"quoteText":8586,"quoteSource":8587},"We are working hard with all our partners to plan and prepare to meet consumer demand for home deliveries during The peak Christmas period. Our final-mile delivery partner Evri has improved its service levels during the year. As demand rises for online orders during this crucial trading period, having the right infrastructure in place to respond will be key.","A spokesperson at Next PLC","quote$fb0aeb18-ce60-4e4c-9777-1a03fb2e7097",{"id":8590,"uid":8591,"url":8592,"type":50,"href":8593,"tags":8594,"first_publication_date":8595,"last_publication_date":8596,"slugs":8597,"linked_documents":8598,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":8599,"data":8600},"ZVSPbxAAAB8AEwdW","evris-response-to-the-citizen-advice-parcel-league-table-2023","\u002Fpress\u002Fevris-response-to-the-citizen-advice-parcel-league-table-2023","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZVSPbxAAAB8AEwdW%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2023-11-15T12:55:33+0000","2026-04-10T10:17:33+0000",[8591],[],[],{"title":8601,"category":8,"metaDescription":8601,"canonical":8602,"titleTag":8603,"featuredImage":8604,"publishedDate":8506,"slices":8615},"Evri's response to the Citizen Advice parcel league table 2023","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevris-response-to-the-citizen-advice-parcel-league-table-2023","Evri's Response to the Citizen Advice Parcel League Table 2023",{"dimensions":8605,"alt":8606,"copyright":8,"url":8607,"id":8608,"edit":8609,"thumbnail":8610},{"width":65,"height":865},"An Evri Courier walking down the street in a residential area carrying parcels","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6tgKJbqstJ9-e6j_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6053.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,2,7914,5276&w=960&h=640","Z6tgKJbqstJ9-e6j",{"x":32,"y":4163,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":8611,"alt":8606,"copyright":8,"url":8612,"id":8608,"edit":8613},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6tgKJbqstJ9-e6j_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6053.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,764,7914,3751&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":8614,"zoom":33,"background":71},764,[8616],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":8617,"primary":8619,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[8618],{},{"content":8620},[8621,8625,8628,8631,8634,8638,8640],{"type":126,"text":8622,"spans":8623},"16th November 2023:  \"We are disappointed with where Citizens Advice has placed us in its parcels league table – after a year of significant investment and listening to our customers to improve our service. Our ambition is that every customer’s experience with Evri is a positive one, and we work hard to understand each instance when this is not the case. Our rising parcel volumes are proof that customers and retail clients are voting with their feet and trust us with their deliveries. We have invested more than £130 million to improve our UK operations in the last two years with 99% of the 730 million parcels we handle annually delivered on time. ",[8624],{"start":32,"end":2233,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":8626,"spans":8627},"Evri’s performance improvements have been validated this year by Amazon accrediting Evri for Prime delivery for the first time – because the company is currently delivering some of the highest service standards in the industry, and our reliability is why the Post Office has started to sell our services.",[],{"type":126,"text":8629,"spans":8630},"We are the only parcel delivery company to mandate proof of delivery photos for every parcel and our AI-enabled Parcel Vision provides direct feedback to couriers on the quality of images or if a parcel appears to be in an unsafe location.",[],{"type":126,"text":8632,"spans":8633},"We have invested over £10 million in making it easier to get in touch with us, including doubling the number of UK-based customer care advisors, and launching a new chatbot and automated phoneline.\"",[],{"type":126,"text":8635,"spans":8636},"Chris Ashworth, Chief Customer Officer at Evri.",[8637],{"start":32,"end":3107,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":8639},[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":8641},[],{"id":8643,"uid":8644,"url":8645,"type":50,"href":8646,"tags":8647,"first_publication_date":8648,"last_publication_date":8649,"slugs":8650,"linked_documents":8651,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":8652,"data":8653},"ZUoE5xEAAB4AqIyl","its-in-the-post-evri-to-launch-in-branch-sales-at-post-office","\u002Fpress\u002Fits-in-the-post-evri-to-launch-in-branch-sales-at-post-office","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZUoE5xEAAB4AqIyl%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2023-11-07T09:58:52+0000","2025-02-13T13:04:19+0000",[8644],[],[],{"title":8654,"category":8,"metaDescription":8655,"canonical":8656,"titleTag":8657,"featuredImage":8658,"publishedDate":8670,"slices":8671},"It’s in the post: Evri to launch in-branch sales at Post Office","Read all about Evri's launch into in-branch sales at Post Office","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fits-in-the-post-evri-to-launch-in-branch-sales-at-post-office","It’s in the post: Evri to launch in-branch sales at Post Office | Evri",{"dimensions":8659,"alt":8661,"copyright":8,"url":8662,"id":8663,"edit":8664,"thumbnail":8665},{"width":65,"height":8660},630,"ParcelShop store assistant is smiling and using a blue hand-held device to scan a parcel. The customer can be seen in the foreground.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJDpbqstJ9-Tfl_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2668.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,6000,3938&w=960&h=630","Z6TJDpbqstJ9-Tfl",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":8666,"alt":8661,"copyright":8,"url":8667,"id":8663,"edit":8668},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJDpbqstJ9-Tfl_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2668.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,548,6000,2844&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":8669,"zoom":33,"background":71},548,"2023-11-07",[8672,8690,8696,8702],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":8673,"primary":8675,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[8674],{},{"content":8676},[8677,8681,8684,8687],{"type":126,"text":8678,"spans":8679},"7th November 2023: Today, Evri, the biggest dedicated parcel delivery company, has announced a landmark partnership with the Post Office which will see consumers able to send, collect and return Evri parcels over the counter in over 2,000 Post Office branches this Christmas season and beyond.",[8680],{"start":32,"end":587,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":8682,"spans":8683},"Consumers will be able to pick up and drop off parcels destined for the UK or over 220 international destinations, and for the first time, Evri customers will be able to hand a parcel directly to a Post Office team member to enter address details and apply a label, rather than using a self-service device – which will enhance the customer experience make Evri services accessible to people who are unable to use the self-service devices.",[],{"type":126,"text":8685,"spans":8686},"This follows a trial of in-branch sales, parcel pick-ups and drop-offs which launched in 2022 at 50 Post Office branches. For the first time in its 360-year history, Post Office directly sold end-to-end delivery services fulfilled by Evri rather than exclusively Royal Mail. A year later, on the back of a successful trial, Evri and Post Office plan to launch in-branch sales at 2,000 Post Office branches before the end of November.",[],{"type":126,"text":8688,"spans":8689},"The partnership will also encourage people to return to their local high street and reduces the environmental impact of vans making multiple stops to drop off parcels. Typically, parcels sent via a ParcelShop or Post Office will reduce carbon per parcel by 45%. Most ParcelShops and Post Offices operate longer opening hours than traditional retailers, in-branch pick-up and drop-off is often a more flexible option for consumers, who may not always be at home to receive deliveries. When the service is rolled out, Evri will have c.11,000 locations to send, collect and return parcels across the UK, which is on par with the number of Post Office branches. 95% of the population living in urban areas will live within 1 mile of an Evri ParcelShop or locker.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":8691,"primary":8693,"id":8479,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[8692],{},{"quoteText":8694,"quoteSource":8695},"We are fundamentally transforming Post Office by introducing new mails carriers for over-the-counter sales for the first time in our 360-year history. This expanded partnership with DPD and Evri shows how we are disrupting the mails market to offer greater choice for customers and more opportunities for Postmasters as we build a Post Office fit for the future.","Nick Read, CEO at Post Office,",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":8697,"primary":8699,"id":8701,"slice_type":558,"slice_label":8},[8698],{},{"SectionHeader":8,"SectionText":8700},[],"section_component$6224d55f-1249-486b-ba99-00956072dad1",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":8703,"primary":8705,"id":8708,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[8704],{},{"quoteText":8706,"quoteSource":8707},"We’re committed to delivering a high-quality, convenient, and reliable service and this partnership offers our cost-effective options, with great quality benefits such as tracking as standard, within the Post Office’s expansive network to reach more communities. We deliver over 730 million parcels each year and as well as offering domestic services, which sees us deliver to almost every household in the UK, our international services will be available at selected Post Office counters.","Martijn de Lange, CEO at Evri,","quote$e37826dc-67c0-4b74-b596-ec2b19dd98b9",{"id":8710,"uid":8711,"url":8712,"type":50,"href":8713,"tags":8714,"first_publication_date":8715,"last_publication_date":8716,"slugs":8717,"linked_documents":8720,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":8721,"data":8722},"ZTD1ORAAACQAeY2j","evri-orders-first-electric-hgv","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-orders-first-electric-hgv","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZTD1ORAAACQAeY2j%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2023-10-19T10:42:12+0000","2023-10-19T10:46:34+0000",[8718,8719],"evri-orders-first-electric-hgv-and-strengthens-its-fleet-ahead-of-its-peak-period.","mp-visits-evris-local-depot",[],[],{"title":8723,"category":8,"metaDescription":8724,"canonical":8725,"titleTag":8726,"featuredImage":8727,"publishedDate":8737,"slices":8738},"Evri orders first electric HGV and strengthens its fleet ahead of its peak period.","Read all about Evri's first electric HGV","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-orders-first-electric-hgv","Evri orders first electric HGV and strengthens its fleet ahead of its peak period. | Evri",{"dimensions":8728,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":8729,"id":4555,"edit":8730,"thumbnail":8732},{"width":65,"height":1242},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F51a1d737-b024-4d66-8fec-e2e8754fe946_Evri+branded+trucks+wide.png?auto=compress,format&rect=0,0,6000,4500&w=960&h=720",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":8731,"background":71},0.16,{"dimensions":8733,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":8734,"id":4555,"edit":8735},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F51a1d737-b024-4d66-8fec-e2e8754fe946_Evri+branded+trucks+wide.png?auto=compress,format&rect=0,828,6000,2844&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":7499,"zoom":8736,"background":71},0.064,"2023-10-19",[8739,8760],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":8740,"primary":8742,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[8741],{},{"content":8743},[8744,8748,8751,8754,8757],{"type":126,"text":8745,"spans":8746},"19th October 2023: Evri, the UK’s biggest dedicated parcel delivery company, has invested more than £3 million in its fleet as it prepares for its busiest ever peak period, delivering up to 3.5 million parcels on its busiest days.",[8747],{"start":32,"end":587,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":8749,"spans":8750},"Evri has placed an order for its first-ever electric HGV as it moves towards its goal of reaching net-zero by 2035. This follows the announcement last month that Evri was trialling two electric HGVs, which continues as a separate trial. Evri, keen to progress and grow its sustainable fleet, is delighted to have placed an order of a DAF XB eHGV, which has a range of up to 350 zero-emission kilometres, can go from a 20% to 80% charge in under 70 minutes depending on the specification and will be in operation before Christmas. As a result, some parcels could see a journey only on alternative fuel vehicles.",[],{"type":126,"text":8752,"spans":8753},"The company is also strengthening its fleet in other areas, including adding 12 more bio-CNG (compress natural gas) Iveco S-Way tractor units to its core fleet, bringing the total to 202 bio-CNG vehicles – these are already in operation and reduce emissions by 80%. An additional 20 bio-CNG tractor units have been added to the fleet on a temporary basis, to support with increased volume in Evri’s busiest months.",[],{"type":126,"text":8755,"spans":8756}," Evri has this month taken delivery of 43 long-body rigids which are 10m long rather than 8.5m, increasing the capacity by 25% from 16 to 20 pallets. As a result, these vehicles, which will be in operation by the end of October will significantly reduce the number of vehicles and miles on the road. ",[],{"type":126,"text":8758,"spans":8759},"As the company substantially invests to grow its sustainable fleet and move towards net-zero by 2035, it continues to introduce new initiatives including a move to ensure all new company cars being issued are low carbon – currently more than 44% of Evri’s company cars are low carbon including electric, hybrid and plug in cars. All company cars will be low carbon by 2027. Next year, the company will continue to explore options for improving its charging infrastructure to allow the growth of its existing low carbon fleet, which consists of 44 vehicles running on HVO (hydrotreated vegetable oil), 167 electric vans and growing fleet of e-cargo bikes.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":8761,"primary":8763,"id":8479,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[8762],{},{"quoteText":8764,"quoteSource":8765},"We’re excited get our hands on our first permanent electric HGV. I’m really proud of the investment our business continues to make in more sustainable vehicles, and I can’t wait to see what this vehicle can do in a highly demanding environment. We’ll be closely monitoring its performance so we can explore which other routes might be suitable for this kind of vehicle. Many of our routes require an extensive range to maintain efficiency of the parcel journey, so it’s the toughest area to decarbonise. It’s been great to work with our suppliers Adams Morey Ltd to supply the trucks and our long-term supplier GK Signs for applying the fantastic livery.","David Landy, Head of Fleetat Evri",{"id":8767,"uid":8719,"url":8768,"type":50,"href":8769,"tags":8770,"first_publication_date":8771,"last_publication_date":8772,"slugs":8773,"linked_documents":8774,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":8775,"data":8776},"ZR1XjxEAAB8Akswn","\u002Fpress\u002Fmp-visits-evris-local-depot","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZR1XjxEAAB8Akswn%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2023-10-04T12:34:30+0000","2025-02-13T12:51:23+0000",[8719],[],[],{"title":8777,"category":8,"metaDescription":8778,"canonical":8779,"titleTag":8780,"featuredImage":8781,"publishedDate":8787,"slices":8788},"MP visits Evri’s local Depot","Read all about local MP visiting Evri depot","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fmp-visits-evris-local-depot","MP visits Evri’s local Depot | Evri",{"dimensions":8782,"alt":6624,"copyright":8,"url":6625,"id":6626,"edit":8783,"thumbnail":8784},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":8785,"alt":6624,"copyright":8,"url":6630,"id":6626,"edit":8786},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2023-10-04",[8789,8813,8819,8825],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":8790,"primary":8792,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[8791],{},{"content":8793},[8794,8798,8800,8803,8805,8808,8810],{"type":126,"text":8795,"spans":8796},"29 September 2023: Siobhain McDonagh MP visited the Evri’s bike only depot in Colliers Wood, to tour the site and hear about the firm’s continued growth, recent roll out of e-cargo bikes in the local area and the business’s wider sustainability policies.",[8797],{"start":32,"end":2233,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":8799},[],{"type":126,"text":8801,"spans":8802},"The depot is home to 15 e-cargo bikes servicing the local area. The bikes were put into operation from July and forms part of Evri’s ambitious plans to triple e-cargo bike deliveries within a year to over 500,000. The new bikes will replace 15 vans that were previously operating out of the depot and will deliver around 1500 parcels per day. Siobhain spoke to Evri’s Final Mile Sustainability Specialist who showed her one of the new bikes, discussed its capabilities and the positive impact these bikes can have on the environment, with 100% reduction in tailpipe emissions compared to diesel vans. The introduction of the bikes means the area and its residents will see more than a 75-tonne reduction in C02 per year as a result. ",[],{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":8804},[],{"type":126,"text":8806,"spans":8807},"In addition to reducing Evri’s carbon emissions, the bikes also reduce noise pollution and congestion. Their space efficient design allows them to navigate the city streets easier and deliver a quicker service to customers in built up urban areas. The project has also enabled the recruitment of local couriers who may not have vehicle access, providing increased opportunities for young adults and a wider community demographic.",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":8809},[],{"type":126,"text":8811,"spans":8812},"During the visit Evri shared its wider sustainability policy with Siobhain and its commitment to becoming net zero by 2035. The business has an ongoing exploration of alternative fuels for its fleet and already has 54% of its first mile fleet powered by bio–CNG and 37% of its van fleet is fully electric. Continued advancements are being made into its buildings such, including solar panels, rain harvesting and acoustic bunds to help reduce noise pollution. Evri is also focused on expanding its out of home operation with and plans to have 15,000 parcel shops and lockers located around the UK, deliveries to these locations can reduce a parcels carbon footprint by 45%.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":8814,"primary":8816,"id":8479,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[8815],{},{"quoteText":8817,"quoteSource":8818},"I was really pleased to have Siobhain visit our site and to have the opportunity demonstrate first-hand how great e-cargo bikes are.  We are shifting towards a greener final-mile delivery solution and our roll-out of bikes in Wimbledon and across the UK is a key part of that, in partnership with all our other great sustainability initiatives.","Luke Turnbull, Final Mile Sustainability Specialist, at Evri",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":8820,"primary":8822,"id":8824,"slice_type":558,"slice_label":8},[8821],{},{"SectionHeader":8,"SectionText":8823},[],"section_component$d27320ea-e050-4daf-b543-69d0c4b55f6f",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":8826,"primary":8828,"id":8831,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[8827],{},{"quoteText":8829,"quoteSource":8830},"I was warmly welcomed on my visit to Evri’s facility in my constituency and I was delighted to learn more about how the business is looking to the future of more sustainable parcel delivery. It was great to see the steps being taken by Evri and their investment in e-cargo bikes as one of their initiatives to get close to their net zero target.","Siobhain McDonagh, MP for Mitcham and Morden","quote$6cb3abdb-b6e4-4862-8bee-ab246aab1cbb",[8833,8881,8957,9056,9156,9232,9303,9374,9444,9531,9618,9688],{"id":8834,"uid":8835,"url":8836,"type":50,"href":8837,"tags":8838,"first_publication_date":8839,"last_publication_date":8840,"slugs":8841,"linked_documents":8842,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":8843,"data":8844},"ZQRzvREAACAAg6s2","evri-trials-electric-hgvs-as-it-pushes-towards-net-zero","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-trials-electric-hgvs-as-it-pushes-towards-net-zero","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZQRzvREAACAAg6s2%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2023-09-15T15:22:47+0000","2025-02-13T13:17:56+0000",[8835],[],[],{"title":8845,"category":8,"metaDescription":8846,"canonical":8847,"titleTag":8848,"featuredImage":8849,"publishedDate":8859,"slices":8860},"Evri trials electric HGVs as it pushes towards net zero","Read all about Evri's trial of electric hgvs as it pushes towards net zero","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-trials-electric-hgvs-as-it-pushes-towards-net-zero","Evri trials electric HGVs as it pushes towards net zero | Evri",{"dimensions":8850,"alt":8851,"copyright":8,"url":8852,"id":8853,"edit":8854,"thumbnail":8855},{"width":65,"height":865},"A female van driver dressed in an Evri branded hi-vis vest is charging a blue Evri electric van.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zAJZbqstJ9-iNE_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9537.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6zAJZbqstJ9-iNE",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":8856,"alt":8851,"copyright":8,"url":8857,"id":8853,"edit":8858},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zAJZbqstJ9-iNE_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9537.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2023-09-15",[8861,8875],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":8862,"primary":8864,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[8863],{},{"content":8865},[8866,8869,8872],{"type":126,"text":8867,"spans":8868},"Evri, the UK’s biggest dedicated parcel delivery company, is trialling two electric HGVs this month as it moves to reduce emissions in the first and middle mile of a parcel’s journey. These vehicles join the existing fleet which includes 190 bio-CNG (compressed natural gas) tractor units, 44 vehicles running on HVO (hydrotreated vegetable oil), 168 electric vans and over 20 e-cargo bikes.",[],{"type":126,"text":8870,"spans":8871},"In a trial, due to conclude by the end of September 2023, Evri is testing a Volvo FM Electric 4x2 tractor unit and a 16t rigid, both of which produce zero tailpipe emissions and will be charged at Evri’s hub in Rugby. The Volvo FM Electric has a load capacity of 23 tonnes, a battery capacity of 450-540 kWh which should deliver a 300km range. The vehicle has 3 electrical motors and performs up to 2400 Nm and 650 hp.",[],{"type":126,"text":8873,"spans":8874},"This follows Evri’s recent announcement that it reduced its operational carbon emissions by 31% since last year and reduced its carbon per parcel by 10% in 2022-23 from a 2020\u002F21 baseline. Yorkshire-based Evri expects to deliver more than 500,000 parcels with e-cargo bikes this year and hopes to have an alternative-fuel solution in first, middle and final mile.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":8876,"primary":8878,"id":8479,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[8877],{},{"quoteText":8879,"quoteSource":8880},"We’re delighted to have the vehicles to try out and learn from them. We’re keen for our site teams to get used to the new technology as we continue to grow a more sustainable fleet. These journeys require an extensive range to maintain efficiency of the parcel journey, so it’s the toughest areas to decarbonise.","David Landy, Head of Fleet at Evri,",{"id":8882,"uid":8883,"url":8884,"type":50,"href":8885,"tags":8886,"first_publication_date":8887,"last_publication_date":8888,"slugs":8889,"linked_documents":8890,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":8891,"data":8892},"ZNtOIREAACIAxpKm","evri-continues-e-cargo-bike-roll-out-to-support-net-zero-ambitions","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-continues-e-cargo-bike-roll-out-to-support-net-zero-ambitions","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZNtOIREAACIAxpKm%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2023-08-15T10:14:26+0000","2025-02-13T13:06:13+0000",[8883],[],[],{"title":8893,"category":8,"metaDescription":8894,"canonical":8895,"titleTag":8896,"featuredImage":8897,"publishedDate":8907,"slices":8908},"Evri continues e-cargo bike roll-out to support net zero ambitions","Read all about Evri's latest rollout of e-cargo bikes to support its net zero ambitions.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-continues-e-cargo-bike-roll-out-to-support-net-zero-ambitions","Evri continues e-cargo bike roll-out to support net zero ambitions | Evri",{"dimensions":8898,"alt":8899,"copyright":8,"url":8900,"id":8901,"edit":8902,"thumbnail":8903},{"width":65,"height":865},"An Evri Courier handing over two parcels to an ecastatic mother and child at their doorstep.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6thLpbqstJ9-e91_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6217.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6thLpbqstJ9-e91",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":8904,"alt":8899,"copyright":8,"url":8905,"id":8901,"edit":8906},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6thLpbqstJ9-e91_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6217.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2023-08-15",[8909,8931,8937,8943],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":8910,"primary":8912,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[8911],{},{"content":8913},[8914,8920,8928],{"type":126,"text":8915,"spans":8916},"Evri, the UK’s largest dedicated parcel delivery company, has announced the latest rollout of e-cargo bikes within its national network as part of its wider sustainability strategy and commitment to reach net-zero in direct and indirect carbon emissions by 2035.",[8917,8918],{"start":32,"end":671,"type":163},{"start":32,"end":671,"type":279,"data":8919},{"link_type":281,"url":348},{"type":126,"text":8921,"spans":8922},"The company, which already uses e-cargo bikes in Bristol, Edinburgh and Manchester has partnered with Zoomo, a global leader in last-mile electric fleet solutions, to provide 15 EAV cargo bikes for its Wimbledon depot. It follows Evri’s recent commitment to triple its parcel deliveries by e-cargo bikes to over 500,000 within the next year.",[8923,8925],{"start":8924,"end":891,"type":163},102,{"start":8924,"end":891,"type":279,"data":8926},{"link_type":281,"url":8927},"press.html\u002F\u002Fridezoomo.com\u002Fuk",{"type":126,"text":8929,"spans":8930},"As part of its new vehicle-as-a-service offering, Zoomo will provide a maintenance guarantee and telematically enabled fleet management software. The EAV cargo bikes are one of the largest on the market, boasting a cargo volume of 2,000 litres and a 170kg payload, with 2m3 of cargo space. This capacity positions them as a potential replacement for van deliveries and Evri is one of the first customers to deploy them through the Zoomo platform.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":8932,"primary":8934,"id":8479,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[8933],{},{"quoteText":8935,"quoteSource":8936},"Research shows that e-cargo bikes deliver goods 60% faster than vans in city centres while reducing carbon emissions by 90% compared to diesel vans and one-third compared to electric vans. Partnerships like this are an important step forward as we continue to trial alternative fuels and innovative ways of delivering in the final mile","Nancy Hobhouse, Head of ESG, Evri",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":8938,"primary":8940,"id":8942,"slice_type":558,"slice_label":8},[8939],{},{"SectionHeader":8,"SectionText":8941},[],"section_component$bb1d0be8-60cd-44bb-ba66-b55e62f3cd04",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":8944,"primary":8946,"id":8956,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[8945],{},{"content":8947},[8948,8952],{"type":126,"text":8949,"spans":8950},"Michael Johnson, Co-Founder and CRO, Zoomo said: \"We admire Evri's commitment to reducing its carbon footprint in the last mile and are thrilled to support Evri on this journey. Making the switch to e cargo bikes for commercial fleets is still in its early days, but there is a clear business case. As a customer-led platform, Zoomo wants to accelerate the uptake of these vehicle types for urban logistics with its one-stop-shop solution and flexible financing options. By teaming up with Evri and unleashing the power of EAV cargo bikes, we're making big strides in removing fossil-fuel vans from our city streets. Together, we are driving the shift towards a greener and more efficient last-mile delivery ecosystem.\"",[8951],{"start":32,"end":8554,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":8953,"spans":8954},"Adam Barmby, CEO, EAV, said: \"This latest step with our forward-thinking delivery and last-mile solutions partners, is another demonstration of the way the industry is moving – to become better for the planet, for the city, and better for people. We’re very proud to be playing an essential role in reducing the carbon impact of delivery. Our EAVs provide a game changing format to deliver heavy and complex loads faster than vans in urban areas, on a tiny proportion of the carbon footprint. Brilliant to see the scale of the ambition Evri have to hit over 500,000 deliveries by e-cargo bike, and prove the ability Zoomo and we have to help them get there.\"",[8955],{"start":32,"end":1084,"type":163},"rich_text$804c8a82-3759-4079-8d42-dc1e2154eb08",{"id":8958,"uid":8959,"url":8960,"type":50,"href":8961,"tags":8962,"first_publication_date":8963,"last_publication_date":8964,"slugs":8965,"linked_documents":8967,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":8968,"data":8969},"ZIskyhAAACYA7t56","evri-announces-support-of-period-poverty-charity","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-announces-support-of-period-poverty-charity","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZIskyhAAACYA7t56%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2023-06-15T14:54:00+0000","2026-04-10T10:24:19+0000",[8966],"evri-announces-support-of-period-poverty-charity-bloody-good-period",[],[],{"title":8970,"category":8,"metaDescription":8971,"canonical":8972,"titleTag":8973,"featuredImage":8974,"publishedDate":8984,"slices":8985},"Evri Announces Support of Period Poverty Charity, Bloody Good Period","Read all about how Evri has partnered with period poverty charity Bloody Good Period ahead of Refugee Week.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-announces-support-of-period-poverty-charity","Evri Announces Support of Period Poverty Charity | Evri",{"dimensions":8975,"alt":7332,"copyright":8,"url":8977,"id":8978,"edit":8979,"thumbnail":8980},{"width":65,"height":8976},639,"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDYJbqstJ9-cfD_EVRI_LOCATION_04_3556.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,2,8203,5460&w=960&h=639","Z6pDYJbqstJ9-cfD",{"x":32,"y":4163,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":8981,"alt":7332,"copyright":8,"url":8982,"id":8978,"edit":8983},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDYJbqstJ9-cfD_EVRI_LOCATION_04_3556.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,788,8203,3888&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":1251,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2023-06-15",[8986],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":8987,"primary":8989,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[8988],{},{"content":8990},[8991,8994,8997,9000,9004,9008,9012,9014,9018,9021,9024,9037,9041,9044,9047,9050,9053],{"type":126,"text":8992,"spans":8993},"Evri, the largest dedicated parcel delivery company, is supporting period poverty charity Bloody Good Period ahead of Refugee Week, to deliver period supplies to those who can’t afford or access them.",[],{"type":126,"text":8995,"spans":8996},"Evri will be utilising its network to provide free deliveries of period products across England and Wales to those that need it the most. Last year the charity provided over 120,000 packs of period products across England and Wales - an increase of 87% compared to the prior year. As part of the partnership, Bloody Good Period will be providing education sessions for Evri’s people, to support in answering important menstrual, sexual, and reproductive health questions.",[],{"type":126,"text":8998,"spans":8999},"In addition, Evri will also be providing all its sites with free period products, for use by all colleagues and visitors, with the aim of normalising open conversations on the topics of periods, menstruation, and menopause. This follows the recently announced vision of Lyn Warren, Evri’s new Chief Human Resource Officer – who is committed to ensuring the business has an even more inclusive and open culture. ",[],{"type":126,"text":9001,"spans":9002},"Martijn De Lange, CEO of Evri said “We’re proud to be supporting Bloody Good Period in their work for menstrual equity, with the aim to educate around the stigma attached to menstrual, sexual, and reproductive health. We’re delighted to support this important cause by providing the tools to help them get the supplies to people who need them.”",[9003],{"start":32,"end":1070,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":9005,"spans":9006},"Rachel Grocott, CEO at Bloody Good Period said “As the cost-of-living crisis continues to unfold and we continue to see huge levels of need for free period products, at the same time as our fundraising is under immense pressure, Evri’s support is hugely appreciated. Their support will help us in the distribution of vital period products to our community partners.",[9007],{"start":32,"end":278,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":9009,"spans":9010},"Kate Osborne MP said: Evri’s partnership with Bloody Good Period shows a promising step forward in recognising and supporting Period Poverty. Period Poverty has a profound impact on women's health, and is worsening with the rising cost of living crisis. We must continue to reduce the stigma around the menstrual cycle and improve access to period products for those who cannot afford them. Normalising discussions and inclusivity towards periods is incredibly important, and I look forward to seeing this partnership in action.”",[9011],{"start":32,"end":2234,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":9013},[],{"type":126,"text":9015,"spans":9016},"NOTES TO EDITORS",[9017],{"start":32,"end":405,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":251,"spans":9019},[9020],{"start":32,"end":254,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":9022,"spans":9023},"Evri is the UK’s biggest dedicated parcel delivery company, delivering over 700 million parcels a year. The company has a mission to be the most convenient way to send, receive and return parcels, without costing the earth. Evri works with most of Europe’s top retailers including Next, John Lewis, M&S and ASOS. The roots of Evri can be traced back to 1974 but the business has grown over the decades and now has a team of 6,700+ employees, 20,000+ couriers, 10,000+ out of home locations and a growing network of state-of-the-art hubs and depots.",[],{"type":126,"text":9025,"spans":9026},"For more info: www.evri.com",[9027,9028],{"start":277,"end":3553,"type":163},{"start":277,"end":3553,"type":279,"data":9029},{"id":9030,"type":9031,"tags":9032,"lang":19,"slug":9031,"first_publication_date":9034,"last_publication_date":9035,"url":9036,"link_type":98,"isBroken":87},"YfrihxEAACEA-fLe","home",[9033],"Home","2022-02-02T19:59:06+0000","2026-07-09T09:16:50+0000","\u002F",{"type":126,"text":9038,"spans":9039},"About Bloody Good Period",[9040],{"start":32,"end":1075,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":9042,"spans":9043},"We fight for menstrual equity and the rights of all people who bleed.",[],{"type":126,"text":9045,"spans":9046},"Period products aren’t free and accessible in the UK, which means that many people can’t afford or access them. People who menstruate suffer because of the culture of embarrassment and shame that exists around this natural, biological process.",[],{"type":126,"text":9048,"spans":9049},"We give period products to those who can’t afford them and provide reproductive health education to those less likely to access it. And we help everybody talk about periods!",[],{"type":126,"text":9051,"spans":9052},"For more info: www.bloodygoodperiod.com ",[],{"type":126,"text":9054,"spans":9055},"Bloody Good Period is a registered charity, number 1185849, and a limited company, number 11801410.",[],{"id":9057,"uid":9058,"url":9059,"type":50,"href":9060,"tags":9061,"first_publication_date":9062,"last_publication_date":9063,"slugs":9064,"linked_documents":9066,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":9067,"data":9068},"ZH74eBAAACgAuW9j","evri-cuts-emissions","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-cuts-emissions","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZH74eBAAACgAuW9j%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2023-06-06T09:17:25+0000","2025-02-13T12:59:49+0000",[9065],"evri-cuts-carbon-emissions-by-nearly-a-third-as-part-of-its-investment-in-sustainability",[],[],{"title":9069,"category":8,"metaDescription":9070,"canonical":9071,"titleTag":9072,"featuredImage":9073,"publishedDate":9083,"slices":9084},"Evri cuts carbon emissions by nearly a third, as part of its investment in sustainability","Read all about how Evri has reduced its carbon emissions by nearly a third as part of the wider investment by the UK’s leading parcel delivery company in progressing its environmental, social and governance (ESG) strategy.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-cuts-emissions","Evri cuts carbon emissions by nearly a third, as part of its investment in sustainability | Evri",{"dimensions":9074,"alt":9075,"copyright":8,"url":9076,"id":9077,"edit":9078,"thumbnail":9079},{"width":65,"height":865},"An Evri Courier approaching the driveway of a suburban house carrying two parcels","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6tgAZbqstJ9-e6D_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6028.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6tgAZbqstJ9-e6D",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":9080,"alt":9075,"copyright":8,"url":9081,"id":9077,"edit":9082},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6tgAZbqstJ9-e6D_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6028.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2023-06-05",[9085,9115,9121,9127],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":9086,"primary":9088,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[9087],{},{"content":9089},[9090,9093,9096,9099,9102,9105,9108],{"type":109,"text":9091,"spans":9092},"Evri reduced its operational carbon emissions by 31% and reduced its carbon per parcel by 10% in 2022-23 from a 2020\u002F21 baseline   ",[],{"type":109,"text":9094,"spans":9095},"This included it introducing 30 new Bio-CNG tractor units, bringing the total to 190 – which is 52% of its core HGV fleet ",[],{"type":109,"text":9097,"spans":9098},"In its annual ESG report, Evri updated on its strong progress towards reaching net zero emissions for direct and indirect emissions by 2035 ",[],{"type":126,"text":9100,"spans":9101},"Evri today announced that it reduced its operational carbon emissions by nearly a third in its financial year to February 2023, as part of the wider investment by the UK’s leading parcel delivery company in progressing its environmental, social and governance (ESG) strategy.  ",[],{"type":126,"text":9103,"spans":9104},"This 31% reduction includes efficiency improvements, augmented use of renewable energy and other carbon emission elimination strategies, as part of Evri’s commitment to reaching net zero for direct and indirect emissions by 2035.  ",[],{"type":126,"text":9106,"spans":9107},"As part of its sustainability strategy, Evri continued to build the biggest green fleet of any dedicated parcel delivery company in the UK in 2022-23, introducing 30 new Bio-CNG tractor units, bringing the total to 190 – representing 52% of its core fleet. ",[],{"type":126,"text":9109,"spans":9110},"In its latest annual ESG report, Evri revealed it has also doubled the number of electric vehicles in service in London, bringing EV to 37% of its total van fleet. Evri aims to serve all ParcelShop deliveries, which are the most carbon efficient way to send, by EV at the earliest opportunity.  ",[9111,9112],{"start":206,"end":367,"type":163},{"start":206,"end":4070,"type":279,"data":9113},{"link_type":281,"url":9114},"press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fenvironment-social-and-governance",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":9116,"primary":9118,"id":395,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[9117],{},{"quoteText":9119,"quoteSource":9120},"We are committed to investing in environmental sustainability as part of our comprehensive ESG strategy. Evri continues to make strong progress towards reaching our goal of net zero for direct and indirect emissions by 2035. We are also committed to doing the right thing for colleagues with enhanced working conditions, which we are proud to set out in our second ESG report.","Fash Sawyerr, Chief Transformation Officer at Evri",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":9122,"primary":9124,"id":9126,"slice_type":558,"slice_label":8},[9123],{},{"SectionHeader":8,"SectionText":9125},[],"section_component$b3e3ea79-7fbf-4c19-86d6-97e4d3bfbb1e",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":9128,"primary":9130,"id":473,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[9129],{},{"content":9131},[9132,9135,9138,9141,9144,9147,9150],{"type":126,"text":9133,"spans":9134},"As part of its continuing exploration of alternative fuels, Evri was the first UK parcel company to trial an electric HGV, and HVO (hydrotreated vegetable oil) is now the standard at our Brooklands depot in Weybridge. ",[],{"type":126,"text":9136,"spans":9137},"Following an in-depth audit, Evri also launched an energy efficiency programme, which is now saving more than 13,000kwh per week. ",[],{"type":126,"text":9139,"spans":9140},"Evri is committed to reducing its carbon footprint in the ‘last mile’ from its depots to customers’ doorsteps. In April 2023, Evri announced ambitious plans to triple its number of parcel deliveries to more than 500,000 a year using electric-cargo bikes, as part of its wider sustainability strategy.  ",[],{"type":126,"text":9142,"spans":9143},"Evri delivered about 160,000 parcels to UK customers using e-cargo bikes in the year to February 2023 – with its couriers cycling about 12,200 miles and saving 25.6 tonnes of CO2, based on average final-mile CO2 emissions. ",[],{"type":126,"text":9145,"spans":9146},"Yorkshire-based Evri now expects to deliver more than 500,000 parcels with e-cargo bikes in its current financial year to February 2024, reflecting how it has already extended the service to more cities and growing demand. ",[],{"type":126,"text":9148,"spans":9149},"People are Evri’s greatest asset, and it took significant steps to improve the working conditions of more than 12,000 Self-Employed Plus (SE+) couriers, including automatic enrolment in a workplace pension scheme and providing maternity\u002Fpaternity leave rights, in 2022-23.  ",[],{"type":126,"text":9151,"spans":9152},"The parcel delivery specialist also introduced compulsory ESG training for management in 2022, emphasising the significance of ESG and encouraging employees to incorporate environmental and social considerations into their daily responsibilities, this was also highlighted with all senior leaders in the business having multiple personal objectives tied to ESG. ",[9153],{"start":9154,"end":9155,"type":163},361,362,{"id":9157,"uid":9158,"url":9159,"type":50,"href":9160,"tags":9161,"first_publication_date":9162,"last_publication_date":9163,"slugs":9164,"linked_documents":9166,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":9167,"data":9168},"ZG8tqhEAACEAC8EC","evri-becomes-prime-carrier","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-becomes-prime-carrier","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZG8tqhEAACEAC8EC%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2023-05-25T10:00:09+0000","2026-04-10T10:41:07+0000",[9165],"evri-becomes-an-amazon-seller-fulfilled-prime-carrier",[],[],{"title":9169,"category":8,"metaDescription":9170,"canonical":9171,"titleTag":9172,"featuredImage":9173,"publishedDate":9179,"slices":9180},"Evri becomes an Amazon Seller Fulfilled Prime carrier","Evri today announces that Amazon has made it an accredited Seller Fulfilled Prime carrier for its Prime service. Read more here.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-becomes-prime-carrier","Evri becomes a Seller Fulfilled Prime for Amazon Prime | Evri",{"dimensions":9174,"alt":7149,"copyright":8,"url":7150,"id":7151,"edit":9175,"thumbnail":9176},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":9177,"alt":7149,"copyright":8,"url":7155,"id":7151,"edit":9178},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2023-05-22",[9181,9210,9216,9221],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":9182,"primary":9184,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[9183],{},{"content":9185},[9186,9189,9192,9195,9198,9201,9204,9207],{"type":109,"text":9187,"spans":9188},"Evri has become an accredited Seller Fulfilled Prime carrier for Amazon supporting merchants across the UK.",[],{"type":109,"text":9190,"spans":9191},"This gives Evri the opportunity to grow its business by several million parcels focused on next day delivery. ",[],{"type":109,"text":9193,"spans":9194},"Evri excelled during the trial with Amazon Prime meeting all their requirements by delivering a high-quality service during the trial period, with a delivery success rate of over 97%.",[],{"type":126,"text":9196,"spans":9197},"Evri today announces that Amazon has made it an accredited Seller Fulfilled Prime carrier for its Prime service to deliver parcels on behalf of all merchants on the e-commerce giant’s website – reinforcing Evri’s position as the UK’s leading parcel delivery company and giving the opportunity to grow its business by several million parcels a year.",[],{"type":126,"text":9199,"spans":9200},"Evri received accreditation for the Amazon Prime service by completing a rigorous 6-week trial, during which it consistently met or surpassed Amazon’s requirement to successfully deliver parcels to stringent standards. ",[],{"type":126,"text":9202,"spans":9203},"A key requirement of the trial was that Evri could collect the parcels after 4.30pm from Monday to Friday and after 12.30pm on Saturday from the merchants within the UK, to then deliver to recipients the next day, anywhere in the country. ",[],{"type":126,"text":9205,"spans":9206},"Evri already delivers to individual consumers on Amazon and this new Prime collaboration will allow about 85,000 UK SMEs on the Amazon store to select Evri as their delivery provider across Prime and non-Prime orders, reflecting its status as the value for money carrier on the website. ",[],{"type":126,"text":9208,"spans":9209},"Supporting the growth of SMEs and Amazon Prime shippers is a key focus for Evri as part of their commitment to offer a competitive, fast, and reliable service for all customers across the UK and abroad no matter how big or small. ",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":9211,"primary":9213,"id":395,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[9212],{},{"quoteText":9214,"quoteSource":9215},"This new collaboration with Amazon Prime is an important milestone for Evri. It demonstrates, once again, that Evri is a parcel industry disruptor that is helping to bring down the cost of delivery for consumers and businesses, and offering a fast, reliable, and cost-effective service to compete with the UK’s traditional carriers. Evri has always been committed to supporting businesses, big and small, and Amazon’s website is a great way to demonstrate – at the highest level – what we can help them achieve.","David Saenz, E-Commerce Director at Evri",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":9217,"primary":9219,"id":9126,"slice_type":558,"slice_label":8},[9218],{},{"SectionHeader":8,"SectionText":9220},[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":9222,"primary":9224,"id":473,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[9223],{},{"content":9225},[9226,9229],{"type":126,"text":9227,"spans":9228,"direction":112},"The accreditation by Amazon Prime reflects Evri’s commitment to investing in technology, fulfilment and customer service, as well as reinforcing Evri’s high service performance & network scale domestically & abroad given that it delivers more than 700 million parcels each year.  ",[],{"type":126,"text":9230,"spans":9231,"direction":112},"Evri is the partner of choice for the majority of the UK’s biggest retailer brands, including Next, John Lewis, M&S and ASOS. Evri partners with over 1,000 SMEs across retail and other sectors in the UK. With Amazon Prime certification, Evri has proven its capability to support all businesses, from micro-shippers, to SMEs, to large corporates with the same exacting and high standards demanded by Amazon. It has the scale and flexibility to quickly adapt to retail clients’ needs, having invested £130m following Covid, to help deliver its five-year growth plan. Alongside investing in technology and customer service, Evri has set targets to become net-zero by 2035, and, as the UK’s largest operator of bio-CNG (compressed natural gas) vehicles within the industry, plans to grow the biggest sustainable fleet in the sector, as well as work towards 100% renewable energy.",[],{"id":9233,"uid":9234,"url":9235,"type":50,"href":9236,"tags":9237,"first_publication_date":9238,"last_publication_date":9239,"slugs":9240,"linked_documents":9241,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":9242,"data":9243},"ZFtWKxYAACYAKRWu","evri-employees-support-the-opening-of-emmaus-bradford","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-employees-support-the-opening-of-emmaus-bradford","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZFtWKxYAACYAKRWu%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2023-05-10T08:34:40+0000","2025-02-13T13:10:06+0000",[9234],[],[],{"title":9244,"category":8,"metaDescription":9245,"canonical":9246,"titleTag":9247,"featuredImage":9248,"publishedDate":9254,"slices":9255},"Evri employees support the opening of Emmaus Bradford","Read here to find out about how Evri employees spent a day helping out the Emmaus team open their new site in Bradford, which will help support formerly homeless by giving them meaningful work and a sense of belonging.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-employees-support-the-opening-of-emmaus-bradford","Evri employees support the opening of Emmaus Bradford | Evri",{"dimensions":9249,"alt":2293,"copyright":8,"url":2294,"id":2295,"edit":9250,"thumbnail":9251},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":9252,"alt":2293,"copyright":8,"url":2299,"id":2295,"edit":9253},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2023-05-04",[9256,9277,9283,9288],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":9257,"primary":9259,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[9258],{},{"content":9260},[9261,9264,9267,9270,9274],{"type":126,"text":9262,"spans":9263},"Four Evri employees, based at Morley in Leeds, spent yesterday 3rd May with the Emmaus team to support the opening of their new site on Pollard Lane in Bradford. The new site will support formerly homeless people by giving companions a home, meaningful work, and a sense of belonging. ",[],{"type":126,"text":9265,"spans":9266},"The Evri team offered their time and support to help paint and decorate the new companion houses in preparation for the opening. The team also made donations of toiletries and bedding which are used as part of Emmaus’ accommodation packages for the new residents in the community. The employees enjoyed meeting some of the companions and a tour of the new facility which can accommodate 24 previously homeless people and currently has 5 residents.",[],{"type":126,"text":9268,"spans":9269},"Evri, the UK’s biggest dedicated parcel delivery company, partnered with Emmaus in 2020, since then over £127,000 has been raised through fundraising by Evri’s people and cash donations from the business. Evri continues to support the national charity through fundraising, discounted parcel sending and work experience. Evri has recently supported the Emmaus community in Bolton to get new windows which were over 90 years old, the new windows are helping to keep residents warm, keep noise to a minimum and make energy saving.",[],{"type":126,"text":9271,"spans":9272},"Darrel Tinsley, CEO of Emmaus Bradford, said: \"Evri’s time spent volunteering has not only helped to improve the physical environment of our community, but also helped to provide a sense of hope and belonging to those we serve.",[9273],{"start":32,"end":1128,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":9275,"spans":9276},"I want to express my appreciation for the impact Evri have made on our community, and I hope that their experience volunteering with us has been as meaningful for you as it has been for us. We look forward to the continued partnership and support from the EVRI team in the future. It is a testament to your commitment to creating positive change in the world.\"",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":9278,"primary":9280,"id":395,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[9279],{},{"quoteText":9281,"quoteSource":9282},"It was humbling and grounding to meet with the companions and hear their stories, I’m so glad that we could spend time helping to get the rooms ready for the companions and feel like we’ve made difference, no matter how small.","Emma Brown, Business Development Manager at Evri",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":9284,"primary":9286,"id":9126,"slice_type":558,"slice_label":8},[9285],{},{"SectionHeader":8,"SectionText":9287},[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":9289,"primary":9291,"id":473,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[9290],{},{"content":9292},[9293,9296,9298,9301],{"type":126,"text":251,"spans":9294},[9295],{"start":32,"end":254,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":9022,"spans":9297},[],{"type":126,"text":9299,"spans":9300},"For more information about Evri, visit www.evri.com.",[],{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":9302},[],{"id":9304,"uid":9305,"url":9306,"type":50,"href":9307,"tags":9308,"first_publication_date":9309,"last_publication_date":9310,"slugs":9311,"linked_documents":9313,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":9314,"data":9315},"ZFtU9xYAACYAKRAc","mp-visits-evri-to-see-new-bury-depot","\u002Fpress\u002Fmp-visits-evri-to-see-new-bury-depot","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZFtU9xYAACYAKRAc%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2023-05-10T08:29:36+0000","2025-02-13T13:09:07+0000",[9312],"mp-visits-evri-to-see-new-depot-in-bury-st-edmunds",[],[],{"title":9316,"category":8,"metaDescription":9317,"canonical":9318,"titleTag":9319,"featuredImage":9320,"publishedDate":9326,"slices":9327},"MP visits Evri to see new depot in Bury St Edmunds","Read here to find out about Jo Churchill's visit to Evri's new depot in Bury St Edmunds","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fmp-visits-evri-to-see-new-bury-depot","MP visits Evri to see new depot in Bury St Edmunds | Evri",{"dimensions":9321,"alt":6950,"copyright":8,"url":6951,"id":6952,"edit":9322,"thumbnail":9323},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":9324,"alt":6950,"copyright":8,"url":6956,"id":6952,"edit":9325},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2023-05-05",[9328,9351,9357,9362],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":9329,"primary":9331,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[9330],{},{"content":9332},[9333,9336,9339,9342,9345,9349],{"type":126,"text":9334,"spans":9335},"Jo Churchill, MP for Bury St Edmunds visited the recently opened 77,000 sq ft depot in Suffolk Logistics Park in Bury St Edmunds to tour the site and hear about the firm’s continued growth and investment in sustainability initiatives. ",[],{"type":126,"text":9337,"spans":9338},"Jo was taken on a tour of the depot, which is an integral part of the national operation, delivering a staggering 700 million parcels a year. The tour was then followed by discussions around Evri’s overall business performance, which has seen double digit growth over the past few years, as well as regional investment and employment. To support Evri’s ESG commitments the new depot comes complete with an EPC A rating and is built to BREEAM ‘Excellent’ certified specifications.  ",[],{"type":126,"text":9340,"spans":9341},"Excitingly, more than 50 new jobs were created when the site relocated from Newmarket to a larger site at Bury St Edmunds, and the depot is continuing to recruit. The new jobs at the location include warehouse operatives, van drivers, HGV drivers and several management roles. ",[],{"type":126,"text":9343,"spans":9344},"The strategic move forms part of the company’s commitment to continuing to invest in its infrastructure to support the growth of online shopping, increasing capacity from 120,000 to 180,000. Parcels processed are then delivered across the area including Suffolk, Cambridgeshire and Norfolk.",[],{"type":126,"text":9346,"spans":9347},"Josh Stylianou, Area Manager at Evri, said: “Today was a great opportunity to showcase how we are continuing to grow and invest in our operations in the area. We are proud to provide regional employment opportunities for people seeking to work in a flexible and rewarding environment within a growing national business.”  ",[9348],{"start":32,"end":1161,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":9350},[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":9352,"primary":9354,"id":395,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[9353],{},{"quoteText":9355,"quoteSource":9356},"Fantastic to visit the new Evri facility today, creating local 50 jobs with more on the way. This really shows the future of parcel delivery. We’ve spoken about environmental, social and governance issues and opportunities for everyone. This is Bury St Edmunds at its best: new facility, new jobs and excellent service delivery.","Jo Churchill, MP for Bury St Edmunds",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":9358,"primary":9360,"id":9126,"slice_type":558,"slice_label":8},[9359],{},{"SectionHeader":8,"SectionText":9361},[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":9363,"primary":9365,"id":473,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[9364],{},{"content":9366},[9367,9370,9372],{"type":126,"text":402,"spans":9368},[9369],{"start":32,"end":405,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":9022,"spans":9371},[],{"type":126,"text":9299,"spans":9373},[],{"id":9375,"uid":9376,"url":9377,"type":50,"href":9378,"tags":9379,"first_publication_date":9380,"last_publication_date":9381,"slugs":9382,"linked_documents":9384,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":9385,"data":9386},"ZFKABhEAACIAHkkf","hoyland-common-pupils-evri-tour","\u002Fpress\u002Fhoyland-common-pupils-evri-tour","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZFKABhEAACIAHkkf%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2023-05-03T16:11:39+0000","2026-04-10T10:41:34+0000",[9383],"evri-hoyland-common-pupils-make-their-own-delivery-at-evri-hub",[],[],{"title":9387,"category":8,"metaDescription":9388,"canonical":1836,"titleTag":9387,"featuredImage":9389,"publishedDate":9399,"slices":9400},"Evri Hoyland Common Pupils Make Their Own Delivery at Evri Hub","Children from Hoyland Common Primary School have been given a special guided tour of Evri’s hub. Read more here.",{"dimensions":9390,"alt":9391,"copyright":8,"url":9392,"id":9393,"edit":9394,"thumbnail":9395},{"width":65,"height":865},"A mother and child thanking their Evri Courier after a satisfactory delivery of two parcels","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6the5bqstJ9-e-A_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6364.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6the5bqstJ9-e-A",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":9396,"alt":9391,"copyright":8,"url":9397,"id":9393,"edit":9398},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6the5bqstJ9-e-A_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6364.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2023-04-18",[9401,9421,9427,9432],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":9402,"primary":9404,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[9403],{},{"content":9405},[9406,9409,9412,9415,9418],{"type":126,"text":9407,"spans":9408},"Excited schoolchildren from Hoyland Common Primary School have been given a special guided tour of Evri’s hub off Olympus Way in Hoyland Common, Barnsley. Fifty-four pupils from Hoyland Common Primary School, on Sheffield Road, took part in a visit to their neighbour, Evri, to learn what happens inside a hub as research into a geography topic in which they’ve been studying the local area.",[],{"type":126,"text":9410,"spans":9411},"The children, aged between 6 and 7 were each allocated their own special hi-vis jackets as they saw lorries being unloaded, before being given the chance to place their own special parcel on to the huge automatic sorters. The pupils also visited the control room in order to speak to drivers on the radio, as well as exploring inside one of Evri’s bio-CNG (Compressed Natural Gas) lorries, where they enjoyed revving the engine and beeping the horn.",[],{"type":126,"text":9413,"spans":9414},"A jammed-packed day saw the children race remote control cars and take part in a drawing competition, before they travelled back to their classroom, where their special delivery was already waiting for them!",[],{"type":126,"text":9416,"spans":9417},"The visit follows Evri opening the £60 million site last September. The site has a bio-CNG fuelling station for the vehicles which reduce emissions by over 85% compared to diesel as well as other eco initiatives including solar panels, a rainwater-harvesting system and planting of over 25,000 hedges and trees.",[],{"type":126,"text":9419,"spans":9420},"Evri has worked with the school from the build phase and has previously donated equipment including hi-vis jackets, signs, cable reels and other materials for a special outdoor area.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":9422,"primary":9424,"id":395,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[9423],{},{"quoteText":9425,"quoteSource":9426},"I’m really keen that we open our doors to the community to see what a positive impact our business can have on the local community. We loved giving the children a special insight into the journey of a parcel, as well as taking part in some fun activities. However, the pupils were also given an important lesson in health and safety, and how that plays an important part in everything we do.","Gareth Shawcroft, Head of Barnsley Hub at Evri",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":9428,"primary":9430,"id":557,"slice_type":558,"slice_label":8},[9429],{},{"SectionHeader":8,"SectionText":9431},[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":9433,"primary":9435,"id":473,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[9434],{},{"content":9436},[9437,9440,9442],{"type":126,"text":251,"spans":9438},[9439],{"start":32,"end":254,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":9022,"spans":9441},[],{"type":126,"text":9299,"spans":9443},[],{"id":9445,"uid":9446,"url":9447,"type":50,"href":9448,"tags":9449,"first_publication_date":9450,"last_publication_date":9451,"slugs":9452,"linked_documents":9454,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":9455,"data":9456},"ZFJ_AREAACIAHkSF","evri-cargo-bike-plans","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-cargo-bike-plans","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZFJ_AREAACIAHkSF%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2023-05-03T15:38:38+0000","2026-04-10T10:20:07+0000",[9453],"evri-plans-to-triple-parcel-deliveries-by-e-cargo-bikes",[],[],{"title":9457,"category":8,"metaDescription":9458,"canonical":9459,"titleTag":9460,"featuredImage":9461,"publishedDate":9467,"slices":9468},"Evri plans to triple parcel deliveries by e-cargo bikes","Read here to find out about Evri's plans to triple deliveries by e-cargo bike over the next year","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-cargo-bike-plans","Evri Plans to Triple Parcel deliveries by e-cargo bikes | Evri",{"dimensions":9462,"alt":7843,"copyright":8,"url":7844,"id":7845,"edit":9463,"thumbnail":9464},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":9465,"alt":7843,"copyright":8,"url":7849,"id":7845,"edit":9466},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2023-04-24",[9469,9505,9511,9516],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":9470,"primary":9472,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[9471],{},{"content":9473},[9474,9477,9480,9483,9487,9490,9493,9496,9499,9502],{"type":126,"text":9475,"spans":9476},"·        Evri plans to deliver more than 500,000 parcels with e-cargo bikes in the year to February 2024",[],{"type":126,"text":9478,"spans":9479},"·        Its couriers already use e-cargo bikes in Bristol, Edinburgh and Manchester ",[],{"type":126,"text":9481,"spans":9482},"·        E-cargo bikes are part of Evri’s commitment to reach net-zero in carbon emissions by 2035",[],{"type":126,"text":9484,"spans":9485},"24 April 2023: Evri, the UK’s largest dedicated parcel company, today announces ambitious plans to triple its number of parcel deliveries to more than 500,000 a year using electric-cargo bikes, as part of its wider sustainability strategy and commitment to reach net-zero in direct and indirect carbon emissions by 2035.",[9486],{"start":32,"end":4838,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":9488,"spans":9489},"Evri delivered about 154,000 parcels to UK customers using e-cargo bikes in the 12 months to February 2023 – with its couriers cycling about 12,200 miles and saving 25.6 tonnes of CO2, based on average final-mile CO2 emissions. ",[],{"type":126,"text":9491,"spans":9492},"Barnsley-based Evri now expects to deliver more than 500,000 parcels with e-cargo bikes in its current financial year to February, reflecting how it has already extended the service to more cities and growing demand. ",[],{"type":126,"text":9494,"spans":9495},"Evri’s largest e-cargo bike city, Bristol is expected to account for 345,000 of its parcel deliveries, which will be 100% reduction in tailpipe emissions for parcels under 15kg – saving an estimated 57.4 tons of CO2 per annum – in 2023-24. This would be the equivalent of removing 15 polluting vehicles from Bristol’s streets. ",[],{"type":126,"text":9497,"spans":9498},"Evri, formally Hermes UK, began its inaugural trial of e-cargo bikes in East Yorkshire in the UK in April 2022 – and subsequently launched them in Edinburgh, Manchester and Bristol, where it has also started a trial in the city’s low emission zone.",[],{"type":126,"text":9500,"spans":9501},"The delivery specialist is also planning to introduce the e-cargo bikes into Leeds and Wimbledon in south London later this year, as part of its commitment to reduce its carbon footprint in the ‘last mile’ from its depots to customers’ doorsteps.",[],{"type":126,"text":9503,"spans":9504},"More widely, Evri is growing the biggest sustainable truck fleet in the industry, alongside its work towards using 100% renewable electricity, such as at its distribution centres.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":9506,"primary":9508,"id":395,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[9507],{},{"quoteText":9509,"quoteSource":9510},"We continue to push ahead with our deployment of e-cargo bikes, which are not only more reliable and help to deliver a quicker service to customers in busy, built-up urban areas, but also are better for the environment. As a company committed to being a parcel industry leader in ESG, our e-cargo deliveries will help us create a network of sustainable delivery options to supplement our current courier model in the UK and internationally.","Nancy Hobhouse, Head of ESG at Evri",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":9512,"primary":9514,"id":9126,"slice_type":558,"slice_label":8},[9513],{},{"SectionHeader":8,"SectionText":9515},[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":9517,"primary":9519,"id":473,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[9518],{},{"content":9520},[9521,9525,9528],{"type":126,"text":9522,"spans":9523},"Notes to Editors ",[9524],{"start":32,"end":362,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":9526,"spans":9527},"About Evri ",[],{"type":126,"text":9529,"spans":9530},"Evri is the UK’s biggest dedicated parcel delivery company, delivering over 700 million parcels a year. The company has a mission to be the most convenient way to send, receive and return parcels, without costing the earth. Evri works with most of Europe’s top retailers including Next, John Lewis, M&S and ASOS. The roots of Evri can be traced back to 1974 but the business has grown over the decades and now has a team of 6,700+ employees, 20,000+ couriers, 10,000+ out of home locations and a growing network of state-of-the-art hubs and depots. ",[],{"id":9532,"uid":9533,"url":9534,"type":50,"href":9535,"tags":9536,"first_publication_date":9537,"last_publication_date":9538,"slugs":9539,"linked_documents":9540,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":9541,"data":9542},"ZAjJyBEAACEA5Azv","evri-continues-drive-for-zero-emission-deliveries-in-major-cities","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-continues-drive-for-zero-emission-deliveries-in-major-cities","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZAjJyBEAACEA5Azv%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2023-03-08T17:48:50+0000","2025-02-13T13:22:38+0000",[9533],[],[],{"title":9543,"category":8,"metaDescription":9544,"canonical":9545,"titleTag":9546,"featuredImage":9547,"publishedDate":9557,"slices":9558},"Evri continues drive for zero-emission deliveries in major cities","Read our latest blog post to find about Evri's goal of zero-emission deliveries in major cities.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-continues-drive-for-zero-emission-deliveries-in-major-cities","evri-continues-drive-for-zero-emission-deliveries-in-major-cities | Evri",{"dimensions":9548,"alt":9549,"copyright":8,"url":9550,"id":9551,"edit":9552,"thumbnail":9553},{"width":65,"height":865},"A female courier is walking up a quiet British street. A brick wall can be seen beside her and she is holding a brown paper parcel in her hand.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zAl5bqstJ9-iNt_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9647.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6zAl5bqstJ9-iNt",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":9554,"alt":9549,"copyright":8,"url":9555,"id":9551,"edit":9556},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zAl5bqstJ9-iNt_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9647.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2023-03-08",[9559],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":9560,"primary":9562,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[9561],{},{"content":9563},[9564,9567,9570,9573,9578,9583,9588,9590,9594,9598,9601,9605,9608,9612,9615],{"type":126,"text":9565,"spans":9566},"As part of its commitment to net zero carbon emissions by 2035 Evri, the UK’s leading parcel delivery company, has partnered with Zedify and Urb-it, to provide carbon free deliveries to all consumers in the Bristol Clean Air Zone. Zedify and Urb-it will use their specialist e-cargo bikes to deliver to consumers’ homes within the clean air zone meaning that all deliveries, under 15kg, will be 100% emission-free. The number of deliveries is estimated at around 345,000 per year with savings of 57.4 tons of CO2 per annum. ",[],{"type":126,"text":9568,"spans":9569},"Evri, who has the lowest carbon emissions of any dedicated parcel company in the UK, has also started a trial with Urb-it in Glasgow’s low emission zone to explore how efficient the bikes are as a solution ahead of the changes coming into place June 2023. It follows similar partnerships in Leeds and Manchester and future planned trials in Oxford, Cambridge and other areas as and when Clean Air Zones are rolled out.  ",[],{"type":126,"text":9571,"spans":9572},"In addition to the ESG benefits the trials will assess whether the e-cargo bikes are also more reliable in built up areas that are challenging to deliver to using traditional methods, and therefore more efficient as they move through urban areas quicker. ",[],{"type":126,"text":9574,"spans":9575},"Nancy Hobhouse, Head of ESG said “We’re focused on reducing our carbon emission across our operation, using innovative products and services such as this which brings us that step closer to our net zero goal. Using these bikes means that all delivers made to consumers’ homes within the low emissions zone that are under 15kg will be done so 100% carbon free, with a single bike expected to produce a carbon saving of 3t alone.” ",[9576],{"start":367,"end":9577,"type":1324},429,{"type":126,"text":9579,"spans":9580},"Simon Whitehead, Head of Bristol Hub at Zedify said \"At Zedify, we're on a mission to get vans off streets and make cities like Bristol cleaner, safer places that are better for everyone. In 2021, we launched our award-winning cargo bike delivery service in the city. Now, with the launch of a new clean air zone, this collaboration helps to maximise our impact in dramatically decarbonising the process of getting parcels to people's doorsteps and cleaning up Bristol's air.\" ",[9581],{"start":684,"end":9582,"type":1324},477,{"type":126,"text":9584,"spans":9585},"Kevin Kviblad, CEO at Urb-it said \"We are delighted to work with Evri to sustainably deliver its products to their customers in the UK. Evri has high ambitions for improving its sustainability strategy, and we're pleased to be able to partner on making our industry better and our cities healthier and more liveable.\" ",[9586],{"start":5726,"end":9587,"type":1324},318,{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":9589},[],{"type":126,"text":9591,"spans":9592},"Notes to editor ",[9593],{"start":32,"end":277,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":9595,"spans":9596},"About Zedify ",[9597],{"start":819,"end":699,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":9599,"spans":9600},"Zedify is one of the sustainable delivery models that Evri is partnering with to support its commitment to becoming the UK’s most sustainable delivery business. ",[],{"type":126,"text":9602,"spans":9603},"About Urb-it ",[9604],{"start":819,"end":4838,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":9606,"spans":9607},"Urb-it, are a Swedish B-Corp certified cargo bike company who have also enjoy success with Evri in 2022 working together to deliver in Manchester, Liverpool, and London. ",[],{"type":126,"text":9609,"spans":9610},"About Evri ",[9611],{"start":819,"end":3706,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":9613,"spans":9614},"Evri is the UK’s biggest dedicated parcel delivery company, delivering over 700 million parcels a year. The company has a mission to be the most convenient way to send, receive and return parcels, without costing the earth. Evri works with most of Europe’s top retailers including Next, John Lewis, M&S and ASOS. The roots of Evri can be traced back to 1974 but the business has grown over the decades and now has a team of 6,700+ employees, 20,000+ couriers, 10,000+ out of home locations and a growing network of state-of-the-art hubs and depots. ",[],{"type":126,"text":9616,"spans":9617},"For more information about Evri, visit www.evri.com ",[],{"id":9619,"uid":9620,"url":9621,"type":50,"href":9622,"tags":9623,"first_publication_date":9624,"last_publication_date":9625,"slugs":9626,"linked_documents":9627,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":9628,"data":9629},"ZAjJJhEAACMA5AoR","evri-launches-zero-emission-deliveries-in-bristol-clean-air-zone","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-launches-zero-emission-deliveries-in-bristol-clean-air-zone","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZAjJJhEAACMA5AoR%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2023-03-08T17:45:13+0000","2025-02-13T13:21:57+0000",[9620],[],[],{"title":9630,"category":8,"metaDescription":9631,"canonical":9632,"titleTag":9633,"featuredImage":9634,"publishedDate":9557,"slices":9640},"Evri launches zero-emission deliveries in Bristol Clean Air Zone","Read our latest blog post to find about the launch of Evri's zero-emission deliveries in Bristol Clean Air Zone","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-launches-zero-emission-deliveries-in-bristol-clean-air-zone","Evri launches zero-emission deliveries in Bristol Clean Air Zone | Evri",{"dimensions":9635,"alt":7264,"copyright":8,"url":7265,"id":7266,"edit":9636,"thumbnail":9637},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":9638,"alt":7264,"copyright":8,"url":7270,"id":7266,"edit":9639},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},[9641],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":9642,"primary":9644,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[9643],{},{"content":9645},[9646,9649,9652,9655,9659,9662,9665,9668,9671,9673,9676,9678,9681,9683,9686],{"type":126,"text":9647,"spans":9648},"Evri, the UK’s leading parcel delivery company has partnered with Zedify and Urb-it, two of the top providers of zero-emission delivery solutions to provide carbon free deliveries to all consumers in the Bristol Clean Air Zone. ",[],{"type":126,"text":9650,"spans":9651},"Zedify and Urb-it will use their specialist e-cargo bikes to deliver within Bristol’s Clean Air Zone from the 1st March 2023. The partnerships mean that any Evri parcel, under 15kg, delivered to consumers’ homes within the clean air zone will be 100% emission-free. The total number of parcels expected to be delivered is around 345,000 per year with an estimated saving 57.4 tons of CO2 per annum. ",[],{"type":126,"text":9653,"spans":9654},"Evri has the lowest carbon emissions of any dedicated parcel company in the UK. This partnership reinforces the business commitment to net zero carbon emissions by 2035 as it strives to be an ESG leader.  ",[],{"type":126,"text":9656,"spans":9657},"Nancy Hobhouse, Head of ESG said “We’re focused on reducing our carbon emission across our operation, using innovative products and services such as this brings us that step closer to our net zero goal.“ ",[9658],{"start":367,"end":4353,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":9579,"spans":9660},[9661],{"start":684,"end":9582,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":9584,"spans":9663},[9664],{"start":5726,"end":9587,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":9591,"spans":9666},[9667],{"start":32,"end":277,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":9595,"spans":9669},[9670],{"start":32,"end":4838,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":9599,"spans":9672},[],{"type":126,"text":9602,"spans":9674},[9675],{"start":32,"end":4838,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":9606,"spans":9677},[],{"type":126,"text":9609,"spans":9679},[9680],{"start":32,"end":3706,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":9613,"spans":9682},[],{"type":126,"text":9684,"spans":9685},"For more information about Evri, visit www.evri.com. ",[],{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":9687},[],{"id":9689,"uid":9690,"url":9691,"type":50,"href":9692,"tags":9693,"first_publication_date":9694,"last_publication_date":9695,"slugs":9696,"linked_documents":9697,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":9698,"data":9699},"Y-twDhEAACUAGgYR","evri-appoints-chief-human-resource-officer","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-appoints-chief-human-resource-officer","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22Y-twDhEAACUAGgYR%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2023-02-14T11:31:52+0000","2025-02-13T13:24:29+0000",[9690],[],[],{"title":9700,"category":8,"metaDescription":9701,"canonical":9702,"titleTag":9703,"featuredImage":9704,"publishedDate":9714,"slices":9715},"Evri appoints Chief Human Resource Officer","Read our latest blog post to find about the appointment of our new Chief Human Resource Officer.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-appoints-chief-human-resource-officer","Evri appoints Chief Human Resource Officer | Evri",{"dimensions":9705,"alt":9706,"copyright":8,"url":9707,"id":9708,"edit":9709,"thumbnail":9710},{"width":65,"height":865},"A customer sitting in a wheelchair is outside and a courier is handing a parcel to them with one hand and using a device in the other hand to scan the parcel. The customer is positioned to be facing away from the camera, with the courier in full view.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XpdJbqstJ9-WbI_EVRI_LOCATION_01_0645.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6XpdJbqstJ9-WbI",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":9711,"alt":9706,"copyright":8,"url":9712,"id":9708,"edit":9713},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XpdJbqstJ9-WbI_EVRI_LOCATION_01_0645.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2023-02-08",[9716],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":9717,"primary":9719,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[9718],{},{"content":9720},[9721,9724,9727,9730,9733],{"type":126,"text":9722,"spans":9723},"Evri, the UK’s largest dedicated parcel company, has appointed Lyn Warren as Chief Human Resource Officer (CHRO), as part of its commitment to investing in its people as the business continues to grow and transform. ",[],{"type":126,"text":9725,"spans":9726},"Lyn will be leading Evri’s people strategy and vision, overseeing every aspect of the company’s workplace and employee activity. She will be focused on developing the current strategy to ensure the business is attracting, retaining, and developing talented people. ",[],{"type":126,"text":9728,"spans":9729},"Lyn brings with her a wealth of experience from over 20 years working in HR and retail, most recently as Retail and People Director at Joules. ",[],{"type":126,"text":9731,"spans":9732},"Commenting on her new role, Lyn said ‘I’m excited to be joining such a fast growing and innovative business. My main focus will be on making sure this is an amazing, inclusive place to work, and helping and supporting our people to be the best they can be.” ",[],{"type":126,"text":9734,"spans":9735},"Martijn de Lange, CEO at Evri, said ‘Lyn’s experience and expertise means we now have a full board of experts leading the business. Our people are at the heart of our success and Lyn’s passion for leading and developing our people strategy will play a vital role in our continued growth.”",[],[9737,9777,9827,9876,10006,10059,10111,10273,10352,10409,10459,10518],{"id":9738,"uid":9739,"url":9740,"type":50,"href":9741,"tags":9742,"first_publication_date":9743,"last_publication_date":9744,"slugs":9745,"linked_documents":9747,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":9748,"data":9749},"Y3ZOvRAAACgAjmXs","evris-response-to-the-citizens-advice-parcel-league-table","\u002Fpress\u002Fevris-response-to-the-citizens-advice-parcel-league-table","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22Y3ZOvRAAACgAjmXs%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-11-17T15:27:17+0000","2026-04-10T10:18:18+0000",[9746],"evris-response-to-the-citizens-advice-parcel-league-table-2022",[],[],{"title":9750,"category":8,"metaDescription":9751,"canonical":9752,"titleTag":9753,"featuredImage":9754,"publishedDate":9760,"slices":9761},"Evri’s response to the Citizens Advice parcel league table 2022","Read our response to the Citizens Advice Bureau's parcel league table which is based on inaccurate data and concerning survey methodology.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevris-response-to-the-citizens-advice-parcel-league-table","Evri’s Response to the Citizens Advice Parcel League Table 2022",{"dimensions":9755,"alt":6624,"copyright":8,"url":6625,"id":6626,"edit":9756,"thumbnail":9757},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":9758,"alt":6624,"copyright":8,"url":6630,"id":6626,"edit":9759},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2022-11-09",[9762],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":9763,"primary":9765,"id":9776,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[9764],{},{"content":9766},[9767,9770],{"type":126,"text":9768,"spans":9769,"direction":112},"As the UK’s leading dedicated parcel company, Evri delivers over 2 million parcels each day and we pride ourselves on offering a fast, reliable, sustainable service which doesn’t cost the earth for consumers and businesses alike. Evri is rated great on Trustpilot with a score of 4.2, based on over 3 million independent reviews and we have a loyal client base, including the majority of the high street and we have long-standing and loyal clients who have worked with Evri for an average of 10 years. We have made significant investments to improve our service as we grow, adding dedicated customer service teams operating seven days a week in depots; building the biggest parcel distribution hub in Europe, in Barnsley; and expanded our ParcelShops and Lockers, which help customers to send and receive parcels at over 10,000 locations nationwide, improving first-time delivery rates and reducing the carbon footprint of each delivery. The survey from the Citizen’s Advice Bureau is based on inaccurate data and we have raised significant concerns with them about their survey methodology, which uses historic volume data; is overly reliant on Twitter and includes reference to fake and incorrect handles.",[],{"type":126,"text":9771,"spans":9772,"direction":112},"Learn more about Evri",[9773],{"start":32,"end":206,"type":279,"data":9774},{"link_type":281,"url":9775,"target":283},"press.html\u002F\u002Fprismic-io.s3.amazonaws.com\u002Fev-mercury\u002F79f53a54-d84b-449b-b46c-cd857b41d715_Citizens+Advice+response.pdf","rich_text$a4572524-1e11-4e05-90c8-5985cc1c84af",{"id":9778,"uid":9779,"url":9780,"type":50,"href":9781,"tags":9782,"first_publication_date":9783,"last_publication_date":9784,"slugs":9785,"linked_documents":9786,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":9787,"data":9788},"Y0friBAAACQAVtgz","evri-opens-new-maidstone-depot-creating-150-jobs","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-opens-new-maidstone-depot-creating-150-jobs","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22Y0friBAAACQAVtgz%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-10-13T10:44:46+0000","2025-02-13T13:40:01+0000",[9779],[],[],{"title":9789,"category":8,"metaDescription":9790,"canonical":9791,"titleTag":9792,"featuredImage":9793,"publishedDate":9803,"slices":9804},"Evri opens new Maidstone depot creating 150 jobs","Evri, the UK’s largest dedicated parcel company, has opened its a new distribution depot in Aylesford, Maidstone creating 150 jobs.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-opens-new-maidstone-depot-creating-150-jobs","Evri opens new Maidstone depot creating 150 jobs | Evri",{"dimensions":9794,"alt":9795,"copyright":8,"url":9796,"id":9797,"edit":9798,"thumbnail":9799},{"width":65,"height":865},"A female courier dressed in an Evri uniform stands in front of a blue Evri van with a handful of delivery slips.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6y_j5bqstJ9-iMN_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9338.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6y_j5bqstJ9-iMN",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":9800,"alt":9795,"copyright":8,"url":9801,"id":9797,"edit":9802},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6y_j5bqstJ9-iMN_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9338.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2022-10-05",[9805,9820],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":9806,"primary":9808,"id":9819,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[9807],{},{"content":9809},[9810,9813,9816],{"type":126,"text":9811,"spans":9812},"Evri, the UK’s largest dedicated parcel company, has opened its a new distribution depot in Aylesford, Maidstone at Panattoni Park, Bellingham Way, Aylesford, ME20 6SQ. Around 50 full time jobs and 100 part time jobs have been created at the substantial 78,794 sq ft warehouse, which was fully operational from Sunday 9th October 2022.",[],{"type":126,"text":9814,"spans":9815},"The new facility can handle over 220K parcels each day, over double as many as its previous site a few miles away, with the ability to operate 24\u002F7 if required.  It forms part of the ongoing investment programme by Evri to expand its capacity to meet the huge demand created by people shopping at home during the pandemic and the continuing growth in the sector. ",[],{"type":126,"text":9817,"spans":9818},"To support Evri’s ESG commitments, the new depot comes complete with EV charging as Evri now has 30% electric vehicle ParcelShop fleet, smart lighting, rainwater harvesting, low carbon heating, solar panels and is built to BREEAM ‘Excellent’ certified specifications.  ",[],"rich_text$73528258-e015-4529-9cce-97d129b3b4e7",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":9821,"primary":9823,"id":9826,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[9822],{},{"quoteText":9824,"quoteSource":9825},"We are all very excited to have moved into our new home. It shows the faith the business has in Team Maidstone to deliver a world class service from this world class facility.  We are all very grateful for this opportunity and would just like to say a big thank you to everyone who has helped make this happen.","Gemma Jones, Depot General Manager, Evri","quote$6e6b053a-20fb-4c4b-8944-631252b26017",{"id":9828,"uid":9829,"url":9830,"type":50,"href":9831,"tags":9832,"first_publication_date":9833,"last_publication_date":9834,"slugs":9835,"linked_documents":9836,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":9837,"data":9838},"Y0fmlBAAACQAVsGQ","evri-uses-ai-to-develop-parcel-vision-software","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-uses-ai-to-develop-parcel-vision-software","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22Y0fmlBAAACQAVsGQ%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-10-13T10:23:35+0000","2025-02-13T13:29:36+0000",[9829],[],[],{"title":9839,"category":8,"metaDescription":9840,"canonical":9841,"titleTag":9842,"featuredImage":9843,"publishedDate":9854,"slices":9855},"Evri uses AI to develop parcel vision software","Find out in this article how Evri the leading consumer delivery specialist, has developed bespoke software designed to further improve parcel delivery accuracy and customer communication,","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-uses-ai-to-develop-parcel-vision-software","Evri uses AI to develop parcel vision software | Evri",{"dimensions":9844,"alt":9845,"copyright":8,"url":9846,"id":9847,"edit":9848,"thumbnail":9849},{"width":65,"height":733},"A parcel in waterproof blue packaging is being photographed by a courier as proof of delivery. Both the courier and recipient are clearly visible","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6y925bqstJ9-iJP_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9178.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,7543,4832&w=960&h=615","Z6y925bqstJ9-iJP",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":9850,"alt":9845,"copyright":8,"url":9851,"id":9847,"edit":9852},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6y925bqstJ9-iJP_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9178.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,629,7543,3575&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":9853,"zoom":33,"background":71},629,"2022-10-12",[9856,9870],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":9857,"primary":9859,"id":9819,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[9858],{},{"content":9860},[9861,9864,9867],{"type":126,"text":9862,"spans":9863},"The Innovation Team at Evri, the leading consumer delivery specialist, has developed bespoke software designed to further improve parcel delivery accuracy and customer communication, ahead of this year’s peak Christmas period. It is currently being trialled regionally.",[],{"type":126,"text":9865,"spans":9866},"Parcel Vision has been designed to detect and flag any safe place photos that are taken by the courier as proof of delivery but which fail to show the parcel and where it has been left. This is for the occasional mistake where the parcel may not be clearly visible, be too close to the lens or the camera lens covered.  ",[],{"type":126,"text":9868,"spans":9869},"The software has been developed using a machine learning model that was trained using 1000’s of SafePlace photos and will detect these issues, alert the courier explaining the problem and ask them retake the photo. Initial trail results show a 98% success rate.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":9871,"primary":9873,"id":9826,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[9872],{},{"quoteText":9874,"quoteSource":9875},"We are always looking to leverage technology to support delivery accuracy and further improve the customer experience. Machine learning and AI is a gamechanger and our team is working on a number of exciting developments in this area.","Sam Greenwood, Innovation Engineer at Evri",{"id":9877,"uid":9878,"url":9879,"type":50,"href":9880,"tags":9881,"first_publication_date":9882,"last_publication_date":9883,"slugs":9884,"linked_documents":9886,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":9887,"data":9888},"YzWkdhAAACQABumL","the-most-heritage-rich-cities-across-england","\u002Fpress\u002Fthe-most-heritage-rich-cities-across-england","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YzWkdhAAACQABumL%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-09-29T15:19:47+0000","2025-02-13T13:38:17+0000",[9885],"map-reveals-the-most-heritage-rich-cities-across-england",[],[],{"title":9889,"category":8,"metaDescription":9890,"canonical":9891,"titleTag":9892,"featuredImage":9893,"publishedDate":9903,"slices":9904},"Map Reveals the Most Heritage-Rich Cities Across England","English cities have it all, but certain places appear to hold more heritage than others. Find out which in this article.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fthe-most-heritage-rich-cities-across-england","The most heritage rich cities in England | Evri",{"dimensions":9894,"alt":9895,"copyright":8,"url":9896,"id":9897,"edit":9898,"thumbnail":9899},{"width":65,"height":865},"An Evri courier walking down a driveway in a suburban neighbourhood carrying two parcels.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6tfuZbqstJ9-e5D_EVRI_LOCATION_05_5921.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6tfuZbqstJ9-e5D",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":9900,"alt":9895,"copyright":8,"url":9901,"id":9897,"edit":9902},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6tfuZbqstJ9-e5D_EVRI_LOCATION_05_5921.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2022-09-21",[9905,9957,9994],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":9906,"primary":9908,"id":9819,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[9907],{},{"content":9909},[9910,9913,9916,9919,9922,9925,9931,9934,9937,9940,9943,9946,9949,9952,9955],{"type":109,"text":9911,"spans":9912},"Data reveals dog breeds are inspiring road names across the UK",[],{"type":109,"text":9914,"spans":9915},"Larger dogs are more popular than smaller breeds and the Great Dane is the most popular breed",[],{"type":109,"text":9917,"spans":9918},"London, Liverpool and Leeds are home to the most dog inspired street names",[],{"type":109,"text":9920,"spans":9921},"Having a dog themed street name could increase property value by up to £32K",[],{"type":126,"text":9923,"spans":9924},"From inventors and entertainers to historic and religious buildings, English cities have it all, but certain places appear to hold more heritage than others. ",[],{"type":126,"text":9926,"spans":9927},"New research by the UK’s largest delivery service, Evri, has analysed the amount of heritage plaques in each city across the UK, and unsurprisingly London has come out on top.",[9928,9929],{"start":1671,"end":3009,"type":163},{"start":1671,"end":3009,"type":279,"data":9930},{"link_type":281,"url":348},{"type":126,"text":9932,"spans":9933},"The original blue plaque scheme started in the capital by English Heritage, placed plaques honouring the likes of actor, Charlie Chaplain, novelist, Charles Dickens and prime minister, Sir Winston Churchill.",[],{"type":126,"text":9935,"spans":9936},"Heritage plaques are dotted across the country, highlighting historical landmarks, yet, many people don’t know they may be living near a piece of history. ",[],{"type":126,"text":9938,"spans":9939},"Liverpool, Norwich and Leeds also score high for heritage taking the next top spots, with 735 plaques combined. ",[],{"type":126,"text":9941,"spans":9942},"In Liverpool you can find plaques for Titanic captain, Edward John Smith and the iconic English band, The Beatles. Whilst in Norwich, English prison reformer, Elizabeth Fry and author, Amelia Opie have been honoured.",[],{"type":126,"text":9944,"spans":9945},"The research also revealed that the south of England has the most heritage, with 2035 plaques in total, followed by the north with 1337 and then the midlands with 577 plaques honouring historical sites and people. ",[],{"type":126,"text":9947,"spans":9948},"Each city has their own official plaque scheme made from a variety of green, blue, stone and brown colours, and can generally be found mounted to walls and historic buildings. ",[],{"type":126,"text":9950,"spans":9951},"Some cities have specific heritage, with Cambridge known for its academia and home to various ground-breaking research, such as the discovery of DNA, and intellectuals, such as Charles Darwin.",[],{"type":126,"text":9953,"spans":9954},"Whilst York is known for its Viking and Romans heritage, with large numbers of plaques pinpointing historical archaeological sites, such as Stonegate, and the Roman Walls.",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":9956},[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":9958,"primary":9989,"id":9993,"slice_type":7457,"slice_label":8},[9959,9962,9965,9968,9971,9974,9977,9980,9983,9986],{"Col1Content":9960,"Col2Content":9961},"London (incl westminster)","987",{"Col1Content":9963,"Col2Content":9964},"Liverpool","295",{"Col1Content":9966,"Col2Content":9967},"Norwich","260",{"Col1Content":9969,"Col2Content":9970},"Leeds","180",{"Col1Content":9972,"Col2Content":9973},"Brighton + Hove","151",{"Col1Content":9975,"Col2Content":9976},"Coventry","142",{"Col1Content":9978,"Col2Content":9979},"York","135",{"Col1Content":9981,"Col2Content":9982},"Newcastle Upon Tyne","125",{"Col1Content":9984,"Col2Content":9985},"Wolverhampton","98",{"Col1Content":9987,"Col2Content":9988},"Birmingham","96",{"SectionTitle":9990,"SectionSubtitle":8,"Col1Header":9991,"Col2Header":9992,"TableFooter":8,"isTableShort":87},"The cities with the most heritage plaques:","City","No. of Plaques","information_table$16d39825-ef1e-417e-8996-0689cb543d32",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":9995,"primary":9997,"id":10005,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[9996],{},{"content":9998},[9999,10002],{"type":126,"text":407,"spans":10000},[10001],{"start":32,"end":3706,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":10003,"spans":10004},"The number of heritage plaques were taken from official sources of every city across the UK, such as civic society websites and city council websites. Where these sources weren’t available, plaques were taken from the website, Open Plaques, which lists every heritage plaque within the city postcode. Duplicates were then emitted and cities were ranked highest to lowest to reveal the ranking.",[],"rich_text$a4ce3657-506f-4d76-96b6-4ecc6c719864",{"id":10007,"uid":10008,"url":10009,"type":50,"href":10010,"tags":10011,"first_publication_date":10012,"last_publication_date":10013,"slugs":10014,"linked_documents":10015,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":10016,"data":10017},"YzWixxAAACQABuIO","evri-launches-collaboration-with-vinted","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-launches-collaboration-with-vinted","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YzWixxAAACQABuIO%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-09-29T13:57:35+0000","2025-02-13T13:33:12+0000",[10008],[],[],{"title":10018,"category":8,"metaDescription":10019,"canonical":10020,"titleTag":10021,"featuredImage":10022,"publishedDate":10032,"slices":10033},"Evri launches collaboration with Vinted","Evri has entered into a partnership with Vinted, the largest online consumer-to-consumer marketplace in Europe dedicated to second-hand fashion. Read more here.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-launches-collaboration-with-vinted","Evri launches collaboration with Vinted | Evri",{"dimensions":10023,"alt":10024,"copyright":8,"url":10025,"id":10026,"edit":10027,"thumbnail":10028},{"width":65,"height":865},"A customer is crouched on the floor of their apartment, placing a cardboard parcel inside waterproof packaging.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XscpbqstJ9-We0_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5276.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6XscpbqstJ9-We0",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":10029,"alt":10024,"copyright":8,"url":10030,"id":10026,"edit":10031},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XscpbqstJ9-We0_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5276.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2022-07-06",[10034,10045,10052],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10035,"primary":10037,"id":9819,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[10036],{},{"content":10038},[10039,10042],{"type":126,"text":10040,"spans":10041},"Evri, the consumer delivery specialist, has entered into a strategic partnership with Vinted, the largest online consumer-to-consumer marketplace in Europe dedicated to second-hand fashion. Evri has been a key delivery partner for the Vinted marketplace since 2018, during which time both organisations have experienced remarkable growth.",[],{"type":126,"text":10043,"spans":10044},"As part of the collaboration, a social media influencer programme will highlight the benefits of using Vinted and the convenience of sending parcels via Evri’s ParcelShops, with several well-known content creators across TikTok and Instagram working to create fun and engaging videos. This includes Ana* and Bryon* who have teamed up to complete a “Sell Out Challenge” to see who can sell the most from their wardrobes via Vinted. In addition, over 50 of Evri’s flagship ParcelShops will be co-branded with Vinted.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10046,"primary":10048,"id":10051,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[10047],{},{"quoteText":10049,"quoteSource":10050},"“Vinted is a phenomenal success story and we are proud to be one of its delivery partners. This latest collaboration showcases our dedication and scale in supporting both the Vinted marketplace and its members.”","Claire Phelan, Head of E-commerce Partnerships, Evri","quote$f7d0a67d-905b-4fa1-bc32-40fd281b48ec",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10053,"primary":10055,"id":10058,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[10054],{},{"quoteText":10056,"quoteSource":10057},"“We have seen a real growth in interest in second-hand fashion, particularly over the past few years, with members helping to extend the life cycle of clothes that have already been produced, whilst benefiting from saving money and making some extra cash. This is reflected in our growing member base, which has over 65 million registered members globally, and more than 3 million in the UK.”","Natacha Blanchard, Consumer PR Lead, Vinted","quote$87261dca-c5ff-4958-808f-b86014e0a623",{"id":10060,"uid":10061,"url":10062,"type":50,"href":10063,"tags":10064,"first_publication_date":10065,"last_publication_date":10066,"slugs":10067,"linked_documents":10069,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":10070,"data":10071},"YzMbSBAAACQA-7Jg","evri-pledges-150k-to-support-smes","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-pledges-150k-to-support-smes","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YzMbSBAAACQA-7Jg%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-09-27T15:54:46+0000","2025-02-13T13:37:23+0000",[10068],"evri-pledges-another-150k-to-support-smes-using-its-apprenticehsip-levy-funding",[],[],{"title":10072,"category":8,"metaDescription":10073,"canonical":10074,"titleTag":10075,"featuredImage":10076,"publishedDate":10086,"slices":10087},"Evri pledges another £150k to support SME's using its apprenticehsip levy funding","Evri, one of the UK’s leading consumer delivery companies, has pledged over £150k of its apprenticeship levy funds to help support SMEs for the second year running.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-pledges-150k-to-support-smes","Evri pledges £150k to support SME's | Evri",{"dimensions":10077,"alt":10078,"copyright":8,"url":10079,"id":10080,"edit":10081,"thumbnail":10082},{"width":65,"height":865},"Customer inside a ParcelShop store, handing multiple parcels to store assistant, ready to be collected by Evri","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6R2JJbqstJ9-SPf_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2548.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6R2JJbqstJ9-SPf",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":10083,"alt":10078,"copyright":8,"url":10084,"id":10080,"edit":10085},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6R2JJbqstJ9-SPf_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2548.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2022-07-14",[10088,10105],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10089,"primary":10091,"id":9819,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[10090],{},{"content":10092},[10093,10096,10099,10102],{"type":126,"text":10094,"spans":10095},"Evri, one of the UK’s leading consumer delivery companies, has pledged over £150k of its apprenticeship levy funds to help support SMEs for the second year running. This will enable other companies to take on new apprentices or upskill existing ones, providing a valuable boost for their businesses as they experience rising costs. ",[],{"type":126,"text":10097,"spans":10098},"This follows the pledge the business made last year, which supported over 19 employers and 23 learners including dental nurses, adult care workers and assistant accountants.",[],{"type":126,"text":10100,"spans":10101},"To help identify suitable companies and ensure the funds are being spent efficiently, helping those that will benefit most, Evri is working closely with West Midlands Combined Authority and Total People, one of the largest providers of apprenticeships and work-based learning in the North-West of England. ",[],{"type":126,"text":10103,"spans":10104},"In addition, businesses can see any pledges on a public website and apply for funding to pay for 100% of their apprenticeship training and assessment costs (up to the funding band maximum).",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10106,"primary":10108,"id":10051,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[10107],{},{"quoteText":10109,"quoteSource":10110},"“At Evri, we are fortunate to already have strong apprenticeship and training schemes in place, so we have taken the decision to gift some of our levy to SMEs that will benefit from it. The last few years have presented many challenges for all businesses, but particularly SMEs, so we’re proud to be able to support them in training their future workforces and providing their employees with increased lifelong earning potential.”","Martijn de Lange CEO, Evri",{"id":10112,"uid":10113,"url":10114,"type":50,"href":10115,"tags":10116,"first_publication_date":10117,"last_publication_date":10118,"slugs":10119,"linked_documents":10121,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":10122,"data":10123},"YzLToBAAACEA-neP","most-popular-dog-breed-street-names","\u002Fpress\u002Fmost-popular-dog-breed-street-names","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YzLToBAAACEA-neP%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-09-27T11:23:59+0000","2025-02-13T13:26:04+0000",[10120],"the-most-popular-dog-breed-inspired-street-names-revealed",[],[],{"title":10124,"category":8,"metaDescription":10125,"canonical":10126,"titleTag":10127,"featuredImage":10128,"publishedDate":10134,"slices":10135},"The Most Popular Dog Breed-Inspired Street Names Revealed","With over 2 million streets across the UK, there’s plenty of quirky names out there, but did you know that dog breeds are a popular theme? Find out more here","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fmost-popular-dog-breed-street-names","Most popular dog breed street names | Evri",{"dimensions":10129,"alt":7264,"copyright":8,"url":7265,"id":7266,"edit":10130,"thumbnail":10131},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":10132,"alt":7264,"copyright":8,"url":7270,"id":7266,"edit":10133},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2022-09-15",[10136,10172,10207,10227,10256],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10137,"primary":10139,"id":9819,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[10138],{},{"content":10140},[10141,10143,10145,10147,10149,10152,10155,10161,10164,10167,10170],{"type":109,"text":9911,"spans":10142},[],{"type":109,"text":9914,"spans":10144},[],{"type":109,"text":9917,"spans":10146},[],{"type":109,"text":9920,"spans":10148},[],{"type":126,"text":10150,"spans":10151},"With over 2 million streets across the UK, there’s plenty of quirky and obscure names out there, but did you know that dog breeds are a popular theme? ",[],{"type":126,"text":10153,"spans":10154},"In fact, recent data has shown there are over 660 dog-breed inspired street names, with everything from Cavalier Close to Dane Road, across England and Wales.  ",[],{"type":126,"text":10156,"spans":10157},"However, a new study, undertaken by the UK’s biggest dedicated delivery company, Evri, has revealed which breeds are the most popular for street name inspiration.  ",[10158,10159],{"start":4437,"end":497,"type":163},{"start":4437,"end":497,"type":279,"data":10160},{"link_type":281,"url":348},{"type":126,"text":10162,"spans":10163},"Analysing the Kennel Club’s 50 dog breeds, with everything from Cocker Spaniels to Labradors, the results have shown the Great Dane takes top spot. ",[],{"type":126,"text":10165,"spans":10166},"From Dane Bank, Dane Close and Dane Common there are 457 street names all related to the German breed!",[],{"type":126,"text":10168,"spans":10169},"Unsurprisingly, the classic English breeds, Cavalier King Charles Spaniels and Cocker Spaniels, are also popular. From Cavalier Green and Cavalier Grove to Cocker Road and Cocker Square, these breeds have taken second and third place in the overall ranking.",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":10171},[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10173,"primary":10203,"id":9993,"slice_type":7457,"slice_label":8},[10174,10177,10180,10183,10186,10189,10192,10195,10198,10200],{"Col1Content":10175,"Col2Content":10176},"Great Dane","457",{"Col1Content":10178,"Col2Content":10179},"Cavalier King Charles Spaniel","49",{"Col1Content":10181,"Col2Content":10182},"Cocker Spaniel","48",{"Col1Content":10184,"Col2Content":10185},"Beagle","26",{"Col1Content":10187,"Col2Content":10188},"Newfoundland","13",{"Col1Content":10190,"Col2Content":10191},"Pointer","11",{"Col1Content":10193,"Col2Content":10194},"Brittany","10",{"Col1Content":10196,"Col2Content":10197},"Boxer","7",{"Col1Content":10199,"Col2Content":10197},"Bulldog",{"Col1Content":10201,"Col2Content":10202},"Labrador","6",{"SectionTitle":10204,"SectionSubtitle":8,"Col1Header":10205,"Col2Header":10206,"TableFooter":8,"isTableShort":87},"The top 10 dog breeds influencing street names","Breed","Number of Streets",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10208,"primary":10210,"id":10005,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[10209],{},{"content":10211},[10212,10215,10218,10221,10224],{"type":126,"text":10213,"spans":10214},"Interestingly, larger breeds seem to be more favourable, with six of the top ten street names belonging to medium and large dogs. ",[],{"type":126,"text":10216,"spans":10217},"Half of the top ten breeds originate from England too, making these streets even more patriotic. ",[],{"type":126,"text":10219,"spans":10220},"With dog breeds being popular, the study also looked at general dog-themed street names, such as those including bark, kibble and woof. The research found that the canine theme featured in some areas more than others.",[],{"type":126,"text":10222,"spans":10223},"London, Liverpool and Leeds are home to the most dog-inspired street names, with the capital alone having 40 streets with a canine theme.",[],{"type":126,"text":10225,"spans":10226},"Other areas with a love for dog names include northern cities York, Sheffield and Manchester, having 41 streets combined.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10228,"primary":10251,"id":10255,"slice_type":7457,"slice_label":8},[10229,10232,10233,10235,10237,10239,10242,10244,10246,10248],{"Col1Content":10230,"Col2Content":10231},"London","40",{"Col1Content":9963,"Col2Content":10185},{"Col1Content":9969,"Col2Content":10234},"23",{"Col1Content":9978,"Col2Content":10236},"15",{"Col1Content":10238,"Col2Content":7433},"Sheffield",{"Col1Content":10240,"Col2Content":10241},"Manchester","12",{"Col1Content":10243,"Col2Content":10241},"Margate",{"Col1Content":10245,"Col2Content":10191},"Wakefield",{"Col1Content":10247,"Col2Content":10191},"Barnsley",{"Col1Content":10249,"Col2Content":10250},"Leicester","9",{"SectionTitle":10252,"SectionSubtitle":8,"Col1Header":10253,"Col2Header":10254,"TableFooter":8,"isTableShort":87},"The areas with the most dog themed street names:","Area","Number of Dog Themed Streets","information_table$905da597-556a-472a-9e84-464d70138b5f",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10257,"primary":10259,"id":10272,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[10258],{},{"content":10260},[10261,10264,10267,10270],{"type":126,"text":10262,"spans":10263},"Dog themed streets are not only cute, but they could also increase your property value, according to recent research by SaveOnEnergy.",[],{"type":126,"text":10265,"spans":10266},"The energy comparison site revealed that dog themed street names could add a whopping additional £32,000 to your home.",[],{"type":126,"text":10268,"spans":10269},"So, if you’re looking to buy or sell a new house, it might be worth noting if your street is related a pooch.",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":10271},[],"rich_text$13b67627-cf81-4d4d-9bf7-c6bc92b748d7",{"id":10274,"uid":10275,"url":10276,"type":50,"href":10277,"tags":10278,"first_publication_date":10279,"last_publication_date":10280,"slugs":10281,"linked_documents":10283,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":10284,"data":10285},"YzLQYRAAACMA-mnr","evri-opens-new-gatwick-depot","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-opens-new-gatwick-depot","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YzLQYRAAACMA-mnr%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-09-27T10:39:28+0000","2025-02-20T16:04:20+0000",[10282],"evri-opens-new-gatwick-depot-and-donates-2k-to-support-local-charity",[],[],{"title":10286,"category":8,"metaDescription":10287,"canonical":10288,"titleTag":10289,"featuredImage":10290,"publishedDate":10300,"slices":10301},"Evri opens new Gatwick depot and donates 2k to support local charity","Evri announcies the opening of a new Gatwick depot and donates £2000 to support local charity St Catherine’s Hospice","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-opens-new-gatwick-depot","Evri opens new Gatwick depot | Evri",{"dimensions":10291,"alt":10292,"copyright":8,"url":10293,"id":10294,"edit":10295,"thumbnail":10296},{"width":65,"height":865},"An Evri Courier is scanning the barcode of a single parcel as he approaches the doorstep of a home in a residential area. He is there to make a delivery.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ69xSZbqstJ9-pUv_EVRI_LOCATION_01_0151.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z69xSZbqstJ9-pUv",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":10297,"alt":10292,"copyright":8,"url":10298,"id":10294,"edit":10299},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ69xSZbqstJ9-pUv_EVRI_LOCATION_01_0151.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2022-04-04",[10302,10318,10324,10334,10341],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10303,"primary":10305,"id":9819,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[10304],{},{"content":10306},[10307,10310,10313,10316],{"type":126,"text":10308,"spans":10309},"Evri (formerly Hermes UK), the UK’s largest dedicated parcel company has donated 2K to St Catherine’s Hospice to support the local community following the opening of its new 81,671sq ft distribution depot near Gatwick airport at Manor Royal, Crawley.",[],{"type":126,"text":10311,"spans":10312},"Prior to opening, the site had been put to good use, supporting Vodaphone with a photography project. Vodaphone needed a new clean and modern distribution centre, and their new Gatwick site was perfect.",[],{"type":126,"text":10314,"spans":10315}," As part of this support Evri received 2K location fee which they have donated to St Catherine’s Hospice who provide expert care for terminally ill people in Sussex and East Surrey, when and where they need it most.",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":10317},[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10319,"primary":10321,"id":10051,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[10320],{},{"quoteText":10322,"quoteSource":10323},"“ We aspire to a world where everyone can face death informed, supported and pain free. Last year we helped over 2000 people, we try and create caring, friendly and happy atmosphere in very difficult circumstances. This care and support is only possibly through generous donations such as this.”","St. Catherines Hospice Spokesperson",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10325,"primary":10327,"id":10333,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[10326],{},{"content":10328},[10329,10331],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":10330},[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":10332},[],"rich_text$bfd223f1-8042-4747-a022-79fb2ddd75e1",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10335,"primary":10337,"id":10340,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[10336],{},{"quoteText":10338,"quoteSource":10339},"“ Of course we’re incredibly excited to be opening our new facility, we’ll be able to handle 200k parcels each day, double our previous capacity. We're also really pleased to be able to support the local community and donate to this crucial cause, a short distance from our site.\"","Evri Spokesperson","quote$027c9daf-0941-4cdc-823f-d38cc9752e01",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10342,"primary":10344,"id":10351,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[10343],{},{"content":10345},[10346,10348],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":10347},[],{"type":126,"text":10349,"spans":10350},"As well as the increased capacity, the new depot comes complete with EV charging as Evri now has 30% electric vehicle ParcelShop fleet, LED lighting on sensors throughout, rainwater harvesting, low carbon heating, solar panels and is built to BREEAM ‘Excellent’ certified specifications.  ",[],"rich_text$00aab380-4b23-4b00-af6c-c5dc7cdde90d",{"id":10353,"uid":10354,"url":10355,"type":50,"href":10356,"tags":10357,"first_publication_date":10358,"last_publication_date":10359,"slugs":10360,"linked_documents":10361,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":10362,"data":10363},"YzLNthAAACMA-l3j","evri-appoints-chief-product-officer","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-appoints-chief-product-officer","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YzLNthAAACMA-l3j%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-09-27T10:26:24+0000","2025-02-13T13:15:50+0000",[10354],[],[],{"title":10364,"category":8,"metaDescription":10365,"canonical":10366,"titleTag":10367,"featuredImage":10368,"publishedDate":10379,"slices":10380},"Evri appoints chief product officer","Wvri the leading consumer delivery specialist, has appointed a Chief Product Officer as part of its continuing investment in product development and customer service","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-appoints-chief-product-officer","Evri appoints chief product officer | Evri - The New Hermes",{"dimensions":10369,"alt":10370,"copyright":8,"url":10371,"id":10372,"edit":10373,"thumbnail":10374},{"width":65,"height":865},"A handful of parcels are being handed to a recipient at the door. A blue Evri van can be seen in the background.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6y-GZbqstJ9-iJx_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9216.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,7327,4885&w=960&h=640","Z6y-GZbqstJ9-iJx",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":10375,"alt":10370,"copyright":8,"url":10376,"id":10372,"edit":10377},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6y-GZbqstJ9-iJx_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9216.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,707,7327,3473&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":10378,"zoom":33,"background":71},707,"2022-06-03",[10381,10397,10403],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10382,"primary":10384,"id":9819,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[10383],{},{"content":10385},[10386,10389,10392,10395],{"type":126,"text":10387,"spans":10388},"Evri (formerly Hermes), the leading consumer delivery specialist, has appointed a Chief Product Officer as part of its continuing investment in product development, customer experience and digital innovation. ",[],{"type":126,"text":10390,"spans":10391},"Joe Tarragano will join the Evri executive committee, bringing with him over 25 years of digital experience at organisations including eBay, Dun & Bradstreet and Thomson Reuters. He has provided consultancy to leading retailers such as Argos, Sports Direct and Debenhams on eCommerce best practices and is also the founder of two start-ups. Most recently, Joe led all the customer product activity at GSK, spanning 70 markets globally, as part of its digital transformation initiatives. ",[],{"type":126,"text":10393,"spans":10394},"In his new role, Joe will be responsible for ensuring that the company’s technology initiatives continue to support the needs of its different stakeholders and continue to rapidly innovate premium services that are both cost-effective and environmentally responsible.",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":10396},[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10398,"primary":10400,"id":10051,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[10399],{},{"quoteText":10401,"quoteSource":10402},"“Evri has experienced tremendous growth and is hugely successful for its stakeholders, demonstrating real innovation. Its scale and its importance to the way we all now shop means it has a huge impact on consumers and this also comes with an important environmental responsibility. Being part of its continuing digital transformation is hugely exciting for me.”","Joe Tarragano, Chief Product Officer, Evri",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10404,"primary":10406,"id":10340,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[10405],{},{"quoteText":10407,"quoteSource":10408},"“The demand for on-line shopping is here to stay with recent research from YouGov finding that 45% of people prefer to buy things online and more than two thirds saying that online shopping makes their life easier. We continue to experience strong growth and is absolutely vital that we have the best people in place to ensure we can continue to be able to meet the needs of ‘Evri’ customer.  Joe’s appointment to our senior team will further support this.”","Martijn de Lange, CEO, Evri,",{"id":10410,"uid":10411,"url":10412,"type":50,"href":10413,"tags":10414,"first_publication_date":10415,"last_publication_date":10416,"slugs":10417,"linked_documents":10419,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":10420,"data":10421},"YzK2URAAACEA-fUd","evri-commits-to-provide-manadatory-esg-training","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-commits-to-provide-manadatory-esg-training","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YzK2URAAACEA-fUd%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-09-27T08:52:07+0000","2025-02-13T13:28:43+0000",[10418],"evri-commits-to-provide-manadatory-esg-training-for-all-employees--contractors-by-2024",[],[],{"title":10422,"category":8,"metaDescription":10423,"canonical":10424,"titleTag":10425,"featuredImage":10426,"publishedDate":10436,"slices":10437},"Evri commits to provide manadatory ESG training for all employees & contractors by 2024","Evri, the consumer delivery specialist, has committed to providing mandatory ESG Training for all employees and contractors by 2024. Read more here.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-commits-to-provide-manadatory-esg-training","Evri commits to provide ESG training | Evri - The New Hermes",{"dimensions":10427,"alt":10428,"copyright":8,"url":10429,"id":10430,"edit":10431,"thumbnail":10432},{"width":65,"height":865},"A customer sat in a wheelchair is outside their front door smiling as the courier hands a parcel to them. The courier is taking a photo of the parcel being received as proof of delivery.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XpK5bqstJ9-Wam_EVRI_LOCATION_01_0288.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6XpK5bqstJ9-Wam",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":10433,"alt":10428,"copyright":8,"url":10434,"id":10430,"edit":10435},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XpK5bqstJ9-Wam_EVRI_LOCATION_01_0288.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2022-07-19",[10438,10454],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10439,"primary":10441,"id":9819,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[10440],{},{"content":10442},[10443,10446,10449,10452],{"type":126,"text":10444,"spans":10445},"Evri, the consumer delivery specialist, has committed to providing mandatory ESG Training for all employees and contractors by 2024, as it continues its journey to becoming an even more ethical and sustainable business. ",[],{"type":126,"text":10447,"spans":10448},"Forming part of the company’s comprehensive and ambitious ESG strategy, the training is designed to highlight the importance of ESG, and to encourage employees to consider environmental and social implications during their day to day roles.  It is being rolled out across the whole company and will be mandatory for all 7,128 employees and 20k plus contractors.  In order to ensure full access, everyone involved has been given a dedicated email address, including all couriers and warehouse operatives.”",[],{"type":126,"text":10450,"spans":10451},"The company’s dedicated Digital Learning Designer and Digital Learning Manager have worked closely with the ESG team to create the training and will be responsible for the roll-out across the company.  The training will focus on Evri's ESG performance and future ESG targets. The aim is that upon completion, employees should feel comfortable talking about the ethos of ESG within the company.",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":10453},[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10455,"primary":10457,"id":10051,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[10456],{},{"quoteText":10458,"quoteSource":10110},"“Following a period of exceptional growth for the business, it’s never been more important to recognise our impact on the planet and its people. While we have always been a responsible carrier, the last 12 months have seen a significant gear change in our efforts to become an even more ethical and sustainable business. \n\n“To underline our commitment, ESG forms two of the four core pillars that underpin our new brand: Community and ESG itself. With a dedicated team and a bold new vision in place, Evri is in a strong ESG leadership position as the next chapter for our business begins.”",{"id":10460,"uid":10461,"url":10462,"type":50,"href":10463,"tags":10464,"first_publication_date":10465,"last_publication_date":10466,"slugs":10467,"linked_documents":10469,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":10470,"data":10471},"YzGgiRAAACIA9RCb","evri-to-relocate-depot-to-larger-site-in-bury","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-to-relocate-depot-to-larger-site-in-bury","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YzGgiRAAACIA9RCb%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-09-26T12:56:52+0000","2025-02-13T13:41:15+0000",[10468],"evri-to-relocate-depot-to-larger-site-in-bury-st-edmunds-to-support-operational-growth-strategy",[],[],{"title":10472,"category":8,"metaDescription":10473,"canonical":10474,"titleTag":10475,"featuredImage":10476,"publishedDate":10482,"slices":10483},"Evri to relocate depot to larger site in Bury St Edmunds to support operational growth strategy","Read all about Evri's larger site in Bury St Edmunds. The new 77,000 sq ft site is on the Suffolk Logistics Park, a preferred geographical location to enable Evri to better serve the local area.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-to-relocate-depot-to-larger-site-in-bury","Evri to relocate depot to larger site in Bury St Edmunds to support operational growth strategy | Evri - The New Hermes",{"dimensions":10477,"alt":9895,"copyright":8,"url":9896,"id":9897,"edit":10478,"thumbnail":10479},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":10480,"alt":9895,"copyright":8,"url":9901,"id":9897,"edit":10481},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2022-09-26",[10484,10498,10505],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10485,"primary":10487,"id":9819,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[10486],{},{"content":10488},[10489,10492,10495],{"type":126,"text":10490,"spans":10491},"Evri (formerly Hermes UK) the leading consumer delivery company, is relocating their Newmarket depot to a site in Bury St Edmunds, creating over 50 new jobs in the area. It forms part of the company’s commitment to continuing to invest in its infrastructure to ensure it is able to support the growth of online shopping. The new facility will be operational later this month.",[],{"type":126,"text":10493,"spans":10494},"The new 77,000 sq ft site is on the Suffolk Logistics Park, a preferred geographical location to enable Evri to better serve the local area. The depot is double the size of the Newmarket location providing an increase in capacity from 120,000 to 180,000 per day, to support the business’ expansion strategy.  Evri have worked with the developer from the initial design stage allowing them to create a purpose-built warehouse that meets all of their operational requirements.  ",[],{"type":126,"text":10496,"spans":10497},"To support Evri’s ESG commitments the new depot comes complete with an EPC A rating and is built to BREEAM ‘Excellent’ certified specifications.  The new jobs at the location include warehouse operatives, van drivers, HGV drivers and a number of management roles. 95% of existing permanent workers will move to the new site.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10499,"primary":10501,"id":10504,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[10500],{},{"quoteText":10502,"quoteSource":10503},"We are extremely excited to be opening our new depot in Bury St Edmunds. The site will allow us to process more efficiently and provide the team with an outstanding work environment. This exciting new depot will also provide new jobs into the surrounding Bury St Edmunds area in addition to moving the vast majority of our existing staff across from Newmarket.","Nora Kiss-Burrows, Depot General Manager at the new Bury St Edmunds site","quote$82da9713-6100-4223-bf77-d4f0c2687012",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10506,"primary":10508,"id":10517,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[10507],{},{"content":10509},[10510],{"type":126,"text":10511,"spans":10512},"Apply at: evricareer.com",[10513,10514],{"start":254,"end":1075,"type":163},{"start":254,"end":1075,"type":279,"data":10515},{"link_type":281,"url":10516},"press.html\u002F\u002Fevricareer.com\u002FCareers\u002F2022%20Multipage%20Microsite-1995?SiteID=3680","rich_text$fc471840-2cb0-4d59-9eef-a370cdd8fbc0",{"id":10519,"uid":10520,"url":10521,"type":50,"href":10522,"tags":10523,"first_publication_date":10524,"last_publication_date":10525,"slugs":10526,"linked_documents":10527,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":10528,"data":10529},"YzGfPBAAACQA9Qqt","evri-opens-largest-distribution-hub-in-europe","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-opens-largest-distribution-hub-in-europe","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YzGfPBAAACQA9Qqt%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-09-26T12:46:54+0000","2025-02-13T13:45:15+0000",[10520],[],[],{"title":10530,"category":8,"metaDescription":10531,"canonical":10532,"titleTag":10533,"featuredImage":10534,"publishedDate":10540,"slices":10541},"Evri opens largest distribution hub in Europe","Read all about Evri's new distribution hub in Barnsley .The 340,000 square foot facility has the capacity to process up to 1.1 million parcels every day and will increase the company’s overall parcel processing capacity to 4.2 million a day.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-opens-largest-distribution-hub-in-europe","Evri opens largest distribution hub in Europe | Evri",{"dimensions":10535,"alt":7332,"copyright":8,"url":7333,"id":7334,"edit":10536,"thumbnail":10537},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":10538,"alt":7332,"copyright":8,"url":7338,"id":7334,"edit":10539},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2022-09-23",[10542,10559,10564],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10543,"primary":10545,"id":9819,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[10544],{},{"content":10546},[10547,10550,10553,10556],{"type":126,"text":10548,"spans":10549},"Evri (formerly Hermes UK), the consumer delivery specialist, has today opened its new automated parcel distribution hub, the largest of its kind in Europe which represents a £60 million investment in Barnsley, near Sheffield. ",[],{"type":126,"text":10551,"spans":10552},"The hub is creating around 1,400 new jobs in the area. Over 800 full time roles have been recruited, including 12 apprentices in partnership with Barnsley College, in addition, 600 temporary and part time roles will be available to support during busy periods for those looking for more flexible employment. Over 80% of operatives have been recruited from the local area. The £60 million development is located in Barnsley, near Sheffield.",[],{"type":126,"text":10554,"spans":10555},"The 340,000 square foot facility has the capacity to process up to 1.1 million parcels every day and will increase the company’s overall parcel processing capacity to 4.2 million a day. It is strategically located near the motorway, close to a number of Evri’s retail customers’ distribution sites meaning that later cut off times for collections will be provided.",[],{"type":126,"text":10557,"spans":10558},"As part of its ESG (Environmental, Social and Governance) commitment Evri has also confirmed that by early 2023, over 50% of the vehicles operating from the site will utilise bio CNG (compressed natural gas) that reduces carbon emissions by over 80% compared to diesel.  Other eco initiatives include natural grassed acoustic bunds to absorb the small amounts of noise between the site and residential dwellings, a balancing pond, a biodiversity area and over 25,000 plants, trees and hedgerows that will be planted. The building itself will include solar panels on the roof and a rainwater-harvesting system. Earlier this month, Evri was recognised for its work in this area and won ‘Best Environmental Practice’ at the Green World Awards.",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10560,"primary":10562,"id":10504,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[10561],{},{"quoteText":10563,"quoteSource":147},"This development showcases our commitment to responding to the ever-increasing demand for online shopping and yet provide a service that doesn’t cost the earth. Our continued investment to strengthen our network and infrastructure across the UK is laying the foundations for future growth, creating more employment opportunities and confirming our position as an industry leader.",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10565,"primary":10567,"id":10570,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[10566],{},{"quoteText":10568,"quoteSource":10569},"We are delighted to see the positive figures on recruitment for the new Evri site here in Barnsley. Our commitment has been to create more and better jobs in the borough, and it’s great to see local people benefitting from new job opportunities in a range of roles.\n\nIt is also a key benefit from such a significant investment, like the Evri site, that we will attract new people and businesses to the area to enjoy all that Barnsley has to offer. \n\n“Barnsley is investing so businesses, and jobs, stay in Barnsley. Having a job is more than just income. It’s about having a purpose and motivation, supporting good health and having a sense of pride and belonging. We are committed to giving people these opportunities. I know many people will be excited about starting their new roles, and I wish all staff at Evri every success at the new Barnsley hub.”","Barnsley Council Spokesperson, local councillor and Chair of the Ward Alliance, Nicola Sumner","quote$dddbb0ad-115f-4441-b19d-13178a0740c6",[10572,10632,10681,10773,10815,10877,10946,11005,11050,11096,11168,11228],{"id":10573,"uid":10574,"url":10575,"type":50,"href":10576,"tags":10577,"first_publication_date":10578,"last_publication_date":10579,"slugs":10580,"linked_documents":10581,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":10582,"data":10583},"YwSz5xAAACIAVuIX","evri-appoints-chief-data-officer","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-appoints-chief-data-officer","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YwSz5xAAACIAVuIX%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-08-23T11:09:15+0000","2025-02-13T13:27:32+0000",[10574],[],[],{"title":10584,"category":8,"metaDescription":10585,"canonical":10586,"titleTag":10587,"featuredImage":10588,"publishedDate":10598,"slices":10599},"Evri appoints Chief Data Officer","Read all about how Evri have appointed a Chief Data Officer, a new role designed to support the company’s continuing growth and ensure that it is leveraging its data assets to maximise operational and delivery performance.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-appoints-chief-data-officer","Evri appoints Chief Data Officer | Evri - The New Hermes",{"dimensions":10589,"alt":10590,"copyright":8,"url":10591,"id":10592,"edit":10593,"thumbnail":10594},{"width":65,"height":865},"A customer sat on a sofa, holding their tablet and looking at their screen. The display shows the customer is reading about our three easy ways to return a parcel","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XqX5bqstJ9-WcC_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5657.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6XqX5bqstJ9-WcC",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":10595,"alt":10590,"copyright":8,"url":10596,"id":10592,"edit":10597},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XqX5bqstJ9-WcC_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5657.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2022-08-05",[10600,10612,10619,10625],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10601,"primary":10603,"id":10611,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[10602],{},{"content":10604},[10605,10608],{"type":126,"text":10606,"spans":10607},"Evri, formerly Hermes, has appointed a Chief Data Officer, a new role designed to support the company’s continuing growth and ensure that it is leveraging its data assets to maximise operational and delivery performance. ",[],{"type":126,"text":10609,"spans":10610},"Harvinder Atwal joins the business from MoneySuperMarket where he was Chief Data Scientist and was responsible for integrating advanced analytics and machine learning to deliver a sophisticated and personalised customer experience. Prior to this he worked for Dunnhumby where he was Insight Director for the Tesco Clubcard Development. In his new role Harvinder will be focusing on developing a best practice data strategy for the business, setting a vision for data for the next 3-5 years. This will include ensuring the business continues to operate to the highest standard of data compliance and security.",[],"rich_text$4ae365a9-14f5-40c0-b869-92664b53a94c",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10613,"primary":10615,"id":10618,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[10614],{},{"quoteText":10616,"quoteSource":10617},"I was attracted to this role because of the scale of the business, its strong growth trajectory and the dynamism of the sector. My background is in operational research and using data algorithms to improve performance and I am excited to be using my skills to support Evri on its ongoing Transformation journey","Harvinder Atwal, commenting on his new role","quote$7fe8b3c5-031e-4f13-8227-361b16d9307e",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10620,"primary":10622,"id":10624,"slice_type":558,"slice_label":8},[10621],{},{"SectionHeader":8,"SectionText":10623},[],"section_component$99897d66-0226-43f8-882d-4adc93ada317",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10626,"primary":10628,"id":10631,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[10627],{},{"quoteText":10629,"quoteSource":10630},"This is a key area of our business and it’s important that we have the right calibre of person in place. Harvinder is talented and experienced and we are confident will be a great asset to our team.","Fash Sawyerr, Chief Transformations Officer at Evri","quote$20d9443e-ba05-4c51-8a62-dec72852d4fe",{"id":10633,"uid":10634,"url":10635,"type":50,"href":10636,"tags":10637,"first_publication_date":10638,"last_publication_date":10639,"slugs":10640,"linked_documents":10642,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":10643,"data":10644},"YtqZaREAACMA4sDZ","evri-pledges-150k-apprenticeship-levy-funding","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-pledges-150k-apprenticeship-levy-funding","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YtqZaREAACMA4sDZ%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-07-22T12:38:30+0000","2025-02-13T13:43:55+0000",[10641],"evri-pledges-another-150k-to-support-smes-using-its-apprenticeship-levy-funding",[],[],{"title":10645,"category":8,"metaDescription":10646,"canonical":10647,"titleTag":10648,"featuredImage":10649,"publishedDate":10660,"slices":10661},"Evri pledges another £150k to support SMES using its apprenticeship levy funding","Read all about how Evri, one of the UK’s leading consumer delivery companies, has pledged over £150k of its apprenticeship levy funds to help support SMEs for the second year running.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-pledges-150k-apprenticeship-levy-funding","Evri pledges another £150k to support SMES using its apprenticeship levy funding | Evri - The New Hermes",{"dimensions":10650,"alt":10651,"copyright":8,"url":10652,"id":10653,"edit":10654,"thumbnail":10655},{"width":65,"height":865},"Customer carrying multiple parcels inside a ParcelShop store, ready to drop off for delivery","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6R1D5bqstJ9-SOx_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2468.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,6762,4508&w=960&h=640","Z6R1D5bqstJ9-SOx",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":10656,"alt":10651,"copyright":8,"url":10657,"id":10653,"edit":10658},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6R1D5bqstJ9-SOx_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2468.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,653,6762,3205&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":10659,"zoom":33,"background":71},653,"2022-07-29",[10662,10675],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10663,"primary":10665,"id":10611,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[10664],{},{"content":10666},[10667,10669,10671,10673],{"type":126,"text":10094,"spans":10668},[],{"type":126,"text":10097,"spans":10670},[],{"type":126,"text":10100,"spans":10672},[],{"type":126,"text":10103,"spans":10674},[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10676,"primary":10678,"id":10618,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[10677],{},{"quoteText":10679,"quoteSource":10680},"At Evri, we are fortunate to already have strong apprenticeship and training schemes in place, so we have taken the decision to gift some of our levy to SMEs that will benefit from it. The last few years have presented many challenges for all businesses, but particularly SMEs, so we’re proud to be able to support them in training their future workforces and providing their employees with increased lifelong earning potential.","Martijn de Lange, CEO at Evri UK",{"id":10682,"uid":10683,"url":10684,"type":50,"href":10685,"tags":10686,"first_publication_date":10687,"last_publication_date":10688,"slugs":10689,"linked_documents":10691,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":10692,"data":10693},"Ys7B9xAAACAAXHGc","evri-start-trial-with-zedify","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-start-trial-with-zedify","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22Ys7B9xAAACAAXHGc%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-07-13T13:00:55+0000","2025-02-13T13:20:39+0000",[10690],"evri-start-trial-with-zedify-in-bristol-to-support-sustainable-last-mile-delivery-solution",[],[],{"title":10694,"category":8,"metaDescription":10695,"canonical":10696,"titleTag":10697,"featuredImage":10698,"publishedDate":10708,"slices":10709},"Evri start trial with Zedify (In Bristol) to support sustainable last mile delivery solution","Evri is trialling a delivery solution with sustainable last mile innovators, Zedify as part of the company's sustainable last mile delivery strategy.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-start-trial-with-zedify","Evri start trial with Zedify (In Bristol) to support sustainable last mile delivery solution | Evri - The New Hermes",{"dimensions":10699,"alt":10700,"copyright":8,"url":10701,"id":10702,"edit":10703,"thumbnail":10704},{"width":65,"height":865},"An Evri Courier delivering multiple parcels to a block of flats, pressing the buzzer to notify the recipient","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDapbqstJ9-cfL_EVRI_LOCATION_04_3627.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6pDapbqstJ9-cfL",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":10705,"alt":10700,"copyright":8,"url":10706,"id":10702,"edit":10707},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDapbqstJ9-cfL_EVRI_LOCATION_04_3627.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2022-06-22",[10710,10725,10732,10738,10745],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10711,"primary":10713,"id":10724,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[10712],{},{"content":10714},[10715,10718,10721],{"type":126,"text":10716,"spans":10717},"Evri, the leading consumer delivery company, is trialling a delivery solution with sustainable last mile innovators, Zedify, using pedal-powered electric vehicles such as cargo bikes, as part of the company’s sustainable last mile delivery strategy. The trial is taking place in Bristol to explore the impact on efficiency and carbon emissions, as well as the effect on reducing congestion and creating quieter, safer streets and more liveable cities.",[],{"type":126,"text":10719,"spans":10720},"Early data from the trial shows a 13% increase in efficiency, plus a 98% reduction in carbon in the final mile when delivered by bike compared to a traditional van delivery, aided by an increase in volume. The estimated carbon saving figure in the final mile would be 62kg co2e per week.",[],{"type":126,"text":10722,"spans":10723},"Zedify is one of the sustainable delivery models that Evri is partnering with to support its commitment to becoming the UK’s most sustainable delivery business. Last year, the company teamed up with vehicle manufacturing giant Ford, to pilot a sustainable courier service in central London designed to support cleaner air and clearer roads through a unique set-up of delivery vans, pedestrian couriers (porters) and smart software.",[],"rich_text$6335a838-d375-4e67-89d7-c244169f90c2",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10726,"primary":10728,"id":10731,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[10727],{},{"quoteText":10729,"quoteSource":10730},"We’re exploring innovative delivery partnerships like this to see how they can play a role in our goal to create a network of sustainable delivery options to complement our current courier model. We already have the lowest carbon emission of any dedicated parcel delivery company and one of our company targets for the year is to introduce alternative zero-emission transport methods in our final mile.  We’re excited by what we’ve seen so far and look forward to the results of this and other trials.","Carl Lyon, COO at Evri","quote$77ae793a-47ac-4ca0-9988-2e25b51e78ee",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10733,"primary":10735,"id":10737,"slice_type":558,"slice_label":8},[10734],{},{"SectionHeader":8,"SectionText":10736},[],"section_component$cd02a4d5-4ee0-4773-993b-c9cf7af1c307",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10739,"primary":10741,"id":10744,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[10740],{},{"quoteText":10742,"quoteSource":10743},"We're thrilled to be supporting Evri on their sustainability journey. It’s fantastic to see a leading parcel carrier embracing an innovative approach to sustainable urban logistics. Zedify offers a genuine, scalable alternative to diesel vans and EVs in cities; as demonstrated by this trial, it's not only the dramatic cuts in emissions which stand to be gained, but with a 13% increase in productivity, cargo bikes are proving they can keep last mile costs under control, too. We look forward to expanding the partnership into our network of UK cities, to achieve even greater efficiencies for Evri and their customers.","James Nellist, COO at Zedify","quote$d1a34706-1a31-426a-b16a-8607b24852e7",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10746,"primary":10748,"id":10772,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[10747],{},{"content":10749},[10750,10753,10756,10759,10763,10766,10769],{"type":126,"text":4218,"spans":10751},[10752],{"start":32,"end":405,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":251,"spans":10754},[10755],{"start":32,"end":254,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":10757,"spans":10758},"Evri is the UK’s biggest dedicated parcel delivery company, delivering over 700 million parcels a year. The company has a mission to be the most convenient way to send, receive and return parcels, without costing the earth. Evri works with most of Europe’s top retailers including Next, John Lewis, M&S and ASOS. The roots of Evri can be traced back to 1974 but the business has grown over the decades and now has a team of 6,700+ employees, 30,000+ couriers, 10,000+ ParcelShops and Lockers and a growing network of state-of-the-art hubs and depots.",[],{"type":126,"text":10760,"spans":10761},"About Zedify",[10762],{"start":32,"end":699,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":10764,"spans":10765},"Zedify deliver better cities, fit for the future. They partner with retailers, parcel carriers, D2C and subscription brands to transform their customer experience with sustainable last mile logistics. Cargo bikes, hyperlocal delivery hubs, and a powerful ecommerce integrated tech platform all combine to create a service that is revolutionising the way parcels arrive at the urban doorstep. ",[],{"type":126,"text":10767,"spans":10768},"Currently in 10 UK cities, they have funding to help drive growth into 45 by 2025.",[],{"type":126,"text":10770,"spans":10771},"London- Glasgow- Bristol- Edinburgh- Cambridge- Southampton- Brighton- Norwich- Winchester- Plymouth",[],"rich_text$002b9cde-8ae7-4de2-8e37-18a3f62177c5",{"id":10774,"uid":10775,"url":10776,"type":50,"href":10777,"tags":10778,"first_publication_date":10779,"last_publication_date":10780,"slugs":10781,"linked_documents":10783,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":10784,"data":10785},"Ys7AIRAAACIAXGlG","evri-to-open-new-site-in-plymouth","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-to-open-new-site-in-plymouth","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22Ys7AIRAAACIAXGlG%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-07-13T12:52:53+0000","2025-02-13T13:39:26+0000",[10782],"evri-to-open-new-site-in-plymouth-creating-over-50-new-jobs",[],[],{"title":10786,"category":8,"metaDescription":10787,"canonical":10788,"titleTag":10789,"featuredImage":10790,"publishedDate":10796,"slices":10797},"Evri to open new site in Plymouth creating over 50 new jobs","Read all about Evri's new depot opening in Plymouth which is creating 50 new jobs in the area. The new site will open in July 2022.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-to-open-new-site-in-plymouth","Evri to open new site in Plymouth creating over 50 new jobs | Evri - The New Hermes",{"dimensions":10791,"alt":8606,"copyright":8,"url":8607,"id":8608,"edit":10792,"thumbnail":10793},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":4163,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":10794,"alt":8606,"copyright":8,"url":8612,"id":8608,"edit":10795},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":8614,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2022-07-22",[10798,10809],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10799,"primary":10801,"id":10611,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[10800],{},{"content":10802},[10803,10806],{"type":126,"text":10804,"spans":10805},"Evri (formerly Hermes UK) the leading consumer delivery company, is opening a new depot in Plymouth, creating over 50 new jobs in the area. It forms part of the company’s commitment to continuing to invest in its infrastructure to ensure it is able to support the growth of online shopping. The new site will open in July 2022.",[],{"type":126,"text":10807,"spans":10808},"The new site is on the Parkway Industrial estate and at 60,000 sq ft is almost double the size of the existing depot at Bell Close which has been managed by a third-party contractor. Evri’s decision to invest over £1 million pounds in a new site and move the operation in-house will increase capacity fivefold and provide increased control over service levels. All existing permanent workers will TUPE across. ",[],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10810,"primary":10812,"id":10618,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[10811],{},{"quoteText":10813,"quoteSource":10814},"At our new depot we will be able to handle up to 480,000 parcels each week at peak times and provide a strong delivery service for the local community and a good working environment for our people.","Ethan Treble-Westlake, Depot Manager at the new Plymouth site",{"id":10816,"uid":10817,"url":10818,"type":50,"href":10819,"tags":10820,"first_publication_date":10821,"last_publication_date":10822,"slugs":10823,"linked_documents":10826,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":10827,"data":10828},"YqxjoBIAACQAurmL","evri-raise-161k-for-soccer-aid-for-unicef","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-raise-161k-for-soccer-aid-for-unicef","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YqxjoBIAACQAurmL%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-06-17T11:21:09+0000","2023-03-22T10:12:03+0000",[10824,10825,10817],"evri-raise-161k-for-soccer-aid","evri-raise-161k-for-soccer-aid--evri---the-new-hermes",[],[],{"title":10829,"category":8,"metaDescription":10830,"canonical":10831,"titleTag":10832,"featuredImage":10833,"publishedDate":10844,"slices":10845},"Evri raise £161k for Soccer Aid","Evri were delighted to be involved as one of the event sponsors for last Sunday's Soccer Aid, raising a fantastic £161,000 along the way.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-raise-161k-for-soccer-aid-for-unicef","Evri raise £161k for Soccer Aid for UNICEF | Evri - The New Hermes",{"dimensions":10834,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":10835,"id":10836,"edit":10837,"thumbnail":10839},{"width":65,"height":865},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F45ab5742-1963-4072-b0e0-39d64ee3b9dd_AB1_2930+%281%29.jpg?auto=compress,format&rect=0,0,5149,3433&w=960&h=640","YqxerRIAACMAuqOp",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":10838,"background":34},0.18644396970285493,{"dimensions":10840,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":10841,"id":10836,"edit":10842},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F45ab5742-1963-4072-b0e0-39d64ee3b9dd_AB1_2930+%281%29.jpg?auto=compress,format&rect=0,496,5149,2440&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":8436,"zoom":10843,"background":34},0.07457758788114197,"2022-06-16",[10846],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10847,"primary":10849,"id":10876,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[10848],{},{"content":10850},[10851,10854,10857,10860,10869],{"type":126,"text":10852,"spans":10853},"Last Sunday, Soccer Aid for UNICEF 2022 was broadcast live to the world on ITV and STV. The event raised a record breaking £15.6 million, bringing the current total raised to over £75 million, since Soccer Aid for UNICEF’s inception in 2006.",[],{"type":126,"text":10855,"spans":10856},"The money raised could help provide vaccines, fight malnutrition, and provide safe spaces to protect children in times of crisis, helping kids get their childhoods back.",[],{"type":126,"text":10858,"spans":10859},"Evri were delighted to be involved as one of the event sponsors, and as part of their partnership they delivered the match ball to the centre circle for kick-off, in an Evri buggy!",[],{"type":126,"text":10861,"spans":10862},"Evri raised a fantastic £161k through several generous corporate donations, as well as a number of employee run activities, such as bake sales and penalty shootouts, at the various UK sites. You can watch our behind the scenes highlights here.",[10863,10866],{"start":10864,"end":10865,"type":163},238,242,{"start":10864,"end":10865,"type":279,"data":10867},{"link_type":281,"url":10868},"press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.youtube.com\u002Fwatch?v=uCVOEkktsk4",{"type":126,"text":10870,"spans":10871},"There is still time to donate at https:\u002F\u002Fwww.socceraid.org.uk\u002F",[10872,10873],{"start":367,"end":3544,"type":163},{"start":367,"end":3544,"type":279,"data":10874},{"link_type":281,"url":10875},"press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.socceraid.org.uk\u002F","rich_text$a6cd3989-3f09-45b8-a808-a89890b8b28d",{"id":10878,"uid":10879,"url":10880,"type":50,"href":10881,"tags":10882,"first_publication_date":10883,"last_publication_date":10884,"slugs":10885,"linked_documents":10886,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":10887,"data":10888},"YqxNrxIAAOwgule6","evri-launches-esg-report","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-launches-esg-report","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YqxNrxIAAOwgule6%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-06-17T09:47:30+0000","2025-02-13T13:31:07+0000",[10879],[],[],{"title":10889,"category":8,"metaDescription":10890,"canonical":10891,"titleTag":10892,"featuredImage":10893,"publishedDate":10903,"slices":10904},"Evri launches ESG Report","Evri, the consumer delivery specialist, has published its first ever Environmental, Social and Governance (ESG) Report.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-launches-esg-report","Evri launches ESG Report | Evri - The New Hermes",{"dimensions":10894,"alt":10895,"copyright":8,"url":10896,"id":10897,"edit":10898,"thumbnail":10899},{"width":65,"height":865},"A customer sitting in a wheelchair is outside and a courier is handing a parcel to them with a smile. The customer is positioned to be facing away from the camera, with the courier in full view.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XpZ5bqstJ9-Wa__EVRI_LOCATION_01_0589.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6XpZ5bqstJ9-Wa_",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":10900,"alt":10895,"copyright":8,"url":10901,"id":10897,"edit":10902},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XpZ5bqstJ9-Wa__EVRI_LOCATION_01_0589.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2022-06-29",[10905],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10906,"primary":10908,"id":10945,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[10907],{},{"content":10909},[10910,10913,10916,10919,10922,10925,10928,10931,10934,10937,10940],{"type":126,"text":10911,"spans":10912},"Evri, the consumer delivery specialist, has published its first ever Environmental, Social and Governance (ESG) Report which highlights the progress the company has made against its ambitious ESG strategy during the 52 weeks of the financial year ended 26 February 2022. It further underpins the company’s commitment to becoming the UK’s most sustainable delivery business.",[],{"type":126,"text":10914,"spans":10915},"The report covers key achievements and performance data, as well as the challenges and opportunities the business has faced this year as it strives to deliver a better future and reach net zero in direct and indirect emissions by 2035.",[],{"type":126,"text":10917,"spans":10918},"Key initiatives detailed in the report include:",[],{"type":126,"text":10920,"spans":10921},"·         The use of 100% renewable energy in all Evri operations",[],{"type":126,"text":10923,"spans":10924},"·         Ongoing investment in alternative bio-fuels and electric vehicles",[],{"type":126,"text":10926,"spans":10927},"·         Creation of eco-solutions for major retail clients including zero emissions final mile delivery solutions",[],{"type":126,"text":10929,"spans":10930},"·         Industry leading benefits for self- employed couriers which now include paid holiday, pensions and parental leave",[],{"type":126,"text":10932,"spans":10933},"·         ESG bonus targets for the Evri Senior Team ",[],{"type":126,"text":10935,"spans":10936},"·         ESG Training for every single employee and courier",[],{"type":126,"text":10938,"spans":10939},"Fash Sawyerr, Chief Transformation Officer at Evri said, “As a responsible carrier, we recognise our impact on the environment and we are pushing sustainability and ethics to the forefront of our operating model. We are committed to delivering a better future for the planet, including our people, our customers and retail partners, and wider communities.” ",[],{"type":126,"text":10941,"spans":10942},"Click here to download the report.",[10943],{"start":32,"end":5726,"type":279,"data":10944},{"link_type":281,"url":9114},"rich_text$cb349b7d-dc3e-4f25-b667-a7b8af153197",{"id":10947,"uid":10948,"url":10949,"type":50,"href":10950,"tags":10951,"first_publication_date":10952,"last_publication_date":10953,"slugs":10954,"linked_documents":10955,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":10956,"data":10957},"YoOZSBAAACIAiH__","evri-appoints-head-of-dei","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-appoints-head-of-dei","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YoOZSBAAACIAiH__%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-05-17T12:47:07+0000","2025-02-13T13:13:15+0000",[10948],[],[],{"title":10958,"category":8,"metaDescription":10959,"canonical":10960,"titleTag":10961,"featuredImage":10962,"publishedDate":10972,"slices":10973},"Evri appoints Head of DE&I","Evri (formerly Hermes), the leading consumer delivery company, has appointed a Head of Diversity, Equity and Inclusion (DE&I) as part of its commitment to becoming an employer of choice for diverse talent.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-appoints-head-of-dei","Evri appoints Head of DE&I | Evri - The New Hermes",{"dimensions":10963,"alt":10964,"copyright":8,"url":10965,"id":10966,"edit":10967,"thumbnail":10968},{"width":65,"height":865},"An Evri courier is delivering three parcels to a man at his doorstep. He looks pleased to be recieving them","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdGZbqstJ9-inj_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8036.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6zdGZbqstJ9-inj",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":10969,"alt":10964,"copyright":8,"url":10970,"id":10966,"edit":10971},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdGZbqstJ9-inj_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8036.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2022-05-12",[10974,10986,10992,10998],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10975,"primary":10977,"id":10985,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[10976],{},{"content":10978},[10979,10982],{"type":126,"text":10980,"spans":10981},"Evri (formerly Hermes), the leading consumer delivery company, has appointed a Head of Diversity, Equity and Inclusion (DE&I) as part of its commitment to becoming an employer of choice for diverse talent. The new role forms part of an ongoing broader employee experience and culture focus.",[],{"type":126,"text":10983,"spans":10984},"Stacey Ramm takes up the role, bringing with her over eight years’ experience having held senior roles at Virgin Media, latterly as the Inclusion Lead working across the business to design, develop and implement an effective, data-driven DE&I Strategy. Prior to that Stacey held a number of HR and recruitment positions.",[],"rich_text$5561daeb-552b-46d2-805b-de41cddfc074",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10987,"primary":10989,"id":10991,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[10988],{},{"quoteText":10990,"quoteSource":147},"At Evri we are committed to being a diverse and inclusive workplace. We are doing things differently, and we want to be leading the way within our industry and this new role will ensure that our commitment to this continues to be demonstrated by our actions, processes and culture.","quote$eb3dd4ec-a58e-46a2-9e76-27f7a0cc933c",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10993,"primary":10995,"id":10997,"slice_type":558,"slice_label":8},[10994],{},{"SectionHeader":8,"SectionText":10996},[],"section_component$b2798123-38ca-4910-ad92-366c80ceb73d",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":10999,"primary":11001,"id":11004,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":8},[11000],{},{"quoteText":11002,"quoteSource":11003},"I am excited to be joining Evri – a company that is committed to ensuring that the fundamentals of diversity, fairness and inclusivity run throughout the whole business. This is not just the right thing to do but makes clear business sense as we know how important this is to both existing employees, job applicants and clients.","Stacey Ramm","quote$2abfcf4c-cdcd-477f-ad01-0e0502a6d376",{"id":11006,"uid":11007,"url":11008,"type":50,"href":11009,"tags":11010,"first_publication_date":11011,"last_publication_date":11012,"slugs":11013,"linked_documents":11014,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":11015,"data":11016},"YmqWpxIAACkAwXGG","evri-formerly-hermes-trials-new-diesel-replacement","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-formerly-hermes-trials-new-diesel-replacement","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YmqWpxIAACkAwXGG%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-04-28T13:29:16+0000","2025-02-20T16:01:45+0000",[11007],[],[],{"title":11017,"category":8,"metaDescription":11018,"canonical":11019,"titleTag":11020,"featuredImage":11021,"publishedDate":11027,"slices":11028},"Evri (formerly Hermes) trials new diesel replacement","Read more about how Evri (formerly Hermes) is trialling Green D+ HVO (Hydrotreated Vegetable Oil) at its Brooklands site.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-formerly-hermes-trials-new-diesel-replacement","Evri trials new diesel replacement | Evri - The New Hermes",{"dimensions":11022,"alt":1512,"copyright":8,"url":1513,"id":1514,"edit":11023,"thumbnail":11024},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":11025,"alt":1512,"copyright":8,"url":1518,"id":1514,"edit":11026},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2022-04-29",[11029],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":11030,"primary":11032,"id":11049,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[11031],{},{"content":11033},[11034,11037,11040,11044],{"type":126,"text":11035,"spans":11036},"Leading consumer delivery company Evri (formerly Hermes UK) is trialling Green D+ HVO (Hydrotreated Vegetable Oil), a 100% renewable diesel replacement derived from waste and residue oils.  The trial is designed to validate claims of a 90% plus reduction in emissions and assess the need to use more volume than diesel due to its ‘lower calorific content’. ",[],{"type":126,"text":11038,"spans":11039},"Green D+ HVO can be used in standard diesel vehicles without any modifications, the fuels can be mixed so tanks don’t need to be cleaned if they need to switch back to diesel. The team at Evri will be using it for its local HGV fleet at its Brooklands site instead of traditional diesel and submitting their findings. ",[],{"type":126,"text":11041,"spans":11042},"David Landy, Head of Fleet at Evri, said: “At Evri we are currently using CNG (Compressed Natural Gas) vehicles for our first mile, client collections and trunking and have been investing in electric vehicles for the ParcelShop fleet (final mile). The middle mile has been the tricky one to get right and we have trialled the 12t CNG and continue to look at that as an option as well as electric vehicles. Green D+ HVO isn’t widely available and there’s a limited supply so it isn’t possible to run our entire fleet from this fuel but, subject to this trial,  we believe it will be an viable option to help support our sustainable delivery commitments.”",[11043],{"start":1161,"end":10659,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":11045,"spans":11046},"Magnus Hammick, COO of GBF, said: “We’re proud to welcome Evri to the GBF family of partners. All of our clients have one thing in common: they are determined to deliver on their net zero commitments and are making every proactive change they can. Supporting Evri with Gd+ will not only help to reduce their emissions during deliveries, but it will also improve local air quality in communities, so we can all breathe a little easier.” ",[11047],{"start":5726,"end":11048,"type":1324},436,"rich_text$a22dec3b-2cb2-423d-b5e6-1da584e98303",{"id":11051,"uid":11052,"url":11053,"type":50,"href":11054,"tags":11055,"first_publication_date":11056,"last_publication_date":11057,"slugs":11058,"linked_documents":11060,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":11061,"data":11062},"Yk77XBIAACsARnoP","evri-trial-reduces-final-mile-carbon-emissions-by-89-percent","\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-trial-reduces-final-mile-carbon-emissions-by-89-percent","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22Yk77XBIAACsARnoP%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-04-07T14:55:55+0000","2025-02-20T16:03:03+0000",[11059],"evri-trial-reduces-final-mile-carbon-emissions-by-89",[],[],{"title":11063,"category":8,"metaDescription":11064,"canonical":11065,"titleTag":11066,"featuredImage":11067,"publishedDate":11077,"slices":11078},"Evri trial reduces final mile carbon emissions by 89%","A trial conducted by Evri has reduced final mile carbon emissions by 89%. Read on to find out more.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-trial-reduces-final-mile-carbon-emissions-by-89-percent","Evri trial reduces final mile carbon emissions by 89% | Evri - The New Hermes",{"dimensions":11068,"alt":11069,"copyright":8,"url":11070,"id":11071,"edit":11072,"thumbnail":11073},{"width":65,"height":865},"An Evri courier in high vis is smiling posing towards the camera with a parcel under their arm. The backdrop is a street of terraced houses in a rural British neighbourhood.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ69x25bqstJ9-pVF_EVRI_LOCATION_02_1771.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z69x25bqstJ9-pVF",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":11074,"alt":11069,"copyright":8,"url":11075,"id":11071,"edit":11076},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ69x25bqstJ9-pVF_EVRI_LOCATION_02_1771.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2022-04-08",[11079],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":11080,"primary":11082,"id":11095,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[11081],{},{"content":11083},[11084,11087,11090],{"type":126,"text":11085,"spans":11086},"Evri (formerly Hermes UK) is continuing to explore alternative modes of transport that are kinder to the environment with a trial of a new electronically assisted cargo bike that is made from natural fibre composite materials and recycled plastics and metals. So far, the results show a reduction in final mile carbon emissions by 89%.  ",[],{"type":126,"text":11088,"spans":11089},"The trial is being undertaken by an Evri courier in Driffield, East Yorkshire who is using it to deliver on his usual rounds to ensure a like for like comparison. The savings have been calculated using the fuel saved by not running the courier’s vehicle and then adding back the carbon used to generate the electricity to charge the battery and the extra food eaten by the courier to power it!",[],{"type":126,"text":11091,"spans":11092},"Adrian Berry, Innovation Delivery Manager at Evri, said: “It is early days as this is one of the first trials into this kind of delivery option but the results look extremely positive. Moving forward it may well play a role in our goal to create a network of sustainable delivery options to supplement our current courier model.”",[11093],{"start":3684,"end":11094,"type":1324},329,"rich_text$037efd4f-9637-49f0-8de1-bdbfd1bc5849",{"id":11097,"uid":11098,"url":11099,"type":50,"href":11100,"tags":11101,"first_publication_date":11102,"last_publication_date":11103,"slugs":11104,"linked_documents":11105,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":11106,"data":11107},"Yi8S9hIAACgArHeY","hermes-uk-announces-pension-deal-for-couriers-as-it-rebrands-to-become-evri","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-uk-announces-pension-deal-for-couriers-as-it-rebrands-to-become-evri","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22Yi8S9hIAACgArHeY%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-03-14T10:35:35+0000","2023-03-21T15:40:15+0000",[11098],[],[],{"title":11108,"category":8,"metaDescription":11109,"canonical":11110,"titleTag":11111,"featuredImage":11112,"publishedDate":11122,"slices":11123},"Hermes UK announces pension deal for couriers as it rebrands to become 'Evri'","Hermes UK has announced that it is to rebrand as Evri and roll out pensions for self-employed couriers for the first time. Click here to find out more.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-uk-announces-pension-deal-for-couriers-as-it-rebrands-to-become-evri","Hermes UK Announces Pension Deal For Couriers As It Rebands To Become Evri | Evri - The New Hermes",{"dimensions":11113,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":11114,"id":11115,"edit":11116,"thumbnail":11118},{"width":65,"height":865},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fe77807a3-54f2-48c6-9e38-9f195d59353b_MK231+-+C2C+Launch+Comms+GFX+-+Blog+image+V22.png?auto=compress,format&rect=0,0,5000,3333&w=960&h=640","YitffBEAACwAQu_b",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":11117,"background":71},0.192019201920192,{"dimensions":11119,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":11120,"id":11115,"edit":11121},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fe77807a3-54f2-48c6-9e38-9f195d59353b_MK231+-+C2C+Launch+Comms+GFX+-+Blog+image+V22.png?auto=compress,format&rect=0,482,5000,2370&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":8436,"zoom":8437,"background":71},"2022-03-25",[11124],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":11125,"primary":11127,"id":11167,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[11126],{},{"content":11128},[11129,11132,11135,11138,11141,11144,11147,11150,11152,11155,11158,11161,11164],{"type":126,"text":11130,"spans":11131},"Hermes UK, the leading consumer delivery firm, has announced that it is to rebrand as ‘Evri’ with a new logo and brand identity that will be rolled out across all its locations, vehicles and ParcelShops. ",[],{"type":126,"text":11133,"spans":11134},"One of the first announcements under the new brand is that the company is to auto-enrol its self-employed plus (SE+) couriers, 85% of the network, into a pension by the end of this year. This move is a UK logistics industry first and represents a £7 million plus investment each year in the earnings security of its SE+ couriers. In addition, following discussions with the GMB Union, ‘Evri’ will also be introducing the right to maternity\u002Fpaternity leave for all SE+ couriers with effect from March 2022.",[],{"type":126,"text":11136,"spans":11137},"Stephen Timms MP, chair of the House of Commons Work and Pensions Select Committee said: “This is a huge step in the right direction and will help thousands of couriers plan for retirement. I am delighted to see Hermes provide pensions and parental leave in addition to the holiday pay, guaranteed pay rates and union recognition already available.”   ",[],{"type":126,"text":11139,"spans":11140},"Martijn de Lange, CEO at Evri (formerly Hermes UK) said: “When we first announced our SE+ model in 2019 we committed to continuing to develop our support for our self-employed couriers and we are proud to have been true to that and be leading the industry once again. Our couriers receive guaranteed pay rates, paid holiday and now a pension but have also been able to retain the flexibility that so many treasure, fitting in their deliveries alongside their other (often family) commitments.”",[],{"type":126,"text":11142,"spans":11143},"The new brand will also see a significant investment in its customer service as part of its commitment to ensuring that its customer service remains responsive, knowledgeable and helpful. This will include Evri opening a fully UK-based customer service team and adding 200 experts who will be based in local depots, closer to where potential issues are. It will also be upgrading its chatbot and releasing more phone lines for those who prefer to speak directly to someone.",[],{"type":126,"text":11145,"spans":11146},"ESG will be at the heart of the new Evri brand as the company remains committed to reducing its impact on the planet and promoting equality and fairness. This will include continuing to grow its industry leading use of alternative fuels and innovative building initiatives which have already resulted in it using 100% renewable electricity across all its operations. It will continue on its journey to net zero target for direct and indirect emissions for 2035.",[],{"type":126,"text":11148,"spans":11149},"Martijn de Lange, CEO at Evri (formerly Hermes UK) said: “This rebrand follows significant investment and two years of dramatic growth which has resulted in our entire business going through a major transformation programme. It is more than just a name change – it is a statement of intent of our commitment to leading the way in creating responsible delivery experiences for ‘Evri one’, ‘Evri where’. It heralds a new culture and an even better way of doing things in an ever-evolving world – building on our achievements and successes.”",[],{"type":126,"text":402,"spans":11151},[],{"type":1049,"text":11153,"spans":11154},"Evri is the UK’s biggest dedicated parcel delivery company, delivering over 650 million parcels a year. The company has a mission to be the most      convenient way to send, receive and return parcels, without costing the earth. Evri works with most of Europe’s top retailers including Next, John Lewis, M&S and ASOS. The roots of Evri can be traced back to 1974 but the business has grown over the decades and now has a team of 6,700+ employees, 30,000+ couriers, 10,000+ ParcelShops and Lockers and a growing network of state-of-the-art hubs and depots.\n",[],{"type":1049,"text":11156,"spans":11157},"The pension scheme will apply to SE+ (self-employed plus) couriers which make up around 85% of its courier network. SE+ couriers will be auto enrolled into the pension scheme with Hermes contributing 3% of earnings into a pension pot, while they contribute a minimum of 5% of earnings. Couriers will also be able to opt-out of the pension scheme if they choose.\n",[],{"type":1049,"text":11159,"spans":11160},"Steve Garelick, GMB Organiser, said: “This breakthrough deal is a massive step forward and will make work better for GMB members. Tens of thousands of couriers will now have the safety and security of knowing their retirement plans are being looked after. Meanwhile, the right to maternity and paternity leave will break down barriers previously blocking those with children from entering the profession. GMB and Evri (was Hermes) have shown once again that when trade unions and businesses are in agreement, the so-called gig economy can be a better place.” \n",[],{"type":1049,"text":11162,"spans":11163},"Mark Pawsey, MP for Rugby and member of the House of Commons BEIS select committee said: “I welcome Hermes’ ongoing commitment to investing in their workforce by introducing this pension scheme for their couriers. This will be a great benefit for their couriers, including those in my constituency, and will give them confidence and security in their retirement. I also welcome their ongoing work to support their workforce      through the right to paternity leave from this month.”\n",[],{"type":1049,"text":11165,"spans":11166},"The company’s first ever TV advertising campaign will be launching at 8.15pm on Friday 18th March, which is the ITV Coronation Street centre advert break. The advert will also be broadcast in the half time break of the England v France 6 Nations game on Saturday 19th March.",[],"rich_text$8f43d1fd-4937-4b26-bdec-bc68d69d86cf",{"id":11169,"uid":11170,"url":11171,"type":50,"href":11172,"tags":11173,"first_publication_date":11174,"last_publication_date":11175,"slugs":11176,"linked_documents":11178,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":11179,"data":11180},"YizJxhIAAC8AokTY","nancy-hobhouse-and-esg-release","\u002Fpress\u002Fnancy-hobhouse-and-esg-release","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YizJxhIAAC8AokTY%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-03-12T16:29:34+0000","2025-02-21T09:44:04+0000",[11177],"hermes-appoints-nancy-hobhouse-as-head-of-esg",[],[],{"title":11181,"category":8,"metaDescription":11182,"canonical":11183,"titleTag":11184,"featuredImage":11185,"publishedDate":11191,"slices":11192},"Hermes appoints Nancy Hobhouse as Head of ESG","Read our latest blog to learn about our appointment of Nancy Hobhouse as Head of ESG.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fnancy-hobhouse-and-esg-release","Hermes Appoints Nancy Hobhouse as Head of ESG | Evri",{"dimensions":11186,"alt":9895,"copyright":8,"url":9896,"id":9897,"edit":11187,"thumbnail":11188},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":11189,"alt":9895,"copyright":8,"url":9901,"id":9897,"edit":11190},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2021-05-07",[11193],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":11194,"primary":11196,"id":11227,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[11195],{},{"content":11197},[11198,11201,11204,11207,11210,11215,11219,11223],{"type":126,"text":11199,"spans":11200},"Hermes, one of the UK’s leading consumer delivery companies, has appointed a Head of ESG to drive the business's environmental, social, governance agenda.",[],{"type":126,"text":11202,"spans":11203}," Nancy Hobhouse will take up the newly created role, spearheading several key initiatives and developing an ambitious and robust ESG strategy. Her remit covers every aspect of the business from product development to operational changes around key touch points including alternative fuel usage, industry knowledge sharing and people-centric initiatives. She will also lead the company’s reporting on ESG.",[],{"type":126,"text":11205,"spans":11206}," Nancy joins from John Lewis Partnership where she was Senior Sustainability Manager leading the Partnership’s wide climate strategy and John Lewis’ circular economy and raw materials strategy. Nancy also was an elected member of the Partnership governing authority. Prior to that, Nancy was responsible for implementing Barclay’s Bank PLC’s strategy for managing and reporting the Bank’s global climate strategy and worked in ESG for the Credit Risk teams. Nancy has an MSc from King's College London in Environmental Monitoring, Modelling and Management and a degree in Oceanography and Geology from the National Oceanography Centre at Southampton University.",[],{"type":126,"text":11208,"spans":11209},"Commenting on the appointment, Fash Sawyerr, Chief Transformation Officer at Hermes UK, said:",[],{"type":126,"text":11211,"spans":11212},"“Nancy’s appointment is designed to accelerate the good work that is already well underway in this area and take it to the next level in line with our ESG ambitions and commitments. Nancy has excellent experience of driving similar programmes and will be a great asset to the team.” ",[11213],{"start":32,"end":11214,"type":1324},283,{"type":126,"text":11216,"spans":11217},"Fash Sawyerr, Chief Transformation Officer at Hermes UK",[11218],{"start":32,"end":3009,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":11220,"spans":11221},"\"The Hermes team has shown real passion for the environment, social and governance (ESG) and I am very much looking forward to joining to help bring the business to the forefront of this agenda.\" ",[11222],{"start":32,"end":1319,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":11224,"spans":11225},"Nancy Hobhouse, Head of ESG at Hermes UK",[11226],{"start":32,"end":8197,"type":163},"rich_text$76d4539f-9a19-41fd-aa25-a6f0bb8eeedc",{"id":11229,"uid":11230,"url":11231,"type":50,"href":11232,"tags":11233,"first_publication_date":11234,"last_publication_date":11235,"slugs":11236,"linked_documents":11237,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":11238,"data":11239},"YiY1HBIAAC0AF9nx","hermes-invests-seven-figure-sum-in-parcelshop-branding","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-invests-seven-figure-sum-in-parcelshop-branding","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YiY1HBIAAC0AF9nx%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-03-07T16:38:55+0000","2025-02-21T08:54:09+0000",[11230],[],[],{"title":11240,"category":8,"metaDescription":11241,"canonical":11242,"titleTag":11243,"featuredImage":11244,"publishedDate":11250,"slices":11251},"Hermes invests seven-figure sum in ParcelShop branding","Read here to learn about our seven-figure brand refresh of over 200 ParcelShops to increase our high-street presence.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-invests-seven-figure-sum-in-parcelshop-branding","Hermes Invests Seven-Figure Sum in ParcelShop Branding | Evri - The New Hermes",{"dimensions":11245,"alt":5415,"copyright":8,"url":5416,"id":5417,"edit":11246,"thumbnail":11247},{"width":65,"height":5414},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":11248,"alt":5415,"copyright":8,"url":5421,"id":5417,"edit":11249},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":5423,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2020-01-17",[11252],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":11253,"primary":11255,"id":11280,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[11254],{},{"content":11256},[11257,11260,11263,11267,11271,11276],{"type":126,"text":11258,"spans":11259},"Consumer delivery specialist Hermes has announced a seven-figure brand refresh project at over 200 of its ParcelShops throughout the UK to increase its high street presence and attract more customers wanting a convenient way to post parcels and return unwanted items.",[],{"type":126,"text":11261,"spans":11262},"These include 200 ambassador and branded stores which include a full front fascia, full window decals and projecting wall sign, reminding customers of the company’s many parcel options at their local shop.",[],{"type":126,"text":11264,"spans":11265},"\"Our network of over ParcelShops are open early until late, 7 days a week and form part of our commitment to providing a range of convenient services to suit everyone’s needs. Across the stores involved in the project so far we have already seen an increased footfall as a result of the increased brand awareness as more consumers become aware of our services.\"",[11266],{"start":32,"end":9154,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":11268,"spans":11269},"Kath Gill, Head of ParcelShop",[11270],{"start":32,"end":1084,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":11272,"spans":11273},"\"It’s great to see the new look which is much brighter and fresher. Providing customers with clear information about the parcel options in-store has made a difference here and I’m really happy with the results.\"",[11274],{"start":32,"end":11275,"type":1324},211,{"type":126,"text":11277,"spans":11278},"Nadarajah Arumugathas, owner of Coulsden Village Stores, Croydon",[11279],{"start":32,"end":3236,"type":163},"rich_text$a446cfc5-37e3-4ebe-9a72-c8c5459066c8",[11282,11337,11394,11462,11520,11573,11633,11687,11753,11801,11864,11921],{"id":11283,"uid":11284,"url":11285,"type":50,"href":11286,"tags":11287,"first_publication_date":11288,"last_publication_date":11289,"slugs":11290,"linked_documents":11291,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":11292,"data":11293},"YhfssxIAACoA171S","hermes-supports-uk-supermarkets","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-supports-uk-supermarkets","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhfssxIAACoA171S%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T20:40:40+0000","2025-02-21T09:08:15+0000",[11284],[],[],{"title":11294,"category":8,"metaDescription":11295,"canonical":11296,"titleTag":11297,"featuredImage":11298,"publishedDate":11308,"slices":11309},"Hermes supports UK supermarkets","During the pandemic we're pledging our support to supermarket chains during the pandemic. Read our post to find out more.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-supports-uk-supermarkets","Hermes Supports UK Supermarkets | Evri",{"dimensions":11299,"alt":11300,"copyright":8,"url":11301,"id":11302,"edit":11303,"thumbnail":11304},{"width":65,"height":4158},"Customer in a ParcelShop store scanning their parcel's QR code using a Print in Store device to print their label for sending.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TItZbqstJ9-Tew_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2000.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=2,0,7056,4836&w=960&h=658","Z6TItZbqstJ9-Tew",{"x":4163,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":11305,"alt":11300,"copyright":8,"url":11306,"id":11302,"edit":11307},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TItZbqstJ9-Tew_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2000.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,745,7059,3346&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":4168,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2020-04-09",[11310],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":11311,"primary":11313,"id":11336,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[11312],{},{"content":11314},[11315,11318,11321,11324,11327,11332],{"type":126,"text":11316,"spans":11317},"Hermes, the consumer delivery specialist, usually known for delivering alongside retailers such as Next, John Lewis and ASOS, has reached out to the big-five UK supermarket chains to offer support during the COVID-19 pandemic.",[],{"type":126,"text":11319,"spans":11320},"Hermes has pledged its services to supermarkets through a dedicated online portal, so food can reach the supermarket shelves and shopping baskets of those requiring essentials, at a time of need.",[],{"type":126,"text":11322,"spans":11323},"The delivery firm is already working with ASDA and Morrisons to collect trailers full of essentials including bread and toilet roll, from national distribution hubs and deliver them across the country to local supermarkets.",[],{"type":126,"text":11325,"spans":11326},"Hermes has made over 90 journeys to date using its own green, renewable bio-methane fuelled trucks and hired diesel trucks with at least 9 routes for Morrisons and up to 20 shifts for ASDA being covered by Hermes drivers each day.",[],{"type":126,"text":11328,"spans":11329},"\"We value the hard work of other businesses in the UK, including our supermarkets, which are keeping the nation and our own parcel people fed during the fast-evolving situation. We are proud to support our industry colleagues wherever we can, offering our own resources; time, fuel and drivers. Hermes is doing everything it can during the current national emergency to offer its services and help the nation’s key infrastructure meet demand whilst keeping drivers driving, fitting all additional work around an already busy network.\"",[11330],{"start":32,"end":11331,"type":1324},534,{"type":126,"text":11333,"spans":11334},"Jon Ormond, Director of Hubs and Depots at Hermes",[11335],{"start":32,"end":5125,"type":163},"rich_text$bf50369d-50a1-4c62-a165-3dea5619f420",{"id":11338,"uid":11339,"url":11340,"type":50,"href":11341,"tags":11342,"first_publication_date":11343,"last_publication_date":11344,"slugs":11345,"linked_documents":11346,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":11347,"data":11348},"YhfsDxIAACgA17s2","hermes-supports-flourishing-sme-clients","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-supports-flourishing-sme-clients","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhfsDxIAACgA17s2%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T20:37:54+0000","2025-02-21T09:09:36+0000",[11339],[],[],{"title":11349,"category":8,"metaDescription":11350,"canonical":11351,"titleTag":11352,"featuredImage":11353,"publishedDate":11363,"slices":11364},"Hermes supports 'flourishing' SME clients","We're supporting SMEs in looking at online alternatives to selling in-person during lockdown. Read our blog to find out how we're helping.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-supports-flourishing-sme-clients","Hermes Supports 'Flourishing' SME Clients | Evri",{"dimensions":11354,"alt":11355,"copyright":8,"url":11356,"id":11357,"edit":11358,"thumbnail":11359},{"width":65,"height":865},"Customer is walking away from a ParcelShop, holding their collected parcel in one hand and a store-bought cup of coffee in the other hand.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJR5bqstJ9-Tf7_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2942.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6TJR5bqstJ9-Tf7",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":11360,"alt":11355,"copyright":8,"url":11361,"id":11357,"edit":11362},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJR5bqstJ9-Tf7_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2942.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2020-04-23",[11365],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":11366,"primary":11368,"id":11336,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[11367],{},{"content":11369},[11370,11373,11376,11381,11385,11390],{"type":126,"text":11371,"spans":11372},"SMEs across a range of sectors are flourishing as consumers look to online alternatives during the lockdown, according to Hermes UK, the consumer delivery specialist. The company is currently delivering around 700,000 parcels a week on behalf of its Business Account customers (SMEs) - an uplift of 100% on this time last year.",[],{"type":126,"text":11374,"spans":11375},"In order to support these clients, Hermes has adapted a number of its services in line with government guidelines. This includes providing increased contact-free collections and doubling the number of lockers available for its customers to use.",[],{"type":126,"text":11377,"spans":11378},"\"Many of our SME clients have been able to respond quickly to the changing needs of consumers who are looking for alternative sources of products as a result of shop closures and travel restrictions. Our account managers have worked closely with them to understand how we can best support them during these challenging times whilst ensure that the safety of our people and our customers remains a top priority.\"",[11379],{"start":32,"end":11380,"type":1324},411,{"type":126,"text":11382,"spans":11383},"Jon Oldroyd, Head of Business Accounts at Hermes",[11384],{"start":32,"end":8554,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":11386,"spans":11387},"\"We are proud to play our part in helping to manufacture and sell essential items to our customers in these challenging times, including hand sanitiser and wipes. We have seen our online orders rocket from 300 a week to more than 500 a day, the majority of which are sent through Hermes. Our staff have been amazing in coping with the extra demand and adhering to guidelines. These past few weeks have been difficult but also a game-changer for online businesses like ours. It has meant we’ve been able to get items safely to customers who are self-isolating. We’re grateful we have been able to cope with this increase in demand with Hermes’ support.\"",[11388],{"start":32,"end":11389,"type":1324},652,{"type":126,"text":11391,"spans":11392},"Janis Liepa, of Wigan-based Assured Products",[11393],{"start":32,"end":8281,"type":163},{"id":11395,"uid":11396,"url":11397,"type":50,"href":11398,"tags":11399,"first_publication_date":11400,"last_publication_date":11401,"slugs":11402,"linked_documents":11404,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":11405,"data":11406},"YhfrMRIAACsA17dF","hermes-starts-work-on-new-31m-midlands-super-hub","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-starts-work-on-new-31m-midlands-super-hub","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhfrMRIAACsA17dF%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T20:35:05+0000","2023-03-21T15:24:47+0000",[11396,11403],"hermes-priotitises-staff-development-whilst-raising-funds-for-the-princes-trust",[],[],{"title":11407,"category":8,"metaDescription":11408,"canonical":11409,"titleTag":11410,"featuredImage":11411,"publishedDate":11423,"slices":11424},"Hermes starts work on new £31m Midlands super hub","Read our latest blog and find all about our exciting plans to develop a brand new £31m Midlands super hub!","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-starts-work-on-new-31m-midlands-super-hub","Hermes Starts Work on New £31m Midlands Super Hub | Evri",{"dimensions":11412,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":11414,"id":11415,"edit":11416,"thumbnail":11418},{"width":65,"height":11413},719,"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ff0e77a86-459d-4056-b701-4d6cb4627508_new+depot+image+3.jpg?auto=compress,format&rect=0,0,1280,959&w=960&h=719","YhdyGhIAACoA1fns",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":11417,"background":34},0.75,{"dimensions":11419,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":11420,"id":11415,"edit":11421},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ff0e77a86-459d-4056-b701-4d6cb4627508_new+depot+image+3.jpg?auto=compress,format&rect=0,177,1280,607&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":7499,"zoom":11422,"background":34},0.3,"2021-01-21",[11425],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":11426,"primary":11428,"id":11336,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[11427],{},{"content":11429},[11430,11433,11436,11439,11444,11448,11451,11454,11459],{"type":126,"text":11431,"spans":11432},"Hermes, the consumer delivery specialist, has today confirmed it is to build a state-of-the-art automated parcel distribution hub located in Rugby, Warwickshire. The £31 million development will be the largest single investment ever made by Hermes and illustrates the company’s ongoing commitment to providing exceptional levels of service in light of continued business growth.",[],{"type":126,"text":11434,"spans":11435},"The 270,000 square foot Midlands Super Hub will have the capacity to process up to 1.1 million parcels every day and will increase the company’s overall parcel processing capacity by 45%, as well as creating more than 200 new permanent jobs.",[],{"type":126,"text":11437,"spans":11438},"Work on the facility commenced earlier this week under the supervision of Hermes CEO Carole Woodhead and Chief Operating Officer Martijn de Lange. The delivery specialist will work together with site developer Roxhill and contractor Winvic during the construction of the hub, which is anticipated to officially open in August of next year.",[],{"type":126,"text":11440,"spans":11441},"\"As work begins at our new facility in Rugby, we are embarking on an exciting new chapter in the history of Hermes that will ensure we can continue to provide retailers with world class services and solutions. The hub’s enormous throughput capability and built in flexibility will help to future proof our business whilst also ensuring we are in the very best position to grow alongside our clients.\"",[11442],{"start":32,"end":11443,"type":1324},400,{"type":126,"text":11445,"spans":11446},"Carole Woodhead, CEO at Hermes",[11447],{"start":32,"end":2883,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":11449,"spans":11450},"News of the investment comes after Hermes enjoyed its busiest and most efficient peak season to date. Throughout December the delivery firm processed 30.3 million parcels, representing a 24% increase on the previous year. The record-breaking peak season followed a successful Black Friday period, with Hermes processing 8.2 million parcels in the week following the major retail event that is famed for huge discounts.",[],{"type":126,"text":11452,"spans":11453},"The construction of the Midlands Super Hub follows last year’s significant investment that saw Hermes add a secondary sortation tier at its northern automated distribution hub in Warrington, which can now process up to one million parcels a day.",[],{"type":126,"text":11455,"spans":11456},"\"The substantial investment at both Rugby and Warrington shows how we continue to strengthen our network and infrastructure across the UK. This will ensure we have the capacity to cope with prolonged periods of intense activity as well as spikes such as Black Friday and Cyber Monday. We are laying the foundations for future growth, creating more employment opportunities and confirming our position as an industry leader.\"",[11457],{"start":32,"end":11458,"type":1324},424,{"type":126,"text":11445,"spans":11460},[11461],{"start":32,"end":2883,"type":163},{"id":11463,"uid":11464,"url":11465,"type":50,"href":11466,"tags":11467,"first_publication_date":11468,"last_publication_date":11469,"slugs":11470,"linked_documents":11471,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":11472,"data":11473},"YhfqABIAAC8A17Gy","hermes-scoops-leading-industry-award-for-training","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-scoops-leading-industry-award-for-training","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhfqABIAAC8A17Gy%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T20:29:37+0000","2025-02-20T16:28:06+0000",[11464],[],[],{"title":11474,"category":8,"metaDescription":11475,"canonical":11476,"titleTag":11477,"featuredImage":11478,"publishedDate":11487,"slices":11488},"Hermes scoops leading industry award for training","We're really happy that we have won a national award at this year's Motor Transport Awards. Read our blog post and find out more about the accomplishment.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-scoops-leading-industry-award-for-training","Hermes Scoops Leading Industry Award for Training | Evri",{"dimensions":11479,"alt":1512,"copyright":8,"url":11480,"id":11481,"edit":11482,"thumbnail":11483},{"width":65,"height":865},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6y9YJbqstJ9-iH7_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9068.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6y9YJbqstJ9-iH7",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":11484,"alt":1512,"copyright":8,"url":11485,"id":11481,"edit":11486},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6y9YJbqstJ9-iH7_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9068.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2018-03-21",[11489],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":11490,"primary":11492,"id":11336,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[11491],{},{"content":11493},[11494,11497,11500,11503,11507,11511,11516],{"type":126,"text":11495,"spans":11496},"Leading home delivery courier company Hermes, who operate regional depots in Southampton, Crewe, Swindon, Weybridge, Nuneaton and Bradford have won a national award at this year’s Motor Transport Awards. The Training Award recognises the success of the Hermes Driving School, which has enabled the company to reduce accidents within its fleet operation by more than 40 per cent, lower fuel consumption by 25 per cent and achieve cost savings of around £1 million.",[],{"type":126,"text":11498,"spans":11499},"The coveted Training Award was presented to Hermes at London’s Grosvenor House Hotel in front of 1,200 leading industry figures. The sell-out event was compered by comedian and impressionist Rory Bremner, with help from Sky Sports presenter Di Stewart, and is designed to promote the major achievements and best practise that is taking place in the road transport and logistics industry.",[],{"type":126,"text":11501,"spans":11502},"Entrants in the training category were asked to demonstrate how they had improved staff training in the past 12 to 18 months and how this had benefitted their business. Hermes showed how it had improved the safe and efficient driving skills of the company’s 480 employed and 160 agency drivers in order to minimise accidents, improve customer service, lower costs and reduce the environmental impact of the fleet operation.",[],{"type":126,"text":11504,"spans":11505},"\"The cost savings attributable to training are significant – very impressive! Hermes has implemented a high-quality training programme with tangible results.\"",[11506],{"start":32,"end":332,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":11508,"spans":11509},"The judges tasked with selecting the Training Award winner",[11510],{"start":32,"end":2501,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":11512,"spans":11513},"\"We are absolutely delighted that our concerted focus on at-work driving safety has been recognised by this year’s Motor Transport Awards. This success is a testament to the hard work of our driving school team and highlights the importance of service excellence that underpins our entire operation.\"",[11514],{"start":32,"end":11515,"type":1324},300,{"type":126,"text":11517,"spans":11518},"Carole Woodhead, CEO of Hermes UK",[11519],{"start":32,"end":367,"type":163},{"id":11521,"uid":11522,"url":11523,"type":50,"href":11524,"tags":11525,"first_publication_date":11526,"last_publication_date":11527,"slugs":11528,"linked_documents":11529,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":11530,"data":11531},"Yhfn4BIAACgA16fm","hermes-rolls-out-updated-alexa-features-to-provide-greater-control-and-convenience-for-customers","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-rolls-out-updated-alexa-features-to-provide-greater-control-and-convenience-for-customers","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22Yhfn4BIAACgA16fm%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T20:25:46+0000","2025-02-21T08:16:32+0000",[11522],[],[],{"title":11532,"category":8,"metaDescription":11533,"canonical":11534,"titleTag":11535,"featuredImage":11536,"publishedDate":11546,"slices":11547},"Hermes rolls out updated Alexa features to provide greater control and convenience for customers","We're always keen to improve our customer experience. Find out in this blog how we've improved our range of features for Alexa Skill.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-rolls-out-updated-alexa-features-to-provide-greater-control-and-convenience-for-customers","Hermes Rolls Out Updated Alexa Features to Provide Greater Control and Convenience for Customers | Evri",{"dimensions":11537,"alt":11538,"copyright":8,"url":11539,"id":11540,"edit":11541,"thumbnail":11542},{"width":65,"height":865},"A close-up of a customer sitting on a sofa, holding their phone and smiling at their screen.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XtDJbqstJ9-WfQ_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5611.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6XtDJbqstJ9-WfQ",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":11543,"alt":11538,"copyright":8,"url":11544,"id":11540,"edit":11545},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XtDJbqstJ9-WfQ_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5611.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2018-12-03",[11548],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":11549,"primary":11551,"id":11336,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[11550],{},{"content":11552},[11553,11556,11559,11562,11565,11569],{"type":126,"text":11554,"spans":11555},"Hermes, the consumer delivery specialist, has launched a new range of features for its Alexa Skill, which is designed to provide customers with even more control and convenience when sending or receiving parcels. The move forms part of Hermes’ wider commitment to innovation and using smart technology to further improve the customer experience it provides on behalf of the UK’s leading retailers.",[],{"type":126,"text":11557,"spans":11558},"Last year, Hermes became the first parcel company in the UK to fully integrate its end-to-end tracking solution with Amazon’s line of Echo smart speakers, powered by digital assistant Alexa. The business has now built on its initial success by developing a number of additional industry-first features for Alexa users.",[],{"type":126,"text":11560,"spans":11561},"Updates for Alexa include a ParcelShop finder, which determines the location of the nearest Hermes ParcelShop; the ability to set a designated safe place or choose to have your parcel delivered to a neighbour when not at home and an enhanced returns process. Consumers asking Hermes to return their order via the Alexa Skill will be emailed a QR code and PIN that allows them to print a returns label at the nearest ParcelShop. Updates for the Amazon Echo Spot and Echo Show also include the ability to view a SafePlace photo or signature when a parcel has been delivered.",[],{"type":126,"text":11563,"spans":11564},"The new functionality has been developed and tested at the company's Innovation Lab in the centre of Leeds, where a team are dedicated to creating a range of cutting-edge solutions designed to revolutionise the delivery landscape.",[],{"type":126,"text":11566,"spans":11567},"\"Our commitment to innovation and our desire to continuously enhance our range of delivery solutions is driven by consumer feedback and improving the customer experience. Off the back of becoming the first UK parcel company to integrate our tracking solution with Alexa, we have set another technology milestone by introducing new functionality that boosts the consumer experience and will drive repeat sales for retailers.\"",[11568],{"start":32,"end":11458,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":11570,"spans":11571},"Chris Ashworth, CIO at Hermes UK",[11572],{"start":32,"end":3455,"type":163},{"id":11574,"uid":11575,"url":11576,"type":50,"href":11577,"tags":11578,"first_publication_date":11579,"last_publication_date":11580,"slugs":11581,"linked_documents":11582,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":11583,"data":11584},"Yhfm2xIAACsA16NI","hermes-pledges-to-support-national-childrens-charity-chicks","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-pledges-to-support-national-childrens-charity-chicks","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22Yhfm2xIAACsA16NI%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T20:15:42+0000","2025-02-20T16:45:22+0000",[11575],[],[],{"title":11585,"category":8,"metaDescription":11586,"canonical":11587,"titleTag":11588,"featuredImage":11589,"publishedDate":11600,"slices":11601},"Hermes pledges to support national children's charity, CHICKS","Click on our latest blog post to learn all about our partnership with children's charity CHICKS.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-pledges-to-support-national-childrens-charity-chicks","Hermes Pledges to Support National Children's Charity, CHICKS | Evri",{"dimensions":11590,"alt":11591,"copyright":8,"url":11592,"id":11593,"edit":11594,"thumbnail":11595},{"width":65,"height":865},"Two children are smiling and embracing eachother in front of their house whilst posing towards the camera.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6tibZbqstJ9-e-s_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6836.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,2,8074,5383&w=960&h=640","Z6tibZbqstJ9-e-s",{"x":32,"y":4163,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":11596,"alt":11591,"copyright":8,"url":11597,"id":11593,"edit":11598},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6tibZbqstJ9-e-s_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6836.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,780,8074,3827&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":11599,"zoom":33,"background":71},780,"2018-06-27",[11602],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":11603,"primary":11605,"id":11336,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[11604],{},{"content":11606},[11607,11610,11613,11616,11621,11625,11629],{"type":126,"text":11608,"spans":11609},"Hermes, the consumer delivery specialist, has signed a partnership agreement pledging its support to children’s charity CHICKS.",[],{"type":126,"text":11611,"spans":11612},"CHICKS is a national charity that provides free respite breaks to disadvantaged children from all over the UK. Children are referred to CHICKS by professionals, including teachers or social workers, to stay at one of CHICKS’ retreats weekly from February to December in the South West and Derbyshire. The children are accompanied by three fully-trained members of the CHICKS team, and up to six adult volunteers.",[],{"type":126,"text":11614,"spans":11615},"Hermes will support CHICKS as its chosen charity partner through fundraising events and swapping skills.",[],{"type":126,"text":11617,"spans":11618},"\"We’re proud to be able to support such a great cause, not only through fundraising, but also by enabling our employees to access volunteering opportunities with CHICKS. We have a large network that takes part in multiple local fundraising events throughout the year, and so to be able to combine this regular support from regional hubs, depots and partners with regular volunteering will hopefully make an impact to enable CHICKS to continue their valuable work with disadvantaged children across the UK.\"",[11619],{"start":32,"end":11620,"type":1324},506,{"type":126,"text":11622,"spans":11623},"Hugo Martin, Legal Director at Hermes and Chair of Hermes’ CSR Committee",[11624],{"start":32,"end":3539,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":11626,"spans":11627},"\"The children that CHICKS help come from a variety of backgrounds. They might be living in poverty, be young carers, be victims of bullying or abuse, or have been bereaved. The one thing they all have in common is that they could really benefit from a week away from their circumstances. Like all charities, being able to sustain and grow our efforts is a huge task and so we’re thrilled that Hermes has chosen to support us, not only by raising funds but also by being able to allow their employees to volunteer and share their skills with us. We’re very much looking forward to collaborating with the Hermes team over the coming months.\"",[11628],{"start":32,"end":8976,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":11630,"spans":11631},"Andrew Dean, Chief Executive, CHICKS",[11632],{"start":32,"end":162,"type":163},{"id":11634,"uid":11635,"url":11636,"type":50,"href":11637,"tags":11638,"first_publication_date":11639,"last_publication_date":11640,"slugs":11641,"linked_documents":11642,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":11643,"data":11644},"Yhfl5xIAACkA157g","hermes-preparation-delivers-record-breaking-peak-2019","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-preparation-delivers-record-breaking-peak-2019","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22Yhfl5xIAACkA157g%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T20:12:28+0000","2025-02-21T08:53:09+0000",[11635],[],[],{"title":11645,"category":8,"metaDescription":11646,"canonical":11647,"titleTag":11648,"featuredImage":11649,"publishedDate":11659,"slices":11660},"Hermes' preparation delivers record-breaking peak 2019","Our preparation has paid off for our busiest ever peak. Read all about our success during the busiest period of the year in this blog post.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-preparation-delivers-record-breaking-peak-2019","Hermes' Preparation Delivers Record-Breaking Peak 2019 | Evri",{"dimensions":11650,"alt":11651,"copyright":8,"url":11652,"id":11653,"edit":11654,"thumbnail":11655},{"width":65,"height":865},"Female courier handing parcel to recipient. She is taking a proof of delivery photo.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TmW5bqstJ9-UBJ_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10020.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6TmW5bqstJ9-UBJ",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":11656,"alt":11651,"copyright":8,"url":11657,"id":11653,"edit":11658},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TmW5bqstJ9-UBJ_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10020.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2020-01-13",[11661],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":11662,"primary":11664,"id":11336,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[11663],{},{"content":11665},[11666,11669,11672,11675,11678,11683],{"type":126,"text":11667,"spans":11668},"Hermes UK, the consumer delivery specialist, has experienced its most successful peak season to date, which included the busiest day in the company’s history. The organisation handled in excess of 49.1 million parcels during December 2019 alone – significantly up from 39.5 million in December 2018.",[],{"type":126,"text":11670,"spans":11671},"The milestone day fell on 5th December when the company processed 2.1 million parcels, beating 2018’s total of 1.9 million items handled in a single day. The first week in December was also a record week which saw the company deliver 13.9 million parcels and operate almost 1000 client collections in just one day.",[],{"type":126,"text":11673,"spans":11674},"In order to prepare for peak 2019 Hermes had implemented the largest peak capacity uplift in the industry, across all hubs, enabling its network to process over 2 million parcels a day.",[],{"type":126,"text":11676,"spans":11677},"An additional 1000 trailers and 3200 scanning devices were acquired and 560 drivers, 7000 couriers and 28 peak managers joined existing teams to help provide support. Deliveries were made 7 days a week from the beginning of December up until 6pm on the 24th December.",[],{"type":126,"text":11679,"spans":11680},"\"This was another record-breaking peak and once again we were ready and able to deliver Christmas. We started planning at the beginning of the year, working with our longstanding and committed retail clients to provide a collaborative, flexible and scalable service. Our ongoing investment into developing our infrastructure and proposition, supported by some industry leading new products and services, also meant that this year we were able to further enhance the customer experience, providing strong communication and added assurance and convenience.\"",[11681],{"start":32,"end":11682,"type":1324},555,{"type":126,"text":11684,"spans":11685},"Martijn de Lange, CEO at Hermes",[11686],{"start":32,"end":4070,"type":163},{"id":11688,"uid":11689,"url":11690,"type":50,"href":11691,"tags":11692,"first_publication_date":11693,"last_publication_date":11694,"slugs":11695,"linked_documents":11696,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":11697,"data":11698},"YhflIRIAACwA15th","hermes-prioritises-staff-development-whilst-raising-funds-for-the-princes-trust","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-prioritises-staff-development-whilst-raising-funds-for-the-princes-trust","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhflIRIAACwA15th%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T20:08:49+0000","2025-02-20T16:11:28+0000",[11403],[],[],{"title":11699,"category":8,"metaDescription":11700,"canonical":11701,"titleTag":11702,"featuredImage":11703,"publishedDate":11713,"slices":11714},"Hermes priotitises staff development whilst raising funds for The Prince's Trust","Our colleagues are being encouraged to channel entrepreneurial spirit to raise vital funds for the UK's leading youth charity. Read more here.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-prioritises-staff-development-whilst-raising-funds-for-the-princes-trust","Hermes Priotitises Staff Development Whilst Raising Funds for The Prince's Trust | Evri",{"dimensions":11704,"alt":11705,"copyright":8,"url":11706,"id":11707,"edit":11708,"thumbnail":11709},{"width":65,"height":865},"An Evri Courier is scanning the barcode of a parcel at the doorstep of a home in a rural area.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ69xmpbqstJ9-pU8_EVRI_LOCATION_02_1264.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z69xmpbqstJ9-pU8",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":11710,"alt":11705,"copyright":8,"url":11711,"id":11707,"edit":11712},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ69xmpbqstJ9-pU8_EVRI_LOCATION_02_1264.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2022-02-17",[11715],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":11716,"primary":11718,"id":11336,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[11717],{},{"content":11719},[11720,11723,11726,11729,11732,11735,11740,11744,11749],{"type":126,"text":11721,"spans":11722},"Employees from Hermes, the consumer delivery specialist, are being encouraged to channel their entrepreneurial spirit to raise vital funds for the UK’s leading youth charity, The Prince’s Trust. 32 employees are taking part in Million Makers, the charity’s national fundraising challenge, as part of Hermes UK’s internal leadership and development programme.",[],{"type":126,"text":11724,"spans":11725},"Million Makers sees teams from various companies across the UK compete to raise at least £10,000 for over a period of six months, from a starting pot of £1,500. The initial donation is made by The Prince’s Trust, who in return receives all of the proceeds from each project. Three teams from Hermes have already pitched their business ideas and commenced fundraising, which will run until the end of the year. Participants will also be invited to a special regional awards ceremony early next year.",[],{"type":126,"text":11727,"spans":11728},"Projects currently being finalised and used to raise money include creating a children’s book, livery advertising on Hermes’ national fleet, the Total Warrior challenge, sweepstakes, an old PCs sale, quiz night auctions and the installation of high end coffee machines on a number of Hermes sites. The teams will also be taking on a number of personal fundraising activities to ensure that they meet their targets.",[],{"type":126,"text":11730,"spans":11731},"Hermes was keen for employees to take time away from their daily schedules to participate in the event to build essential business skills, as well as enabling them to work alongside colleagues from different departments.",[],{"type":126,"text":11733,"spans":11734},"The Hermes team will add to the funds raised by the Million Makers initiative, now in its tenth year, which has to date raised more than £10m for The Trust. The Prince’s Trust helps young people to develop the confidence and skills they need to realise their ambitions, so that they can live, learn and earn.",[],{"type":126,"text":11736,"spans":11737},"\"We are committed to making sure that our employees can reach their full potential at Hermes, so we’re really excited to be able to support the Million Makers programme in partnership with The Prince’s Trust. This is an incredible opportunity for our employees to take part in proven learning and development activities that will help to develop their business skills whilst supporting such a worthy cause.\"",[11738],{"start":32,"end":11739,"type":1324},407,{"type":126,"text":11741,"spans":11742},"Jill Maples, HR Director at Hermes",[11743],{"start":32,"end":5726,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":11745,"spans":11746},"\"The Prince’s Trust is thrilled to have Hermes participating in Million Makers for its tenth anniversary year. We are proud to deliver a challenge which provides action based learning and development benefits for those involved. Teams across the UK are utilising their business acumen, team work and passion to raise life changing funds that will transform young lives.\"",[11747],{"start":32,"end":11748,"type":1324},370,{"type":126,"text":11750,"spans":11751},"Claire Quigley, Senior Head of Employee Fundraising at The Prince’s Trust",[11752],{"start":32,"end":5710,"type":163},{"id":11754,"uid":11755,"url":11756,"type":50,"href":11757,"tags":11758,"first_publication_date":11759,"last_publication_date":11760,"slugs":11761,"linked_documents":11762,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":11763,"data":11764},"YhfjURIAAC4A15Mj","hermes-promises-million-pound-coronavirus-fund-to-support-self-employed-couriers","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-promises-million-pound-coronavirus-fund-to-support-self-employed-couriers","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhfjURIAAC4A15Mj%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T20:00:58+0000","2025-02-21T09:05:57+0000",[11755],[],[],{"title":11765,"category":8,"metaDescription":11766,"canonical":11767,"titleTag":11768,"featuredImage":11769,"publishedDate":11779,"slices":11780},"Hermes promises million pound 'coronavirus' fund to support self-employed couriers","We're pledging a £1m fund for our self-employed couriers to help support them during self-isolation. Find out more in our latest post.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-promises-million-pound-coronavirus-fund-to-support-self-employed-couriers","Hermes Promises Million Pound 'Coronavirus' Fund to Support Self-employed Couriers | Evri",{"dimensions":11770,"alt":11771,"copyright":8,"url":11772,"id":11773,"edit":11774,"thumbnail":11775},{"width":65,"height":865},"An Evri courier is taking a photo confirmation of a successful delivery whilst the customer holds the parcels in clear view.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdHJbqstJ9-inq_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8123.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6zdHJbqstJ9-inq",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":11776,"alt":11771,"copyright":8,"url":11777,"id":11773,"edit":11778},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdHJbqstJ9-inq_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8123.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2020-03-23",[11781],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":11782,"primary":11784,"id":11336,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[11783],{},{"content":11785},[11786,11789,11794,11798],{"type":126,"text":11787,"spans":11788},"Hermes, the consumer delivery specialist has announced it is to make a £1 million pound fund available for its self- employed couriers, to help support them if they need to self-isolate as a result of the coronavirus. It follows concerns about their welfare as self-employed people are not eligible for sick pay. Hermes will also support them in finding someone to deliver on their behalf if they do not have a substitute and guarantee that their rounds will be kept open for them for when they return. This initiative is supported by the GMB Union. ",[],{"type":126,"text":11790,"spans":11791},"\"This is an extraordinary situation and we have taken the decision to help support our couriers financially if they need help and also ensure we are doing everything we can to prevent the spread of the virus. It is simply the right thing to do and I hope that other organisations will follow our lead.\"",[11792],{"start":32,"end":11793,"type":1324},302,{"type":126,"text":11795,"spans":11796},"Martijn De Lange, CEO at Hermes",[11797],{"start":32,"end":4070,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":11799,"spans":11800},"Hermes is at the forefront of supporting rights for the self-employed as demonstrated by its introduction of the ‘Self-Employed Plus’ (SE+) option, which attracts a number of benefits such as holiday pay and is the first of its kind in any sector.  The deal is backed by the GMB Trade Union under a partnership agreement which saw Hermes provide recognition of the GMB’s representation of any of its circa 15,000 self-employed couriers that choose to join the Union.",[],{"id":11802,"uid":11803,"url":11804,"type":50,"href":11805,"tags":11806,"first_publication_date":11807,"last_publication_date":11808,"slugs":11809,"linked_documents":11810,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":11811,"data":11812},"YhfigRIAACoA149r","hermes-rolls-out-safeplace-photo-and-geo-fencing-to-end-consumers","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-rolls-out-safeplace-photo-and-geo-fencing-to-end-consumers","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhfigRIAACoA149r%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T19:57:13+0000","2025-02-20T16:49:52+0000",[11803],[],[],{"title":11813,"category":8,"metaDescription":11814,"canonical":11815,"titleTag":11816,"featuredImage":11817,"publishedDate":11827,"slices":11828},"Hermes rolls out SafePlace Photo and geo-fencing to end consumers","Read our latest blog post to find out how we're using SafePlace photo's and geo-fencing to improve customer experience.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-rolls-out-safeplace-photo-and-geo-fencing-to-end-consumers","Hermes Rolls Out SafePlace Photo and Geo-Fencing to End Consumers | Evri",{"dimensions":11818,"alt":11819,"copyright":8,"url":11820,"id":11821,"edit":11822,"thumbnail":11823},{"width":65,"height":865},"A courier is outside next to an open garage door, scanning a parcel for its delivery to a safe place.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TxTpbqstJ9-UUj_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9890.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6TxTpbqstJ9-UUj",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":11824,"alt":11819,"copyright":8,"url":11825,"id":11821,"edit":11826},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TxTpbqstJ9-UUj_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9890.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2018-09-21",[11829],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":11830,"primary":11832,"id":11336,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[11831],{},{"content":11833},[11834,11837,11840,11843,11846,11849,11852,11855,11860],{"type":126,"text":11835,"spans":11836},"Hermes, the consumer delivery specialist, has begun to roll out its SafePlace Photo product and geo-fencing capabilities to end consumers, following positive feedback from retailers after it launched at the beginning of this year.",[],{"type":126,"text":11838,"spans":11839},"SafePlace Photo, combined with the location tracking that Hermes’ hand held terminals also provide, will provide retailers and their end consumers with photographic evidence and co-ordinates of parcels left in a safe location and keep them informed. This combination of products helps retailers to lower costs, reduce contacts and improve customer satisfaction.",[],{"type":126,"text":11841,"spans":11842},"Geo-fencing provides a location and a map of where each parcel has been delivered, within a radius as small as 10m and updates can be pushed through a choice of channels, including SMS, email, app or website updates.",[],{"type":126,"text":11844,"spans":11845},"SafePlace Photo enhances the overall delivery experience by providing consumers with added confidence that their purchases have arrived even when they are not at home. This will provide consumers with increased confidence to shop online and make them more likely to nominate a SafePlace when placing future orders.",[],{"type":126,"text":11847,"spans":11848},"This latest development will also benefit retailers by significantly reducing missed deliveries, incoming customer service enquiries and fraudulent claims.",[],{"type":126,"text":11850,"spans":11851},"Hermes couriers will use their existing handheld terminals to take high-resolution images of parcels left in a predetermined or suitably safe location, and also record location co-ordinates. Retailers deploying SafePlace Photo will then receive the images as soon as they are taken; with the additional option to have the photos automatically uploaded into their CRM systems. Retailers will also benefit from an increase in first time delivery and a drop in incoming contact centre enquiries, as well as provide added confidence to reduce and reject fraudulent claims.",[],{"type":126,"text":11853,"spans":11854},"SafePlace Photo and geo-fencing forms part of Hermes’ Digital Futures strategy, a £55m project that prioritises customer experience through investment in innovation and technology, including a new website with updated tracking options and a refreshed app, which are amongst new developments that are coming this year.",[],{"type":126,"text":11856,"spans":11857},"\"SafePlace Photo combined with geo-fencing is the latest of our Digital Futures updates that reflects our vision to become the carrier of choice for every end consumer in the UK. It’s so important to take every opportunity to increase transparency throughout the parcel journey to continue to enhance the customer experience, and SafePlace Photo plus geo-fencing will help us and our clients to achieve this.\"",[11858],{"start":32,"end":11859,"type":1324},409,{"type":126,"text":11861,"spans":11862},"Martijn de Lange, CEO of Hermes UK",[11863],{"start":32,"end":5726,"type":163},{"id":11865,"uid":11866,"url":11867,"type":50,"href":11868,"tags":11869,"first_publication_date":11870,"last_publication_date":11871,"slugs":11872,"linked_documents":11873,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":11874,"data":11875},"YhfhJBIAACkA14ky","hermes-trials-self-driving-robots-in-london","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-trials-self-driving-robots-in-london","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhfhJBIAACkA14ky%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T19:53:07+0000","2025-02-20T16:40:30+0000",[11866],[],[],{"title":11876,"category":8,"metaDescription":11877,"canonical":11878,"titleTag":11879,"featuredImage":11880,"publishedDate":11890,"slices":11891},"Hermes trials self-driving robots in London","We are proud to take part in an innovative testing programme of self-driving delivery robots. Read here to find out more about it.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-trials-self-driving-robots-in-london","Hermes Trials Self-Driving Robots in London | Evri",{"dimensions":11881,"alt":11882,"copyright":8,"url":11883,"id":11884,"edit":11885,"thumbnail":11886},{"width":65,"height":865},"A customer is standing in the doorway of their home holding their parcel and smiling for the photo.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XpoZbqstJ9-Wbe_EVRI_LOCATION_02_1616.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6XpoZbqstJ9-Wbe",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":11887,"alt":11882,"copyright":8,"url":11888,"id":11884,"edit":11889},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XpoZbqstJ9-Wbe_EVRI_LOCATION_02_1616.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2017-04-07",[11892],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":11893,"primary":11895,"id":11336,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[11894],{},{"content":11896},[11897,11900,11903,11906,11909,11912,11917],{"type":126,"text":11898,"spans":11899},"Hermes, the consumer delivery specialist, is launching an innovative testing programme for the use of self-driving delivery robots in London. In partnership with Starship Technologies, Hermes will soon trial a number of parcel collections in the London borough of Southwark.",[],{"type":126,"text":11901,"spans":11902},"This latest trial follows on from a project which has seen Hermes Germany and Starship Technologies test parcel delivery by robot in the Ottensen, Volksdorf and Grindel suburbs of Hamburg. Starting last August, three robots were deployed on the streets of the German city.",[],{"type":126,"text":11904,"spans":11905},"Hermes will use the testing period to better understand how the robots could enhance the company’s ability to offer an increased range of on-demand solutions in the future, as part of its ongoing commitment to providing value-added services. Initially, the trial will allow the delivery firm to offer limited thirty-minute time slots for the collection of parcels, either for items being returned to retailers, or for items being sent by small businesses or consumers via myHermes. Moving forward, the robots could offer Hermes greater scheduling and tracking capabilities.",[],{"type":126,"text":11907,"spans":11908},"The self-driving delivery robots offer a viable alternative to drones, especially in highly developed cities, towns and suburbs where strict aviation laws are in constant operation. Each vehicle is 55cm high by 70cm long and incorporates a secured compartment where parcels with a maximum weight of 10KG can be transported, accessible to consumers via a link generated by a smartphone app. They have six wheels and can travel at speeds up to 4mph per hour.",[],{"type":126,"text":11910,"spans":11911},"The robots can be used within a 2 mile radius from a control centre, where the vehicles are loaded and charged. The aim is for the robots to be 99% autonomous in the future, and can always be connected to a human operator via the internet and GPS. In the future, one operator can monitor several robots at the same time and can also take control of the robots if required.",[],{"type":126,"text":11913,"spans":11914},"\"Starship Technologies is a highly innovative and pioneering firm. We are extremely pleased to utilise their expertise to explore exciting new ways that will further strengthen our portfolio of services and offer greater choice and convenience for customers. We can already see first-hand the success they’ve had with food deliveries in London, and we are excited to team up with them in a bid to revolutionise the home delivery marketplace.\"",[11915],{"start":32,"end":11916,"type":1324},442,{"type":126,"text":11918,"spans":11919},"Carole Woodhead, CEO of Hermes",[11920],{"start":32,"end":2883,"type":163},{"id":11922,"uid":11923,"url":11924,"type":50,"href":11925,"tags":11926,"first_publication_date":11927,"last_publication_date":11928,"slugs":11929,"linked_documents":11930,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":11931,"data":11932},"YhfgdBIAACsA14Xp","hermes-uk-and-ford-trial-pedestrian-couriers-in-london","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-uk-and-ford-trial-pedestrian-couriers-in-london","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhfgdBIAACsA14Xp%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T19:48:35+0000","2025-02-21T09:37:17+0000",[11923],[],[],{"title":11933,"category":8,"metaDescription":11934,"canonical":11935,"titleTag":11936,"featuredImage":11937,"publishedDate":11943,"slices":11944},"Hermes UK and Ford trial pedestrian couriers in London","We're partnering with Ford to trial pedestrian couriers in London! Find out more in our latest blog post.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-uk-and-ford-trial-pedestrian-couriers-in-london","Hermes UK and Ford Trial Pedestrian Couriers in London | Evri",{"dimensions":11938,"alt":7264,"copyright":8,"url":7265,"id":7266,"edit":11939,"thumbnail":11940},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":11941,"alt":7264,"copyright":8,"url":7270,"id":7266,"edit":11942},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2021-02-08",[11945],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":11946,"primary":11948,"id":11336,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[11947],{},{"content":11949},[11950,11953,11956,11959,11962,11967,11971,11975],{"type":126,"text":11951,"spans":11952},"Hermes UK, the leading consumer delivery company, has teamed up with vehicle manufacturing giant Ford, to pilot a more sustainable courier service in central London designed to support cleaner air and clearer roads through a unique set-up of delivery vans, pedestrian couriers (porters) and smart software.",[],{"type":126,"text":11954,"spans":11955},"The trial involves delivery vans bringing full vehicle loads of parcels into the Capital where unique software identifies suitable, safe locations for the drivers to park. Each van is met there by a number of couriers who unload parcels onto trollies and then deliver them to nearby delivery addresses. The vans then return to collect the next load from the depot. The initiative is designed to reduce the number of vans on the road and in doing so help tackle air pollution and ease congestion and was developed in a collaboration between Ford and the Hermes Innovation Lab.",[],{"type":126,"text":11957,"spans":11958},"During the trial, parcels were delivered more quickly than when one courier drove to each address. In fact, the team of eight pedestrian couriers and two vans delivered the same number of parcels as six vans making conventional doorstep deliveries. The couriers employed in the trial also came from hospitality roles in the capital who were unable to work due to lockdown. Initially focussed on three postcodes in Central London, Ford and Hermes will now explore extending the pilot to further across the UK.",[],{"type":126,"text":11960,"spans":11961},"Ford’s intelligent logistics software, identifies safe, convenient locations for the handovers to pedestrian couriers and coordinates those teams as they make deliveries to a mix of high-rise, business and residential buildings. The couriers use a simple smartphone app that advises the location of the van and shows the most efficient routes and itinerary to deliver the parcels. The app integrates with Hermes’ tracking systems to ensure customers have real-time visibility of the status of their deliveries.",[],{"type":126,"text":11963,"spans":11964},"\"We’re exploring new delivery initiatives that can reduce emissions for the final mile delivery as part of our commitment to sustainability and getting ahead of future legislation in cities, such as Ultra Low Emissions Zones. In addition, this operating model is easy to scale up to meet the increasing demand for home delivery and opens up the courier work for a whole new workforce who no longer need to drive or own a vehicle and want to stay active.\"",[11965],{"start":32,"end":11966,"type":1324},454,{"type":126,"text":11968,"spans":11969},"Carl Lyon, COO at Hermes UK",[11970],{"start":32,"end":3553,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":11972,"spans":11973},"\"Being smarter about how we deliver parcels in the future will enable carriers to operate more sustainably and efficiently – while delivering a better experience for customers. Our trials with Hermes have shown how multi-modal deliveries can be scalable and effective, even during peak times of the year\"",[11974],{"start":32,"end":5423,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":11976,"spans":11977},"Tom Thompson, Project Lead at Ford Mobility",[11978],{"start":32,"end":183,"type":163},[11980,12037,12088,12138,12213,12268,12326,12397,12450,12505,12550,12664],{"id":11981,"uid":11982,"url":11983,"type":50,"href":11984,"tags":11985,"first_publication_date":11986,"last_publication_date":11987,"slugs":11988,"linked_documents":11989,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":11990,"data":11991},"Yhfe8RIAACkA138M","hermes-uk-and-gmb-union-agree-further-benefits-for-self-employed-plus-couriers","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-uk-and-gmb-union-agree-further-benefits-for-self-employed-plus-couriers","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22Yhfe8RIAACkA138M%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T19:45:29+0000","2025-02-21T09:39:51+0000",[11982],[],[],{"title":11992,"category":8,"metaDescription":11993,"canonical":11994,"titleTag":11995,"featuredImage":11996,"publishedDate":12006,"slices":12007},"Hermes UK and GMB union agree further benefits for self employed plus couriers","Read our latest blog post to find out the benefits Hermes and GMB Union have negotiated for self-employed couriers.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-uk-and-gmb-union-agree-further-benefits-for-self-employed-plus-couriers","Hermes UK and GMB Union Agree Further Benefits for Self Employed Plus Couriers | Evri",{"dimensions":11997,"alt":11998,"copyright":8,"url":11999,"id":12000,"edit":12001,"thumbnail":12002},{"width":65,"height":865},"A female courier hands a parcel to a recipient. They are both examining the parcel.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TloZbqstJ9-T_W_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9928.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6TloZbqstJ9-T_W",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":12003,"alt":11998,"copyright":8,"url":12004,"id":12000,"edit":12005},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TloZbqstJ9-T_W_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9928.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2021-03-25",[12008],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":12009,"primary":12011,"id":11336,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[12010],{},{"content":12012},[12013,12016,12019,12022,12025,12029,12033],{"type":126,"text":12014,"spans":12015},"Hermes UK, the leading consumer delivery company, and the GMB Union have announced that they have concluded their annual negotiations which have resulted in further benefits for all SE+ (self- employed plus) couriers. It follows the ground-breaking deal in 2019, the first of its kind designed to support the rights of self-employed workers operating in the so called ‘gig economy’, which included paid holiday and guaranteed minimum payment rates for SE+ couriers and the ability for the GMB to secure further benefits on their behalf.",[],{"type":126,"text":12017,"spans":12018},"Under the terms of the new deal, effective from Saturday 27 March 2021, all SE+ couriers will benefit from a range of increased payments for the services that they provide, including increased rates for parcels collections and additional incentives.",[],{"type":126,"text":12020,"spans":12021},"The option to become an SE+ courier has been available at Hermes since 2019 and it is estimated that by the end of June 2021 over 70% will have made the decision to move – around 20,000 couriers. Their continued self-employed status means that they are still able to  maintain the flexibility that so many couriers treasure, fitting in their deliveries alongside their other (often family) commitments. ",[],{"type":126,"text":12023,"spans":12024},"\"When we announced our deal in 2019 we committed to continuing to develop our support for the rights of self- employed workers. Independent research shows that over three quarters of our SE+ couriers believe that their health and wellbeing has improved as a result of having paid holidays. This is particularly important given the challenging events of the past year where they have played a vital role in ensuring that people have been able to get essential items delivered safely.\"",[],{"type":126,"text":12026,"spans":12027},"Martijn de Lange, CEO at Hermes UK",[12028],{"start":32,"end":5726,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":12030,"spans":12031},"\"Hermes is continuing to show other companies that looking after those who work for you is not just the right thing to do, it’s good for business. Couriers now have a real voice in their workplace and the right to take holidays and the right to guaranteed pay. These are basic rights that the GMB has fought hard for on behalf of members and the continuing evolvement of this deal shows the gig economy doesn’t have to rip off workers and that exploitative employers need to sit up and take notice.\"",[12032],{"start":32,"end":1573,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":12034,"spans":12035},"Mick Rix, GMB National Officer",[12036],{"start":32,"end":2883,"type":163},{"id":12038,"uid":12039,"url":12040,"type":50,"href":12041,"tags":12042,"first_publication_date":12043,"last_publication_date":12044,"slugs":12045,"linked_documents":12047,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":12048,"data":12049},"Yhfd7BIAACsA13pW","hermes-uk-announces-last-dates-for-christmas-deliveries","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-uk-announces-last-dates-for-christmas-deliveries","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22Yhfd7BIAACsA13pW%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T19:38:48+0000","2025-02-20T16:17:08+0000",[12046],"hermes-uk-announces-last-dates-for-christmas-deliveries-2021",[],[],{"title":12050,"category":8,"metaDescription":12051,"canonical":12052,"titleTag":12053,"featuredImage":12054,"publishedDate":12060,"slices":12061},"Hermes UK announces last dates for Christmas deliveries 2021","Read this blog to find out the last festive postal dates of 2021 to ensure all your presents are delivered in time for Christmas.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-uk-announces-last-dates-for-christmas-deliveries","Hermes UK Announces Last Dates for Christmas Deliveries 2021 | Evri",{"dimensions":12055,"alt":8606,"copyright":8,"url":8607,"id":8608,"edit":12056,"thumbnail":12057},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":4163,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":12058,"alt":8606,"copyright":8,"url":8612,"id":8608,"edit":12059},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":8614,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2021-11-05",[12062],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":12063,"primary":12065,"id":11336,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[12064],{},{"content":12066},[12067,12070,12073,12077,12081,12085],{"type":126,"text":12068,"spans":12069},"Hermes, one of the UK’s leading consumer delivery specialists, has announced the last recommended posting days to ensure presents are delivered in time for Christmas 2021.  ",[],{"type":126,"text":12071,"spans":12072},"They are:",[],{"type":109,"text":12074,"spans":12075},"Monday 20th December. For customers who want a Hermes courier to collect a parcel from them.",[12076],{"start":32,"end":2234,"type":163},{"type":109,"text":12078,"spans":12079},"Tuesday 21st December (12 noon). For customers sending presents from Hermes’ nationwide network of ParcelShops or lockers, using the standard service.",[12080],{"start":32,"end":3455,"type":163},{"type":109,"text":12082,"spans":12083},"Wednesday 22nd December (12 noon). For customers sending presents from one of Hermes’ nationwide network of ParcelShops or lockers, using the next day service.",[12084],{"start":32,"end":5726,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":12086,"spans":12087},"The company has also urged customers to let their recipients know that there is a parcel on the way by including the recipients email address when sending a parcel. This is particularly important when posting items close to the last dates, so that recipients can receive notifications and arrange to be available for delivery or divert their parcel to a safe place, neighbour or ParcelShop.",[],{"id":12089,"uid":12090,"url":12091,"type":50,"href":12092,"tags":12093,"first_publication_date":12094,"last_publication_date":12095,"slugs":12096,"linked_documents":12097,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":12098,"data":12099},"YhfcyxIAACgA13Uv","hermes-uk-appoints-chief-transformation-officer-as-its-record-growth-continues","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-uk-appoints-chief-transformation-officer-as-its-record-growth-continues","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhfcyxIAACgA13Uv%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T19:34:22+0000","2025-02-21T09:32:06+0000",[12090],[],[],{"title":12100,"category":8,"metaDescription":12101,"canonical":12102,"titleTag":12103,"featuredImage":12104,"publishedDate":12114,"slices":12115},"Hermes UK appoints Chief Transformation Officer as its record growth continues","We're pleased to announce that Fash Sawyerr has joined Hermes as Chief Transformation Officer. Read all about it in this post.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-uk-appoints-chief-transformation-officer-as-its-record-growth-continues","Hermes UK Appoints Chief Transformation Officer as its Record Growth Continues | Evri",{"dimensions":12105,"alt":12106,"copyright":8,"url":12107,"id":12108,"edit":12109,"thumbnail":12110},{"width":65,"height":865},"An Evri courier is entering the rear of a house through a side gate. He is carrying two parcels to drop off.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdFpbqstJ9-ini_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8021.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6zdFpbqstJ9-ini",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":12111,"alt":12106,"copyright":8,"url":12112,"id":12108,"edit":12113},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdFpbqstJ9-ini_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8021.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2021-01-14",[12116],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":12117,"primary":12119,"id":11336,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[12118],{},{"content":12120},[12121,12124,12127,12130,12135],{"type":126,"text":12122,"spans":12123},"Hermes, one of the UK’s leading consumer delivery companies, has appointed an experienced Chief Transformation Officer to support the business in the next stage of its development.",[],{"type":126,"text":12125,"spans":12126},"Fash Sawyerr will join the Hermes UK main board, reporting directly to CEO Martijn de Lange, and brings a proven track record in helping companies organise themselves for future growth. Fash joins from Anchorage Capital, where he was a Managing Director in their Portfolio Group, working with the fund’s European portfolio companies to drive ambitious transformation programmes. Prior to this, he spent eight years at Actis LLP, a London-based private equity fund specialising in emerging markets.",[],{"type":126,"text":12128,"spans":12129},"Fash’s remit involves developing a transformation portfolio to focus on business-wide initiatives that will include driving process improvements, spearheading a new ESG strategy, entering new markets and creating new products designed to support Hermes’ growing numbers of retail and SME clients. This appointment follows that of Tony De Nunzio CBE, who has joined Hermes as non-executive Chairman to the Shareholder Board.",[],{"type":126,"text":12131,"spans":12132},"\"My Directors and I are pleased to welcome Fash on board, and we’re also proud to be attracting such a strong calibre of talent to our team. We have achieved momentous growth from £350m turnover seven years ago to what will be almost £1.5bn this year, so it’s vital that we continue to make the right investments in our business. Our parcel volumes have soared from 400m last year to over 600m this year and Fash will help us to think a bit differently, bring a fresh perspective and will really complement the skillsets that we already have in the business.\"",[12133],{"start":32,"end":12134,"type":1324},559,{"type":126,"text":12026,"spans":12136},[12137],{"start":32,"end":5726,"type":163},{"id":12139,"uid":12140,"url":12141,"type":50,"href":12142,"tags":12143,"first_publication_date":12144,"last_publication_date":12145,"slugs":12146,"linked_documents":12147,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":12148,"data":12149},"Yhe5xBIAACsA1tQj","hermes-takes-the-reins-on-christmas-charity-deliveries","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-takes-the-reins-on-christmas-charity-deliveries","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22Yhe5xBIAACsA1tQj%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T17:00:59+0000","2025-02-21T08:20:04+0000",[12140],[],[],{"title":12150,"category":8,"metaDescription":12151,"canonical":12152,"titleTag":12153,"featuredImage":12154,"publishedDate":12156,"slices":12157},"Hermes takes the reins on Christmas charity deliveries","Read about our partnership with national charity CHICKS to carry out a fun-filled festive campaign to deliver treasured Christmas presents to children in need.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-takes-the-reins-on-christmas-charity-deliveries","Hermes Takes the Reins on Christmas Charity Deliveries | Evri - The New Hermes",{"thumbnail":12155},{},"2018-12-10",[12158,12185],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":12159,"primary":12161,"id":12183,"slice_type":12184,"slice_label":8},[12160],{},{"Image":12162},{"dimensions":12163,"alt":6420,"copyright":8,"url":12166,"id":6422,"edit":12167,"tablet":12169,"mobile":12176},{"width":12164,"height":12165},1200,280,"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6y_8JbqstJ9-iMt_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9442.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1776,8192,1911&w=1200&h=280",{"x":32,"y":12168,"zoom":33,"background":71},1776,{"dimensions":12170,"alt":6420,"copyright":8,"url":12173,"id":6422,"edit":12174},{"width":12171,"height":12172},704,240,"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6y_8JbqstJ9-iMt_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9442.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1336,8192,2793&w=704&h=240",{"x":32,"y":12175,"zoom":33,"background":71},1336,{"dimensions":12177,"alt":6420,"copyright":8,"url":12180,"id":6422,"edit":12181},{"width":12178,"height":12179},343,160,"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6y_8JbqstJ9-iMt_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9442.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,821,8192,3821&w=343&h=160",{"x":32,"y":12182,"zoom":33,"background":71},821,"photo_block$9a474543-bb3d-4b0d-ad4d-2078d39c70b7","photo_block",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":12186,"primary":12188,"id":11336,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[12187],{},{"content":12189},[12190,12193,12196,12201,12205,12209],{"type":126,"text":12191,"spans":12192},"Hermes, the consumer delivery specialist, has teamed up with national charity CHICKS to play a vital role in a fun-filled festive campaign to deliver treasured Christmas presents to children in need. It was all hands on deck (the halls) as enthusiastic employees at the company’s head office in Morley carefully wrapped over 450 presents.",[],{"type":126,"text":12194,"spans":12195},"More than 60 colleagues scored, cut and folded their way through 100 rolls of wrapping paper and 50 rolls of sticky tape as they took part in the ‘wrap-a-thon’ last Friday (14th December). The delivery firm will now take the reins and collect pre-wrapped presents from other participating companies, before sending all of the gifts to those deprived children chosen by the charity.",[],{"type":126,"text":12197,"spans":12198},"\"We have really enjoyed supporting CHICKS this year and our team of employees were more than happy to donate their time to wrap these gifts for children in need. Last year we made sure 100% of deliveries for CHICKS were completed before Christmas Eve – and it is our top priority to repeat that feat – even if it means sharing that chimney with Father Christmas himself.\" ",[12199],{"start":32,"end":12200,"type":1324},372,{"type":126,"text":12202,"spans":12203},"Martijn De Lange, CEO of Hermes",[12204],{"start":32,"end":4070,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":12206,"spans":12207},"\"We are very grateful for the support Hermes has provided with wrapping and delivering our Christmas presents. For many of the children we work with at CHICKS, these presents will be the only ones they receive this Christmas. The reality of their lives is queuing at food banks and electricity running out on the meter, let alone imagining any gifts. Hermes has therefore enabled hundreds of children living in incredibly difficult circumstances across the UK to wake up on Christmas morning with a smile on their faces. Thank you Hermes!\" ",[12208],{"start":32,"end":489,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":12210,"spans":12211},"Mabel Duncombe, Partnerships Manager at CHICKS",[12212],{"start":32,"end":278,"type":163},{"id":12214,"uid":12215,"url":12216,"type":50,"href":12217,"tags":12218,"first_publication_date":12219,"last_publication_date":12220,"slugs":12221,"linked_documents":12222,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":12223,"data":12224},"Yhe4lxIAACwA1s2o","hermes-to-build-largest-distribution-hub-in-europe","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-to-build-largest-distribution-hub-in-europe","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22Yhe4lxIAACwA1s2o%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T16:56:13+0000","2023-03-21T14:56:38+0000",[12215],[],[],{"title":12225,"category":8,"metaDescription":12226,"canonical":12227,"titleTag":12228,"featuredImage":12229,"publishedDate":12238,"slices":12239},"Hermes to build largest distribution hub in Europe","Read our latest blog post to find about our plans to build the largest distribution hub in Europe.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-to-build-largest-distribution-hub-in-europe","Hermes to Build Largest Distribution Hub in Europe | Evri",{"dimensions":12230,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":12231,"id":12232,"edit":12233,"thumbnail":12234},{"width":65,"height":11413},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fe63aee59-96e1-4536-93eb-aa2ce9bfd164_new+depot+image+2.jpg?auto=compress,format&rect=0,0,1280,959&w=960&h=719","YhdyHBIAACkA1fnx",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":11417,"background":34},{"dimensions":12235,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":12236,"id":12232,"edit":12237},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fe63aee59-96e1-4536-93eb-aa2ce9bfd164_new+depot+image+2.jpg?auto=compress,format&rect=0,177,1280,607&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":7499,"zoom":11422,"background":34},"2020-02-11",[12240],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":12241,"primary":12243,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[12242],{},{"content":12244},[12245,12248,12251,12254,12257,12260,12265],{"type":126,"text":12246,"spans":12247},"Hermes, the consumer delivery specialist, is to build a state-of-the-art automated parcel distribution hub located in Barnsley, near Sheffield.",[],{"type":126,"text":12249,"spans":12250},"Due for completion in 2022, the £60 million development will be the largest of its kind in Europe and will create around 1,300 new jobs in the area. Up to 800 people will work on site during shifts.  ",[],{"type":126,"text":12252,"spans":12253},"The 363,000sq ft facility, named Colossus, will initially process 1.3 million parcels daily; boosting the company’s overall capacity to 3.8 million a day. To future-proof and prepare for expected growth, further tiers will be added to the hub in coming years.",[],{"type":126,"text":12255,"spans":12256},"CNG vehicles will be based at the hub and there will be provision for electric cars. Colossus is strategically located near the motorway, close to several of Hermes’ retail customers’ distribution sites. This means that later cut off times for collections will be provided.",[],{"type":126,"text":12258,"spans":12259},"Meanwhile, further investment across Hermes’ network is also being planned to further support growth. This includes investment at the firm’s Nottingham and EuroCentral depots this year, adding automation and capacity to process an additional 280,000 parcels to the network annually.",[],{"type":126,"text":12261,"spans":12262},"\"The online shopping boom shows no sign of slowing down and we have just experienced our biggest Christmas period to date, handling in excess of 49.1 million parcels during December 2019 alone – significantly up from 39.5 million in December 2018. “Our continued investment to strengthen our network and infrastructure across the UK is laying the foundations for future growth, creating more employment opportunities and confirming our position as an industry leader.\" ",[12263],{"start":32,"end":12264,"type":1324},469,{"type":126,"text":11684,"spans":12266},[12267],{"start":32,"end":4070,"type":163},{"id":12269,"uid":12270,"url":12271,"type":50,"href":12272,"tags":12273,"first_publication_date":12274,"last_publication_date":12275,"slugs":12276,"linked_documents":12277,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":12278,"data":12279},"Yhe3sBIAACgA1smP","hermes-to-expand-depot-network-creating-over-100-jobs","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-to-expand-depot-network-creating-over-100-jobs","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22Yhe3sBIAACgA1smP%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T16:52:06+0000","2025-02-21T09:10:27+0000",[12270],[],[],{"title":12280,"category":8,"metaDescription":12281,"canonical":12282,"titleTag":12283,"featuredImage":12284,"publishedDate":12290,"slices":12291},"Hermes to expand depot network creating over 100 jobs","We're really happy that we can offer over 100 new jobs in Nottingham, following the opening of a new depot. Read more about our investment in this blog post.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-to-expand-depot-network-creating-over-100-jobs","Hermes to Expand Depot Network Creating Over 100 Jobs | Evri",{"dimensions":12285,"alt":6624,"copyright":8,"url":6625,"id":6626,"edit":12286,"thumbnail":12287},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":12288,"alt":6624,"copyright":8,"url":6630,"id":6626,"edit":12289},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2020-06-09",[12292],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":12293,"primary":12295,"id":12325,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[12294],{},{"content":12296},[12297,12300,12303,12306,12310,12314,12319,12323],{"type":126,"text":12298,"spans":12299},"Hermes UK, the leading consumer delivery company, has announced it is to open a new depot in Nottingham; creating over 100 new jobs in the area. It forms part of the company’s commitment to continuing to invest in its infrastructure to ensure it is able to continue to support the growth of online shopping.",[],{"type":126,"text":12301,"spans":12302},"Ideally located just off junction 26 of the M1, the 75,719 sq ft building is expected to process more than 100,000 parcels daily in its first year and has the capacity to process up to 120,000 a day. It is due to open on 1st June 2020, one month early, in order to support the increased volumes resulting from lockdown and will operate in line with the company’s strict Covid 19 operating measures.",[],{"type":126,"text":12304,"spans":12305},"To provide further capacity during the pandemic Hermes is also to open a new, dedicated returns centre at its site in Rugby which can process in the region of 120k parcels per day and is also investing in upgrading its facility in Nuneaton which is normally only used during the peak Christmas season.",[],{"type":126,"text":12307,"spans":12308},"\"During these unprecedented times we are seeing a new wave of adoption of online shopping as it becomes the core route for people to get their essentials and also send parcels as a way of connecting with their loved ones. This has generated an increase in parcel volumes and a demand for additional capacity and it is therefore imperative that we continue to make the right strategic investments in the right locations. This will also create new jobs and provide economic stimulation to these regions as the UK faces challenging economic times.\" ",[12309],{"start":32,"end":5414,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":12311,"spans":12312},"Jon Ormond, Operations Director – Hubs & Depots at Hermes",[12313],{"start":32,"end":3684,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":12315,"spans":12316},"\"We were pleased to work with Hermes to complete this transaction at Panattoni Park Nottingham. Hermes’ outline requirement was for a building of this size in this location. We were able to work with their team to adapt the building, which we had developed on a speculative basis, to suit their exact needs. The additional works required providing further yard space with four more level access doors on the end elevation of the building to meet Hermes requirements.\" ",[12317],{"start":32,"end":12318,"type":1324},468,{"type":126,"text":12320,"spans":12321},"Simon Jenkins, Development Director at Panattoni",[12322],{"start":32,"end":8554,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":12324},[],"rich_text$8e2074bd-94e1-4a55-b5e5-72fbb4931084",{"id":12327,"uid":12328,"url":12329,"type":50,"href":12330,"tags":12331,"first_publication_date":12332,"last_publication_date":12333,"slugs":12334,"linked_documents":12335,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":12336,"data":12337},"Yhe2QxIAACwA1sMN","hermes-to-launch-unique-amazon-echo-tracking-solution","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-to-launch-unique-amazon-echo-tracking-solution","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22Yhe2QxIAACwA1sMN%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T16:46:09+0000","2025-02-20T16:39:06+0000",[12328],[],[],{"title":12338,"category":8,"metaDescription":12339,"canonical":12340,"titleTag":12341,"featuredImage":12342,"publishedDate":12352,"slices":12353},"Hermes to launch unique Amazon Echo tracking solution","Read this blog post and find out how we've became the first parcel company in the UK to fully integrate tracking with Amazon Echo smart devices.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-to-launch-unique-amazon-echo-tracking-solution","Hermes to Launch Unique Amazon Echo Tracking Solution | Evri",{"dimensions":12343,"alt":12344,"copyright":8,"url":12345,"id":12346,"edit":12347,"thumbnail":12348},{"width":65,"height":865},"An Evri Courier navigating to their next delivery using their car sat-nav","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDfpbqstJ9-cfS_EVRI_LOCATION_04_3894.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6pDfpbqstJ9-cfS",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":12349,"alt":12344,"copyright":8,"url":12350,"id":12346,"edit":12351},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDfpbqstJ9-cfS_EVRI_LOCATION_04_3894.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2017-02-23",[12354],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":12355,"primary":12357,"id":12396,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[12356],{},{"content":12358},[12359,12362,12365,12368,12371,12375,12379,12382,12386,12389],{"type":126,"text":12360,"spans":12361},"Hermes, the consumer delivery specialist, has become the first parcel company in the UK to fully integrate its end-to-end tracking solution with Amazon’s line of Echo smart speakers. Consumers will be able use voice commands via Alexa-enabled devices, such as an Amazon Echo or Echo Dot, to hear updates on where their parcel is.",[],{"type":126,"text":12363,"spans":12364},"This unique functionality is part of the company’s ongoing commitment to providing retailers with an increasingly innovative portfolio of services and solutions, as well as further enhancing the overall delivery experience provided to the UK’s growing number of online shoppers.",[],{"type":126,"text":12366,"spans":12367},"Owners of the Amazon devices, powered by the company's digital assistant Alexa, will be able to track their parcels by enabling the specific skill on the Alexa app. Consumers will receive updates on those deliveries being carried out by Hermes, on behalf of the UK’s best-known retailers and brands, as well as those sent via myHermes. This new functionality will also allow online shoppers to track any items they have returned to a retailer.",[],{"type":126,"text":12369,"spans":12370},"The integration was engineered within the company's dedicated Innovation Lab in the centre of Leeds, which is specifically tasked with developing a range of forward-thinking products that will change the delivery landscape.",[],{"type":126,"text":12372,"spans":12373},"\"An important part of our remit is to explore new and exciting technologies that will allow us to enrich the delivery experience. Digital assistants such as Siri, Cortana and Alexa have been developed to drive increased convenience, and our research tells us that there will be a future shift away from screen interactions in favour of conversational interface technology. We are thrilled with our initial release, but we are already experimenting with new interactions and functionality that we will be releasing throughout this year.\" ",[12374],{"start":32,"end":1278,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":12376,"spans":12377},"David Turner, Head of Digital Strategy & Technology Innovation,",[12378],{"start":32,"end":3441,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":12380,"spans":12381},"In addition to this pioneering tracking feature, the Innovation Lab continues to work on developing additional features as part of the integration. This will include the ability to ask Alexa where the nearest myHermes ParcelShop is located, set your delivery preferences such as safe place location and preferred neighbours and schedule a courier collection.",[],{"type":126,"text":12383,"spans":12384},"\"It remains absolutely vital that we continue to push the innovative boundaries to create additional value for our clients and the ever-demanding Millennial Generation. We are excited to see what further innovations 2017 will bring.\" ",[12385],{"start":32,"end":5956,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":11918,"spans":12387},[12388],{"start":32,"end":2883,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":12390,"spans":12391},"If you would like to find out more about how your customers can benefit from tracking their parcels via Amazon Echo contact us.",[12392],{"start":12393,"end":5287,"type":279,"data":12394},116,{"link_type":281,"url":12395},"mailto:sales@evri.com?subject=Amazon%20Echo%20tracking%20solution","rich_text$38a36e50-1cf4-4676-a379-2c9f34e0365c",{"id":12398,"uid":12399,"url":12400,"type":50,"href":12401,"tags":12402,"first_publication_date":12403,"last_publication_date":12404,"slugs":12405,"linked_documents":12406,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":12407,"data":12408},"Yhe1YxIAACoA1r75","hermes-uk-appoints-new-director-of-depots-as-parcel-volumes-remain-high","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-uk-appoints-new-director-of-depots-as-parcel-volumes-remain-high","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22Yhe1YxIAACoA1r75%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T16:42:15+0000","2025-02-21T09:41:02+0000",[12399],[],[],{"title":12409,"category":8,"metaDescription":12410,"canonical":12411,"titleTag":12412,"featuredImage":12413,"publishedDate":12419,"slices":12420},"Hermes UK appoints new Director of Depots as parcel volumes remain high","We're pleased to announce that John Clark has joined Hermes as Director of Depots. Read all about his appointment in this blog.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-uk-appoints-new-director-of-depots-as-parcel-volumes-remain-high","Hermes UK Appoints New Director of Depots as Parcel Volumes Remain High | Evri",{"dimensions":12414,"alt":9075,"copyright":8,"url":9076,"id":9077,"edit":12415,"thumbnail":12416},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":12417,"alt":9075,"copyright":8,"url":9081,"id":9077,"edit":12418},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2021-04-09",[12421],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":12422,"primary":12424,"id":12449,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[12423],{},{"content":12425},[12426,12429,12432,12437,12440,12445],{"type":126,"text":12427,"spans":12428},"Hermes UK, one of the leading consumer delivery companies, has appointed a supply chain professional with a strong track record of delivering results and change to the new role of Director of Depots. John Clark has joined the senior team with a remit to support the continuing growth of the business. whilst ensuring that high service standards are maintained as Hermes continues to deliver more than 640m parcels this year.",[],{"type":126,"text":12430,"spans":12431},"John joins from the Culina Group where he was Operational Excellence and Procurement Director and has previously held senior roles at Argos, Bibby, DHL and the NHS Supply Chain. In his new role he will report directly into Carl Lyon, COO and be responsible for all depot operations.",[],{"type":126,"text":12433,"spans":12434},"\"Our ambitions for growth and service levels are both exciting and challenging, so it’s vital that we continue to build our senior team with the right skills and expertise. John’s experience of delivering operational excellence and transformation within major UK organisations makes him a great addition our team.\" ",[12435],{"start":32,"end":12436,"type":1324},315,{"type":126,"text":11968,"spans":12438},[12439],{"start":32,"end":3553,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":12441,"spans":12442},"\"Hermes is leading the way in the sector through its innovation and commitment to exceeding the expectations of its retail clients and their customers at this exceptionally busy time. I’m excited to be joining a company with a great proposition for customers that is well positioned to continue to grow in a vibrant market sector.\" ",[12443],{"start":32,"end":12444,"type":1324},332,{"type":126,"text":12446,"spans":12447},"John Clark, Director of Depots at Hermes UK",[12448],{"start":32,"end":183,"type":163},"rich_text$7eb8792d-801e-48a3-b688-0b5ab7ba8a19",{"id":12451,"uid":12452,"url":12453,"type":50,"href":12454,"tags":12455,"first_publication_date":12456,"last_publication_date":12457,"slugs":12458,"linked_documents":12459,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":12460,"data":12461},"Yhe0vRIAACoA1rv_","hermes-uk-appoints-tony-de-nunzio-cbe-as-chairman-following-completion-of-investment-deal-by-advent-international","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-uk-appoints-tony-de-nunzio-cbe-as-chairman-following-completion-of-investment-deal-by-advent-international","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22Yhe0vRIAACoA1rv_%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T16:39:38+0000","2025-02-21T09:20:42+0000",[12452],[],[],{"title":12462,"category":8,"metaDescription":12463,"canonical":12464,"titleTag":12465,"featuredImage":12466,"publishedDate":12475,"slices":12476},"Hermes UK appoints Tony De Nunzio CBE as chairman following completion of investment deal by Advent International","We're pleased to announce that Tony De Nunzio CBE has joined Hermes as non-executive Chairman. Read all about his appointment in this blog.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-uk-appoints-tony-de-nunzio-cbe-as-chairman-following-completion-of-investment-deal-by-advent-international","Hermes UK Appoints Tony De Nunzio CBE as Chairman Following Completion of Investment Deal by Advent International | Evri",{"dimensions":12467,"alt":10292,"copyright":8,"url":12468,"id":12469,"edit":12470,"thumbnail":12471},{"width":65,"height":865},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ69xVJbqstJ9-pUx_EVRI_LOCATION_01_0190.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z69xVJbqstJ9-pUx",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":12472,"alt":10292,"copyright":8,"url":12473,"id":12469,"edit":12474},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ69xVJbqstJ9-pUx_EVRI_LOCATION_01_0190.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2020-12-11",[12477],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":12478,"primary":12480,"id":12504,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[12479],{},{"content":12481},[12482,12485,12488,12492,12496,12501],{"type":126,"text":12483,"spans":12484},"Tony De Nunzio CBE has been appointed as non-executive Chairman to the Shareholder Board at leading consumer delivery company, Hermes UK.  He joins with a remit to help guide the company through its next stage of growth and development. His appointment follows the conclusion of a significant investment deal by Advent International (‘Advent’), one of the largest and most experienced global private equity firms, that was announced earlier this year.",[],{"type":126,"text":12486,"spans":12487},"Tony has extensive experience in the European retail and consumer goods sectors as a finance professional, CEO and chairman. This includes over 25 years in the retail industry both in the UK and internationally, covering the food, fashion, department store, DIY and speciality retail sectors. He was previously President and Chief Executive of Asda, non-executive Director of Alliance Boots and Chairman of Pets at Home. He is currently Senior Independent Director of Dixons Carphone, a Senior Advisor to Kohlberg, Kravis, Roberts & Co and Chairman of the British Retail Consortium.",[],{"type":126,"text":12489,"spans":12490},"\"I am delighted to join Martijn and his team at this exciting time for Hermes UK. The company has a strong track record of serving retail clients and their customers and is a market leader in a fast-growing sector. They have a clear and ambitious strategy for growth and I look forward to helping them to achieve it.\" ",[12491],{"start":32,"end":9587,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":12493,"spans":12494},"Tony De Nunzio CBE",[12495],{"start":32,"end":587,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":12497,"spans":12498},"\"All of the Directors and I are very excited to have Tony on board and we look forward to him bringing his expertise to our growing business. It will be a privilege to work alongside someone with his experience and insight, which I know will be invaluable as we continue our journey.\" ",[12499],{"start":32,"end":12500,"type":1324},285,{"type":126,"text":12026,"spans":12502},[12503],{"start":32,"end":5726,"type":163},"rich_text$12c0606a-c568-422e-86ca-7224e2f8a9b6",{"id":12506,"uid":12507,"url":12508,"type":50,"href":12509,"tags":12510,"first_publication_date":12511,"last_publication_date":12512,"slugs":12513,"linked_documents":12514,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":12515,"data":12516},"Yhez_xIAACwA1rh3","hermes-pledges-200k-to-support-smes-using-its-apprenticeship-levy-funding","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-pledges-200k-to-support-smes-using-its-apprenticeship-levy-funding","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22Yhez_xIAACwA1rh3%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T16:36:20+0000","2025-02-20T16:20:54+0000",[12507],[],[],{"title":12517,"category":8,"metaDescription":12518,"canonical":12519,"titleTag":12520,"featuredImage":12521,"publishedDate":12531,"slices":12532},"Hermes pledges £200k to support SMES using its apprenticeship levy funding","Read our latest blog and learn how we're supporting SMEs with our apprenticeship funding scheme.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-pledges-200k-to-support-smes-using-its-apprenticeship-levy-funding","Hermes Pledges £200k to Support SMES Using its Apprenticeship Levy Funding | Evri",{"dimensions":12522,"alt":12523,"copyright":8,"url":12524,"id":12525,"edit":12526,"thumbnail":12527},{"width":65,"height":865},"An Evri Courier walking down the street in a residential area carrying two parcels","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6tf3pbqstJ9-e5e_EVRI_LOCATION_05_5973.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6tf3pbqstJ9-e5e",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":12528,"alt":12523,"copyright":8,"url":12529,"id":12525,"edit":12530},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6tf3pbqstJ9-e5e_EVRI_LOCATION_05_5973.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2021-09-20",[12533],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":12534,"primary":12536,"id":12549,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[12535],{},{"content":12537},[12538,12541,12544,12546],{"type":126,"text":12539,"spans":12540},"Hermes, one of the UK’s leading consumer delivery companies, has pledged over £200k of its apprenticeship levy funds to help support SMEs – the maximum amount it can in a year, under the government scheme.  This will enable other companies to take on new apprentices or upskill existing ones, providing a valuable post pandemic boost for their businesses.",[],{"type":126,"text":12542,"spans":12543},"To help identify suitable companies and ensure the funds are being spent efficiently, helping those that will benefit most, Hermes is working closely with Leeds City Council, West Midlands Combined Authority and Total People, one of the largest providers of apprenticeships and work-based learning in the North-West of England.",[],{"type":126,"text":10103,"spans":12545},[],{"type":126,"text":12547,"spans":12548},"Martijn de Lange, CEO at Hermes UK, said: “At Hermes, we are fortunate to already have strong apprenticeship and training schemes in place, so we have taken the decision to gift some of our levy to SMEs that will benefit from it. This year has presented many challenges for all businesses, but particularly SMEs, so we’re proud to be able to support them in training their future workforces and providing their employees with increased lifelong earning potential.”",[],"rich_text$80e4daa2-e99e-40ac-a6f4-c96b31359804",{"id":12551,"uid":12552,"url":12553,"type":50,"href":12554,"tags":12555,"first_publication_date":12556,"last_publication_date":12557,"slugs":12558,"linked_documents":12560,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":12561,"data":12562},"YheyrxIAACkA1rI3","hermes-uk-commits-to-electric-vehicles-for-the-road-ahead","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-uk-commits-to-electric-vehicles-for-the-road-ahead","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YheyrxIAACkA1rI3%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T16:30:49+0000","2025-02-20T16:19:19+0000",[12559],"hermes-commits-to-electric-vehicles-for-the-road-ahead",[],[],{"title":12563,"category":8,"metaDescription":12564,"canonical":12565,"titleTag":12566,"featuredImage":12567,"publishedDate":12573,"slices":12574},"Hermes commits to electric vehicles for the road ahead","Read this latest blog post as we discuss our commitment to an emissions free future by adding to our green fleet.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-uk-commits-to-electric-vehicles-for-the-road-ahead","Hermes Commits to Electric Vehicles for the Road Ahead | Evri",{"dimensions":12568,"alt":8851,"copyright":8,"url":8852,"id":8853,"edit":12569,"thumbnail":12570},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":12571,"alt":8851,"copyright":8,"url":8857,"id":8853,"edit":12572},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2021-10-20",[12575],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":12576,"primary":12578,"id":12663,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[12577],{},{"content":12579},[12580,12583,12586,12589,12592,12595,12598,12601,12604,12608,12613,12618,12621,12626,12630,12635,12638,12641,12644,12647,12652,12655,12658],{"type":126,"text":12581,"spans":12582},"Consumer parcel delivery specialist Hermes has underscored its commitment to an emissions-free future by placing a landmark order for 168 fully electric Mercedes-Benz eSprinters.",[],{"type":126,"text":12584,"spans":12585},"The zero-emission vans should all be on the road before the end of the year. They will be assigned to Hermes’ popular ParcelShops service, which operates from more than 5,000 convenience stores and other locations nationwide.",[],{"type":126,"text":12587,"spans":12588},"The company’s first substantial investment in battery-powered vans follows successful trials from a depot in Enfield, north London, of a pair of eSprinter demonstrators supplied by Intercounty Truck & Van.",[],{"type":126,"text":12590,"spans":12591},"The Dealer, which has headquarters in Wellingborough, and other branches in Boston, Milton Keynes, Peterborough and Toddington, won Hermes’ tender and will be fulfilling its entire order for Mercedes-Benz vans. This also includes 132 diesel-engined Sprinter 315 CDI variants.",[],{"type":126,"text":12593,"spans":12594},"Hermes has commissioned Pod Point UK to install charging points at its network of depots. This work is already underway, with the focus initially on those in London and other cities that have introduced low emission zones.",[],{"type":126,"text":12596,"spans":12597},"Hermes plans to undertake all ParcelShop collections with electric vehicles at the earliest opportunity. The company has only ordered the diesel vans to ‘tide it over’ pending completion of its infrastructure programme and the introduction of next-generation battery-powered variants.",[],{"type":126,"text":12599,"spans":12600},"Thus, while its first eSprinters will be the subject of longer Mercedes-Benz Finance contract hire agreements, the Sprinter 315 CDIs will be on one-year terms with Athlon UK, which is owned by Mercedes-Benz parent Daimler AG. This arrangement will allow Hermes to replace the diesels once charging facilities are in place and electric versions with  longer ranges and higher carrying capacities become available.",[],{"type":126,"text":12602,"spans":12603},"The company relies on a core fleet to service its ParcelShop business. This currently stands at some 450 units but is growing, and supplemented with rented vehicles during busy periods. The owned fleet includes 30 smaller electric vans that work from a depot in East London, while French-built diesels will be stood down to make way for the eSprinters.",[],{"type":126,"text":12605,"spans":12606},"Hermes Head of Fleet David Landy confirmed: “The transition to a zero-emission, electric fleet is integral to our ESG (environment, social and governance) agenda, and we’ve been keen to take the next, major step forward towards this goal.",[12607],{"start":32,"end":1161,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":12609,"spans":12610},"“However, we are under no illusions… this will not be an easy journey. From a purely operational standpoint, and given the current state of the technology, whichever way you look at it – whether in terms of range, payload or volume – a van with an internal combustion engine beats an electric one hands down.\"",[12611],{"start":32,"end":12612,"type":1324},309,{"type":126,"text":12614,"spans":12615},"“Only when it comes to tailpipe emissions does the battery-powered vehicle outshine the diesel. So we know there are constraints and compromises to make, and we recognise that this is going to put extra pressure and increased demands on those colleagues out in our depots who are doing a difficult job, day in, day out.” ",[12616],{"start":32,"end":12617,"type":1324},321,{"type":126,"text":12619,"spans":12620},"Key to Hermes’ decision to align itself with Mercedes-Benz Vans is the manufacturer’s stature and reputation within the industry, as well as the commitments it has made and the flexibility it has demonstrated. Likewise, the customer service provided by Regional Fleet Sales Manager James Holmes and his colleagues at Intercounty Truck & Van, and the commercial vehicle focus of the wider Mercedes-Benz Vans Dealer network.",[],{"type":126,"text":12622,"spans":12623},"“We’re at the very beginning of what is going to be a long and challenging process,” continued David Landy. “This is new technology, so product support will be crucial. There are electric vans out there that offer a longer range than the eSprinter, but any electric vehicle is going to break down, and it’s going to do so in new ways too.\"",[12624],{"start":32,"end":12625,"type":1324},339,{"type":126,"text":12627,"spans":12628},"“When that happens we want to know there’s an army of people out there who are fully clued-up and able to get us back on the road as quickly as possible. Mercedes-Benz Vans gives me that confidence.\"",[12629],{"start":32,"end":4352,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":12631,"spans":12632},"“It’s reassuring to know that we’re starting out on this journey with the backing of the right people, a global manufacturer that will help us to overcome operational hurdles as they arise, and Dealers who appreciate the importance of restricting vehicle downtime to an absolute minimum.”",[12633],{"start":32,"end":12634,"type":1324},288,{"type":126,"text":12636,"spans":12637},"The Mercedes-Benz eSprinter is powered by a 114 hp electric motor that drives the front wheels. It will travel 95 miles (combined WLTP with 80 km\u002Fh speed limiter) on a single charge, which is ample for the majority of urban delivery and last mile applications; recuperative energy recovered when decelerating supplements the batteries’ output. ",[],{"type":126,"text":12639,"spans":12640},"The vehicle is based on the L2 (medium length), H2 (high roof) Sprinter. Its 55 kWh high-voltage battery pack is securely mounted beneath the body, so does not impinge on cargo carrying space. As a result, the eSprinter’s 11m3 load volume is identical to that of its diesel-engined, front-wheel drive stablemate, and half a cubic metre larger than its rear-wheel drive equivalent.",[],{"type":126,"text":12642,"spans":12643},"However, when specifying diesel Sprinters Hermes has opted for the long-bodied L3 H2 variant, which offers a 14m3 load volume. The reduced parcel carrying capacity of the L2 eSprinter compared to the L3 version represents the biggest operational compromise that Hermes will have to make. Initially, therefore, it will be allocating the electric vans to those routes best suited to their smaller cargo areas and restricted range.",[],{"type":126,"text":12645,"spans":12646},"Mr Landy acknowledged that the electric revolution was still in its infancy, and that Hermes would face fewer operational challenges as Mercedes-Benz Vans’ zero-emission product range evolved. “This technology is moving so fast that the vehicle we’re about to start putting to work will not be the vehicle we’re still running in a year or two’s time,” he said.",[],{"type":126,"text":12648,"spans":12649},"“Not only does the agreement we’ve reached with Mercedes-Benz Vans mean we can swap out diesel vans for more battery-powered ones as our charging infrastructure programme progresses, but it also allows us to transition our first electric vans to new-generation versions that will cover greater distances and carry more as these become available.”",[12650],{"start":32,"end":12651,"type":1324},346,{"type":126,"text":12653,"spans":12654},"Hermes operates its own driving academy, whose instructors have already received eSprinter product familiarisation training from Intercounty Truck & Van. They will shortly begin to ‘cascade’ what they have learned down to members of the front-line driving team, with particular focus on battery management and range optimisation.",[],{"type":126,"text":12656,"spans":12657},"And while the vehicles will be recharged overnight, the Dealer’s James Holmes is also using Hermes’ ParcelShop routing data to plot additional points at which they can be replenished – using an 80kW DC fast-charging cable, the eSprinter’s four parallel batteries can be restored from 10% to 80% of maximum capacity in just 30 minutes.",[],{"type":126,"text":12659,"spans":12660},"Mr Landy added: “I like the fact that Mercedes-Benz Vans and Intercounty Truck & Van have come to us with a forward-thinking proposition that is entirely realistic about what this transition is going to entail. It’s not going to be easy, but we’re confident that we have the right partner to help us achieve our sustainability goal.”",[12661],{"start":405,"end":12662,"type":1324},333,"rich_text$c8cbe1ef-d5fb-4be5-808b-5946d843e1e2",{"id":12665,"uid":12666,"url":12667,"type":50,"href":12668,"tags":12669,"first_publication_date":12670,"last_publication_date":12671,"slugs":12672,"linked_documents":12673,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":12674,"data":12675},"YheyDhIAAC0A1q8w","hermes-plans-for-busiest-ever-peak","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-plans-for-busiest-ever-peak","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YheyDhIAAC0A1q8w%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T16:28:16+0000","2025-02-21T08:50:17+0000",[12666],[],[],{"title":12676,"category":8,"metaDescription":12677,"canonical":12678,"titleTag":12679,"featuredImage":12680,"publishedDate":12686,"slices":12687},"Hermes plans for busiest ever peak","We're preparing for our busiest ever peak. Read our latest blog post and find out what we're planning to do to tackle the busiest period of the year.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-plans-for-busiest-ever-peak","Hermes Plans for Busiest Ever Peak | Evri",{"dimensions":12681,"alt":7332,"copyright":8,"url":7333,"id":7334,"edit":12682,"thumbnail":12683},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":12684,"alt":7332,"copyright":8,"url":7338,"id":7334,"edit":12685},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2019-11-15",[12688],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":12689,"primary":12691,"id":12722,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[12690],{},{"content":12692},[12693,12696,12699,12702,12705,12708,12711,12714,12719],{"type":126,"text":12694,"spans":12695},"Hermes UK, the leading consumer delivery specialist, has announced a number of developments to support its predicted busiest peak period yet.",[],{"type":126,"text":12697,"spans":12698},"The company is estimating that year-on-year parcel numbers will be up by 14%, with 12.8 million parcels predicted in the first week of December alone.",[],{"type":126,"text":12700,"spans":12701},"In order to prepare for this, Hermes has implemented the largest peak capacity uplift in the industry, across all hubs, enabling its network to process up to 2.5 million parcels a day.",[],{"type":126,"text":12703,"spans":12704},"An additional 1,000 trailers and 3,200 scanning devices have been acquired and 560 drivers, 7,000 couriers and 32 peak managers will join existing teams to provide seasonal support. Deliveries will be made seven days a week from the beginning of December up to and including Christmas Eve.",[],{"type":126,"text":12706,"spans":12707},"In case of bad weather, dedicated teams will be monitoring road surface temperatures and forecasts daily, with grit and snow ploughs strategically placed across the network.",[],{"type":126,"text":12709,"spans":12710},"The company has also invested £1.4m in equipment that will enable it to significantly increase the number of returns it can process. This is part of a £21.5m investment across the business in the last 12 months.",[],{"type":126,"text":12712,"spans":12713},"Earlier this year, the business opened its third sortation tier at its Rugby hub to support the increased volumes. Hermes’ customer service bot, Holly, will also deal with customer queries.",[],{"type":126,"text":12715,"spans":12716},"\"We start planning for peak at the start of each year, working with our longstanding and committed retail clients. As a growing business which has made significant investment in the past 12 months, we are prepared to deal with the predicted higher volumes during peak 2019.\" ",[12717],{"start":32,"end":12718,"type":1324},275,{"type":126,"text":11684,"spans":12720},[12721],{"start":32,"end":4070,"type":163},"rich_text$c31658df-860d-45c4-9c00-ecd9fcef2e2b",[12724,12791,12854,12909,12960,13016,13069,13115,13166,13226,13273,13322],{"id":12725,"uid":12726,"url":12727,"type":50,"href":12728,"tags":12729,"first_publication_date":12730,"last_publication_date":12731,"slugs":12732,"linked_documents":12734,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":12735,"data":12736},"YhexfRIAACsA1qyc","hermes-uk-confirms-1400-jobs-alongside-commitment-to-eco-initiatives-at-new-barnsley-parcel-hub","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-uk-confirms-1400-jobs-alongside-commitment-to-eco-initiatives-at-new-barnsley-parcel-hub","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhexfRIAACsA1qyc%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T16:25:38+0000","2025-02-20T16:55:16+0000",[12733],"1400-new-jobs-at-new-barnsley-parcel-hub",[],[],{"title":12737,"category":8,"metaDescription":12738,"canonical":12739,"titleTag":12740,"featuredImage":12741,"publishedDate":12750,"slices":12751},"1,400 New Jobs at New Barnsley Parcel Hub","We're pleased to offer 1,400 full time roles at our new parcel distribution hub in Barnsley. Read all about it in our latest blog post.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-uk-confirms-1400-jobs-alongside-commitment-to-eco-initiatives-at-new-barnsley-parcel-hub","Hermes UK Confirms 1,400 Jobs Alongside Commitment to Eco Initiatives at New Barnsley Parcel Hub | Evri",{"dimensions":12742,"alt":12523,"copyright":8,"url":12743,"id":12744,"edit":12745,"thumbnail":12746},{"width":65,"height":865},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6tg4pbqstJ9-e9A_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6171.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6tg4pbqstJ9-e9A",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":12747,"alt":12523,"copyright":8,"url":12748,"id":12744,"edit":12749},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6tg4pbqstJ9-e9A_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6171.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2021-09-25",[12752],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":12753,"primary":12755,"id":12790,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[12754],{},{"content":12756},[12757,12760,12763,12768,12772,12777,12781,12784,12787],{"type":126,"text":12758,"spans":12759},"Hermes UK, one of the UK’s leading consumer delivery companies, has confirmed that it will be recruiting for 1400 full time roles at its new parcel distribution hub in Barnsley which is due to be completed as scheduled in September 2022. These will include a general manager, operations managers, engineers, health and safety officers, planning managers, transport managers, warehouse operatives and administrators. In addition, there will be around 300 temporary and part time roles available to support during busy periods for those looking for more flexible employment.",[],{"type":126,"text":12761,"spans":12762},"As part of its ESG (Environmental, Social and Governance) commitment Hermes has also confirmed that over 50% of the vehicles operating from the site will utilise compressed natural gas alternative fuel that reduces carbon emissions by over 80% compared to diesel. (Hermes currently has the largest CNG fleet in the UK parcel sector). Other eco initiatives include natural grassed acoustic bunds to absorb the small amounts of noise between the site and residential dwellings, a balancing pond, a biodiversity area and over 25,000 plants, trees and hedgerows that will be planted. The building itself will include solar panels on the roof and a rainwater-harvesting system. Hermes has already formed a sponsorship deal with the local cricket club, has provided the local school with equipment and plans to continue supporting the local community.",[],{"type":126,"text":12764,"spans":12765},"\"With one year to go until we open our newest and largest hub at Barnsley, we’re pleased to be able to confirm that we will be creating over 1400 full time roles at all levels and continuing to take our environmental and community responsibilities seriously alongside other tenants on the site. This is a huge investment and priority for us as we respond to the ever-increasing demand for online shopping and strive to provide a service that doesn’t cost the earth.\" ",[12766],{"start":32,"end":12767,"type":1324},467,{"type":126,"text":12769,"spans":12770},"Carl Lyon, Chief Operating Officer at Hermes UK",[12771],{"start":32,"end":3107,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":12773,"spans":12774},"\"We’re working closely with Hermes in order to maximise job and training opportunities for local people on this prime site next year. We’re taking full advantage of the sites potential in terms of partnership working to better the community, working with schools and local sports clubs, as well as for the environment with Hermes putting sustainability at the forefront of their operations. This investment is a further example that Barnsley is an excellent location for business and our award winning support service in Enterprising Barnsley is there to help businesses thrive.\" ",[12775],{"start":32,"end":12776,"type":1324},580,{"type":126,"text":12778,"spans":12779},"Matt Gladstone, Executive Director for Place at Barnsley Council",[12780],{"start":32,"end":3236,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":12782,"spans":12783},"The 320,000 sq ft hub, located on a 55-acre plot will have the capacity to process up to 1.3 million parcels daily, boosting the company’s overall capacity to 4.4 million a day. To future-proof and prepare for expected growth, further tiers will be added inside the hub in coming years. The hub runs parallel to the M1 and is strategically located off a new bypass road near junction 36, close to several of Hermes’ retail customers’ distribution sites. This allows later cut off times for collections can be provided to meet the ongoing demand for online shopping and next day delivery.",[],{"type":126,"text":12785,"spans":12786},"Notes to the editor:",[],{"type":126,"text":12788,"spans":12789},"Hermes UK, headquartered in Morley, Leeds, is one of the UK’s leading consumer delivery companies, successfully delivering over 640 million parcels a year on behalf of many of Europe’s leading retailers. The company, backed by private equity firm, Advent, has experienced sustainable double-digit growth for the past 10 years, consistently reinvesting profit into its proposition, infrastructure and people, including developing an award-winning app and building a nationwide estate of 6000 ParcelShops and lockers.",[],"rich_text$b97b872d-5f6b-412f-a5d7-aa30432b219e",{"id":12792,"uid":12793,"url":12794,"type":50,"href":12795,"tags":12796,"first_publication_date":12797,"last_publication_date":12798,"slugs":12799,"linked_documents":12800,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":12801,"data":12802},"YhewtRIAAC8A1qiS","hermes-uk-delivers-record-volumes-of-parcels-in-peak-and-throughout-2020","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-uk-delivers-record-volumes-of-parcels-in-peak-and-throughout-2020","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhewtRIAAC8A1qiS%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T16:22:17+0000","2025-02-21T09:31:20+0000",[12793],[],[],{"title":12803,"category":8,"metaDescription":12804,"canonical":12805,"titleTag":12806,"featuredImage":12807,"publishedDate":12817,"slices":12818},"Hermes UK delivers record volumes of parcels in peak and throughout 2020","Read our latest blog post to find out all the interesting facts and statistics from our record breaking peak season.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-uk-delivers-record-volumes-of-parcels-in-peak-and-throughout-2020","Hermes UK Delivers Record Volumes of Parcels in Peak and Throughout 2020 | Evri",{"dimensions":12808,"alt":12809,"copyright":8,"url":12810,"id":12811,"edit":12812,"thumbnail":12813},{"width":65,"height":865},"An Evri Courier finding the next parcel to deliver in the back of their car","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDVJbqstJ9-ce-_EVRI_LOCATION_04_3362.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6pDVJbqstJ9-ce-",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":12814,"alt":12809,"copyright":8,"url":12815,"id":12811,"edit":12816},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDVJbqstJ9-ce-_EVRI_LOCATION_04_3362.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2021-01-05",[12819],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":12820,"primary":12822,"id":12853,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[12821],{},{"content":12823},[12824,12827,12830,12833,12836,12839,12842,12845,12850],{"type":126,"text":12825,"spans":12826},"Hermes, one of the UK’s leading consumer delivery companies, successfully delivered 630 million parcels in 2020. Outside of the traditionally busy Peak winter months, volume also doubled year-on-year in April, May and June.",[],{"type":126,"text":12828,"spans":12829},"This is an increase of 250 million from Hermes’ 2019 annual deliveries figure. Almost 72 million parcels were delivered between Black Friday and Christmas Eve compared to around 42 million in the same period in 2019.",[],{"type":126,"text":12831,"spans":12832},"These volumes were partially driven by lockdown restrictions, alongside the ongoing growth in the sector, which has seen Hermes’ parcel volumes grow year on year for the past decade and its flexibility in adapting its network to retailer’s increasing and unique demands.",[],{"type":126,"text":12834,"spans":12835},"Hermes Send, the business area dedicated to C2C sending of parcels, either from a local ParcelShop or via a courier collection, saw an increase of 104% across the year, with 10 million parcels delivered in December as people’s Christmas plans changed at short notice and needed to ensure that loved ones still received gifts.",[],{"type":126,"text":12837,"spans":12838},"Across the business, the busiest day for Hermes UK was 1st December with 3.5 million parcels handled in a 24-hour period. The busiest months were November and December with 67 million and 82.5 million being delivered respectively.",[],{"type":126,"text":12840,"spans":12841},"To support this growth, Hermes opened 4 operational hubs and 5 new depots. It increased its fleet by 2,500, created more than 10,500 new roles across the business and added 13,000 couriers to its nationwide network.",[],{"type":126,"text":12843,"spans":12844},"Hermes worked closely with its retail clients to fast-track innovations, including pioneering contact-free deliveries, adding additional geo-location products such as its collaboration with What3Words and introducing ‘store to door’ deliveries for retailers to fulfil orders for goods directly from closed retail units into the delivery network.",[],{"type":126,"text":12846,"spans":12847},"\"As a result of the pandemic and lockdown, we had to fast forward our 5-year plan and deliver it in just 5 months. The level of parcel volumes that we handled was what we had originally planned for in 2025. To achieve this, we worked closely with our retail clients to ensure that we had both capability and capacity, and we also focused on our scalability, innovation and technology to make sure that our couriers had the right tools to enable them to deliver easily, efficiently and safely. We aren’t seeing many signs that this demand is slowing down so far in 2021 and are continuing our ongoing investment into developing our infrastructure and proposition, supported by an award-winning and industry-leading app, and new products and services that are designed to continue to enhance the customer experience. This includes a new local customer service model with agents situated in our depots across the country. We’re focusing on providing strong communication and added assurance and convenience to all of our customers.\" ",[12848],{"start":32,"end":12849,"type":1324},1030,{"type":126,"text":12026,"spans":12851},[12852],{"start":32,"end":5726,"type":163},"rich_text$5c3ae40f-2ecd-45db-ab60-69edfcf98e28",{"id":12855,"uid":12856,"url":12857,"type":50,"href":12858,"tags":12859,"first_publication_date":12860,"last_publication_date":12861,"slugs":12862,"linked_documents":12863,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":12864,"data":12865},"Yhev8xIAACgA1qT_","hermes-uk-extends-remit-with-posttag-to-cover-all-location-queries","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-uk-extends-remit-with-posttag-to-cover-all-location-queries","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22Yhev8xIAACgA1qT_%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T16:19:03+0000","2025-02-20T16:06:01+0000",[12856],[],[],{"title":12866,"category":8,"metaDescription":12867,"canonical":12868,"titleTag":12869,"featuredImage":12870,"publishedDate":12876,"slices":12877},"Hermes UK extends remit with PostTag to cover all location queries","We've partnered with PostTag, a final-mile delivery technology company. Read all about how the partnership will improve customer experience in our latest blog.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-uk-extends-remit-with-posttag-to-cover-all-location-queries","Hermes UK Extends Remit with PostTag to Cover All Location Queries | Evri",{"dimensions":12871,"alt":11705,"copyright":8,"url":11706,"id":11707,"edit":12872,"thumbnail":12873},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":12874,"alt":11705,"copyright":8,"url":11711,"id":11707,"edit":12875},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2022-03-01",[12878],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":12879,"primary":12881,"id":12908,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[12880],{},{"content":12882},[12883,12889,12892,12896,12899,12904],{"type":126,"text":12884,"spans":12885},"Hermes, the consumer delivery specialist, has extended its remit with PostTag, the last mile delivery technology company, to cover its business fully end to end. It follows a successful initial 6-month partnership which has seen PostTag support Hermes in maintaining its high first-time delivery rate, despite a huge upturn in volumes as a result of the pandemic.",[12886],{"start":2506,"end":758,"type":279,"data":12887},{"link_type":281,"url":12888,"target":283},"press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.posttag.com\u002F",{"type":126,"text":12890,"spans":12891},"The new deal means that every part of the business and all Hermes’ customers will now benefit from the PostTag technology which checks, verifies and locates precise addresses, as an order is placed. This is done without any additional requirements or inputs, providing valuable and invisible support. Benefits include an increase in first time delivery rates even for hard-to-find locations.",[],{"type":126,"text":12893,"spans":12894},"\"Since the start of the pandemic we have experienced a huge increase in parcel volumes and have invested in technology to help support our couriers in achieving safe and efficient deliveries. The PostTag platform is one of the steps we have taken, and we have seen over 600 million address verification enquiries using their technology. Based on this we have taken the decision to broaden their scope and deliver similar benefits across the business and for our customers sending parcels through our network.\" ",[12895],{"start":32,"end":2451,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":11570,"spans":12897},[12898],{"start":32,"end":3455,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":12900,"spans":12901},"\"Hermes is just one of a number of the companies that are reaping the benefits of our solution which is unique as it checks addresses across multiple data bases to ensure drivers can finding the right delivery address, first time, quickly. The fact that our contract has been extended with an increased scope is testament to the success of this relationship and our solution.\" ",[12902],{"start":32,"end":12903,"type":1324},377,{"type":126,"text":12905,"spans":12906},"Paul Yewman, CEO at PostTag",[12907],{"start":32,"end":3553,"type":163},"rich_text$56c158e3-b4e5-4ffe-acfe-52c4763cf24e",{"id":12910,"uid":12911,"url":12912,"type":50,"href":12913,"tags":12914,"first_publication_date":12915,"last_publication_date":12916,"slugs":12917,"linked_documents":12918,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":12919,"data":12920},"YhevjBIAACsA1qMN","hermes-partners-with-tesco-to-expand-its-parcelshop-network-across-the-uk","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-partners-with-tesco-to-expand-its-parcelshop-network-across-the-uk","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhevjBIAACsA1qMN%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T16:17:35+0000","2025-02-20T16:58:44+0000",[12911],[],[],{"title":12921,"category":8,"metaDescription":12922,"canonical":12923,"titleTag":12924,"featuredImage":12925,"publishedDate":12936,"slices":12937},"Hermes partners with Tesco to expand its Parcelshop network across the UK","Read our latest blog and learn all about our new partnership with Tesco as we expand our ParcelShop network.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-partners-with-tesco-to-expand-its-parcelshop-network-across-the-uk","Hermes Partners with Tesco to Expand its Parcelshop Network Across the UK | Evri",{"dimensions":12926,"alt":12927,"copyright":8,"url":12928,"id":12929,"edit":12930,"thumbnail":12931},{"width":65,"height":8660},"ParcelShop store assistant is holding a blue hand-held device to scan the customer's parcel.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TI2JbqstJ9-TfS_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2384.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,0,5271,3459&w=960&h=630","Z6TI2JbqstJ9-TfS",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":12932,"alt":12927,"copyright":8,"url":12933,"id":12929,"edit":12934},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TI2JbqstJ9-TfS_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2384.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,481,5271,2498&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":12935,"zoom":33,"background":71},481,"2021-08-16",[12938],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":12939,"primary":12941,"id":12959,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[12940],{},{"content":12942},[12943,12946,12953,12956],{"type":126,"text":12944,"spans":12945},"Hermes, one of the UK’s leading consumer delivery companies, has announced its partnership with the UK’s largest supermarket to provide ParcelShop services across its convenience estate nationwide. Services will commence from 6th September in the first phase of stores and a continued roll-out is planned over the coming months.",[],{"type":126,"text":12947,"spans":12948},"With more consumers choosing Out of Home options for parcel deliveries as lockdown rules lift, which includes ParcelShops and lockers, Hermes plans to expand its network to make it even easier for consumers to access options for sending, receiving and returning parcels.",[12949],{"start":5287,"end":12950,"type":279,"data":12951},133,{"link_type":281,"url":12952},"press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.myhermes.co.uk\u002Four-services\u002Flockers",{"type":126,"text":12954,"spans":12955},"The Hermes ParcelShop estate currently includes more than 7,300 independent retailers, retail groups and lockers. Hermes predicts that by 2022, 80% of the UK’s population will be within a 10-minute walk of their nearest ParcelShop or locker. It also expects to handle more than 80 million parcels through its Out of Home network this year.",[],{"type":126,"text":12957,"spans":12958},"Kath Gill, Head of ParcelShop Services at Hermes, said: “We’re really excited to announce our new partnership with Tesco, which will make Hermes ParcelShop services even more accessible to people across the UK, at a time when we know people are looking for maximum convenience and options for sending, receiving and returning their parcels. The last 18 months have demonstrated the importance of being able to meet ever-changing consumer demands when it comes to both online shopping and customer-to-customer sending, so we continue to invest in our infrastructure, technology and services to support the nation.”",[],"rich_text$bb14737b-b718-4b71-8e0b-8e196356acc7",{"id":12961,"uid":12962,"url":12963,"type":50,"href":12964,"tags":12965,"first_publication_date":12966,"last_publication_date":12967,"slugs":12968,"linked_documents":12969,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":12970,"data":12971},"YheuxhIAAC8A1p9e","hermes-uk-growth-supported-by-investment-from-advent","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-uk-growth-supported-by-investment-from-advent","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YheuxhIAAC8A1p9e%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T16:14:03+0000","2025-02-21T09:16:08+0000",[12962],[],[],{"title":12972,"category":8,"metaDescription":12973,"canonical":12974,"titleTag":12975,"featuredImage":12976,"publishedDate":12982,"slices":12983},"Hermes UK Growth Supported by Investment from Advent","Hermes is set to benefit from significant investment by Advent International. Read all about the investment in the latest blog here.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-uk-growth-supported-by-investment-from-advent","Hermes UK Growth Supported by Investment from Advent | Evri",{"dimensions":12977,"alt":9895,"copyright":8,"url":9896,"id":9897,"edit":12978,"thumbnail":12979},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":12980,"alt":9895,"copyright":8,"url":9901,"id":9897,"edit":12981},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2020-08-11",[12984],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":12985,"primary":12987,"id":13015,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[12986],{},{"content":12988},[12989,12992,12995,12998,13003,13006,13009,13012],{"type":126,"text":12990,"spans":12991},"Hermes UK, the leading consumer delivery company, is to benefit from a significant investment by Advent International (‘Advent’), one of the largest and most experienced global private equity firms. This follows an announcement from Otto Group, that it has formed a partnership with Advent for its Hermes Group businesses in the UK and Germany.",[],{"type":126,"text":12993,"spans":12994},"Under the terms of the deal, Advent will partner with the current management team to acquire a 75% stake in Hermes UK. Otto Group will continue to own 25% of the company. The transaction will facilitate further investment by Hermes in technology and infrastructure and support the future growth of the business in the rapidly growing parcel delivery sector. The management of Hermes UK will continue to lead the business as an independent company, with ‘business as usual’ for employees, suppliers and customers.",[],{"type":126,"text":12996,"spans":12997},"This follows a recent announcement by Hermes UK that it is looking for more than 10.5K ‘parcel people’ to join its business, to meet the huge demand created by people shopping at home during lockdown, and the continuing growth in the sector. Hermes UK predicts that parcel volumes will reach record levels during the Black Friday and Christmas period.",[],{"type":126,"text":12999,"spans":13000},"\"This is fantastic news for Hermes UK as we continue our upwards trajectory in the fast-growing and capital-hungry home delivery sector. The investment will enable us to remain independent and be agile and responsive to future market requirements. It will help to expedite the development of our capacity and technology, supporting the introduction of new innovative products and services that will greatly benefit our retail clients and their customers.\" ",[13001],{"start":32,"end":13002,"type":1324},456,{"type":126,"text":12026,"spans":13004},[13005],{"start":32,"end":5726,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":13007,"spans":13008},"Advent has extensive experience of successfully partnering with management teams to develop and grow market leading businesses. Current investments in the e-commerce and logistics sector include InPost, a company which provides secure self-service lockers for the collection, return and delivery of parcels that has seen significant growth since Advent’s involvement.",[],{"type":126,"text":13010,"spans":13011},"In addition to the 75% shareholding in Hermes UK, Advent will also acquire a 25% stake in Hermes Germany, which includes other Hermes Germany Group companies including BorderGuru and a share in the ParcelLock joint venture.",[],{"type":126,"text":13013,"spans":13014},"The transaction with Otto Group is subject to approval by the boards and relevant antitrust authorities.",[],"rich_text$9db8fc59-0f30-422b-9969-5f6c911f7673",{"id":13017,"uid":13018,"url":13019,"type":50,"href":13020,"tags":13021,"first_publication_date":13022,"last_publication_date":13023,"slugs":13024,"linked_documents":13025,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":13026,"data":13027},"Yhes4xIAAC8A1pZ6","hermes-opens-the-uks-largest-parcel-hub-to-provide-further-confidence-in-peak-capacity","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-opens-the-uks-largest-parcel-hub-to-provide-further-confidence-in-peak-capacity","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22Yhes4xIAAC8A1pZ6%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T16:06:01+0000","2023-03-21T13:53:56+0000",[13018],[],[],{"title":13028,"category":8,"metaDescription":13029,"canonical":13030,"titleTag":13031,"featuredImage":13032,"publishedDate":13038,"slices":13039},"Hermes opens the UK's largest parcel hub to provide further confidence in peak capacity","We're proud to officially launch our brand new purpose built distribution hub in Rugby. Read here to find out all about it.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-opens-the-uks-largest-parcel-hub-to-provide-further-confidence-in-peak-capacity","Hermes Opens the UK's Largest Parcel Hub to Provide Further Confidence in Peak Capacity | Evri - The New Hermes",{"dimensions":13033,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":12231,"id":12232,"edit":13034,"thumbnail":13035},{"width":65,"height":11413},{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":11417,"background":34},{"dimensions":13036,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":12236,"id":12232,"edit":13037},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":7499,"zoom":11422,"background":34},"2017-08-14",[13040],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":13041,"primary":13043,"id":13068,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[13042],{},{"content":13044},[13045,13048,13051,13054,13057,13060,13065],{"type":126,"text":13046,"spans":13047},"Hermes, the consumer delivery specialist, has today officially opened its purpose built, state-of-the-art automated parcel distribution hub in Rugby, the biggest of its kind in the UK, creating over 100 new jobs. The £31m development represents the most significant investment in the company's history, highlighting its dedication to future growth, innovation and peak capacity.",[],{"type":126,"text":13049,"spans":13050},"Located at the Rugby Gateway, the Midlands Super Hub measures 270,000 square feet, the equivalent of 34 football pitches, and has the capability to efficiently process in excess of one million parcels each day. As a result, the company’s overall parcel processing capacity will be increased by 45%, ensuring it will continue to comfortably handle rising volumes driven by the ongoing growth of ecommerce in the UK and overseas.",[],{"type":126,"text":13052,"spans":13053},"The facility also provides Hermes, which has experienced double-digit growth every year for the past six years, with future expansion opportunities. This includes the installation of a third sortation tier that would increase the hub’s capacity by a further half a million parcels a day.",[],{"type":126,"text":13055,"spans":13056},"Many of the UK’s leading retailers and etailers joined Hermes CEO Carole Woodhead and Managing Director Martijn de Lange at the official opening of the Midlands Super Hub earlier today. The special event was kicked-off in style as six-time Olympic gold medallist Sir Chris Hoy addressed the audience, before attendees were transported to Rugby for a lunch and a full tour of the premises.",[],{"type":126,"text":13058,"spans":13059},"Clients enjoyed visiting the interactive area at Rugby which supports Hermes’ commitment to innovation and enables the company to showcase its latest services and solutions to clients, including those devised by the Hermes Innovation Lab. On the day they were able to see a number of innovations such as the type of autonomous vehicles that could be used in the future and Starship delivery robots.",[],{"type":126,"text":13061,"spans":13062},"\"We are extremely proud to officially open our Midlands Super Hub in Rugby, the largest parcel hub of its kind in the UK. This substantial project demonstrates our total commitment to delivering world-class delivery solutions, not just for today, but for the foreseeable future. A retailer’s top priority is to have complete confidence in their delivery partner’s capacity during peak. This £31m investment guarantees that we will continue to operate a highly proficient operation throughout the year, including those intense and prolonged spikes of activity. The facility significantly strengthens our network and infrastructure, vastly enhances our throughput capability, and guarantees that we are in the best possible position to support the UK’s retail industry for many years to come.\" ",[13063],{"start":32,"end":13064,"type":1324},792,{"type":126,"text":11517,"spans":13066},[13067],{"start":32,"end":367,"type":163},"rich_text$c6c1650f-ac7d-45b6-ab6f-bd2fac70ec1e",{"id":13070,"uid":13071,"url":13072,"type":50,"href":13073,"tags":13074,"first_publication_date":13075,"last_publication_date":13076,"slugs":13077,"linked_documents":13078,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":13079,"data":13080},"YheruhIAAC0A1pED","hermes-uk-launches-mental-health-training-and-wellbeing-support-programme-for-its-people","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-uk-launches-mental-health-training-and-wellbeing-support-programme-for-its-people","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YheruhIAAC0A1pED%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T16:01:20+0000","2025-02-21T09:20:03+0000",[13071],[],[],{"title":13081,"category":8,"metaDescription":13082,"canonical":13083,"titleTag":13084,"featuredImage":13085,"publishedDate":13091,"slices":13092},"Hermes UK launches Mental Health Training and Wellbeing Support Programme for its People","Read all about the Mental Health Ambassadors programme in this latest post as Hermes commits to supporting mental health in the business.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-uk-launches-mental-health-training-and-wellbeing-support-programme-for-its-people","Hermes UK launches Mental Health Training and Wellbeing Support Programme for its People | Evri",{"dimensions":13086,"alt":5496,"copyright":8,"url":5497,"id":5498,"edit":13087,"thumbnail":13088},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":13089,"alt":5496,"copyright":8,"url":5502,"id":5498,"edit":13090},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2020-11-23",[13093],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":13094,"primary":13096,"id":13114,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[13095],{},{"content":13097},[13098,13101,13105,13110],{"type":126,"text":13099,"spans":13100},"Hermes UK, the leading consumer delivery company, has implemented a number of measures designed to support the mental health and wellbeing of its employees. At the heart of this programme is a network of 72 volunteer “Mental Health Ambassadors,” who are being equipped with the tools, skills and ultimately the confidence to listen and talk with someone who needs support, as well as recognise behaviours that can positively and negatively affect worker wellbeing.",[],{"type":126,"text":13102,"spans":13103},"The company is committed to providing a framework to raise awareness and address the stigma of poor mental health and signpost clear information on available support and guidance. Other initiatives include the creation of an online wellbeing hub as a social space, where people can find advice, support and share their own personal stories.",[13104],{"start":3706,"end":699,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":13106,"spans":13107},"\"Our vision is to create a great place to work - an environment where our people can grow, develop and reach their potential. As part of this commitment, we will focus on ensuring that everyone feels supported in looking after their own mental health as well as those around them. This is ever more important as we all continue to feel the impact of COVID-19 on almost every aspect of our lives.\" ",[13108],{"start":32,"end":13109,"type":1324},397,{"type":126,"text":13111,"spans":13112},"Jill Maples, HR Director at Hermes UK",[13113],{"start":32,"end":1816,"type":163},"rich_text$c970e148-e16a-4dcd-8555-2bf3b099f736",{"id":13116,"uid":13117,"url":13118,"type":50,"href":13119,"tags":13120,"first_publication_date":13121,"last_publication_date":13122,"slugs":13123,"linked_documents":13124,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":13125,"data":13126},"Yheq1hIAAC0A1ozC","hermes-opens-city-centre-tech-hub-in-leeds-to-attract-top-it-talent","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-opens-city-centre-tech-hub-in-leeds-to-attract-top-it-talent","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22Yheq1hIAAC0A1ozC%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T15:57:55+0000","2025-02-21T08:28:16+0000",[13117],[],[],{"title":13127,"category":8,"metaDescription":13128,"canonical":13129,"titleTag":13130,"featuredImage":13131,"publishedDate":13140,"slices":13141},"Hermes opens city centre Tech Hub in Leeds to attract top IT talent","We have a new office! We're proud to unveil our new Tech Hub in Leeds City Centre as part of our commitment to innovation and growth.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-opens-city-centre-tech-hub-in-leeds-to-attract-top-it-talent","Hermes Opens City Centre Tech Hub in Leeds to Attract Top IT talent | Evri - The New Hermes",{"dimensions":13132,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":13133,"id":13134,"edit":13135,"thumbnail":13136},{"width":65,"height":865},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ7NkJ57c43Q3f31w_20220725-EVRI-PeoplePhotography-464.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,0,6240,4160&w=960&h=640","Z7NkJ57c43Q3f31w",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":13137,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":13138,"id":13134,"edit":13139},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ7NkJ57c43Q3f31w_20220725-EVRI-PeoplePhotography-464.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,601,6240,2958&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":2088,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2019-02-25",[13142],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":13143,"primary":13145,"id":13165,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[13144],{},{"content":13146},[13147,13150,13153,13156,13161],{"type":126,"text":13148,"spans":13149},"Hermes, the consumer delivery specialist, is set to open a brand-new office in the centre of Leeds as part of its commitment to innovation and to facilitate the next stage of its growth. The business will use this strategic expansion as an opportunity to recruit 50 new permanent technology specialists, including senior developers and UX experts.",[],{"type":126,"text":13151,"spans":13152},"The new 6,500 square foot Tech Hub is located at No.1 Whitehall Riverside and provides Hermes with an important presence in the heart of Leeds’ fast-growing technology district. The office space will also be the new home to the company’s Innovation Lab, which has been creating forward-thinking services and solutions designed to change the delivery landscape since its creation in 2016. The premises incorporate 70 hot desks as the business prioritises an agile working environment to drive increased engagement and productivity. The 50 new recruits – who will include developers, testers and product owners – will be joined by a further 20 colleagues who will relocate from the company’s headquarters in Morley, plus those from the Innovation Lab, who previously worked from a separate office space in Leeds.  ",[],{"type":126,"text":13154,"spans":13155},"As well as helping the business attract the very best talent, No.1 Whitehall Riverside will help Hermes to increase its brand presence across the region and provide exceptional meeting room facilities for client visits. The Tech Hub also includes a private roof terrace overlooking the canal, as well as adequate space to host external events, workshops and hackathons. The premises was designed and fitted out by Officeinsight.",[],{"type":126,"text":13157,"spans":13158},"\"We are very excited to be opening our new Tech Hub in the city centre of Leeds, which is quickly growing into the UK’s leading technology centre outside of London. At a time of economic uncertainty, we are committed to further investing in our future, and this vibrant office will play a key role in that. It provides us with the perfect opportunity to attract the very best talent from across the north of England, who will each be given the freedom to make a real impact on our evolving business. \"",[13159],{"start":32,"end":13160,"type":1324},501,{"type":126,"text":13162,"spans":13163},"Chris Ashworth, CIO at Hermes",[13164],{"start":32,"end":1084,"type":163},"rich_text$28694f19-146f-486e-9a5d-4a024bff5863",{"id":13167,"uid":13168,"url":13169,"type":50,"href":13170,"tags":13171,"first_publication_date":13172,"last_publication_date":13173,"slugs":13174,"linked_documents":13176,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":13177,"data":13178},"YhepfhIAACkA1oZl","hermes-uk-launches-whats-in-the-box-the-further-improve-returns-service","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-uk-launches-whats-in-the-box-the-further-improve-returns-service","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhepfhIAACkA1oZl%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T15:51:37+0000","2025-02-21T09:33:58+0000",[13175],"hermes-uk-launches-whats-in-the-box-to-further-improve-returns-service",[],[],{"title":13179,"category":8,"metaDescription":13180,"canonical":13181,"titleTag":13182,"featuredImage":13183,"publishedDate":11423,"slices":13193},"Hermes UK Launches 'What's in the box' to Further Improve Returns Service","Read about our commitment to improving our returns service through innovative products in this latest blog post.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-uk-launches-whats-in-the-box-the-further-improve-returns-service","Hermes UK Launches 'What's in the box' to Further Improve Returns Service | Evri",{"dimensions":13184,"alt":13185,"copyright":8,"url":13186,"id":13187,"edit":13188,"thumbnail":13189},{"width":65,"height":8660},"Customer in a ParcelShop store handing their packageless parcel to a smiling store assistant.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TIypbqstJ9-Te__EVRI_LOCATION_03_2332b.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,6000,3938&w=960&h=630","Z6TIypbqstJ9-Te_",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":13190,"alt":13185,"copyright":8,"url":13191,"id":13187,"edit":13192},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TIypbqstJ9-Te__EVRI_LOCATION_03_2332b.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,548,6000,2844&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":8669,"zoom":33,"background":71},[13194],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":13195,"primary":13197,"id":13225,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[13196],{},{"content":13198},[13199,13202,13205,13208,13213,13216,13221],{"type":126,"text":13200,"spans":13201},"Hermes UK, the leading consumer delivery company, has launched an innovative new service designed to further improve the ‘returns experience’ for its retail customers and their consumers. It follows a successful trial by fashion retailer, Joe Browns.",[],{"type":126,"text":13203,"spans":13204},"The ‘What’s inside the box?” service allows consumers to inform the retailer exactly which items they are returning in advance.  As a result, the retailer benefits from knowing which items are being sent back, allowing them to update SKUs, manage warehouse stock levels and acquire accurate and up to date customers data. There is also the option for retailers to offer an immediate or expedited refund. Consumers it also helps to ensure there is no confusion.",[],{"type":126,"text":13206,"spans":13207},"The ‘What’s in the box’ functionality can be integrated into a retailer’s own website or app or through the Hermes website.",[],{"type":126,"text":13209,"spans":13210},"\"This is another great addition to our already industry leading returns proposition. It forms part of our ongoing commitment to developing and delivering market leading solutions that improve the customer journey whilst adding value for our retail clients.\" ",[13211],{"start":32,"end":13212,"type":1324},258,{"type":126,"text":11570,"spans":13214},[13215],{"start":32,"end":3455,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":13217,"spans":13218},"\"This is another step forward from Hermes in helping to make our customer journey simpler. Returns have always been a fundamental part of clothing mail order and, with recent changes in buying habits switching from in store to on- line, this has become increasingly important. As a business the more information we can collect in an electronic format the more efficient we become. “What’s in the box” gives both us and our customers exactly what they need.\" ",[13219],{"start":32,"end":13220,"type":1324},458,{"type":126,"text":13222,"spans":13223},"Darren Abbott, Financial Director at Joe Browns",[13224],{"start":32,"end":3107,"type":163},"rich_text$f59781ab-c3ab-404f-8729-d15c7e34f674",{"id":13227,"uid":13228,"url":13229,"type":50,"href":13230,"tags":13231,"first_publication_date":13232,"last_publication_date":13233,"slugs":13234,"linked_documents":13235,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":13236,"data":13237},"YheozxIAAC8A1oMl","hermes-launches-warehouse-to-wheels-national-apprentice-programme","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-launches-warehouse-to-wheels-national-apprentice-programme","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YheozxIAAC8A1oMl%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T15:48:58+0000","2025-02-20T16:47:42+0000",[13228],[],[],{"title":13238,"category":8,"metaDescription":13239,"canonical":13240,"titleTag":13241,"featuredImage":13242,"publishedDate":13251,"slices":13252},"Hermes launches Warehouse to Wheels national apprentice programme","Our latest blog covers our nationwide apprentice programme designed to provide new opportunities for its employees and help address the countries driver shortage.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-launches-warehouse-to-wheels-national-apprentice-programme","Hermes Launches Warehouse to Wheels National Apprentice Programme | Evri",{"dimensions":13243,"alt":866,"copyright":8,"url":13244,"id":13245,"edit":13246,"thumbnail":13247},{"width":65,"height":865},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6thopbqstJ9-e-E_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6484.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6thopbqstJ9-e-E",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":13248,"alt":866,"copyright":8,"url":13249,"id":13245,"edit":13250},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6thopbqstJ9-e-E_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6484.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2023-03-21",[13253],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":13254,"primary":13256,"id":13272,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[13255],{},{"content":13257},[13258,13261,13264,13269],{"type":126,"text":13259,"spans":13260},"Hermes UK, the consumer delivery specialist, has launched a nationwide apprentice programme designed to provide new opportunities for its employees whilst helping to address the country’s driver shortage. Warehouse to Wheels is a 12- month programme which enables existing staff members to undertake their LGV training and progress to join the company’s driver team.",[],{"type":126,"text":13262,"spans":13263},"The company has enrolled 69 people for year one of the initiative, with an average age of 29 years old. Training will take place during working hours with ‘graduation’ in Autumn 2019, in time for our peak season. The programme has been launched across the entire Hermes depot network with individual roll out plans agreed with each depot.",[],{"type":126,"text":13265,"spans":13266},"\"We, like everyone else in the sector, are aware of the challenges of recruiting LGV drivers and therefore are planning for our future. This initiative not only enables us to provide a fantastic new career opportunity for members of staff, but will also develop a team of drivers that we know will have received fantastic support and training. We wish all of our apprentices on the Warehouse to Wheels programme to the best of luck! \"",[13267],{"start":32,"end":13268,"type":1324},434,{"type":126,"text":13111,"spans":13270},[13271],{"start":32,"end":1816,"type":163},"rich_text$6ed237cf-988f-4e8b-bd32-734534d7341c",{"id":13274,"uid":13275,"url":13276,"type":50,"href":13277,"tags":13278,"first_publication_date":13279,"last_publication_date":13280,"slugs":13281,"linked_documents":13282,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":13283,"data":13284},"YheogBIAAC4A1oHp","hermes-uk-to-open-new-purpose-built-northern-depot-in-bolton-creating-100-more-jobs","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-uk-to-open-new-purpose-built-northern-depot-in-bolton-creating-100-more-jobs","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YheogBIAAC4A1oHp%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T15:47:17+0000","2025-02-21T09:36:15+0000",[13275],[],[],{"title":13285,"category":8,"metaDescription":13286,"canonical":13287,"titleTag":13288,"featuredImage":13289,"publishedDate":13298,"slices":13299},"Hermes UK to open new purpose-built northern depot in Bolton creating 100 more jobs","We're delighted to open our new depot in Bolton in Autumn 2021. Read all about it and the exciting opportunities in this blog post.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-uk-to-open-new-purpose-built-northern-depot-in-bolton-creating-100-more-jobs","Hermes UK to Open New Purpose-Built Northern Depot in Bolton Creating 100 More Jobs | Evri",{"dimensions":13290,"alt":11705,"copyright":8,"url":13291,"id":13292,"edit":13293,"thumbnail":13294},{"width":65,"height":865},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6913pbqstJ9-pXv_EVRI_LOCATION_02_1209.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6913pbqstJ9-pXv",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":13295,"alt":11705,"copyright":8,"url":13296,"id":13292,"edit":13297},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6913pbqstJ9-pXv_EVRI_LOCATION_02_1209.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2021-01-25",[13300],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":13301,"primary":13303,"id":13321,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[13302],{},{"content":13304},[13305,13308,13311,13314,13318],{"type":126,"text":13306,"spans":13307},"Hermes, one of the UK’s leading consumer delivery companies, has announced its plans to open a new, purpose-built depot In Bolton in Autumn 2021.  It forms part of the company’s ongoing investment into its infrastructure, designed to support its significant volume increases which saw a record 600 million successful deliveries in 2020, up from 400 million.",[],{"type":126,"text":13309,"spans":13310},"The new Wingates Estate Bolton depot will replace an existing site nearby with all current staff transferring and being joined by an additional 100 new recruits across a range of roles, include traditional warehousing roles, but also a variety of management positions across customer services, compliance and finance.  It will be able to handle almost 3 times more parcels – 220,000 per day.",[],{"type":126,"text":13312,"spans":13313},"With sustainability a key driver for Hermes, the new Bolton site will feature EV charging points, energy efficient measures including smart lighting and will be built to BREEAM certified specifications. The ability to sort more parcels locally will be increased, which enables Hermes to reduce parcel miles annually, ultimately decreasing each parcel’s carbon footprint.",[],{"type":126,"text":13315,"spans":13316},"\"The pandemic and lockdown restrictions have expedited the already significant growth of online shopping and we are continuing to make bold investments to ensure we can continue to meet current and future demand. Bolton is a key location for us and forms a vital part of our growing infrastructure.\" ",[13317],{"start":32,"end":11515,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":11968,"spans":13319},[13320],{"start":32,"end":3553,"type":163},"rich_text$7e6094ad-8080-4e52-a7d5-a1179fa1a391",{"id":13323,"uid":13324,"url":13325,"type":50,"href":13326,"tags":13327,"first_publication_date":13328,"last_publication_date":13329,"slugs":13330,"linked_documents":13331,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":13332,"data":13333},"YhentxIAACsA1n5i","hermes-launches-sunday-delivery-service-in-uk-first","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-launches-sunday-delivery-service-in-uk-first","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhentxIAACsA1n5i%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T15:44:30+0000","2025-02-20T16:34:08+0000",[13324],[],[],{"title":13334,"category":8,"metaDescription":13335,"canonical":13336,"titleTag":13337,"featuredImage":13338,"publishedDate":13344,"slices":13345},"Hermes launches Sunday delivery service in UK first","We are launching a Sunday delivery service, meaning we're now offering customers a 7-day service. Find out more here.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-launches-sunday-delivery-service-in-uk-first","Hermes Launches Sunday Delivery Service in UK First | Evri - The New Hermes",{"dimensions":13339,"alt":8899,"copyright":8,"url":8900,"id":8901,"edit":13340,"thumbnail":13341},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":13342,"alt":8899,"copyright":8,"url":8905,"id":8901,"edit":13343},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2014-02-05",[13346],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":13347,"primary":13349,"id":13374,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[13348],{},{"content":13350},[13351,13359,13362,13367,13371],{"type":126,"text":13352,"spans":13353},"Hermes, the UK’s second largest consumer delivery company, is launching a Sunday delivery service to provide added convenience and choice for customers. It is the first consumer delivery company to offer its retail customers a 7- day service.",[13354],{"start":13355,"end":13356,"type":279,"data":13357},74,98,{"link_type":281,"url":13358},"press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.myhermes.co.uk\u002Four-services\u002Fweekend-delivery",{"type":126,"text":13360,"spans":13361},"The Sunday service will initially be available as a next day service, with customers able to order all day Saturday for a Sunday delivery and will be fully tracked.",[],{"type":126,"text":13363,"spans":13364},"\"The retail sector has been trading 7 days a week for a long time now and by introducing this service we are giving online shoppers the same service. We recently commissioned some independent research that found that two thirds of online shoppers found Sunday deliveries appealing. Quite simply it fits around their increasingly busy lifestyles and is often a day they can guarantee being at home. As a result we believe our new Sunday service will increase the first time delivery success rate and overall customer satisfaction.\" ",[13365],{"start":32,"end":13366,"type":1324},531,{"type":126,"text":13368,"spans":13369},"Carole Woodhead, CEO at Hermes UK",[13370],{"start":32,"end":367,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":13372,"spans":13373},"This announcement is just one of the new service initiatives that Hermes has planned to help give its retail clients a competitive edge by providing high levels of service and added convenience for consumers. This includes the opening of a brand new £6m call centre in Leeds and the growth of its myHermes ParcelShop network which now totals 3,500 and will increase to 5,000 in 2014.",[],"rich_text$dca4fe3c-e0c2-4c7f-ae77-12f9832696a5",[13376,13443,13493,13536,13599,13650,13700,13772,13837,13902,13965,14006],{"id":13377,"uid":13378,"url":13379,"type":50,"href":13380,"tags":13381,"first_publication_date":13382,"last_publication_date":13383,"slugs":13384,"linked_documents":13385,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":13386,"data":13387},"YhengBIAACkA1n1i","hermes-uk-trials-voice-in-van-concept","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-uk-trials-voice-in-van-concept","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhengBIAACkA1n1i%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T15:43:05+0000","2025-02-21T09:38:08+0000",[13378],[],[],{"title":13388,"category":8,"metaDescription":13389,"canonical":13390,"titleTag":13391,"featuredImage":13392,"publishedDate":13398,"slices":13399},"Hermes UK trials 'Voice In Van' concept","A voice assistant that supports couriers on their delivery rounds is being trialled in London this month. Read all about it in our latest post.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-uk-trials-voice-in-van-concept","Hermes UK Trials 'Voice In Van' Concept | Evri",{"dimensions":13393,"alt":7957,"copyright":8,"url":7958,"id":7959,"edit":13394,"thumbnail":13395},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":13396,"alt":7957,"copyright":8,"url":7963,"id":7959,"edit":13397},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2021-03-18",[13400],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":13401,"primary":13403,"id":13442,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[13402],{},{"content":13404},[13405,13408,13411,13414,13417,13421,13425,13429,13433,13438],{"type":126,"text":13406,"spans":13407},"A voice assistant that supports couriers on their delivery rounds is being trialled in London this month by Hermes UK and Volkswagen Commercial Vehicles.",[],{"type":126,"text":13409,"spans":13410},"‘Neo’ can broadcast or display specific delivery information to the driver, including the type of delivery and the customer’s preferred safe place location to improve efficiencies and provide enhanced support to new or busy drivers with high parcel volumes, in rush-hour traffic or at unknown destinations.",[],{"type":126,"text":13412,"spans":13413},"The assistant runs on the VW infotainment system and guides the courier through deliveries via voice, making sure that they can fully focus on the road and have all the information they need when they arrive at a delivery destination. The driver can also easily ask for more details about each item on the job list.",[],{"type":126,"text":13415,"spans":13416},"‘Neo’ was created by Neohelden, a German start-up business, and is one of the winners of the Future Logistics Challenge that was launched by Hermes Europe in cooperation with Volkswagen Commercial Vehicles. The challenge was designed to help identify and develop logistics solutions for the future, with each of the winners receiving up to €100,000 to carry out a feasibility test of the ideas that they presented.",[],{"type":126,"text":13418,"spans":13419},"\"Our network of over 27,000 couriers are working hard to deliver ever-increasing volumes driven by the natural growth of e-commerce. On top of that, the pandemic has seen our volumes soar to more than 630 million parcels over the last year and we’ve grown our teams and network of self-employed couriers, which has meant a lot of new starters to onboard, fast. Anything that helps us to do this quicker and supports our couriers in delivering more safely and efficiently is really important, so we’re excited to be part of this trial in partnership with our Innovation Lab team.\" ",[13420],{"start":32,"end":12776,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":13422,"spans":13423},"Lynsey Aston, Head of Product at Hermes UK",[13424],{"start":32,"end":1161,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":13426,"spans":13427},"\"Finding useful solutions in our light commercial vehicle sector and testing them in real-life situations is key for us. When it comes to integration projects of new technologies into existing systems, such as our vehicles, challenges are inevitable. With partners like Neohelden, we had an innovative team next to us that worked out a best-in-class product for our customers.\" ",[13428],{"start":32,"end":1968,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":13430,"spans":13431},"Artur Hasselbach, Volkswagen Commercial Vehicles",[13432],{"start":32,"end":8554,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":13434,"spans":13435},"\"We’re very proud that we could bring our concept from the Future Logistics Challenge to life with Hermes UK and Volkswagen and that our technology can contribute to supporting busy couriers.\" ",[13436],{"start":32,"end":13437,"type":1324},193,{"type":126,"text":13439,"spans":13440},"Philipp Csernalabics, COO at Neohelden",[13441],{"start":32,"end":2884,"type":163},"rich_text$379fa170-fdee-410e-a132-096770522199",{"id":13444,"uid":13445,"url":13446,"type":50,"href":13447,"tags":13448,"first_publication_date":13449,"last_publication_date":13450,"slugs":13451,"linked_documents":13452,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":13453,"data":13454},"YhemmRIAACwA1nkG","hermes-upgrades-to-meet-retailers-delivery-requirements","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-upgrades-to-meet-retailers-delivery-requirements","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhemmRIAACwA1nkG%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T15:39:09+0000","2025-02-20T16:09:12+0000",[13445],[],[],{"title":13455,"category":8,"metaDescription":13456,"canonical":13457,"titleTag":13458,"featuredImage":13459,"publishedDate":13465,"slices":13466},"Hermes Upgrades to Meet Retailers' Delivery Requirements","Catch up on our latest post to learn about how we've expanded our real-time parcel tracking, MI reporting and much more.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-upgrades-to-meet-retailers-delivery-requirements","Hermes Upgrades to Meet Retailers' Delivery Requirements | Evri",{"dimensions":13460,"alt":7957,"copyright":8,"url":7958,"id":7959,"edit":13461,"thumbnail":13462},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":13463,"alt":7957,"copyright":8,"url":7963,"id":7959,"edit":13464},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2022-02-28",[13467],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":13468,"primary":13470,"id":13492,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[13469],{},{"content":13471},[13472,13475,13478,13481,13484,13489],{"type":126,"text":13473,"spans":13474},"Hermes, the UK's largest courier delivery network, has expanded its real-time parcel tracking, MI reporting and SMS messaging capabilities in parallel with a major upgrade of the company’s Courier Hand Held Terminal. These service enhancements build on the initial, successful deployment of mobile handheld terminals across 7,500 couriers last year and will enable Hermes to further meet the needs of its retail customers and improve the delivery experience for the consumer.",[],{"type":126,"text":13476,"spans":13477},"Real-time parcel tracking will now provide instant access to data, with information captured at each stage of the delivery process using the handheld terminals. This will provide retailers with immediate confirmation of delivery status and provides the platform to trigger consumer communication via email or the new SMS messaging service.",[],{"type":126,"text":13479,"spans":13480},"Added SMS functionality will enable home shoppers to be notified of a planned delivery and to be informed of an unattended delivery the moment it happens. Hermes is currently exploring the opportunity for wider SMS services in the future.",[],{"type":126,"text":13482,"spans":13483},"A new suite of key service performance reports will build on existing MI reporting capabilities to provide clients with greater visibility, certainty and understanding of their home delivery operation. The package will cover both delivery and collection performance and exception reporting. It will provide the ability to analyse a diverse range of data to identify trends, delivery issues and network performance as part of Hermes’ commitment to continuous service improvement. This will enable retailers to better manage and develop their home delivery solution to meet the needs of customers.",[],{"type":126,"text":13485,"spans":13486},"\"The implementation of the mobile communications infrastructure last year created the foundation for us to transform the way we track, trace and report on the delivery of parcels. This next stage of development is already enhancing the service we provide to our customers and statistically demonstrating our proven ability to deliver a high quality doorstep experience to the consumer.\" ",[13487],{"start":32,"end":13488,"type":1324},387,{"type":126,"text":11517,"spans":13490},[13491],{"start":32,"end":367,"type":163},"rich_text$007cc5de-2c07-45c2-a1be-20c716fd3132",{"id":13494,"uid":13495,"url":13496,"type":50,"href":13497,"tags":13498,"first_publication_date":13499,"last_publication_date":13500,"slugs":13501,"linked_documents":13503,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":13504,"data":13505},"YheftRIAACoA1lsW","hermes-launches-road-to-logisitcs-scheme","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-launches-road-to-logisitcs-scheme","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YheftRIAACoA1lsW%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T15:09:47+0000","2025-02-21T08:31:17+0000",[13502],"hermes-launches-road-to-logistics-scheme",[],[],{"title":13506,"category":8,"metaDescription":13507,"canonical":13508,"titleTag":13509,"featuredImage":13510,"publishedDate":13520,"slices":13521},"Hermes launches Road to Logistics scheme","Catch our latest post to read about the initiative aimed at addressing the UK driver shortage, enabling unemployed workers to gain the skills needed.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-launches-road-to-logisitcs-scheme","Hermes Launches Road to Logistics Scheme | Evri - The New Hermes",{"dimensions":13511,"alt":13512,"copyright":8,"url":13513,"id":13514,"edit":13515,"thumbnail":13516},{"width":65,"height":865},"An Evri Courier is walking down the street in a residential area with a parcel under his arm.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ69xYZbqstJ9-pUz_EVRI_LOCATION_01_0687.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z69xYZbqstJ9-pUz",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":13517,"alt":13512,"copyright":8,"url":13518,"id":13514,"edit":13519},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ69xYZbqstJ9-pUz_EVRI_LOCATION_01_0687.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2019-05-10",[13522],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":13523,"primary":13525,"id":11227,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[13524],{},{"content":13526},[13527,13530,13533],{"type":126,"text":13528,"spans":13529},"Leading consumer delivery company Hermes UK has launched a new initiative to help address the UK driver shortage and enable unemployed workers to gain valuable skills and the possibility of full-time employment.  It is designed to ensure the company has its own ‘talent pipeline’ and is prepared for any future legislation and possible Brexit impact.",[],{"type":126,"text":13531,"spans":13532},"The new “Road to Logistics” programme is funded through the company’s Apprenticeship Levy and will see Hermes recruit a number of LGV Apprentices who currently have no driving experience, supporting them to achieve their Cat C and Cat C&E Licence. The scheme is open to applicants of any age with the training taking 12 months.  All successful participants will then be offered roles as employed Hub Drivers within Hermes’ hubs at Warrington and Rugby.",[],{"type":126,"text":13534,"spans":13535},"The bespoke scheme is supported by Seetec, Hermes’ training provider, and includes both theory and practical sessions.",[],{"id":13537,"uid":13538,"url":13539,"type":50,"href":13540,"tags":13541,"first_publication_date":13542,"last_publication_date":13543,"slugs":13544,"linked_documents":13545,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":13546,"data":13547},"YhefKxIAACkA1liX","hermes-wins-prestigious-national-business-award","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-wins-prestigious-national-business-award","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhefKxIAACkA1liX%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T15:07:28+0000","2025-02-20T16:25:40+0000",[13538],[],[],{"title":13548,"category":8,"metaDescription":13549,"canonical":13550,"titleTag":13551,"featuredImage":13552,"publishedDate":11487,"slices":13558},"Hermes Wins Prestigious National Business Award","We're pleased to say we have won a top accolade at this year's National Business Awards. Read more in this blog post.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-wins-prestigious-national-business-award","Hermes Wins Prestigious National Business Award | Evri",{"dimensions":13553,"alt":5216,"copyright":8,"url":5217,"id":5218,"edit":13554,"thumbnail":13555},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":13556,"alt":5216,"copyright":8,"url":5222,"id":5218,"edit":13557},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},[13559],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":13560,"primary":13562,"id":13598,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[13561],{},{"content":13563},[13564,13567,13570,13575,13578,13583,13587,13591,13595],{"type":126,"text":13565,"spans":13566},"Hermes UK, the leading consumer delivery specialist has received a top accolade at this year’s National Business Awards. The company won the Growth Business of the Year category having been recognised for the significant expansion in the business that has seen a 53 per cent growth in parcel volumes in the past three years, with a further 15-20 per cent expected this year.",[],{"type":126,"text":13568,"spans":13569},"The twelfth annual National Business Awards held at London’s Grosvenor House Hotel was opened by a video address from the Rt Hon David Cameron and followed by Sir Bob Geldof, who addressed the 1200 attending business leaders on the role of business in society. HRH Prince Andrew also announced his support for the launch of The HRH Duke of York New Entrepreneur of the Year Award for 2014.",[],{"type":126,"text":13571,"spans":13572},"\"We are thrilled to be recognised by the National Business Awards. Our success is the result of unrivalled levels of commitment and passion being displayed throughout the organisation. In the past few years we have transformed into a leading multichannel delivery business in response to changing retail and consumer requirements. This ensures we are best placed to meet the demands of the online shopping marketplace, which is expected to more than double in size by 2020.\" ",[13573],{"start":32,"end":13574,"type":1324},475,{"type":126,"text":11517,"spans":13576},[13577],{"start":32,"end":367,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":13579,"spans":13580},"\"Visionary leadership has enabled Hermes to transform itself and deliver very impressive growth. With a real focus on its customers, how it can deliver solutions and continually improve its service offer, Hermes shows a deep understanding of the changing marketplace and how the company itself needs to evolve to meet changing market requirements.\" ",[13581],{"start":32,"end":13582,"type":1324},349,{"type":126,"text":13584,"spans":13585},"Judge Yvonne Quinn from Cranfield School of Management",[13586],{"start":32,"end":3241,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":13588,"spans":13589},"\"The full spectrum of British business has been honoured in 2013 - from exemplary social enterprise to fast growth start-up, inspirational SME to transformational PLC, and dynamic entrepreneur to visionary CEO. The National Business Awards truly reflect the quality and diversity driving economic growth in the UK.\" ",[13590],{"start":32,"end":6694,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":13592,"spans":13593},"Alex Evans, Programme Director of the National Business Awards",[13594],{"start":32,"end":3544,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":13596,"spans":13597},"The 2013 National Business Awards supports the Prince’s Trust, a charity that offers practical and financial support to young people who need it.",[],"rich_text$321ac9e6-ee6e-4096-93b6-9c86390a5650",{"id":13600,"uid":13601,"url":13602,"type":50,"href":13603,"tags":13604,"first_publication_date":13605,"last_publication_date":13606,"slugs":13607,"linked_documents":13608,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":13609,"data":13610},"YheeDRIAAC4A1lay","warrington-pupils-make-their-own-special-delivery-at-hermes-hub","\u002Fpress\u002Fwarrington-pupils-make-their-own-special-delivery-at-hermes-hub","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YheeDRIAAC4A1lay%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T15:02:53+0000","2025-02-21T08:35:27+0000",[13601],[],[],{"title":13611,"category":8,"metaDescription":13612,"canonical":13613,"titleTag":13614,"featuredImage":13615,"publishedDate":13625,"slices":13626},"Warrington pupils make their own special delivery at Hermes hub","This week, we welcomed pupils from Sacred Heart Primary School to visit our Warrington Hub. Read all about their exciting visit in our latest blog.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fwarrington-pupils-make-their-own-special-delivery-at-hermes-hub","Warrington Pupils Make Their Own Special Delivery at Hermes Hub | Evri",{"dimensions":13616,"alt":13617,"copyright":8,"url":13618,"id":13619,"edit":13620,"thumbnail":13621},{"width":65,"height":865},"An Evri Courier is approaching the doorstep of a house in a residential area. He is carrying a single parcel, ready to deliver it.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ69xOpbqstJ9-pUt_EVRI_LOCATION_01_0022.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z69xOpbqstJ9-pUt",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":13622,"alt":13617,"copyright":8,"url":13623,"id":13619,"edit":13624},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ69xOpbqstJ9-pUt_EVRI_LOCATION_01_0022.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2019-07-10",[13627],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":13628,"primary":13630,"id":13649,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[13629],{},{"content":13631},[13632,13635,13638,13640,13645],{"type":126,"text":13633,"spans":13634},"Excited schoolchildren from Warrington have been given a special guided tour of Hermes’ hub at Omega Park. Twenty-seven pupils from Sacred Heart Primary School, in Selby Street, took part in a pre-summer holidays excursion as they learnt about what happens to a parcel when you shop online.",[],{"type":126,"text":13636,"spans":13637},"The Year 2 children were each allocated their own special Hermes hi-vis jackets as they saw lorries being unloaded, before being given the chance to place their own special parcel on to the huge automatic sorters. The pupils also visited the control room in order to speak to drivers on the radio, as well as exploring inside one of Hermes’ CNG (Compressed Natural Gas) lorries, where they enjoyed revving the engine and beeping the horn.",[],{"type":126,"text":9413,"spans":13639},[],{"type":126,"text":13641,"spans":13642},"\"After a long school year we wanted to treat the children by giving them a special insight into the journey of a parcel, as well as taking part in some fun activities. However, the pupils were also given an important lesson in health and safety, and how that plays an important part in everything we do.\" ",[13643],{"start":32,"end":13644,"type":1324},305,{"type":126,"text":13646,"spans":13647},"Wayne Antrobus, Warrington Hub Operations Manager at Hermes",[13648],{"start":32,"end":1676,"type":163},"rich_text$91be9c5c-a1ff-4922-a331-3554231fa2e5",{"id":13651,"uid":13652,"url":13653,"type":50,"href":13654,"tags":13655,"first_publication_date":13656,"last_publication_date":13657,"slugs":13658,"linked_documents":13659,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":13660,"data":13661},"YhebyxIAACoA1lOi","hermes-launches-myplaces","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-launches-myplaces","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhebyxIAACoA1lOi%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T14:53:05+0000","2025-02-21T09:12:06+0000",[13652],[],[],{"title":13662,"category":8,"metaDescription":13663,"canonical":13664,"titleTag":13665,"featuredImage":13666,"publishedDate":13676,"slices":13677},"Hermes launches MyPlaces","We've launched a brand new feature - 'MyPlaces' in a move to support contactless delivery during the pandemic. Read our latest blog to find out more.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-launches-myplaces","Hermes Launches MyPlaces | Evri",{"dimensions":13667,"alt":13668,"copyright":8,"url":13669,"id":13670,"edit":13671,"thumbnail":13672},{"width":65,"height":865},"A parcel has been placed inside a garden shed out of public view and protected from the elements.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TxIJbqstJ9-UUd_EVRI_LOCATION_06_8848.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,7783,5189&w=960&h=640","Z6TxIJbqstJ9-UUd",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":13673,"alt":13668,"copyright":8,"url":13674,"id":13670,"edit":13675},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TxIJbqstJ9-UUd_EVRI_LOCATION_06_8848.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,751,7783,3689&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":4811,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2020-06-24",[13678],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":13679,"primary":13681,"id":13699,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[13680],{},{"content":13682},[13683,13686,13689,13692,13696],{"type":126,"text":13684,"spans":13685},"Hermes UK, the leading consumer delivery company, has introduced ‘MyPlaces’ in a move designed to further support its commitment to ‘contactless delivery’ during the pandemic and help provide an accurate first-time delivery option for when people are not in. MyPlaces enables customers to choose a preferred safe place at their home address and upload a photo of it to assist the delivery.",[],{"type":126,"text":13687,"spans":13688},"The information on MyPlaces can be amended at any time and notes added for increased clarity providing the option for up to date, real time communication with the courier. Other features to be rolled out later this year include the ability to use What3Words to set the exact location, adding PIN codes for access to their property, setting a preferred ParcelShop & Locker location. Future enhancements will also include the ability for customers to add waypoints to their designated place and it will provide the courier with a platform to ask for further instructions if any delivery is complex or difficult to find.",[],{"type":126,"text":13690,"spans":13691},"It is accessible through the Hermes app and a number of Hermes retail clients are also now integrating this improved delivery process into their customer journey, placing links to the Hermes app on their websites. Clients are also signposting to the app in their customer notifications so that their customers can save preferences for future deliveries.",[],{"type":126,"text":13693,"spans":13694},"\"MyPlaces is the latest innovation from Hermes designed to promote delivery accuracy and give consumers more choice and control over their deliveries, whilst ensuring that safety remains a key priority. It is particularly useful for customers with addresses that are hard to find both in busy cities but also rural locations.\" ",[13695],{"start":32,"end":6223,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":13162,"spans":13697},[13698],{"start":32,"end":1084,"type":163},"rich_text$9d72f118-e97d-4d05-a379-a0099e442bb0",{"id":13701,"uid":13702,"url":13703,"type":50,"href":13704,"tags":13705,"first_publication_date":13706,"last_publication_date":13707,"slugs":13708,"linked_documents":13709,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":13710,"data":13711},"YheVcxIAAC4A1j5n","hermes-launches-europes-largest-consumer-parcel-network","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-launches-europes-largest-consumer-parcel-network","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YheVcxIAAC4A1j5n%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T14:26:01+0000","2025-02-20T16:35:16+0000",[13702],[],[],{"title":13712,"category":8,"metaDescription":13713,"canonical":13714,"titleTag":13715,"featuredImage":13716,"publishedDate":13727,"slices":13728},"Hermes launches Europe’s largest consumer parcel network","Our latest blog details the launch of the most comprehensive international delivery solution on the market.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-launches-europes-largest-consumer-parcel-network","Hermes Launches Europe’s Largest Consumer Parcel Network | Evri - The New Hermes",{"dimensions":13717,"alt":13718,"copyright":8,"url":13719,"id":13720,"edit":13721,"thumbnail":13722},{"width":65,"height":11389},"A customer sitting in a wheelchair is outside their house and holding their parcel as the courier takes a photo for proof of delivery. The customer is in full view with a side profile of the courier.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XpzJbqstJ9-Wbo_EVRI_LOCATION_01_0944.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=3,0,8287,5628&w=960&h=652","Z6XpzJbqstJ9-Wbo",{"x":903,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":13723,"alt":13718,"copyright":8,"url":13724,"id":13720,"edit":13725},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XpzJbqstJ9-Wbo_EVRI_LOCATION_01_0944.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,849,8292,3930&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":13726,"zoom":33,"background":71},849,"2014-07-16",[13729],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":13730,"primary":13732,"id":13771,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[13731],{},{"content":13733},[13734,13737,13740,13743,13748,13751,13755,13759,13764,13768],{"type":126,"text":13735,"spans":13736},"Hermes has launched the most comprehensive international delivery solution on the market, enabling retailers seamless access to consumers in 20 European countries. It will also provide a simple and effective cross border returns service designed to overcome the reticence of international customers to buy from overseas websites due to concerns about returning unwanted items.*",[],{"type":126,"text":13738,"spans":13739},"The Hermes International service offers a fully tracked end-to-end solution that can be managed through a single point of integration. All transportation will be undertaken by Hermes Logistics’ own fleet throughout Europe delivering a secure, single carrier experience, with a number of final mile options including access to over 36,000 parcel shops and Hermes’ unique courier model.",[],{"type":126,"text":13741,"spans":13742},"The service will be supported by a dedicated international team based in Hamburg providing a single point of contact. There are also plans in place to expand the service beyond its current focus on EU countries to comprise a total of 35 countries, including Russia by 2015.",[],{"type":126,"text":13744,"spans":13745},"\"Many of our customers are actively pursuing a strategy of international growth and we need to be able to support them with the best possible solution in the marketplace. Hermes International offers a unique combination of scale and local presence which enables us to take into consideration the cultural difference within the region and provide a service that works at both an international and domestic level. \"",[13746],{"start":32,"end":13747,"type":1324},413,{"type":126,"text":13368,"spans":13749},[13750],{"start":32,"end":367,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":13752,"spans":13753},"\"The announcement of the international service from Hermes is good news for retailers like us who are looking to extend our reach overseas. The fact that it offers attractive rates, a fully tracked service and a single point of integration make the service extremely appealing, as does the access to 36,000 ParcelShops across the region.\" ",[13754],{"start":32,"end":12625,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":13756,"spans":13757},"Tony Brown at Joe Browns",[13758],{"start":32,"end":1075,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":13760,"spans":13761},"\"By creating the largest consumer parcel network in Europe, we are providing clients and customers alike with the best possible conditions to participate in the on-going boom in e-commerce. \"",[13762],{"start":32,"end":13763,"type":1324},191,{"type":126,"text":13765,"spans":13766},"Hanjo Schneider, Member of the Executive Board at the Otto Group with responsibility for services and CEO of Hermes Europe GmbH",[13767],{"start":32,"end":8545,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":13769,"spans":13770},"*Research undertaken by Hermes UK last year found that 50% of people were fearful of difficulties with the returns process when buying from international websites.",[],"rich_text$9a9dbcba-7629-44ef-a940-9100fb67d240",{"id":13773,"uid":13774,"url":13775,"type":50,"href":13776,"tags":13777,"first_publication_date":13778,"last_publication_date":13779,"slugs":13780,"linked_documents":13782,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":13783,"data":13784},"YheQNhIAAC8A1i1C","unique-technology-makes-parcels-personal-as-hermes","\u002Fpress\u002Funique-technology-makes-parcels-personal-as-hermes","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YheQNhIAAC8A1i1C%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T14:08:58+0000","2025-02-21T08:27:06+0000",[13781],"hermes-play-goes-live",[],[],{"title":13785,"category":8,"metaDescription":13786,"canonical":13787,"titleTag":13788,"featuredImage":13789,"publishedDate":13799,"slices":13800},"Hermes Play Goes Live","We're proud to launch our industry leading new product, Hermes Play. Read all about it in our latest blog.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Funique-technology-makes-parcels-personal-as-hermes","Unique Technology 'Makes Parcels Personal' as Hermes Play Goes Live | Evri - The New Hermes",{"dimensions":13790,"alt":13791,"copyright":8,"url":13792,"id":13793,"edit":13794,"thumbnail":13795},{"width":65,"height":865},"A mother and her two children record an Evri video on their mobile device. They are sat cuddled up on a sofa in their living room.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6tj7JbqstJ9-fAt_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7276.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6tj7JbqstJ9-fAt",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":13796,"alt":13791,"copyright":8,"url":13797,"id":13793,"edit":13798},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6tj7JbqstJ9-fAt_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7276.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2019-02-14",[13801],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":13802,"primary":13804,"id":13836,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[13803],{},{"content":13805},[13806,13809,13812,13815,13818,13821,13825,13829,13833],{"type":126,"text":13807,"spans":13808},"Hermes Play, an industry-leading product which allows senders to record and attach personal videos to their parcels via an app, has now gone live.  The augmented reality technology aims to bring people together and has been launched in the run-up to Valentine’s Day so that customers could send personalised videos to loved ones.",[],{"type":126,"text":13810,"spans":13811},"Over 100 video messages have been sent within the first few days, including messages from small businesses, Happy Birthday and Valentine’s declarations.",[],{"type":126,"text":13813,"spans":13814},"Created within the leading consumer delivery company’s Innovation Lab, Hermes Play allows the sender to pre-record a personal message which is then uploaded via the Hermes Send app.",[],{"type":126,"text":13816,"spans":13817},"A 2D barcode (similar to a QR code) is then created which is added to the parcel label. The parcel recipient is then invited to scan the code and watch the video message on their phone or tablet.  The video uses augmented reality to bring the parcel to life so that the video plays on top of the parcel itself\u002F  Videos will be saved for a maximum of 30 days.",[],{"type":126,"text":13819,"spans":13820},"Free of charge for a limited time, Hermes Play is available to anyone using the Hermes app and is compatible with both Android and iPhone devices. Later this year it will be rolled out to Hermes’ retail clients, who will be able to use it to further personalise their service to consumers, with the ability to share a variety of videos including promotions or DIY instructions for products.",[],{"type":126,"text":13822,"spans":13823},"\"I thought Hermes Play was a great idea, I stumbled across it in the app and I was excited to make a video for a customer who had bought something I sold on eBay. I thought it was a nice personal touch, I am downsizing and selling a few collectable items so was a great way to them tell about what else I am selling.\" ",[13824],{"start":32,"end":9587,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":13826,"spans":13827},"Brian Redwood, eBay seller and one of the first users of Play",[13828],{"start":32,"end":309,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":13830,"spans":13831},"\"At Hermes this year our mission is to make parcels even more personal and our digital teams have been working hard to create new and exciting initiatives. Hermes Play is a unique, fantastic service that can be used by consumers to send messages to family and friends or by businesses for a more commercially focussed approach. It’s designed to create a personal connection and make the experience of sending and receiving a parcel just that little bit more special.\"",[13832],{"start":32,"end":12767,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":13162,"spans":13834},[13835],{"start":32,"end":1084,"type":163},"rich_text$fbb98802-0c08-4dbc-9c57-d04303c8296f",{"id":13838,"uid":13839,"url":13840,"type":50,"href":13841,"tags":13842,"first_publication_date":13843,"last_publication_date":13844,"slugs":13845,"linked_documents":13847,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":13848,"data":13849},"YheQshIAACsA1i2s","hermes-launches-early-stage-trials-of-self-driving-vans-in-oxford","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-launches-early-stage-trials-of-self-driving-vans-in-oxford","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YheQshIAACsA1i2s%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T14:05:41+0000","2025-02-20T16:46:44+0000",[13846],"hermes-uk-launches-early-stage-trials-of-self-driving-vans-in-oxford",[],[],{"title":13850,"category":8,"metaDescription":13851,"canonical":13852,"titleTag":13853,"featuredImage":13854,"publishedDate":13860,"slices":13861},"Hermes UK launches early stage trials of self-driving vans in Oxford","Read our latest blog to find out how we've became part of a Ford trial designed to make city deliveries more efficient.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-launches-early-stage-trials-of-self-driving-vans-in-oxford","Hermes UK Launches Early Stage Trials of Self-Driving Vans in Oxford | Evri - The New Hermes",{"dimensions":13855,"alt":12809,"copyright":8,"url":12810,"id":12811,"edit":13856,"thumbnail":13857},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":13858,"alt":12809,"copyright":8,"url":12815,"id":12811,"edit":13859},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2018-06-12",[13862],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":13863,"primary":13865,"id":13901,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[13864],{},{"content":13866},[13867,13870,13874,13877,13880,13885,13889,13894,13898],{"type":126,"text":13868,"spans":13869},"Hermes, the consumer delivery specialist, has become the first customer to take part in an early stage trial with Ford, Europe’s market leader in commercial vehicles, to make city deliveries more efficient and sustainable in the future.",[],{"type":126,"text":13871,"spans":13872},"Ford’s new ‘European Self-Driving Vehicle Research Programme’ has been designed to help businesses in Europe understand how autonomous vehicles can benefit their operations.  The two-week trial will use a specially adapted Ford commercial vehicle featuring sensors that mimic the look of an actual self-driving vehicle, while enabling an experienced, hidden driver to ‘drive’.  The research aims to better understand how other road users would interact with an apparently driverless delivery van. ",[13873],{"start":327,"end":5240,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":13875,"spans":13876},"The driver will play an entirely passive role, simply driving the vehicle. Pedestrian couriers will support the delivery van equipped with a smartphone app that lets them hail the vehicle and remotely unlock the load door after it is safely parked at the roadside. Once inside, voice prompts and digital screens will direct the courier to the locker containing the parcels to be delivered.",[],{"type":126,"text":13878,"spans":13879},"The research vehicles will enable Hermes to understand how their teams could work alongside driverless vehicles ensuring that business processes are able to continue safely without a driver present. ",[],{"type":126,"text":13881,"spans":13882},"\"We’re excited to collaborate with Ford on this proof of concept trial, which is all about understanding the potential for autonomous vehicles and if they have a role in delivery in the longer-term future. We’re constantly innovating to incubate and then explore concepts like this, and we look forward to the initial findings, which will no doubt be useful on an industry-wide level. \"",[13883],{"start":32,"end":13884,"type":1324},386,{"type":126,"text":13886,"spans":13887},"Lynsey Aston, Head of Product, Innovation and Onboarding at Hermes UK",[13888],{"start":32,"end":630,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":13890,"spans":13891},"\"As we plan to bring autonomous vehicles to the roads, it is important that we focus not only on enabling the technology, but on enabling our customers’ businesses. Clearly, there is no better way to identify how they may need to adapt than to experience those processes in real life.\" ",[13892],{"start":32,"end":13893,"type":1324},286,{"type":126,"text":13895,"spans":13896},"Richard Balch, Director, Autonomous Vehicles and Mobility at Ford of Europe",[13897],{"start":32,"end":1666,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":13899,"spans":13900},"Ford has for six years been Europe’s market leader in commercial vehicles. By harnessing this experience with Hermes, the company intends to identify new opportunities and models for autonomous vehicle operations – in particular understanding how existing processes and human interactions can work alongside automated vehicles. Commercial vehicles’ planned operations and many human interactions are an ideal test case.",[],"rich_text$9106c846-901c-4937-a772-55987c39dad3",{"id":13903,"uid":13904,"url":13905,"type":50,"href":13906,"tags":13907,"first_publication_date":13908,"last_publication_date":13909,"slugs":13910,"linked_documents":13912,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":13913,"data":13914},"YheMgRIAACsA1if6","rugby-mp-visits-hermes-parcel-hub--to-view-latest-expansion","\u002Fpress\u002Frugby-mp-visits-hermes-parcel-hub--to-view-latest-expansion","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YheMgRIAACsA1if6%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T13:48:05+0000","2025-02-21T08:43:35+0000",[13911],"rugby-mp-visits-hermes-parcel-hub",[],[],{"title":13915,"category":8,"metaDescription":13916,"canonical":13917,"titleTag":13918,"featuredImage":13919,"publishedDate":13925,"slices":13926},"Rugby MP Visits Hermes' Parcel Hub","Rugby MP Mark Pawsey has this week visited Hermes Rugby Hub. Read all about his experience in this post.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Frugby-mp-visits-hermes-parcel-hub--to-view-latest-expansion","Rugby MP Visits Hermes' Parcel Hub to View Latest Expansion | Evri",{"dimensions":13920,"alt":9075,"copyright":8,"url":9076,"id":9077,"edit":13921,"thumbnail":13922},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":13923,"alt":9075,"copyright":8,"url":9081,"id":9077,"edit":13924},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2019-10-08",[13927],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":13928,"primary":13930,"id":13964,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[13929],{},{"content":13931},[13932,13935,13938,13941,13944,13947,13952,13956,13960],{"type":126,"text":13933,"spans":13934},"Conservative MP Mark Pawsey has visited the Hermes Parcel Hub at Rugby Gateway to see its latest expansion in operation, two years after he officially opened the £31m facility, which is the biggest of its kind in the UK.  ",[],{"type":126,"text":13936,"spans":13937},"The Hermes team gave the MP for Rugby a tour of facility, which has a significantly boosted capacity for the upcoming peak season with the completion of a third sortation tier.",[],{"type":126,"text":13939,"spans":13940},"This gives the hub the capability to process 1.35 million parcels each day, enhancing existing output by 40% and ensuring it will continue to comfortably handle rising volumes of parcels driven by the growth of online shopping in the UK and overseas. The investment has also boosted jobs at the site by a third.",[],{"type":126,"text":13942,"spans":13943},"The tour was then followed by discussions around Hermes’ overall business performance which has seen double digit growth over the past few years. The company expects to successfully deliver a record 390 million parcels this year.",[],{"type":126,"text":13945,"spans":13946},"Sustainability was also on the agenda as Hermes demonstrated how it is pioneering alternative low carbon fuels to slash emissions, looking to expand its electric fleet outside of London and planning to trial hydrogen tractor units next year.",[],{"type":126,"text":13948,"spans":13949},"\"Re-visiting Hermes’ Rugby Hub was a great opportunity to see the operational expansion ahead of the firm’s busiest period. It’s encouraging to see how the business is continually investing in our region, its employees and in greener, more efficient vehicles as it grows.\" ",[13950],{"start":32,"end":13951,"type":1324},273,{"type":126,"text":13953,"spans":13954},"Mark Pawsey MP",[13955],{"start":32,"end":341,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":13957,"spans":13958},"\"We very much appreciate that Mr Pawsey has taken the time to visit us for an update on both this site and our broader operations. We are committed to supporting the local community and economy both now and in the future.\" ",[13959],{"start":32,"end":8405,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":13961,"spans":13962},"Craig Ryder, Hub General Manager at Hermes",[13963],{"start":32,"end":1161,"type":163},"rich_text$b19a0ce1-a205-419a-9aef-ab9df817d290",{"id":13966,"uid":13967,"url":13968,"type":50,"href":13969,"tags":13970,"first_publication_date":13971,"last_publication_date":13972,"slugs":13973,"linked_documents":13975,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":13976,"data":13977},"YheJOBIAACgA1iJt","new-normanton-distribution-depot-opens-creating-133-jobs","\u002Fpress\u002Fnew-normanton-distribution-depot-opens-creating-133-jobs","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YheJOBIAACgA1iJt%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T13:33:51+0000","2025-02-21T09:12:37+0000",[13974],"normanton-depot-opens-creating-133-jobs",[],[],{"title":13978,"category":8,"metaDescription":13979,"canonical":13980,"titleTag":13981,"featuredImage":13982,"publishedDate":13992,"slices":13993},"Normanton Depot Opens Creating 133 Jobs","This week we have launched a brand-new distribution depot in Normanton, creating 133 new jobs. Catch up on this in our latest blog.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fnew-normanton-distribution-depot-opens-creating-133-jobs","New Normanton Distribution Depot Opens Creating 133 Jobs | Evri",{"dimensions":13983,"alt":13984,"copyright":8,"url":13985,"id":13986,"edit":13987,"thumbnail":13988},{"width":65,"height":865},"A female courier in an Evri branded sweater poses with a parcel on a driveway.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zAwpbqstJ9-iOD_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9714.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6zAwpbqstJ9-iOD",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":13989,"alt":13984,"copyright":8,"url":13990,"id":13986,"edit":13991},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zAwpbqstJ9-iOD_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9714.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2020-08-17",[13994],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":13995,"primary":13997,"id":14005,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[13996],{},{"content":13998},[13999,14002],{"type":126,"text":14000,"spans":14001},"Today sees the opening of a new distribution depot by Hermes UK, the consumer delivery specialists, in Gilcar Way, Castleford. Around 133 new jobs have been created at the 111K sq ft warehouse, which has been opened ahead of the busy Black Friday and Christmas peak periods.",[],{"type":126,"text":14003,"spans":14004},"The new Normanton facility will be able to handle over 84K parcels each day with the ability to operate 24\u002F7 as needed. It forms part of the ongoing investment programme by Hermes UK to expand its capacity to meet the huge demand created by people shopping at home during lockdown and the continuing growth in the sector. The company estimates that it will see record parcel volumes later this year, up to 3.5 million each day across its network, almost double that of last year.",[],"rich_text$9cd7bb91-93a0-4c90-b66c-9d9418221cea",{"id":14007,"uid":14008,"url":14009,"type":50,"href":14010,"tags":14011,"first_publication_date":14012,"last_publication_date":14013,"slugs":14014,"linked_documents":14016,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":14017,"data":14018},"YhdxzxIAAC4A1fln","new-distribution-depot-opens-creating-133-jobs","\u002Fpress\u002Fnew-distribution-depot-opens-creating-133-jobs","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhdxzxIAAC4A1fln%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T13:28:15+0000","2025-02-20T16:20:11+0000",[14015],"new-lakeside-distribution-depot-opens-creating-133-jobs",[],[],{"title":14019,"category":8,"metaDescription":14020,"canonical":14021,"titleTag":14022,"featuredImage":14023,"publishedDate":14032,"slices":14033},"New Lakeside Distribution Depot Opens Creating 133 jobs","This week we have launched a brand-new distribution depot in West Thurrock. Catch up on this in our latest blog.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fnew-distribution-depot-opens-creating-133-jobs","New Lakeside Distribution Depot Opens Creating 133 jobs | Evri",{"dimensions":14024,"alt":7652,"copyright":8,"url":14025,"id":14026,"edit":14027,"thumbnail":14028},{"width":65,"height":865},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDbpbqstJ9-cfN_EVRI_LOCATION_04_3670.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6pDbpbqstJ9-cfN",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":14029,"alt":7652,"copyright":8,"url":14030,"id":14026,"edit":14031},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDbpbqstJ9-cfN_EVRI_LOCATION_04_3670.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2021-10-14",[14034,14055,14079],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":14035,"primary":14037,"id":14054,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[14036],{},{"content":14038},[14039,14042,14045,14050],{"type":126,"text":14040,"spans":14041},"This week sees the opening of a new distribution depot by Hermes UK, the consumer delivery specialists, in Valor Park, West Thurrock. Around 140 new jobs have been created at the 157K sq ft warehouse, which has been opened ahead of the busy Black Friday and Christmas peak periods.",[],{"type":126,"text":14043,"spans":14044},"The new facility will be able to handle over 115K parcels each day with the ability to operate 24\u002F7 as needed. It forms part of the ongoing investment programme by Hermes UK to expand its capacity to meet the huge demand created by people shopping at home during lockdown and the continuing growth in the sector. The company estimates that it will see record parcel volumes later this year.",[],{"type":126,"text":14046,"spans":14047},"\"It has been a hectic but successful couple of days since we opened. Our new team includes people from all kinds of professions who have been made redundant as a result of the Covid-19 pandemic and being able to employ so many local people from the area has been really important for me. We are getting ready for a busy Black Friday and Christmas period and will be working hard to ensure that our customers continue to get a fantastic service.\" ",[14048],{"start":32,"end":14049,"type":1324},446,{"type":126,"text":14051,"spans":14052},"Sidonia Grigorie, Depot General Manager at Hermes UK",[14053],{"start":32,"end":684,"type":163},"rich_text$9d4d7574-26c1-4790-ae4a-e4d53f4aec88",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":14056,"primary":14058,"id":14078,"slice_type":12184,"slice_label":8},[14057],{},{"Image":14059},{"dimensions":14060,"alt":14061,"copyright":8,"url":14062,"id":11415,"edit":14063,"tablet":14066,"mobile":14072},{"width":12164,"height":12165},"employees in blue jackets gathered in warehouse with balloons in entrance","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ff0e77a86-459d-4056-b701-4d6cb4627508_new+depot+image+3.jpg?auto=compress,format&rect=0,331,1280,299&w=1200&h=280",{"x":32,"y":14064,"zoom":14065,"background":34},-310,0.9375,{"dimensions":14067,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":14068,"id":11415,"edit":14069},{"width":12171,"height":12172},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ff0e77a86-459d-4056-b701-4d6cb4627508_new+depot+image+3.jpg?auto=compress,format&rect=0,262,1280,436&w=704&h=240",{"x":32,"y":14070,"zoom":14071,"background":34},-144,0.55,{"dimensions":14073,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":14074,"id":11415,"edit":14075},{"width":12178,"height":12179},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ff0e77a86-459d-4056-b701-4d6cb4627508_new+depot+image+3.jpg?auto=compress,format&rect=0,179,1280,597&w=343&h=160",{"x":32,"y":14076,"zoom":14077,"background":34},-48,0.26796875,"photo_block$f14f80b8-2115-4c09-9274-ebb43e80b8c5",{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":14080,"primary":14082,"id":14096,"slice_type":12184,"slice_label":8},[14081],{},{"Image":14083},{"dimensions":14084,"alt":14085,"copyright":8,"url":14086,"id":12232,"edit":14087,"tablet":14088,"mobile":14092},{"width":12164,"height":12165},"open warehouse with vans, forklifts and pallets lined up at edges","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fe63aee59-96e1-4536-93eb-aa2ce9bfd164_new+depot+image+2.jpg?auto=compress,format&rect=0,331,1280,299&w=1200&h=280",{"x":32,"y":14064,"zoom":14065,"background":34},{"dimensions":14089,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":14090,"id":12232,"edit":14091},{"width":12171,"height":12172},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fe63aee59-96e1-4536-93eb-aa2ce9bfd164_new+depot+image+2.jpg?auto=compress,format&rect=0,262,1280,436&w=704&h=240",{"x":32,"y":14070,"zoom":14071,"background":34},{"dimensions":14093,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":14094,"id":12232,"edit":14095},{"width":12178,"height":12179},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fe63aee59-96e1-4536-93eb-aa2ce9bfd164_new+depot+image+2.jpg?auto=compress,format&rect=0,179,1280,597&w=343&h=160",{"x":32,"y":14076,"zoom":14077,"background":34},"photo_block$d4560211-ed4d-48c0-825f-cff572e6a1e7",[14098,14149,14217,14265,14307,14372,14437,14485,14545,14616,14680,14757],{"id":14099,"uid":14100,"url":14101,"type":50,"href":14102,"tags":14103,"first_publication_date":14104,"last_publication_date":14105,"slugs":14106,"linked_documents":14107,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":14108,"data":14109},"YheHxhIAAC4A1h_a","hermes-launches-degree-apprentice-programme","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-launches-degree-apprentice-programme","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YheHxhIAAC4A1h_a%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T13:27:42+0000","2025-02-20T16:51:09+0000",[14100],[],[],{"title":14110,"category":8,"metaDescription":14111,"canonical":14112,"titleTag":14113,"featuredImage":14114,"publishedDate":14124,"slices":14125},"Hermes launches degree apprentice programme","Click here to read more about our Degree Apprenticeship Programme designed to help students earn while they learn.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-launches-degree-apprentice-programme","Hermes Launches Degree Apprentice Programme | Evri - The New Hermes",{"dimensions":14115,"alt":14116,"copyright":8,"url":14117,"id":14118,"edit":14119,"thumbnail":14120},{"width":65,"height":4158},"Customer in a ParcelShop store stood next to a Print in Store device, applying a label to their parcel.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TIw5bqstJ9-Te7_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2037.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=2,0,7056,4836&w=960&h=658","Z6TIw5bqstJ9-Te7",{"x":4163,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":14121,"alt":14116,"copyright":8,"url":14122,"id":14118,"edit":14123},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TIw5bqstJ9-Te7_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2037.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,745,7059,3346&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":4168,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2018-09-06",[14126],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":14127,"primary":14129,"id":14148,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[14128],{},{"content":14130},[14131,14134,14137,14140,14145],{"type":126,"text":14132,"spans":14133},"Hermes UK, the consumer delivery specialist, has launched a Degree Apprentice Programme which enables students to earn while they learn, get a degree and leave college with virtually no debt. In addition, they are guaranteed a job with the company when they have successfully completed their degree course.",[],{"type":126,"text":14135,"spans":14136},"The four-year programme is being run in association with Leeds Beckett University, and this year six students will participate in the scheme. They will each take a job with Hermes and will be given time off for lectures and study. All tuition fees will be paid by Hermes and students will also receive a competitive salary, as well as invaluable work experience.",[],{"type":126,"text":14138,"spans":14139},"Two of the students will be joining the IT department whilst studying for a degree in Digital and Technology Solutions whilst the others, all studying for a Chartered Management degree, will take roles throughout the business at its Contact Centre, the Warrington hub and with the ParcelShops team. Dedicated mentors will work closely with the students to help them maximise their work and study time.",[],{"type":126,"text":14141,"spans":14142},"\"This programme is designed to bring talented young people both into our business and the industry as a whole. It is a fantastic opportunity for them and for us and is just one of a number of initiatives we are implementing to grow our ‘Parcel People’ at all levels.\" ",[14143],{"start":32,"end":14144,"type":1324},268,{"type":126,"text":13111,"spans":14146},[14147],{"start":32,"end":1816,"type":163},"rich_text$cb661cdb-b4de-46d1-a11b-32d0893001ff",{"id":14150,"uid":14151,"url":14152,"type":50,"href":14153,"tags":14154,"first_publication_date":14155,"last_publication_date":14156,"slugs":14157,"linked_documents":14158,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":14159,"data":14160},"YheFQBIAACwA1hue","hermes-invests-18m-in-new-technology-to-heighten-delivery-experience","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-invests-18m-in-new-technology-to-heighten-delivery-experience","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YheFQBIAACwA1hue%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T13:17:05+0000","2025-02-21T08:37:13+0000",[14151],[],[],{"title":14161,"category":8,"metaDescription":14162,"canonical":14163,"titleTag":14164,"featuredImage":14165,"publishedDate":14171,"slices":14172},"Hermes invests £18m in new technology to heighten delivery experience","Read here to learn about our £18m investment in state-of-the-art handheld scanners designed to heighten visibility during the parcel journey.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-invests-18m-in-new-technology-to-heighten-delivery-experience","Hermes Invests £18m in New Technology to Heighten Delivery Experience | Evri",{"dimensions":14166,"alt":7652,"copyright":8,"url":14025,"id":14026,"edit":14167,"thumbnail":14168},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":14169,"alt":7652,"copyright":8,"url":14030,"id":14026,"edit":14170},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2019-07-16",[14173],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":14174,"primary":14176,"id":14216,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[14175],{},{"content":14177},[14178,14181,14184,14187,14190,14193,14196,14199,14204,14207,14212],{"type":126,"text":14179,"spans":14180},"Hermes, the consumer delivery specialist, has invested £18m in state-of-the-art handheld scanners in what represents one of the largest mobile implementation projects in Europe. The company will equip its local courier network and myHermes ParcelShops with more than 20,000 innovative devices, in a move designed to heighten the overall customer experience it provides on behalf of the UK’s leading retailers.",[],{"type":126,"text":14182,"spans":14183},"These new scanners and the software which powers them will provide greater visibility during the delivery process as the company moves towards its goal of 100% first time delivery success.",[],{"type":126,"text":14185,"spans":14186},"The 4G devices have a 10-hour battery life and boast improved GPS functionality. This allows Geo-fencing technology to provide pin-point accuracy for delivery, which means parcels are satellite-tracked to the customer’s doorstep.",[],{"type":126,"text":14188,"spans":14189},"The devices will also support the ETA time window-service, which, when implemented later this year will give retailers the opportunity to enhance the online shopping experience by giving their customers a four hour time window for their parcel delivery or collection, removing the need for them to ‘wait in all day’. Hermes will reduce the window to two hours by the end of 2016.",[],{"type":126,"text":14191,"spans":14192},"In addition, a built-in camera gives Hermes the opportunity to capture high quality photographs.",[],{"type":126,"text":14194,"spans":14195},"This investment will provide a foundation for Hermes to develop additional functionality throughout 2016 that will further improve the choice and convenience it provides to online shoppers. The rollout of the handheld devices to Hermes’ local couriers will start in the spring and will be completed in late summer, whilst the growing network of 4,500 myHermes ParcelShops across the UK will also be equipped with the devices ahead of the 2016 peak season.",[],{"type":126,"text":14197,"spans":14198},"The devices have been manufactured by Zebra Technologies and will operate a mobile workforce management solution developed in partnership with Cognito iQ, which supports the scalability and flexibility required for Hermes’ desire to offer new services and increase the customer’s control over the delivery of their parcels.",[],{"type":126,"text":14200,"spans":14201},"\"Our aim is to achieve 100% first time delivery success as well as industry-leading customer choice and convenience. We continually place innovation at the heart of our business and this substantial investment equips us with the capability to add premium features such as ETA to a standard product. This strengthens Hermes’ positioning in the UK delivery industry as the market leader in innovating and changing the face of standard delivery at standard prices. \"",[14202],{"start":32,"end":14203,"type":1324},463,{"type":126,"text":11918,"spans":14205},[14206],{"start":32,"end":2883,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":14208,"spans":14209},"\"The TC75 enterprise mobile computer, designed for parcel and direct delivery services, will help Hermes achieve its goal to provide both retailers and consumers greater visibility into the delivery process. The enterprise asset intelligence Hermes will gain from this solution will result in new insights and ultimately, an outstanding experience for its customers. \"",[14210],{"start":32,"end":14211,"type":1324},368,{"type":126,"text":14213,"spans":14214},"Ashley Ford, Vice President and General Manager, EMEA at Zebra Technologies",[14215],{"start":32,"end":1666,"type":163},"rich_text$c230d076-1a8d-4455-8088-df52c621c8aa",{"id":14218,"uid":14219,"url":14220,"type":50,"href":14221,"tags":14222,"first_publication_date":14223,"last_publication_date":14224,"slugs":14225,"linked_documents":14227,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":14228,"data":14229},"YheCYBIAAC4A1hTw","hermes-invests-16m-to-boost-rugby-capacity-by-40-percent","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-invests-16m-to-boost-rugby-capacity-by-40-percent","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YheCYBIAAC4A1hTw%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T13:05:02+0000","2025-02-21T08:42:38+0000",[14226],"hermes-invests-16m-to-boost-rugby-capacity-by-40",[],[],{"title":14230,"category":8,"metaDescription":14231,"canonical":14232,"titleTag":14233,"featuredImage":14234,"publishedDate":14240,"slices":14241},"Hermes invests £16m to boost Rugby capacity by 40%","Read our latest blog post to hear about the construction of a third sortation tier at its fully-automated Midlands Super Hub in Rugby.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-invests-16m-to-boost-rugby-capacity-by-40-percent","Hermes Invests £16m to Boost Rugby Capacity by 40% | Evri",{"dimensions":14235,"alt":5216,"copyright":8,"url":5217,"id":5218,"edit":14236,"thumbnail":14237},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":14238,"alt":5216,"copyright":8,"url":5222,"id":5218,"edit":14239},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2019-09-13",[14242],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":14243,"primary":14245,"id":14264,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[14244],{},{"content":14246},[14247,14250,14253,14256,14261],{"type":126,"text":14248,"spans":14249},"Hermes, the consumer delivery specialist, has significantly boosted its capacity for the upcoming peak season after completing the construction of a third sortation tier at its fully-automated Midlands Super Hub in Rugby. The £16m project enhances existing output by 40% with the capability to process 1.35 million parcels each day.",[],{"type":126,"text":14251,"spans":14252},"Located at the Rugby Gateway, the 270,000 square foot Midlands Super Hub officially opened in August 2017 featuring two original sortation tiers. The £31m development, the most substantial investment in Hermes’ history to date, remains the biggest of its kind in Europe.",[],{"type":126,"text":14254,"spans":14255},"The installation of the high specification sortation tier – manufactured by Beumer – has taken place over the past 12 months, overseen by the company’s in house engineering team who ensured that the hub has remained fully operational. The new tier can sort 22,973 items per hour which increases the hub’s hourly total to 68,919 items per hour. It measures over 1.1kms in length, incorporates 480 tonnes of steelwork, features 1,942 trays, and is powered by 41kms of electrical wiring. Scales measure the dimension and check the weight of every parcel whilst also checking for any damages.",[],{"type":126,"text":14257,"spans":14258},"\"For the last few years we have witnessed double-digit growth due to our commitment to invest in our world-class network and infrastructure, our innovative fleet and our industry-leading portfolio of services solutions. In addition, our in-house engineering team is constantly optimising our equipment to ensure it is best in class and we will soon be introducing further automation to support our returns process in the coming months. Last year, we enjoyed our most effective and busiest peak season to date, whilst, at the same time, achieving record service levels and I’m absolutely confident the third sortation tier in Rugby will put us in the strongest possible position to further support the retail industry over the coming years. \"",[14259],{"start":32,"end":14260,"type":1324},741,{"type":126,"text":11861,"spans":14262},[14263],{"start":32,"end":5726,"type":163},"rich_text$c7a29c82-bb0c-4711-860c-9ede0ffc3401",{"id":14266,"uid":14267,"url":14268,"type":50,"href":14269,"tags":14270,"first_publication_date":14271,"last_publication_date":14272,"slugs":14273,"linked_documents":14274,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":14275,"data":14276},"Yhd9VBIAACgA1gyG","hermes-integrates-with-etsy-for-added-delivery-choice","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-integrates-with-etsy-for-added-delivery-choice","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22Yhd9VBIAACgA1gyG%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T12:43:07+0000","2025-02-21T09:45:32+0000",[14267],[],[],{"title":14277,"category":8,"metaDescription":14278,"canonical":14279,"titleTag":14280,"featuredImage":14281,"publishedDate":14287,"slices":14288},"Hermes integrates with Etsy for added delivery choice","We're pleased to announce we are integrated with global online marketplace, Etsy. Catch our latest blog post to find out more","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-integrates-with-etsy-for-added-delivery-choice","Hermes Integrates with Etsy for Added Delivery Choice | Evri",{"dimensions":14282,"alt":5496,"copyright":8,"url":5497,"id":5498,"edit":14283,"thumbnail":14284},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":14285,"alt":5496,"copyright":8,"url":5502,"id":5498,"edit":14286},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2021-07-16",[14289],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":14290,"primary":14292,"id":14306,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[14291],{},{"content":14293},[14294,14297,14300,14303],{"type":126,"text":14295,"spans":14296},"Sellers on Etsy are to benefit from greater choice, convenience, accuracy and cheaper prices for customer deliveries following the decision by Hermes UK to develop an API that will integrate their services with the global online marketplace.",[],{"type":126,"text":14298,"spans":14299},"It means that from the end of July Etsy sellers will no longer have to enter data manually to create individual parcel labels with Hermes but can download the data and upload it directly in bulk to save time and avoid issues with typing incorrect address details in error. They will also be able to automatically set their preferences for collection and tracking and even automatically add the return address.",[],{"type":126,"text":14301,"spans":14302},"Etsy is the latest organisation to be integrated with Hermes UK and joins Amazon, eBay and Shopify.",[],{"type":126,"text":14304,"spans":14305},"Claire Phelan, Head of E-commerce Partnerships at Hermes UK, said: “There has been significant growth within the small business sector over the past few years and this has continued through the pandemic as many people looked to generate income after being furloughed or losing their jobs. We are making it easier for these small businesses to access the Hermes services whilst helping them to save time and money.”",[],"rich_text$07a795a5-43e5-483e-b230-5abac8706492",{"id":14308,"uid":14309,"url":14310,"type":50,"href":14311,"tags":14312,"first_publication_date":14313,"last_publication_date":14314,"slugs":14315,"linked_documents":14316,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":14317,"data":14318},"YhdyMRIAACoA1fof","hermes-integrates-printer-less-labelling-with-ebay","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-integrates-printer-less-labelling-with-ebay","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhdyMRIAACoA1fof%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T11:55:40+0000","2025-02-20T16:52:40+0000",[14309],[],[],{"title":14319,"category":8,"metaDescription":14320,"canonical":14321,"titleTag":14322,"featuredImage":14323,"publishedDate":14334,"slices":14335},"Hermes integrates printer-less labelling with eBay","Read our blog post to find out about our new printer-less labelling solution for eBay sellers.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-integrates-printer-less-labelling-with-ebay","Hermes Integrates Printer-Less Labelling with eBay | Evri",{"dimensions":14324,"alt":14325,"copyright":8,"url":14326,"id":14327,"edit":14328,"thumbnail":14329},{"width":65,"height":8660},"Customer in a ParcelShop store holding their mobile phone and entering information on a Print in Store device for printing their label.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TIvJbqstJ9-Te3_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2007.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,6431,4220&w=960&h=630","Z6TIvJbqstJ9-Te3",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":14330,"alt":14325,"copyright":8,"url":14331,"id":14327,"edit":14332},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TIvJbqstJ9-Te3_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2007.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,587,6431,3048&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":14333,"zoom":33,"background":71},587,"2018-10-07",[14336],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":14337,"primary":14339,"id":14371,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[14338],{},{"content":14340},[14341,14344,14347,14350,14353,14358,14362,14367],{"type":126,"text":14342,"spans":14343},"Hermes, the consumer delivery specialist, has invested in a printer-less labelling solution with eBay, which will be available to UK eBay sellers when they purchase their postage via eBay delivery powered by Shutl.",[],{"type":126,"text":14345,"spans":14346},"Printer-less labelling simplifies the send process for the customer and increases efficiency for Hermes. Labels for sold eBay items can be paid for on eBay, and UK customers will then receive an email to their smartphone with a QR code and 6-digit authorisation code. The code can be used at one of 2,600 Hermes ParcelShops across the UK and the self-adhesive label is printed, free of charge. More Hermes ParcelShops will offer this service across the UK network in 2019.",[],{"type":126,"text":14348,"spans":14349},"Once the parcel is with Hermes, the Shutl 2-3 day service can be tracked all the way to the eBay buyer’s front door.",[],{"type":126,"text":14351,"spans":14352},"85% of all Hermes Send customers already use the Hermes ParcelShop network to send or receive parcels. The standardised self-adhesive label will reduce issues with labels being damaged, badly printed or poorly applied to the parcel.",[],{"type":126,"text":14354,"spans":14355},"\"We’re excited to launch the Hermes printer-less labelling solution with eBay, which will enhance the overall sending experience for customers by improving efficiencies and convenience as we help to reduce dependence on the hassle and cost of a printer, and roll this service out across our ParcelShops network. \"",[14356],{"start":32,"end":14357,"type":1324},313,{"type":126,"text":14359,"spans":14360},"Claire Phelan, Head of Hermes Send and Partnerships",[14361],{"start":32,"end":1671,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":14363,"spans":14364},"\"We are delighted to be partnering with Hermes to deliver print-in-store postage labels to UK sellers via eBay delivery powered by Shutl. Print in store offers eBay UK sellers the opportunity to enjoy selling on eBay, without needing a printer. eBay sees this as an important milestone in helping to create speed and convenience in sellers’ busy lives, by making it as quick and easy as possible for them to buy postage and send items from the eBay platform.\" ",[14365],{"start":32,"end":14366,"type":1324},460,{"type":126,"text":14368,"spans":14369},"Mike Pitt, Director Shipping and Logistics, eBay Marketplaces UK",[14370],{"start":32,"end":3236,"type":163},"rich_text$40008a9a-2bdf-49ed-b493-ee3d1663a407",{"id":14373,"uid":14374,"url":14375,"type":50,"href":14376,"tags":14377,"first_publication_date":14378,"last_publication_date":14379,"slugs":14380,"linked_documents":14381,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":14382,"data":14383},"YhdwRxIAACwA1fbm","hermes-inspires-innovators-of-tomorrow-at-first-hackathon","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-inspires-innovators-of-tomorrow-at-first-hackathon","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhdwRxIAACwA1fbm%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T11:47:32+0000","2025-02-20T16:44:03+0000",[14374],[],[],{"title":14384,"category":8,"metaDescription":14385,"canonical":14386,"titleTag":14387,"featuredImage":14388,"publishedDate":14397,"slices":14398},"Hermes inspires innovators of tomorrow at first Hackathon","Read our latest post about our most innovative employees have gone head to head in the Hermes Hackathon.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-inspires-innovators-of-tomorrow-at-first-hackathon","Hermes Inspires Innovators of Tomorrow at First Hackathon | Evri - The New Hermes",{"dimensions":14389,"alt":7332,"copyright":8,"url":14390,"id":14391,"edit":14392,"thumbnail":14393},{"width":65,"height":865},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDYpbqstJ9-cfE_EVRI_LOCATION_04_3559.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6pDYpbqstJ9-cfE",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":14394,"alt":7332,"copyright":8,"url":14395,"id":14391,"edit":14396},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDYpbqstJ9-cfE_EVRI_LOCATION_04_3559.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2018-03-13",[14399],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":14400,"primary":14402,"id":14436,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[14401],{},{"content":14403},[14404,14407,14410,14413,14416,14419,14424,14427,14432],{"type":126,"text":14405,"spans":14406},"The UK’s next generation of innovators have gone head-to-head to create a range of exciting solutions that could enrich the home delivery industry at a Hackathon organised by Hermes, the consumer delivery specialist. A multi-platform live chat application and an enhanced GPS tracking solution designed to drive down fuel consumption were among ideas concocted by students from Leeds Beckett University and judged by a panel of experts including a member of Google’s technical team.",[],{"type":126,"text":14408,"spans":14409},"Hermes, who delivers parcels on behalf of 80% of the UK’s leading retailers and etailers, including John Lewis, Next and Arcadia Group, staged the event alongside the University in order to encourage the innovators of tomorrow to bring pioneering ideas to life. To facilitate this, Hermes granted the students special access to its sophisticated development portal and the company’s APIs (Application Program Interfaces).",[],{"type":126,"text":14411,"spans":14412},"Five student teams competed against industry thought leaders from the Hermes Innovation Lab, in an attempt to create the next big delivery solution in just six hours. The winning group, Team 404, devised an application to streamline the shipping process for myHermes customers, including increased functionality when printing multiple shipping labels. Team 404 also impressed the judging panel by examining different ways it could potentially integrate with external APIs, belonging to organisations such as eBay and PayPal. Each team member received an Amazon Echo Dot as a prize.",[],{"type":126,"text":14414,"spans":14415},"Runners up on the day (The Wolf Hack) focused on bringing Hermes’ ‘Live Chat’ platform to a number of different devices, including smartphones and digital assistants such as Amazon Alexa. They each secured a shopping voucher for their efforts.",[],{"type":126,"text":14417,"spans":14418},"The judging panel was formed of: Carole Woodhead, CEO of Hermes; Chris Ashworth, CIO at Hermes; Zoe McClelland, Head of Business Strategy, Operations and Enterprise at Leeds Beckett; and Sean Davis, Technical Consultant from Google, who flew in from Switzerland specifically for the event.",[],{"type":126,"text":14420,"spans":14421},"\"The energy, creativity and commercial prowess displayed by this group of students has been truly remarkable. I was impressed by how each team took the time to understand our business and developed highly innovative solutions that could make a real difference to the home delivery sector moving forwards. Every student who took part in our first Hackathon did a fantastic job, and I wouldn't be surprised to see many of these talented individuals working at Hermes HQ in the years to come. \"",[14422],{"start":32,"end":14423,"type":1324},491,{"type":126,"text":11517,"spans":14425},[14426],{"start":32,"end":367,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":14428,"spans":14429},"\"One of the key priorities for Leeds Business School is the employability of our students. This is a fantastic opportunity to engage with an organisation such as Hermes to put into practice what they’ve learned. We’re very grateful to the organisations, like Hermes, that take time out to work with our students. David Turner, Head of Innovation at Hermes, played a key role organising the event. He said: Taking part in events like this gives us access to students who are thinking outside the box. They’re not constrained and we see some ideas that we would never have thought of. It’s a good chance for students to meet us and show us some of their great ideas. We’re always recruiting and will provide start-up funding if we see an idea with real potential and look at sponsoring a team to take that idea forward. \"",[14430],{"start":32,"end":14431,"type":1324},819,{"type":126,"text":14433,"spans":14434},"Zoe McClelland, Head of Business Strategy, Operations and Enterprise at Leeds Beckett",[14435],{"start":32,"end":497,"type":163},"rich_text$768d0524-d11a-4f8a-9715-bc2521d83f90",{"id":14438,"uid":14439,"url":14440,"type":50,"href":14441,"tags":14442,"first_publication_date":14443,"last_publication_date":14444,"slugs":14445,"linked_documents":14446,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":14447,"data":14448},"Yhdq_hIAAC4A1elg","new-distribution-depot-in-winwick-opens-creating-over-550-seasonal-jobs","\u002Fpress\u002Fnew-distribution-depot-in-winwick-opens-creating-over-550-seasonal-jobs","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22Yhdq_hIAAC4A1elg%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T11:26:27+0000","2023-03-21T15:18:37+0000",[14439],[],[],{"title":14449,"category":8,"metaDescription":14450,"canonical":14451,"titleTag":14452,"featuredImage":14453,"publishedDate":14459,"slices":14460},"New distribution depot in Winwick opens creating over 550 seasonal jobs","This week we have launched a brand-new distribution depot in Warrington, creating over 550 season jobs. Catch up on this in our latest blog.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fnew-distribution-depot-in-winwick-opens-creating-over-550-seasonal-jobs","New Distribution Depot in Winwick Opens Creating Over 550 Seasonal Jobs | Evri",{"dimensions":14454,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":11414,"id":11415,"edit":14455,"thumbnail":14456},{"width":65,"height":11413},{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":11417,"background":34},{"dimensions":14457,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":11420,"id":11415,"edit":14458},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":7499,"zoom":11422,"background":34},"2020-10-16",[14461],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":14462,"primary":14464,"id":14484,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[14463],{},{"content":14465},[14466,14469,14472,14475,14480],{"type":126,"text":14467,"spans":14468},"This week sees the opening of a new distribution depot by Hermes UK, the consumer delivery specialists, in Mill Lane, Warrington (at the ex-Royal Mail North West Distribution Centre). Over 550 seasonal temporary jobs have been created at the 185,000sqft sq ft warehouse, which has been opened ahead of the busy Black Friday and Christmas peak periods.",[],{"type":126,"text":14470,"spans":14471},"The new facility will be able to handle over 450K parcels each day with the ability to operate 24\u002F7 as needed. It forms part of the ongoing investment programme by Hermes UK to expand its capacity to meet the huge demand created by people shopping at home during lockdown and the continuing growth in the sector. The company estimates that it will see record parcel volumes later this year.",[],{"type":126,"text":14473,"spans":14474},"Due to local restrictions as a result of Covid-19, the team decided to donate the money they would have spent on launching the site to a local food bank, to help support local people going through the difficult times due to the pandemic.",[],{"type":126,"text":14476,"spans":14477},"\"During a year where we have learnt to take nothing for granted, it is fantastic to be opening a new hub for Hermes where business continues to grow, allowing us to provide much needed job opportunities during these uncertain times. The new team has worked extremely hard to get the site ready for what will be one of the busiest periods of the year and ensure that our customers continue to get a fantastic service.\" ",[14478],{"start":32,"end":14479,"type":1324},418,{"type":126,"text":14481,"spans":14482},"Sam Spring, Hub Manager at Hermes UK",[14483],{"start":32,"end":162,"type":163},"rich_text$f5dd5cb5-4521-43c8-8113-c81a0346a03b",{"id":14486,"uid":14487,"url":14488,"type":50,"href":14489,"tags":14490,"first_publication_date":14491,"last_publication_date":14492,"slugs":14493,"linked_documents":14494,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":14495,"data":14496},"YhdowxIAACgA1eGy","mp-visits-purpose-built-hermes-depot-in-his-constituency","\u002Fpress\u002Fmp-visits-purpose-built-hermes-depot-in-his-constituency","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhdowxIAACgA1eGy%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T11:15:21+0000","2025-02-21T08:48:10+0000",[14487],[],[],{"title":14497,"category":8,"metaDescription":14498,"canonical":14499,"titleTag":14500,"featuredImage":14501,"publishedDate":14507,"slices":14508},"MP visits purpose-built Hermes depot in his constituency","Read our latest blog to hear about Sir Mike Penning's visit to his local Hermes depot and his view of the operation.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fmp-visits-purpose-built-hermes-depot-in-his-constituency","MP Visits Purpose-Built Hermes Depot in his Constituency | Evri",{"dimensions":14502,"alt":10292,"copyright":8,"url":12468,"id":12469,"edit":14503,"thumbnail":14504},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":14505,"alt":10292,"copyright":8,"url":12473,"id":12469,"edit":14506},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2019-11-11",[14509],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":14510,"primary":14512,"id":14544,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[14511],{},{"content":14513},[14514,14517,14520,14523,14526,14531,14535,14540],{"type":126,"text":14515,"spans":14516},"Sir Mike Penning, the MP for Hemel Hempstead, has this morning visited the Hermes depot in his constituency to hear about the investment in its environmental capabilities.",[],{"type":126,"text":14518,"spans":14519},"The MP, a former Minister of State, was taken on a tour of the building by the Hermes Depot Operations Management team.  The purpose-built Hemel Hempstead site opened in October 2018 and is one of 26 depots across the country operated by the business, forming an integral part of the national operation which delivers 390 million parcels a year.",[],{"type":126,"text":14521,"spans":14522},"It has environmental capabilities including; rain water harvesting, solar panels, LED lighting and solar thermal hot water – contributing to Hermes’ focus on sustainability. Just last month, Hermes added a further 42 Compressed Natural Gas (CNG) fuelled vehicles to its network after a successful 12-month trial which delivered carbon savings in excess of 4,000 tonnes.",[],{"type":126,"text":14524,"spans":14525},"The tour was then followed by discussions around Hermes’ overall business performance, which has seen double digit growth over the past few years; as well as regional investment and employment. More than 120 people work at the Hemel Hempstead depot.",[],{"type":126,"text":14527,"spans":14528},"\"The firm’s investment in a purpose-built site means that we can be at the forefront of environmental initiatives in our operations here. Today was a great opportunity to demonstrate our commitment to sustainability and also regional recruitment as the business continues to grow and invest.\" ",[14529],{"start":32,"end":14530,"type":1324},293,{"type":126,"text":14532,"spans":14533},"Kris Langsdale, Hemel Hempstead Depot Manager",[14534],{"start":32,"end":1128,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":14536,"spans":14537},"\"It was great to get an insight into the operations at Hermes; the business is clearly focused on reducing its environmental impact and upon great working practices. I look forward to seeing how the business continues to invest in this region as it grows.\" ",[14538],{"start":32,"end":14539,"type":1324},257,{"type":126,"text":14541,"spans":14542},"Sir Mike Penning MP",[14543],{"start":32,"end":2233,"type":163},"rich_text$903f35e7-3e75-4876-a467-fbab8896f096",{"id":14546,"uid":14547,"url":14548,"type":50,"href":14549,"tags":14550,"first_publication_date":14551,"last_publication_date":14552,"slugs":14553,"linked_documents":14555,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":14556,"data":14557},"YhdoOxIAACoA1d8y","hermes-increases-its-cng-fleet-to-become-the-largest-in-the-uk-parcel-sector-as-part-of-ongoing-commitment-to-reducing-climate-i","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-increases-its-cng-fleet-to-become-the-largest-in-the-uk-parcel-sector-as-part-of-ongoing-commitment-to-reducing-climate-i","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhdoOxIAACoA1d8y%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T11:13:09+0000","2025-02-21T08:37:56+0000",[14554],"hermes-increases-its-cng-fleet-to-become-the-largest-in-the-uk-parcel-sector-as-part-of-ongoing-commitment-to-reduce-climate-impact",[],[],{"title":14558,"category":8,"metaDescription":14559,"canonical":14560,"titleTag":14561,"featuredImage":14562,"publishedDate":14568,"slices":14569},"Hermes increases its CNG fleet to become the largest in the UK parcel sector as part of ongoing commitment to reduce climate impact","Read our latest blog post and find out how we've increased our CNG fleet to become the largest in the UK parcel sector.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-increases-its-cng-fleet-to-become-the-largest-in-the-uk-parcel-sector-as-part-of-ongoing-commitment-to-reducing-climate-i","Hermes Increases its CNG Fleet to Become the Largest in the UK Parcel Sector | Evri",{"dimensions":14563,"alt":8851,"copyright":8,"url":8852,"id":8853,"edit":14564,"thumbnail":14565},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":14566,"alt":8851,"copyright":8,"url":8857,"id":8853,"edit":14567},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2019-08-26",[14570],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":14571,"primary":14573,"id":14615,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[14572],{},{"content":14574},[14575,14578,14581,14584,14586,14589,14591,14594,14596,14598,14602,14606,14611],{"type":126,"text":14576,"spans":14577},"Leading consumer delivery specialist Hermes UK is adding a further 70 units to its fleet of Compressed Natural Gas (CNG) fuelled vehicles in a move to further reduce emissions.  This brings the total to 160 – around 50% of the company’s core hub tractor fleet.",[],{"type":126,"text":14579,"spans":14580},"Driven by its commitment to reducing climate impact and air pollution across the UK’s cities, Hermes’ use of alternative fuels makes it the largest UK parcel company fleet to employ CNG vehicles, bettered only by retailer John Lewis and Partners.",[],{"type":126,"text":14582,"spans":14583},"Each of the new model IVECO S-WAY units being introduced reduces CO2 emissions by over 80% when compared to a Euro 6 diesel vehicle. This is a reduction of 150 tons of CO2 per vehicle and over 24,000 tons of CO2 across the 160 CNG vehicle fleet annually. Other benefits of the CNG vehicles include huge reductions in air pollution impact, such as 70% less NOX, 99% less particulate matter, 90% less NMHC and 88% less methane.",[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":14585},[],{"type":126,"text":14587,"spans":14588},"This follows Hermes’ recent announcement that it is one of the first companies to trial the IVECO Eurocargo, a new 12 tonne vehicle, which also runs on CNG.",[],{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":14590},[],{"type":126,"text":14592,"spans":14593},"Hermes currently uses an electric vehicle fleet for its Central London routes, so if the trial is successful the company will be able to have an alternative fuels vehicle option for all of its journeys, something that is in high demand from Hermes’ retail clients.",[],{"type":126,"text":334,"spans":14595},[],{"type":126,"text":127,"spans":14597},[],{"type":126,"text":14599,"spans":14600},"\"Sustainability is a huge focus for us as we recognise our responsibility as one of the UK’s largest consumer delivery companies. We are committed to putting sustainability at the heart of every aspect of our business, through innovative products and processes. As such we were an early adopter of CNG as an alternative fuel and are continuing to increase its presence in our fleet, to drive down emissions.\" ",[14601],{"start":32,"end":11859,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":14603,"spans":14604},"David Landy, Head of Fleet at Hermes",[14605],{"start":32,"end":162,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":14607,"spans":14608},"\"An incredibly prominent national operator on our roads, Hermes already run one of the largest IVECO CNG truck fleets. We are therefore honoured that they will continue to grow this with us, taking the new IVECO S-WAY CNG and cementing not just our position as a market-leader in natural gas propulsion, but theirs as pioneers in commercial transport decarbonisation.\" ",[14609],{"start":32,"end":14610,"type":1324},369,{"type":126,"text":14612,"spans":14613},"Gareth Lumsdaine, IVECO UK’s Heavy Business-line Director",[14614],{"start":32,"end":3684,"type":163},"rich_text$e029d6b1-c40c-4724-bd48-c1ac3d62765b",{"id":14617,"uid":14618,"url":14619,"type":50,"href":14620,"tags":14621,"first_publication_date":14622,"last_publication_date":14623,"slugs":14624,"linked_documents":14625,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":14626,"data":14627},"YhdnshIAAC0A1dx8","martijn-de-lange-appointed-chief-operating-officer-at-hermes","\u002Fpress\u002Fmartijn-de-lange-appointed-chief-operating-officer-at-hermes","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhdnshIAAC0A1dx8%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T11:12:14+0000","2025-02-20T16:36:05+0000",[14618],[],[],{"title":14628,"category":8,"metaDescription":14629,"canonical":14630,"titleTag":14631,"featuredImage":14632,"publishedDate":14642,"slices":14643},"Martijn De Lange appointed Chief Operating Officer at Hermes","Hermes has promoted Martijn De Lange to role of Chief Operating Officer. Read all about the appointment","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fmartijn-de-lange-appointed-chief-operating-officer-at-hermes","Martijn De Lange Appointed Chief Operating Officer at Hermes | Evri",{"dimensions":14633,"alt":14634,"copyright":8,"url":14635,"id":14636,"edit":14637,"thumbnail":14638},{"width":65,"height":865},"A customer is standing in the doorway of their home smiling and holding onto parcels. A courier is standing opposite on the top step smiling and taking a photo of the parcels for proof of delivery.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6Xpk5bqstJ9-WbZ_EVRI_LOCATION_02_1378.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6Xpk5bqstJ9-WbZ",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":14639,"alt":14634,"copyright":8,"url":14640,"id":14636,"edit":14641},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6Xpk5bqstJ9-WbZ_EVRI_LOCATION_02_1378.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2015-07-23",[14644],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":14645,"primary":14647,"id":14679,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[14646],{},{"content":14648},[14649,14653,14656,14659,14662,14667,14671,14675],{"type":126,"text":14650,"spans":14651},"Originally published on 2nd August 2015",[14652],{"start":32,"end":6602,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":14654,"spans":14655},"Hermes, the consumer delivery specialist, has promoted Martijn de Lange to the position of Chief Operating Officer (COO). Martijn had previously held the role of Operations Director since joining the company in March 2013.",[],{"type":126,"text":14657,"spans":14658},"The appointment recognises the increased size, breadth and complexity of the operations leadership role at Hermes, which has grown in excess of 15% each year for the last five years and now delivers more than 240 million parcels per annum.",[],{"type":126,"text":14660,"spans":14661},"Martijn has more than 13 years’ experience in the logistics industry, previously working for TNT Post in both The Netherlands and the UK.",[],{"type":126,"text":14663,"spans":14664},"\"Martijn has taken the operation on a revolutionary journey since he joined Hermes just over two years ago, using his passion and energy to drive positive change and results, and challenging the culture of our organisation. This is a well earned opportunity for Martijn and recognises the outstanding impact and influence that he has personally had in driving the business forward, particularly with substantial cost, service offer and quality improvements.\" ",[14665],{"start":32,"end":14666,"type":1324},459,{"type":126,"text":14668,"spans":14669},"Carole Woodhead, CEO, Hermes",[14670],{"start":32,"end":1981,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":14672,"spans":14673},"\"I look forward to continuing with my current duties along with having a broader responsibility for existing product development, as well as implementing further substantial service and cost improvements. This is a very exciting time for Hermes and the whole business is working hard to cement its position as the market leader.\" ",[14674],{"start":32,"end":7057,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":14676,"spans":14677},"Martijn De Lange, COO, Hermes",[14678],{"start":32,"end":1084,"type":163},"rich_text$8388711f-ec37-4808-8bc3-03da8ca45bfa",{"id":14681,"uid":14682,"url":14683,"type":50,"href":14684,"tags":14685,"first_publication_date":14686,"last_publication_date":14687,"slugs":14688,"linked_documents":14690,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":14691,"data":14692},"YhdmiRIAACsA1db7","leeds-local-delivery","\u002Fpress\u002Fleeds-local-delivery","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhdmiRIAACsA1db7%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T11:05:54+0000","2025-02-20T16:07:55+0000",[14689],"hermes-uk-launches-new-service-to-support-independent-leeds-traders",[],[],{"title":14693,"category":8,"metaDescription":14694,"canonical":14695,"titleTag":14696,"featuredImage":14697,"publishedDate":14708,"slices":14709},"Hermes UK launches new service to support independent Leeds traders","Read our latest blog post to learn about our new service to enable Kirkgate Market traders to make home deliveries to the local community.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fleeds-local-delivery","Hermes UK Launches New Service to Support Independent Leeds Traders | Evri",{"dimensions":14698,"alt":14699,"copyright":8,"url":14700,"id":14701,"edit":14702,"thumbnail":14703},{"width":65,"height":865},"An Evri courier is walking down a street of terraced houses carrying a parcel. The greenery and architecture suggests a rural British town or village.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ69x0ZbqstJ9-pVE_EVRI_LOCATION_02_1597.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,7610,5073&w=960&h=640","Z69x0ZbqstJ9-pVE",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":14704,"alt":14699,"copyright":8,"url":14705,"id":14701,"edit":14706},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ69x0ZbqstJ9-pVE_EVRI_LOCATION_02_1597.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,735,7610,3607&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":14707,"zoom":33,"background":71},735,"2022-02-24",[14710],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":14711,"primary":14713,"id":14756,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[14712],{},{"content":14714},[14715,14718,14721,14724,14727,14731,14735,14738,14743,14747,14752],{"type":126,"text":14716,"spans":14717},"Hermes UK, which has roots in Yorkshire that can be traced back to the 1970s, is trialling a new service designed to enable independent traders at Leeds Kirkgate Market to offer a home delivery service to the local community. Deliveries will be made same day by dedicated Hermes’ employees on eco-friendly, zero emission bikes and will be free for retailers and consumers in the first phase. ",[],{"type":126,"text":14719,"spans":14720},"Two apps to support the service have been developed by the Hermes’ Innovation Lab who are based in Leeds and are focussed on developing new products and services to drive the home delivery market forward. The app for retailers enables them to book new deliveries and track them throughout their journey. A different app for the riders shows the collections to be made, the best route to take and navigates them using cycle paths wherever possible.",[],{"type":126,"text":14722,"spans":14723},"Leeds Kirkgate Market has been the city’s essential shopping destination for over a century and is one of the biggest indoor markets in Europe working with local independent businesses in the city since 1857. The latest lockdown guidance has seen some of the retailers unable to trade and others suffering from reduced footfall.",[],{"type":126,"text":14725,"spans":14726},"Panda Refills, a zero-waste stall located in Leeds Kirkgate Market is one of the first businesses to sign up with Hermes to start the free delivery trial.",[],{"type":126,"text":14728,"spans":14729},"\"This is exactly what we needed to get our products to customers who cannot come into the city centre at the moment.\" ",[14730],{"start":32,"end":5811,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":14732,"spans":14733},"Buyer at Panda Refills, Aimee Charlotte explains",[14734],{"start":32,"end":8554,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":14736,"spans":14737},"Hermes would like other traders to sign up to the service which will enable them to offer delivery to most areas within the outer ring road of Leeds city centre. Orders will be made through the traders’ own social channels, websites or by phone.",[],{"type":126,"text":14739,"spans":14740},"\"We started designing the service last year after realising that very few local independent shops were set up to offer a delivery service. We wanted to help support the local community in which we work and where many of us live, and enable vulnerable and shielding customers, as well as those city-based office workers currently working from home. to continue to buy from their local retailers in a more sustainable way.\" ",[14741],{"start":32,"end":14742,"type":1324},422,{"type":126,"text":14744,"spans":14745},"Adrian Berry, Innovation Delivery Manager at Hermes",[14746],{"start":32,"end":1671,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":14748,"spans":14749},"\"This is a great opportunity for our independent businesses to provide a delivery service for their customers who may not be able to visit the city at the moment. It’s providing our traders a platform to be able to adapt their business for existing and new customers.\" ",[14750],{"start":32,"end":14751,"type":1324},269,{"type":126,"text":14753,"spans":14754},"Councillor Jonathan Pryor, Executive Member for Learning, Skills and Employment",[14755],{"start":32,"end":1780,"type":163},"rich_text$49ce6601-d7ee-41c5-bcf9-b4117da3b9c1",{"id":14758,"uid":14759,"url":14760,"type":50,"href":14761,"tags":14762,"first_publication_date":14763,"last_publication_date":14764,"slugs":14765,"linked_documents":14767,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":14768,"data":14769},"Yhdl_RIAAC8A1dRk","hermes-increases-green-fleet-as-part-of-ongoing-sustainabilty-drive","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-increases-green-fleet-as-part-of-ongoing-sustainabilty-drive","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22Yhdl_RIAAC8A1dRk%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T11:03:58+0000","2025-02-21T08:46:29+0000",[14766],"hermes-increases-green-fleet-as-part-of-ongoing-sustainability-drive",[],[],{"title":14770,"category":8,"metaDescription":14771,"canonical":14772,"titleTag":14773,"featuredImage":14774,"publishedDate":14784,"slices":14785},"Hermes increases 'green fleet' as part of ongoing sustainability drive","We're adding to our green fleet! Read all about our plans for new CNG fuelled vehicles following a successful trial.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-increases-green-fleet-as-part-of-ongoing-sustainabilty-drive","Hermes Increases 'Green Fleet' as Part of Ongoing Sustainability Drive | Evri - The New Hermes",{"dimensions":14775,"alt":14776,"copyright":8,"url":14777,"id":14778,"edit":14779,"thumbnail":14780},{"width":65,"height":1242},"A drone shot of an Evri hub. There are rows of Evri trucks and vans of various sizes stationed at the units across the hub ready to take on parcels. ","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ7Nygp7c43Q3f4HG_DJI_0034.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,0,6000,4500&w=960&h=720","Z7Nygp7c43Q3f4HG",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":14781,"alt":14776,"copyright":8,"url":14782,"id":14778,"edit":14783},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ7Nygp7c43Q3f4HG_DJI_0034.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,828,6000,2844&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":4561,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2019-10-04",[14786],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":14787,"primary":14789,"id":14820,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[14788],{},{"content":14790},[14791,14794,14797,14800,14804,14808,14813,14817],{"type":126,"text":14792,"spans":14793},"Leading consumer delivery specialist Hermes UK is adding a further 42 units to its fleet of Compressed Natural Gas (CNG) fuelled vehicles. The investment follows a successful 12-month trial which delivered carbon savings in excess of 4,000 tonnes and forms part of the company’s commitment to delivering ‘a premium service that doesn’t cost the earth.’",[],{"type":126,"text":14795,"spans":14796},"A total of 42 Iveco Stralis CNG tractor units will be added to the operation over the coming weeks, taking the total to 72 across the firm’s fleet. Once introduced, the new vehicles will account for more than 40% of Hermes’ first mile delivery fleet. These have been ordered from CNG Fuels, the only UK supplier of Renewable Transport Fuel Obligation (RTFO) approved biomethane.",[],{"type":126,"text":14798,"spans":14799},"Each vehicle will reduce CO2 emissions by over 80% when compared to a diesel Euro 6 vehicle. This will result in a reduction of 150 tons of CO2 per vehicle and 9,600 tons of CO2 across the 72 CNG vehicle fleet annually. Other benefits of the CNG vehicles include: 70% less NOX, 99% less particulate matter, 90% less NMHC and 88% less methane.",[],{"type":126,"text":14801,"spans":14802},"\"At Hermes we are committed to ‘delivering a premium service that doesn’t cost the earth’ which reflects both our industry leading cost proposition and sustainable approach to business. As part of this we are continuing to support pioneering alternative low carbon fuels to achieve our goal of slashing emissions. We will also be trialling DAF hydrogen tractor units next year and looking to expand our electric fleet outside of London. \"",[14803],{"start":32,"end":617,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":14805,"spans":14806},"Jon Ormond, Hubs & Depots at Hermes",[14807],{"start":32,"end":1070,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":14809,"spans":14810},"\"CNG Fuels are committed to helping our customers reach their low carbon goals through our growing UK network of public access Bio-CNG refuelling stations. Renewable & Sustainable Biomethane is currently the only mass-adoptable low-carbon solution for HGVs and we are thrilled Hermes will now have access to our Warrington Bio-CNG Station, the largest of its kind in Europe. \"",[14811],{"start":32,"end":14812,"type":1324},376,{"type":126,"text":14814,"spans":14815},"Peter Eaton, General Manager, CNG Fuels",[14816],{"start":32,"end":6602,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":14818,"spans":14819},"Hermes has also undertaken a number of other initiatives as part of its sustainability drive. Earlier this year the company acquired 32 bespoke double-decker trailers which provided the extra capacity to dramatically reduce the number of miles its drivers travel by up to 1.5 million a year. The new trailers – tailored to Hermes’ exact requirements by Don-Bur – hold 33% more than a standard model and 12% more than the previous double-decker trailers.",[],"rich_text$a1695d83-3898-4f93-94b6-b8d19c295033",[14822,14877,14934,14995,15049,15093,15149,15205,15255,15303,15352,15402],{"id":14823,"uid":14824,"url":14825,"type":50,"href":14826,"tags":14827,"first_publication_date":14828,"last_publication_date":14829,"slugs":14830,"linked_documents":14832,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":14833,"data":14834},"YhdkzRIAAC4A1c91","hermes-improves-efficiency-with-purpose-built-sustainable-hemel-hempstead-site","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-improves-efficiency-with-purpose-built-sustainable-hemel-hempstead-site","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhdkzRIAAC4A1c91%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T10:59:48+0000","2023-03-21T14:12:36+0000",[14831,14824],"hermes-new-hemel-hempstead-site",[],[],{"title":14835,"category":8,"metaDescription":14836,"canonical":14837,"titleTag":14838,"featuredImage":14839,"publishedDate":14845,"slices":14846},"Hermes New Hemel Hempstead Site","Read our latest post to learn about our new purpose-built parcel distribution depot at Prologis Park in Hemel Hempstead.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-improves-efficiency-with-purpose-built-sustainable-hemel-hempstead-site","Hermes Improves Efficiency with Purpose Built, Sustainable, Hemel Hempstead Site | Evri",{"dimensions":14840,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":12231,"id":12232,"edit":14841,"thumbnail":14842},{"width":65,"height":11413},{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":11417,"background":34},{"dimensions":14843,"alt":8,"copyright":8,"url":12236,"id":12232,"edit":14844},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":7499,"zoom":11422,"background":34},"2018-10-03",[14847],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":14848,"primary":14850,"id":14876,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[14849],{},{"content":14851},[14852,14855,14858,14861,14864,14867,14872],{"type":126,"text":14853,"spans":14854},"Hermes has opened its purpose-built parcel distribution depot at Prologis Park in Hemel Hempstead, UK, as it further enhances its network and infrastructure ahead of what is anticipated to be its busiest peak season to date.",[],{"type":126,"text":14856,"spans":14857},"The new 80,000ft² (7,432ft²) depot will lead to the creation of 50 new jobs. The depot is the equivalent in size of 11 soccer pitches and has the capacity to process more than 130,000 parcels each day to be distributed across London and the Midlands. This represents the latest major investment in Hermes’s network, following the opening of its £31m Midlands Super Hub in Rugby last year.",[],{"type":126,"text":14859,"spans":14860},"By acquiring this site, Hermes is further highlighting its commitment to sustainability and green technology, which recently saw the company place the largest ever initial order of compressed natural gas (CNG) vehicles in the UK.",[],{"type":126,"text":14862,"spans":14863},"The new depot has a 40kWp design rating photovoltaic array (PV) on-roof, rainwater harvesting system (grey water for toilet flushing); solar thermal hot water to pre-heat water, which saves gas; and EV charging provided across the park.",[],{"type":126,"text":14865,"spans":14866},"The Hemel Hempstead project protects 421 acres of rainforest with eco initiatives such as LED lighting throughout the building and 15% roof lights to maximize natural light in the warehouse, with additional polycarbonate panels in the south elevation to provide further light.",[],{"type":126,"text":14868,"spans":14869},"\"We are extremely proud to officially open our state-of-the-art depot in Hemel Hempstead, which will significantly increase the network capacity in the Southeast. This project demonstrates our total commitment to environmentally friendly, world-class delivery solutions, not just for today, but for the foreseeable future. Last year we handled 9.7 million parcels during our busiest week of the year and we expect that number to grow significantly in 2018. Our team of experts spend the entire year planning for peak so retailers can enjoy absolute confidence in our ability to comfortably process increased volumes driven by Black Friday, Cyber Monday and the Christmas period. The investment in Hemel Hempstead illustrates our ambition to be the carrier of choice for both retailers and consumers alike.\" ",[14870],{"start":32,"end":14871,"type":1324},807,{"type":126,"text":14873,"spans":14874},"Martijn De Lange, CEO at Hermes UK",[14875],{"start":32,"end":5726,"type":163},"rich_text$d50db538-06a9-4896-a8f0-3cd5cab1bb16",{"id":14878,"uid":14879,"url":14880,"type":50,"href":14881,"tags":14882,"first_publication_date":14883,"last_publication_date":14884,"slugs":14885,"linked_documents":14887,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":14888,"data":14889},"YhdkoxIAACsA1c62","leading-retailers-sign-up-to-new-hermes-parcel-tracking-app","\u002Fpress\u002Fleading-retailers-sign-up-to-new-hermes-parcel-tracking-app","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhdkoxIAACsA1c62%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T10:57:43+0000","2025-02-20T16:23:17+0000",[14886],"leading-retailers--hermes-tracking-app",[],[],{"title":14890,"category":8,"metaDescription":14891,"canonical":14892,"titleTag":14893,"featuredImage":14894,"publishedDate":11487,"slices":14904},"Leading Retailers & Hermes Tracking App","Our new parcel tracking up is seeing many retailers sign up to get involved. Read our latest post to find out all you need to know.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fleading-retailers-sign-up-to-new-hermes-parcel-tracking-app","Leading Retailers Sign-Up to New Hermes Parcel Tracking App | Evri",{"dimensions":14895,"alt":14896,"copyright":8,"url":14897,"id":14898,"edit":14899,"thumbnail":14900},{"width":65,"height":865},"A close-up of a customer sitting on a sofa, holding their phone and looking at the screen. The display shows the 'Track' page for the customer to track where their parcel is on its journey.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XtIZbqstJ9-Wfd_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5633.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6XtIZbqstJ9-Wfd",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":14901,"alt":14896,"copyright":8,"url":14902,"id":14898,"edit":14903},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XtIZbqstJ9-Wfd_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5633.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},[14905],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":14906,"primary":14908,"id":14933,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[14907],{},{"content":14909},[14910,14913,14916,14919,14924,14927,14930],{"type":126,"text":14911,"spans":14912},"Hermes, the consumer delivery specialist, has seen a large number of retailers sign-up to its new free app service which has been designed to enhance the customer delivery experience during the peak season and improve customer satisfaction. Online shoppers can now access real-time updates about the status of their Hermes deliveries on a smartphone or tablet via the Hermes Parcel Manager app.",[],{"type":126,"text":14914,"spans":14915},"Once retailers have dispatched the items to Hermes, consumers can track their parcels from the company’s hub right up to their front door, place of work, a neighbour’s house, or one of the 4,500 myHermes ParcelShops across the UK. By providing increased visibility via real-time tracking, retailers will see a reduction in failed delivery attempts and the number of consumer enquiries received during their busiest time of year.",[],{"type":126,"text":14917,"spans":14918},"The app is fully compatible with iOS and Android devices and is dual branded with each individual retailer, helping to provide an extension of the overall brand experience. It allows online shoppers to search for their parcels using their email address or a unique tracking number, which is provided within the dispatch confirmation email. Hermes Parcel Manager also provides push notifications so customers can receive direct updates on their parcel’s progress.",[],{"type":126,"text":14920,"spans":14921},"\"We continue to place huge emphasis on creating innovative products to complement our delivery services. Our recent International research revealed that more than twice as many Brits are using smartphones and tablets to buy products online than the French and the Germans. As people are using these devices more often, we wanted to create an app that provides increased visibility, reduces inbound enquiries for retailers and improves the first time delivery rate, which is critical as Christmas fast approaches.\" ",[14922],{"start":32,"end":14923,"type":1324},514,{"type":126,"text":11918,"spans":14925},[14926],{"start":32,"end":2883,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":14928,"spans":14929},"Hermes Parcel Manager can be used when buying items from a wide range of retailers, including New Look, River Island, Cotton Traders and Spotshoes.com.",[],{"type":126,"text":14931,"spans":14932},"Shoppers can download Hermes Parcel Manager from the Apple and Android App Store.",[],"rich_text$8de4f133-174d-4455-87f2-222967266ac8",{"id":14935,"uid":14936,"url":14937,"type":50,"href":14938,"tags":14939,"first_publication_date":14940,"last_publication_date":14941,"slugs":14942,"linked_documents":14944,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":14945,"data":14946},"YhdjxxIAACkA1cq6","homeless-charity-emmaus-announces-partnership-with-hermes-uk","\u002Fpress\u002Fhomeless-charity-emmaus-announces-partnership-with-hermes-uk","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhdjxxIAACkA1cq6%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T10:54:22+0000","2025-02-21T09:18:48+0000",[14943],"homeless-charity-emmaus-announces-partnership-with-hermes",[],[],{"title":14947,"category":8,"metaDescription":14948,"canonical":14949,"titleTag":14950,"featuredImage":14951,"publishedDate":14962,"slices":14963},"Homeless charity Emmaus announces partnership with Hermes","We are honoured to announce that we have partnered with homeless charity Emmaus. Read all about the partnership in this blog post.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhomeless-charity-emmaus-announces-partnership-with-hermes-uk","Homeless Charity Emmaus Announces Partnership with Hermes UK | Evri",{"dimensions":14952,"alt":14953,"copyright":8,"url":14954,"id":14955,"edit":14956,"thumbnail":14957},{"width":65,"height":865},"A female van driver dressed in an Evri banded vest is loading a blue Evri van with parcels.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zAC5bqstJ9-iM8_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9494.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,7762,5175&w=960&h=640","Z6zAC5bqstJ9-iM8",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":14958,"alt":14953,"copyright":8,"url":14959,"id":14955,"edit":14960},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zAC5bqstJ9-iM8_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9494.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,749,7762,3679&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":14961,"zoom":33,"background":71},749,"2020-11-20",[14964],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":14965,"primary":14967,"id":14994,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[14966],{},{"content":14968},[14969,14972,14975,14978,14983,14987,14991],{"type":126,"text":14970,"spans":14971},"National homelessness charity Emmaus has announced that Hermes UK, the leading consumer delivery company, has become a corporate partner, supporting its aim to give its companions a home, meaningful work and a sense of belonging.",[],{"type":126,"text":14973,"spans":14974},"The funds raised by Hermes will be used across the UK to expand the services the charity is able to offer. Unlike many homelessness charities, Emmaus provides a home for as long as it is needed, along with the stability and self-esteem that comes from having meaningful work to do every day. With support from Hermes, Emmaus hopes to increase the number of people they can support in the UK and improve training and development opportunities that companions can access.",[],{"type":126,"text":14976,"spans":14977},"Hermes will aim to raise a minimum of £100k for the charity through fundraising activities with clients and employees. The business is also exploring other ways to support the charity, including providing valuable work experience and work placements, running technology and interview training workshops and donating items for companions.",[],{"type":126,"text":14979,"spans":14980},"\"The issue of homelessness was already extremely challenging before Covid-19 and we can only see this situation getting worse as more and more people face an uncertain future. The virus and lockdown have presented many challenges for us, not only affecting our income from our shops and social enterprises, but also taking away the meaningful work that is such an important part of supporting our companions. This partnership comes at a great time as we work to overcome the challenges presented by the virus. We are extremely excited to be working with Hermes and look forward building a true partnership that both organisations can benefit from.\" ",[14981],{"start":32,"end":14982,"type":1324},649,{"type":126,"text":14984,"spans":14985},"Simon Grange, CEO at Emmaus",[14986],{"start":32,"end":3553,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":14988,"spans":14989},"\"We’re seeing the impact of the pandemic first hand when it comes to the volume of people looking for work and applying for roles, and unfortunately a severe consequence of rising unemployment is that the UK’s homelessness crisis is being further exacerbated. There is an additional financial strain on local services, which makes charities such as Emmaus even more important now. We’re pleased to be able to support this crucial cause by giving people the tools to help them succeed, both now and in the future.\" ",[14990],{"start":32,"end":14923,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":12026,"spans":14992},[14993],{"start":32,"end":5726,"type":163},"rich_text$fc207877-8d9e-4033-93f9-b32683df7aa9",{"id":14996,"uid":14997,"url":14998,"type":50,"href":14999,"tags":15000,"first_publication_date":15001,"last_publication_date":15002,"slugs":15003,"linked_documents":15004,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":15005,"data":15006},"Yhdf2RIAACoA1by2","hermes-hits-3000-and-expands-parcelshop-services","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-hits-3000-and-expands-parcelshop-services","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22Yhdf2RIAACoA1by2%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T10:37:20+0000","2025-02-21T08:51:49+0000",[14997],[],[],{"title":15007,"category":8,"metaDescription":15008,"canonical":15009,"titleTag":15010,"featuredImage":15011,"publishedDate":15021,"slices":15022},"Hermes hits 3,000 and expands ParcelShop services","Hermes has increased the number of myHermes ParcelShops in the UK to 3,000. Read our latest post to find our plans for further expansion.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-hits-3000-and-expands-parcelshop-services","Hermes Hits 3,000 and Expands ParcelShop Services | Evri",{"dimensions":15012,"alt":15013,"copyright":8,"url":15014,"id":15015,"edit":15016,"thumbnail":15017},{"width":65,"height":8660},"ParcelShop store assistant is smiling and handing a blue receipt to the customer to confirm their parcel has been accepted.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TI7pbqstJ9-TfZ_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2423.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,6000,3938&w=960&h=630","Z6TI7pbqstJ9-TfZ",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":15018,"alt":15013,"copyright":8,"url":15019,"id":15015,"edit":15020},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TI7pbqstJ9-TfZ_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2423.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,548,6000,2844&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":8669,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2019-12-06",[15023],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":15024,"primary":15026,"id":15048,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[15025],{},{"content":15027},[15028,15031,15034,15037,15040,15044],{"type":126,"text":15029,"spans":15030},"Hermes, the leading consumer delivery service, has increased the number of myHermes ParcelShops in the UK to 3,000, and is set to continue to expand the network further throughout 2014. It is estimated that the myHermes Parcelshop network will handle over 1.5 million parcels throughout November and December this year – an increase of 326% on last year.",[],{"type":126,"text":15032,"spans":15033},"In addition Hermes is now extending the range of services available through the myHermes ParcelShop network to enable people to specify their nearest shop as an alternative location to home delivery.",[],{"type":126,"text":15035,"spans":15036},"Hermes’ retail clients are now able offer this service to their customers by integrating the myHermes ParcelShop finder with their web platform. This will enable shoppers to seamlessly identify and specify the nearest or most appropriate location as an alternative to Hermes’ existing home, neighbour or safe place delivery options. Customers will be alerted by SMS or email when a parcel is ready for collection.",[],{"type":126,"text":15038,"spans":15039},"myHermes ParcelShop was launched nationwide in June 2012 at 500 convenience stores to provide an simple and affordable way of sending personal and business parcels, as well as allowing retailers to offer a cost effective means of returning unwanted online purchases. The stores are situated in major urban locations that have been specially selected based on population density and online demand, meaning that around 80 per cent of the population are within two miles of their nearest myHermes ParcelShop.",[],{"type":126,"text":15041,"spans":15042},"\"Our myHermes ParcelShop network forms an important part of our multi-channel approach which is designed to deliver high levels of satisfaction and ultimately create brand value. By adding a click and collect element to our service we are providing an even wider choice and greater convenience for our customer.\" ",[15043],{"start":32,"end":14357,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":15045,"spans":15046},"Steve Murray, Head of New Markets Development",[15047],{"start":32,"end":1128,"type":163},"rich_text$daec98ac-2f4d-4da7-b008-6d27c7d9123b",{"id":15050,"uid":15051,"url":15052,"type":50,"href":15053,"tags":15054,"first_publication_date":15055,"last_publication_date":15056,"slugs":15057,"linked_documents":15058,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":15059,"data":15060},"YhddPhIAACsA1bV5","hermes-goes-green-this-christmas","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-goes-green-this-christmas","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhddPhIAACsA1bV5%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T10:26:18+0000","2025-02-20T16:21:57+0000",[15051],[],[],{"title":15061,"category":8,"metaDescription":15062,"canonical":15063,"titleTag":15064,"featuredImage":15065,"publishedDate":11487,"slices":15071},"Hermes goes green this Christmas","We're on an emission mission! Read our latest blog post and find out how our customers in Central London will receive 100% emission free parcel delivery.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-goes-green-this-christmas","Hermes Goes Green This Christmas | Evri",{"dimensions":15066,"alt":9075,"copyright":8,"url":9076,"id":9077,"edit":15067,"thumbnail":15068},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":15069,"alt":9075,"copyright":8,"url":9081,"id":9077,"edit":15070},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},[15072],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":15073,"primary":15075,"id":15092,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[15074],{},{"content":15076},[15077,15080,15083,15088],{"type":126,"text":15078,"spans":15079},"Some Hermes customers in the Central London area will benefit from a ‘100% emission free’ parcel delivery over the festive period, following the company’s decision to team up with final mile delivery specialist Gnewt Cargo.",[],{"type":126,"text":15081,"spans":15082},"Hermes, the leading consumer delivery specialist, is working with Gnewt Cargo to support its existing courier network within Central London during the peak trading period, in anticipation of record numbers of parcel deliveries. Gnewt Cargo runs a fleet of electric mini vans that are 100% emission free and have been independently verified to cut CO2 emissions per parcel delivered by 62%!",[],{"type":126,"text":15084,"spans":15085},"\"We are anticipating another record year for parcel deliveries and this is just one of a number of initiatives we have in place to ensure that no-one is disappointed this Christmas. The fact that we can do this whilst also significantly reducing any impact on the environment is fantastic and is part of our commitment to reducing our carbon footprint wherever possible. Over the last 5 years Hermes UK have successfully reduced its CO2 emissions, per unit of despatch, by 22%\" ",[15086],{"start":32,"end":15087,"type":1324},478,{"type":126,"text":15089,"spans":15090},"Gary Winter, Sales & Marketing Director at Hermes UK",[15091],{"start":32,"end":684,"type":163},"rich_text$1bf3344e-5c85-464b-8d64-adb40cd17f45",{"id":15094,"uid":15095,"url":15096,"type":50,"href":15097,"tags":15098,"first_publication_date":15099,"last_publication_date":15100,"slugs":15101,"linked_documents":15102,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":15103,"data":15104},"YhdYqRIAACsA1afh","hermes-drives-enhanced-delivery-experience-with-new-app-launch","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-drives-enhanced-delivery-experience-with-new-app-launch","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhdYqRIAACsA1afh%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T10:06:37+0000","2025-02-21T08:40:59+0000",[15095],[],[],{"title":15105,"category":8,"metaDescription":15106,"canonical":15107,"titleTag":15108,"featuredImage":15109,"publishedDate":15119,"slices":15120},"Hermes drives enhanced delivery experience with new app launch","We've enhanced our delivery experience with a brand new app! Catch our latest post to find out more.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-drives-enhanced-delivery-experience-with-new-app-launch","Hermes Drives Enhanced Delivery Experience with New App Launch | Evri",{"dimensions":15110,"alt":15111,"copyright":8,"url":15112,"id":15113,"edit":15114,"thumbnail":15115},{"width":65,"height":865},"A side-profile view of a customer sitting on a sofa in their lounge, holding their mobile phone and looking at their screen.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6Xsw5bqstJ9-We8_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5361.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6Xsw5bqstJ9-We8",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":15116,"alt":15111,"copyright":8,"url":15117,"id":15113,"edit":15118},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6Xsw5bqstJ9-We8_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5361.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2019-08-30",[15121],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":15122,"primary":15124,"id":15148,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[15123],{},{"content":15125},[15126,15129,15132,15135,15138,15141,15145],{"type":126,"text":15127,"spans":15128},"Hermes, the leading consumer delivery company, has finalised the roll-out of its new app that enables retailers to deliver an enhanced consumer experience. This new innovation provides online shoppers with increased visibility, as well as more choice and control over how they receive their parcels.",[],{"type":126,"text":15130,"spans":15131},"Available on both iOS and Android platforms, the Hermes app allows users to track and\u002For divert their parcels in real-time via their smartphones, as well as receive notifications on the current progress of their deliveries. Currently, consumers have the option to re-route their deliveries to a neighbour or a safe place whilst the parcel is in transit - with further options such as diverting to a ParcelShop or locker set to be added later this year. In addition, those online shoppers looking to return items will be able to do so more conveniently via their devices. They will be able to book a return in a few clicks, before receiving the relevant QR code and order numbers.",[],{"type":126,"text":15133,"spans":15134},"The app will also be vital to the roll-out of Hermes Play later this year, which enables the sender of a parcel to connect with its recipient through a personal video message. The sender will be able to record and upload a file via the app, which can be accessed by scanning a 2D barcode upon delivery.",[],{"type":126,"text":15136,"spans":15137},"Meanwhile, sole traders, online marketplace sellers and consumers looking to send parcels will be able to use the app to book deliveries. Users can simply navigate the menus to pick a recipient from their address book, and generate the shipping labels, before arranging a courier collection or dropping off at a ParcelShop.",[],{"type":126,"text":15139,"spans":15140},"The roll-out and ongoing development of the Hermes app - which has been previously trialled on iOS platforms before also being made available to Android users - forms part of the company’s Digital Futures strategy, which is supporting Hermes’ mission to become the UK’s carrier of choice by 2021.",[],{"type":126,"text":15142,"spans":15143},"\"Our dedicated team of innovators and specialist developers are continuing to shape the future of home deliveries by creating a wave of new and exciting products. This app provides a foundation for many of these new features, which are designed to drive a greater customer experience for our retail clients. \"",[15144],{"start":32,"end":12612,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":13162,"spans":15146},[15147],{"start":32,"end":1084,"type":163},"rich_text$2263c930-9278-458a-ac81-d8a031f32c27",{"id":15150,"uid":15151,"url":15152,"type":50,"href":15153,"tags":15154,"first_publication_date":15155,"last_publication_date":15156,"slugs":15157,"linked_documents":15158,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":15159,"data":15160},"YhdVRRIAAC0A1aAm","hermes-doubles-number-of-lockers-to-help-support-social-distancing","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-doubles-number-of-lockers-to-help-support-social-distancing","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhdVRRIAAC0A1aAm%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T09:52:12+0000","2025-02-21T08:57:06+0000",[15151],[],[],{"title":15161,"category":8,"metaDescription":15162,"canonical":15163,"titleTag":15164,"featuredImage":15165,"publishedDate":15175,"slices":15176},"Hermes doubles number of lockers to help support social distancing","To help support social distancing during the pandemic, we've increased the number of parcel Lockers in our network. Read here to find out more.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-doubles-number-of-lockers-to-help-support-social-distancing","Hermes Doubles Number of Lockers to Help Support Social Distancing | Evri",{"dimensions":15166,"alt":15167,"copyright":8,"url":15168,"id":15169,"edit":15170,"thumbnail":15171},{"width":65,"height":4284},"Customer holding parcel and standing outside at an Evri Locker, watching as their label prints out","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=3,0,8158,5464&w=960&h=643","Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb",{"x":903,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":15172,"alt":15167,"copyright":8,"url":15173,"id":15169,"edit":15174},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,797,8164,3869&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":4293,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2020-03-11",[15177],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":15178,"primary":15180,"id":15204,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[15179],{},{"content":15181},[15182,15187,15193,15196,15201],{"type":126,"text":15183,"spans":15184},"Hermes, the consumer delivery specialist, has increased the number of lockers available for its customers to use to return or send items as part of its drive for contactless delivery and to support social distancing.",[15185],{"start":2506,"end":758,"type":279,"data":15186},{"link_type":281,"url":12952},{"type":126,"text":15188,"spans":15189},"The lockers, operated in partnership with Inpost, are located in a variety of safe and secure outdoor locations around the UK and are open 24\u002F7 hours, enabling people to access them during quiet times without the need for personal interaction. There are also plans in place for additional Inpost lockers throughout the country, including sites close to hospitals to support NHS staff and other key workers. Locations can be found in the Hermes ParcelShop finder.",[15190],{"start":671,"end":3706,"type":279,"data":15191},{"link_type":281,"url":15192},"press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.myhermes.co.uk\u002Ffind-a-parcel-shop?lockers=true",{"type":126,"text":15194,"spans":15195}," Martijn de Lange, CEO at Hermes UK, said: “As the country adapts to changes around social distancing and self-isolation, we are providing more delivery options for customers across the country. As part of this we have increased the numbers of outdoor lockers located in local communities from 450 to 831, enabling more of our customers to send and return parcels in a safe way during these challenging circumstances.",[],{"type":126,"text":15197,"spans":15198},"\"As the country adapts to changes around social distancing and self-isolation, we are providing more delivery options for customers across the country. As part of this we have increased the numbers of outdoor lockers located in local communities from 450 to 831, enabling more of our customers to send and return parcels in a safe way during these challenging circumstances. We would ask people to use the lockers sensibly and to be mindful of the government advice regarding essential travel and suggest that customers might consider using this service as part of their daily exercise routine. This is also important as some of our independent ParcelShops may be subject to changing opening times or closure as things develop and we are urging customers to double check ParcelShop openings before they travel to them.\" ",[15199],{"start":32,"end":15200,"type":1324},820,{"type":126,"text":11684,"spans":15202},[15203],{"start":32,"end":4070,"type":163},"rich_text$442115a6-a227-4976-9a8f-ca3e8cd36e50",{"id":15206,"uid":15207,"url":15208,"type":50,"href":15209,"tags":15210,"first_publication_date":15211,"last_publication_date":15212,"slugs":15213,"linked_documents":15214,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":15215,"data":15216},"YhdR1RIAACkA1Zjk","hermes-displays-excellence-to-win-national-award","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-displays-excellence-to-win-national-award","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhdR1RIAACkA1Zjk%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T09:37:32+0000","2025-02-20T16:26:17+0000",[15207],[],[],{"title":15217,"category":8,"metaDescription":15218,"canonical":15219,"titleTag":15220,"featuredImage":15221,"publishedDate":11487,"slices":15231},"Hermes displays excellence to win national award","Winners! We're pleased to say we've won a Motor Transport Award. Read our latest blog to find out more.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-displays-excellence-to-win-national-award","Hermes Displays Excellence to Win National Award | Evri",{"dimensions":15222,"alt":15223,"copyright":8,"url":15224,"id":15225,"edit":15226,"thumbnail":15227},{"width":65,"height":865},"An Evri courier smiling and posing for the camera with two parcels in their grasp. The backdrop is a suburban British neighbourhood with plenty of greenery.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ69yGpbqstJ9-pVR_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4940.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z69yGpbqstJ9-pVR",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":15228,"alt":15223,"copyright":8,"url":15229,"id":15225,"edit":15230},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ69yGpbqstJ9-pVR_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4940.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},[15232],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":15233,"primary":15235,"id":15254,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[15234],{},{"content":15236},[15237,15240,15243,15246,15251],{"type":126,"text":15238,"spans":15239},"Hermes UK, the consumer delivery specialist based in Morley, Yorkshire, is celebrating after winning a national award. The company triumphed in the Operational & Compliance Excellence category at the 2014 Motor Transport Awards, held in London on Wednesday night.",[],{"type":126,"text":15241,"spans":15242},"The award is designed to recognise a company that manages the balancing act of running a profitable, safe, legal and efficient fleet of vehicles. The judging panel said it was impressed by how “Hermes is managing such dynamic growth and simultaneously driving up operational standards and compliance”.",[],{"type":126,"text":15244,"spans":15245},"Over the past year, Hermes has invested in its infrastructure, including the opening of a new fully automated hub in Warrington, growing its network of myHermes ParcelShops, and increasing its number of couriers. At the same time, the company improved its operational and compliance scores, as well as driving up its on-time delivery performance. Hermes was also praised for its in-house driving school, which gives employees the opportunity to develop their skill-set.",[],{"type":126,"text":15247,"spans":15248},"\"We are thrilled that Hermes has been recognised by the Motor Transport Awards. Over the past year we have invested heavily in order to future-proof our business. As a result we have been rewarded with an increase in parcel volumes and improved service levels. The team works extremely hard to ensure that our growing fleet of vehicles remain compliant at all times and they are very deserving of this award. \"",[15249],{"start":32,"end":15250,"type":1324},410,{"type":126,"text":11918,"spans":15252},[15253],{"start":32,"end":2883,"type":163},"rich_text$9e0a189c-8a93-4c0b-abbc-f09425a653a0",{"id":15256,"uid":15257,"url":15258,"type":50,"href":15259,"tags":15260,"first_publication_date":15261,"last_publication_date":15262,"slugs":15263,"linked_documents":15264,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":15265,"data":15266},"YhdQIxIAAC4A1ZXz","hermes-displays-excellence-to-scoop-top-award","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-displays-excellence-to-scoop-top-award","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhdQIxIAAC4A1ZXz%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T09:30:30+0000","2025-02-20T16:27:08+0000",[15257],[],[],{"title":15267,"category":8,"metaDescription":15218,"canonical":15268,"titleTag":15269,"featuredImage":15270,"publishedDate":11487,"slices":15276},"Hermes displays excellence to scoop top award","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-displays-excellence-to-scoop-top-award","Hermes Displays Excellence to Scoop Top Award | Evri",{"dimensions":15271,"alt":13617,"copyright":8,"url":13618,"id":13619,"edit":15272,"thumbnail":15273},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":15274,"alt":13617,"copyright":8,"url":13623,"id":13619,"edit":15275},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},[15277],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":15278,"primary":15280,"id":15302,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[15279],{},{"content":15281},[15282,15285,15288,15291,15296,15299],{"type":126,"text":15283,"spans":15284},"Hermes, the consumer delivery specialist, is celebrating after the company secured a national award on Wednesday evening. The Morley-based company fought off tough competition to win in the Operational & Compliance Excellence category at the 2017 Motor Transport Awards, held at Grosvenor House in London.",[],{"type":126,"text":15286,"spans":15287},"The award recognises a company that manages the balancing act of running a profitable, safe, legal and efficient fleet of vehicles. Hermes’ operational team ensures the business remains proficient, profitable and compliant, whilst continuing to champion further improvements via major investment.",[],{"type":126,"text":15289,"spans":15290},"The judging panel was impressed after Hermes recorded Green ‘Operator Compliance Risk Scores’ (OCRS) across all areas, whilst the MOT pass rate during 2016 was 96% for vehicles and 99% for trailers. Last year, the company also invested in an advanced tracking solution that highlights harsh braking, idle running and over revving. This data is being used by Hermes to train drivers and achieve a better MPG, so far equating to more than 130,000 miles saved.",[],{"type":126,"text":15292,"spans":15293},"\"We are very proud to have won the Motor Transport Award for Operational & Compliance Excellence for the second time in four years. This is an incredibly important category for any transport or logistics provider to win, and I would like to congratulate our operations team for their continued hard work. We will continue to significantly invest in both our fleet and our network to ensure we continue to provide an exceptional level of service to our clients and their customers. \"",[15294],{"start":32,"end":15295,"type":1324},482,{"type":126,"text":11918,"spans":15297},[15298],{"start":32,"end":2883,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":15300,"spans":15301},"Twelve months ago, Hermes’ Peak Planning & Delivery Team was named Team of the Year at the 2016 Motor Transport Awards.",[],"rich_text$89c62bef-3554-49af-947d-5e5345a9a172",{"id":15304,"uid":15305,"url":15306,"type":50,"href":15307,"tags":15308,"first_publication_date":15309,"last_publication_date":15310,"slugs":15311,"linked_documents":15312,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":15313,"data":15314},"YhdNaRIAAC4A1ZFe","hermes-delivers-christmas-promise","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-delivers-christmas-promise","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhdNaRIAAC4A1ZFe%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T09:21:51+0000","2025-02-20T16:53:28+0000",[15305],[],[],{"title":15315,"category":8,"metaDescription":15316,"canonical":15317,"titleTag":15318,"featuredImage":15319,"publishedDate":15325,"slices":15326},"Hermes delivers Christmas promise","Our Hermes Guaranteed Christmas Delivery Promise assures peace of mind for our customers. Catch our latest post to find out how.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-delivers-christmas-promise","Hermes Delivers Christmas Promise | Evri",{"dimensions":15320,"alt":14953,"copyright":8,"url":14954,"id":14955,"edit":15321,"thumbnail":15322},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":15323,"alt":14953,"copyright":8,"url":14959,"id":14955,"edit":15324},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":14961,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2018-11-29",[15327],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":15328,"primary":15330,"id":15351,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[15329],{},{"content":15331},[15332,15335,15338,15341,15344,15348],{"type":126,"text":15333,"spans":15334},"Hermes, the consumer delivery specialist, will provide retailers and their customers with added peace of mind in the lead-up to Christmas by offering a unique money back delivery guarantee.",[],{"type":126,"text":15336,"spans":15337},"For a seventh consecutive year, the Hermes Guaranteed Christmas Delivery Promise assures that all purchases will be delivered before Christmas Day; enabling retailers to avoid disappointing their online shoppers.",[],{"type":126,"text":15339,"spans":15340},"The terms of the commitment apply to each individual parcel that enters the Hermes network, with a UK mainland address, by 23.59 on 21st December for standard deliveries and 23:59 on 22nd December for Next Day.",[],{"type":126,"text":15342,"spans":15343},"It guarantees that a minimum of one delivery attempt will be made to ensure purchases are received in time for Christmas; otherwise Hermes will refund the delivery charge.",[],{"type":126,"text":15345,"spans":15346},"\"We’re happy to honour our Guaranteed Christmas Delivery Promise for the seventh year running and we anticipate it will be the busiest peak ever. Along with this promise, we have continued to significantly invest in our network and infrastructure to help retailers enjoy their most prosperous peak season to date. \"",[15347],{"start":32,"end":12436,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":12202,"spans":15349},[15350],{"start":32,"end":4070,"type":163},"rich_text$b3148858-453e-4303-889c-b5d08659f063",{"id":15353,"uid":15354,"url":15355,"type":50,"href":15356,"tags":15357,"first_publication_date":15358,"last_publication_date":15359,"slugs":15360,"linked_documents":15362,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":15363,"data":15364},"YhdMgBIAAC4A1Yyd","hermes-cuts-1-5-million-miles-each-year-with-new-double-decker-trailers","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-cuts-1-5-million-miles-each-year-with-new-double-decker-trailers","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhdMgBIAAC4A1Yyd%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-24T09:14:44+0000","2025-02-13T10:30:07+0000",[15361],"hermes-cuts-1.5-million-miles-each-year-with-new-double-decker-trailers",[],[],{"title":15365,"category":8,"metaDescription":15366,"canonical":15367,"titleTag":15368,"featuredImage":15369,"publishedDate":14171,"slices":15375},"Hermes cuts 1.5 million miles each year with new double decker trailers","Catch our latest post and find out how we've been able save 1.5m travel miles each year through our new double-decker trailers.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-cuts-1-5-million-miles-each-year-with-new-double-decker-trailers","Hermes Cuts 1.5 million Miles Each Year with New Double Decker Trailers | Evri",{"dimensions":15370,"alt":6536,"copyright":8,"url":6537,"id":6538,"edit":15371,"thumbnail":15372},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":15373,"alt":6536,"copyright":8,"url":6542,"id":6538,"edit":15374},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},[15376],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":15377,"primary":15379,"id":15401,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[15378],{},{"content":15380},[15381,15384,15387,15390,15393,15398],{"type":126,"text":15382,"spans":15383,"direction":112},"The new trailers - tailored to Hermes’ exact requirements by Don-Bur - hold 33% more than a standard model and 12% more than the existing double decker trailers used by the company to transport parcels on behalf of the majority of the UK’s leading retailers and retailers.",[],{"type":126,"text":15385,"spans":15386,"direction":112},"The bespoke design incorporates an aluminium roof with LED lighting instead of a traditional plastic top panel, which can typically crack, whilst also leading to higher internal temperatures. Instead of being formed of plywood and thin plastic, which can be easily punctured, the new side panels are constructed from a high-density polythene (HDPE) foam core, a hot dipped galvanisation steel skin, and polyester baked paint. Hermes has opted for this specification in order to guarantee the safe and secure transportation of parcels, whilst ensuring the durable panels maintain a fresh and new look for longer.",[],{"type":126,"text":15388,"spans":15389,"direction":112},"The trailers will be operating out of Hermes’ fully-automated hubs in Warrington and Rugby, whilst they have also been designed to be ferry-safe, which means they don’t need to have a tractor unit attached to them on a ferry for stability.",[],{"type":126,"text":15391,"spans":15392,"direction":112},"This latest investment follows the news that Hermes became the first UK delivery company to acquire Compressed Natural Gas (CNG) vehicles, thereby reducing CO2 emissions by 80% against a comparable diesel Euro 6 vehicle.",[],{"type":126,"text":15394,"spans":15395,"direction":112},"\"After extensive research exploring the best type of trailer for a number of our most travelled routes, we opted to modernise our fleet with a bespoke model from Don-Bur, the leaders in this field. Our team worked closely with theirs in true partnership and the result is leading edge designed trailers with unrivalled safety features, that look fantastic on the roads. This important investment highlights our commitment to operational efficiency as well as prioritising the security and safety of the parcels we carry. \"",[15396],{"start":32,"end":15397,"type":1324},522,{"type":126,"text":12311,"spans":15399,"direction":112},[15400],{"start":32,"end":3684,"type":163},"rich_text$31ee7f23-0384-4db1-b39c-e083c33cf181",{"id":15403,"uid":15404,"url":15405,"type":50,"href":15406,"tags":15407,"first_publication_date":15408,"last_publication_date":15409,"slugs":15410,"linked_documents":15412,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":15413,"data":15414},"YhaEehIAACwA0k6n","hermes-creates-10-5k-new-jobs-across-the-uk-and-announces-100-million-investment","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-creates-10-5k-new-jobs-across-the-uk-and-announces-100-million-investment","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhaEehIAACwA0k6n%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-23T19:01:19+0000","2025-02-21T09:14:44+0000",[15411],"hermes-creates-10.5k-new-jobs-across-the-uk-and-announces-100-million-investment",[],[],{"title":15415,"category":8,"metaDescription":15416,"canonical":15417,"titleTag":15418,"featuredImage":15419,"publishedDate":15429,"slices":15430},"Hermes creates 10.5K new jobs across the UK and announces £100 million investment","We're pleased to announce that we've been able to create 10,500 new jobs following significant investment in our operation. Find out more in this post.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-creates-10-5k-new-jobs-across-the-uk-and-announces-100-million-investment","Hermes Creates 10.5K New Jobs Across the UK and Announces £100 million investment | Evri",{"dimensions":15420,"alt":11651,"copyright":8,"url":15421,"id":15422,"edit":15423,"thumbnail":15424},{"width":65,"height":865},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6Tm95bqstJ9-UCa_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10061.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,2,7857,5238&w=960&h=640","Z6Tm95bqstJ9-UCa",{"x":32,"y":4163,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":15425,"alt":11651,"copyright":8,"url":15426,"id":15422,"edit":15427},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6Tm95bqstJ9-UCa_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10061.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,759,7857,3724&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":15428,"zoom":33,"background":71},759,"2020-07-23",[15431],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":15432,"primary":15434,"id":15459,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[15433],{},{"content":15435},[15436,15439,15442,15445,15448,15451,15456],{"type":126,"text":15437,"spans":15438},"Hermes UK, the leading consumer delivery company is looking for over 10.5K ‘parcel people’ to join its business as it invests £100 million to expand its capacity to meet the huge demand created by people shopping at home during lockdown and the continuing growth in the sector.",[],{"type":126,"text":15440,"spans":15441},"The company is looking for around 1500 full-time staff, including some roles at its head office in Yorkshire, and throughout its UK network for drivers, warehouse operatives, managers and supervisors. There are also opportunities for another 9K self-employed couriers nationwide, who will have the option of becoming SE+ couriers with guaranteed holiday pay as part of Hermes’ ground-breaking deal with the GMB Union.",[],{"type":126,"text":15443,"spans":15444},"Recruitment for all roles is starting now in advance of the busy peak season. More than £30 million has been invested in the operation this year, including the opening of an additional 90 new sub depots, new vehicles and brand new customer service technology.",[],{"type":126,"text":15446,"spans":15447},"The investment will be used to strengthen the company’s infrastructure to enable it to handle its predicted parcels volumes of 3.5million each day during the Black Friday and Christmas period – almost double last year.",[],{"type":126,"text":15449,"spans":15450},"With the safety of its people a top priority, the company has already spent £8 million on PPE and seen a reduction in productivity of around 20% since the start of the lockdown, due to necessary operational changes and social distancing.  However, it will not be accepting any money from the Government for furloughed staff but will instead self-fund this.",[],{"type":126,"text":15452,"spans":15453},"\"The pandemic has expedited the already phenomenal growth of online shopping and we see no sign of this changing. As a result, it is important that we have the right infrastructure and people in place to support this. This is good news for the many people who have sadly had their income affected and we are pleased to be able to support the UK economy with so many jobs at this time. In that first fortnight of lockdown we had thousands of applications from pub staff, chefs, children’s entertainers, dog walkers, pub singers, beauticians, hairdressers, pilots and many, many others. We look forward to welcoming our new recruits over the coming weeks.\"",[15454],{"start":32,"end":15455,"type":1324},654,{"type":126,"text":12026,"spans":15457},[15458],{"start":32,"end":5726,"type":163},"rich_text$7523e51c-e570-40f2-ac3a-7c1520d90a05",[15461,15514,15587,15656,15703,15759,15821,15879,15931,15986,16048,16109],{"id":15462,"uid":15463,"url":15464,"type":50,"href":15465,"tags":15466,"first_publication_date":15467,"last_publication_date":15468,"slugs":15469,"linked_documents":15470,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":15471,"data":15472},"YhaDahIAAC0A0koT","hermes-confirms-record-breaking-peak-season","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-confirms-record-breaking-peak-season","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhaDahIAAC0A0koT%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-23T18:56:56+0000","2025-02-13T08:54:17+0000",[15463],[],[],{"title":15473,"category":8,"metaDescription":15474,"canonical":15475,"titleTag":15476,"featuredImage":15477,"publishedDate":11487,"slices":15487},"Hermes confirms record breaking peak season","Find out about our record breaking and busiest peak to date in our latest blog post.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-confirms-record-breaking-peak-season","Hermes Confirms Record Breaking Peak Season | Evri",{"dimensions":15478,"alt":15479,"copyright":8,"url":15480,"id":15481,"edit":15482,"thumbnail":15483},{"width":65,"height":865},"An Evri Courier closing their boot after retrieving the correct parcel for a delivery","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDe5bqstJ9-cfR_EVRI_LOCATION_04_3848.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6pDe5bqstJ9-cfR",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":15484,"alt":15479,"copyright":8,"url":15485,"id":15481,"edit":15486},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDe5bqstJ9-cfR_EVRI_LOCATION_04_3848.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},[15488],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":15489,"primary":15491,"id":15513,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[15490],{},{"content":15492},[15493,15496,15499,15502,15507,15510],{"type":126,"text":15494,"spans":15495},"Hermes, the consumer delivery specialist, has confirmed that it enjoyed its busiest and most efficient peak season to date. Throughout December the delivery firm processed 30.3 million parcels, representing a 24% increase on the previous year.",[],{"type":126,"text":15497,"spans":15498},"The record-breaking peak season followed a successful Black Friday period, with Hermes processing 8.2 million parcels in the week following the major retail event that is famed for huge discounts. Throughout the final month of the year, Hermes handled more than one million parcels in a single night on 22 separate occasions, while working the Bank Holiday on December 28th ensured its clients also received a great Boxing Day sale service. The busiest day of the year fell on Friday 4th December when the delivery firm processed 1.4 million parcels.",[],{"type":126,"text":15500,"spans":15501},"For the third year running, Hermes offered its customers a Christmas Guarantee, which meant that every parcel that entered the Hermes network, with a UK mainland address, by 23.59 on Monday 21 December had at least one delivery attempt in time for Christmas, or the cost of the delivery was refunded.",[],{"type":126,"text":15503,"spans":15504},"\"Our success during the recent peak season is testimony to the meticulous planning between our client managers and retailers, combined with the hard work and dedication displayed by our teams across our hubs, depots and final mile delivery network. Last year we also invested in a secondary sortation tier at our fully automated hub in Warrington, opened another 125 sub depots across the UK and added another 3,000 couriers to our network for the peak season. This investment has boosted our overall capacity and helped us to deliver a fantastic service in the lead-up to and after Christmas. \"",[15505],{"start":32,"end":15506,"type":1324},595,{"type":126,"text":11445,"spans":15508},[15509],{"start":32,"end":2883,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":15511,"spans":15512},"The myHermes delivery solution, which is used by consumers and SMEs to send parcels within the UK and to more than 190 countries around the world, saw a 30% increase in volumes throughout December. The myHermes ParcelShop network, which now totals 4,500 outlets, handled 40% more parcels in December than the previous year.",[],"rich_text$d25f94fd-09e3-4fe7-8a49-22087d698b72",{"id":15515,"uid":15516,"url":15517,"type":50,"href":15518,"tags":15519,"first_publication_date":15520,"last_publication_date":15521,"slugs":15522,"linked_documents":15524,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":15525,"data":15526},"YhaCbhIAAC0A0kVz","hermes-can-now-deliver-to-any-3-metre-square-in-the-uk-using-what3words","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-can-now-deliver-to-any-3-metre-square-in-the-uk-using-what3words","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhaCbhIAAC0A0kVz%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-23T18:52:33+0000","2025-02-21T09:17:02+0000",[15523],"hermes--what3words",[],[],{"title":15527,"category":8,"metaDescription":15528,"canonical":15529,"titleTag":15530,"featuredImage":15531,"publishedDate":15540,"slices":15541},"Hermes & what3words","We're pleased to announce we now offer even more accurate deliveries with what3words integration. Read our latest blog post to find out more.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-can-now-deliver-to-any-3-metre-square-in-the-uk-using-what3words","Hermes Can Now Deliver to any 3 Metre Square in the UK Using what3words | Evri",{"dimensions":15532,"alt":7332,"copyright":8,"url":15533,"id":15534,"edit":15535,"thumbnail":15536},{"width":65,"height":865},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDXpbqstJ9-cfC_EVRI_LOCATION_04_3497.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6pDXpbqstJ9-cfC",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":15537,"alt":7332,"copyright":8,"url":15538,"id":15534,"edit":15539},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDXpbqstJ9-cfC_EVRI_LOCATION_04_3497.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2020-08-20",[15542],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":15543,"primary":15545,"id":15586,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[15544],{},{"content":15546},[15547,15550,15558,15561,15564,15567,15570,15575,15579,15583],{"type":126,"text":15548,"spans":15549},"Hermes, one of the leading consumer delivery companies in the UK, has partnered with innovative addressing company what3words to provide even more accurate deliveries. From today, Hermes can now accept what3words addresses from any retailer or e-commerce client and deliver to that exact location.",[],{"type":126,"text":15551,"spans":15552},"what3words is a simple way to talk about, and share location. The system divides the world into 57 trillion 3 metre squares, giving each square a new, simplified address made up of three dictionary words. For example, the exact 3 metre square of the front door of what3words London HQ is at \u002F\u002F\u002Ffilled.count.soap.",[15553,15555],{"start":7303,"end":15554,"type":163},311,{"start":7303,"end":15554,"type":279,"data":15556},{"link_type":281,"url":15557},"press.html\u002F\u002Fmap.what3words.com\u002Ffilled.count.soap",{"type":126,"text":15559,"spans":15560},"what3words provides a simple, innovative and robust way for couriers to deliver parcels right to a customer’s doorstep or desired delivery point. Street addresses across the UK can be   inaccurate: pins can drop in the centre of the building, leaving couriers struggling to find the correct door or access point, and postcodes often cover a large area. what3words addresses are even more accurate than postal addresses and allow customers to specify their precise delivery location, whether a doorstep or a safe place in their garden.",[],{"type":126,"text":15562,"spans":15563},"Hermes delivers over 400  million parcels each year on behalf of some of the UK's largest online retailers including H&M, Next, ASOS,  JD Williams and Debenhams. At the height of lockdown, Hermes delivered 2.5million parcels in one day - beating their previous record during Christmas 2019 of 2.1million.",[],{"type":126,"text":15565,"spans":15566},"As online shopping continues to grow, what3words has seen a 833% increase in adoption of its addressing technology on the checkout pages of retailers around the UK,  who are looking to provide customers with a way to ensure their delivery makes it to the correct place or a safe contact-free location.",[],{"type":126,"text":15568,"spans":15569},"Using the Hermes app, customers can add the what3words address to their profile. The driver will then have the what3words address in addition to the traditional address information, such as postcodes, providing an extra layer of detail for the last mile of the delivery.  ",[],{"type":126,"text":15571,"spans":15572},"\"Hermes is leading the way in the UK, delivering on the promise of fast, efficient deliveries for its customers. Traditional street addresses aren’t accurate enough to deliver your online orders smoothly every time. This year has shown the importance of e-commerce, and the role it plays in the UK - with record numbers predicted this Christmas period. This means more deliveries, more new delivery drivers on the road and more customers with increasingly high expectations for fast and seamless deliveries. Hermes app users only have to update their preferred what3words delivery address once, and every subsequent order, dispatched by Hermes, will arrive at that precise three-metre square. For the retailers, our integration means that Hermes e-commerce clients can deliver to any 3m square in the UK. \"",[15573],{"start":32,"end":15574,"type":1324},806,{"type":126,"text":15576,"spans":15577},"Clare Jones, CCO at what3words",[15578],{"start":32,"end":2883,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":15580,"spans":15581},"\"We’re really excited to team up with what3words and become the first delivery company in the UK to provide what3words addresses for any parcel. This marks the latest development in our innovation portfolio that we had been planning for some time, however given the pandemic, when we have experienced five years’ growth in five months due to online shopping behaviours changing, we have expedited the use of this tech to further enhance our contact-free deliveries option, at a time when both our clients and their customers need efficient, safe deliveries.\" ",[15582],{"start":32,"end":12134,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":11570,"spans":15584},[15585],{"start":32,"end":3455,"type":163},"rich_text$f15e47b2-8bc2-483a-a5fe-d589c3a530c3",{"id":15588,"uid":15589,"url":15590,"type":50,"href":15591,"tags":15592,"first_publication_date":15593,"last_publication_date":15594,"slugs":15595,"linked_documents":15597,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":15598,"data":15599},"YhZ_whIAACkA0jks","hermes-builds-on-alexa-success-with-google-assistant-integration","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-builds-on-alexa-success-with-google-assistant-integration","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhZ_whIAACkA0jks%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-23T18:41:13+0000","2025-02-20T16:41:03+0000",[15596],"hermes-google-assistant-integration",[],[],{"title":15600,"category":8,"metaDescription":15601,"canonical":15602,"titleTag":15603,"featuredImage":15604,"publishedDate":15614,"slices":15615},"Hermes Google Assistant Integration","Catch our latest post and find out how we've become the first UK business to integrate its tracking solution with Google Assistant.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-builds-on-alexa-success-with-google-assistant-integration","Hermes Builds on Alexa Success with Google Assistant Integration | Evri",{"dimensions":15605,"alt":15606,"copyright":8,"url":15607,"id":15608,"edit":15609,"thumbnail":15610},{"width":65,"height":865},"An Evri Courier handing a customer a blue slip to confirm the details of a doorstep parcel collection. The transaction is taking place in a block of flats","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ69x-ZbqstJ9-pVM_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4535.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z69x-ZbqstJ9-pVM",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":15611,"alt":15606,"copyright":8,"url":15612,"id":15608,"edit":15613},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ69x-ZbqstJ9-pVM_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4535.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2017-08-30",[15616],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":15617,"primary":15619,"id":15655,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[15618],{},{"content":15620},[15621,15630,15633,15636,15639,15644,15648,15652],{"type":126,"text":15622,"spans":15623},"Hermes, the consumer delivery specialist, has continued its mission to interact with the latest wave of smart devices on the market by becoming the first parcel company in the UK to fully integrate its tracking solution with Google Assistant. This latest innovation follows another UK first, when Hermes integrated with Amazon’s intelligent personal assistant Alexa earlier this year.",[15624,15627],{"start":15625,"end":15626,"type":163},225,241,{"start":15625,"end":15626,"type":279,"data":15628},{"link_type":281,"url":15629},"press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fgoogle-assistant",{"type":126,"text":15631,"spans":15632},"Consumers waiting for a Hermes delivery on behalf of one of the UK’s leading retailers, or expecting a package via the myHermes C2C network, will now be able to track their parcels via Google Assistant. The voice-activated application is incorporated within the Google Home device, as well as a wide range of Google and Android smartphones, tablets and other smart devices. Users will also be able to track any products they have returned to a retailer.",[],{"type":126,"text":15634,"spans":15635},"The full integration of Hermes’ end-to-end tracking solution with Google Assistant plays a vital role in the company’s unwavering obligation to provide retailers and their consumers with a highly sophisticated and innovative range of value-added solutions.",[],{"type":126,"text":15637,"spans":15638},"The development of this unique functionality was carried out by the Hermes Innovation Lab, where a specialist team, led by David Turner, the company's Head of Innovation, continues to devise a range of forward-thinking services that will change the future of home delivery. In addition to the Alexa integration, the Innovation Lab has also worked closely alongside Starship Technologies to trial self-driving delivery robots in London.",[],{"type":126,"text":15640,"spans":15641},"\"The completion of this latest project signifies the importance we place on developing our service offering and providing additional value to our customers, focusing on convenience. We are excited to become the first parcel delivery company in the UK to complete this integration and we look forward to unveiling even more exciting solutions in the near future.\" ",[15642],{"start":32,"end":15643,"type":1324},363,{"type":126,"text":15645,"spans":15646},"David Turner, Head of Innovation at Hermes",[15647],{"start":32,"end":1161,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":15649,"spans":15650},"\"Similar to the unparalleled growth of smartphones over the past decade, more and more consumers are now equipping their own homes with innovative devices such as Amazon Echo, Echo Dot and Google Home. We have a commitment to react to these technological trends and develop new and exciting functionality that will ultimately benefit the UK retail industry and its customers.\" ",[15651],{"start":32,"end":12903,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":11445,"spans":15653},[15654],{"start":32,"end":2883,"type":163},"rich_text$fe18e85a-57cb-483d-b01c-2c64eb2edde8",{"id":15657,"uid":15658,"url":15659,"type":50,"href":15660,"tags":15661,"first_publication_date":15662,"last_publication_date":15663,"slugs":15664,"linked_documents":15665,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":15666,"data":15667},"YhZ-ghIAACoA0jOD","hermes-bolsters-sme-service-with-significant-investment","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-bolsters-sme-service-with-significant-investment","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhZ-ghIAACoA0jOD%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-23T18:35:53+0000","2025-02-20T16:37:38+0000",[15658],[],[],{"title":15668,"category":8,"metaDescription":15669,"canonical":15670,"titleTag":15671,"featuredImage":15672,"publishedDate":15678,"slices":15679},"Hermes bolsters SME service with significant investment","Read out latest blog post and find out how we're significantly investing in our Business Account proposition.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-bolsters-sme-service-with-significant-investment","Hermes Bolsters SME Service with Significant Investment | Evri",{"dimensions":15673,"alt":10428,"copyright":8,"url":10429,"id":10430,"edit":15674,"thumbnail":15675},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":15676,"alt":10428,"copyright":8,"url":10434,"id":10430,"edit":15677},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2016-05-02",[15680],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":15681,"primary":15683,"id":15702,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[15682],{},{"content":15684},[15685,15688,15691,15694,15698],{"type":126,"text":15686,"spans":15687},"Hermes, the consumer delivery specialist, is investing a six-figure sum to support the phenomenal growth of its Business Accounts. The service is now used by more than 650 sole traders, internet power sellers and SME retailers across the UK to send parcels to their customers. Hermes has bolstered its sales and support teams as an increased number of businesses look to take advantage of the benefits being offered by the delivery firm.",[],{"type":126,"text":15689,"spans":15690},"Whilst Hermes deliver parcels on behalf of 80% of the UK’s top retailers and etailers, including Next, ASOS, John Lewis, Debenhams and Arcadia Group, through its Corporate Accounts, the company also processes over 10 million parcels a year for its Business Account clients who send more than 150 parcels a week. This includes businesses working within a variety of sectors, such as clothing and fashion, sports equipment, camping accessories and homeware.",[],{"type":126,"text":15692,"spans":15693},"Since being launched two years ago, Hermes Business Accounts have offered a range of benefits including free van collection, as well as a flexible pricing scale, where the more parcels a business ships the more money it saves. Account holders are also allocated a dedicated account manager and receive access to a UK based customer service team.",[],{"type":126,"text":15695,"spans":15696},"\"A Hermes Business Account is the perfect option for SMEs as they can benefit from economies of scale. In many cases, Business Accounts retailers have experienced incredible growth and become so successful they are now part of Corporate Accounts. This investment highlights the tremendous success of the service and we look forward to continuing our impressive growth in 2016. \"",[15697],{"start":32,"end":1968,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":15699,"spans":15700},"Mike Antwoon, Sales Director of Hermes",[15701],{"start":32,"end":2884,"type":163},"rich_text$ac270c6f-a9c1-4913-b55b-d4440cdd77ab",{"id":15704,"uid":15705,"url":15706,"type":50,"href":15707,"tags":15708,"first_publication_date":15709,"last_publication_date":15710,"slugs":15711,"linked_documents":15712,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":15713,"data":15714},"YhZ7QxIAAC4A0iRU","hermes-appoints-chief-operating-officer-as-growth-continues","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-appoints-chief-operating-officer-as-growth-continues","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhZ7QxIAAC4A0iRU%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-23T18:22:00+0000","2025-02-21T09:17:42+0000",[15705],[],[],{"title":15715,"category":8,"metaDescription":15716,"canonical":15717,"titleTag":15718,"featuredImage":15719,"publishedDate":15725,"slices":15726},"Hermes appoints Chief Operating Officer as growth continues","Read our latest blog post to hear about the appointment of Carl Lyon as our new COO to support our recent significant growth.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-appoints-chief-operating-officer-as-growth-continues","Hermes Appoints Chief Operating Officer as Growth Continues | Evri UK",{"dimensions":15720,"alt":10964,"copyright":8,"url":10965,"id":10966,"edit":15721,"thumbnail":15722},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":15723,"alt":10964,"copyright":8,"url":10970,"id":10966,"edit":15724},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2020-09-10",[15727],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":15728,"primary":15730,"id":15758,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[15729],{},{"content":15731},[15732,15735,15738,15742,15745,15748,15753],{"type":126,"text":15733,"spans":15734},"Leading consumer delivery company Hermes UK has appointed a Chief Operating Officer (COO) in a move designed to support its operations following significant increase in volumes, due to both Covid-19 and the ongoing growth of online shopping. This will also support the business in moving forward with its ambitious growth plans following multimillion-pound investment.",[],{"type":126,"text":15736,"spans":15737},"Carl Lyon will take on the role of COO having been with the business for over 7 years in a number of senior operational roles, including most recently Operations Director– Delivery Experience. He has been a member of the Hermes UK main board for three years and has successfully developed its delivery model with the introduction of industry leading technology and the launch of SE+ - a new model for Hermes’ network of self-employed couriers. Carl has also helped to create Hermes’ unique ParcelShop and locker network – the largest in the country for parcel volume. Prior to this, he held a number of roles at Christian Salvesen, TNT Post and Post NL.",[],{"type":126,"text":15739,"spans":15740},"\"Over the last few months our business has grown beyond what any of us could have predicted or planned. We have responded to this growth by fast-tracking our capacity build programme with a multimillion-pound investment in our infrastructure, systems and people. Carl’s new appointment will enable him to support this moving forward by utilising his experience and knowledge across all of our business including our hubs and depots network. In addition, he is also leading our customer service transformation initiative.\" ",[15741],{"start":32,"end":15397,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":12026,"spans":15743},[15744],{"start":32,"end":5726,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":15746,"spans":15747},"It follows the recent announcement that Hermes UK, is to benefit from a significant investment by Advent International (‘Advent’), one of the largest and most experienced global private equity firms.  Under the terms of the deal, Advent will partner with the current management team to acquire a 75% stake in Hermes UK and Otto Group will continue to own 25% of the company. The transaction will facilitate further investment by Hermes in technology and infrastructure and support the future growth of the business in the rapidly growing parcel delivery sector. The management of Hermes UK will continue to lead the business as an independent company, with ‘business as usual’ for employees, suppliers and customers.",[],{"type":126,"text":15749,"spans":15750},"About Hermes UK",[15751,15752],{"start":32,"end":277,"type":1324},{"start":32,"end":277,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":15754,"spans":15755},"Hermes UK is one of the UK’s leading consumer delivery companies, successfully delivering over 400 million parcels a year on behalf of many of Europe’s leading retailers. The company has experienced sustainable double-digit growth for the past 7 years, consistently reinvesting profit into its proposition, infrastructure and people. Last year it became the first company to provide its self-employed couriers with holiday pay following a ground-breaking deal with the GMB Union.",[15756],{"start":32,"end":15757,"type":1324},479,"rich_text$dc5e4b70-a643-47d7-a245-da069cb5da68",{"id":15760,"uid":15761,"url":15762,"type":50,"href":15763,"tags":15764,"first_publication_date":15765,"last_publication_date":15766,"slugs":15767,"linked_documents":15768,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":15769,"data":15770},"YhZ5dxIAACsA0hwE","hermes-announces-leadership-changes-as-part-of-growth-strategy","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-announces-leadership-changes-as-part-of-growth-strategy","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhZ5dxIAACsA0hwE%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-23T18:14:21+0000","2025-02-20T16:42:12+0000",[15761],[],[],{"title":15771,"category":8,"metaDescription":15772,"canonical":15773,"titleTag":15774,"featuredImage":15775,"publishedDate":15785,"slices":15786},"Hermes announces leadership changes as part of growth strategy","Catch our latest post to read about the changes to our leadership team to support the next stage of the industry leading organisation’s growth and progression.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-announces-leadership-changes-as-part-of-growth-strategy","Hermes Announces Leadership Changes as Part of Growth Strategy | Evri",{"dimensions":15776,"alt":15777,"copyright":8,"url":15778,"id":15779,"edit":15780,"thumbnail":15781},{"width":65,"height":865},"An Evri employee is sat at their desk with another stood beside them. They are laughing at a joke or anecdote. ","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ7NktZ7c43Q3f32M_20220725-EVRI-PeoplePhotography-471.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,0,6240,4160&w=960&h=640","Z7NktZ7c43Q3f32M",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":15782,"alt":15777,"copyright":8,"url":15783,"id":15779,"edit":15784},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ7NktZ7c43Q3f32M_20220725-EVRI-PeoplePhotography-471.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,601,6240,2958&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":2088,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2017-11-10",[15787],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":15788,"primary":15790,"id":15820,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[15789],{},{"content":15791},[15792,15795,15798,15801,15804,15808,15812,15816],{"type":126,"text":15793,"spans":15794},"Hermes, the leading consumer delivery company, has announced changes to its leadership team designed to support the next stage of the industry leading organisation’s growth and progression.",[],{"type":126,"text":15796,"spans":15797},"Carole Walker (previously Woodhead) has been appointed Chief Executive Officer of Hermes Europe, Hamburg, with effect from 2nd November. She will be responsible for the leadership of all European logistics activities of the Otto Group, taking over from Donald Pilz.",[],{"type":126,"text":15799,"spans":15800},"Carole joined the Otto Group 30 years ago and became Operations Director of Hermes UK in 2001, Managing Director in 2004 and Chief Executive Officer in 2009. During this time she has overseen the business develop from an internal logistic arm of Freemans and Grattan to become the second largest delivery company in the UK.",[],{"type":126,"text":15802,"spans":15803},"Martijn de Lange will take over the role of CEO Hermes UK in line with the organisation’s previously announced succession plan. Martijn, who previously held the position of Operations Director at TNT, joined the business in 2014 as Operations Director, then COO before becoming Managing Director in March this year, with responsibility for all aspects of the day-to-day running of the company. Carole and Martijn will work together over the next few months to ensure a seamless transition for employees, retailers, customers and the Hermes Group.",[],{"type":126,"text":15805,"spans":15806},"\"I am incredibly proud of what we have achieved in the UK and would like to thank my fantastic team. This new role is an amazing opportunity for me to use my experience, industry expertise and UK success to help support and develop Hermes’ businesses across Europe. I am excited about the possibilities and opportunities, not only for me personally, but for us as a Group. My passion for Hermes UK could not be more apparent and I intend to take that same passion across the Group. \"",[15807],{"start":32,"end":6206,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":15809,"spans":15810},"Carole Walker, CEO Hermes Europe",[15811],{"start":32,"end":3455,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":15813,"spans":15814},"\"I am honoured to become CEO of such an amazing business as we continue our journey ‘to be the carrier of choice for every end consumer in the UK’. We are making the transition from an operational business to a more customer experience and technology driven organisation and this is an exciting time for us. I am really looking forward to taking this agenda forward, and of course focusing Hermes on our current priority, which is to ensure that we deliver a fantastic Peak for our retailers.\" ",[15815],{"start":32,"end":2448,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":15817,"spans":15818},"Martijn de Lange, CEO Hermes UK",[15819],{"start":32,"end":4070,"type":163},"rich_text$094ed7e5-e348-4007-b583-1101098fb393",{"id":15822,"uid":15823,"url":15824,"type":50,"href":15825,"tags":15826,"first_publication_date":15827,"last_publication_date":15828,"slugs":15829,"linked_documents":15830,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":15831,"data":15832},"YhZ2gxIAACwA0hBm","hermes-announces-last-sending-dates-for-christmas-deliveries","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-announces-last-sending-dates-for-christmas-deliveries","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhZ2gxIAACwA0hBm%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-23T18:01:44+0000","2025-02-13T10:17:23+0000",[15823],[],[],{"title":15833,"category":8,"metaDescription":15834,"canonical":15835,"titleTag":15836,"featuredImage":15837,"publishedDate":15847,"slices":15848},"Hermes announces last sending dates for Christmas deliveries","Read our latest post to hear about our last recommended posting days to ensure presents are delivered in time for Christmas 2020.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-announces-last-sending-dates-for-christmas-deliveries","Hermes Announces Last Sending Dates for Christmas Deliveries | Evri",{"dimensions":15838,"alt":15839,"copyright":8,"url":15840,"id":15841,"edit":15842,"thumbnail":15843},{"width":65,"height":865},"A customer is crouched on the floor of their apartment, unpealing their label, ready to apply to the parcel in front of them.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XsMpbqstJ9-Weh_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5249.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6XsMpbqstJ9-Weh",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":15844,"alt":15839,"copyright":8,"url":15845,"id":15841,"edit":15846},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XsMpbqstJ9-Weh_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5249.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2020-11-27",[15849],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":15850,"primary":15852,"id":15878,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[15851],{},{"content":15853},[15854,15857,15859,15863,15867,15871,15874],{"type":126,"text":15855,"spans":15856,"direction":112},"Hermes, the UK’s leading consumer delivery specialist, has announced the last recommended posting days for customers using the Hermes send service to ensure presents are delivered in time for Christmas 2020.  ",[],{"type":126,"text":12071,"spans":15858,"direction":112},[],{"type":109,"text":15860,"spans":15861,"direction":112},"Saturday 19th December. For customers who want a Hermes courier to collect a parcel from them.",[15862],{"start":32,"end":8276,"type":163},{"type":109,"text":15864,"spans":15865,"direction":112},"Monday 21st December (noon). For customers sending presents from Hermes’ nationwide network of ParcelShops, using the standard service.",[15866],{"start":32,"end":1981,"type":163},{"type":109,"text":15868,"spans":15869,"direction":112},"Tuesday 22nd December (noon). For customers sending presents from one of Hermes’ nationwide network of ParcelShops, using the next day service.",[15870],{"start":32,"end":1084,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":15872,"spans":15873,"direction":112}," The company has also urged customers to let their recipients know that there is a parcel on the way using the tracking facility on the app or online. This is particularly important when posting items close to the last dates, so that recipients can arrange to be available for delivery. ",[],{"type":126,"text":15875,"spans":15876,"direction":112},"Notes to Editors\nHermes, the consumer delivery specialist, provides flexible and affordable delivery options to home, work and ParcelShops.\nThe company delivers more than 400 million parcels a year with a mission to be the UK’s carrier of choice.\nHermes works with the majority of the UK’s top retailers including Next, ASOS, John Lewis and Boohoo.",[15877],{"start":32,"end":362,"type":163},"rich_text$4f230749-0e0c-4339-9158-e3aef2560c72",{"id":15880,"uid":15881,"url":15882,"type":50,"href":15883,"tags":15884,"first_publication_date":15885,"last_publication_date":15886,"slugs":15887,"linked_documents":15889,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":15890,"data":15891},"YhZ0YhIAACsA0gan","hermes-announces-last-dates-for-christmas-deliveries","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-announces-last-dates-for-christmas-deliveries","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhZ0YhIAACsA0gan%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-23T17:52:50+0000","2025-02-20T16:10:19+0000",[15888],"last-dates-for-christmas-deliveries",[],[],{"title":15892,"category":8,"metaDescription":15893,"canonical":15894,"titleTag":15895,"featuredImage":15896,"publishedDate":15902,"slices":15903},"Last Dates for Christmas Deliveries","Read our latest post to hear about our last recommended posting days to ensure presents are delivered in time for Christmas 2019.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-announces-last-dates-for-christmas-deliveries","Hermes Announces Last Dates for Christmas Deliveries | Evri",{"dimensions":15897,"alt":10964,"copyright":8,"url":10965,"id":10966,"edit":15898,"thumbnail":15899},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":15900,"alt":10964,"copyright":8,"url":10970,"id":10966,"edit":15901},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2019-11-21",[15904],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":15905,"primary":15907,"id":15930,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[15906],{},{"content":15908},[15909,15913,15915,15919,15923,15927],{"type":126,"text":15910,"spans":15911},"Hermes, the UK’s leading consumer delivery specialist, has announced the last recommended posting days to ensure presents are delivered in time for Christmas 2019.  ",[15912],{"start":32,"end":6010,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":12071,"spans":15914},[],{"type":109,"text":15916,"spans":15917},"Thursday 19th December. For customers who want a Hermes courier to collect a parcel from them.",[15918],{"start":32,"end":8276,"type":163},{"type":109,"text":15920,"spans":15921},"Saturday 21st December (noon). For customers sending presents from Hermes’ nationwide network of ParcelShops, using the standard service.",[15922],{"start":32,"end":2883,"type":163},{"type":109,"text":15924,"spans":15925},"Sunday 22nd December (noon). For customers sending presents from one of Hermes’ nationwide network of ParcelShops, using the next day service.",[15926],{"start":32,"end":1981,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":15928,"spans":15929},"The company has also urged customers to let their recipients know that there is a parcel on the way using the tracking facility on the app or online. This is particularly important when posting items close to the last dates, so that recipients can arrange to be available for delivery.",[],"rich_text$566b6aab-5a63-4af9-beeb-12577437298d",{"id":15932,"uid":15933,"url":15934,"type":50,"href":15935,"tags":15936,"first_publication_date":15937,"last_publication_date":15938,"slugs":15939,"linked_documents":15940,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":15941,"data":15942},"YhZyRxIAACwA0gGA","hermes-announces-busiest-ever-peak-period","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-announces-busiest-ever-peak-period","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhZyRxIAACwA0gGA%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-23T17:43:49+0000","2025-02-20T16:56:47+0000",[15933],[],[],{"title":15943,"category":8,"metaDescription":15944,"canonical":15945,"titleTag":15946,"featuredImage":15947,"publishedDate":15953,"slices":15954},"Hermes announces busiest ever peak period","It's been a busy one! We've just come out of our busiest ever peak period. Read our latest post to find out all about how we've handled increased volumes.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-announces-busiest-ever-peak-period","Hermes Announces Busiest Ever Peak Period | Evri",{"dimensions":15948,"alt":15479,"copyright":8,"url":15480,"id":15481,"edit":15949,"thumbnail":15950},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":15951,"alt":15479,"copyright":8,"url":15485,"id":15481,"edit":15952},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2019-11-29",[15955],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":15956,"primary":15958,"id":15985,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[15957],{},{"content":15959},[15960,15963,15968,15972,15975,15979,15982],{"type":126,"text":15961,"spans":15962},"The UK’s second largest consumer delivery company, Hermes, has confirmed that it has had its busiest peak period to date and achieved its highest service levels, as the predicted rise in online shopping continues. However it has reported that volumes were pretty steady throughout December compared to previous year, with consumers choosing not to leave it until the last minute.",[],{"type":126,"text":15964,"spans":15965},"\"For the past few years we have seen consumers leaving it later and later to send Christmas gifts which has been a big challenge for delivery companies. However, this year that didn’t happen, possibly because a number of retailers started their sales earlier than usual and also because consumers are becoming more aware of how things like bad weather can hamper delivery. \"",[15966],{"start":32,"end":15967,"type":1324},374,{"type":126,"text":15969,"spans":15970},"Gary Winter, Sales & Marketing Director at Hermes",[15971],{"start":32,"end":5125,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":15973,"spans":15974},"In December Hermes experienced its highest volume period at 21 million parcels – an overall increase of 14% on the previous year – successfully delivering for leading retail customers including Debenhams, John Lewis, Next and ASOS. In one night alone it handled a record 1 million parcels.",[],{"type":126,"text":15976,"spans":15977},"\"We started our preparation for peak back in February and have invested heavily in our infrastructure and customer service teams to ensure that we would be ready to support our customers. This year we also offered our existing customers a unique money back guarantee which meant that every parcel that entered the Hermes network, with a UK mainland address, by 23.59 on Friday 20 December would be delivered in time for Christmas – with a minimum of one delivery attempt. This was designed to provide peace of mind for retailers and their customers during the Christmas peak period and also help avoid a last minute rush. All of these measures paid off for us and our customers as we achieved high levels of service throughout this difficult period with 98% first time delivery for our standard service – up 2.6% on last year. \"",[15978],{"start":32,"end":4561,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":15969,"spans":15980},[15981],{"start":32,"end":5125,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":15983,"spans":15984},"The myHermes delivery solution, which is ordered online with items collected by courier direct from the door, handled over 1 million parcels in the month of December, an increase 170% on the previous year. This service continues to be popular with businesses using auction sites, marketplaces and other Internet sales as well as consumers. The myHermes Parcelshop network, which now totals 3,000 outlets, handled over half a million parcels - an increase of 200% on last year.",[],"rich_text$b1c4051b-6d83-4c20-a61e-29cbdb4ca3cc",{"id":15987,"uid":15988,"url":15989,"type":50,"href":15990,"tags":15991,"first_publication_date":15992,"last_publication_date":15993,"slugs":15994,"linked_documents":15995,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":15996,"data":15997},"YhZw2BIAACwA0f8Z","hermes-and-volkswagen-partnership-announced-in-uk-first","\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-and-volkswagen-partnership-announced-in-uk-first","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhZw2BIAACwA0f8Z%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-23T17:37:33+0000","2025-02-21T08:55:06+0000",[15988],[],[],{"title":15998,"category":8,"metaDescription":15999,"canonical":16000,"titleTag":16001,"featuredImage":16002,"publishedDate":16008,"slices":16009},"Hermes and Volkswagen partnership announced in UK first","We have been chosen by Volkswagen as its first partner to trial the first UK in-car delivery service. Read our latest blog post to learn all about it.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fhermes-and-volkswagen-partnership-announced-in-uk-first","Hermes and Volkswagen Partnership Announced in UK First | Evri",{"dimensions":16003,"alt":7957,"copyright":8,"url":7958,"id":7959,"edit":16004,"thumbnail":16005},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":16006,"alt":7957,"copyright":8,"url":7963,"id":7959,"edit":16007},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2020-02-20",[16010],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":16011,"primary":16013,"id":16047,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[16012],{},{"content":16014},[16015,16018,16021,16024,16027,16030,16034,16038,16043],{"type":126,"text":16016,"spans":16017},"Hermes UK, the leading consumer delivery company, has been chosen by Volkswagen as its first partner to trial a UK-first in-car delivery service.",[],{"type":126,"text":16019,"spans":16020},"The Hermes in-car delivery service is being trialled in Milton Keynes and is designed to boost first time delivery rates and provide further convenience for consumers.",[],{"type":126,"text":16022,"spans":16023},"Once trials have been conducted and feedback collated, it is envisaged that the service will be rolled out gradually across the UK. The service would allow Volkswagen owners with cars produced in 2019 and beyond, equipped with the We Connect Plus package.  Customers can sign-up for in-car deliveries using their Volkswagen ID.  ",[],{"type":126,"text":16025,"spans":16026},"Registered consumers for the service will receive an SMS or email when one of their parcels arrives at the delivery depot, giving them the option to have it delivered to their car. If they accept they authenticate themselves using their Volkswagen ID, which enables the courier to see which deliveries have been converted to in-car.",[],{"type":126,"text":16028,"spans":16029},"The courier is then given a one-time, time-specific access to open the car which can only be used by Hermes, and only for the time specified. GPS co-ordinates for the parked car are sent to the courier who provides photo evidence of the successful delivery and confirms that the boot is securely locked.",[],{"type":126,"text":16031,"spans":16032},"\"At Hermes we are constantly looking to develop innovative products and services that improve convenience for our customers. We are really pleased to be partnering with Volkswagen UK and look forward to working with them to develop this further. It is the first trial of its kind in the UK and supports our mission to make parcels more personal. Further to this, we envisage that in-car delivery services will increase first-time delivery rates reducing the number of delivery vans on our streets.\" ",[16033],{"start":32,"end":1573,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":16035,"spans":16036},"Adrian Berry, Innovation Product Owner at Hermes",[16037],{"start":32,"end":8554,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":16039,"spans":16040},"\"We are excited to have Hermes on board as our first courier partner to trial We Deliver in the UK. Feedback from users in Germany, where the scheme is already live, has been consistently positive and we hope to begin rolling out gradually across the UK by late 2020. Security is of course high on our list of priorities which is why delivery details are traceable to specific individual couriers. Should the delivery be unviable on the day for any reason – for example, there is insufficient space in the boot or the courier can’t locate the car – then the delivery will default to the user’s alternative address instead. \"",[16041],{"start":32,"end":16042,"type":1324},624,{"type":126,"text":16044,"spans":16045},"Claire McGreal, Brand Strategy and Mobility Services Manager at Volkswagen UK",[16046],{"start":32,"end":758,"type":163},"rich_text$17590326-af93-4215-be8e-6154a3236d35",{"id":16049,"uid":16050,"url":16051,"type":50,"href":16052,"tags":16053,"first_publication_date":16054,"last_publication_date":16055,"slugs":16056,"linked_documents":16057,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":16058,"data":16059},"YhZs8hIAACwA0e4G","feedback-shows-hermes-customers-focus-is-delivering","\u002Fpress\u002Ffeedback-shows-hermes-customers-focus-is-delivering","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhZs8hIAACwA0e4G%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-23T17:21:43+0000","2025-02-21T08:45:12+0000",[16050],[],[],{"title":16060,"category":8,"metaDescription":16061,"canonical":16062,"titleTag":16063,"featuredImage":16064,"publishedDate":16070,"slices":16071},"Feedback shows Hermes' customers focus is delivering","We've now reached 300,000 reviews on Trustpilot, with a the highest rating of any UK parcel carrier. Read our latest blog post to find out more.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Ffeedback-shows-hermes-customers-focus-is-delivering","Feedback Shows Hermes' Customers Focus is Delivering | Evri",{"dimensions":16065,"alt":5582,"copyright":8,"url":5583,"id":5584,"edit":16066,"thumbnail":16067},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":16068,"alt":5582,"copyright":8,"url":5588,"id":5584,"edit":16069},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},"2019-10-17",[16072],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":16073,"primary":16075,"id":16108,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[16074],{},{"content":16076},[16077,16080,16083,16086,16089,16092,16096,16100,16104],{"type":126,"text":16078,"spans":16079},"Hermes UK, the leading consumer delivery specialist, has achieved a 4.4\u002F5-star rating on leading review site Trustpilot, higher than any other UK parcel carrier. The company, which delivers on behalf of leading retailers, now has over 300,000 reviews on the site which it monitors carefully to assess customer feedback and address any issues.",[],{"type":126,"text":16081,"spans":16082},"This success follows the introduction of a number of new product and service initiatives designed to improve how Hermes interacts with customers on all platforms. These form part of the company’s Digital Futures strategy, a £55m project prioritises customer experience through investment in innovation and technology.",[],{"type":126,"text":16084,"spans":16085},"Initiatives include the introduction of an AI Chatbot (Holly) which has been designed to automate 40% of contact to Customer Services and automates parcel tracking, including signature, diversions and confirmation of delivery. Since the initial Chatbot launch in November, Holly has had a total of 432,000 chats resulting in a reduction of contacts to customer service operatives by 50%.",[],{"type":126,"text":16087,"spans":16088},"The company has also integrated its services with all Amazon Alexa and Google Assistant devices to include a ParcelShop finder, the ability to set a nominated safe place or select a neighbor to take your parcel when not at home, plus an improved process for booking returns.",[],{"type":126,"text":16090,"spans":16091},"A new app that provides online shoppers with increased visibility, as well as more choice and control over how they receive their parcels is also playing a key role in improving the customer experience. Available on both iOS and Android platforms, it allows users to track and\u002For divert their parcels in real-time via their smartphones, as well as receive notifications on the current progress of their deliveries. In addition, those online shoppers looking to return items will be able to do so more conveniently via their devices. They will be able to book a return in a few clicks, before receiving the relevant QR code and order numbers.",[],{"type":126,"text":16093,"spans":16094},"\"Trustpilot and Hermes have partnered for over 5 years, working on gaining the best possible insight into customer feedback. Hermes has incorporated a review invitation into the customer's user journey following the delivery of a parcel ensuring all reviews are legitimate and verified.\" ",[16095],{"start":32,"end":12634,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":16097,"spans":16098},"Rachel Weber, Customer Success Manager at Trustpilot",[16099],{"start":32,"end":684,"type":163},{"type":126,"text":16101,"spans":16102},"\"Our commitment to innovation and our desire to continuously enhance our range of delivery solutions is unapparelled across the industry. This is now being reflected in the customer reviews and this feedback is key for us in maintaining a great customer experience.\"",[16103],{"start":32,"end":6020,"type":1324},{"type":126,"text":16105,"spans":16106},"Eoin Kenneally, Head of Customer Experience – Digital and Insight",[16107],{"start":32,"end":629,"type":163},"rich_text$9db423d7-6bbd-4b84-a5a3-510c7c907129",{"id":16110,"uid":16111,"url":16112,"type":50,"href":16113,"tags":16114,"first_publication_date":16115,"last_publication_date":16116,"slugs":16117,"linked_documents":16118,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":16119,"data":16120},"YhZrGBIAACsA0eWH","myhermes-to-launch-sme-service-designed-to-save-time-and-money","\u002Fpress\u002Fmyhermes-to-launch-sme-service-designed-to-save-time-and-money","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhZrGBIAACsA0eWH%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-23T17:13:14+0000","2025-02-20T16:24:39+0000",[16111],[],[],{"title":16121,"category":8,"metaDescription":16122,"canonical":16123,"titleTag":16124,"featuredImage":16125,"publishedDate":11487,"slices":16131},"MyHermes to launch SME service designed to save time and money","Read our latest blog and learn about our new SME service, designed to save time and money for business owners.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fmyhermes-to-launch-sme-service-designed-to-save-time-and-money","MyHermes to launch SME Service Designed to Save Time and Money | Evri",{"dimensions":16126,"alt":7332,"copyright":8,"url":7333,"id":7334,"edit":16127,"thumbnail":16128},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":16129,"alt":7332,"copyright":8,"url":7338,"id":7334,"edit":16130},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},[16132],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":16133,"primary":16135,"id":16155,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[16134],{},{"content":16136},[16137,16140,16143,16146,16151],{"type":126,"text":16138,"spans":16139},"Consumer delivery specialist Hermes is set to launch a new service for SMEs as part of its commitment to providing tailored solutions designed to provide competitive advantage for its customers. The myHermes Business Account, which will be launched in full later this Spring, offers a range of benefits including a new pricing structure, a dedicated account manager and access to a UK based customer service team.",[],{"type":126,"text":16141,"spans":16142},"The myHermes Business Account can be seamlessly integrated with a number of the leading third-party e-commerce platforms, such as Channel Advisor and eSeller Pro, offering businesses full visibility and control over their day-to-day shipping operations. Account holders will be able to take advantage of a free van collection service which will be made available for companies sending more than 150 parcels a week. Customers will also benefit from a flexible pricing scale, meaning the more parcels they ship the more money they will save.",[],{"type":126,"text":16144,"spans":16145},"The 2-to-3 day standard parcel delivery service is fully tracked through myHermes.co.uk, where customers will also have access to a parcel order management dashboard. The new offering also incorporates a tailored compensation with flexible payment options.",[],{"type":126,"text":16147,"spans":16148},"\"The delivery element is an absolutely key part of any online business and can quite simply make the difference between success and failure. The myHermes Business Account is specifically designed to help SMEs save time and money and ensure they in turn are able to provide an even better service to their customer base. It is without doubt the strongest SME delivery solution currently on the market and is just one of several new service developments planned this year.\"",[16149],{"start":32,"end":16150,"type":1324},471,{"type":126,"text":16152,"spans":16153},"Jonathan Bennett, Head of Marketing at myHermes",[16154],{"start":32,"end":3107,"type":163},"rich_text$79477e3b-3320-4940-ade6-3a84a0ef725a",[16157,16189,16242],{"id":16158,"uid":16159,"url":16160,"type":50,"href":16161,"tags":16162,"first_publication_date":16163,"last_publication_date":16164,"slugs":16165,"linked_documents":16166,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":16167,"data":16168},"YhZmNxIAACsA0c87","bradford-warehouse-man-retires-after-50-years-at-hermes","\u002Fpress\u002Fbradford-warehouse-man-retires-after-50-years-at-hermes","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhZmNxIAACsA0c87%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-23T16:52:37+0000","2025-02-20T16:33:02+0000",[16159],[],[],{"title":16169,"category":8,"metaDescription":16170,"canonical":16171,"titleTag":16172,"featuredImage":16173,"publishedDate":11487,"slices":16179},"Bradford warehouse man retires after 50 years at Hermes","Read our latest post and find out how one of our longest serving day loaders has retired after 50 years at Hermes.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fbradford-warehouse-man-retires-after-50-years-at-hermes","Bradford Warehouse Man Retires After 50 Years at Hermes | Evri - The New Hermes",{"dimensions":16174,"alt":10292,"copyright":8,"url":12468,"id":12469,"edit":16175,"thumbnail":16176},{"width":65,"height":865},{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":16177,"alt":10292,"copyright":8,"url":12473,"id":12469,"edit":16178},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},[16180],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":16181,"primary":16183,"id":16188,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[16182],{},{"content":16184},[16185],{"type":126,"text":16186,"spans":16187},"The team at the Hermes site in Low Moor, Bradford held a ‘socially distanced’ send-off for Trevor Lee who retired last week after 50 years with the business. Trevor joined back in 1970 and has worked as a day loader ever since. His colleagues bought him some gardening tools and B&Q vouchers as a leaving present as he intends to spend more time in his garden which he loves.",[],"rich_text$e0ddf234-f77f-497e-aed4-1d6c460c834d",{"id":16190,"uid":16191,"url":16192,"type":50,"href":16193,"tags":16194,"first_publication_date":16195,"last_publication_date":16196,"slugs":16197,"linked_documents":16198,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":16199,"data":16200},"YhZkPRIAACwA0cX2","bradford-mp-visits-hermes-depot-to-view-investment-ahead-of-peak-season","\u002Fpress\u002Fbradford-mp-visits-hermes-depot-to-view-investment-ahead-of-peak-season","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhZkPRIAACwA0cX2%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-23T16:43:47+0000","2025-02-20T16:32:26+0000",[16191],[],[],{"title":16201,"category":8,"metaDescription":16202,"canonical":16203,"titleTag":16204,"featuredImage":16205,"publishedDate":11487,"slices":16211},"Bradford MP visits Hermes depot to view investment ahead of peak season","Read our latest post and hear from one of our courier from Avonmouth who is retiring after 31 years of service.","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fbradford-mp-visits-hermes-depot-to-view-investment-ahead-of-peak-season","Bradford MP Visits Hermes Depot to View Investment Ahead of Peak Season | Evri",{"dimensions":16206,"alt":7332,"copyright":8,"url":8977,"id":8978,"edit":16207,"thumbnail":16208},{"width":65,"height":8976},{"x":32,"y":4163,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":16209,"alt":7332,"copyright":8,"url":8982,"id":8978,"edit":16210},{"width":74,"height":75},{"x":32,"y":1251,"zoom":33,"background":71},[16212],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":16213,"primary":16215,"id":16241,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[16214],{},{"content":16216},[16217,16220,16223,16226,16229,16232,16235,16238],{"type":126,"text":16218,"spans":16219},"Judith Cummins, the MP for Bradford South, has visited the Hermes depot in her constituency this morning to hear about the investment in local depots and employees ahead of the anticipated seasonal increase in parcel volume.",[],{"type":126,"text":16221,"spans":16222},"A Yorkshire company born and bred, Hermes’ roots can be traced back to 1974 when Grattan Mail Order in Bradford launched its own home delivery model.",[],{"type":126,"text":16224,"spans":16225},"The former MP for Bradford South now that Parliament has been dissolved, was taken on a tour of the building by the Hermes Depot Operations Management team.  The 55,000 sq ft site is one of 26 depots across the country operated by the business, forming an integral part of the national operation which delivers 390 million parcels a year.",[],{"type":126,"text":16227,"spans":16228},"The tour was then followed by discussions around Hermes’ overall business performance, which has seen double digit growth over the past few years; as well as regional investment and employment. More than 120 people work at the Bradford depot with an additional 21 roles created in the last month.",[],{"type":126,"text":16230,"spans":16231},"We’re proud that investment has continued in one of the company’s core Yorkshire sites with many exciting roles currently available. Today was a great opportunity to demonstrate our commitment to the region. ",[],{"type":126,"text":16233,"spans":16234},"Stephen Taylor, Hermes’ Depot Manager at Bradford",[],{"type":126,"text":16236,"spans":16237},"It was great to be invited to the Hermes depot in Low Moor to speak with workers. This year, working jointly with trade unions, Hermes improved their workers’ rights by guaranteeing paid holiday for couriers. If re-elected as the MP for Bradford South I will continue to champion workers’ rights so that everyone is treated fairly. ",[],{"type":126,"text":16239,"spans":16240},"Judith Cummins, Labour Parliamentary Candidate for Bradford South",[],"rich_text$3b423181-6190-4854-85b7-5bdc4f4f675d",{"id":16243,"uid":16244,"url":16245,"type":50,"href":16246,"tags":16247,"first_publication_date":16248,"last_publication_date":16249,"slugs":16250,"linked_documents":16251,"lang":19,"alternate_languages":16252,"data":16253},"YhZdAxIAACwA0aSl","avonmouth-driver-retires-after-31-years-at-hermes","\u002Fpress\u002Favonmouth-driver-retires-after-31-years-at-hermes","press.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22YhZdAxIAACwA0aSl%22%29+%5D%5D",[13],"2022-02-23T16:22:58+0000","2025-02-20T16:31:05+0000",[16244],[],[],{"title":16254,"category":8,"metaDescription":16202,"canonical":16255,"titleTag":16256,"featuredImage":16257,"publishedDate":11487,"slices":16267},"Avonmouth Driver Retires After 31 Years at Hermes","press.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Favonmouth-driver-retires-after-31-years-at-hermes","Avonmouth Driver Retires After 31 Years at Hermes | Evri",{"dimensions":16258,"alt":16259,"copyright":8,"url":16260,"id":16261,"edit":16262,"thumbnail":16263},{"width":65,"height":865},"A female courier hands a parcel to a recipient. A blue Evri van can be seen in the background.","press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TnQ5bqstJ9-UDF_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10085.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6TnQ5bqstJ9-UDF",{"x":32,"y":33,"zoom":33,"background":71},{"dimensions":16264,"alt":16259,"copyright":8,"url":16265,"id":16261,"edit":16266},{"width":74,"height":75},"press.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TnQ5bqstJ9-UDF_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10085.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":32,"y":874,"zoom":33,"background":71},[16268],{"variation":82,"version":83,"items":16269,"primary":16271,"id":16276,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":8},[16270],{},{"content":16272},[16273],{"type":126,"text":16274,"spans":16275},"The team at the Hermes site in Kings Weston Lane, Bristol, held a ‘socially distanced’ send-off for Steve Wright who retired last week after 31 years with the business. During his time with the company Steve has been a driver, a depot trainer and a driver trainer and also represented Hermes UK at an event in Germany.",[],"rich_text$eb926de7-15ce-4ca7-ac82-013ce2226ed3",["Reactive",16278],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":16279,"$sclients":16345,"$sglobal-basket-count":8},{"abtasty":16280,"accessibe":16284,"appPromoBanner":16287,"autoDivertUpdates":16290,"awin":16293,"bulkInternational":16296,"bulkSendEnabled":16299,"businessAccountForm75Enabled":16302,"enableBasketCount":16305,"enableBulkPhaseTwo":16308,"euCustomsDuty":16311,"groovyAdvert":16314,"newInternationalSendFlow":16317,"newinternationalpages":16323,"oohPreferenceFlag":16327,"opentel":16330,"premium":16333,"savedCards":16336,"smallParcelSize":16339,"yourPricesDrawer":16342},{"_createdAt":16281,"_updatedAt":16282,"enabled":16283},"2025-11-05T15:39:37.217Z","2025-11-05T15:39:37.452Z",true,{"_createdAt":16285,"_updatedAt":16286,"enabled":16283},"2025-07-15T08:41:16.873Z","2025-10-28T11:52:03.675Z",{"_createdAt":16288,"_updatedAt":16289,"enabled":87},"2026-03-06T12:16:35.816Z","2026-03-06T12:16:36.662Z",{"_createdAt":16291,"_updatedAt":16292,"enabled":87},"2026-04-30T13:26:45.107Z","2026-04-30T13:26:45.355Z",{"_createdAt":16294,"_updatedAt":16295,"enabled":87},"2025-08-19T09:46:14.552Z","2025-09-02T10:23:26.022Z",{"_createdAt":16297,"_updatedAt":16298,"enabled":16283},"2025-06-23T14:37:21.102Z","2026-01-28T10:04:13.631Z",{"_createdAt":16300,"_updatedAt":16301,"enabled":16283},"2024-11-14T16:08:24.373Z","2025-06-05T12:32:29.563Z",{"_createdAt":16303,"_updatedAt":16304,"enabled":16283},"2024-11-14T16:09:05.362Z","2024-11-21T10:37:32.927Z",{"_createdAt":16306,"_updatedAt":16307,"enabled":16283},"2025-10-28T13:17:38.716Z","2026-04-14T10:49:05.879Z",{"_createdAt":16309,"_updatedAt":16310,"enabled":16283},"2025-11-07T14:21:27.204Z","2026-05-14T12:54:05.701Z",{"_createdAt":16312,"_updatedAt":16313,"enabled":16283},"2026-06-18T11:40:48.164Z","2026-06-30T22:04:35.623Z",{"_createdAt":16315,"_updatedAt":16316,"enabled":16283},"2025-10-01T11:40:52.25Z","2025-10-22T15:35:15.447Z",{"_createdAt":16318,"_updatedAt":16319,"enabled":16283,"path":16320},"2026-01-13T16:58:51.594Z","2026-01-22T12:50:33.103Z",[9036,16321,16322],"\u002Finternational-send","\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services",{"_createdAt":16324,"_updatedAt":16325,"enabled":16283,"paths":16326},"2025-09-22T09:43:54.509Z","2025-09-22T09:43:54.887Z",[16322,16321],{"_createdAt":16328,"_updatedAt":16329,"enabled":87},"2024-12-12T10:31:42.198Z","2026-05-28T10:09:49.795Z",{"_createdAt":16331,"_updatedAt":16332,"enabled":87},"2026-06-02T07:47:02.794Z","2026-06-02T07:47:02.886Z",{"_createdAt":16334,"_updatedAt":16335,"enabled":87},"2025-12-18T14:25:42.778Z","2025-12-1